{"id": "23170", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23170", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamonyi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamonyi ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, haherereye mu Murenge wa Gacurabwenge, mu Akarere ka Kamonyi, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nRwibutsa Abatutsi biciwe muri ako gace mu 1994, imibiri yabo ikaba yarakusanyijwe igashyingurwa aho. Imibiri y'abazize Jenoside isaga 47\u00a0000 ishyinguye mu mva rusange z'urwibutso rwa Kamonyi, rwubatswe ku muhanda Kigali\u2013Huye, mu gace ka Kibuza.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri ku musozi wa Kibuza, mu Murenge wa Gacurabwenge, ari na wo cyicaro cy'Akarere ka Kamonyi, iruhande rw'umuhanda wa kaburimbo Kigali\u2013Muhanga (umuhanda Kigali\u2013Huye). Ruri hafi y'ibiro by'Umurenge wa Gacurabwenge, kandi ruroroshye kugerwaho uturutse i Kigali.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kamonyi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nMbere ya 1994, agace ka Kamonyi kari muri Perefegitura ya Gitarama. Ubushakashatsi bwa Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) bugaragaza ko ari hamwe mu hantu abayobozi ba komini n'ab'igihugu bakanguriye abaturage gushyira mu bikorwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ubuhamya bwatanzwe nyuma ya Jenoside buvuga ko Abatutsi birukanwaga muri paruwasi no ku masoko byo hafi bakajyanwa mu gace ka Kibuza, aho ibitero by'Interahamwe n'abasirikare byahitanye benshi; imibiri yabo nyuma yimuriwe mu rwibutso rwa Kamonyi.\nUrwibutso rwa Kamonyi ruri mu nzibutso za Jenoside zabaruwe na CNLG, nyuma na Minisiteri y'Ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda n'Inshingano Mboneragihugu (MINUBUMWE), hamwe n'izindi nka Nyamata, Murambi, Bisesero cyangwa Gisozi.\nAmateka.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, abarokotse n'imiryango y'abazize Jenoside, bafashijwe n'inzego z'ibanze n'umuryango w'abarokotse Ibuka, bakusanyirije ku musozi wa Kibuza imibiri y'Abatutsi biciwe mu gace ka Musambira, Gacurabwenge n'amakomini ahakikije. Aho hantu hagiye hatunganywa buhoro buhoro hahinduka urwibutso rufite imva rusange zubakishijwe amatafari, imva z'abantu benshi n'ahantu ho kunamira.\nHagati mu myaka ya 2000, umuryango w'Abongereza Survivors Fund (SURF) watanze inkunga yo kubaka, hafi y'urwibutso, inyubako igenewe ibikorwa byo kwibuka no kubika inyandiko. Mu 2015, iyo nyubako yashyikirijwe ku mugaragaro Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) kugira ngo ikoreshwe nk'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu 2025, MINUBUMWE yatangaje ko i Kamonyi hagiye gufungurwa ikigo cy'igihugu cy'ububiko bw'inyandiko n'ubushakashatsi ku mateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, kizifashisha ibikorwaremezo bisanzwe biri mu karere, kigatuma Kamonyi iba ihuriro ry'ubushakashatsi no kwibuka.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Kamonyi rugizwe n'imva rusange zubakishijwe beto, zishyinguyemo imibiri y'ibihumbi by'abazize Jenoside yakuwe ahantu hatandukanye muri ako gace, cyane cyane mu cyahoze ari Komini Musambira. Hari amabuye n'ibimenyetso byibutsa ubwicanyi bwabereye mu gace ka Kibuza no mu mirenge ihakikije, ndetse n'urwibutso rw'Abatutsi bo mu Karere ka Kamonyi.\nUrwibutso rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\", gusurwa n'amatsinda y'abanyeshuri, n'intumwa z'ibigo bya Leta n'iby'abikorera bahategurira ibikorwa by'uburere mboneragihugu no kwibuka. Inyubako y'ubushakashatsi yubatswe na SURF igashyikirizwa CNLG ikoreshwa mu mahugurwa, mu nama z'abarokotse no mu bikorwa byo kwandika amateka bijyanye no gukumira Jenoside."}
{"id": "23171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23171", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ggolo", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ggolo ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, haherereye i Ggolo, mu karere ka Mpigi, muri Uganda.\nRushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yatembanywe n'imigezi yo mu Rwanda, hanyuma ikagera mu kiyaga cya Victoriya, mbere yo gukurwamo igashyingurwa ku butaka bwa Uganda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Ggolo, mu karere ka Mpigi, ku nkombe za Uganda z'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Ni rumwe mu hantu hashyinguwe muri Uganda abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi imibiri yabo yabonetse imaze gutembanwa n'amazi ikagera mu kiyaga cya Victoriya.\nImiterere rusange.\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abishwe bajugunywaga mu migezi, irimo Nyabarongo n'Akagera, yisuka mu kibaya cy'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Imibiri yaje kuboneka mu mazi no ku nkombe za Uganda z'icyo kiyaga.\nMuri Uganda habarurwa ahantu hatatu ho gushyingura no kwibukira abo bazize Jenoside: Ggolo, mu karere ka Mpigi, Lambu, mu karere ka Masaka, na Kasensero, mu karere ka Rakai.\nAmateka.\nJenoside yo mu 1994.\nMu 1994, muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abantu bicirwaga mu Rwanda hanyuma bakajugunywa mu migezi. Amazi yatwaye imibiri ayigeza mu kiyaga cya Victoriya, igera ku nkombe zitandukanye za Uganda. Inzego z'ubuyobozi n'abaturage bo muri ako gace bagize uruhare mu kuyikuramo no kuyishyingura.\nAhantu ha Ggolo hafitanye isano n'ibyo bikorwa byo gushyingura byabereye muri Uganda, ku bazize Jenoside akenshi batashoboraga kumenyekana umwe ku wundi. Habungabunga urwibutso rw'abantu biciwe mu Rwanda bagashyingurwa hanze y'ubutaka bw'u Rwanda kubera ko imibiri yabo yatwawe n'amazi.\nIshyirwaho n'iterambere ry'urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Ggolo ruri mu nzibutso eshatu zo muri Uganda zagenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi babonetse mu kiyaga cya Victoriya. Nk'uko Ambasade y'u Rwanda muri Uganda ibivuga, muri izo nzibutso uko ari eshatu hashyinguwe abazize Jenoside 10\u00a0983: 4\u00a0771 i Ggolo, 3\u00a0337 i Lambu na 2\u00a0875 i Kasensero.\nMu 2020, havuzwe ibiganiro hagati y'u Rwanda na Uganda ku bijyanye no gutunga cyangwa gucunga ubutaka buriho inzibutso za Jenoside ziri mu mahanga, harimo iza Ggolo, Lambu na Kasensero. Intego yavuzwe ni ukugira ngo u Rwanda rubashe kwita ku bubungabunga no ku isuku by'aho hantu ho kwibukira.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Ggolo rwihariye kuko ruri hanze y'u Rwanda. Rufitanye isano n'amateka y'abazize Jenoside imibiri yabo yatwawe n'amazi nyuma y'ubwicanyi bwo mu 1994, ikaboneka muri Uganda.\nNi ahantu imiryango, abarokotse, Abanyarwanda baba muri Uganda n'abayobozi bitabira buri mwaka imihango yo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi baza kunamira. Hakorerwa imihango yo kwibuka mu gihe cya \"Kwibuka\", igihe ngarukamwaka cyo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23172", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kasensero", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kasensero ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, haherereye i Kasensero, mu karere ka Rakai, muri Uganda.\nRushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yatembanywe n'imigezi yo mu Rwanda, hanyuma ikagera mu kiyaga cya Victoriya, mbere yo gukurwamo igashyingurwa ku butaka bwa Uganda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Kasensero, mu karere ka Rakai, ku nkombe za Uganda z'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Ni rumwe mu hantu hashyinguwe muri Uganda abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi imibiri yabo yabonetse imaze gutembanwa n'amazi ikagera mu kiyaga cya Victoriya.\nImiterere rusange.\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abishwe bajugunywaga mu migezi, irimo Nyabarongo n'Akagera, yisuka mu kibaya cy'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Imibiri yaje kuboneka mu mazi no ku nkombe za Uganda z'icyo kiyaga.\nMuri Uganda habarurwa ahantu hatatu ho gushyingura no kwibukira abo bazize Jenoside: Ggolo, mu karere ka Mpigi, Lambu, mu karere ka Masaka, na Kasensero, mu karere ka Rakai.\nAmateka.\nJenoside yo mu 1994.\nMu 1994, muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abantu bicirwaga mu Rwanda hanyuma bakajugunywa mu migezi. Amazi yatwaye imibiri ayigeza mu kiyaga cya Victoriya, igera ku nkombe zitandukanye za Uganda. Inzego z'ubuyobozi n'abaturage bo muri ako gace bagize uruhare mu kuyikuramo no kuyishyingura.\nAhantu ha Kasensero hafitanye isano n'ibyo bikorwa byo gushyingura byabereye muri Uganda, ku bazize Jenoside akenshi batashoboraga kumenyekana umwe ku wundi. Habungabunga urwibutso rw'abantu biciwe mu Rwanda bagashyingurwa hanze y'ubutaka bw'u Rwanda kubera ko imibiri yabo yatwawe n'amazi.\nIshyirwaho n'iterambere ry'urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Kasensero ruri mu nzibutso eshatu zo muri Uganda zagenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi babonetse mu kiyaga cya Victoriya. Nk'uko Ambasade y'u Rwanda muri Uganda ibivuga, muri izo nzibutso uko ari eshatu hashyinguwe abazize Jenoside 10\u00a0983: 4\u00a0771 i Ggolo, 3\u00a0337 i Lambu na 2\u00a0875 i Kasensero.\nMu 2020, havuzwe ibiganiro hagati y'u Rwanda na Uganda ku bijyanye no gutunga cyangwa gucunga ubutaka buriho inzibutso za Jenoside ziri mu mahanga, harimo iza Ggolo, Lambu na Kasensero. Intego yavuzwe ni ukugira ngo u Rwanda rubashe kwita ku bubungabunga no ku isuku by'aho hantu ho kwibukira.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Kasensero rwihariye kuko ruri hanze y'u Rwanda. Rufitanye isano n'amateka y'abazize Jenoside imibiri yabo yatwawe n'amazi nyuma y'ubwicanyi bwo mu 1994, ikaboneka muri Uganda.\nNi ahantu imiryango, abarokotse, Abanyarwanda baba muri Uganda n'abayobozi bitabira buri mwaka imihango yo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi baza kunamira. Hakorerwa imihango yo kwibuka mu gihe cya \"Kwibuka\", igihe ngarukamwaka cyo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23173", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23173", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Lambu", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Lambu ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, haherereye i Lambu, mu karere ka Masaka, muri Uganda.\nRushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yatembanywe n'imigezi yo mu Rwanda, hanyuma ikagera mu kiyaga cya Victoriya, mbere yo gukurwamo igashyingurwa ku butaka bwa Uganda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Lambu, mu karere ka Masaka, ku nkombe za Uganda z'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Ni rumwe mu hantu hashyinguwe muri Uganda abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi imibiri yabo yabonetse imaze gutembanwa n'amazi ikagera mu kiyaga cya Victoriya.\nImiterere rusange.\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abishwe bajugunywaga mu migezi, irimo Nyabarongo n'Akagera, yisuka mu kibaya cy'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Imibiri yaje kuboneka mu mazi no ku nkombe za Uganda z'icyo kiyaga.\nMuri Uganda habarurwa ahantu hatatu ho gushyingura no kwibukira abo bazize Jenoside: Ggolo, mu karere ka Mpigi, Lambu, mu karere ka Masaka, na Kasensero, mu karere ka Rakai.\nAmateka.\nJenoside yo mu 1994.\nMu 1994, muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abantu bicirwaga mu Rwanda hanyuma bakajugunywa mu migezi. Amazi yatwaye imibiri ayigeza mu kiyaga cya Victoriya, igera ku nkombe zitandukanye za Uganda. Inzego z'ubuyobozi n'abaturage bo muri ako gace bagize uruhare mu kuyikuramo no kuyishyingura.\nAhantu ha Lambu hafitanye isano n'ibyo bikorwa byo gushyingura byabereye muri Uganda, ku bazize Jenoside akenshi batashoboraga kumenyekana umwe ku wundi. Habungabunga urwibutso rw'abantu biciwe mu Rwanda bagashyingurwa hanze y'ubutaka bw'u Rwanda kubera ko imibiri yabo yatwawe n'amazi.\nIshyirwaho n'iterambere ry'urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Lambu ruri mu nzibutso eshatu zo muri Uganda zagenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi babonetse mu kiyaga cya Victoriya. Nk'uko Ambasade y'u Rwanda muri Uganda ibivuga, muri izo nzibutso uko ari eshatu hashyinguwe abazize Jenoside 10\u00a0983: 4\u00a0771 i Ggolo, 3\u00a0337 i Lambu na 2\u00a0875 i Kasensero.\nMu 2020, havuzwe ibiganiro hagati y'u Rwanda na Uganda ku bijyanye no gutunga cyangwa gucunga ubutaka buriho inzibutso za Jenoside ziri mu mahanga, harimo iza Ggolo, Lambu na Kasensero. Intego yavuzwe ni ukugira ngo u Rwanda rubashe kwita ku bubungabunga no ku isuku by'aho hantu ho kwibukira.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Lambu rwihariye kuko ruri hanze y'u Rwanda. Rufitanye isano n'amateka y'abazize Jenoside imibiri yabo yatwawe n'amazi nyuma y'ubwicanyi bwo mu 1994, ikaboneka muri Uganda.\nNi ahantu imiryango, abarokotse, Abanyarwanda baba muri Uganda n'abayobozi bitabira buri mwaka imihango yo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi baza kunamira. Hakorerwa imihango yo kwibuka mu gihe cya \"Kwibuka\", igihe ngarukamwaka cyo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu 2023, habereye umuhango wo kwibuka ku rwibutso rwa Lambu, mu karere ka Masaka, witabiriwe n'abagize umuryango w'Abanyarwanda baba muri Uganda, abayobozi n'Abagande."}
{"id": "23176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23176", "title": "Chantal Umuhoza", "text": "Chantal Umuhoza (yavutse mu 1986) ni Umunyarwandakazi uharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore (\"feminisiti\") n'ubumwe bw'Afurika (\"panafurikanisiti\"), akaba n'impuguke mu bijyanye n'ubutabera mbonezamubano n'ubutabera mu by'ubukungu. Ni we washinze akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa SPECTRA, umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta w'urubyiruko rw'abafeminisiti mu Rwanda, kandi akunze kugira uruhare mu nama zo mu karere no ku rwego mpuzamahanga zigaruka ku burenganzira bw'abagore.\nUbuzima bwite.\nChantal Umuhoza yavutse mu 1986 mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda. Ni umwana wa gatatu mu bakobwa bane bavukana. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, yabuze ababyeyi be bombi na bashiki be babiri.\nAvuga ko urugamba rwe rwo guharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore rwashibutse mu bihe bya nyuma ya Jenoside, igihe sosiyete nyarwanda, yari isanzwe yiganjemo imyumvire ishyira imbere abagabo, yabonye abagore bagira uruhare rugenda rwiyongera mu kongera kubaka igihugu, bitewe n'ubusumbane mu mubare w'abaturage bwasizwe n'ubwicanyi.\nAmashuri.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Chantal Umuhoza yimukiye muri Ubugande, ari na ho yarangirije amashuri yisumbuye. Yagarutse mu Rwanda kwiga muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ubukungu.\nNyuma yaho, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"Master of Arts\") mu burenganzira bwa muntu, uburinganire n'ubushakashatsi ku makimbirane (\"Human Rights, Gender and Conflict Studies: Social Justice Perspectives\"), muri International Institute of Social Studies mu Buholandi, mu mwaka w'amashuri wa 2013\u20132014.\nUmwuga.\nChantal Umuhoza afite uburambe bw'imyaka irenga 20 akorana n'imiryango itandukanye ya sosiyete sivile, abikorera, imiryango mpuzamahanga n'inzego za Leta. Ubuhanga bwe bwibanda ku butabera mu by'imibonano mpuzabitsina n'imyororokere, ubutabera mu by'ubukungu, ubuyobozi bushingiye ku mahame ya feminisime, kubaka imiryango iharanira impinduka, gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa politiki, n'ubuvugizi.\nMu 2012, yari umuhuzabikorwa w'imishinga mu Ishyirahamwe Nyarwanda riharanira Imibereho Myiza y'Umuryango (ARBEF).\nSPECTRA.\nMu 2016, afatanyije n'abandi bakobwa b'abafeminisiti, yashinze SPECTRA, umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta w'urubyiruko rw'abafeminisiti mu Rwanda, washinzwe n'urubyiruko rw'abafeminisiti kandi ukorera urwo rubyiruko. Uwo muryango ugamije kubaka urugaga ruhamye rw'abayobozi bakiri bato b'abafeminisiti bagira uruhare mu guharanira ubutabera mbonezamubano bw'abakobwa n'abagore bakiri bato, binyuze mu kongerera abantu ubushobozi, mu gutoza hagati y'ibisekuru no mu buvugizi.\nAyobora kandi \"Tanga Community by SPECTRA\", ikigo nyarwanda cy'ubucuruzi bugamije imibereho myiza (\"social enterprise\"), gishingiye ku mahame y'abafeminisiti b'Abanyafurika, kigamije guteza imbere ibikorwa by'abagore, abakobwa n'urubyiruko.\nIbikorwa ku rwego rw'akarere n'isi.\nKu rwego rwa Afurika, Chantal Umuhoza yagize uruhare mu isesengura no mu guhindura politiki mu nzego z'Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe (AU): yabaye umwe mu bagize Inama Ngishwanama y'Urubyiruko ya AU, atanga inama mu ishami rya AU rishinzwe uburinganire, kandi ari mu muryango w'abagore b'Abanyafurika b'abahuza (FEMWISE) mu ishami rishinzwe amahoro n'umutekano.\nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, yagize uruhare mu nama z'Umuryango w'Abibumbye, zirimo Komisiyo ishinzwe Abaturage n'Iterambere, Komisiyo ishinzwe Imibereho y'Abagore (CSW) n'Inama ishinzwe Uburenganzira bwa Muntu. Akurikirana kandi ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry'Intego z'Iterambere Rirambye (SDGs) ku rwego rw'igihugu, rw'akarere n'urw'isi, kandi yagize uruhare mu bikorwa bya \"Generation Equality\" bya UN Women.\nIbitekerezo.\nChantal Umuhoza ashimangira ko mbere ya Jenoside, umugore mu Rwanda yahabwaga agaciro gusa ku bijyanye no kubyara no kwita ku rugo:"}
{"id": "23177", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23177", "title": "Raffinor-BF", "text": "Uruganda rw'Igihugu rutunganya Zahabu rwa Burkina Faso (Raffinor-BF, mu Gifaransa: \"Raffinerie nationale d'or du Burkina Faso\") ni ikigo gitunganya zahabu giherereye i Wagadugu, muri Burukina Faso. Cyashyiriweho guhindura dor\u00e9 (uruvange rw'ibyuma rugizwe ahanini na zahabu) ikomoka ku musaruro wa zahabu, ikabyazwamo utubari twa zahabu iyunguruye neza.\nUru ruganda rwatashywe ku wa 28 Nzeri 2026 na Perezida wa Burkina Faso, Ibrahim Traor\u00e9, ari kumwe n'abagize guverinoma ye. Rufatwa nk'uruganda rwa mbere rutunganya zahabu muri Burkina Faso.\nAmateka.\nIyubakwa ry'uru ruganda ryatangiye mu Ugushyingo 2023. Rwubatswe hagamijwe kongera ubushobozi bw'igihugu bwo gutunganya zahabu icukurwa muri Burkina Faso. Uru ruganda ruherereye mu karere ka 12 k'umujyi wa Wagadugu, rwubatswe ku butaka bungana na hegitari 5. Rugizwe by'umwihariko n'aho bashongeshereza ibyuma, laboratwari isuzuma, ububiko bwa zahabu, iduka ry'imitako n'inyubako y'ubuyobozi.\nRwatwaye amafaranga arenga miliyari 11 z'amafaranga ya CFA. Rwatewe inkunga ahanini na Leta binyuze mu Kigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe Amabuye y'Agaciro (SONASP), hamwe n'uruhare rw'abafatanyabikorwa b'abikorera bo mu gihugu.\nIbikoresho n'ubushobozi.\nRAFFINOR-BF ikoresha ibikoresho bikora ubwabyo kandi ikora mu buryo bufunze (\"circuit ferm\u00e9\"). Yubatswe hakurikijwe amahame agamije kugabanya imyanda isohoka mu gihe cyo gutunganya zahabu. Uruganda rufite imiterere igizwe n'ibice (\"modulaire\") ituma hashobora kongerwaho indi mirongo mishya yo gutunganya. Mu cyiciro cya mbere, ubushobozi bwarwo bubarwa ni toni 164 za zahabu ku mwaka. Icyiciro cya kabiri kigomba kuzamura ubu bushobozi bukagera kuri toni 515 ku mwaka.\nUru ruganda rugomba kandi guhindura dor\u00e9 mo utubari twa zahabu iyunguruye ifite isuku ya 99,99 %.\nIntego.\nGutangiza RAFFINOR-BF biri muri politiki ya guverinoma ya Burkina Faso igamije kongera itunganyirizwa mu gihugu ry'umutungo kamere wayo w'amabuye y'agaciro. Abayobozi bifuza ko igice kinini cy'agaciro kiyongera gikomoka ku bucukuzi bwa zahabu cyaguma ku butaka bwa Burkina Faso.\nUru ruganda rugomba kandi gufasha kongera ikurikiranwa ry'inkomoko ya zahabu icukurwa muri Burkina Faso no kunoza igenzura ry'amafaranga ajyanye n'ubucuruzi bwayo. Rwashyizweho kandi kugira ngo rufashe kurwanya uburiganya, ubucuruzi bwa magendu n'iyezandonke mu gihugu.\nPerezida Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 avuga ko uru ruganda ari intambwe ya mbere ya politiki yagutse yo gutunganyiriza mu gihugu umutungo w'amabuye y'agaciro. Yatangaje ko guverinoma ye yifuza no guteza imbere itunganywa ry'ibindi byuma bicukurwa mu gihugu:\nAkazi n'amahugurwa.\nRAFFINOR-BF igomba gutanga imirimo igera ku 100 itaziguye n'imirimo 5 000 iziguye. Uru ruganda rugomba kandi kugira uruhare mu guhugura abakozi b'inzobere mu mirimo ijyanye no gutunganya no guhindura ibyuma. Muri urwo rwego, guverinoma ifata iterambere ry'ubumenyi bw'abenegihugu nk'ikintu cy'ingenzi kugira ngo uru ruganda rukore kandi rubungabungwe n'abo mu gihugu.\nAkamaro.\nBurkina Faso ni kimwe mu bihugu bicukura zahabu muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara. Umusaruro wa zahabu w'igihugu warenze toni 94 mu 2025. Gushyiraho ubu bushobozi bw'igihugu bwo gutunganya zahabu bigamije kugabanya kwishingikiriza ku gutunganyirizwa kwa zahabu mu mahanga no gushimangira ubugenzuzi bw'igihugu ku ruhererekane nyongeragaciro rw'uyu mutungo. Abayobozi ba Burkina Faso bifuza kandi ko RAFFINOR-BF yaba igikoresho gishobora gufasha guteza imbere ibikorwa byo gutunganya zahabu ku rwego rw'akarere muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba."}
{"id": "23178", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23178", "title": "Ibrahim Traor\u00e9", "text": "Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 (wavutse ku wa 14 Werurwe 1988 i K\u00e9ra, muri komine ya Bondokuy, muri Burukina Faso) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyaburukinafaso, akaba ari Umukuru w'Igihugu cya Burkina Faso kuva ku wa 30 Nzeri 2022.\nYahiritse ku butegetsi Lieutenant-colonel Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba binyuze muri kudeta, afata ubuyobozi bw'Umutwe wo Gukunda Igihugu ugamije Kurinda no Kugarura Ituze (\"Mouvement patriotique pour la sauvegarde et la restauration\", MPSR) ku wa 30 Nzeri 2022. Mu ngabo za Burkina Faso, afite ipeti rya Kapiteni.\nIgihe yageraga ku butegetsi afite imyaka 34, ni we wari umukuru w'igihugu ukiri muto kurusha abandi ku isi.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nIbrahim Traor\u00e9 yavukiye i K\u00e9ra, muri komine ya Bondokuy, ku wa 14 Werurwe 1988.\nYize amashuri abanza mu ishuri rya Leta rya Bondokuy. Amashuri yisumbuye yayigiye muri \"lyc\u00e9e mixte d'Accart-ville\" i Bobo-Dioulasso, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye (\"baccalaur\u00e9at s\u00e9rie D\") mu 2006.\nMu 2006, yinjiye muri Kaminuza ya Wagadugu (ubu yitwa Kaminuza Joseph Ki-Zerbo), mu ishami ry'ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga, mu gice cy'ubutabire, ibinyabuzima n'ubumenyi bw'isi (g\u00e9ologie). Mu 2010, yarangije afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri (\"ma\u00eetrise\") mu bumenyi bw'isi, ayibonana amanota meza.\nIgihe yari mu masomo, yari umurwanashyaka w'Ishyirahamwe ry'Igihugu ry'Abanyeshuri ba Burkina (ANEB), umuryango w'abanyeshuri ugendera ku bitekerezo bya Marx. Yari kandi hafi y'amashyirahamwe y'Abayisilamu, akaba n'umunyamuryango w'Ishyirahamwe ry'Abanyeshuri b'Abayisilamu.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nTraor\u00e9 ntiyanyuze mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya \"Prytan\u00e9e militaire de Kadiogo\" (PMK), bitandukanye n'uwo yasimbuye, Damiba, ndetse n'abandi basirikare bakuru benshi bo muri Burkina Faso. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza, yinjiye mu gisirikare mu 2010. Yatorejwe mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare Georges Namoano, ishuri rihugura abofisiye riri i P\u00f4, ahasoza ari uwa kabiri mu bo bari bigana. Nyuma yaho yazamutse vuba mu mapeti ya gisirikare.\nMu 2012 yabaye Sous-lieutenant, nyuma y'imyaka ibiri ahabwa ipeti rya Lieutenant, maze mu 2020 azamurwa ku ipeti rya Kapiteni. Muri Werurwe 2022, Perezida Paul-Henri Damiba yamugize umukuru w'imbunda nini (artillerie) muri Batayo ya 10 ishinzwe ubuyobozi, ubufasha n'ingoboka (10e RCAS) ifite icyicaro i Kaya.\nKapiteni Traor\u00e9 yagize uruhare mu bikorwa byinshi bya gisirikare byo kurwanya iterabwoba, cyane cyane i Djibo, aho yari ayobowe na Lieutenant-colonel Damiba, icyo gihe wari umuyobozi w'itsinda ry'ingabo zirwanya iterabwoba mu 2017. Yanagize uruhare mu gikorwa cya gisirikare cyiswe \"Otapuanu\" mu 2019, kandi yakoreye mu itsinda ry'ingabo ryari i Markoye, mu ntara ya Sahel.\nPerezida wa Burkina Faso.\nKudeta zo muri Mutarama na Nzeri 2022 n'ifatwa ry'ubutegetsi.\nIbrahim Traor\u00e9 yafashe ubutegetsi binyuze muri kudeta ku wa 30 Nzeri 2022, amaze gutangaza ko Damiba akuwe ku butegetsi. Iyo yari kudeta ya kabiri igihugu cyari kibonye muri uwo mwaka. Kapiteni Traor\u00e9 yari umwe mu basirikare bakuru bagize uruhare muri kudeta yahiritse Perezida Roch Marc Christian Kabor\u00e9, igashyira ku butegetsi Lieutenant-colonel Damiba, perezida wa MPSR, ku wa 24 Mutarama 2022.\nBitewe n'umutekano wari ukomeje kuzamba no kuba ibyemezo byafashwe mu gihe cya kudeta ya mbere bitarubahirijwe, abo basirikare bahisemo gukura ku butegetsi Perezida Damiba ku wa 30 Nzeri 2022, maze Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 afata ubuyobozi bwa MPSR. Iyi kudeta yakurikiye ibitero byinshi by'iterabwoba byahitanye abantu benshi, cyane cyane icyabereye i Gaskind\u00e9, mu majyaruguru ya Burkina Faso, aho imodoka zari zitwaye ibiribwa zaguye mu gico cy'abaterabwoba. Imibare yatangajwe na Leta yavugaga abasirikare 11 bishwe n'abasivili benshi baburiwe irengero, mu gihe andi makuru yavugaga abasivili bagera ku ijana bishwe. Damiba yaje kwegura ku wa 2 Ukwakira 2022.\nImiyoborere.\nAmaze gufata ubutegetsi ku wa 30 Nzeri, Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 yatangaje ati: \nKu wa 6 Ukwakira, itegeko shingiro ryagaruye Itegeko Nshinga maze ritangaza ko Traor\u00e9 ari Umukuru w'Igihugu. Yabaye atyo Umuyisilamu wa mbere ugeze kuri uwo mwanya kuva Saye Zerbo yahirikwa ku butegetsi mu 1982.\nAvuga ko ari gukemura gusa ibibazo by'ibanze by'igihugu, Traor\u00e9 yatangaje ko perezida w'inzibacyuho, yaba umusivili cyangwa umusirikare, azatoranywa n'inama nkuru y'igihugu (\"assises\") ku wa 14 Ukwakira 2022. Abamushyigikiye bakoze imyigaragambyo basaba ko ari we wahabwa kuyobora igihugu, maze ahabwa kuyobora inzibacyuho nk'umuyobozi wa MPSR. Ku wa 21 Ukwakira, yarahiriye kuba Perezida w'inzibacyuho imbere y'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga. Mu Ugushyingo, yanze guhembwa umushahara wa perezida, ahitamo kuguma ahembwa uwa kapiteni.\nKu wa 3 Gashyantare 2023, Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 yatangaje ibitero bikomeye byari bigiye kugabwa ku barwanyi b'intagondwa z'abajihadi, asaba abaturage kumushyigikira. Muri Mata 2023, yatangaje ko igihugu cyose kigomba kwitegura urugamba (\"mobilisation g\u00e9n\u00e9rale\"). Muri Gicurasi, yavuze ku bihugu \"by'inshuti\" bafatanya cyangwa bongera ubufatanye mu bya gisirikare: Uburusiya, aho abacancuro b'itsinda rya Wagner bashobora kuba bari muri Burkina Faso, Turukiya imuha indege zitagira abapilote (drones) zo mu bwoko bwa Bayraktar TB2, ndetse na Koreya y\u2019Amajyaruguru yatekerezaga ko yamuha intwaro. Icyo gihe, guverinoma yahisemo kwifashisha ingabo zayo bwite mu kurwanya abajihadi, kandi ntibyagaragaraga ko yasabye ubufasha bw'Abarusiya ba Wagner. Mu rwego rwo gukaza urugamba rwo kurwanya iterabwoba, guverinoma ye yateguye igikorwa kidasanzwe cyo kwinjiza abasirikare 3 000, ndetse no kwinjiza abafasha b'ingabo 50 000 bitwa \"Abakorerabushake bo kurinda Igihugu\" (\"Volontaires pour la d\u00e9fense de la patrie\", VDP).\nKubera ko ingengo y'imari ya Leta, yari yazahajwe n'ibihano by'ubukungu, itabashaga gutera inkunga urugamba rwo kurwanya abajihadi, guverinoma yongereye imisoro.\nBitewe n'imyaka ye, uburambe afite ku rugamba n'imivugire ye, Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 akundwa n'urubyiruko, rugize abarenga 70 % by'abaturage ariko rukaba rudahagarariwe bihagije mu nzego za politiki. Mu ijambo rye akunze kwifashisha ibitekerezo bya Thomas Sankara, nko guharanira ubusugire bw'igihugu no kwamagana ubukoloni bushya (\"imp\u00e9rialisme\"). Akurikiza politiki irwanya Ubufaransa, bimuhesha gushyigikirwa n'abaharanira ubumwe bwa Afurika (\"panafricanistes\") ndetse n'Abayisilamu b'Abawahabi. Nyamara, uretse uko gukundwa, sosiyete sivile, abanyamakuru, abacamanza n'abayobozi b'amashyaka bibasirwa n'igitugu cy'ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare, rimwe na rimwe bakajyanwa ku ngufu mu gisirikare ku rugamba. Abasivili na bo bahuye n'ibyo, ndetse bamwe baburirwa irengero ku gahato.\nKu wa 16 Nzeri 2023, Ibrahim Traor\u00e9, ari kumwe na Colonel Assimi Go\u00efta na Jenerali Abdourahamane Tiani, bashinze Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel (\"Alliance des \u00c9tats du Sahel\", AES), amasezerano yo gutabarana hagati ya Mali, Nigeri na Burukina Faso. Ku wa 28 Mutarama 2024, yakuye Burkina Faso mu Muryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu by'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO).\nAmaze kurokoka umugambi wa kudeta muri Nzeri 2023, yitabaje abasirikare b'Abarusiya ngo bamurinde. Mu Ukuboza, Minisitiri w'Intebe mushya, Apollinaire Joachim Ky\u00e9lem de Tamb\u00e8la, yatangaje ko Uburusiya buzafasha mu ivugurura ry'ingabo za Burkina Faso, cyane cyane mu gushyiraho batayo nshya zo gutabara byihuse, mu gihe Ubushinwa na Turukiya na byo byari kuzatanga ubufasha. Muri icyo gihe kandi, guverinoma ya Burkina Faso yasinye amasezerano n'Uburusiya yo kubaka uruganda rutanga amashanyarazi akomoka ku ngufu za nikleyeri.\nKu wa 25 Gicurasi 2024, nyuma y'indi nama nkuru y'inzibacyuho itaritabiriwe n'amatsinda ya sosiyete sivile n'amashyaka atavuga rumwe na Ibrahim Traor\u00e9, inzibacyuho yongerewe imyaka itanu (guhera ku wa 2 Nyakanga 2024) hemejwe itegeko rishya (\"charte\") rimuha izina rya Perezida wa Burkina Faso, rikanamwemerera kuzaziyamamaza mu matora azakurikira. Iyi nama yabaye hashize iminsi mike habaye indi isa na yo muri Mali, igihugu bafatanyije, na yo yongereye inzibacyuho imyaka itanu. Uwo munsi nyine, Traor\u00e9 yashyize umukono kuri iryo tegeko rishya, bituma ritangira gukurikizwa.\nKu wa 11 Kamena 2024, abajihadi b'Itsinda rishyigikira Isilamu n'Abayisilamu (JNIM) bagabye igitero ku kigo cya gisirikare no muri komine ya Mansila. Bukeye bwaho, igisasu cyarashwe ku cyicaro cya Televiziyo y'igihugu (RTB), hafi y'ingoro ya perezida i Wagadugu, abakirashe ntibamenyekana. Mu minsi yakurikiyeho, kuba Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 atagaragaraga cyane mu ruhame byateje ibibazo mu Banyaburukinafaso. Abasirikare ba Mali n'abacancuro b'Abarusiya ba Wagner bageze i Wagadugu muri iyo minsi, ariko inshingano zabo ntizasobanuwe. Inama y'Abaminisitiri yagombaga kuyobora ku wa 19 Kamena 2024 yimuriwe bukeye bwaho, maze Traor\u00e9 yongera kugaragara icyo gihe. Muri Kanama, igihugu cyagabweho igitero cy'iterabwoba cy'abajihadi cyahitanye abantu benshi kurusha ibindi byose mu mateka yacyo, mu mudugudu wa Barsalogho mu majyaruguru rwagati y'igihugu, aho abaturage bari hagati ya 300 na 400 bishwe n'Itsinda rishyigikira Isilamu n'Abayisilamu (JNIM).\nAmashusho n'amafoto by'impimbano byakozwe hifashishijwe ubwenge buhangano (AI), birata Ibrahim Traor\u00e9, byuzuye ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Muri ayo mashusho, akozwe neza cyangwa nabi, kapiteni agaragazwa nk'umuyobozi w'intwari urinda abaturage be, kandi akwirakwizwa na konti z'impimbano. Ayo mashusho, atagenewe abaturage ba Burkina Faso, rimwe na rimwe arebwa n'abantu babarirwa muri za miliyoni, kandi akenshi akurura ibitekerezo by'abamushima, haba muri Afurika ivuga Igifaransa aho Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 asanzwe azwi, haba muri Afurika ivuga Icyongereza, cyane cyane muri Gana, Nijeriya na Kenya, ndetse no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika no mu birwa bya Karayibe. Ayo mashusho amwerekana ari kumwe n'ibyamamare by'isi nka Beyonc\u00e9, Rihanna cyangwa Justin Bieber. Andi mashusho menshi y'impimbano agaragaza \"ubukungu bwa Burkina Faso butera imbere, bubasha gukora telefoni zigezweho, ibinyabiziga n'imashini z'ubuhinzi\".\nKu wa 23 Ukuboza 2025, yasimbuye Assimi Go\u00efta ku mwanya wa Perezida w'Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel.\nKu wa 29 Mutarama 2026, nyuma y'inama y'Abaminisitiri, guverinoma ya gisirikare yasheshe amashyaka ya politiki yose.\nKu wa 3 Mata 2026, mu kiganiro yagiriye kuri Televiziyo y'igihugu (RTB), Kapiteni Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 yatangaje ko Burkina Faso igomba kwibagirwa igitekerezo cya demokarasi, avuga ko muri iki gihe gikoreshwa n'abakoloni bashya (\"imp\u00e9rialistes\"):"}
{"id": "23179", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23179", "title": "Assimi Go\u00efta", "text": "Assimi Go\u00efta (wavutse ku wa 9 Ugushyingo 1983 i Bamako, muri Mali) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyamali, akaba ayoboye Mali kuva mu 2021. Afite ipeti rya Jenerali w'ingabo (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral d'arm\u00e9e\"), ari ryo peti risumba ayandi mu gihugu.\nYabaye perezida w'Akanama k'Igihugu gashinzwe Gukiza Abaturage (\"Comit\u00e9 national pour le salut du peuple\", CNSP), agatsiko k'abasirikare kahiritse ku butegetsi Perezida Ibrahim Boubacar Ke\u00efta muri kudeta yo muri Kanama 2020. Nyuma yaho yabaye visi-perezida w'inzibacyuho iyobowe na Bah N'Daw, ariko akomeza kuba we nyir'ububasha nyakuri mu gihugu. Muri Gicurasi 2021, yakoze indi kudeta, maze aba Perezida w'inzibacyuho.\nKu butegetsi bwe, Mali yacanye umubano mu bya gisirikare n'Ubufaransa, yegera Uburusiya n'itsinda ry'abacancuro rya Wagner, ndetse ivana mu Muryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu by'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO). Hamwe n'abayobozi ba gisirikare ba Burukina Faso na Nigeri, yashinze Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel (AES), aba perezida waryo wa mbere kuva mu 2024 kugeza mu 2025. Ubutegetsi bwe burangwa n'igitugu: amatora yasubitswe igihe kitazwi, amashyaka ya politiki yose yasheshwe mu 2025, maze ahabwa manda y'imyaka itanu ishobora kongerwa nta matora.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAssimi Go\u00efta ni uwo mu bwoko bw'Abaminyanka (\"Minianka\"). Yavukiye i Bamako ku wa 9 Ugushyingo 1983, akaba umwana w'umusirikare mukuru wo mu ngabo za Mali. Yize mu mashuri ya gisirikare ya Mali, by'umwihariko muri Prytan\u00e9e militaire de Kati no mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Koulikoro (\"\u00c9cole militaire interarmes\", EMIA).\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nGo\u00efta yabaye Koloneli muri Batayo yigenga y'ingabo zidasanzwe (\"Bataillon autonome des forces sp\u00e9ciales\"), ayobora ingabo zidasanzwe za Mali mu gice cyo hagati cy'igihugu. Yagize uruhare mu rugamba rwo kurwanya inyeshyamba z'abajihadi mu Mali.\nYahawe andi mahugurwa ya gisirikare na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, Ubufaransa n'Ubudage, kandi yakoranye n'ingabo zidasanzwe z'Amerika (\"Green Berets\"). Mu 2018, yahuye na Mamady Doumbouya, waje nyuma gukora kudeta muri Gineya akaba perezida waho.\nKu butegetsi.\nKudeta ya 2020 n'umwanya wa visi-perezida.\nAssimi Go\u00efta ni umwe mu bateguye kudeta yo mu 2020 yahiritse Perezida Ibrahim Boubacar Ke\u00efta, ari kumwe na Isma\u00ebl Wagu\u00e9, Malick Diaw, Sadio Camara na Modibo Kon\u00e9. Abo basirikare biyemeje gutegura amatora mashya. Ku wa 19 Kanama 2020, yagizwe perezida w'Akanama k'Igihugu gashinzwe Gukiza Abaturage (CNSP). Ku wa 24 Kanama 2020, itegeko shingiro ryemejwe na CNSP ryamugize Umukuru w'Igihugu wa Mali mu buryo bufatika (\"de facto\").\nCEDEAO yashyize igitutu ku gatsiko k'abasirikare kugira ngo igihugu kiyoborwe n'umusivili. Umuryango mpuzamahanga wanze ko ari we wayobora inzibacyuho, cyangwa ko yasimbura perezida w'inzibacyuho, n'iyo yava mu gisirikare. Ku wa 21 Nzeri 2020, itsinda ry'abatora 17 ryamugize visi-perezida w'inzibacyuho, naho Bah N'Daw wahoze ari Minisitiri w'Ingabo agirwa Perezida w'inzibacyuho; bari bagenewe kumara amezi 18 kugeza habaye amatora. Barahiye ku wa 25 Nzeri 2020. Ku wa 1 Ukwakira 2020, hasohotse itegeko ry'inzibacyuho (\"charte de la transition\") ryavugaga, bisabwe na CEDEAO, ko visi-perezida \"ushinzwe ibibazo by'ingabo n'umutekano\" adashobora gusimbura Perezida Bah N'Daw. Nyamara, Assimi Go\u00efta yakomeje kuba we nyir'ububasha nyakuri mu gihugu.\nGo\u00efta ashima cyane uwahoze ari Perezida wa Burkina Faso, Thomas Sankara. Mu 2020, mu nama ya CEDEAO yabereye i Peduase muri Gana, yahuye n'uwahoze ari Perezida wa Gana, Jerry Rawlings, baganira ku itangizwa ry'inzibacyuho muri Mali.\nKudeta ya 2021.\nKu wa 24 Gicurasi 2021, nyuma gato y'itangazwa rya guverinoma ya kabiri iyobowe na Moctar Ouane, itarimo abakoloneli babiri bahoze muri CNSP (Modibo Kon\u00e9 na Sadio Camara), Perezida Bah N'Daw, Minisitiri w'Intebe na Minisitiri w'Ingabo bafashwe, bajyanwa i Kati barinzwe n'abasirikare. Bukeye bwaho, Koloneli Assimi Go\u00efta yatangaje ko yambuye Perezida na Minisitiri w'Intebe ububasha bwabo, abashinja \"kudindiza\" inzibacyuho no gushyiraho guverinoma nshya batabanje kumugisha inama. Koko, itegeko ry'inzibacyuho ryamuhaga uburenganzira bwo kugira icyo avuga ku ihitamo rya Minisitiri w'Ingabo n'uw'Umutekano, imyanya yari isanzwe ifitwe n'inshuti ze Camara na Kon\u00e9. Amaze gufata ubutegetsi, yasubije Sadio Camara ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Ingabo.\nIyo kudeta yatumye Assimi Go\u00efta aba Perezida w'inzibacyuho w'agateganyo. Ku wa 28 Gicurasi 2021, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ko umwanya wa perezida utagira nyirawo, maze rumutangaza nka Perezida w'inzibacyuho, Umukuru w'Igihugu, kugeza inzibacyuho irangiye. Bidatinze, yegereye Ihuriro ry'Igihugu ry'Abakozi ba Mali (UNTM), ryari ryateguye imyigaragambyo y'abakozi.\nUwo munsi nyine, yatangaje ko umwanya wa Minisitiri w'Intebe uzahabwa ihuriro ry'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Mouvement du 5 Juin \u2013 Rassemblement des forces patriotiques (M5-RFP). Iryo huriro ryatoranyije umuyobozi waryo, Choguel Kokalla Ma\u00efga, wagiye ku buyobozi bwa guverinoma ku wa 7 Kamena 2021, nyuma y'aho Go\u00efta arahiriye imbere y'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga.\nKu wa 20 Nyakanga 2021, mu birori by'Ilayidi (\"A\u00efd al-Adha\"), umugabo witwaje icyuma yagerageje kumutera icyuma ari mu isengesho mu Musigiti Mukuru wa Bamako, ariko ntiyakomereka. Abantu babiri bafashwe n'inzego z'umutekano, ariko umwe muri bo yaje kugaragara ko ari umusirikare wo mu ngabo zidasanzwe wakekwagaho ubufatanyacyaha atari byo. Uwamuteye, wari umwarimu, yapfiriye muri gereza nyuma y'iminsi itanu, icyamwishe ntikimenyekana.\nKongera igihe cy'inzibacyuho.\nMu Ukuboza 2021, nyuma y'inama nkuru y'igihugu yiswe \"Assises nationales pour la refondation\", yasabye ko inzibacyuho yongerwa kuva ku mezi atandatu kugeza ku myaka itanu kugira ngo hakorwe amavugurura ya politiki, Assimi Go\u00efta yatangaje ko yifuza kongera inzibacyuho imyaka itanu. Yateganyaga kamarampaka ku Itegeko Nshinga muri Mutarama 2024, amatora y'abadepite n'ay'abasenateri mu Ugushyingo 2025, n'amatora ya perezida mu Ukuboza 2026. Iyo gahunda yaganiriweho mu nama idasanzwe ya CEDEAO yo ku wa 9 Mutarama 2022. Iyo nama yanze iyo gahunda, ifunga imipaka yayo na Mali, ihamagaza abambasaderi kandi ishyiraho ibihano by'ubukungu.\nKu wa 21 Gashyantare 2022, itegeko ry'inzibacyuho ryarahinduwe, inzibacyuho yongerwa igihe kitarenze imyaka itanu. Iryo tegeko ryavugaga kandi ko Assimi Go\u00efta atemerewe kwiyamamaza mu matora ya perezida keretse yeguye, kandi ko perezida w'Inama y'Igihugu y'Inzibacyuho (CNT) ari we wasimbura Perezida w'inzibacyuho. Ku wa 21 Kanama 2022, Go\u00efta yagize Abdoulaye Ma\u00efga Minisitiri w'Intebe w'agateganyo, asimbura Choguel Kokalla Ma\u00efga wari mu bitaro kuva ku wa 10 Kanama.\nMu Kamena 2023, habaye kamarampaka ku Itegeko Nshinga rishya; ku wa 23 Kamena hatangajwe ko ryemejwe ku majwi 97 %, abitabiriye bakaba 39,4 % by'abiyandikishije. Abanenga iryo tegeko bavuze ko kamarampaka itanyuze mu mucyo, kandi ko ryongereye ububasha bwa perezida, bigatuma amavugurura ya demokarasi arushaho kugorana.\nIgihe cy'inzibacyuho, cyari cyarashyizweho n'iteka rya perezida, cyarangiye ku wa 26 Werurwe 2024 nta matora abaye. Muri Mata 2024, Minisitiri w'Intebe Ma\u00efga yatangaje ko amatora azaba nyuma y'ibiganiro hagati y'Abanyamali n'igihe igihugu kizaba gifite ituze. Muri icyo gihe, ibikorwa by'amashyaka byarahagaritswe, kandi itangazamakuru ryose ribuzwa kubivugaho. Ku wa 10 Gicurasi 2024, ibiganiro hagati y'Abanyamali byasabye ko inzibacyuho yongerwa indi myaka iri hagati y'ibiri n'itanu, ko umubare w'amashyaka ugabanywa kandi ntahabwe inkunga ya Leta, ndetse ko Go\u00efta yiyamamaza mu matora ya perezida, akanazamurwa ku ipeti rya Jenerali hamwe n'abandi bayobozi bane b'agatsiko k'abasirikare. Amashyaka menshi yamaganye ibyo byemezo, avuga ko ibyo biganiro byateguwe n'agatsiko k'abasirikare kugira ngo kagume ku butegetsi, kandi ko ababyitabiriye batatowe.\nKu wa 16 Ukwakira 2024, inama y'abaminisitiri yamugize Jenerali w'ingabo (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral d'arm\u00e9e\") \"ku buryo budasanzwe\". Afite inyenyeri eshanu, akaba ari we musirikare ufite ipeti risumba ayandi muri Mali.\nKu wa 20 Ugushyingo 2024, yirukanye Minisitiri w'Intebe Choguel Kokalla Ma\u00efga, wari washinje agatsiko k'abasirikare kutamureka ngo ayobore no kwanga gushyiraho itariki y'amatora, maze asesa guverinoma ye. Bukeye bwaho, yashyizeho Jenerali Abdoulaye Ma\u00efga ngo amusimbure.\nIseswa ry'amashyaka na manda itagira iherezo.\nKu wa 28 na 29 Mata 2025, habaye indi nama nkuru y'igihugu, amashyaka menshi ya politiki atitabiriye. Yasabye ko Assimi Go\u00efta agirwa Perezida wa Repubulika mu gihe cy'imyaka itanu ishobora kongerwa, kandi ko amashyaka ya politiki aseswa. Ku wa 3 Gicurasi, amagana y'abayoboke b'ayo mashyaka bakoze imyigaragambyo imbere y'Ingoro y'Umuco i Bamako, basaba ko inzibacyuho irangira bitarenze ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2025. Indi nama yari iteganyijwe kubera ku Nzu y'Itangazamakuru yaburijwemo n'abantu boherejwe n'agatsiko k'abasirikare. Mu gihe hari hateganyijwe imyigaragambyo ku wa 9 Gicurasi, ubutegetsi bwahagaritse ibikorwa by'amashyaka ku wa 7 Gicurasi.\nKu wa 12 Gicurasi 2025, Inama y'Igihugu y'Inzibacyuho yatoye ivanwaho ry'itegeko rigenga amashyaka, maze Go\u00efta arishyiraho umukono bukeye bwaho, ku wa 13 Gicurasi. Uwo munsi nyine, nyuma y'inama y'abaminisitiri, yasheshe amashyaka yose ya politiki, anabuza abayoboke bayo guhurira hamwe. Icyo cyemezo cyajyanye no guhagarika itangazwa rya televiziyo TV5 Monde muri Mali.\nKu wa 11 Kamena 2025, inama y'abaminisitiri yemeje ko manda ye yongerwa imyaka itanu nta matora abaye. Ku wa 3 Nyakanga 2025, Inama y'Igihugu y'Inzibacyuho yemeje ivugurura ry'itegeko ry'inzibacyuho rimuha manda y'imyaka itanu ishobora kongerwa \"inshuro zose bizaba ngombwa\" nta matora, kandi rikamwemerera kuziyamamaza mu matora ya perezida azakurikira. Iryo tegeko ryashyizweho umukono ku wa 8 Nyakanga 2025.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2023, Go\u00efta yababariye abasirikare 46 ba C\u00f4te d'Ivoire bari barakatiwe n'inkiko za Mali mu Ukuboza 2022.\nMuri Nyakanga 2023, yitabiriye Inama y'Uburusiya n'Afurika yabereye i Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg, rukaba rwari urugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga kuva kudeta yo mu 2021. Nyuma y'iyo nama, yahuye na Perezida Vladimir Putin baganira ku nkunga y'ubukungu n'ubutabazi Uburusiya buha Mali. Muri iyo nama, Go\u00efta yashinje ibihugu byafatiye Mali ibihano \"gukoresha uburyo bw'ubukoloni bushya\".\nNyuma ya kudeta yo muri Nyakanga 2023 muri Nigeri, Go\u00efta yashyigikiye agatsiko k'abasirikare kafashe ubutegetsi muri icyo gihugu (CNSP), maze na ko kemerera ingabo za Mali kwinjira muri Nigeri. Ku wa 16 Nzeri 2023, ari kumwe na Kapiteni Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 wa Burkina Faso na Jenerali Abdourahamane Tiani wa Nigeri, yashinze Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel (AES). Muri Mutarama 2024, Mali yatangaje ko ivuye muri CEDEAO. Go\u00efta yabaye perezida wa mbere w'Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel kuva ku wa 6 Nyakanga 2024 kugeza mu Ukuboza 2025, asimburwa na Ibrahim Traor\u00e9.\nMuri Ukwakira 2023, yagiranye ikiganiro kuri telefoni na Putin, kikaba cyari icya gatatu mu mezi atageze kuri abiri, baganira ku bucuruzi n'umutekano. Nyuma yaho, yashimiye ku mugaragaro \"inkunga yose Uburusiya buha Mali\".\nMuri Ukwakira 2024, yakiriye intumwa z'inteko ishinga amategeko ya Turukiya mu rwego rwo gutandukanya abafatanyabikorwa ba Mali mu bukungu no mu by'umutekano. Turukiya yagaragaje ko ishyigikiye ingabo za Mali (FAMa) mu rugamba rwo kurwanya iterabwoba; muri Nyakanga 2024, Perezida wa Turukiya Recep Tayyip Erdo\u011fan yari yamwijeje inkunga ye mu kiganiro kuri telefoni.\nIbitero byo muri Mata 2026.\nKu wa 25 Mata 2026, Umutwe wo Kubohora Azawad (FLA) n'Itsinda rishyigikira Isilamu n'Abayisilamu (JNIM) bagabye hamwe ibitero mu bice byinshi bya Mali. Nk'uko ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare bubivuga, abarwanyi bagerageje kwica Go\u00efta bakoresheje imodoka yuzuyemo ibisasu bari bagenewe kohereza ku nzu ye. Yamaze iminsi atagaragara mu ruhame, yongera kugaragara ku wa 29 Mata ubwo yakiraga ambasaderi w'Uburusiya. Ku wa 4 Gicurasi 2026, yigize Minisitiri w'Ingabo, asimbura Sadio Camara wiciwe muri ibyo bitero, naho umugaba mukuru w'ingabo Oumar Diarra agirwa Minisitiri wungirije.\nPolitiki y'ubukungu.\nKu butegetsi bwa Go\u00efta, umugabane wa Leta mu mishinga y'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro wavuye kuri 20 % ugera kuri 35 %, Leta ikagira n'uburenganzira bwo kongeraho andi 10 %. Ibigo by'ubucukuzi bisabwa kwishyura imisoro mishya no kwishyura imisoro byari birimo, bitabikora bigahanwa bikomeye. Ashyigikira ko ibigo bihinduka ibya Leta, nk'uko byagenze ku birombe bibiri bya zahabu, Morila na Yatela, ubu biri mu maboko ya Leta yose. Igenzura ryategetswe na Go\u00efta ryagaragaje ko hari \"amakosa\" mu masezerano y'ubucukuzi.\nIsura ye mu ruhame.\nAssimi Go\u00efta yiyerekana nk'\"Umurinzi n'Umubohozi wa Mali\" kandi nk'\"umuntu udasanzwe mu bihe bidasanzwe\", isura ijyanye n'imigani n'imigenzo ya Mali. Imvugo ye yo kubohora igihugu ifatwa nk'iy'abaharanira kubungabunga imigenzo bashingiye ku rubanda (\"populisme conservateur\"), aho kuba iy'impinduramatwara y'ibumoso.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe mu 2023 n'umuryango w'Abadage Friedrich-Ebert-Stiftung bwagaragaje ko Abanyamali benshi cyane bishimiye ubutegetsi bw'inzibacyuho buyobowe na Assimi Go\u00efta.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAssimi Go\u00efta yashakanye na Lala Diallo. Ni Umuyisilamu."}
{"id": "23180", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23180", "title": "Abdourahamane Tiani", "text": "Abdourahamane Tiani (rimwe na rimwe yandikwa Tchiani mu binyamakuru byo mu Burengerazuba; yavutse mu 1964 i Toukounous, mu karere ka Filingu\u00e9, muri Nigeri) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyanijeri, akaba Perezida wa Nigeri kuva mu 2025. Afite ipeti rya Jenerali w'ingabo (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral d'arm\u00e9e\").\nKuva mu 2011 kugeza mu 2023, yayoboye ingabo zirinda Perezida wa Repubulika. Muri Nyakanga 2023, yahiritse ku butegetsi Perezida Mohamed Bazoum, ayobora Akanama k'Igihugu gashinzwe Kurengera Igihugu (\"Conseil national pour la sauvegarde de la patrie\", CNSP), agatsiko k'abasirikare kafashe ubutegetsi. Ku wa 26 Werurwe 2025, yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Repubulika mu gihe cy'imyaka itanu.\nKu butegetsi bwe, Nigeri yavuye mu Muryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu by'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO), ishinga Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel (AES) hamwe na Mali na Burukina Faso, yirukana ingabo z'Ubufaransa n'iza Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, kandi yegera Uburusiya. Akunzwe na benshi mu gihugu kubera imvugo ye irwanya ubukoloni bushya kandi iharanira ubumwe bw'Afurika, ariko ubutegetsi bwe bufatwa nk'ubw'igitugu.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAbdourahamane Tiani yavutse mu 1964 mu muryango w'Abahawusa. Akomoka i Toukounous, mu Ntara ya Tillab\u00e9ri, akarere k'iburengerazuba bw'igihugu gakunze kuvamo abasirikare benshi b'ingabo za Nigeri.\nYize amashuri abanza iwabo i Toukounous, akomereza muri \"Coll\u00e8ge d'enseignement g\u00e9n\u00e9ral\" (CEG) ya Filingu\u00e9, arangiriza amashuri yisumbuye i Niamey, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye (baccalaur\u00e9at s\u00e9rie D) mu 1984. Uwo mwaka, yinjiye mu gisirikare, yiga mu Ishuri rikuru ry'abofisiye rya Thi\u00e8s, muri Senegali.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nMbere yo kuyobora ingabo zirinda Perezida, yayoboye ingabo mu ntara za Zinder, Agadez na Diffa, aho yarwanyaga icuruzwa ry'ibiyobyabwenge. Yahawe amahugurwa y'ingabo zirwanira ku butaka i Montpellier mu Ubufaransa, i Benguerir muri Maroke n'i Koulikoro muri Mali, ndetse no muri \"College of International Security Affairs\" (CISA) i Washington, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika.\nMu 1989, ni we musirikare mukuru wa mbere wageze ahaguye indege ya UTA Flight 772 mu butayu bwa T\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9, abiherwa umudari. Yakoze kandi mu butumwa bwo kubungabunga amahoro bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye muri C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, muri Sudani no muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ndetse no mu Ngabo zihuriweho n'ibihugu byinshi (\"Force multinationale mixte\") zashyizweho na Nigeri, Cadi, Nijeriya na Kameruni kurwanya Boko Haram.\nMu 2011, Perezida Mahamadou Issoufou yamugize umuyobozi w'ingabo zirinda Perezida, maze aba umwe mu bamwizeraga cyane; mu 2018, Issoufou yamuzamuye ku ipeti rya Jenerali wa burigade. Mu 2015, yashinjwe kugira uruhare mu mugambi wo guhirika Issoufou, ariko ahakana ibyo aregwa imbere y'urukiko.\nMu 2021, ni we wayoboye umutwe waburijemo umugambi wa kudeta, ubwo itsinda ry'abasirikare ryageragezaga gufata ingoro ya perezida, habura iminsi ibiri ngo Issoufou ahererekanye ubutegetsi n'uwamusimbuye watowe mu buryo bwa demokarasi, Mohamed Bazoum. Muri Mata 2021, Bazoum yamugumishije ku mwanya we. Tiani yagize uruhare mu kuburizamo imigambi ibiri ya kudeta yari igamije Bazoum, mbere y'uko na we amuhirika.\nKu butegetsi.\nKudeta ya 2023.\nKu wa 26 Nyakanga 2023, Tiani yategetse abasirikare barinda Perezida gufunga Bazoum mu nzu ye y'i Niamey. Bazoum yari ateganya kumukura ku mwanya we: nk'uko abamwegereye babivuga, yari yarabyemeje mu nama y'abaminisitiri yo ku wa 24 Nyakanga, kuko umubano wabo wari warazambye. Iyirukanwa rye n'ivugurura ry'ingabo zirinda Perezida byari biteganyijwe ku wa 27 Nyakanga 2023. Kuva icyo gihe, Bazoum n'umugore we Hadiza bafungiwe mu gice kimwe cy'inzu ya perezida.\nKu wa 28 Nyakanga 2023, nyuma y'iminsi ibiri y'imishyikirano mu ngabo, Tiani yagaragaye kuri televiziyo y'igihugu nka perezida wa CNSP. Yavuze ko kudeta yakozwe kugira ngo hirindwe \"irimbuka rigenda buhoro buhoro kandi ridashobora kwirindwa\" ry'igihugu, ashinja Bazoum guhisha \"ukuri gukomeye\" kw'igihugu, yise \"ikirundo cy'abapfuye, abavuye mu byabo, ugusuzugurwa n'agahinda\". Yanenze kandi ko ingamba z'umutekano za guverinoma nta musaruro zatanze.\nKu wa 4 Kanama 2023, yakoze impinduka za mbere mu ngabo: hafi abagaba bakuru bose b'ingabo basimbuwe, abamwegereye n'inshuti ze bazamurwa mu ntera. Ku wa 7 Kanama 2023, yagize Ali Lamine Zeine, wahoze ari Minisitiri w'Imari, Minisitiri w'Intebe. Mu ijoro ryo ku wa 9 Kanama 2023, mbere gato y'inama idasanzwe ya CEDEAO yerekeye Nigeri, CNSP yashyizeho guverinoma y'inzibacyuho, maze ku wa 11 Kanama ayobora inama ya mbere y'abaminisitiri.\nUmubano na CEDEAO.\nCEDEAO yasubije kuri iyo kudeta ishyiraho ibihano bikaze kurusha ibindi byose yigeze gufatira igihugu kinyamuryango: gufunga imipaka yose na Nigeri, guhagarika ihererekanya ry'amafaranga no gufatira umutungo w'igihugu mu mabanki yo hanze, isaba ko Bazoum asubizwa ku butegetsi. Ku wa 19 Kanama 2023, mu ijambo yagejeje ku baturage, Tiani yatangaje ibiganiro by'igihugu bihuriweho na bose n'inzibacyuho y'imyaka itatu. Yamaganye ibihano bya CEDEAO, avuga ko \"binyuranyije n'amategeko kandi bitarimo ubumuntu\"; CEDEAO yo yanze iyo nzibacyuho y'imyaka itatu, isaba ko ubutegetsi buhita bushyikirizwa abasivili. Uwo munsi, intumwa za CEDEAO zari i Niamey zahuye n'agatsiko k'abasirikare ndetse na Bazoum wahiritswe. Ni bwo bwa nyuma bahuye na we.\nNigeri imaze kuva muri CEDEAO hamwe na Mali na Burkina Faso mu 2024, uwo muryango wakuyeho ibihano kubera impamvu z'ubutabazi.\nIhuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel n'ububanyi n'amahanga.\nTiani yahuye n'abayobozi ba Mali na Burkina Faso, biyemeza gufatanya mu by'umutekano no muri politiki mu rwego rw'Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel (AES), ryabaye Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu (\"Conf\u00e9d\u00e9ration\") muri Nyakanga 2024. Ingabo za Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika n'iz'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi zavuye mu gihugu, maze Nigeri yegera Uburusiya; abacancuro b'itsinda rya Wagner boherejwe gufasha Nigeri kurwanya inyeshyamba z'abajihadi.\nMu Ukuboza 2024, Tiani yashinje Ubufaransa na Nijeriya gufatanya n'imitwe y'inyeshyamba kugira ngo bahungabanye ubutegetsi bwa Nigeri, ashinja kandi Nijeriya kwangiza umuyoboro wa peteroli ugana muri Bene; Nijeriya yahakanye ibyo birego.\nKuba Perezida wa Repubulika.\nKuva ku wa 15 kugeza ku wa 18 Gashyantare 2025, habaye inama nkuru y'ivugurura ry'igihugu (\"assises de la refondation\"). Yasabye ko Tiani agirwa Perezida wa Repubulika mu gihe cy'imyaka itanu ishobora kongerwa, ahabwa ipeti rya Jenerali w'ingabo, yemeza itegeko ry'ivugurura (\"charte de la refondation\") kandi isaba ko amashyaka ya politiki aseswa.\nKu wa 26 Werurwe 2025, yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Repubulika mu gihe cy'imyaka itanu, imbere y'uwahoze ari Perezida Mahamadou Issoufou n'intumwa z'Ihuriro ry'Ibihugu bya Sahel. Uwo munsi, yazamuwe ku ipeti rya Jenerali w'ingabo, ashyira umukono ku itegeko nshinga ry'inzibacyuho, maze asesa amashyaka yose ya politiki.\nAbasesenguzi bavuga ko politiki ye y'imbere mu gihugu ifite intego eshatu z'ingenzi: kuvugurura igisirikare, guteza imbere ubukungu (harimo kugabanya kwishingikiriza kuri uraniyumu binyuze mu gushora imari mu buhinzi, ibikorwa remezo n'ingufu zisubira), no kurwanya ruswa.\nPolitiki y'imibereho myiza.\nTiani akurikiza politiki ishyigikira imigenzo gakondo. Yakuyeho itegeko No 2015-36 rirwanya icuruzwa ry'abimukira, ryabuzaga ivangura rishingiye ku mpamvu zitandukanye harimo n'icyerekezo cy'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Muri Kamena 2026, igitabo gishya cy'amategeko ahana cyashyizeho igifungo cy'imyaka 5 kugeza ku 10 ku bakora ubutinganyi.\nItegeko nshinga ry'inzibacyuho ryo mu 2025 ryagize Igihawusa ururimi rw'igihugu, Igifaransa kigabanyirizwa agaciro.\nPolitiki y'ubukungu.\nMuri Ukwakira 2023, ibihano n'ihagarikwa ry'inkunga mpuzamahanga byatumye Nigeri iba kimwe mu bihugu bikennye cyane ku isi. Agatsiko k'abasirikare kagabanyije ingengo y'imari ya 2023 ho 40 %. Nijeriya, yahaga Nigeri 71 % by'amashanyarazi yayo mbere ya kudeta, yahagaritse kuyaha, ku buryo muri Ukwakira 2023 ikigo cya Leta Nigelec cyabashaga gutanga hagati ya kimwe cya kane na kimwe cya kabiri cy'amashanyarazi akenewe mu gihugu.\nMuri Gashyantare 2024, hashyizweho itegeko rishya ryatumye amafaranga akoreshwa mu gisirikare atagengwa n'amategeko y'amasoko ya Leta, bigatuma kugura intwaro no gukoresha abacancuro byihuta. Muri Kamena 2024, ubutegetsi bwambuye ikigo cy'Abafaransa Orano uruhushya rwo gucukura uraniyumu mu kirombe cya Imouraren, kimwe mu binini ku isi, maze nyuma y'iminsi mike gitangaza ko icyo kirombe gisubijwe mu mutungo rusange wa Leta.\nUmugambi wa kudeta wo mu 2026.\nMuri Kanama 2026, abasirikare bigometse bagerageje guhirika Tiani i Niamey. Visi-perezida wa CNSP, Salifou Modi, yatangaje kuri televiziyo y'igihugu ko uwo mugambi waburijwemo.\nIsura ye mu ruhame.\nMu gihugu, hakwirakwijwe poropaganda n'indirimbo zimushyigikira. Umushakashatsi Taiwo Adeagbo avuga ko Abahawusa, ari bo benshi muri Nigeri, batashyigikiraga Bazoum kubera inkomoko ye y'Abarabu ba Ouled Slimane, maze bakaba abayoboke ba Tiani kubera imvugo ye ishingiye ku bwoko no ku rubanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nTiani arubatse, akaba afite abana batanu. Avuga Igifaransa, Igihawusa, Ikizarma n'Icyongereza."}
{"id": "23181", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23181", "title": "Abdelmadjid Tebboune", "text": "Abdelmadjid Tebboune (mu Cyarabu: \u0639\u0628\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062c\u064a\u062f \u062a\u0628\u0648\u0646; wavutse ku wa 17 Ugushyingo 1945 i M\u00e9cheria, muri Aligeriya) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyaligeriya, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Aligeriya akaba na Minisitiri w'Ingabo z'Igihugu kuva mu 2019.\nYabaye guverineri (\"wali\") w'intara nyinshi, aba minisitiri inshuro nyinshi ku butegetsi bwa Chadli Bendjedid na Abdelaziz Bouteflika, cyane cyane Minisitiri w'Imiturire. Yabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe kuva muri Gicurasi kugeza muri Kanama 2017, ari we Minisitiri w'Intebe wamaze igihe gito kurusha abandi mu mateka y'igihugu. Mu Ukuboza 2019, nyuma y'imyigaragambyo ya \"Hirak\" yatumye Bouteflika yegura, yatorewe kuba Perezida wa Repubulika mu matora yitabiriwe na bake. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2024 ku majwi 84,3 %.\nKu butegetsi bwe, Itegeko Nshinga ryavuguruwe mu 2020 no mu 2026, ariko abanenga ubutegetsi bwe bavuga ko ubwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru n'ubw'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bwagabanutse. Mu bubanyi n'amahanga, umubano wa Aligeriya na Maroke n'Ubufaransa warazambye, mu gihe yegereye Uburusiya, Ubushinwa n'Ubutaliyani.\nUbuzima.\nUmuryango n'amashuri.\nAbdelmadjid Tebboune yavutse ku wa 17 Ugushyingo 1945 i M\u00e9cheria, mu ntara ya Na\u00e2ma y'ubu, icyo gihe yari mu karere ka A\u00efn Sefra. Akomoka mu muryango wo muri komine ya Boussemghoun, mu ntara ya El-Bayadh y'ubu, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Aligeriya. Se, Ahmed Tebboune, yari \"cheikh\" wo mu Ishyirahamwe ry'Abamenyi b'Abayisilamu ba Aligeriya (\"Association des oul\u00e9mas musulmans alg\u00e9riens\"), akaba n'umusirikare. Yarangije amashuri mu Ishuri rikuru ry'Igihugu ry'Ubuyobozi (\"\u00c9cole nationale d'administration\", ENA) mu 1969, mu gice cy'ubukungu n'imari.\nUmwuga mu buyobozi.\nYatangiye akazi mu 1969 nk'umuyobozi w'imenyereza mu ntara ya Saoura; icyo gihe yinjiye mu ishyaka rya \"Front de lib\u00e9ration nationale\" (FLN). Yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru w'intara za Djelfa (1975\u20131976), Adrar (1977\u20131979), Blida (1979\u20131982) na M'Sila (1982\u20131983). Nyuma yaho yabaye guverineri (\"wali\") w'intara ya Adrar (1983\u20131984), iya Tiaret (1984\u20131989) n'iya Tizi Ouzou (1989\u20131991).\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMinisitiri.\nMuri Kamena 1991, yagizwe Minisitiri wungirije ushinzwe inzego z'ibanze muri guverinoma ya Sid Ahmed Ghozali, ava muri guverinoma mu 1992. Mu 1999, Perezida Abdelaziz Bouteflika yamugize Minisitiri w'Itumanaho n'Umuco, nyuma y'amezi atandatu asubizwa ku mwanya wa Minisitiri wungirije ushinzwe inzego z'ibanze. Mu 2001, yagizwe Minisitiri w'Imiturire n'Imigi, umwanya yamazeho kugeza mu 2002. Muri icyo gihe, izina rye ryavuzwe mu rubanza rwa \"Khalifa\", rwerekeye isenyuka ry'itsinda ry'ibigo by'umucuruzi Rafik Khalifa.\nKu wa 3 Nzeri 2012, yongeye kugirwa Minisitiri w'Imiturire n'Imigi muri guverinoma ya Abdelmalek Sellal, umwanya yagumyeho kugeza mu 2017. Ku wa 19 Mutarama 2017, nyuma y'urupfu rwa Bakhti Bela\u00efb, yahawe n'umwanya wa Minisitiri w'Ubucuruzi w'agateganyo.\nMinisitiri w'Intebe (2017).\nKu wa 24 Gicurasi 2017, nyuma y'amatora y'abadepite, Bouteflika yamugize Minisitiri w'Intebe asimbura Abdelmalek Sellal; icyo gihe yafatwaga nk'inshuti y'umugaba mukuru w'ingabo, Ahmed Ga\u00efd Salah. Guverinoma ye yashyizweho ku wa 25 Gicurasi.\nKu wa 15 Kanama 2017, nyuma y'amezi atageze kuri atatu, Bouteflika yaramwirukanye amusimbuza Ahmed Ouyahia. Impamvu zavuzwe ni ubushake bwe bwo kugabanya ibitumizwa mu mahanga no kurwanya ruswa, ndetse n'icyo ibiro bya perezida byise \"gutoteza abacuruzi\". Muri Nyakanga, guverinoma ye yari yihanangirije ibigo binini byari byatsindiye amasoko ya Leta, harimo ikigo ETRHB cy'umucuruzi Ali Haddad, wari inshuti ya Sa\u00efd Bouteflika, murumuna wa Perezida. Yabaye atyo Minisitiri w'Intebe wamaze igihe gito kurusha abandi mu mateka ya Aligeriya. Izo ngamba zatumye akundwa n'abaturage, avugwa nk'ushobora gusimbura Bouteflika.\nAmatora ya perezida yo mu 2019.\nMuri Nzeri 2019, mu gihe cy'imyigaragambyo ya \"Hirak\" yari yatumye Bouteflika yegura, yatangaje ko aziyamamaza mu matora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza. Yiyita \"umukandida w'abaturage\", yasezeranyije kuvugurura Itegeko Nshinga n'itegeko ry'amatora no gushyiraho \"demokarasi nyayo\". Abigaragambyaga baramwamaganye, abamunenga bakamwita \"umukandida w'igisirikare\".\nKu wa 12 Ukuboza 2019, yatowe ku majwi 58 % mu cyiciro cya mbere, mu matora abantu batageze kuri 40 % bitabiriye, atsinze abakandida b'amashyaka abiri makuru, FLN na RND. Abasesenguzi bamwe bavuze ko imibare yatangajwe \"iteye amakenga\". Mu kiganiro cye cya mbere n'abanyamakuru nyuma yo gutorwa, yavuze ko arambuye ukuboko kuri \"Hirak\" kandi ashyigikiye ibiganiro.\nPerezida wa Repubulika.\nIrahira n'ingamba za mbere.\nKu wa 19 Ukuboza 2019, yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Rubanda ya Aligeriya. Ni we Perezida wa mbere wa Aligeriya utarabaye umurwanyi (\"moudjahid\") mu ntambara y'ubwigenge, akaba kandi ari we wari ukuze kurusha abandi atangiye manda. Yasabye ko atazongera kwitwa \"Nyakubahwa\" (\"Excellence\"), izina ryari ryarakoreshejwe cyane ku butegetsi bwa Bouteflika. Ku wa 28 Ukuboza 2019, yagize Abdelaziz Djerad Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nIvugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga.\nKu wa 8 Mutarama 2020, yashyizeho akanama k'impuguke 17, abenshi bakaba ari abarimu b'amategeko nshinga, kayobowe na Ahmed Laraba, gashinzwe gutegura ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga. Yagasabye kwibanda ku ngingo zirindwi, harimo kongera uburenganzira bw'abaturage, kurwanya ruswa, kuringaniza ububasha, kwigenga kw'ubucamanza, no gushyiraho manda ebyiri gusa ku mukuru w'igihugu, \"zidashobora guhinduka\". Umushinga watangajwe ku wa 7 Gicurasi 2020 wanenzwe kuko utahinduraga ubutegetsi bushingiye cyane kuri perezida.\nKamarampaka yo ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 2020 yemeje iryo vugurura ku majwi 66,8 %, ariko abitabiriye bari 23 % gusa; Tebboune yashyize umukono ku iteka ririshyira mu bikorwa ku wa 30 Ukuboza 2020. Ku wa 18 Gashyantare 2021, yasheshe Inteko Ishinga Amategeko (APN), ategeka amatora y'abadepite mbere y'igihe.\nMu 2026, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yemeje ku bwiganze busesuye irindi vugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga. Abahanga mu mategeko barimo Massensen Cherbi na Mouloud Boumghar bavuga ko iryo vugurura ryongereye ububasha bwa Perezida. Nyuma y'inkongi z'amashyamba zo mu 2026, Tebboune yasabye ko igitabo cy'amategeko ahana kivugururwa kugira ngo abatwika amashyamba bahanishwe igihano cy'urupfu.\nUmuhanga mu mateka Jean-Pierre Filiu avuga ko umugaba mukuru w'ingabo, Sa\u00efd Chengriha, ari we ufite ububasha bukomeye kurusha Perezida; ikinyamakuru \"Jeune Afrique\" cyo kivuga ko bombi ari bo bagabo babiri bakomeye kurusha abandi mu gihugu.\n\"Hirak\" n'ubwisanzure.\nMuri Gashyantare 2020, Tebboune yavuze ko \"Hirak\" ari \"ikintu cyiza cyakijije igihugu\", maze ashyiraho ku wa 22 Gashyantare \"Umunsi w'igihugu w'ubuvandimwe n'ubumwe hagati y'abaturage n'ingabo zabo kubera demokarasi\". Ku wa 17 Werurwe 2020, mu rwego rwo kurwanya icyorezo cya COVID-19, yabujije imyigaragambyo yose. Amnesty International yamaganye ko, mu gihe amaso yose yari ku cyorezo, ubutegetsi bwihutishaga ikurikiranwa n'imanza z'abarwanashyaka, abanyamakuru n'abashyigikiye \"Hirak\".\nKu wa 1 Werurwe 2020, avuga ku ifungwa ry'abanyamakuru barimo Khaled Drareni, yavuze ko bamwe muri bo bakorera itangazamakuru ry'amahanga \"ritewe inkunga n'amahanga\" kugira ngo risenye inzego z'igihugu. Ku wa 15 Nzeri 2020, Drareni yakatiwe mu bujurire igifungo cy'imyaka ibiri. Ku wa 18 Gashyantare 2021, Tebboune yahaye imbabazi abantu bagera kuri 60 bari bafunzwe kubera \"Hirak\". Ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 2024, ku isabukuru y'imyaka 70 y'itangazo ryo ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 1954, yahaye imbabazi imfungwa zirenga 4 000, barimo umunyamakuru Ihsane El Kadi.\nIndwara ya COVID-19.\nMuri Ukwakira 2020, byatangajwe ko Tebboune yanduye COVID-19; ku wa 28 Ukwakira yajyanywe mu Budage kuvurwa, Minisitiri w'Intebe Abdelaziz Djerad amusimbura mu mirimo ye. Yagarutse muri Aligeriya ku wa 29 Ukuboza 2020, asubira i Berlin ku wa 10 Mutarama 2021 kubagwa ikirenge kubera ingaruka za COVID-19, agaruka ku wa 12 Gashyantare 2021.\nUbukungu.\nKu wa 15 Gashyantare 2022, yatangaje ko urubyiruko rufite hagati y'imyaka 19 na 40 rudafite akazi ruzajya ruhabwa amafaranga y'ingoboka, mu gihe ubushomeri bwari burenze 15 %. Nyuma y'igitero cy'Uburusiya kuri Ukraine, yemereye Ubutaliyani n'Uburayi kongererwa gaze; ku wa 18 Nyakanga 2022, yasinyanye na Minisitiri w'Intebe w'Ubutaliyani Mario Draghi amasezerano y'agaciro ka miliyari 4 z'amayero, bituma Aligeriya iba igihugu cya mbere gihaye Ubutaliyani gaze nyinshi. Muri Nzeri 2022, yatangaje ko ashaka gutandukanya ubukungu bw'igihugu no kongera ibyoherezwa mu mahanga bitari peteroli na gaze.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nMu gihe cy'intambara yo muri Libiya, Aligeriya yongeye kugira uruhare muri icyo kibazo; Tebboune yitabiriye inama ya Berlin yerekeye Libiya ku wa 19 Mutarama 2020, kandi muri Nyakanga 2021 yemereye Libiya \"ubufasha bwuzuye\" ubwo yakiraga Mohamed el-Menfi. Ku wa 24 Mutarama 2022, yasuye Perezida wa Misiri Abdel Fattah al-Sissi i Kayiro, akaba ari bwo bwa mbere Perezida wa Aligeriya yari asuye Misiri kuva mu 2008.\nKu wa 27 Gicurasi 2020, nyuma y'ishyirwa ahagaragara rya filime mbarankuru ebyiri ku \"Hirak\" kuri televiziyo z'Abafaransa, Aligeriya yahamagaje ambasaderi wayo i Paris. Ku wa 7 Gicurasi 2020, yagize ku wa 8 Gicurasi \"umunsi wo kwibuka\" ubwicanyi bwabereye i S\u00e9tif, Guelma na Kherrata mu 1945, kandi yashimye icyemezo cy'Ubufaransa cyo gusubiza Aligeriya ibihanga by'abarwanyi 24 bishwe mu gihe cy'ubukoloni. Mu Ukuboza 2022, yakiriye Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Ubufaransa G\u00e9rald Darmanin, bakemura ikibazo cya viza zari zaragabanyijwe kuva muri Nzeri 2021.\nKuva mu 2021, Aligeriya na Maroke bafitanye amakimbirane ya dipolomasi nyuma y'aho Maroke isubukuriye umubano na Isiraheli; ibihugu byombi bihanganye ku kibazo cya Sahara y'Iburengerazuba, aho Aligeriya ishyigikira ubwigenge bwayo. Aligeriya ifitanye umubano wihariye na Tuniziya ya Ka\u00efs Sa\u00efed. Ku wa 13 Kamena 2023, yatangiye uruzinduko rw'iminsi itatu mu Burusiya, aho we na Vladimir Putin biyemeje gukomeza \"ubufatanye bw'ingenzi\" hagati y'ibihugu byombi; kuva ku wa 17 kugeza ku wa 21 Nyakanga 2023, yasuye Ubushinwa. Mu 2024, yanenze intambara ya Isiraheli muri Gaza, ayishinja jenoside ku Banyapalestina.\nMuri Mutarama 2024, yamaganye \"ibikorwa by'ubwanzi\" bya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu, azishinja gushaka guhungabanya Aligeriya n'umubano wayo n'abaturanyi bayo, nka Mali, Nigeri na Libiya, kugira ngo zishyigikire Maroke. Ku wa 10 Nzeri 2026, Aligeriya yacanye umubano wa dipolomasi na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu, yirukana ambasaderi wazo.\nAmatora ya perezida yo mu 2024.\nMuri Gicurasi 2024, ishyaka El Bina rya Abdelkader Bengrina ryatangaje ko rishyigikiye Perezida uriho, maze Tebboune yemeza kandidatire ye ku wa 11 Nyakanga. Mu kwiyamamaza, yakoreshaga cyane urubuga rwa TikTok, bimuhesha akazina ka \"Tonton Tebboune\" (Nyirarume Tebboune) ku mbuga nkoranyambaga.\nKu wa 7 Nzeri 2024, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 84,3 %. Imibare y'abitabiriye amatora, yavuye kuri 26,46 % igera kuri 48,03 % mu masaha atatu, yateje impaka mu bakurikiranira hafi amatora n'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Ibyavuye mu matora bya nyuma, byatangajwe ku wa 14 Nzeri, byari bitandukanye cyane n'iby'agateganyo: amajwi ya Tebboune yavuye kuri 94,65 % agera kuri 84,30 %.\nUbuzima bwite.\nTebboune yashakanye na Fatima Zohra Bella, bafitanye abana batanu: Saloua, Maha, Salaheddine Ilyes, Mohamed na Khaled. Umuhungu we Khaled yafunzwe muri Kamena 2018 mu rubanza rwa ruswa, agirwa umwere muri Gashyantare 2020. Tebboune azwiho kunywa itabi cyane.\nKuva Liamine Z\u00e9roual yapfa mu 2026, ni we Perezida wa Aligeriya wenyine ukiriho."}
{"id": "23182", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23182", "title": "Jo\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o", "text": "Jo\u00e3o Manuel Gon\u00e7alves Louren\u00e7o (wavutse ku wa 5 Werurwe 1954 i Lobito, muri Angola) ni umujenerali n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyangola, akaba Perezida wa gatatu wa Repubulika ya Angola kuva ku wa 26 Nzeri 2017. Kuva muri Nzeri 2018, ni na we Perezida w'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi, \"Movimento Popular de Liberta\u00e7\u00e3o de Angola\" (MPLA).\nYarwanye intambara y'ubwigenge bwa Angola, yiga amateka mu Ubumwe bw'Abasoviyeti, nyuma aba guverineri w'intara, umunyamabanga mukuru wa MPLA (1998\u20132003), visi-perezida wa mbere w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko (2003\u20132014) na Minisitiri w'Ingabo (2014\u20132017). Yasimbuye Jos\u00e9 Eduardo dos Santos wari umaze imyaka 38 ku butegetsi.\nKu butegetsi bwe, yarwanyije ruswa n'ikimenyane by'umuryango wa dos Santos, ndetse yegereza Angola ibihugu by'Uburengerazuba. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2022. Kuva muri Gashyantare 2025 kugeza muri Gashyantare 2026, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika, kandi yabaye umuhuza mu makimbirane yo mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana.\nLouren\u00e7o yakuriye mu muryango w'abana icumi wari ufite ibitekerezo bya politiki. Se, Sequeira Jo\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o (1923\u20131999), wakomokaga i Malanje, yari umuganga akaba n'uharanira ubwigenge, wafunzwe imyaka itatu n'ubutegetsi bw'abakoloni b'Abanyaporutigali azira ibikorwa bya politiki. Nyina, Josefa Gon\u00e7alves Cipriano Louren\u00e7o (1928\u20131997), wakomokaga i Namibe, yari umudozi. Yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye mu ntara ya Bi\u00e9 n'i Luanda.\nAmashuri n'urugendo mu gisirikare.\nYize mu Ishuri ry'Inganda rya Luanda. Muri Kanama 1974, nyuma y'isenyuka ry'ubutegetsi bw'abakoloni b'Abanyaporutigali, yari mu itsinda rya mbere ry'abasirikare ba MPLA binjiye mu gihugu banyuze i Miconge, berekeza mu mujyi wa Cabinda. Yarwanye intambara y'ubwigenge bwa Angola, nyuma arwana ku ruhande rwa MPLA mu ntambara y'abenegihugu.\nYahuguwe mu by'imbunda nini (\"artillerie\"), aba umusirikare ushinzwe politiki muri MPLA. Kuva mu 1978 kugeza mu 1982, yize mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare n'irya politiki rya Lenin mu Bumwe bw'Abasoviyeti, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu mateka. Yabaye komiseri w'intara, hanyuma umuyobozi w'ishami rikuru rya politiki ry'Ingabo za rubanda zo kubohora Angola (FAPLA).\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMu 1984, yagizwe guverineri w'intara ya Moxico, maze muri Mata 1986, Perezida Jos\u00e9 Eduardo dos Santos amugira guverineri w'intara ya Benguela. Kuva mu 1992 kugeza mu 1997, yari umunyamabanga ushinzwe itangazamakuru muri MPLA, naho kuva mu 1993 kugeza mu 1998 ayobora itsinda ry'abadepite ba MPLA mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko.\nKu wa 12 Ukuboza 1998, yatorewe kuba umunyamabanga mukuru wa MPLA, bavuga ko ari ku bw'ubushake bwa dos Santos, ndetse abantu bakeka ko ashobora kuzamusimbura. Ariko mu 2001, ubwo dos Santos yavugaga ko atazongera kwiyamamaza, Louren\u00e7o yagaragaje ku mugaragaro ko yifuza kuba umukandida wa MPLA; ibyo byamuteranyije na dos Santos, utari afite umugambi nyakuri wo kuva ku butegetsi, ahubwo washakaga kumenya abo bahanganye. Mu Ukuboza 2003, yasimbuwe ku mwanya w'umunyamabanga mukuru wa MPLA.\nKuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2014, yabaye visi-perezida wa mbere w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko. Muri Mata 2014, yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ingabo, maze muri Kanama 2016 agirwa visi-perezida wa MPLA.\nPerezida wa Angola.\nManda ya mbere (2017\u20132022).\nMu Ukuboza 2016, MPLA yamutoranyije kuba umukandida wayo wa mbere ku rutonde rw'amatora y'abadepite yo muri Kanama 2017. Yafatwaga nk'umuntu w'inararibonye wo mu ishyaka, ushyira mu gaciro. Muri Gashyantare 2017, dos Santos yatangaje ku mugaragaro ko atazongera kwiyamamaza, kandi ko Louren\u00e7o ari we mukandida wa MPLA. Nk'uko Itegeko Nshinga ryo mu 2010 ribiteganya, umuntu uri ku isonga ry'urutonde rw'ishyaka ribonye amajwi menshi mu matora rusange ahita aba Perezida wa Repubulika. MPLA imaze gutsinda amatora ibona imyanya 150, Louren\u00e7o yabaye Perezida, ararahira ku wa 26 Nzeri 2017.\nLouren\u00e7o yarwanyije ikimenyane cyari cyarashyizweho n'uwo yasimbuye: mu Ugushyingo 2017, yirukanye Isabel dos Santos, umukobwa wa dos Santos, ku buyobozi bw'ikigo cya peteroli cya Leta Sonangol; muri Mutarama 2018, yirukana Jos\u00e9 Filomeno dos Santos, umuhungu we, ku buyobozi bw'ikigega cy'igihugu cy'ishoramari. Nyamara, umuryango wa dos Santos wakomeje kugenzura ibice byinshi by'ubukungu bwa Angola. Mu 2018, yasimbuje umuyobozi w'inzego z'iperereza (SINSE), hanyuma n'umugaba mukuru w'ingabo, nyuma y'uko aregwa mu rubanza rwa ruswa.\nKu wa 8 Nzeri 2018, mu nama nkuru ya MPLA, yatorewe kuyobora iryo shyaka ku majwi 98,59 %, asimbura dos Santos. Nyamara, igihugu cyakomeje guhura n'ibibazo by'ubukungu: ubukungu bwasubiye inyuma mu 2018, ubushomeri bugera hafi kuri 20 %, n'izamuka ry'ibiciro rikomeza kuba hejuru.\nMuri Kamena 2018, Louren\u00e7o yemeye ishyirahamwe rya mbere ry'abaryamana bahuje ibitsina muri Angola. Muri Mutarama 2019, yakuyeho itegeko ry'abakoloni ryo mu 1886 ryahanaga ubutinganyi, abuza ivangura ribakorerwa, kandi yemera gukuramo inda iyo umugore yafashwe ku ngufu cyangwa ubuzima bwe cyangwa ubw'umwana buri mu kaga.\nKu wa 1 Nyakanga 2019, mu ruzinduko muri Kiba, yahawe umudari wa Jos\u00e9 Mart\u00ed, ari wo mudari usumba iyindi muri icyo gihugu. Mu 2021, yasabye imbabazi ku mugaragaro ku bw'ubwicanyi bwakozwe mu guhashya umugambi wa kudeta wo ku wa 27 Gicurasi 1977, wahitanye abantu ibihumbi. Muri Nzeri 2020, umuyobozi w'ibiro bye, Edeltrudes Costa, yashinjwe n'iperereza ry'abanyamakuru kunyereza umutungo wa Leta, bituma abigaragambya i Luanda basaba ko yirukanwa.\nManda ya kabiri (kuva 2022).\nManda ye ya mbere yaranzwe cyane no kurwanya ruswa, ariko politiki ye y'ubukungu (gutandukanya inkomoko y'amafaranga y'igihugu no kwegurira abikorera ibigo bya Leta) ntiyagabanyije ubukene, bituma akundwa na bake. Mu matora rusange yo muri Kanama 2022, MPLA yabonye 51,17 % by'amajwi, ishyaka rikomeye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, UNITA, ribona 43,95 %. UNITA yanze ibyavuye mu matora, ariko Louren\u00e7o yongera kuba Perezida.\nKu butegetsi bwe, Angola, yari ifitanye umubano wihariye n'Ubumwe bw'Abasoviyeti hanyuma n'Uburusiya, yegereye ibihugu by'Uburengerazuba; mu 2024, Joe Biden yabaye Perezida wa mbere wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika usuye Angola. Muri Nyakanga 2025, imyigaragambyo yamagana izamuka ry'igiciro cya lisansi yahitanye abantu 22 mu minsi itatu, mu gihugu aho 40 % by'abaturage bari munsi y'umurongo w'ubukene. Mbere y'uko manda ye irangira, yihutishije kwegurira abikorera ibigo bya Leta; Itegeko Nshinga ntirimwemerera kwiyamamaza mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2027.\nUbumwe bwa Afurika n'ubuhuza.\nKuva ku wa 15 Gashyantare 2025 kugeza ku wa 14 Gashyantare 2026, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika. Yafashije kandi mu biganiro na Perezida wa Gabon Brice Oligui Nguema, byatumye uwo yahiritse ku butegetsi mu 2023, Ali Bongo, n'umuryango we barekurwa bajya kuba i Luanda. Mu 2025, yatanzwe nk'umukandida w'Igihembo cyitiriwe Nobel cy'Amahoro.\nKuva muri Nyakanga 2022 kugeza muri Werurwe 2025, yari umuhuza washyizweho n'Ubumwe bwa Afurika mu nzira y'amahoro yiswe \"Processus de Luanda\", igamije kugarura amahoro mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yateguye inama nyinshi i Luanda zahuje abayobozi ba Kongo, u Rwanda n'abandi, zivamo amasezerano yo guhagarika imirwano, nubwo akenshi yarenzwagaho n'umutwe wa M23. Muri Werurwe 2024, yasubukuye ibiganiro, bivamo andi masezerano yo guhagarika imirwano muri Nyakanga 2024. Nyuma y'inama yo ku wa 15 Ukuboza 2024 yari igamije guhuza F\u00e9lix Tshisekedi na Paul Kagame ariko ntiyabe, n'ukwanga kw'abarwanyi ba M23 kwitabira ibiganiro byo ku wa 18 Werurwe 2025, Angola yatangaje ko ihagaritse ubuhuza bwayo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye na Ana Afonso Dias Louren\u00e7o, umudepite wa MPLA wahoze ari Minisitiri w'Igenamigambi (1997\u20132012) akaba yarakoreye Banki y'Isi. Bafitanye abakobwa batatu; afite kandi umuhungu w'imfura, Henrique Manuel Pires Louren\u00e7o, yabyaranye n'undi mugore, n'abandi bana babiri. Uretse Igiporutigali, avuga Ikirusiya, Icyesipanyolo n'Icyongereza. Akiri muto, yakinaga karate (afite umukandara w'umukara) n'umupira w'amaguru; akunda gusoma, gukina \u00e9checs no kugendera ku mafarashi."}
{"id": "23183", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23183", "title": "Romuald Wadagni", "text": "Kossi Mbueke Romuald Wadagni (wavutse ku wa 20 Kamena 1976 i Lokossa, muri Bene) ni umuhanga mu ibaruramari n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyabene, akaba Perezida wa cyenda wa Repubulika ya Bene kuva ku wa 24 Gicurasi 2026.\nYamaze imyaka 17 akorera ikigo mpuzamahanga cy'igenzura n'ubujyanama Deloitte mu Ubufaransa, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika no muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu 2016, Perezida Patrice Talon yamugize Minisitiri w'Ubukungu n'Imari, umwanya yamazeho imyaka icumi, avugurura cyane ubukungu bw'igihugu no gucunga imyenda ya Leta.\nMu matora ya perezida yo muri Mata 2026, ashyigikiwe na Talon n'amashyaka ari ku butegetsi, yatsinze ku majwi agera kuri 94 %.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nRomuald Wadagni yavukiye i Lokossa ku wa 20 Kamena 1976, akaba ari imfura mu bana batanu. Se, Nestor Wadagni, wari impuguke mu ibarurishamibare n'ubukungu wize muri ENSAE, yakoze imirimo ikomeye mu butegetsi bwa Bene, maze amaze kujya mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru yandika igitabo cy'ubushakashatsi (th\u00e8se) mu mibare; nyina ni umushoramari. Akiri muto, yakundaga imirimo y'amaboko, yiga ubwubatsi n'ubukanishi.\nAmaze kubona impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye mu bumenyi muri Bene, yakomereje amashuri mu Bufaransa. Kuva mu 1995 kugeza mu 1999, yize muri \"\u00c9cole sup\u00e9rieure des affaires\" (ESA) ya Grenoble, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu by'imari ari uwa mbere mu ishuri rye. Ari i Grenoble, yahuye n'umufatanyabikorwa wa Deloitte wamushyize muri icyo kigo mu 1998.\nUmwuga muri Deloitte.\nArangije amashuri, yakoreye ibiro bya Deloitte i Lyon imyaka ine. Mu 2003, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'umuhanga mu ibaruramari wo muri Amerika (\"Certified Public Accountant\"), ajya i Boston aho yabaye umuyobozi w'igenzura (\"Audit Manager\") kugeza mu 2006, akorana n'ibigo binini nka Orange. Mu 2007, yahuguriwe muri \"Harvard Business School\" mu by'ishoramari.\nMu 2012, afite imyaka 36, yabaye umufatanyabikorwa (\"associ\u00e9\") wa Deloitte, akaba ari we wari ukiri muto kurusha abandi mu mateka y'icyo kigo. Uwo mwaka, yafunguye ibiro bya Deloitte i Kinshasa n'i Lubumbashi. Muri Ugushyingo 2015, yagizwe umuyobozi w'igenzura muri Afurika ivuga Igifaransa. Mu 2016, yari amaze imyaka 17 akorera Deloitte i Paris, Lyon, Boston, New York na Lubumbashi, azwiho ubuhanga mu mahame mpuzamahanga y'ibaruramari (IFRS).\nMinisitiri w'Ubukungu n'Imari (2016\u20132026).\nKu wa 7 Mata 2016, yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ubukungu n'Imari muri guverinoma ya mbere ya Patrice Talon. Mu gihugu cyari kiremerewe n'imyenda, yashyize imbere gutunganya imari ya Leta kugira ngo Bene yizerwe n'abaterankunga, ashyiraho politiki yo gucunga imyenda hakiri kare. Ibyo byatumye igihugu kibasha kuguza igihe kirekire no ku nyungu ziri hasi ugereranyije n'ibindi bihugu byo mu karere nka C\u00f4te d'Ivoire na Senegali.\nMuri Ukwakira 2018, yashakiye Bene inguzanyo ya miliyoni 260 z'amayero ku masoko mpuzamahanga, ubwa mbere mu mateka y'igihugu. Muri Werurwe 2019, yayoboye isohorwa rya mbere ry'impapuro mpeshamwenda mpuzamahanga (\"eurobond\") za Bene, zifite agaciro ka miliyoni 500 z'amayero. Ku wa 12 Mutarama 2021, Bene yasohoye \"eurobonds\" ebyiri, harimo imwe y'imyaka 31, bituma iba mu bihugu bike bikizamuka bifite impapuro nk'izo zirengeje imyaka 30. Muri Nyakanga 2021, Bene yabaye igihugu cya mbere cya Afurika gisohoye \"eurobond\" igenewe gutera inkunga imishinga y'Intego z'Iterambere Rirambye z'Umuryango w'Abibumbye, ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 500 z'amayero. Ku wa 29 Ugushyingo 2021, Bene yishyuye mbere y'igihe igice cy'umwenda wayo, bituma izigama miliyoni 55 z'amayero z'inyungu.\nMu gihe cy'icyorezo cya COVID-19, ubukungu bwa Bene bwakomeje guhagarara neza: mu 2021 bwazamutseho 7,2 %. Muri Werurwe 2021, ikigo Moody's cyazamuye amanota y'igihugu kuva kuri B2 kugera kuri B1. Mu 2020, nk'uko UNCTAD ibivuga, Bene yabaye igihugu cya mbere ku isi aho gushinga ikigo byoroshye kandi byihuta kurusha ahandi. Kuva mu 2018 kugeza mu 2020, yayoboye Inama y'Abaminisitiri ya UEMOA, ayobora amavugurura arimo n'irya \"franc CFA\", Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere yise \"ay'amateka\".\nMuri Gicurasi 2021, Talon yamugumishije ku mwanya we. Mu 2022, mu gihe cy'ingaruka za COVID-19 n'intambara yo muri Ukraine, guverinoma yashoye miliyari 41 z'amafaranga CFA mu kugabanya ibiciro by'ibicuruzwa by'ibanze. Muri Mata 2022, yayoboye intumwa za Bene i Washington, bagirana na FMI amasezerano y'inkunga ya miliyoni 700 z'amadolari. Mu ntangiriro za 2023, Talon yamwongereye inshingano z'ubufatanye mpuzamahanga n'iz'umutekano, cyane cyane kurinda amajyaruguru y'igihugu no kugura ibikoresho bya gisirikare.\nMuri Gashyantare 2024, Bene yasohoye impapuro mpeshamwenda za mbere mu madolari y'Amerika, ibona miliyoni 750 z'amadolari. Muri Mata 2024, ikigo Standard &amp; Poor's cyazamuye amanota y'inguzanyo ya Bene kuva kuri \"B+\" kugera kuri \"BB\u2212\", rikaba rimwe mu manota meza muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara nyuma ya Botswana, Maurice na C\u00f4te d'Ivoire. Muri Gicurasi 2024, ubushakashatsi bwa \"Open Budget Survey\" bwashyize Bene ku mwanya wa mbere mu bihugu bivuga Igifaransa mu bijyanye no gukorera mu mucyo mu ngengo y'imari. Muri Ugushyingo 2024, muri COP 29 i Bakou, yatanze gahunda yo gutera inkunga urugamba rwo kurwanya imihindagurikire y'ibihe. Mu ntangiriro za 2025, abantu benshi bifuzaga ko yiyamamariza kuyobora Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere, ariko ntiyabikora.\nPerezida wa Bene.\nAmatora yo mu 2026.\nKu wa 31 Kanama 2025, amashyaka abiri ashyigikiye Perezida, UPR na BR, yamutoranyije kuba umukandida wayo mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2026, nyuma y'inama yabereye kwa Patrice Talon. Wadagni ntabarizwa mu ishyaka na rimwe. Talon ntiyari yemerewe kwiyamamaza manda ya gatatu. Uwo bafatanyije kwiyamamaza ku mwanya wa visi-perezida yari Mariam Chabi Talata, visi-perezida wari usanzweho.\nMu matora yo ku wa 12 Mata 2026, yatsinze ku majwi 94,05 %. Umukandida w'ishyaka ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi \"Les D\u00e9mocrates\" ntiyabashije kwiyamamaza kubera kutabona abamushyigikira (\"parrainages\") bahagije. Abitabiriye amatora bari 58,75 %, kandi CEDEAO yashimye uko amatora yagenze. Nk'uko TV5 Monde ibivuga, intsinzi ye yashingiye ku cyizere yari yaragiriwe kubera amavugurura y'ubukungu yakoze ari Minisitiri w'Imari.\nKu butegetsi.\nKu wa 24 Gicurasi 2026, yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Bene mu gihe cy'imyaka irindwi, asimbura Patrice Talon, kandi uwo munsi ashyiraho guverinoma ye. Ku wa 1 Kamena 2026, yakoreye urugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga ari Perezida muri Nijeriya.\nUbuzima bwite.\nRomuald Wadagni afite abana babiri."}
{"id": "23184", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23184", "title": "Duma Boko", "text": "Duma Gideon Boko (wavutse ku wa 31 Ukuboza 1969 i Mahalapye, muri Botswana) ni umunyamategeko n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyabotswana, akaba Perezida wa gatandatu wa Repubulika ya Botswana kuva ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 2024.\nYayoboye ishyaka \"Botswana National Front\" (BNF) kuva mu 2010, ashinga ihuriro ry'amashyaka atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi \"Umbrella for Democratic Change\" (UDC), aba Umuyobozi w'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko kuva mu 2014 kugeza mu 2019. Mu matora rusange yo mu 2024, yatsinze ishyaka \"Botswana Democratic Party\" (BDP) ryari ku butegetsi kuva igihugu kibona ubwigenge mu 1966: ni bwo bwa mbere mu mateka ya Botswana ubutegetsi bwahererekanyijwe hagati y'amashyaka.\nAfatwa nk'uharanira demokarasi ishingiye ku mibereho myiza y'abaturage (\"social-d\u00e9mocrate\").\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nDuma Boko yavukiye i Mahalapye, umudugudu wo mu Ntara yo Hagati, uri ku birometero 200 mu majyaruguru y'umurwa mukuru Gaborone. Se, witabye Imana mu 2004, yari umwarimu muri Madiba Brigades. Mu 1987, yatangiye kwiga amategeko muri Kaminuza ya Botswana, aho yatorewe kujya mu nama ihagarariye abanyeshuri; arangiza mu 1993, akomereza muri \"Harvard Law School\" muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu mategeko (LLM) mu 1995.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1993 kugeza mu 2003, yigishije amategeko muri Kaminuza ya Botswana, anayobora ikigo cy'abavoka. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2000, yandikaga inkuru mu kinyamakuru \"The Monitor\", anenga abacamanza n'abashakashatsi kudakora ubushakashatsi buhagije.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nBoko yinjiye mu ishyaka rya \"Botswana National Front\" afite imyaka 21, aryobora kuva mu 2010. Abatavuga rumwe na we bamureze mu nkiko bavuga ko ubwo BNF yacikagamo ibice mu 2000 yari yabaye umwe mu bashinze \"National Democratic Front\", ariko atsinda urwo rubanza. BNF yifatanyije n'amashyaka \"Botswana Movement for Democracy\" na \"Botswana Peoples Party\" bashinga ihuriro \"Umbrella for Democratic Change\" (UDC); abayoboke bamwe ba BNF baramureze, ariko atsinda imanza zose.\nMu matora rusange yo mu 2014, UDC iyobowe na Boko yabaye iya kabiri, ibona imyanya 17 ku 37 ya BDP, maze aba Umuyobozi w'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Mu matora yo mu 2019, yatsinzwe na Anna Mokgethi wa BDP mu ntara y'itora ya Gaborone Bonnington North, atakaza uwo mwanya. Yavuze ko habayeho uburiganya bukomeye mu matora bugamije gufasha Perezida Mokgweetsi Masisi.\nAmatora yo mu 2024.\nMu matora rusange yo mu 2024, yongeye kuba umukandida wa UDC ku nshuro ya gatatu, afatanyije na Ndaba Gaolathe ku mwanya wa visi-perezida. Yiyamamaje avuga ko azatandukanya ubukungu bw'igihugu kugira ngo budashingira gusa ku bucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro, kandi azazamura imishahara, amafaranga ahabwa abanyeshuri n'izabukuru. Yasezeranyije kandi guha impushya z'akazi no gutura Abanyazimbabwe benshi badafite ibyangombwa bari mu gihugu, no kongera kuganira ku masezerano y'ubufatanye na sosiyete ya De Beers mu bijyanye na diyama.\nKu wa 30 Ukwakira 2024, ihuriro rye ryabonye imyanya 36 kuri 69 mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, mu gihe BDP isigarana imyanya ine gusa. Perezida Masisi yemeye ko yatsinzwe, aba Perezida wa mbere wa Botswana utongeye gutorwa.\nPerezida wa Botswana.\nDuma Boko yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 2024, habaho n'undi muhango rusange ku wa 8 Ugushyingo. Ni we Perezida wa mbere utaravuye muri BDP, n'uwa mbere wavutse nyuma y'ubwigenge. Ni bwo bwa mbere kuva mu 1966 ishyaka ryahoze ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi ritsinze amatora.\nMu ijambo rye rya mbere ku miterere y'igihugu, mu Ugushyingo 2024, yavuze ko guverinoma ye izateza imbere ingufu z'izuba, urumogi rukoreshwa mu buvuzi n'ikivuguto cy'inganda (\"chanvre\"), kandi ko yaganiriye na Elon Musk ku kugeza interineti ku gihugu cyose binyuze kuri Starlink. Muri Werurwe 2025, Botswana yohereje mu kirere icyogajuru cyayo cya mbere, BOTSAT-1, kivuye ku bibuga bya SpaceX muri Kaliforuniya.\nKu wa 25 Kanama 2025, yatangaje ibihe bidasanzwe by'ubuzima mu gihugu cyose, kubera ibura ry'imiti n'ibikoresho byo kwa muganga ryatewe n'ingengo y'imari idahagije n'igabanuka ry'inkunga ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika (USAID). Nyuma y'iyo ngorane, yatangaje amavugurura mu rwego rw'ubuzima, harimo kuvugurura ikigo gishinzwe kugura imiti no gushyiraho ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe amakuru y'ubuzima.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nAmaze gutorwa, yavuze ko ashyigikiye politiki y'ububanyi n'amahanga idafite aho ibogamiye, nk'iy'u Busuwisi. Muri Mutarama 2025, we na Perezida w'u Bushinwa Xi Jinping bohererezanye ubutumwa bwo kwizihiza isabukuru y'imyaka 50 y'umubano w'ibihugu byombi.\nMuri Werurwe 2025, yagiye i Washington ahura n'Umunyamabanga wa Leta w'Amerika, Marco Rubio. Umubano n'Amerika waje kurangwa n'ibibazo by'ubucuruzi: ku wa 1 Kanama 2025, Amerika yashyize umusoro wa 37 % ku bicuruzwa bya Botswana, bibangamira ibyoherezwa mu mahanga bya diyama; Botswana yatanze icyifuzo cyo guha Amerika uburenganzira bwa mbere bwo gushakisha amabuye y'agaciro y'ingenzi mu turere dutatu. Muri Ukwakira 2025, uwo musoro wari wageze kuri 15 %. Mu 2026, Boko yagize ati: \"Perezida Trump ashyira imbere Amerika, nanjye nshyira imbere Botswana\". Muri Nzeri 2026, yakiriye mu ruzinduko rwa Leta Sultani wa Omani, Haitham bin Tariq."}
{"id": "23185", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23185", "title": "\u00c9variste Ndayishimiye", "text": "\u00c9variste Ndayishimiye (wavutse ku wa 17 Kamena 1968 i Giheta, mu Ntara ya Gitega, mu Burundi) ni umujenerali n'umunyapolitiki w'Umurundi, akaba Perezida wa cumi wa Repubulika y'u Burundi kuva ku wa 18 Kamena 2020. Kuva muri Gashyantare 2026, ni na we Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika.\nMu gihe cy'intambara y'abenegihugu yo mu Burundi, yinjiye mu mutwe w'inyeshyamba \"Conseil national pour la d\u00e9fense de la d\u00e9mocratie \u2013 Forces pour la d\u00e9fense de la d\u00e9mocratie\" (CNDD-FDD), azamuka mu ntera mu ngabo zawo. Intambara irangiye, yinjiye mu ngabo z'igihugu, aba Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu, hanyuma akora mu biro bya Perezida Pierre Nkurunziza. Kuva mu 2016 kugeza mu 2020, yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru wa CNDD-FDD, ishyaka riri ku butegetsi.\nNkurunziza yamushyigikiye kugira ngo amusimbure mu matora yo mu 2020, maze atsinda ku majwi agera kuri 69 %. Ubutegetsi bwe bwanenzwe n'imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nUbuzima.\n\u00c9variste Ndayishimiye yavutse ku wa 17 Kamena 1968 i Musama, muri zone ya Kabanga, muri komine ya Giheta, mu Ntara ya Gitega. Ni umukirisitu Gatolika. Yatangiye kwiga amategeko muri Kaminuza y'u Burundi; mu 1995, ubwo abanyeshuri b'Abahutu bicwaga muri iyo kaminuza mu gihe cy'urugomo rushingiye ku moko rwajyanye n'intambara y'abenegihugu (1993\u20132005), yari umwe mu banyeshuri b'Abahutu bake bari bakiri muri iyo kaminuza, arokoka ku buryo bwa hafi.\nIntambara y'abenegihugu.\nYahunze igihugu, aba umwe mu ba mbere binjiye mu mutwe w'inyeshyamba \"Forces de d\u00e9fense de la d\u00e9mocratie\" (FDD), washinzwe nyuma y'iyicwa rya Perezida w'Umuhutu Melchior Ndadaye; bamwe mu bagize umuryango we barishwe. Mu gihe cy'imyaka icumi, mu birindiro bya FDD mu ishyamba rya Kibira no mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yabaye umuyobozi w'ingabo mu turere dutandukanye, azamuka mu ntera zose za gisirikare. Yahimbwe izina rya \"Neva\". Intambara irangiye, yari ayoboye ibiro bishinzwe gutegura politiki y'urugamba.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare no muri politiki.\nAmasezerano ya Arusha yo mu 2000 yagiye arangiza intambara buhoro buhoro: FDD yayasinye mu mpera za 2002, ireka urugamba rw'intwaro. Mu 2005, Ndayishimiye yagizwe umugaba mukuru wungirije w'Ingabo nshya z'igihugu (FDN) afite ipeti rya Jenerali. Kuva mu 2006 kugeza mu 2007, yabaye Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu.\nNyuma yaho, yabaye umukuru w'ibiro bya gisirikare bya Perezida Nkurunziza kugeza mu 2014, hanyuma mu 2015 ayobora ibiro bye bya gisivili. Muri icyo gihe, yize muri \"Wisdom University of Africa\", ahabona impamyabumenyi mu 2014, kandi ayobora Komite y'Igihugu y'Imikino Olempike igihe kirekire. Muri Kanama 2016, yatorewe kuba umunyamabanga mukuru wa CNDD-FDD, asimbura Pascal Nyabenda; bitandukanye n'uwo yasimbuye wakundaga kwibasira umuryango mpuzamahanga n'ibihugu by'Uburengerazuba, we yagaragaje ubushake bwo kuganira.\nPerezida w'u Burundi.\nAmatora yo mu 2020.\nMu 2018, nyuma y'aho abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi biyongereye, Nkurunziza yatangaje ko atazongera kwiyamamaza mu 2020. Ku wa 26 Mutarama 2020, mu nama nkuru ya CNDD-FDD yabereye i Gitega, Ndayishimiye yatoranyijwe kuba umukandida w'ishyaka mu matora ya perezida yo ku wa 20 Gicurasi 2020. Byavugwaga ko Nkurunziza yashakaga gukomeza kuyobora igihugu yihishe inyuma ye, ariko kandi ko yari umukandida wumvikanyweho na Nkurunziza n'abajenerali ba CNDD-FDD; Ndayishimiye ntiyari ahujwe n'ihohoterwa rikomeye ryabaye ku butegetsi bwa Nkurunziza, kandi yafatwaga nk'utari umunyagitugu kurusha abandi.\nYatsinze amatora ku majwi 68,72 %, atsinda umukandida ukomeye w'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Agathon Rwasa wa CNL, wabonye 24,19 %. Ubunyangamugayo bw'ayo matora bwashidikanyijweho cyane, kandi yabaye mu gihe cy'icyorezo cya COVID-19.\nUrupfu rwa Nkurunziza n'irahira.\nIhererekanyabubasha ryari riteganyijwe ku wa 20 Kanama 2020, ariko Nkurunziza yapfuye mu buryo butunguranye ku wa 8 Kamena 2020; guverinoma yavuze ko yazize \"guhagarara k'umutima\", mu gihe abenshi bakekaga ko yazize COVID-19. Ku wa 12 Kamena, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ko nta gihe cy'inzibacyuho gikenewe, rutegeka ko Ndayishimiye arahira \"vuba bishoboka\". Yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku wa 18 Kamena 2020 muri sitade Ingoma y'i Gitega, amezi abiri mbere y'igihe cyari giteganyijwe, asezeranya gukomeza ibikorwa by'uwo yasimbuye.\nKu butegetsi.\nKu wa 28 Kamena 2020, yashyizeho guverinoma ye ya mbere, agabanya umubare w'abaminisitiri uva kuri 21 ujya kuri 15; Alain-Guillaume Bunyoni yagizwe Minisitiri w'Intebe, Prosper Bazombanza aba Visi-Perezida. Yagaragaje ko adashaka kwitarura amahanga nk'uwo yasimbuye, akorera ingendo nyinshi mu mahanga.\nAtangira manda, yafashe COVID-19 nk'\"umwanzi ukomeye kurusha abandi\" w'igihugu, agabanya igiciro cy'isabune n'amazi kandi ategeka ko abantu bapimwa. Muri Mutarama 2021, yafunze imipaka y'igihugu. Nyamara muri Gashyantare 2021, u Burundi bwanze inkingo z'ikigega COVAX, mbere y'uko muri Ukwakira 2021 bwakira doze 500 000 z'urukingo rw'Abashinwa Sinopharm.\nKu wa 4 Nzeri 2022, mu ijambo rye, yanenze Minisitiri w'Intebe Bunyoni atamuvuze izina, avuga ko ashaka kumuhirika. Ku wa 7 Nzeri, guverinoma ya Bunyoni yakuweho, Gervais Ndirakobuca agirwa Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nMu Ukuboza 2022, yitabiriye inama ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika n'Afurika i Washington. Muri Nyakanga 2023, yitabiriye inama y'Uburusiya n'Afurika i Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg ahura na Vladimir Putin, hanyuma ahura na Xi Jinping mu Ubushinwa. Kuva mu 2024, ashishikariza abikorera n'abanyamahanga gushora imari mu bukerarugendo.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMu Burundi, ubutinganyi bwahanwaga n'amategeko kuva mu 2009. Muri Werurwe 2023, abantu 24 bashinjwe \"imibonano mpuzabitsina y'abahuje ibitsina\", maze Ndayishimiye asaba ko abaryamana bahuje ibitsina \"bacibwa\". Ku wa 29 Ukuboza 2023, abajijwe ku ishyingiranwa ry'abahuje ibitsina, yavuze ko bakwiye \"gushyirwa muri sitade bagaterwa amabuye\", ashinja ibihugu by'Uburengerazuba guhatira ibihugu bito kwemera ibyo bikorwa bikoresheje inkunga. Muri Kanama 2024, raporo ya Amnesty International yamaganye \"iterabwoba, itotezwa, ifatwa n'ifungwa binyuranyije n'amategeko\" by'abarwanashyaka n'abanyamakuru ku butegetsi bwe.\nUbumwe bwa Afurika.\nKu wa 17 Nyakanga 2025, Ubumwe bwa Afurika bwamugize intumwa yihariye mu karere ka Sahel. Ku wa 14 Gashyantare 2026, mu nama ya 39 isanzwe y'abakuru b'ibihugu by'Ubumwe bwa Afurika yabereye Addis-Abeba, yatorewe kuba Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika mu gihe cy'umwaka umwe."}
{"id": "23186", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23186", "title": "Paul Biya", "text": "Paul Biya (amazina ye y'amavuko: Paul Barth\u00e9lemy Biya'a bi Mvondo; wavutse ku wa 13 Gashyantare 1933 i Mvomeka'a, mu karere ka Dja-et-Lobo, muri Kameruni) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyakameruni, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Kameruni kuva ku wa 6 Ugushyingo 1982. Mbere yaho, yabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe kuva mu 1975 kugeza mu 1982.\nYazamutse mu nzego z'ubutegetsi ku gihe cya Perezida Ahmadou Ahidjo, amusimbura amaze kwegura mu buryo butunguranye mu 1982. Yakomeje ububasha bwe nyuma y'umugambi wa kudeta waburijwemo mu 1984. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, ashyizweho igitutu, yemeye amashyaka menshi. Yongeye gutorwa mu 1992, 1997, 2004, 2011, 2018 na 2025, ariko abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi n'ibihugu by'Uburengerazuba bakavuga ko buri matora yarangwaga n'uburiganya.\nAfite imyaka irenga 90, ni we mukuru w'igihugu ukuze kurusha abandi ku isi, akaba n'uwa kabiri mu baperezida bamaze igihe kirekire ku butegetsi, nyuma ya Teodoro Obiang Nguema Mbasogo wa Gineya Ekwatoriyale. Ubutegetsi bwe bufatwa nk'ubw'igitugu.\nUbuzima.\nUmuryango n'amashuri.\nPaul Biya yavukiye mu mudugudu wo mu majyepfo ya Kameruni, hagati mu ishyamba rya ekwateri, ahantu hari hayobowe n'Ubufaransa. Ni umuhungu wa Anastasie Eyenga Ell\u00e9 na \u00c9tienne Mvondo Assam, umukateshiste wifuzaga ko azaba padiri, bituma amujyana mu ishuri gatolika rya Nden, hanyuma mu iseminari za \u00c9d\u00e9a na Akono. Ni Umugatolika ukomeye ku idini.\nAmaze kwiga amashuri yisumbuye muri lyc\u00e9e G\u00e9n\u00e9ral-Leclerc i Yaound\u00e9, yakomereje i Paris muri lyc\u00e9e Louis-le-Grand, muri Kaminuza ya Sorbonne, muri \"Institut d'\u00e9tudes politiques\" (aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'amategeko rusange mu 1961) no muri \"Institut des hautes \u00e9tudes d'outre-mer\". Akiri umunyeshuri, yabaye umwenegihugu w'Ubufaransa, ariko nyuma arabureka asubiye muri Kameruni gukora mu butegetsi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1961, yashakanye na Jeanne-Ir\u00e8ne Biya, witabye Imana ku wa 29 Nyakanga 1992; barera umuhungu we Franck Biya, wavutse mu 1971. Franck Biya avugwa nk'ushobora kuzamusimbura. Ku wa 23 Mata 1994, yashakanye na Chantal Vigouroux, amurusha imyaka 36, babyarana Paul Junior na Brenda Biya.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMu Ukwakira 1962, yashyizwe mu biro bya Perezida Ahmadou Ahidjo nk'ushinzwe ubutumwa (\"charg\u00e9 de mission\"). Mu 1965, yabaye umuyobozi w'ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Uburezi, Urubyiruko n'Umuco, hanyuma umunyamabanga mukuru w'iyo minisiteri. Mu 1967\u20131968, yabaye umuyobozi w'ibiro bya gisivili bya Perezida, hanyuma umunyamabanga mukuru w'ibiro bya Perezida afite ipeti rya minisitiri; mu Kamena 1970, agirwa Minisitiri wa Leta.\nKu wa 30 Kamena 1975, Ahidjo yamugize Minisitiri w'Intebe. Itegeko ryo ku wa 29 Kamena 1979 ryamugize uzasimbura Perezida igihe habayeho icyuho.\nPerezida wa Kameruni.\nGufata ubutegetsi n'umugambi wa kudeta wo mu 1984.\nKu wa 4 Ugushyingo 1982, Ahidjo yeguye mu buryo butunguranye, maze Paul Biya aba Perezida wa Repubulika ku wa 6 Ugushyingo 1982. Ahidjo n'uwamusimbuye ntibatinze guhangana. Ku wa 14 Nzeri 1984, Biya yatorewe kuyobora ishyaka rimwe rukumbi rya UNC, maze ku wa 24 Werurwe 1985 arihindura \"Rassemblement d\u00e9mocratique du peuple camerounais\" (RDPC).\nKu wa 6 Mata 1984, yarokotse umugambi wa kudeta wakozwe n'abasirikare b'ingabo zirinda Repubulika. Bamwe mu bagerageje kumuhirika barafashwe, abandi baricwa. Ahidjo, washinjwe kugira uruhare muri uwo mugambi, yakatiwe igihano cy'urupfu adahari, nyuma Biya amuha imbabazi. Ihashywa ryibasiye cyane cyane uturere two mu majyaruguru, aho abantu amagana bishwe.\nUbukungu n'amashyaka menshi.\nYatowe ari umukandida umwe rukumbi mu 1984 no mu 1988. Yemeye gahunda y'ivugurura ry'ubukungu yatanzwe n'Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari (FMI) na Banki y'Isi: kwegurira abikorera ibigo bya Leta, kugabanya amafaranga akoreshwa mu mibereho myiza; imishahara y'abakozi ba Leta yagabanyijweho 60 %.\nMu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, nyuma y'ibikorwa byo kwanga kumvira ubutegetsi byiswe \"Imigi yapfuye\" (\"Villes mortes\") n'imyigaragambyo, yihutishije ishyirwaho ry'amashyaka menshi, akuraho amategeko \"arwanya ubugambanyi\" yari yarashyizweho n'uwo yasimbuye, yemerera itangazamakuru ryigenga. Mu matora ya mbere y'amashyaka menshi yo mu 1992, yatangajwe ko yatsinze John Fru Ndi ku majwi 40 % kuri 36 %, ibyavuye mu matora abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi banze. Yongeye gutorwa mu 1997 (92,6 %) no mu 2004 (70,9 %). Kuva mu 1992, yagerageje gucamo ibice abamurwanya; mu 2025, Kameruni yari ifite amashyaka agera kuri 300, amwe aterwa inkunga na guverinoma.\nIvugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga ryo mu 2008.\nMu Ukuboza 2007, yatangaje ko ashaka guhindura Itegeko Nshinga ryagabanyaga manda ya perezida kuri ebyiri. Uwo mushinga wanamuhaga ubudahangarwa imbere y'ubucamanza ku bikorwa yakoze ari ku butegetsi. Muri Gashyantare 2008, habaye imyigaragambyo yasabaga igabanuka ry'ibiciro n'iyegura rya Biya; yahashywe bikomeye, ihitana abantu bagera ku ijana, abandi ibihumbi barafungwa. Ivugurura ryemejwe n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko mu 2008. Ku wa 21 Ukwakira 2011, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 78 %; ambasaderi wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, Robert Jackson, yamaganye \"amakosa ku nzego zose\".\nIbibazo by'umutekano.\nMu 2014, inyeshyamba za Boko Haram zaturutse muri Nijeriya zinjira muri Kameruni. Muri Gicurasi 2014, Biya na mugenzi we wa Cadi Idriss D\u00e9by batangaje intambara kuri Boko Haram, bohereza ingabo ku mupaka. Muri Nzeri 2018, Kameruni yatangaje ko Boko Haram yasubijwe inyuma, nubwo imirwano yakomeje mu turere tw'umupaka.\nMu Ugushyingo 2016, mu turere tuvuga Icyongereza two mu Majyaruguru y'Uburengerazuba n'Amajyepfo y'Uburengerazuba, abarimu n'abanyamategeko bigaragambije bamagana ishyirwa ry'abavuga Igifaransa muri utwo turere n'iyimikwa ry'amategeko y'Abaromani aho kuba \"common law\". Benshi basabaga gusubira ku butegetsi bwa federasiyo, abandi bake basaba ubwigenge bw'igihugu gishya bise \"Ambazonia\"; Biya yanze ibyo bisabwa byombi. Mu mpera za 2017, igice cy'abashaka kwitandukanya cyafashe intwaro. Ku wa 30 Ugushyingo 2017, nyuma y'iyicwa ry'abasirikare n'abapolisi, Biya yavuze ko Kameruni yibasiwe n'\"agatsiko k'abaterabwoba\", ijambo radio ya Leta yafashe nk'itangazwa ry'intambara.\nAmatora yo mu 2018 no mu 2025.\nKu wa 7 Ukwakira 2018, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 71,3 %, mu matora yaranzwe n'urugomo n'ubwitabire buke. Mu 2020, guceceka kwe mu gihe cy'icyorezo cya COVID-19 kwaranenzwe.\nKu wa 13 Nyakanga 2025, afite imyaka 92, yatangaje ko aziyamamariza manda ya munani mu matora yo ku wa 12 Ukwakira 2025. Ku wa 27 Ukwakira, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwatangaje ko yatsinze ku majwi 53,66 %, imbere ya Issa Tchiroma Bakary, na we wavugaga ko ari we watsinze. Nyuma y'amatora, habaye imyigaragambyo yamagana uburiganya. Yarahiriye manda ya munani ku wa 6 Ugushyingo 2025, imyigaragambyo ikomeje; Issa Tchiroma yahise ahungira muri Gambiya.\nUbuzima bwe n'uzamusimbura.\nKuva mu myaka ya 2010, kujya kenshi mu mahanga mu \"ngendo bwite\" byateje impungenge ku buzima bwe; inshuro nyinshi havuzwe ko yapfuye. Mu Nzeri n'Ukwakira 2024, yamaze iminsi 50 atagaragara mu ruhame; ku wa 9 Ukwakira, Minisitiri w'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu Paul Atanga Nji yabujije itangazamakuru kuvuga ku buzima bwa Perezida.\nMuri Mata 2026, nyuma y'itora ry'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, Biya yasinye iteka risubizaho umwanya wa visi-perezida, uwo azishyiriraho ubwe, kugira ngo \"hizerwe ukomeza kw'imirimo ya Leta\" igihe habayeho icyuho; abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi babyise \"kudeta ishingiye ku nzego\". Ku wa 20 Kanama 2026, afite imyaka 93, yagarutse i Yaound\u00e9 nyuma y'iminsi 74 ari mu mahanga, nta bisobanuro bitanzwe; ikinyamakuru \"Jeune Afrique\" cyavuze ko yabagiwe ivi i Gen\u00e8ve.\nIsesengura n'inenge.\nUbutegetsi bwe bukunze kwitwa ubw'igitugu. Imiryango nka Amnesty International yanenze ubutegetsi bwe kubuza abaturage uburenganzira bw'ibanze no guhohotera uburenganzira bwa muntu. Ifungwa ry'abanyamakuru, abanditsi, abayobozi b'amasendika n'abarwanashyaka ni kenshi. Human Rights Watch yamaganye \"ihashywa rikomeye\" ry'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Abamushyigikiye bo bavuga ko ku butegetsi bwe habayeho iterambere, nka demokarasi, irekurwa ry'imfungwa za politiki n'ubwinshi bw'abakandida.\nMu 2006, hatangijwe ibikorwa byo kurwanya ruswa byiswe \"\u00c9pervier\", byatumye abayobozi bakuru benshi bafungwa, nubwo bikekwa ko byakoreshejwe mu gukuraho abo bahanganye. Transparency International yashyize Kameruni ku mwanya w'igihugu cyamunzwe na ruswa kurusha ibindi ku isi mu 1998 no mu 1999, no ku mwanya wa 145 kuri 176 mu 2018.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nUbutegetsi bwe bushyigikiwe n'Ubufaransa, buhereza Kameruni intwaro, butoza ingabo zayo kandi akaba ari bwo bushora imari nyinshi muri icyo gihugu. Mu 1986, yasubukuye umubano na Isiraheli, wari warahagaze kuva mu 1973; umutwe w'ingabo zihuta (BIR) uhabwa ibikoresho kandi utozwa na Isiraheli. Ku wa 10 Ukwakira 2002, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga rw'Ubutabera rwemeje ko igice cya Bakassi cyari mu makimbirane na Nijeriya ari icya Kameruni; ihererekanya ry'icyo gice ryakozwe mu mahoro hakurikijwe amasezerano ya Greentree yo mu 2006."}
{"id": "23187", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23187", "title": "Jos\u00e9 Maria Neves", "text": "Jos\u00e9 Maria Pereira Neves (wavutse ku wa 28 Werurwe 1960 i Santa Catarina, ku kirwa cya Santiago, muri Kapu Veri) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyakapuveri wo mu ishyaka \"Partido Africano da Independ\u00eancia de Cabo Verde\" (PAICV), akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Kapu Veri kuva ku wa 9 Ugushyingo 2021.\nYabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe imyaka 15, kuva mu 2001 kugeza mu 2016. Mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2021, yatsinze mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 51,7 %.\nUbuzima.\nJos\u00e9 Maria Neves yavukiye ku kirwa cya Santiago mu 1960. Akiri ingimbi, yatangiye gushishikazwa na politiki, ayobora umuryango w'urubyiruko uharanira ubwigenge mu gihe Kapu Veri yavaga mu bukoloni bw'Abanyaporutigali mu 1975. Yize muri \"Escola de Administra\u00e7\u00e3o de Empresas de S\u00e3o Paulo\" ya Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Get\u00falio Vargas, muri Burezili.\nMu myaka ya 1980, yagarutse muri Kapu Veri akora mu nzego zitandukanye za Leta. Kuva mu 1987 kugeza mu 1989, yari umuhuzabikorwa w'umushinga w'ivugurura no kuvugurura ubutegetsi; yanayoboye Ikigo cy'Igihugu cy'Amahugurwa mu Butegetsi bwa Leta, hanyuma kuva mu 1989 kugeza mu 1998 aba umujyanama mu bijyanye n'amahugurwa n'iterambere ry'abakozi.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya 1980, yinjiye mu ishami ry'urubyiruko rya PAICV, icyo gihe ryari ishyaka rimwe rukumbi. Mu 1996, yiyamamaje ku rutonde rwa PAICV, ryari ryabaye ishyaka ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, mu ntara y'itora ya Santa Catarina. Mu nama nkuru ya PAICV yo muri Nzeri 1997, yiyamamarije kuyobora ishyaka ariko atsindwa na Pedro Pires. Mu Kamena 2000, ubwo yari perezida w'inama njyanama ya Santa Catarina, yatorewe kuyobora PAICV.\nMinisitiri w'Intebe (2001\u20132016).\nYayoboye PAICV itsinda amatora y'abadepite yo ku wa 14 Mutarama 2001, aba Minisitiri w'Intebe. Yashyizeho umubano wa dipolomasi n'Ubushinwa. Mu 2002, yasinyanye n'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi amasezerano yihariye, yatangajwe ku wa 15 Ugushyingo 2005; mu 2007, yasabye ko Kapu Veri igirana umubano wihariye n'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi kubera ko yegereye ibirwa bya Macaron\u00e9sie biri muri Esipanye na Porutigali. Kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2004, yari na Minisitiri w'Imari. Muri Kanama 2005, yasuye Burezili, ahura na Perezida Lula da Silva, baganira ku ishoramari muri Kapu Veri, harimo na Kaminuza ya Kapu Veri, kaminuza ya mbere ya Leta muri icyo gihugu.\nKu wa 22 Mutarama 2006, ishyaka rye ryongeye gutsinda amatora y'abadepite ku majwi 52,28 %, maze ku wa 7 Werurwe atangira manda ye ya kabiri. Banki y'Isi n'Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari bashimye politiki ye y'ubukungu n'imari. Mu Ukuboza 2006, yavuze ko nubwo ubucakara n'ubukoloni byagize ingaruka mbi kuri Afurika, abayobozi b'Afurika ari bo ba mbere bafite inshingano ku bibazo by'umugabane muri iki gihe. Ku wa 2 Mutarama 2007, yatangaje ko ashaka ko Kapu Veri igira umwanya wihariye muri CEDEAO.\nKu wa 27 Kamena 2008, yashyizeho guverinoma nshya yari irimo abagore umunani ku baminisitiri 15, iba guverinoma ya mbere muri Kapu Veri ifite abagore benshi kurusha abagabo. Ku wa 6 Gashyantare 2011, yongeye gutorwa ku nshuro ya gatatu, ishyaka rye ribona 52,68 % n'imyanya 38 kuri 72. Mu matora y'abadepite yo muri Werurwe 2016, ishyaka ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, \"Movimento para a Democracia\" (MpD), ryatsinze ku majwi arenga 53 %, maze ku wa 22 Mata 2016 asimburwa na Ulisses Correia e Silva ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nPerezida wa Kapu Veri.\nMu matora ya perezida yo ku wa 17 Ukwakira 2021, yatsinze mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 51,7 %, imbere ya Carlos Veiga wa MpD wabonye 42,4 %; Veiga yahise yemera ko yatsinzwe. Iyo ntsinzi yatumye habaho ubufatanye bw'ubutegetsi (\"cohabitation\") na Minisitiri w'Intebe Ulisses Correia e Silva wo muri MpD. Yatangiye imirimo ku wa 9 Ugushyingo 2021.\nUmwanditsi.\nNeves yanditse ibitabo n'inyandiko byinshi, bimwe byasohotse mu bindi bihugu bya Afurika, mu Burayi no muri Burezili, birimo:"}
{"id": "23188", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23188", "title": "Faustin-Archange Touad\u00e9ra", "text": "Faustin-Archange Touad\u00e9ra (wavutse ku wa 21 Mata 1957 i Bangui) ni umwarimu w'imibare n'umunyapolitiki wo muri Repubulika ya Santara Afurika, akaba Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva muri Werurwe 2016. Mbere yaho, yabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe kuva mu 2008 kugeza mu 2013 ku butegetsi bwa Fran\u00e7ois Boziz\u00e9.\nYatorewe kuba Perezida mu 2016, yongera gutorwa mu 2020\u20132021 no mu 2025, mu matora yitabiriwe na bake kandi arangwa n'urugomo. Kuva yagera ku butegetsi, yegereye Uburusiya: itsinda ry'abacancuro b'Abarusiya rya Wagner rimurinda kandi rimufasha guhashya inyeshyamba. Ku butegetsi bwe, Itegeko Nshinga ryavanyeho umubare ntarengwa wa manda mu 2023, kandi abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi barahohoterwa.\nUbuzima.\nFaustin-Archange Touad\u00e9ra yavukiye i Bangui ku wa 21 Mata 1957, mu muryango w'abana icumi wo mu gace ka rubanda rugufi ka Boy-Rabe; se yari umushoferi, nyina ari umuhinzi. Yize amashuri yisumbuye muri Coll\u00e8ge Barth\u00e9lemy Boganda i Bangui, abona impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye mu 1976, hanyuma yiga muri Kaminuza ya Bangui no muri Kaminuza ya Abidjan. Mu 1986, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (doctorat) mu mibare muri Kaminuza ya Lille I mu Ubufaransa, maze mu 2004 abona iya kabiri muri Kaminuza ya Yaound\u00e9 muri Kameruni.\nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nMu 1987, yabaye umwarimu wungirije w'imibare muri Kaminuza ya Bangui, aba visi-dekani w'ishami ry'ubumenyi kuva mu 1989 kugeza mu 1992. Mu 1999, yinjiye muri Komite ihuriweho n'ibihugu ishinzwe guhuza integanyanyigisho z'imibare mu bihugu bivuga Igifaransa n'ibyo mu Nyanja y'Abahinde (CIEHPM), ayiyobora kuva mu 2001 kugeza mu 2003. Muri Gicurasi 2004, yabaye visi-chanseliye wa Kaminuza ya Bangui, hanyuma ayibera umuyobozi mukuru (recteur) kuva mu 2005 kugeza mu 2008, atangiza gahunda yo kwigisha kwihangira imirimo n'ihuriro rya kaminuza \"Euclid\".\nMinisitiri w'Intebe (2008\u20132013).\nKu wa 22 Mutarama 2008, Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Boziz\u00e9 yamugize Minisitiri w'Intebe, nyuma y'iyegura rya \u00c9lie Dot\u00e9. Nyuma y'ibiganiro by'igihugu byo mu Ukuboza 2008, Boziz\u00e9 yasheshe guverinoma ye ku wa 18 Mutarama 2009, ariko bukeye bwaho amugira Minisitiri w'Intebe ku nshuro ya kabiri. Ku wa 12 Mutarama 2013, nyuma y'amasezerano y'amahoro ya Libreville hagati ya guverinoma n'ihuriro ry'inyeshyamba rya S\u00e9l\u00e9ka, yategekaga ko Minisitiri w'Intebe mushya ava mu batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Boziz\u00e9 yaramwirukanye.\nMu 2014, yahungiye ku kigo cy'Umuryango w'Abibumbye i Bangui amezi atandatu, hanyuma ajya i Villeneuve-d'Ascq mu Bufaransa hamwe n'umugore we n'abana be batatu.\nPerezida wa Repubulika.\nAmatora yo mu 2016.\nYagarutse mu gihugu mu 2015, yiyamamaza nk'umukandida wigenga mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2015\u20132016. Mu cyiciro cya mbere, yabaye uwa kabiri ku majwi 19 %, inyuma ya Anicet-Georges Dologu\u00e9l\u00e9 (23,7 %), ariko mu cyiciro cya kabiri atsinda ku majwi 62,7 %. Yarahiye ku wa 30 Werurwe 2016, asimbura Perezida w'inzibacyuho Catherine Samba-Panza, asezeranya gushyira intwaro hasi no kugira igihugu \"kimwe, cy'amahoro, cyerekeje ku iterambere\". Ku wa 2 Mata 2016, yagize Simplice Sarandji Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nManda ya mbere.\nAmaze kurahira, Ubufaransa bwatangaje ko burangije igikorwa cya gisirikare cya Sangaris, bwari bufitemo abasirikare bagera ku 2 500 bafashaga ingabo z'Umuryango w'Abibumbye zigera ku 10 000. Touad\u00e9ra yitabaje itsinda ry'abacancuro b'Abarusiya rya Wagner kugira ngo rifashe kugarura umutekano; ibyo byatumye umubano n'Ubufaransa uzamba, Perezida Emmanuel Macron ahagarika inkunga y'ubukungu. Abarinda Touad\u00e9ra bavugwa ko ari abo muri Wagner. Muri Gashyantare 2022, yari umwe mu bakuru b'ibihugu bake bashyigikiye icyemezo cya Vladimir Putin cyo kwemera ubwigenge bwa Donetsk na Louhansk.\nKu wa 18 Mutarama 2021, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ko yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 53,16 %.\nManda ya kabiri.\nMuri Mata 2022, Repubulika ya Santara Afurika yemeje ko Bitcoin iba ifaranga ryemewe mu gihugu, iba igihugu cya kabiri ku isi kibikoze nyuma ya El Salvador; iyo gahunda yaretswe mu 2023. Muri Werurwe 2023, yafashe ubuyobozi bw'Umuryango w'Ubukungu n'Ifaranga wa Afurika yo Hagati (CEMAC). Muri Nyakanga 2023, yitabiriye inama y'Uburusiya n'Afurika i Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg, avuga ko Uburusiya \"bwafashije kurokora demokarasi no gukumira intambara y'abenegihugu\".\nMuri Nyakanga 2023, kamarampaka yo kuvugurura Itegeko Nshinga yongereye manda ya perezida kuva ku myaka itanu ikagera ku irindwi, ivanaho umubare ntarengwa wa manda; mu Ukwakira 2022, Touad\u00e9ra yari yirukanye perezida w'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga, rwari rwemeje ko iyo kamarampaka inyuranyije n'Itegeko Nshinga. Muri Mata 2024, yakiriwe ku nshuro ya kabiri mu ngoro y'\u00c9lys\u00e9e i Paris, asinya gahunda yo kugarura umubano hagati y'ibihugu byombi. Ku wa 10 Gashyantare 2025, yatangije ifaranga ry'ikoranabuhanga \"$CAR\", ryamaze igihe gito rifite agaciro ka miliyoni 900 z'amadolari mbere yo guta agaciro karenga 90 %.\nAmatora yo mu 2025.\nMuri Nyakanga 2025, ishyaka rye \"Mouvement C\u0153urs unis\" ryamutoranyije kuba umukandida mu matora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza 2025. Mu Ugushyingo 2025, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwamwemereye kongera kwiyamamaza, nubwo abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bavugaga ko atujuje ibisabwa. Mbere y'amatora, yakoresheje ububasha bwa Leta kugira ngo abuze abakandida batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi kwiyamamaza. Ku wa 19 Mutarama 2026, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwatangaje ko yatsinze mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 77,9 %, imbere ya Anicet-Georges Dologu\u00e9l\u00e9 (13,1 %); abitabiriye amatora bari 52,4 %. Abo bahanganye bamaganye uburiganya, basaba ko amatora aseswa.\nUbuzima bwite.\nTouad\u00e9ra yabaye umudiyakoni mu itorero ry'Ababatisita (\"Union fraternelle des \u00c9glises baptistes\"), kandi aracyari umunyamuryango waryo. Afite abagore babiri, Brigitte Touad\u00e9ra na Tina Marguerite Touad\u00e9ra, n'abana batatu."}
{"id": "23189", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23189", "title": "Mahamat Idriss D\u00e9by Itno", "text": "Mahamat Idriss D\u00e9by Itno (mu Cyarabu: \u0645\u062d\u0645\u062f \u0625\u062f\u0631\u064a\u0633 \u062f\u064a\u0628\u064a \u0625\u062a\u0646\u0648; wavutse ku wa 4 Mata 1984 i N'Djamena, muri Cade), uzwi kandi ku izina rya Kaka, ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyacade, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Cade kuva ku wa 21 Mata 2021.\nNyuma y'urupfu rutunguranye rwa se, Perezida Idriss D\u00e9by, wiciwe ku rugamba muri Mata 2021, yayoboye Akanama ka gisirikare k'inzibacyuho, aba umukuru w'igihugu mu buryo bwateje impaka, kuko Itegeko Nshinga ritubahirijwe. Yatsinze amatora ya perezida yo mu 2024, kandi mu Ukuboza 2024 ahabwa ipeti rya Mar\u00e9chal wa Cade.\nUbutegetsi bwe bufatwa nk'ubw'igitugu, burangwa n'ihashywa rikaze ry'imyigaragambyo, harimo iryo ku wa 20 Ukwakira 2022, no kubuza abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi kwisanzura.\nUbuzima.\nInkomoko n'amashuri.\nMahamat Idriss D\u00e9by ni umuhungu wa Idriss D\u00e9by, icyo gihe wari umugaba mukuru w'ingabo zirwanira ku butaka, n'umubyeyi w'Umugorane. Yarezwe na nyirakuru, nyina wa Idriss D\u00e9by, ari na yo mpamvu bamwita \"Mahamat Kaka\" (\"kaka\" bisobanura \"nyirakuru\" mu Cyarabu cya Cade). Yize amashuri yisumbuye muri Cade no mu Ubufaransa, aho yamaze umwaka n'igice muri lyc\u00e9e militaire d'Aix-en-Provence. Agarutse, yize mu ishuri ry'abofisiye ry'ingabo za Cade (G\u00e9mia), arisohokamo ari sous-lieutenant.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nSe yamushyize mu Buyobozi bukuru bushinzwe umutekano w'inzego za Leta (DGSSIE), ingabo zirinda ubutegetsi, ari umuyobozi wungirije w'itsinda ry'abasirikare barwanira ku butaka. Yarwanye bwa mbere muri Mata 2006, ubwo inyeshyamba zateraga umurwa mukuru, azamurwa ku ipeti rya komanda. Muri Gicurasi 2009, yagizwe Jenerali wa burigade, ayobora hamwe n'abandi ingabo za Cade mu ntambara ya Am-Dam, aho inyeshyamba za Timan Erdimi zatsinzwe mu burasirazuba bwa Cade.\nMu 2013, yabaye umuyobozi wungirije w'ingabo za Cade zoherejwe muri Mali (FATIM), arwana mu misozi ya Adrar des Ifoghas; nyuma afata ubuyobozi bwuzuye bw'izo ngabo. Ku wa 20 Nzeri 2014, yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru wa DGSSIE. Yagizwe Jenerali w'ingabo (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de corps d'arm\u00e9e\") mu Ukwakira 2018, Jenerali w'ingabo usumba abandi (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral d'arm\u00e9e\") ku wa 2 Ukuboza 2021, maze ku wa 9 Ukuboza 2024 Inama y'Igihugu y'Inzibacyuho imuha icyubahiro cya Mar\u00e9chal.\nUmukuru w'igihugu.\nAkanama ka gisirikare k'inzibacyuho.\nKu wa 21 Mata 2021, nyuma y'urupfu rwa Idriss D\u00e9by wiciwe mu ntambara n'inyeshyamba za FACT mu majyaruguru y'igihugu, yafashe ubuyobozi bw'Akanama ka gisirikare k'inzibacyuho, aba Perezida wa Repubulika. Itegeko Nshinga, ryavugaga ko Perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ari we usimbura Perezida mu gihe cy'iminsi 45 kugeza kuri 90 kugeza habaye amatora, ryarahagaritswe; bamwe mu banyapolitiki babyise kudeta. Igisirikare cyasheshe Inteko Ishinga Amategeko na guverinoma, gifunga imipaka, gitangaza inzibacyuho y'amezi 18. Ubufaransa bwashyigikiye iyo nzibacyuho, buvuga ko \"ibihe bidasanzwe\" byatewe n'inyeshyamba; Perezida Emmanuel Macron yitabiriye umuhango wo gushyingura Idriss D\u00e9by, yiyemeza gushyigikira Mahamat D\u00e9by.\nKu wa 25 Nzeri 2021, yashyizeho abagize Inama y'Igihugu y'Inzibacyuho 93. Ku wa 8 Kanama 2022, i Doha, guverinoma yasinyanye n'imitwe myinshi y'inyeshyamba amasezerano y'amahoro, ariko FACT n'indi mitwe itavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi barayanze. Ku wa 20 Kanama 2022, yatangije ibiganiro by'igihugu bihuriweho na bose (DNIS), byitabiriwe n'intumwa 1 400, ariko bimwe mu bice bya sosiyete sivile birabyamagana byita \"monologue\".\nPerezida w'inzibacyuho.\nKu wa 3 Ukwakira 2022, ibiganiro by'igihugu byongereye igihe cy'inzibacyuho, binemerera abayobozi b'inzibacyuho kuziyamamaza mu matora, bitandukanye n'ibyo Ubumwe bwa Afurika bwasabaga. Akanama ka gisirikare kamaze guseswa ku wa 8 Ukwakira 2022, yabaye Perezida w'inzibacyuho.\nKu wa 20 Ukwakira 2022, itariki yari yarateganyirijwe amatora, habaye imyigaragambyo ikomeye yaharaniraga demokarasi i N'Djamena n'i Moundou, yateguwe na Wakit Tamma n'ishyaka \"Les Transformateurs\" rya Succ\u00e8s Masra. Inzego z'umutekano zayihashye bikomeye: abantu bari hagati ya 50 na 200 barapfuye, abarenga 600 barafungwa; uwo munsi wiswe \"Ku wa Kane w'umukara\". Muri Werurwe 2023, yahaye imbabazi 259 mu bari bakatiwe kubera iyo myigaragambyo, n'inyeshyamba 380 za FACT zari zarakatiwe gufungwa burundu.\nAmatora yo mu 2024.\nKu wa 13 Mutarama 2024, ishyaka rye \"Mouvement patriotique du salut\" (MPS) ryamutoranyije kuba umukandida mu matora ya perezida yo ku wa 6 Gicurasi 2024. Ku wa 28 Gashyantare 2024, umukandida ukomeye bari bahanganye, Yaya Dillo Dj\u00e9rou, yishwe n'inzego z'umutekano. Mu matora, yatsinze ku majwi 61 %, imbere ya Minisitiri w'Intebe Succ\u00e8s Masra (18,53 %), wari wavuze ko ari we watsinze. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida watowe ku wa 23 Gicurasi 2024, maze agira Allamaye Halina Minisitiri w'Intebe. Ku wa 29 Mutarama 2025, yatorewe kuyobora MPS.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nKu wa 5 Kamena 2025, yahagaritse gutanga viza ku Banyamerika, mu rwego rwo kwihimura ku cyemezo cya Perezida Donald Trump cyo kubuza Abanyacade kwinjira muri Amerika. Nk'uko \"Le Monde\" ibivuga, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu ni zo zimutera inkunga ikomeye, maze na we akemerera intwaro zigenewe umutwe wa \"Forces de soutien rapide\" (RSF) wo muri Sudani kunyura ku butaka bwa Cade. Muri Nyakanga 2026, Cade yatangaje ko ivuye mu Rukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha (CPI), aho we n'abandi bayobozi bakuru bari bararezwe kuva mu Ukuboza 2025 kubera \"ubufatanyacyaha mu byaha mpuzamahanga byakorewe muri Sudani\".\nImpaka.\nMuri Mutarama 2024, ubushinjacyaha bw'Ubufaransa bushinzwe ibyaha by'imari (PNF) bwatangije iperereza ku kunyereza umutungo wa Leta, nyuma y'aho ikinyamakuru \"Mediapart\" gitangaje ko hagati ya 2021 na 2023 yakoresheje hafi miliyoni imwe y'amayero ku mudozi uzwi w'i Paris, mu gihugu aho 35 % by'abaturage bari mu bukene bukabije. Iryo perereza rireba n'imitungo itimukanwa y'umuryango we mu Bufaransa, ifite agaciro nibura ka miliyoni 30 z'amayero. Muri Werurwe 2026, \"Mediapart\" yatangaje ko we n'abamuherekeza bakoresheje hafi 860 000 by'amayero muri hoteli Royal Monceau i Paris, hafi ya yose yishyuwe mu mafaranga y'intoki. Ku wa 21 Mutarama 2025, murumuna we Adam Idriss D\u00e9by Itno yamwandikiye ibaruwa amusaba kwegura.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNi Umuyisilamu ukomeye ku idini, akaba afite abana icyenda. Afite abagore batatu; uwa gatatu, umunyamakuru Dahabaya Oumar Souni, afatwa nka Madamu wa Perezida, akaba n'umujyanama mu itumanaho mu biro bya Perezida.\nMuri Mata 2024, yasohoye igitabo kivuga ku buzima bwe, \"De b\u00e9douin \u00e0 pr\u00e9sident\". Ku wa 15 Mutarama 2026, yahawe Igihembo nyafurika cy'amahoro."}
{"id": "23190", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23190", "title": "Azali Assoumani", "text": "Azali Assoumani (mu Cyarabu: \u063a\u0632\u0627\u0644\u064a \u0639\u062b\u0645\u0627\u0646\u064a; wavutse ku wa 1 Mutarama 1959 i Mitsoudj\u00e9, muri Komore) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyakomore, akaba Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Komore kuva mu 2016, nyuma yo kuba umukuru w'igihugu kuva mu 1999 kugeza mu 2006.\nYafashe ubutegetsi binyuze muri kudeta ku wa 30 Mata 1999, nyuma atorerwa kuba Perezida mu 2002, 2016, 2019 na 2024. Kuva muri Gashyantare 2023 kugeza muri Gashyantare 2024, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika. Ubutegetsi bwe bwa vuba aha bufatwa nk'ubugenda burushaho kuba ubw'igitugu.\nUbuzima.\nAzali Assoumani yavukiye mu muryango w'abahinzi i Mitsoudj\u00e9, mu majyepfo y'ikirwa cya Grande Comore, maze yinjira mu gisirikare. Mu 1995, ubwo umucancuro w'Umufaransa Bob Denard yakoraga kudeta, Azali yari komanda, akaba umwe mu bofisiye bake batayigizemo uruhare. Nyuma yaho, yize mu \"\u00c9cole de guerre\" mu Ubufaransa no mu \"Acad\u00e9mie royale militaire\" ya Mekn\u00e8s muri Maroke. Agarutse muri Komore, yahise azamurwa ku ipeti rya koloneli.\nKu butegetsi (1999\u20132006).\nKudeta ya 1999.\nKu wa 30 Mata 1999, Koloneli Azali yafashe ubutegetsi, ahirika Perezida w'agateganyo Tadjidine Ben Sa\u00efd Massounde. Abasirikare bavuze ko babikoze kugira ngo barinde ubusugire bw'igihugu, kuko Massounde yaganiraga n'abahagarariye ikirwa cya Anjouan ku bwigenge cyangwa ubwisanzure bwisumbuyeho bw'icyo kirwa.\nKu wa 23 Ukuboza 2001, yemeje binyuze muri kamarampaka Itegeko Nshinga rishya. Iryo tegeko ryashyizeho ubuperezida busimburanwa hagati y'ibirwa, riha ibirwa ubwisanzure bwagutse, buri kirwa gifite itegeko shingiro ryacyo, ibendera n'ubuyobozi bwacyo. Igihugu cyavuye ku izina rya Repubulika ya Kisilamu ya Federasiyo ya Komore, cyitwa Ubumwe bwa Komore.\nMu gihe cy'amatora yo mu 2002, habayeho imirwano hagati y'inzego z'umutekano n'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, n'ifatwa ry'abantu binyuranyije n'amategeko. Ku wa 21 Mutarama 2002, yeguye kugira ngo yiyamamaze, asimburwa by'agateganyo na Hamadi Madi Bol\u00e9ro. Yatsinze amatora ya perezida y'amashyaka menshi yo ku wa 14 Mata 2002 ku majwi 75 %, atangira imirimo ku wa 26 Gicurasi 2002. Manda ye yaranzwe n'amakimbirane ku bubasha, kuko yanze kwegurira ibirwa ububasha nk'uko Itegeko Nshinga ryabiteganyaga.\nKuva ku butegetsi.\nItegeko Nshinga ryavugaga ko Perezida agomba guturuka ku kirwa gitandukanye n'icyo uwamubanjirije yaturukagaho; ku wa 26 Gicurasi 2006, yasimbuwe na Ahmed Abdallah Mohamed Sambi wo ku kirwa cya Anjouan. Mu 2009, yasohoye igitabo yise \"Quand j'\u00e9tais pr\u00e9sident\", yirata ko yavuye ku butegetsi manda ye irangiye, bitandukanye n'abandi bakuru b'ibihugu benshi b'Afurika.\nGusubira ku butegetsi (kuva 2016).\nAmatora yo mu 2016.\nMu matora ya perezida yo mu 2016, yabaye uwa gatatu mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 14,96 %, hanyuma atsinda icyiciro cya kabiri ku wa 10 Mata 2016 ku majwi 40,98 %. We na Mohamed Ali Soilihi bamaganye ibyavuye mu matora kubera uburiganya, bituma habaho icyiciro cya gatatu ku kirwa cya Anjouan ku wa 11 Gicurasi. Ku wa 15 Gicurasi 2016, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwatangaje ko yatsinze ku majwi 41,43 %. Yasimbuye Ikililou Dhoinine ku wa 26 Gicurasi 2016, manda y'imyaka itanu.\nIvugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga n'amatora yo mu 2019.\nAbatavuga rumwe na we bamushinje guhindura Itegeko Nshinga kugira ngo agume ku butegetsi kugeza mu 2029. Ifungwa ry'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga n'Urukiko rurwanya ruswa ryatumye Ubumwe bw'Uburayi buhagarika ubufatanye bwose na Komore; Umunyamabanga mukuru wa Loni, Ant\u00f3nio Guterres, na we yagaragaje impungenge ku \"kubuza kenshi ubwisanzure bw'abaturage n'uburenganzira bwa demokarasi\". Yafungishije kandi umuntu ukomeye mu bamurwanya, Perezida wahozeho Ahmed Abdallah Sambi, waje gukatirwa gufungwa burundu nyuma y'imyaka ine azira kunyereza umutungo.\nKu wa 13 Gashyantare 2019, yeguye kugira ngo yiyamamaze mu matora yo ku wa 24 Werurwe 2019, atsinda mu cyiciro cya mbere. Itsinda ry'indorerezi z'Ubumwe bwa Afurika ryagaragaje \"imvururu no kwangiza udusanduku tw'amatora\". Yongeye gutangira imirimo ku wa 3 Mata 2019.\nUbumwe bwa Afurika.\nKu wa 18 Gashyantare 2023, yasimbuye Perezida wa Senegali Macky Sall ku buyobozi bw'Ubumwe bwa Afurika, manda y'umwaka umwe. Ubuyobozi bwe bwaranzwe n'umubano mwiza n'ibindi bihugu, ariko bunengwa intege nke ku bibazo bikomeye nk'umutekano. Muri Nyakanga 2023, yitabiriye inama y'Uburusiya n'Afurika i Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg.\nAmatora yo mu 2024.\nMu Ugushyingo 2023, yatangaje ko aziyamamariza manda ya kane mu matora yo ku wa 14 Mutarama 2024. Mu Ukuboza 2023, yakuye ku mwanya umucamanza mukuru wari ushinzwe gukurikirana amatora, Harimia Ahmed. Ku wa 16 Mutarama 2024, komisiyo y'amatora yatangaje ko yatsinze mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 62,97 %; abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi banze ibyavuye mu matora byose, bavuga ko habayeho uburiganya bukabije, habaho n'urugomo i Moroni. Yarahiriye manda ya kane ku wa 26 Gicurasi 2024.\nKu wa 7 Kanama 2024, yagize umuhungu we Nour El Fath, ufatwa nk'uzamusimbura, umunyamabanga mukuru wa guverinoma afite ububasha bwagutse, bituma abantu benshi bavuga ko ubutegetsi bwe buhinduka nk'ubwami. Ku wa 13 Nzeri 2024, yakomerekejwe gato ku mutwe n'umusirikare w'imyaka 24 wamuteye icyuma mu muhango wo gushyingura i Salimani; uwo musirikare yafashwe, ariko bukeye bwaho asangwa yapfiriye muri kasho. Muri Mutarama 2025, ishyaka rye ryatsinze amatora y'abadepite, ribona imyanya 28 kuri 33; abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi banze ibyavuye mu matora."}
{"id": "23191", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23191", "title": "F\u00e9lix Tshisekedi", "text": "F\u00e9lix Antoine Tshisekedi Tshilombo (wavutse ku wa 13 Kamena 1963 i Kinshasa) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyekongo, akaba Perezida wa gatanu wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuva mu 2019. Abamushyigikiye bamwita \"Fatshi\".\nNi umuhungu wa \u00c9tienne Tshisekedi, wabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Zayire inshuro eshatu akaba n'umuntu ukomeye mu batavugaga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bwa Mobutu Sese Seko. Yamusimbuye ku buyobozi bw'ishyaka \"Union pour la d\u00e9mocratie et le progr\u00e8s social\" (UDPS), ishyaka rya kera kandi rinini muri icyo gihugu. Yatsinze amatora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza 2018, nubwo indorerezi n'abandi batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bavuze ko habayeho uburiganya; ayo matora yatumye, ku nshuro ya mbere kuva igihugu kibona ubwigenge mu 1960, ubutegetsi buhererekanywa mu mahoro. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2023.\nKuva mu 2021 kugeza mu 2022, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika. Manda ze zaranzwe n'intambara yo mu burasirazuba bw'igihugu, cyane cyane imirwano n'umutwe wa M23.\nUbuzima.\nF\u00e9lix Tshisekedi ni Umuluba, akaba umwana wa gatatu mu bana batanu ba \u00c9tienne Tshisekedi na Marthe. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1980, ubwo se yashingaga UDPS akarwanya ku mugaragaro Mobutu, umuryango we woherejwe mu buhungiro mu Kasa\u00ef, bituma amasomo ye ahagarara; mu 1985, Mobutu yemereye we, nyina n'abavandimwe be kuva mu Kasa\u00ef, se ajya mu Bubiligi.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nYinjiye muri UDPS, ishyaka ryayoborwaga na se, aba umwe mu bayobozi baryo; mu mpera za 2008, yagizwe umunyamabanga w'igihugu ushinzwe ububanyi n'amahanga muri UDPS. Mu Ugushyingo 2011, yatorewe kuba umudepite i Mbuji-Mayi, ariko yanga kujya mu Nteko akurikije amabwiriza ya se wavugaga ko amatora yabayemo uburiganya; mandat ye yakuweho ku wa 18 Kamena 2013. Mu Ukwakira 2016, yagizwe umunyamabanga mukuru wungirije wa UDPS.\nMu gihe cy'ikibazo cya politiki cyo mu 2016, cyatewe n'ubushake bwa Joseph Kabila bwo gusubika amatora, yari mu ntumwa z'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi zaganiraga na Kabila, ibiganiro byavuyemo amasezerano ya Saint-Sylvestre yo ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2016. Mu Werurwe 2017, yabaye umuyobozi wungirije w'ihuriro ry'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi (\"Rassemblement\") hamwe na Pierre Lumbi.\nAmatora yo mu 2018.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwa se ku wa 1 Gashyantare 2017, ku wa 31 Werurwe 2018 yatorewe kuyobora UDPS, kandi uwo munsi ishyaka rimutoranya kuba umukandida mu matora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza 2018. Ku wa 10 Mutarama 2019, byatangajwe ko yatsinze, imbere ya Martin Fayulu na Emmanuel Ramazani Shadary washyigikirwaga na Kabila. Fayulu yavuze ko habayeho uburiganya, ariko ku wa 19 Mutarama 2019 Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwanga ikirego cye. Yarahiye ku wa 24 Mutarama 2019; ni bwo bwa mbere kuva mu 1960 Perezida uriho ahererekanyije ubutegetsi n'uwo mu batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi mu mahoro.\nPerezida wa Kongo.\nManda ya mbere (2019\u20132023).\nIhuriro \"Front commun pour le Congo\" (FCC) rishyigikiye Kabila ryari rifite ubwiganze mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko no mu buyobozi bw'intara, bituma mu mezi atandatu ya mbere ubushobozi bwe bwo kuyobora no gushyiraho Minisitiri w'Intebe bugabanuka. Ku wa 13 Werurwe 2019, yahaye imbabazi imfungwa zigera kuri 700, harimo n'abatavugaga rumwe na Kabila. Ku wa 20 Gicurasi 2019, yumvikanye na FCC, agira Sylvestre Ilunga Minisitiri w'Intebe, maze muri Nyakanga 2019 hashyirwaho guverinoma y'abaminisitiri 65 basaranganyijwe hagati ya FCC n'ihuriro rye CACH.\nMuri Mata 2020, umuyobozi w'ibiro bye akaba n'inshuti ye ikomeye muri politiki, Vital Kamerhe, yafunzwe ashinjwa kunyereza amafaranga ya gahunda y'iminsi 100; ku wa 20 Kamena 2020, yakatiwe imyaka 20 y'imirimo y'agahato, ariko mu Kamena 2022 urukiko rw'ubujurire ruramugira umwere. Muri Werurwe 2023, Kamerhe yagizwe Minisitiri w'Intebe wungirije ushinzwe Ubukungu.\nNyuma y'uko ubufatanye na Kabila busenyutse kandi abadepite benshi bakamuyoboka, ku wa 15 Gashyantare 2021 yagize Jean-Michel Sama Lukonde Minisitiri w'Intebe; ku wa 12 Mata 2021, guverinoma nshya yashyizweho, irangiza ku mugaragaro ubufatanye bw'imyaka ibiri na Kabila.\nUmutekano n'ububanyi n'amahanga.\nKu wa 30 Mata 2021, yatangaje ibihe bidasanzwe (\"\u00e9tat de si\u00e8ge\") mu ntara za Ituri na Kivu y'Amajyaruguru, kubera ubwiyongere bw'urugomo rw'imitwe yitwaje intwaro. Ku wa 6 Gashyantare 2021, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika, asimburwa na Macky Sall muri Gashyantare 2022. Muri Kanama 2022, yafashe ubuyobozi bw'umuryango SADC mu gihe cy'umwaka umwe.\nMuri Kamena 2022, nyuma y'uko umutwe wa M23 wongeye kugaba ibitero, Tshisekedi yashinje u Rwanda gushyigikira uwo mutwe; u Rwanda rwahakanye ibyo birego. Mu Ukwakira 2022, Kongo yirukanye ambasaderi w'u Rwanda, maze mu Ugushyingo Tshisekedi asaba urubyiruko kwinjira mu gisirikare. Yanze kuzana abacancuro b'Abarusiya, ahubwo akoresha ibigo byigenga bya gisirikare by'Abanyarumaniya, n'ingabo za EAC na SADC muri Kivu. Muri Gicurasi 2023, yasuye Ubushinwa ahura na Xi Jinping, ashaka kongera kuganira ku masezerano y'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro yari yarasinywe ku butegetsi bwa Kabila.\nKu wa 18 Mutarama 2025, yongeye kuvuga ko Kinshasa itazagirana ibiganiro na M23. Nyuma y'igitero cya M23 cyafashe umujyi wa Goma, Kongo yacanye umubano wa dipolomasi n'u Rwanda ku wa 26 Mutarama 2025, Tshisekedi ahamagarira abaturage gushyigikira ingabo za FARDC. Ku wa 8 Ukuboza 2025, yashinje u Rwanda kurenga ku masezerano y'amahoro yari aherutse gusinywa. Mu Ukwakira 2024, yari yigaragambije ava mu nama y'ibihugu bivuga Igifaransa i Paris, kubera ko Perezida Emmanuel Macron atavuze ku ntambara yo mu burasirazuba bwa Kongo.\nAfatwa nk'umwe mu bakuru b'ibihugu by'Afurika bashyigikira cyane Isiraheli; muri Nzeri 2026, nyuma y'uruzinduko muri Isiraheli, yatangaje ko ashaka kwimurira ambasade ya Kongo i Yeruzalemu.\nManda ya kabiri (kuva 2024).\nMu matora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza 2023, yashyigikiwe na Vital Kamerhe na Jean-Pierre Bemba. Ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2023, byatangajwe ko yatsinze ku majwi 73,34 %; abakandida icyenda batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi banze ibyavuye mu matora, basaba ko asubirwamo. Yarahiriye manda ya kabiri ku wa 20 Mutarama 2024. Ku wa 1 Mata 2024, yagize Judith Suminwa Tuluka Minisitiri w'Intebe, akaba ari we mugore wa mbere wabaye kuri uwo mwanya.\nKu wa 19 Gicurasi 2024, yarokotse umugambi wa kudeta wayobowe na Christian Malanga, warasiwe mu ngoro y'igihugu n'abasirikare barinda Repubulika; uwo mugambi wahitanye abantu batandatu.\nKu wa 24 Gashyantare 2025, raporo y'imiryango irwanya ruswa yanenze ubuzima buhenze bw'inzego za Leta, harimo izamuka rya 19 % ry'ingengo y'imari y'ibiro bya Perezida hagati ya 2023 na 2024. Kuva mu 2024, Tshisekedi yifuza guhindura Itegeko Nshinga ryo mu 2006, rigena manda ebyiri gusa, kugira ngo abashe kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu mu 2028; muri Kamena 2026, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko na Sena byemeje itegeko rigenga kamarampaka, ariko abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi n'Inama y'Abepiskopi Gatolika (Cenco) barabyamagana.\nUmuco n'ibidukikije.\nKu wa 25 Werurwe 2021, yatangije igihembo nyafurika cy'ubuvanganzo gihabwa abanditsi b'Abanyafurika. Muri Nzeri 2021, yashyizeho ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe impinduka mu bidukikije n'iterambere rirambye (ACTEDD), kandi muri COP26 yiyemeje guhagarika no gusubiza inyuma itemwa ry'amashyamba bitarenze 2030.\nUbuzima bwite.\nF\u00e9lix Tshisekedi yashakanye na Denise Nyakeru, bafitanye abana batanu. Mu 2015, yabaye umupantekoti, yinjira mu itorero ry'Assembl\u00e9es de Dieu."}
{"id": "23192", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23192", "title": "Isma\u00efl Omar Guelleh", "text": "Isma\u00efl Omar Guelleh (mu Gisomali: \"Ismaaciil Cumar Geelle\"; mu Cyarabu: \u0625\u0633\u0645\u0627\u0639\u064a\u0644 \u0639\u0645\u0631 \u062c\u064a\u0644\u0647; wavutse ku wa 27 Ugushyingo 1947 i Dire Dawa, muri Etiyopiya), akunze kwitwa IOG, ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyajibuti, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Jibuti kuva mu 1999.\nYatorewe bwa mbere mu 1999 nk'uwatoranyijwe ngo asimbure nyirarume Hassan Gouled Aptidon, wari uyoboye Jibuti kuva igihugu kibona ubwigenge mu 1977. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2005, 2011, 2016, 2021 na 2026, mu matora abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bakunze kwanga kwitabira bavuga ko arimo uburiganya bukabije. Afatwa n'imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu n'ibihugu bimwe by'amahanga nk'umunyagitugu.\nUbuzima.\nIsma\u00efl Omar Guelleh yavukiye i Dire Dawa, muri Etiyopiya, mu muryango wo mu bwoko bw'Abamamassan bo mu Bisa (\"Issas\"), igice cy'Abasomali gikomeye muri politiki. Se, Omar Guelleh, yari umwe mu barimu ba mbere b'abenegihugu mu myaka ya 1930, nyuma akorera ikigo cy'inzira ya gari ya moshi ihuza Jibuti na Addis-Abeba, cyari gifite icyicaro i Dire Dawa. Yize mu ishuri rya Korowani i Dire Dawa, hanyuma mu ishuri ry'Abafaransa Charles-de-Foucauld i Jibuti.\nMu 1965, afite imyaka 18, yatangiye gukora mu nzego z'iperereza z'ubutegetsi bw'Abafaransa, kuko yavugaga Icyamuhariki, Igisomali, Icyarabu, Igifaransa, Igitaliyani n'Icyongereza. Mu 1974, yahagaritswe ku kazi kuko yakekwagaho guha amakuru abaharaniraga ubwigenge. Yinjiye mu ishyaka \"Ligue populaire africaine pour l'ind\u00e9pendance\" (LPAI) ryayoborwaga na Hassan Gouled Aptidon.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMu 1977, yari mu ntumwa zaganiriye n'Ubufaransa ku bwigenge bw'igihugu, bwatangajwe ku wa 27 Kamena 1977. Perezida mushya, Hassan Gouled Aptidon, yamugize umuyobozi w'ibiro bye, umwanya yamazeho imyaka irenga 20. Yayoboye kandi inzego z'umutekano n'iperereza, bimuhesha izina ry'\"umugabo ukomeye\". Yari umunyamuryango w'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi, \"Rassemblement populaire pour le progr\u00e8s\" (RPP), kuva ryashingwa mu 1979.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya 1980, umutwe w'inyeshyamba \"Front pour la restauration de l'unit\u00e9 et de la d\u00e9mocratie\" (FRUD) wagaragaye mu majyaruguru y'igihugu. Guelleh, wagize uruhare mu biganiro byo gushyiraho amashyaka menshi, yabashije gucamo ibice FRUD, ariko kongera umubare w'abasirikare kuva ku 3 000 ukagera ku 15 000 byashyize igihugu mu bibazo by'imari, bituma gisaba ubufasha Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari (FMI).\nPerezida wa Jibuti.\nManda ya mbere n'iya kabiri (1999\u20132011).\nKu wa 4 Gashyantare 1999, Gouled Aptidon yatangaje ko azava ku butegetsi, maze RPP itoranya Guelleh kuba umukandida wayo. Ku wa 9 Mata 1999, yatsinze amatora ku majwi 74,02 %, atsinda Moussa Ahmed Idriss; atangira imirimo ku wa 8 Gicurasi 1999. Muri Nzeri 1999, Moussa Ahmed Idriss yarafashwe ashinjwa \"guca intege ingabo\". Mu Ukuboza 2000, yirukanye umuyobozi wa polisi y'igihugu, Yacin Yabeh, bituma abapolisi bamushyigikiye bigomeka ariko ntibabigereho. Ku wa 12 Gicurasi 2001, igice cya FRUD cyari gisigaye kirwana cyasinye amasezerano y'amahoro, bisoza amakimbirane ashingiye ku moko yari amaze igihe kirekire.\nKuva mu 2000, yakurikije politiki yo guteza imbere ubukungu, harimo kwegurira abikorera imicungire y'icyambu cya Jibuti, cyahawe ikigo DP World cyo muri Dubai ku wa 1 Kamena 2000. Kaminuza ya mbere ya Jibuti yafunguwe mu 2000.\nMu matora yo ku wa 8 Mata 2005, ni we mukandida wenyine wiyamamaje, maze atsinda; yarahiriye manda ya kabiri ku wa 7 Gicurasi 2005, avuga ko ari yo ya nyuma. Nyamara mu Mata 2010, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yahinduye Itegeko Nshinga kugira ngo abashe kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu, bitera imyigaragambyo yahashywe, abayobozi b'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi barafungwa.\nManda ya gatatu kugeza ku ya gatandatu (kuva 2011).\nKu wa 8 Mata 2011, yongeye gutorwa mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 80,6 %; Human Rights Watch yashidikanyije ku bunyangamugayo bw'ayo matora, kuko abayobozi b'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bari barafunzwe kabiri mbere y'amatora. Muri Kanama 2014, bivugwa ko umwe mu barinzi be yamurasheho mu muhango wabereye ku kibuga cy'indege, ariko ntiyamufata. Mu matora yo ku wa 8 Mata 2016, yatsinze ku majwi 86,28 %; mbere y'amatora, itsinda ry'abanyamakuru ba BBC ryarafashwe rirukanwa mu gihugu.\nKu wa 9 Mata 2021, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 98,58 %, atangira manda ya gatanu ku wa 15 Gicurasi 2021. Muri Kamena 2021, yategetse ko abaturage n'abanyamahanga baba muri Jibuti bakingirwa COVID-19 ku gahato. Ku wa 10 Mata 2026, yatorewe manda ya gatandatu ku majwi 97,81 %, ararahira ku wa 9 Gicurasi 2026.\nIsesengura ry'ubutegetsi bwe.\nImiyoborere.\nKu butegetsi bwe, yashyize abo mu muryango we mu myanya ikomeye ya politiki n'ubukungu: umugore we, Kadra Mahamoud Haid, afatwa nka visi-perezida mu buryo bufatika, abakobwa be bombi bafite uruhare runini mu bujyanama no mu bucuruzi, naho murumuna we Saad Omar Guelleh ayobora icyambu cya Jibuti. Ubutumwa bwa ambasade ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika bwo mu 2004 bwavuze ko Jibuti ari \"umujyi-gihugu w'ubucuruzi ugenzurwa n'umuntu umwe, Isma\u00efl Omar Guelleh\". Mu 2020, Reporters sans fronti\u00e8res yashyize Jibuti ku mwanya wa 176 kuri 179 mu bwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru, ivuga ko hari \"iterabwoba ku itangazamakuru\". Raporo ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika yo mu 2020 ku burenganzira bwa muntu yavuze ku bwicanyi bunyuranyije n'amategeko, iyicarubozo n'ikumirwa rikomeye ry'ubwisanzure bwo kuvuga.\nUmubano n'Ubushinwa n'ubukungu.\nGuelleh yakoresheje aho igihugu cye giherereye mu buryo bw'ingenzi, ashora imari myinshi mu byambu n'ibikorwa remezo by'ubwikorezi. Kuva mu 2013, yegereye Ubushinwa, bwashinze ikigo cya gisirikare cyo mu mazi muri Jibuti mu 2017. Yifuza kugira Jibuti \"Singapuru ya Afurika\". Muri Gashyantare 2018, yambuye ku iteka rya perezida ikigo DP World uburenganzira bwo gucunga ikigo cy'ibikoresho bya Doraleh, akabuha ikigo cya Leta; mu 2020, Urukiko mpuzamahanga rw'ubukemurampaka rwa Londres rwemeje ko icyo cyemezo kinyuranyije n'amategeko, ariko Jibuti iranga. Nubwo ubukungu bwazamutse, ubushomeri bukomeje kuba bwinshi, cyane cyane mu rubyiruko: mu 2015, bwari 39 %.\nUrubanza rwa Borrel.\nKuva mu 2004, urubanza rw'umucamanza w'Umufaransa Bernard Borrel, wapfiriye muri Jibuti mu 1995, rwazambije umubano n'Ubufaransa, kuko umupfakazi we, \u00c9lisabeth Borrel, yashinjaga Perezida Guelleh kuba umwe mu bategetse iyicwa rye. Muri Gashyantare 2007, umucamanza w'Umufaransa yasabye kumwumva nk'umutangabuhamya, ariko Minisiteri y'Ubutabera y'Ubufaransa ivuga ko adashobora guhatirwa gutanga ubuhamya kubera ubudahangarwa bwe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye na Kadra Mahamoud Haid, bafitanye abana bane. Ku wa 25 Mutarama 2019, Ubuhinde bwamuhaye umudari wa Padma Vibhushan, kubera uruhare rwe mu guhungisha Abahinde muri Yemeni."}
{"id": "23193", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23193", "title": "Abdel Fattah al-Sissi", "text": "Abdel Fattah al-Sissi (mu Cyarabu: \u0639\u0628\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0641\u062a\u0627\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0633\u064a\u0633\u064a; wavutse ku wa 19 Ugushyingo 1954 i Kayiro, muri Misiri) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyamisiri ufite ipeti rya Mar\u00e9chal, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika y'Abarabu ya Misiri kuva ku wa 8 Kamena 2014.\nYize mu mashuri ya gisirikare yo muri Misiri, mu Bwongereza no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika. Perezida Hosni Moubarak yamugize umuyobozi w'iperereza rya gisirikare. Nyuma y'impinduramatwara yo muri Misiri yo mu 2011 n'itorwa rya Mohamed Morsi mu 2012, Morsi yamugize Minisitiri w'Ingabo. Ku wa 3 Nyakanga 2013, yahiritse Morsi binyuze muri kudeta ya gisirikare, maze mu 2014 atorerwa kuba Perezida ku majwi 96,9 %, mu matora yateje impaka. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2018 (97,1 %) no mu 2023 (89,6 %). Kuva mu 2019 kugeza mu 2020, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika.\nYiyerekana nk'uharanira impinduka n'umutekano, ateza imbere imishinga minini (kwagura umuyoboro wa Suez, kubaka umurwa mukuru mushya w'ubutegetsi, ingoro ndangamurage nkuru ya Misiri), ariko ubutegetsi bwe bufatwa nk'ubw'igitugu, burangwa n'ihashywa rikaze ry'abamunenga, iyicarubozo n'ibura ry'abantu ku gahato.\nUbuzima.\nAbdel Fattah al-Sissi akomoka mu muryango w'abacuruzi bato b'i Kayiro, akaba umwe mu bahungu batatu mu bana umunani. Yavukiye i Gamaleya, mu gice cya Kayiro ya kera. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya gisirikare, maze mu 1973 yinjira mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare, ahitamo ingabo zirwanira ku butaka zigendera ku modoka z'intambara. Yize kandi muri \"Command &amp; Staff College\" yo muri Misiri, mu 1992 ajya mu ishuri rya gisirikare ryo mu Bwongereza i Watchfield, naho mu 2006 yiga muri \"United States Army War College\", aho yanditse inyandiko yise \"Demokarasi mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati\".\nYashakanye na Entissar Amer mu 1977; bafitanye abana bane: abahungu batatu (Moustafa, Mahmoud na Hassan) n'umukobwa umwe (Aya). Azwiho kuba umunyedini, uzi Korowani mu mutwe.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nYatangiye umwuga we mu ngabo zirwanira ku butaka, aba umwe mu bahagarariye ingabo muri ambasade ya Misiri muri Arabiya Sawudite, hanyuma umuyobozi w'ingabo zo mu karere k'amajyaruguru ka Alegisandiriya. Mu Kamena 2011, ubwo yari umuyobozi w'iperereza rya gisirikare akaba n'umwe mu bagize Inama nkuru y'ingabo (CSFA) yayoboraga igihugu nyuma y'iyegura rya Moubarak, yashyigikiye ko abagore bigaragambyaga bapimwa ubusugi \"kugira ngo ingabo zirindwe ibirego by'ifatwa ku ngufu\".\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMinisitiri w'Ingabo na kudeta ya 2013.\nMuri Kanama 2012, Perezida Mohamed Morsi wo mu muryango w'Abavandimwe b'Abayisilamu (\"Fr\u00e8res musulmans\") yamugize Minisitiri w'Ingabo, asimbura Mohamed Hussein Tantawi. Kuri uwo mwanya, yongereye imishahara y'abasirikare n'abofisiye.\nMu gihe cy'imyigaragambyo ikomeye yo muri Kamena na Nyakanga 2013 yasabaga ko Morsi yegura, yavuze ko ingabo zifite inshingano \"zo kwinjira mu kibazo kugira ngo Misiri itinjira mu mwobo w'amakimbirane\"; ku wa 3 Nyakanga 2013, yahiritse Morsi binyuze muri kudeta ya gisirikare. Uwo munsi, yashyizeho umucamanza Adli Mansour, perezida w'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga, nka Perezida w'agateganyo.\nYayoboye ihashywa rikaze ry'Abavandimwe b'Abayisilamu, aho abantu barenga 1 600 bishwe mu bwicanyi bwo ku bibuga bya Rabaa na Nahda; Human Rights Watch yabwise \"bumwe mu bwicanyi bukomeye bw'abigaragambya mu mateka ya vuba\". Nyuma yaho, yibasiye n'abafatanyabikorwa be b'abasekuleri, abakura muri guverinoma no gufunga abarwanashyaka babo.\nAmatora yo mu 2014.\nKu wa 27 Mutarama 2014, yazamuwe ku ipeti rya Mar\u00e9chal. Ku wa 26 Werurwe 2014, yeguye ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Ingabo kugira ngo yiyamamarize kuba Perezida. Ku wa 28 Gicurasi 2014, yatsinze amatora ku majwi 96 %, mu gihe hakekwaga uburiganya. Yarahiye ku wa 8 Kamena 2014, aba Perezida wa gatandatu wa Repubulika y'Abarabu ya Misiri.\nPerezida wa Misiri.\nImishinga minini.\nMuri Kanama 2014, yatangije umushinga w'umuyoboro mushya wa Suez, wikubye kabiri ubushobozi bw'uwari usanzweho, utwara miliyari 8,4 z'amadolari yose yaturutse mu Misiri; wafunguwe ku wa 6 Kanama 2015. Yatangije kandi umushinga w'imihanda y'igihugu ireshya n'ibirometero birenga 4 400, n'uw'umurwa mukuru mushya w'ubutegetsi uri mu burasirazuba bwa Kayiro. Mu 2016, yiyemeje gukuraho utujagari twose dushobora guteza akaga mu myaka ibiri.\nPolitiki y'ubukungu.\nYashyizeho amavugurura y'ubukungu yo gukuraho ibyari bisigaye bya politiki y'imibereho myiza yo ku gihe cya Nasser: kugabanya inkunga ya Leta ku ngufu n'amashanyarazi, gushyiraho umusoro ku nyongeragaciro (TVA), kuzamura ibiciro by'itike ya metero ya Kayiro no guhagarika izamuka ry'imishahara y'abakozi ba Leta. Raporo ya Banki y'Isi yo muri Mata 2019 yagaragaje ko 60 % by'Abanyamisiri bari mu bukene cyangwa mu buzima bugoye. Muri Kamena 2018, umwenda w'igihugu wageze ku rwego rutigeze rubaho (miliyari 92,6 z'amadolari), bitewe ahanini n'ingengo y'imari ya gisirikare n'inyungu z'umwenda.\nAmatora yo mu 2018 n'ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga.\nMuri Mutarama 2018, yatangaje ko aziyamamariza manda ya kabiri. Abantu benshi bari batangaje ko baziyamamaza, barimo Ahmed Chafik na Sami Anan, baratewe ubwoba cyangwa barafungwa. Ku wa 2 Mata 2018, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 97,08 %, mu matora aho uwo bari bahanganye wenyine na we yari amushyigikiye.\nKu wa 16 Mata 2019, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yemeje ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga ryongereye manda ye imyaka ibiri kandi rimwemerera kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu y'imyaka itandatu; kamarampaka yo kuva ku wa 20 kugeza ku wa 22 Mata 2019 yaryemeje ku majwi 88,8 %. Muri Nzeri 2019, nyuma y'aho umucuruzi uri mu buhungiro Mohamed Ali amushinje ruswa, habaye imyigaragambyo mu migi myinshi; abantu bagera ku 2 000 barafashwe.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu.\nKuva yagera ku butegetsi muri Nyakanga 2013, ibihumbi by'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bishwe cyangwa barafungwa, abandi amagana baburirwa irengero. Nk'uko Human Rights Watch ibivuga, abantu 60 000 bafashwe kuva mu 2013, kandi polisi n'inzego z'umutekano bakoresha iyicarubozo kenshi. Muri Gashyantare 2016, umurambo w'umunyeshuri w'Umutaliyani Giulio Regeni, wishwe akorewe iyicarubozo, wabonetse i Kayiro, bitera ikibazo cya dipolomasi hagati ya Misiri n'Ubutaliyani. Ku wa 17 Kamena 2019, Mohamed Morsi wari ufunzwe yapfiriye mu rukiko. Mu Ukuboza 2020, Perezida w'Ubufaransa Emmanuel Macron yamuhaye umudari usumba iyindi wa \"L\u00e9gion d'honneur\", bituma bamwe mu Bataliyani bawuhawe bawusubiza mu rwego rwo kwamagana.\nAmatora yo mu 2023.\nKu wa 18 Ukuboza 2023, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 89,6 %, atangira manda ya gatatu, igomba kuba iya nyuma nk'uko Itegeko Nshinga ribiteganya; yarahiye ku wa 2 Mata 2024.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nUrugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga ari Perezida, ku wa 25 Kamena 2014, rwabaye muri Aligeriya. Umubano na Isiraheli waratejwe imbere nyuma y'ikurwaho rya Morsi; ikinyamakuru \"The Economist\" cyamwise \"umuyobozi wa Misiri ushyigikiye Isiraheli kurusha abandi bose\". Ubutegetsi bwe bushyigikira igisubizo cy'ibihugu bibiri, Palestine ifite umurwa mukuru i Yeruzalemu y'Iburasirazuba. Mu Ukwakira 2023, mu gihe cy'intambara yo muri Gaza, yavuze ko ibisasu Isiraheli yateraga muri Gaza \"byarenze uburenganzira bwo kwirwanaho, bihinduka igihano rusange ku bantu miliyoni 2,3\". Muri Kamena 2025, yahagaritse urugendo mpuzamahanga rwerekezaga muri Gaza.\nAmakimbirane hagati ya Misiri na Etiyopiya ku rugomero rwa Grand Ethiopian Renaissance Dam yarakomeje mu 2021; Sissi yagize ati: \"Ndabwira abavandimwe bacu bo muri Etiyopiya, ntitukagere aho mukora ku gitonyanga na kimwe cy'amazi ya Misiri, kuko inzira zose zirafunguye\". Mu 2019, Emmanuel Macron yamutumiye mu nama ya G7 i Biarritz."}
{"id": "23194", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23194", "title": "Teodoro Obiang Nguema Mbasogo", "text": "Teodoro Obiang Nguema Mbasogo (wavutse ku wa 5 Kamena 1942 i Acoac\u00e1n, mu karere ka Mongomo, muri Gineya Ekwatoriyale) ni umunyapolitiki akaba n'uwahoze ari umusirikare wo muri Gineya Ekwatoriyale, uyoboye icyo gihugu kuva mu 1979, akaba ari Perezida wacyo wa kabiri kuva mu 1982.\nAmaze kwiga mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Zaragoza muri Esipanye, yabaye mu myanya myinshi ku butegetsi bwa nyirarume Francisco Mac\u00edas Nguema, harimo n'uw'umuyobozi wa gereza ya Playa Negra (\"Black Beach\"), izwiho guhohotera uburenganzira bwa muntu. Mu 1979, yahiritse Mac\u00edas binyuze muri kudeta ya gisirikare. Mu 1987, yashinze ishyaka \"Parti d\u00e9mocratique de Guin\u00e9e \u00e9quatoriale\" (PDGE), ryabaye ishyaka rimwe rukumbi ryemewe kugeza mu 1992. Ku butegetsi bwe, Gineya Ekwatoriyale yabaye igihugu gikomeye mu gucukura peteroli kuva mu myaka ya 1990. Kuva mu 2011 kugeza mu 2012, yabaye Perezida w'Ubumwe bwa Afurika.\nAfatwa nk'umunyagitugu uyoboye ubutegetsi burangwa na ruswa ikabije, ikoreshwa nabi ry'ububasha, ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu n'ikimenyane. Ni we mukuru w'igihugu utari umwami umaze igihe kirekire ku butegetsi ku isi, nyuma ya Paul Biya wa Kameruni.\nUbuzima.\nUmuryango.\nTeodoro Obiang yavukiye mu muryango wo mu bwoko bw'Abesangui, ku wa 5 Kamena 1942, mu gace kari mu bukoloni bwa Esipanye, ku mupaka n'Gabon y'ubu. Ni umwana wa gatatu mu bana icumi ba Santiago Nguema Eneme Obama na Mar\u00eda Mbasogo Ngui, bombi b'Abanyagabon bari barimukiye muri Gineya ya Esipanye kugira ngo birinde umusoro w'umubiri no kungukira mu bukungu bwari bwifashe neza. Nyina amaze gupfa, we n'abavandimwe be barezwe na se n'umugore we mushya, Carmen Mikue Mbira.\nKu wa 12 Ukuboza 1968, yashakanye na Constancia Mangue Nsue; umuhungu wabo, Teodoro Nguema Obiang Mangue (\"Teodor\u00edn\"), ni Visi-perezida w'igihugu. Afite abandi bagore, kandi abana be benshi bari mu myanya ikomeye muri guverinoma.\nAmashuri.\nYize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye mu kigo cya Cardenal Cisneros cya Ebibeyin no mu kigo cya La Salle cya Bata. Kuva mu 1963 kugeza mu 1965, yize mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Zaragoza muri Esipanye, ahavana ipeti rya sous-lieutenant.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare ku butegetsi bwa Mac\u00edas.\nMu 1969, nyirarume Perezida Francisco Mac\u00edas Nguema yamugize lieutenant mu ngabo z'igihugu. Mu 1971, yazamuwe ku ipeti rya kapiteni kubera uruhare rwe mu kuvumbura umugambi wa kudeta, hanyuma aba komanda mu 1975. Mu 1979, yabaye Minisitiri wungirije w'Ingabo afite ipeti rya lieutenant-colonel. Mu myaka myinshi, yayoboye gereza ya Playa Negra n'urwego rwose rw'amagereza mu gihugu, aba na guverineri w'ikirwa cya Bioko n'umuyobozi w'ingabo z'igihugu.\nPerezida wa Gineya Ekwatoriyale.\nKudeta ya 1979.\nNyuma y'aho Mac\u00edas ategetse ko abantu benshi bo mu muryango wabo bicwa, barimo na murumuna wa Obiang, Obiang n'abandi bari hafi ya Mac\u00edas bakeka ko yasaze. Ku wa 3 Kanama 1979, Obiang yamuhiritse muri kudeta yamenekeyemo amaraso, maze amushyikiriza urukiko ku byaha yakoze, harimo jenoside y'Ababubi; Mac\u00edas yakatiwe urwo gupfa, aricwa arashwe ku wa 29 Nzeri 1979. Obiang yatangaje ko ubutegetsi bushya buzatangira bundi bushya: yahaye imbabazi imfungwa za politiki, akuraho imirimo y'agahato, kandi yongera kwemera ubukirisitu bwari bwarabujijwe, ariko ntiyavuze ku ruhare rwe mu byaha by'ubutegetsi bwa Mac\u00edas.\nItegeko Nshinga rishya n'amatora.\nMu 1982, igihugu cyasubiye ku butegetsi bwa gisivili mu izina, gishyiraho Itegeko Nshinga rishya; Obiang yatorewe kuba Perezida nta wundi bahanganye, ararahira ku wa 12 Ukwakira 1982. Yongeye gutorwa mu 1989 ari wenyine. Nyuma y'aho amashyaka menshi yemerewe mu 1992, yongeye gutorwa mu 1996 no mu 2002 ku majwi 98 %, mu matora indorerezi mpuzamahanga zavuze ko arimo uburiganya; mu 2002, mu ntara imwe y'itora, yabonye 103 % by'amajwi. Mu 2009, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 97 %, nanone havugwa uburiganya n'iterabwoba. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2016 no mu 2022.\nPDGE ifite ububasha hafi bwose, kandi Itegeko Nshinga riha Perezida ububasha bwagutse, harimo n'ubwo kuyobora binyuze mu mateka. Ubwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru bugarukira cyane: ibinyamakuru hafi ya byose ni ibya Leta cyangwa iby'umuhungu we Teodor\u00edn.\nMu 2004, habaye umugambi wa kudeta wateguwe n'abacancuro b'abanyamahanga, uyobowe n'Umwongereza Simon Mann, waje gukatirwa gufungwa imyaka 34. Muri Nzeri 2022, Obiang yashyize umukono ku itegeko rikuraho igihano cy'urupfu, icyemezo cyashimwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nUmubano na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika warazambye mu 1993, ambasade y'Amerika ifungwa mu 1996. Nyuma y'ibitero byo ku wa 11 Nzeri 2001, Amerika yongeye kwita ku bihugu by'Afurika bicukura peteroli; mu ruzinduko rwe rwo mu 2006, Umunyamabanga wa Leta Condoleezza Rice yamwise \"inshuti nziza\". Ambasade nshya y'Amerika yafunguwe mu 2013. Ku wa 26 Nzeri 2024, yasuye Moscou ahura na Perezida Vladimir Putin.\nUbukungu n'umurwa mukuru mushya.\nMu 1995, sosiyete ExxonMobil yavumbuye peteroli mu gihugu, maze Gineya Ekwatoriyale iba igihugu cya gatatu mu bihugu byo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara bicukura peteroli nyinshi, nyuma ya Nijeriya na Angola. Nubwo igihugu gifite umusaruro mbumbe ku muturage uri hejuru muri Afurika, ubukire bwacyo bugabanywa nabi cyane, ahanini buri mu maboko y'umuryango uri ku butegetsi. Nk'uko \"Forbes\" ibivuga, Obiang afite umutungo wa miliyoni 600 z'amadolari.\nMu 2012, yategetse kubaka umujyi mushya, Ciudad de la Paz (wahoze witwa Oyala), ku mugabane, kugira ngo usimbure Malabo ku mwanya w'umurwa mukuru. Ku wa 2 Mutarama 2026, yasinye iteka rigira Ciudad de la Paz umurwa mukuru ku mugaragaro.\nImpaka.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMu 2006, yasinye iteka ribuza iyicarubozo, ariko imiryango nka Human Rights Watch na Amnesty International ikomeza kugaragaza iyicarubozo, gukubitwa, impfu zidasobanuwe n'ifungwa rinyuranyije n'amategeko mu magereza. Freedom House yamwise umwe mu banyagitugu \"biba umutungo w'igihugu kurusha abandi\" bakiriho. Muri Nyakanga 2003, radiyo ya Leta yamwise \"Imana y'igihugu\" ifite \"ububasha bwose ku bantu n'ibintu\". Mu 2024, ubutegetsi bwe bwahashye imyigaragambyo ku kirwa cya Annob\u00f3n, buhagarika itumanaho na interineti kuri icyo kirwa.\nRuswa n'imitungo y'inyerezo.\nIkinyamakuru \"Los Angeles Times\" cyagaragaje ko amasosiyete akomeye y'Abanyamerika acukura peteroli yishyuraga amafaranga kuri konti igenzurwa na Perezida muri banki ya Riggs i Washington. Mu Bufaransa, mu rubanza ruzwi nka \"biens mal acquis\", ubucamanza bwafatiriye ibintu mu nzu y'umuryango we iri ku muhanda wa Avenue Foch i Paris, ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 100 z'amayero. Muri Nyakanga 2021, umuhungu we Teodor\u00edn yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka itatu gisubitse n'ihazabu ya miliyoni 30 z'amayero. Muri Gicurasi 2009, ubushinjacyaha bwa Esipanye bushinzwe kurwanya ruswa bwasabye iperereza ku iyezandonke ku makonti ye muri Esipanye."}
{"id": "23195", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23195", "title": "Isaias Afwerki", "text": "Isaias Afwerki (mu Gitigrinya: \u12a2\u1233\u12ed\u12eb\u1235 \u12a3\u1348\u12c8\u122d\u1242; wavutse ku wa 2 Gashyantare 1946 i Asmara) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyeritereya, akaba ari we Perezida wa mbere kandi wenyine wa Eritereya kuva igihugu kibona ubwigenge mu 1993.\nYarwanye mu ntambara y'ubwigenge bwa Eritereya yo kwigobotora Etiyopiya, aba umuyobozi w'Ingabo za rubanda zo kubohora Eritereya (\"Eritrean People's Liberation Front\", EPLF). Kuva igihugu kibonye ubwigenge, ayoboye ishyaka rimwe rukumbi, \"People's Front for Democracy and Justice\" (PFDJ), nta matora ya perezida arigera aba. Imiryango mpuzamahanga myinshi ifata ubutegetsi bwe nk'ubw'igitugu; bwagereranyijwe n'ubwa Koreya ya Ruguru, bwiswe \"Koreya ya Ruguru ya Afurika\".\nUbuzima.\nIsaias Afwerki yavukiye i Asmara ku wa 2 Gashyantare 1946, ubwo Eritereya yari mu butegetsi bw'Abongereza. Se, ukomoka mu mudugudu wa Tselot hafi ya Asmara, yari umukozi muto mu kigo cya Leta gishinzwe itabi; nyina yari umugore wo mu rugo. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Prince Makonnen i Asmara, aho yatangiye kuganira kuri politiki iharanira ubwigenge bwa Eritereya. Mu 1965, yatangiye kwiga ubwubatsi (\"ing\u00e9nierie\") muri Kaminuza ya Haile Selassie I i Addis-Abeba, ariko ntiyakomeza amasomo.\nIntambara y'ubwigenge.\nMuri Nzeri 1966, yagiye i Kassala muri Sudani kwinjira mu mutwe \"Eritrean Liberation Front\" (ELF). Mu 1967, yari mu bantu batanu ba ELF bahawe amahugurwa na Leta y'Ubushinwa mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Nankin, aho yize amahame ya Mao n'amayeri y'intambara y'inyeshyamba. Agarutse, mu 1968 yabaye komiseri wa politiki mu karere ka 5 ka ELF. We n'abandi barwanyi b'Abakirisitu banenze ivangura ryakorerwaga Abakirisitu muri ELF; mu 1970 yabaye umuyobozi w'itsinda ryitandukanyije na ELF, maze mu 1971 ryandika inyandiko \"Nihnan Elamanan\" (\"Twe n'intego zacu\") yanditswe na we.\nMu 1973, hashinzwe \"Eritrean People's Liberation Front\" (EPLF), wahanganye na ELF mu ntambara yiswe \"intambara y'abenegihugu ebyiri\". Mu 1977, yatorewe kuba umunyamabanga mukuru wungirije wa EPLF, naho mu 1987 aba umunyamabanga mukuru wawo, abona ububasha busesuye kuri uwo mutwe. Muri Mata 1991, EPLF yafashe Asmara, maze nyuma y'ihirikwa ry'ubutegetsi bwa Derg muri Etiyopiya muri Gicurasi 1991, Isaias yabonye inkunga ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika ku bwigenge bwa Eritereya.\nPerezida wa Eritereya.\nUbwigenge.\nMuri Mata 1993, habaye kamarampaka y'ubwigenge igenzurwa n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye; ubwigenge bwatangajwe ku wa 27 Mata 1993, maze ku wa 24 Gicurasi 1993, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko imutorera kuba Perezida wa Leta ya Eritereya. Ku wa 16 Gashyantare 1994, EPLF yahinduye izina iba \"People's Front for Democracy and Justice\" (PFDJ), Isaias akomeza kuba umunyamabanga mukuru wayo. Muri Gicurasi 1994, yashyizeho gahunda y'umurimo w'igihugu ku gahato, yagombaga kumara amezi 18.\nIgitugu.\nKuva atangira, yashyizeho ubutegetsi bw'ishyaka rimwe rukumbi, nta matora, n'ubukungu bugenzurwa na Leta, kandi abuza cyane ubwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru. Nyuma y'intambara ya kabiri na Etiyopiya (1998\u20132000), ubutegetsi bwe bwarushijeho kuba ubw'igitugu. Mu izina ry'\"intambara yo kurengera igihugu\", umurimo w'igihugu ku gahato wabaye uw'igihe kitazwi, bituma urubyiruko rwinshi ruhunga igihugu.\nMu 2001, abayobozi 15 ba PFDJ, bitwaga G-15, bandikiye Perezida ibaruwa ifunguye basaba amavugurura n'ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry'Itegeko Nshinga ryo mu 1997. Ku wa 18 Nzeri 2001, yafunze ibinyamakuru byose byigenga, abayobozi bakomeye b'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi barafungwa; 11 mu bagize G-15 barafunzwe, kandi mu 2026 bari bataragera aho barekurwa. Mu bafunzwe harimo umunyamakuru Dawit Isaak, umaze imyaka irenga 20 afunzwe nta rubanza. Mu 2010, abajijwe igihe amatora azabera, yasubije ati: \"Reka dutegereze imyaka mirongo itatu cyangwa ine\".\nMu 2013, Amnesty International yavuze ko hari nibura imfungwa za politiki 10 000, kandi ko iyicarubozo rikoreshwa kenshi. Muri Kamena 2015, akanama k'Umuryango w'Abibumbye kamushinje kuyobora ubutegetsi bw'igitugu bukabije bukora ihohoterwa rishobora kuba ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu; mu 2016, komisiyo y'iperereza ya Loni yavuze ko habayeho \"ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu\" kuva mu 1991, ariko Eritereya yanze ibyo birego. Mu 2022, Freedom House yashyize Eritereya mu bihugu \"bitisanzuye\", ibona inota 1 kuri 40 mu burenganzira bwa politiki.\nUbukungu.\nMu 1997, yatangaje gahunda yo kwegurira abikorera ibigo 37 bya Leta, kandi Leta itanga impushya zo gucukura amabuye y'agaciro hafi ya Asmara. Mu 2009, yashyigikiye ko igihugu cyishingikiriza ku nzego zacyo bwite n'umutungo gifite, harimo ibikorwa remezo by'ingufu, ubwikorezi n'itumanaho. Nk'uko Banki y'Isi ibivuga, ubuhinzi n'ubucukuzi ni byo bifite uruhare runini mu bukungu; mu 2018, umusaruro mbumbe w'igihugu wazamutseho 12 %.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nKuva ku wa 6 Gicurasi 1998 kugeza mu 2000, Eritereya na Etiyopiya barwanye intambara ku mupaka utavugwaho rumwe wa Badme, ihitana abantu ibihumbi amagana. Ku wa 12 Ukuboza 2000, Eritereya yasinye amasezerano ya Alger, ariko ibihugu byombi bikomeza kuba mu bihe \"bitari intambara bitari n'amahoro\". Ku wa 9 Nyakanga 2018, Isaias na Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Etiyopiya Abiy Ahmed batangaje iherezo ry'intambara hagati y'ibihugu byombi; ku wa 11 Nzeri 2018, bafunguye imipaka yari ifunzwe kuva mu 1998, maze ku wa 16 Nzeri basinya amasezerano y'amahoro i Djeddah.\nMu ntambara ya Tigray yatangiye ku wa 3 Ugushyingo 2020, ingabo za Eritereya zafatanyije n'iza Etiyopiya kurwanya \"Tigray People's Liberation Front\" (TPLF); zashinjwe gusahura no kwica abaturage, cyane cyane i Axum. Ku wa 26 Werurwe 2021, nyuma y'igitutu mpuzamahanga, byatangajwe ko ingabo za Eritereya zizava muri Tigray.\nMu ntangiriro z'ubutegetsi bwe, yafatwaga nk'umuyobozi ugezweho, ndetse ashimwa na Perezida Bill Clinton. Yegereye Ubushinwa, bwashoye imari mu mabuye y'agaciro y'igihugu kandi bwubaka ibitaro bya Orotta i Asmara. Muri Nyakanga 2023, yitabiriye inama y'Uburusiya n'Afurika i Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg, ahura na Vladimir Putin, ahakana ku mugaragaro ko hari intambara hagati y'Uburusiya na Ukraine. Muri Gicurasi 2026, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika zateganyaga gukuraho ibihano kuri Eritereya, kubera agaciro k'Inyanja Itukura mu bya politiki.\nUmubano na Sudani, wari mubi mu ntangiriro, wongeye gusubukurwa mu Ukuboza 2005, kandi Eritereya yagize uruhare mu gutuma habaho amasezerano y'amahoro hagati ya guverinoma ya Sudani n'ihuriro \"Eastern Front\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nIsaias Afwerki yashakanye na Saba Haile, bafitanye abana batatu: Abraham, Berhane na Elsa. Ururimi rwe kavukire ni Igitigrinya, ariko avuga neza Icyongereza, kandi azi Icyarabu n'Icyamuhariki."}
{"id": "23196", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23196", "title": "Taye Atske Selassie", "text": "Taye Atske Selassie Amde (mu Cyamuhariki: \u1273\u12ec \u12a0\u133d\u1240\u1225\u120b\u1234; wavutse ku wa 13 Mutarama 1956) ni umudipolomate n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyetiyopiya, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Federasiyo ya Etiyopiya kuva mu 2024. Muri Etiyopiya, umwanya wa Perezida ni uw'icyubahiro; ububasha bwo kuyobora igihugu buri mu maboko ya Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nMbere yo kuba Perezida, yabaye mu myanya myinshi ya dipolomasi, harimo ambasaderi wa Etiyopiya muri Misiri, uhagarariye igihugu cye burundu mu Muryango w'Abibumbye, na Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga.\nUbuzima n'amashuri.\nTaye Atske Selassie yavukiye i Debark, mu karere ka Gondar. Yarangije muri Kaminuza ya Addis Ababa, ahabona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri mu bumenyi bwa politiki n'ububanyi n'amahanga, hanyuma mu 1989 abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu bubanyi n'amahanga n'ubushakashatsi ku ngamba (\"strategic studies\") muri Kaminuza ya Lancaster mu Bwongereza.\nUmwuga wa dipolomasi.\nMuri Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga, yabaye umujyanama mu ishami ry'Uburayi, umuyobozi w'ishami ry'Uburayi bw'Iburengerazuba, n'umuyobozi w'agateganyo ushinzwe itangazamakuru. Kuva mu Ukwakira 2002 kugeza mu Ugushyingo 2010, yabaye umujyanama muri ambasade ya Etiyopiya i Washington n'umukonseye mukuru i Los Angeles. Kuva mu 2017 kugeza mu 2018, yabaye ambasaderi wa Etiyopiya muri Misiri, maze mu 2018 aba uhagarariye Etiyopiya burundu mu Muryango w'Abibumbye. Kuri uwo mwanya, yanenze raporo ya komisiyo mpuzamahanga y'impuguke mu burenganzira bwa muntu yagaragazaga ibyaha byakozwe mu ntambara ya Tigray.\nNyuma y'iyegura rya Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga Demeke Mekonnen ku wa 26 Mutarama 2024, Taye yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga ku wa 8 Gashyantare 2024. Yayoboye ibiganiro bitari ibya bugufi na Somaliya, binyuze kuri Turukiya, ku cyifuzo cya Etiyopiya cyo gukodesha ibirometero 20 by'inkombe za Somaliland mu mwanya wo kwemera ubwigenge bwayo.\nPerezida wa Etiyopiya.\nPerezida Sahle-Work Zewde yavanywe ku mwanya we, bivugwa ko yari yashwanye na Minisitiri w'Intebe Abiy Ahmed. Ku wa 7 Ukwakira 2024, Taye Atske Selassie yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Etiyopiya. Afatwa nk'inshuti ya Abiy Ahmed, kandi atangira manda ye yagaragaje ubushake bwo kuganira.\nMuri Gicurasi 2025, yasuye Moscou mu birori by'isabukuru y'imyaka 80 y'intsinzi yo mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi, atumiwe na Perezida Vladimir Putin."}
{"id": "23197", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23197", "title": "Brice Clotaire Oligui Nguema", "text": "Brice Clotaire Oligui Nguema (wavutse ku wa 3 Werurwe 1975 i Ngouoni, mu ntara ya Haut-Ogoou\u00e9, muri Gabon) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyagabon, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Gabon.\nUbwo yari umuyobozi w'ingabo zirinda Repubulika (\"Garde r\u00e9publicaine\"), yagize uruhare rukomeye muri kudeta yo ku wa 30 Kanama 2023 yahiritse Perezida Ali Bongo, maze aba Perezida w'inzibacyuho. Mu Mata 2025, yatsinze amatora ya perezida ku majwi agera kuri 95 %, ararahira ku wa 3 Gicurasi 2025 kuyobora igihugu mu gihe cy'imyaka irindwi.\nUbuzima.\nInkomoko n'amashuri.\nBrice Clotaire Oligui Nguema yavukiye i Ngouoni, mu karere ka L\u00e9kabi-L\u00e9wolo mu ntara ya Haut-Ogoou\u00e9, intara ifatwa nk'indiri y'umuryango wa Bongo. Se yari umusirikare w'Umufang wo mu ntara ya Woleu-Ntem, naho nyina akaba Umuteke. Ni uwo mu muryango wa Bongo, kuko nyina ari mubyara wa nyina wa Perezida Omar Bongo; ni mubyara wa Ali Bongo ku ruhande rwa nyina. Yarezwe ahanini na nyina n'umuryango we i Haut-Ogoou\u00e9, yiga muri Kaminuza ya Omar Bongo, hanyuma mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Mekn\u00e8s muri Maroke.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nYabaye umufasha wihariye (\"aide de camp\") wa Perezida Omar Bongo kugeza apfuye mu 2009. Nyuma y'itorwa rya Ali Bongo mu 2009, yoherejwe kuba umusirikare uhagarariye Gabon muri ambasade zayo muri Maroke no muri Senegali, ibyo ubwe yise \"ubuhungiro\".\nMu Ukwakira 2018, yagaruwe muri Gabon, asimbura Koloneli Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Bongo, murumuna wa Ali Bongo, ku buyobozi bw'urwego rw'iperereza rw'ingabo zirinda Repubulika. Muri Mata 2019, yazamuwe ku ipeti rya Jenerali wa burigade, maze muri Mata 2020 afata ubuyobozi bw'ingabo zirinda Repubulika, asimbura Jenerali Gr\u00e9goire Kouna. Yongereye cyane umutwe udasanzwe ushinzwe ibikorwa byihariye (SIS), uva ku basirikare bagera kuri 30 ugera ku barenga 300.\nKudeta ya 2023 n'inzibacyuho.\nKu wa 30 Kanama 2023, amasaha make nyuma y'uko komisiyo y'amatora itangaje ko Ali Bongo yatsinze amatora ya perezida ku majwi 64 %, Oligui Nguema n'ingabo zirinda Repubulika bafashe ubutegetsi nta guhangana. Agatsiko k'abasirikare kiyise \"Comit\u00e9 pour la transition et la restauration des institutions\" (CTRI) kasheshe inzego zose za Repubulika, kamugira Perezida w'inzibacyuho. Mu kiganiro na \"Le Monde\", yavuze ko abasirikare bakoze kudeta kubera kutishimira kwariyongereye kuva Ali Bongo yarwara indwara yo mu bwonko mu 2018, icyemezo cye cyo kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu n'uburyo amatora yakozwe.\nKu wa 4 Nzeri 2023, yarahiriye kuba Perezida w'inzibacyuho mu ngoro ya Perezida i Libreville. Yasezeranyije amatora \"yisanzuye kandi aciye mu mucyo\", Itegeko Nshinga rishya binyuze muri kamarampaka, n'irekurwa ry'imfungwa zose za politiki. Ku wa 7 Nzeri 2023, yagize Raymond Ndong Sima Minisitiri w'Intebe w'inzibacyuho. Mu Ukwakira 2023, yaretse umushahara wa Perezida, akomeza guhembwa nk'umuyobozi w'ingabo zirinda Repubulika. Ku wa 10 Gashyantare 2024, ivugurura ry'itegeko ry'inzibacyuho ryamwemereye kuziyamamaza mu matora.\nKimwe mu byemezo bye bya mbere nyuma ya kudeta kwari ugufunga abantu bakekwagaho ruswa, barimo Noureddin Bongo Valentin, umuhungu wa Ali Bongo. Muri Gicurasi 2025, nyuma y'ubuhuza bwa Perezida wa Angola Jo\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o, Ali Bongo, umugore we n'umuhungu we barekuwe bajya kuba i Luanda.\nPerezida wa Repubulika.\nKu wa 3 Werurwe 2025, yatangaje ko aziyamamaza mu matora ya perezida yo ku wa 12 Mata 2025. Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ko yatsinze ku majwi 94,85 %, abitabiriye amatora bakaba 70,4 %. Yarahiriye manda y'imyaka irindwi ku wa 3 Gicurasi 2025.\nKu wa 5 Nyakanga 2025, yashinze ku mugaragaro ishyaka \"Union d\u00e9mocratique des b\u00e2tisseurs\" (UDB), risimbura ihuriro rye ry'amatora \"Rassemblement des b\u00e2tisseurs\". Mu matora y'abadepite yo mu 2025, UDB yabonye imyanya 101 kuri 140 mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, naho ishyaka ryahoze ku butegetsi, \"Parti d\u00e9mocratique gabonais\", riba irya mbere mu batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi rifite imyanya 17. Muri Kanama 2025, yatangaje itegeko ry'imbabazi rusange ku bagize uruhare muri kudeta yo mu 2023 no mu mugambi wa kudeta wo mu 2019.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nOligui Nguema yakomeje kandi yagura umubano n'ibihugu by'Uburengerazuba, harimo n'Ubufaransa bwahoze bukolonije Gabon; mu bihugu bitanu by'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba n'iyo Hagati byabayemo kudeta kuva mu 2020, Gabon ni yo yonyine yasubiye vuba ku butegetsi bwa gisivili kandi ikomeza umubano wa hafi n'igihugu cyayikolonije. Perezida Emmanuel Macron yagiriye uruzinduko rwa Leta i Libreville ku wa 23\u201324 Ugushyingo 2025. Muri Gashyantare 2026, Gabon na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu basinyanye amasezerano yagutse y'ubufatanye mu bukungu, harimo n'umushinga w'icyambu cy'amazi maremare cya Mayumba.\nInenge.\nNk'uko iperereza ryo mu 2020 ry'ihuriro ry'abanyamakuru \"Organized Crime and Corruption Reporting Project\" (OCCRP) ribivuga, hagati ya 2015 na 2018 yaguze amafaranga mu ntoki inzu eshatu hafi ya Washington, zifite agaciro karenga miliyoni imwe y'amadolari; abajijwe kuri ibyo, yavuze ko ari \"ibintu bye bwite\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye na Zita Nyangui Oligui, maze muri Werurwe 2024 ashaka undi mugore, Anouchka Avome. Ni umukirisitu. Muramu we, R\u00e9gis Onanga Ndiaye, ni Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga."}
{"id": "23198", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23198", "title": "Adama Barrow", "text": "Adama Barrow (wavutse ku wa 16 Gashyantare 1965 i Mankamang Kunda, muri Gambiya) ni umucuruzi n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyagambiya, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Gambiya kuva ku wa 19 Mutarama 2017.\nAshyigikiwe n'ihuriro ry'amashyaka arindwi atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, yatsinze amatora ya perezida yo ku wa 1 Ukuboza 2016, atsinda Yahya Jammeh wari umaze imyaka 22 ku butegetsi. Jammeh yanze kuva ku butegetsi, bituma Barrow ararahira ari muri ambasade ya Gambiya i Dakar, muri Senegali, mbere y'uko igitero cya gisirikare cya CEDEAO gihatira Jammeh guhunga igihugu. Yongeye gutorwa mu Ukuboza 2021.\nUbuzima.\nAmashuri n'umwuga.\nAdama Barrow yavukiye mu mudugudu wa Mankamang Kunda, mu nkengero z'umujyi wa Basse Santa Su, mu burasirazuba bwa Gambiya. Yize i Koba Kunda no mu Banjul, hanyuma ahabwa buruse yo kwiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye ry'Abayisilamu. Arangije amashuri, yakoreye ikigo cy'ingufu Alhagie Musa Njie &amp; Sons, azamuka kugeza abaye umuyobozi ushinzwe kugurisha.\nMu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2000, yagiye i Londres, aho yize ibijyanye n'imitungo itimukanwa, akanakora nk'umuzamu kugira ngo yishyure amasomo; yavuze ko ubwo buzima bwamwubatse, ati: \"Gukora amasaha 15 ku munsi byubaka umugabo\". Agarutse muri Gambiya, mu 2006 yashinze ikigo cy'imitungo itimukanwa Majum Real Estate, akiyobora kugeza mu 2016.\nIntangiriro muri politiki.\nYatangiye politiki mu ishyaka \"National Reconciliation Party\" (NRP), hanyuma mu 2007 yinjira mu ishyaka \"United Democratic Party\" (UDP), ariko atsindwa amatora y'abadepite. Mbere yo kwiyamamariza kuba Perezida, ntiyari yarigeze atorerwa umwanya uwo ari wo wose, ariko yari umubitsi wa UDP.\nAmatora yo mu 2016 n'ihererekanyabubasha.\nKu wa 30 Ukwakira 2016, ihuriro ry'amashyaka arindwi atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi ryamutoranyije kuba umukandida waryo, maze ava muri UDP kugira ngo yiyamamaze nk'umukandida wigenga. Yasezeranyije gusubiza Gambiya mu Muryango wa Commonwealth no mu Rukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga, kuvugurura inzego z'umutekano, no kuyobora guverinoma y'inzibacyuho akava ku butegetsi nyuma y'imyaka itatu. Ku wa 1 Ukuboza 2016, yatsinze amatora ku majwi 43,3 %, imbere ya Yahya Jammeh (39,6 %) na Mama Kandeh (17,1 %).\nMu ntangiriro, Jammeh yasaga n'uwemera ibyavuye mu matora, ariko ku wa 9 Ukuboza 2016 yatangaje ko abyanze \"burundu\"; Akanama gashinzwe umutekano ku isi ka Loni, Ubumwe bwa Afurika, CEDEAO n'abandi baramwamaganye. Barrow yahungiye muri Senegali kubera umutekano we. Ku wa 17 Mutarama 2017, Jammeh yatangaje ibihe bidasanzwe, maze bukeye bwaho Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yongera manda ye amezi atatu.\nKu wa 19 Mutarama 2017, Barrow yarahiriye kuba Perezida muri ambasade ya Gambiya i Dakar. Uwo munsi, ingabo za Senegali, Nijeriya na Gana zinjiye muri Gambiya mu gikorwa cya gisirikare cya CEDEAO kugira ngo zihatire Jammeh kuva ku butegetsi; ingabo za Gambiya ntizabarwanyije. Nyuma y'ubuhuza bwa Alpha Cond\u00e9 wa Gineya na Mohamed Ould Abdel Aziz wa Moritaniya, Jammeh yemeye kuva ku butegetsi, ahunga igihugu ku wa 21 Mutarama 2017, ajya muri Gineya hanyuma muri Gineya Ekwatoriyale. Barrow yagarutse muri Gambiya ku wa 26 Mutarama 2017, maze ku wa 18 Gashyantare 2017 yongera kurahira muri Gambiya, muri sitade y'Ubwigenge i Bakau.\nPerezida wa Gambiya.\nManda ya mbere.\nKu wa 23 Mutarama 2017, yagize Fatoumata Tambajang Visi-perezida. Yatangaje ko izina rirambuye ry'igihugu risubira kuba \"Repubulika ya Gambiya\" aho kuba \"Repubulika ya Kisilamu ya Gambiya\", nk'uko Jammeh yari yarabihinduye mu 2015. Mu ijambo rye ryo kurahira, yategetse ko imfungwa zose zafunzwe nta rubanza ku butegetsi bwa Jammeh zirekurwa; imfungwa 171 zo muri gereza ya Mile 2 zararekuwe. Yahagaritse icyemezo cyo kuva mu Rukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga, maze Minisitiri w'Ubutabera Ba Tambadou atangaza ishyirwaho rya Komisiyo y'Ukuri, Ubwiyunge n'Indishyi ku bahohotewe ku butegetsi bwa Jammeh. Yahinduye kandi urwego rw'iperereza rw'igihugu (NIA) rwari ruzwiho guhohotera abantu.\nKu wa 10 Gashyantare 2017, yarokotse umugambi wo kumwica ubwo yari mu isengesho mu musigiti wa King Fahd i Banjul. Ku wa 6 Mata 2017, ihuriro rye ryatsinze amatora y'abadepite. Ku wa 21 Nzeri 2017, yasinye amasezerano mpuzamahanga avanaho igihano cy'urupfu. Ku wa 8 Gashyantare 2018, Gambiya yasubiye mu Muryango wa Commonwealth.\nImyigaragambyo ya \"Three Years Jotna\".\nNubwo yari yasezeranyije kuva ku butegetsi nyuma y'imyaka itatu, yaje kwisubiraho, avuga ko Itegeko Nshinga rimusaba kurangiza manda y'imyaka itanu. Mu 2019 no mu ntangiriro za 2020, habaye imyigaragambyo ikomeye yiswe \"Three Years Jotna\" (\"Imyaka itatu irahagije\"), imusaba kuva ku butegetsi; guverinoma yayibujije, abantu amagana barafungwa, abandi batatu barapfa.\nKu wa 15 Gashyantare 2019, yirukanye Visi-perezida Ousainou Darboe n'abaminisitiri benshi ba UDP, maze nyuma y'amezi icumi ashinga ishyaka rye, \"National People's Party\" (NPP). Umushinga w'Itegeko Nshinga rishya, wagabanyaga manda ya perezida ku ebyiri, wanzwe n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ku wa 22 Nzeri 2020, maze Barrow ashinjwa kuba ari we wateguye iryo tsindwa.\nManda ya kabiri.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, yagiranye ubufatanye n'ishyaka rya Jammeh, \"Alliance for Patriotic Reorientation and Construction\" (APRC), nubwo Jammeh ubwe yabyamaganye. Mu Ukuboza 2021, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 53 %, atangira manda ya kabiri ku wa 19 Mutarama 2022. Ku wa 21 Ukuboza 2022, guverinoma yatangaje ko yaburijemo umugambi wa kudeta, abasirikare benshi barafungwa.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAdama Barrow ni Umuyisilamu, akaba afite abagore babiri: Fatoumatta Bah, bashakanye mu 1997, akaba Madamu wa Perezida, na Sarjo Mballow. Ku wa 15 Mutarama 2017, umuhungu we Habibu w'imyaka umunani yapfuye nyuma yo kurumwa n'imbwa; Barrow ntiyabashije kujya mu muhango wo kumushyingura kuko yari ari muri Senegali. Avuga ko avanze amoko: Abasarahule, Abamandinka n'Abafula. Ashyigikira ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'Abongereza Arsenal."}
{"id": "23199", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23199", "title": "Mamadi Doumbouya", "text": "Mamadi Doumbouya (wavutse ku wa 5 Ukuboza 1984 i Kankan, muri Gineya) ni umusirikare n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyagineya, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Gineya.\nYagizwe umuyobozi w'Ingabo zidasanzwe za Gineya (\"Groupement des forces sp\u00e9ciales\") mu 2018, maze ku wa 5 Nzeri 2021 ayobora kudeta yahiritse Perezida Alpha Cond\u00e9. Yabaye Perezida w'Akanama k'igihugu gashinzwe ubumwe n'iterambere (\"Comit\u00e9 national du rassemblement pour le d\u00e9veloppement\", CNRD) na Perezida w'inzibacyuho. Nubwo yari yarasezeranyije ko abagize agatsiko k'abasirikare batazemererwa kwiyamamaza, Itegeko Nshinga rishya ryo mu 2025 ryamwemereye kwiyamamaza; yatsinze amatora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza 2025 ku majwi 86,7 %, ararahira ku wa 17 Mutarama 2026.\nUbutegetsi bwe burangwa n'ihashywa ry'abatavuga rumwe na bwo, ishimutwa n'ibura ry'abantu, iseswa ry'amashyaka n'ibitangazamakuru.\nUbuzima.\nInkomoko n'amashuri.\nMamadi Doumbouya ni umuhungu wa Karifala Doumbouya na Hadja Mandioula Sylla. Akomoka mu karere ka Kankan, umujyi wa kabiri munini muri Gineya, aho yize amashuri abanza. Itariki ye y'amavuko yagiye ivugwaho impaka: urubuga rw'ibiro bya Perezida rwabanje kuvuga ko ari ku wa 4 Werurwe 1980, mbere y'uko Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rwemeza ku wa 5 Ukuboza 1984 mu 2025.\nYabaye umusirikare mu mutwe w'Abanyamahanga w'ingabo z'Ubufaransa (\"L\u00e9gion \u00e9trang\u00e8re\") i N\u00eemes, arangiza amasezerano ye mu 2009 afite ipeti rya caporal, hanyuma mu 2012 asubira mu ngabo za Gineya. Yize mu \"\u00c9cole de guerre\" mu Bufaransa, abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu by'ingabo muri Kaminuza ya Paris-Panth\u00e9on-Assas. Yahawe kandi amahugurwa ya gisirikare muri Senegali, Gabon na Isiraheli, akorera ubutumwa muri Afuganisitani, C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, Jibuti na Repubulika ya Santara Afurika.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nKuva mu 2018, yayoboye Ingabo zidasanzwe za Gineya (GFS), umutwe w'intore z'ingabo zishinzwe kurwanya iterabwoba. Muri Gashyantare 2019, yitabiriye imyitozo ya gisirikare ya Flintlock yateguwe n'ingabo za Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika i Ouagadougou, kimwe na Assimi Go\u00efta wa Mali. Yabaye lieutenant-colonel mu 2019, koloneli mu 2020. Ku wa 24 Mutarama 2024, yagizwe \"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral de corps d'arm\u00e9e\", maze mu Ukuboza 2024 aba \"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral d'arm\u00e9e\".\nKudeta ya 2021 n'inzibacyuho.\nKu wa 5 Nzeri 2021, yatangaje ifatwa rya Perezida Alpha Cond\u00e9, iseswa rya guverinoma, ihagarikwa ry'Itegeko Nshinga, isaha ntarengwa yo kugenda (\"couvre-feu\") n'ifungwa ry'imipaka. Yavuze ko ibyo byakozwe kubera \"imiterere ya politiki n'ubukungu by'igihugu, imikorere mibi y'inzego za Repubulika, ikoreshwa nabi ry'ubutabera n'ihonyorwa ry'uburenganzira bw'abaturage\". Ku wa 1 Ukwakira 2021, yarahiriye kuba Perezida w'inzibacyuho imbere y'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga. Itegeko ry'inzibacyuho ryavugaga ko we n'abandi bagize agatsiko k'abasirikare batemerewe kwiyamamaza mu matora azakurikira.\nKu wa 6 Ukwakira 2021, yagize Mohamed B\u00e9avogui Minisitiri w'Intebe; asimburwa na Bernard Goumou muri Kanama 2022, hanyuma na Bah Oury muri Gashyantare 2024. Muri Mata 2022, yategetse amasosiyete acukura bauxite, Gineya ifitemo ububiko bunini ku isi, kubaka inganda zitunganya alumine mu gihugu.\nCEDEAO yamaganye uburebure bw'inzibacyuho, maze muri Nzeri 2022 ifatira ibihano agatsiko k'abasirikare. Mu Ukwakira 2022, Gineya na CEDEAO bumvikanye ku nzibacyuho y'imyaka ibiri itangira muri Mutarama 2023. Ariko ingengabihe ntiyubahirijwe: muri Nzeri 2024, guverinoma yatangaje ko amatora ya perezida yimuriwe mu 2025.\nItegeko Nshinga rishya n'amatora yo mu 2025.\nKu wa 21 Nzeri 2025, habaye kamarampaka ku Itegeko Nshinga rishya, ryemejwe ku majwi 89,4 %. Iryo tegeko ryongereye manda ya perezida kuva ku myaka itanu kugeza ku irindwi, rishyiraho Sena, kandi ryemerera Perezida w'inzibacyuho kwiyamamaza; abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bavuze ko habayeho uburiganya bukabije.\nKu wa 3 Ugushyingo 2025, yatanze kandidatire ye nk'umukandida wigenga. Mu matora yo ku wa 28 Ukuboza 2025, yatsinze ku majwi 86,7 %, ararahira ku wa 17 Mutarama 2026. Muri Mutarama 2026, Ubumwe bwa Afurika bwakuyeho ibihano bwari bwarafatiye Gineya nyuma ya kudeta.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nKu wa 21 Nzeri 2021, yasuye Bamako, yakirwa na Koloneli Assimi Go\u00efta. Perezida wa Siyera Lewone Julius Maada Bio ni we mukuru w'igihugu wa mbere wamusuye nyuma ya kudeta. Perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame yamusuye muri Gineya; Doumbouya yavuze ko yifuza kuvugurura no kunga igihugu cye nk'uko Kagame yabigenje mu Rwanda. Ku wa 11 Kanama 2024, yitabiriye irahira rya Paul Kagame kuri manda ya kane, maze baganira ku mubano w'ibihugu byombi mu Urugwiro Village. Ku wa 1 Gicurasi 2025, yagiriye uruzinduko rwa Leta rwa kabiri mu Rwanda, mbere yo kwitabira irahira rya Brice Clotaire Oligui Nguema muri Gabon.\nMuri Nzeri 2024, yitabiriye inama y'ubufatanye hagati y'Ubushinwa n'Afurika (FOCAC) i Beijing, ahura na Xi Jinping, amugezaho gahunda ya \"Simandou 2040\" yerekeye ikirombe kinini cy'icyuma cya Simandou.\nIhashywa ry'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi.\nKuva mu 2021, agatsiko k'abasirikare kayobowe na Doumbouya kakajije ingamba zo kubuza ubwisanzure: amashyaka n'ibitangazamakuru byarahagaritswe, imyigaragambyo yabujijwe kuva muri Gicurasi 2022 irahashywa, kandi abayobozi benshi b'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi n'aba sosiyete sivile barafashwe, barakatirwa cyangwa bahungira mu mahanga. Nk'uko Human Rights Watch ibivuga, nibura abantu 59 bishwe mu myigaragambyo hagati ya Kamena 2022 n'impera za 2024.\nKu wa 21 Gicurasi 2024, guverinoma yafunze ibitangazamakuru bitandatu byigenga bikomeye mu gihugu. Umunyamakuru Habib Marouane Camara yashimuswe ku wa 3 Ukuboza 2024 n'abajandarume i Conakry, kandi kugeza ubu ntaraboneka. Mu Ukwakira 2024, agatsiko k'abasirikare kasheshe amashyaka arenga 50, maze muri Werurwe 2026 gasesa andi mashyaka 40, harimo atatu akomeye atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi: UFDG, RPG na UFR.\nMuri Nyakanga 2024, abarwanashyaka Fonik\u00e9 Mengu\u00e8 na Mamadou Billo Bah baburiwe irengero; ku wa 22 Nyakanga 2024, imiryango yabo yareze Doumbouya mu Bufaransa ishinja \"ishimuta n'iyicarubozo\". Muri Kamena 2025, uwahoze ari umukuru w'urugaga rw'abavoka, Mohamed Traor\u00e9, yashimuswe arakubitwa. Ku wa 28 Werurwe 2025, Doumbouya yahaye imbabazi kubera impamvu z'ubuzima uwahoze ari Perezida Moussa Dadis Camara, wari warakatiwe kubera ubwicanyi bwo mu 2009 bwahitanye abantu 156.\nRuswa.\nAkigera ku butegetsi, yashyizeho Urukiko rushinzwe guhana ibyaha by'ubukungu n'imari (CRIEF). Nyamara, ubutegetsi bwe bwavuzwemo amahano y'imari: muri Nzeri 2023, byatangajwe ko ikigo cy'Abashinwa kiri mu mushinga wa Simandou cyari cyarahaye ubutegetsi bwa Conakry miliyoni 75 z'amadolari mu 2021 nta mucyo. Mu mpera za 2024, toni zirenga enye za zahabu zabuze muri Banki Nkuru ya Gineya nyuma yo kwimurirwa i Dubai mu buryo budasobanutse.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMamadi Doumbouya arubatse, akaba afite abana batandatu. Umugore we, Lauriane Doumbouya, ni Umufaransakazi akaba ari mu jandarumori y'Ubufaransa."}
{"id": "23200", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23200", "title": "Horta Inta-A Na Man", "text": "Horta Inta-A Na Man (uzwi kandi nka Horta N'Tam cyangwa N'Ta) ni umujenerali w'Umunyagineya-Biso, akaba Perezida w'inzibacyuho wa Gineya-Biso n'Umuyobozi w'Ubuyobozi Bukuru bwa Gisirikare bushinzwe kugarura umutekano w'igihugu n'ituze rusange kuva kudeta yo mu Ugushyingo 2025 yahirika Perezida Umaro Sissoco Embal\u00f3.\nUbuzima.\nHorta Inta-A Na Man yavutse mu myaka ya 1960, mu muryango wo mu bwoko bw'Ababalanta. Yize mu ishuri rya gisirikare ryo mu Bumwe bw'Abasoviyeti, kandi yambara ku mpuzankano ye ikirango cyo muri icyo gihe.\nUrugendo mu gisirikare.\nYabaye umuyobozi wa batayo y'ingabo zirinda Perezida, maze afasha kurinda Perezida Umaro Sissoco Embal\u00f3 mu mugambi wa kudeta wo muri Gashyantare 2022. Nyuma yaho, yazamuwe ku ipeti rya Jenerali wa burigade, agirwa umuyobozi w'Ingabo z'igihugu (\"Guarda Nacional\"), umwanya yamazeho kugeza muri Kamena 2023 ubwo yazamurwaga ku ipeti rya Jenerali majoro. Ku wa 1 Nzeri 2023, yagizwe umugaba mukuru w'ingabo zirwanira ku butaka, asimbura Jenerali Steve Lassana Massaly.\nKudeta ya 2025 n'inzibacyuho.\nKu wa 26 Ugushyingo 2025, Inta-A yagize uruhare muri kudeta yahiritse Perezida Umaro Sissoco Embal\u00f3, yari iyobowe na Jenerali wa burigade Dinis Incanha; hashyizweho Ubuyobozi Bukuru bwa Gisirikare bushinzwe kugarura umutekano w'igihugu n'ituze rusange, buyobowe na Incanha. Bukeye bwaho, ku wa 27 Ugushyingo 2025, Incanha yeguye, maze Inta-A agirwa Perezida w'inzibacyuho, ararahira ku cyicaro gikuru cy'ingabo i Biso. Ingabo zatangaje ko azayobora mu gihe cy'inzibacyuho cy'umwaka umwe. Iyo kudeta yamaganywe n'umuryango mpuzamahanga, cyane cyane CEDEAO.\nNk'igikorwa cye cya mbere, yagize Il\u00eddio Vieira T\u00e9, wari Minisitiri w'Imari ku butegetsi bwa Embal\u00f3, Minisitiri w'Intebe, ashyiraho guverinoma y'abantu 27. Ku wa 5 Ukuboza 2025, yatangaje ko hatazihanganirwa na gato abacuruza ibiyobyabwenge. Ku wa 22 Mutarama 2026, yasinye iteka rigena ko amatora y'abadepite n'aya perezida azaba ku wa 6 Ukuboza 2026.\nKu wa 11 Werurwe 2026, guverinoma y'inzibacyuho yashyizeho ibiciro ntarengwa by'imbuto za \"cajou\", igicuruzwa cy'ingenzi cy'igihugu. Mu mpera za Werurwe 2026, umurambo w'umurwanashyaka urwanya agatsiko k'abasirikare, Vigario Luis Balanta, wabonetse mu murima w'umuceri, bitera imyigaragambyo; abigaragambyaga bashinja agatsiko k'abasirikare urwo rupfu. Ku wa 10 Kanama 2026, yakoreye urugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga muri Cade, maze ku wa 30 Kanama 2026 atora muri kamarampaka ku Itegeko Nshinga."}
{"id": "23201", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23201", "title": "Alassane Ouattara", "text": "Alassane Dramane Ouattara (akunze kwitwa ADO; wavutse ku wa 1 Mutarama 1942 i Dimbokro, muri Kote Divuwari) ni impuguke mu bukungu n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyakote Divuwari, akaba Perezida wa Repubulika ya Kote Divuwari kuva ku wa 6 Gicurasi 2011.\nYakoreye Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari (FMI) na Banki Nkuru y'Ibihugu by'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (BCEAO), maze aba Minisitiri w'Intebe wa mbere wa Kote Divuwari kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1993. Mu 1999, yatorewe kuyobora ishyaka \"Rassemblement des r\u00e9publicains\" (RDR), ariko ntiyemererwa kwiyamamaza mu matora ya perezida yo mu 1995 no mu 2000 kubera ingingo y'\"ubunyakote Divuwari\" (\"ivoirit\u00e9\") yashyizwe mu mategeko y'amatora.\nMu matora ya perezida yo mu 2010, yatsinze ku majwi 54 % nk'uko komisiyo y'amatora n'umuryango mpuzamahanga hafi ya wose babyemeje, ariko Perezida Laurent Gbagbo yanga kuva ku butegetsi, bitera intambara yahitanye abantu bagera ku 3 000. Yatangiye imirimo nyuma y'ifatwa rya Gbagbo muri Mata 2011. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2015, 2020 na 2025.\nUbuzima.\nInkomoko n'umuryango.\nAlassane Ouattara ni Umuyisilamu wo mu bwoko bw'Abamandingue. Ni umuhungu wa Dramane Ouattara, umwarimu akaba n'umucuruzi ukize, na Hadja Nabintou Ciss\u00e9. Afite abana babiri yabyaranye n'umugore we wa mbere, Umunyamerikakazi Barbara Jean Davis. Ku wa 24 Kanama 1991, yashakanye i Paris na Dominique Nouvian, umushoramari wacungaga imitungo itimukanwa ya Perezida F\u00e9lix Houphou\u00ebt-Boigny. Murumuna we, T\u00e9n\u00e9 Birahima Ouattara, yabaye Minisitiri w'Ingabo kuva muri Werurwe 2021.\nUmwuga mu bukungu.\nAbikesheje buruse, yize muri \"Drexel Institute of Technology\" no muri Kaminuza ya Pennsylvania muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu bukungu mu 1967, hanyuma impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (doctorat) mu 1972. Mu 1968, yinjiye muri FMI nk'impuguke mu bukungu. Yakoreye kandi BCEAO, aba visi-guverineri wayo (1983\u20131984), umuyobozi w'ishami ry'Afurika muri FMI kuva mu 1984, hanyuma guverineri wa BCEAO kuva mu 1988.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nMinisitiri w'Intebe (1990\u20131993).\nKu wa 7 Ugushyingo 1990, Perezida F\u00e9lix Houphou\u00ebt-Boigny yamugize Minisitiri w'Intebe, umwanya wari umaze gushyirwaho n'ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga. Yakurikije politiki yo kugabanya amafaranga ya Leta yakomereye abaturage, ariko itunganya imari ya Leta. Ku wa 7 Ukuboza 1993, yatangaje kuri radio-televiziyo y'igihugu urupfu rwa Houphou\u00ebt-Boigny, avuga ko \"Kote Divuwari ibaye impfubyi\"; nyuma y'iminsi ibiri yeguye, Henri Konan B\u00e9di\u00e9 aba Perezida.\nIvoirit\u00e9 n'ubuhungiro.\nMuri Nyakanga 1994, yabaye Umuyobozi mukuru wungirije wa FMI, Umunyafurika wa mbere wageze kuri uwo mwanya. Mu Ukuboza 1994, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yemeje ivugurura ry'amategeko y'amatora rivuga ko nta muntu ushobora gutorerwa kuba Perezida atari Umunyakote Divuwari kavukire ufite ababyeyi bombi b'Abanyakote Divuwari kavukire. Iyo ngingo y'\"ubunyakote Divuwari\" yari igamije kubuza Ouattara kwiyamamaza, kuko abamurwanyaga bavugaga ko se akomoka muri Burukina Faso; yateje urwango rushingiye ku moko n'urugomo rwa politiki.\nKu wa 31 Nyakanga 1999, yavuye muri FMI, maze bukeye bwaho atorerwa kuyobora RDR. Mu 2000, Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rwanze kandidatire ye mu matora ya perezida, ruvuga ko ari \"uw'ubwenegihugu bushidikanywaho\"; uwo mwaka, imirambo 57 y'abakekwagaho kumushyigikira yabonetse mu cyobo rusange cya Yopougon. Ku wa 20 Nzeri 2002, nyuma y'umugambi wa kudeta w'inyeshyamba zo mu majyaruguru, yarokotse ku buryo bwa hafi igitero cy'abashyigikiye Gbagbo cyatwitse inzu ye, ahungira muri ambasade y'u Budage, hanyuma ajya mu buhungiro muri Gabon no mu Bufaransa. Muri Mata 2005, ubuhuza bwa Perezida wa Afurika y'Epfo Thabo Mbeki bwatumye Gbagbo yemera kandidatire ye; ku wa 26 Mutarama 2006, yagarutse muri Kote Divuwari.\nAmatora yo mu 2010 n'intambara.\nMu cyiciro cya mbere cy'amatora yo mu 2010, yabaye uwa kabiri ku majwi 32,1 %, inyuma ya Laurent Gbagbo (38 %), ariko mu cyiciro cya kabiri ashyigikirwa na Henri Konan B\u00e9di\u00e9. Komisiyo y'amatora yigenga yatangaje ko yatsinze ku majwi 54,1 %, ariko Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga, rwiganjemo abashyigikiye Gbagbo, rwatangaje Gbagbo nk'uwatsinze ku majwi 51,5 % nyuma yo guhagarika amajwi yo mu turere turindwi two mu majyaruguru. Umuryango mpuzamahanga hafi ya wose wasabye Gbagbo kuva ku butegetsi.\nKu wa 4 Ukuboza 2010, bombi bararahiye, Ouattara akorera mu ihoteli ya Golf i Abidjan. Ku wa 28 Werurwe 2011, ingabo zimushyigikiye, zitwaga \"Forces r\u00e9publicaines de C\u00f4te d'Ivoire\" (FRCI), zatangiye igitero gikomeye, maze ku wa 11 Mata 2011 Gbagbo n'umugore we Simone barafatwa.\nPerezida wa Kote Divuwari.\nManda ya mbere (2011\u20132015).\nKu wa 4 Gicurasi 2011, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwamwemeje nka Perezida wa Repubulika, ararahira ku wa 6 Gicurasi 2011. Yatangaje ko ashaka kugarura umutekano no kunga Abanyakote Divuwari, nyuma y'intambara yahitanye abantu bagera ku 3 000; ku wa 20 Nyakanga 2011, yashyizeho Komisiyo y'ibiganiro, ukuri n'ubwiyunge iyobowe na Charles Konan Banny. Yasabye kandi Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga gukora iperereza ku bwicanyi bwakozwe.\nNyamara, Amnesty International yamushinje kwihanganira ibikorwa byo kwihimura ku bakekwaho gushyigikira Gbagbo, mu raporo yise \"Itegeko ry'abatsinze\" mu 2013, ivuga ko nta n'umwe mu bamushyigikiye wakurikiranywe n'ubutabera ku byaha byakozwe mu ntambara. Ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2015, yahaye imbabazi imfungwa 3 100 zo mu ntambara yakurikiye amatora, maze muri Kanama 2018 aha imbabazi abantu 800, barimo Simone Gbagbo.\nAkigera ku butegetsi, yatangije gahunda yihutirwa yo kuzahura ubukungu bwari bwasubiye inyuma ho 8 %, n'ivugurura ry'urwego rwa kawa na kakawo mu 2012. Ingendo ze nyinshi mu mahanga zatumye Banki y'Isi na FMI bagabanya umwenda w'igihugu wo hanze ho miliyari 4,4 z'amadolari.\nManda ya kabiri n'iya gatatu (2015\u20132025).\nKu wa 25 Ukwakira 2015, yongeye gutorwa mu cyiciro cya mbere ku majwi 83,7 %. Mu 2017, abahoze ari inyeshyamba zo mu majyaruguru zamufashije gufata ubutegetsi mu 2011 bigometse inshuro nyinshi, basaba ibihembo.\nKu wa 5 Werurwe 2020, yatangaje ko atazongera kwiyamamaza, maze atoranya Minisitiri w'Intebe Amadou Gon Coulibaly kuba umukandida w'ishyaka RHDP. Gon Coulibaly amaze gupfa muri Nyakanga 2020, Ouattara yisubiyeho, atangaza ku wa 6 Kanama 2020 ko aziyamamariza manda ya gatatu. Iyo kandidatire yateje impaka kuko Itegeko Nshinga ryemeraga manda ebyiri gusa; Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ko manda ye ya mbere, yatangiye ku Itegeko Nshinga rya kera, itabarwa. Abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi banze kwitabira amatora, kandi abantu bagera kuri 30 bapfiriye mu mvururu. Yatsinze ku majwi 95,3 %, abitabiriye amatora bakaba 53,9 %, ararahira ku wa 14 Ukuboza 2020.\nManda ya kane (kuva 2025).\nKu wa 29 Nyakanga 2025, yatangaje ko aziyamamariza manda ya kane mu matora yo ku wa 25 Ukwakira 2025. Kandidatire z'abayobozi b'amashyaka akomeye atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Laurent Gbagbo (PPA-CI) na Tidjane Thiam (PDCI-RDA), zanzwe n'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga; bombi bamaganye \"ikinamico ry'amatora\" na \"kudeta ya gisivili\". Yatsinze ku majwi agera kuri 90 %, abitabiriye amatora bakaba 50,09 %, ararahira ku wa 8 Ukuboza 2025."}
{"id": "23202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23202", "title": "Dafroza Gauthier", "text": "Dafroza Gauthier, wavutse yitwa Dafroza Mukarumongi (4 Kanama 1954 \u2013 3 Ukwakira 2026), yari injeniyeri mu by'ubutabire akaba n'umurwanashyaka w'Umufaransakazi ukomoka mu Rwanda. Yamenyekanye cyane kubera gukurikirana abagize uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi bahungiye mu Bufaransa, kugira ngo bashyikirizwe ubutabera.\nMu 2001, we n'umugabo we Alain Gauthier bashinze ihuriro ry'abaregera indishyi ku Rwanda (\"Collectif des parties civiles pour le Rwanda\", CPCR). Ibikorwa byabo byatumye abagabo barindwi bagize uruhare muri jenoside bahamwa n'ibyaha burundu n'inkiko z'Ubufaransa. Umukwe we ni umuririmbyi akaba n'umwanditsi Ga\u00ebl Faye.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana.\nDafroza Mukarumongi yavukiye i Astrida (ubu ni Butare) ku ya 4 Kanama 1954, mu muryango w'Abatutsi b'abapasitori ukomoka mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda. Yahuye n'ihohoterwa rikiri muto: mu 1963, igihe yari afite imyaka icyenda, se yiciwe mu bwicanyi bwabereye i Gikongoro, maze we ahungira muri kiliziya ya Kibeho. Yize amashuri yisumbuye i Butare, nyuma yiga muri \"Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali\".\nUbuhunzi n'ubuzima mu Bufaransa.\nMu 1973, kubera ubwicanyi bwibasiye Abatutsi, yahunze igihugu. Yabanje kuba mu Uburundi hafi y'umujyi wa Kirundo, nyuma i Bujumbura, maze muri Nzeri 1973 ajya mu Ububiligi aho yakiriwe na musaza we, akomeza amashuri.\nMu 1975 yongeye guhura na Alain Gauthier, bari baramenyaniye i Butare aho yigishaga igifaransa. Bashyingiranwe mu 1977, ahabwa ubwenegihugu bw'Ubufaransa. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1980 batura i Reims, aho babyariye abana batatu.\nJenoside yo mu 1994.\nMu mpera za Gashyantare 1994 yasuye umuryango we i Kigali, asanga umujyi wuzuye Interahamwe n'imvugo z'urwango za Radiyo RTLM, maze nyina amusaba gusubira i Burayi. Ku ya 8 Mata 1994, nyina Suzana Mukamusoni yarasiwe imbere ya kiliziya ya Charles Lwanga i Nyamirambo; iyo nkuru yayibwiwe na Henri Blanchard. Mu gihe cya jenoside, abantu bagera kuri 80 bo mu muryango wa nyina barishwe.\nGuharanira ubutabera.\nIshingwa rya CPCR.\nMu 1996, asubiye mu Rwanda, yumvise ubuhamya bw'abarokotse maze yiyemeza kubushyikiriza umunyamategeko i Paris. Mu 2001 yakurikiranye urubanza rw'\u00abAbanyabutare bane\u00bb i Buruseli, urubanza rwa mbere rwa jenoside rwabereye mu mahanga.\nMu Gushyingo 2001, we n'umugabo we bashinze CPCR. Bajyaga mu Rwanda inshuro eshatu cyangwa enye mu mwaka gushaka ubuhamya bw'abarokotse, abahoze ari abicanyi n'imfungwa, bagakora amadosiye bashyikiriza ubutabera bw'Ubufaransa. Ni bo batanze hafi ibirego byose (bigera kuri 30) byatanzwe mu Bufaransa ku Banyarwanda bakekwaho jenoside, barimo Laurent Bucyibaruta, F\u00e9licien Kabuga, Philippe Hategekimana, Aloys Ntiwiragabo, Agathe Habyarimana, Padiri Wenceslas Munyeshyaka wa paruwasi ya Saint Famille na muganga Sosth\u00e8ne Munyemana.\nImanza.\nIshyirwaho ry'ishami ry'urukiko rw'i Paris rishinzwe ibyaha bya jenoside (2012) ryihutishije imanza. Muri Gashyantare 2014, mu rubanza rwa mbere, urwa Pascal Simbikangwa, Dafroza Gauthier yatanze ubuhamya; Simbikangwa yahamwe n'icyaha cya jenoside. Ku ya 30 Ukwakira 2024, muganga Eugene Rwamucyo, wari mu ba mbere bareze mu 2007, yakatiwe imyaka 27 y'igifungo. Kubera ibikorwa byabo, abashakanye ba Gauthier bakunze kwitwa \u00abAba-Klarsfeld b'u Rwanda\u00bb.\nKwibuka.\nYakundaga gutanga ibiganiro mu mashuri no muri kaminuza, arwanya ihakana rya jenoside. Mu Gushyingo 2017, Perezida Paul Kagame yabahaye umudari w'ishimwe w'ubucuti budasanzwe. Mu 2023, filime mbarankuru n'igitabo cy'amashusho \"Rwanda, \u00e0 la poursuite des g\u00e9nocidaires\" byavuze ku rugamba rwabo.\nUrupfu.\nDafroza Gauthier yapfuye ku ya 3 Ukwakira 2026 i Reims, afite imyaka 72, azize kanseri. Umuryango Ibuka wihanganishije umuryango we."}
{"id": "23203", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23203", "title": "Joseph Boakai", "text": "Joseph Nyuma Boakai (wavutse ku wa 30 Ugushyingo 1944 i Worsonga, mu ntara ya Lofa, muri Liberiya) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyaliberiya, akaba Perezida wa 26 wa Liberiya kuva mu 2024.\nYabaye Minisitiri w'Ubuhinzi kuva mu 1983 kugeza mu 1985, hanyuma aba Visi-perezida wa Liberiya kuva mu 2006 kugeza mu 2018 ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Ellen Johnson Sirleaf. Mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2017, yatsinzwe na George Weah, ariko mu matora yo mu 2023 aramutsinda.\nUbuzima.\nJoseph Boakai yavukiye mu mudugudu wa Worsonga uri kure, mu karere ka Foya mu ntara ya Lofa, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'igihugu hafi y'umupaka na Gineya. Ni uwo mu bwoko bw'Abakissi. Akomoka mu muryango w'abahinzi bakennye, ababyeyi be bombi batazi gusoma no kwandika. Ni umwe mu \"basangwabutaka\", si uwo mu bakomoka ku bacakara b'Abanyamerika babohowe bayoboye igihugu igihe kirekire.\nYize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye muri Siyera Lewone no muri Liberiya, hanyuma arangiza muri \"College of West Africa\" i Monrovia. Mu 1972, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri mu bucungamutungo muri Kaminuza ya Liberiya, akomereza muri Kaminuza ya Kansas muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika.\nYashakanye na Katumu Boakai, bafitanye abana bane. Ni Umubatisita, akaba umudiyakoni w'itorero Effort Baptist Church i Paynesville.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nYakoreye ikigo cya Leta gishinzwe kugurisha ibikomoka ku buhinzi (LPMC) kuva mu 1973 kugeza mu 1982. Kuva mu 1983 kugeza mu 1985, yabaye Minisitiri w'Ubuhinzi ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Samuel Doe, anayobora Ishyirahamwe ry'ibihugu 15 byo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba ry'iterambere ry'umuceri. Mu 1992, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo gitunganya peteroli (LPRC), hanyuma aba umujyanama wa Banki y'Isi i Washington.\nMu 2005, nyuma y'intambara z'abenegihugu zamaze igihe kirekire, yatorewe kuba Visi-perezida, afatanyije na Ellen Johnson Sirleaf, umugore wa mbere watorewe kuyobora igihugu cy'Afurika. Nka Visi-perezida, yayoboraga Sena, kandi yagenzuraga inzego zitandukanye, harimo n'akanama k'igihugu gashinzwe kwambura intwaro, gusezerera no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abahoze ari abarwanyi.\nMu matora ya perezida yo mu 2017, nk'umukandida wa \"Unity Party\", yageze mu cyiciro cya kabiri, ariko atsindwa n'uwahoze ari icyamamare mu mupira w'amaguru, George Weah, ku majwi 38,46 %.\nPerezida wa Liberiya.\nMu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'amatora ya perezida cyo ku wa 14 Ugushyingo 2023, yatsinze George Weah ku majwi 50,64 %. Ku wa 22 Mutarama 2024, afite imyaka 79, yarahiriye kuba Perezida, aba Perezida ukuze kurusha abandi mu mateka ya Liberiya. Mu muhango wo kurahira, ntiyabashije kurangiza ijambo rye, maze bamukura ku ruhimbi, bivugwa ko yari yagizweho ingaruka n'ubushyuhe.\nYashyize imbere kurwanya ruswa: yategetse igenzura ry'inzego zikomeye nka Banki Nkuru ya Liberiya, ahagarika abayobozi barenga 450, barimo n'abaminisitiri, kubera kutagaragaza imitungo yabo, kandi agabanya umushahara we ho 40 %. Mu mwaka we wa mbere, amanota ya Liberiya mu cyegeranyo cya Transparency International ku myumvire ya ruswa yazamutseho amanota abiri. Ku wa 5 Nyakanga 2025, yasabye imbabazi ku mugaragaro abahohotewe mu ntambara ya mbere n'iya kabiri z'abenegihugu muri Liberiya.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nPolitiki ye y'ububanyi n'amahanga yibanda kuri dipolomasi y'ubukungu, ishaka ko Liberiya iva ku kwishingikiriza ku nkunga ikajya ku bufatanye bushingiye ku bucuruzi n'ishoramari. Ku wa 9 Nyakanga 2025, yahuriye i Washington na Perezida Donald Trump, amusaba ko Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika zashora imari muri Liberiya. Muri Kamena 2025, Liberiya yatorewe kuba umunyamuryango udahoraho w'Akanama gashinzwe umutekano ku isi ka Loni mu gihe cya 2026\u20132027."}
{"id": "23204", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23204", "title": "Mohamed el-Menfi", "text": "Mohamed Yunus el-Menfi (mu Cyarabu: \u0645\u062d\u0645\u062f \u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0641\u064a; wavutse ku wa 3 Werurwe 1976) ni umudipolomate n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyalibiya, akaba Perezida w'Inama ya Perezidansi ya Libiya (\"Presidential Council\"), urwego ruhuriweho rukora nk'ubuyobozi bukuru bw'igihugu, kuva mu 2021.\nKu wa 5 Gashyantare 2021, yatorewe kuyobora iyo Nama mu Ihuriro ry'Ibiganiro bya Politiki rya Libiya (\"Libyan Political Dialogue Forum\") ryateguwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Asimbura Fayez el-Sarraj ku wa 15 Werurwe 2021. Mbere yaho, yari ambasaderi wa Libiya mu Ubugereki.\nAmbasaderi mu Bugereki.\nMu 2018, yagizwe ambasaderi wa Libiya mu Bugereki. Igihe yari i Atene cyaranzwe n'umubano mubi hagati ya guverinoma y'ubumwe bw'igihugu ya Libiya (GNA) na guverinoma y'u Bugereki, kubera amasezerano yasinywe hagati ya Libiya na Turukiya ku mipaka yo mu nyanja, ari na yo ntandaro y'amakimbirane amaze igihe kirekire hagati ya Turukiya n'u Bugereki ku burenganzira bwo gucukura mu Nyanja ya Mediterane. Mu Ukuboza 2019, yirukanywe mu Bugereki.\nPerezida w'Inama ya Perezidansi.\nMu buryo bwo guhitamo ubuyobozi bukuru buhuriweho bwagombaga kuyobora igihugu kugeza ku matora rusange yari ateganyijwe ku wa 24 Ukuboza 2021, el-Menfi yiyamamaje ku rutonde rumwe na Abdul Hamid Dbeibeh ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Intebe, hamwe na Musa Al-Koni na Abdullah al-Lafi nk'abagize Inama ya Perezidansi. Urutonde rwabo rwabonye amajwi 39, atanu arenga ay'urutonde rwa Aguila Saleh Issa na Fathi Bashagha. Ambasaderi wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika yahakanye ko hari ibikorwa byo kugira icyo bihindura ku matora yo kurwanya el-Menfi. Ayo matora rusange ntiyigeze aba, kandi igihugu gikomeza gucikamo ibice hagati y'ubutegetsi bwa Tripoli mu burengerazuba n'ubwa Khalifa Haftar mu burasirazuba.\nIkibazo cya Banki Nkuru yo mu 2024.\nMuri Kanama 2024, el-Menfi yakuye ku mwanya guverineri wa Banki Nkuru ya Libiya, Sadiq Al-Kabir, icyemezo cyateje impaka. Nyuma y'ukwezi, mu kiganiro cye cya mbere n'abanyamakuru bo mu Burengerazuba, yavuze ko Al-Kabir yacungaga nabi imari ya banki \"nta buryo bwo kubazwa inshingano\", kandi ko \"yakoreshaga amacakubiri\" hagati y'uburasirazuba n'uburengerazuba bwa Libiya.\nKu wa 25 Nzeri 2024, ubutegetsi bwa Tripoli n'ubwa Tobruk bushyigikiwe na Haftar bumvikanye ku guverineri w'agateganyo n'akanama gashinzwe imari ka banki, amasezerano yafashijwemo n'ubutumwa bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye muri Libiya; el-Menfi yavuze ko ayo masezerano yarinze umurwa mukuru Tripoli \"intambara yari kwibasira banki nkuru mu buryo butaziguye\". Muri uwo mwaka, mu nama rusange y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye i New York, yasinyanye n'Urugaga rw'Ubucuruzi rw'Abanyamerika muri Libiya amasezerano yo gushyigikira iterambere rirambye ry'ubukungu n'uruhare rw'amasosiyete y'Abanyamerika ku isoko rya Libiya."}
{"id": "23205", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23205", "title": "Micha\u00ebl Randrianirina", "text": "Micha\u00ebl Randrianirina (yavukiye i Sevohipoty, hafi ya Ambovombe, mu karere ka Androy mu majyepfo ya Madagasikari) ni umusirikare mukuru n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyamadagasikari, akaba Perezida wa Madagasikari kuva mu Ukwakira 2025 n'umuyobozi w'Inama ya Perezidansi ishinzwe kongera kubaka Repubulika ya Madagasikari (\"Refondation\"). Itariki ye y'amavuko ntivugwaho rumwe: bimwe mu bitangazamakuru bivuga ku wa 23 Kanama 1973, abandi bakavuga mu 1974.\nYabaye guverineri w'akarere ka Androy kuva mu 2016 kugeza mu 2018, hanyuma aba umuyobozi w'umutwe w'intore z'ingabo CAPSAT. Nk'umuyobozi wa CAPSAT, yabaye umuntu w'ingenzi mu myigaragambyo y'urubyiruko (\"Generation Z\") yo mu Ukwakira 2025, yatumye Perezida Andry Rajoelina ahunga igihugu kandi Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ikamukura ku butegetsi. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida imbere y'Urukiko Rukuru rurinda Itegeko Nshinga ku wa 17 Ukwakira 2025, nubwo ahakana ko habayeho kudeta.\nUbuzima n'urugendo mu gisirikare.\nMicha\u00ebl Randrianirina yahawe amahugurwa ya gisirikare mu Ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Antsirabe (ACMIL). Kuva mu 2016 kugeza mu 2018, ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Hery Rajaonarimampianina, yabaye guverineri w'akarere ka Androy. Nyuma yaho, yabaye umuyobozi wa batayo y'ingabo zirwanira ku butaka i Toliara kugeza muri Nyakanga 2022, hanyuma ayobora umutwe w'intore CAPSAT (\"Corps d'arm\u00e9e des personnels et des services administratifs et techniques\").\nBuhoro buhoro, yabaye umwe mu banenga Perezida Andry Rajoelina. Ku wa 27 Ugushyingo 2023, yafashwe ashinjwa \"gushishikariza abasirikare kwigomeka no kugerageza gukora kudeta\", ajyanwa muri gereza ya Tsiafahy. Muri Gashyantare 2024, yararekuwe nyuma yo gukatirwa igihano gisubitse azira guhungabanya umutekano w'igihugu, maze asubira muri CAPSAT.\nIkibazo cya politiki cyo mu 2025.\nKuva ku wa 25 Nzeri 2025, imyigaragambyo y'urubyiruko yiswe iya \"Generation Z\" yatangiriye i Antananarivo, ibanza kwamagana ibura rya hato na hato ry'amashanyarazi n'amazi, hanyuma yamagana ruswa, ubuzima buhenze n'ubukene, isaba ko Perezida Rajoelina yegura.\nMu mpera z'icyumweru cyo ku wa 11\u201312 Ukwakira 2025, Koloneli Randrianirina n'abasirikare ba CAPSAT bavuye mu bigo byabo bajya kwifatanya n'abigaragambya, batangaza ko banze kurasa abaturage. Uwo mutwe wari warigeze no kugira uruhare rukomeye muri kudeta yo mu 2009 yazanye Rajoelina ku butegetsi. Ku wa 13 Ukwakira, CAPSAT yatangaje ko ifashe ubuyobozi bw'ingabo zose. Rajoelina yahunze igihugu ku wa 12 Ukwakira, bivugwa ko yatwawe n'indege ya gisirikare y'Abafaransa, maze ku wa 14 Ukwakira Inteko Ishinga Amategeko imukura ku butegetsi ku majwi 130. Randrianirina yahakanye ko habayeho kudeta, avuga ko ingabo \"zasubije gusa ku guhamagarwa n'abaturage b'Abanyamadagasikari\".\nPerezida wa Madagasikari.\nGufata ubutegetsi.\nKu wa 14 Ukwakira 2025, yatangaje ko ingabo zifashe ubutegetsi, zishyiraho Inama ya Perezidansi igizwe n'abasirikare n'abajandarume, zihagarika Itegeko Nshinga, Sena n'Urukiko Rukuru rurinda Itegeko Nshinga, ariko Inteko Ishinga Amategeko igakomeza imirimo. Uwo munsi, Urukiko Rukuru rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwamusabye gukora imirimo y'umukuru w'igihugu. Ku wa 16 Ukwakira, yisubiyeho ku iseswa rya Sena n'urwo Rukiko, maze ku wa 17 Ukwakira 2025 ararahira nka \"Perezida w'Ivugurura rya Repubulika ya Madagasikari\". Mu ijambo rye, yavuze ko ari \"ihinduka ry'amateka\" kandi yiyemeje \"gutandukana n'ibya kera\".\nKubera umwanya we w'umukuru w'igihugu, yagombaga no kuyobora Umuryango w'Iterambere wa Afurika y'Amajyepfo (SADC), ariko ku wa 1 Ugushyingo 2025 guverinoma ye yatangaje ko iretse uwo mwanya; ku wa 7 Ugushyingo, Perezida wa Afurika y\u2019Epfo Cyril Ramaphosa yawuhawe by'agateganyo.\nUbuyobozi.\nKu wa 20 Ukwakira 2025, yagize umucuruzi Herintsalama Rajaonarivelo Minisitiri w'Intebe. Mu kiganiro na \"Sky News\" ku wa 10 Ugushyingo, yasezeranyije amatora mu mezi 18 kugeza kuri 24 nyuma y'igihe cy'\"ivugurura n'isanamitima\", avuga ko azegura niba abaturage batakimushyigikiye. Ku wa 17 Ugushyingo 2025, yatangaje ibiganiro by'igihugu byose biyobowe n'Inama y'Amatorero ya Gikirisitu muri Madagasikari, kugira ngo hashyirweho uburyo bushya bw'imiyoborere, bikurikirwe na kamarampaka n'amatora ya perezida mu myaka ibiri; yasezeranyije kandi ishyirwaho ry'Inteko y'Urubyiruko.\nKu wa 12 Gashyantare 2026, yasuye Toamasina kureba ibyangijwe na serwakira Gezani. Ku wa 9 Werurwe 2026, yasheshe guverinoma ya Rajaonarivelo, nyuma y'imyigaragambyo y'imiryango y'urubyiruko yasabaga ko Minisitiri w'Intebe agenda, maze ku wa 15 Werurwe agira Mamitiana Rajaonarison Minisitiri w'Intebe. Yatangaje ko abifuza kuba abaminisitiri bazajya babanza gupimwa n'imashini isuzuma ibinyoma kugira ngo harwanywe ruswa.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2026, yatangaje ko Madagasikari ishaka kuba umufatanyabikorwa w'ihuriro BRICS. Ku wa 19 Gashyantare 2026, yahuriye i Kremlin na Perezida w'Uburusiya Vladimir Putin, rukaba rwari urugendo rwe rwa mbere hanze y'Afurika. Ku wa 24 Gashyantare 2026, yakiriwe na Perezida Emmanuel Macron mu ngoro y'\u00c9lys\u00e9e i Paris.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNi umuyoboke ukomeye w'Itorero ry'Abaluteri rya Madagasikari, aho afite icyiciro cya \"Mpiandry\", umulayiki uhabwa inshingano z'ubudiyakoni. Yashakanye na Elisa Randrianirina."}
{"id": "23206", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23206", "title": "Peter Mutharika", "text": "Arthur Peter Mutharika (wavutse ku wa 18 Nyakanga 1940) ni umunyamategeko n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyamalawi, akaba Perezida wa Malawi kuva mu 2025. Yari yarabaye Perezida wa gatanu wa Malawi kuva mu 2014 kugeza mu 2020. Ni murumuna wa Perezida wa gatatu wa Malawi, Bingu wa Mutharika, kandi ayobora ishyaka \"Democratic Progressive Party\" (DPP) kuva mu 2012.\nNi umwarimu w'amategeko, inzobere mu mategeko mpuzamahanga y'ubukungu, amategeko mpuzamahanga n'amategeko nshinga agereranywa; yamaze imyaka igera kuri 30 aba muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Yatsinze amatora ya perezida yo mu 2014, ariko mu 2020 atsindwa na Lazarus Chakwera nyuma y'iseswa ry'amatora yo mu 2019 kubera amakosa. Mu 2025, afite imyaka 85, yongeye gutsinda Chakwera, aba Perezida wa Malawi ukuze kurusha abandi wagiye ku butegetsi akaba n'uwa mbere wayoboye manda ebyiri zidakurikiranye.\nUbuzima n'amashuri.\nPeter Mutharika yavukiye mu karere ka Thyolo; ababyeyi be bari abarimu. Ibindi bitangazamakuru bivuga ko yavukiye i Zomba. Yize mu ishuri ribanza rya Mulanje Mission no mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Dedza. Mu 1965, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri mu mategeko muri Kaminuza ya Londres, hanyuma muri Kaminuza ya Yale abona iy'icyiciro cya gatatu mu 1966 n'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu 1969. Kuva mu 1971, yemerewe gukora umwuga w'ubwunganizi muri Tanzaniya.\nUmwuga mu mategeko.\nYigishije muri Kaminuza ya Dar es Salaam (Tanzaniya), Kaminuza ya Haile Selassie (Etiyopiya), Kaminuza ya Rutgers (Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika), muri Kaminuza ya Makerere (Uganda), ndetse amara imyaka 37 yigisha muri Kaminuza ya Washington i Saint-Louis. Yabaye kandi umushakashatsi watumiwe muri \"London School of Economics\" n'umujyanama mu gikorwa cy'Urugaga rw'Abavoka b'Abanyamerika ku butegetsi bugendera ku mategeko muri Afurika. Muri Kanama 2011, yeguye ku mwanya w'umukemurampaka mu manza ebyiri z'Ikigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe gukemura amakimbirane ajyanye n'ishoramari (ICSID) zerekeye Zimbabwe, kubera impungenge ku kutabogama kwe zatewe n'umubano wa hafi wa murumuna we Bingu na guverinoma ya Robert Mugabe.\nUrugendo muri politiki.\nKuva mu 2004, yabaye umujyanama wa mukuru we Perezida Bingu wa Mutharika ku bibazo by'ububanyi n'amahanga n'iby'imbere mu gihugu, kugeza apfuye ku wa 5 Mata 2012. Muri Gicurasi 2009, yatorewe kuba umudepite, maze aba Minisitiri w'Ubutabera, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Uburezi, Ubumenyi n'Ikoranabuhanga, naho kuva muri Nzeri 2011 aba Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga. Muri Kanama 2011, inama nkuru y'ishyaka DPP yamutoranyije kuba umukandida waryo mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2014.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwa Bingu mu 2012, yashinjwe kugerageza guhisha urwo rupfu no kubuza Visi-perezida Joyce Banda kumusimbura nk'uko Itegeko Nshinga ribiteganya; Banda yabaye Perezida ashyigikiwe n'ingabo. Habayeho kandi impaka ku bwenegihugu bwe, kuko Malawi itemera ubwenegihugu bubiri; ambasade ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika yemeje ko atari umwenegihugu w'Amerika, ahubwo afite gusa uruhushya rwo kuhatura (\"Green card\").\nPerezida wa Malawi.\nManda ya mbere (2014\u20132020).\nKu wa 24 Gicurasi 2014, Perezida Joyce Banda yashatse guhagarika amatora yo ku wa 20 Gicurasi, avuga ko habayemo uburiganya, ariko Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rumusaba kutivanga mu matora; ku wa 31 Gicurasi 2014, yemeye ko yatsinzwe, maze Mutharika ararahira uwo munsi i Blantyre. Manda ye yaranzwe n'izamuka ry'ubukungu, aho izamuka ry'ibiciro ryavuye kuri 24 % mu 2014 rikagera munsi ya 10 % mu 2019, ariko kandi n'uburakari bw'abaturage kubera ruswa, ibura ry'ibiribwa n'ibura ry'amashanyarazi; mu 2018, abantu ibihumbi bigaragambije bamagana ruswa. Ubwe yashinjwe kwakira amadolari arenga 200 000 y'umucuruzi wari watsindiye isoko rya polisi.\nMu matora ya perezida yo mu 2019, yatangajwe ko yatsinze ku majwi 38,6 %, imbere ya Lazarus Chakwera (35,4 %), wavuze ko habayeho uburiganya. Ku wa 3 Gashyantare 2020, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwasheshe ayo matora, rutegeka ko asubirwamo; abamurwanyaga bamwita \"Perezida Tipp-Ex\". Mu matora yasubiwemo ku wa 23 Kamena 2020, yatsinzwe na Chakwera washyigikiwe n'ihuriro ry'amashyaka icyenda (Tonse Alliance), wabonye 59,3 % kuri 39,9 %.\nHagati ya manda zombi.\nMuri Kanama 2020, Komisiyo yo kurwanya ruswa ya Malawi yafatiriye konti z'amabanki ze n'iz'umugore we, mu iperereza ku itumizwa rya sima ifite agaciro ka miliyari 5 za kwacha nta misoro. Muri Mutarama 2021, Urukiko Rukuru rwanze icyifuzo cye cyo gukuraho iryo fatira.\nManda ya kabiri (kuva 2025).\nMuri Kanama 2024, DPP yamutoranyije kuba umukandida mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2025. Ku wa 16 Nzeri 2025, yatsinze ku majwi 56,8 %, imbere ya Perezida wari uriho Lazarus Chakwera (33 %). Ku wa 4 Ukwakira 2025, afite imyaka 85, yarahiriye manda ya kabiri muri sitade Kamuzu i Blantyre.\nKu wa 21 Ukwakira 2025, yatangaje ko amafaranga y'ishuri mu mashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye azakurwaho guhera muri Mutarama 2026, uretse ku mashuri y'abacumbikirwa. Guverinoma ye yaguze toni 200 000 z'ibigori muri Zambiya kugira ngo igaburire abantu barenga miliyoni enye bafite ikibazo cy'inzara, kandi ku wa 23 Ukwakira itangaza ko izabuza kohereza mu mahanga amabuye y'agaciro atatunganyijwe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAfite abakobwa babiri, Moyenda na Monique, n'umuhungu umwe, Mahopela, yabyaranye n'umugore we wa mbere, Christophine, wapfuye azize kanseri ku wa 1 Mutarama 1990. Ku wa 21 Kamena 2014, yashakanye na Gertrude Maseko, umudepite. Ni umuyoboke w'Itorero rya Presbyt\u00e9riens."}
{"id": "23207", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23207", "title": "Mohamed Ould Ghazouani", "text": "Mohamed Ould Ghazouani (izina ryuzuye: \"Mohamed Ould Cheikh Mohamed Ahmed Ould Ghazouani\"; yavutse ku ya 31 Ukuboza 1956 i Boumdeid, mu ntara ya Assaba) ni umusirikare mukuru akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Moritaniya, Perezida wa cyenda w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 1 Kanama 2019. Mbere yo kuba perezida, yabaye umugaba mukuru w'ingabo (2008\u20132018) na Minisitiri w'Ingabo (2018\u20132019). Itorwa rye mu 2019 ryabaye ihererekanyabubasha rya mbere mu mahoro hagati y'abaperezida batowe muri Moritaniya kuva yabona ubwigenge. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2024, kandi yayoboye Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe kuva muri Gashyantare 2024 kugeza muri Gashyantare 2025.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nGhazouani yavukiye i Boumdeid, mu ntara ya Assaba, mu muryango w'Abasufi. Ni umuhungu w'umuyobozi w'iyobokamana w'ubwoko bw'Ideiboussat. Amakuru amwe avuga ko yavutse ku ya 4 Ukuboza 1956. Bivugwa ko yafashe mu mutwe Korowani yose.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye (\"baccalaur\u00e9at\") mu 1977 i Rosso, maze yinjira mu gisirikare mu 1978. Yize mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Mekn\u00e8s muri Maroke, nyuma abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu bumenyi bw'ubuyobozi n'ubwa gisirikare.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nKuva mu 1987 kugeza mu 1991, yabaye umusirikare wungirije (\"aide de camp\") wa Perezida Maaouiya Ould Sid'Ahmed Taya. Yahawe amahugurwa y'ingabo zigendera ku modoka z'intambara muri Iraki, ayobora batayo y'ibifaru, nyuma ayobora ishami ry'ubutasi bwa gisirikare (\"Deuxi\u00e8me bureau\").\nGhazouani yari umwe mu basirikare bakuru bagize akanama ka gisirikare kahiritse Taya ku butegetsi mu 2005, ndetse n'abahiritse Perezida Sidi Ould Cheikh Abdallahi mu 2008, bayobowe na mugenzi we Mohamed Ould Abdel Aziz. Ku ya 6 Kanama 2008, yagizwe umugaba mukuru w'ingabo, nyuma aba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'urwego rw'umutekano w'igihugu (\"S\u00fbret\u00e9 nationale\"). Azwiho uruhare rukomeye mu guhangana n'umutwe w'iterabwoba wa Al-Qa\u00efda mu Majyaruguru ya Afurika (AQMI).\nMu Ukwakira 2018, Perezida Abdel Aziz yamugize Minisitiri w'Ingabo.\nPerezida wa Moritaniya.\nAmatora ya 2019.\nKu ya 1 Werurwe 2019, Ghazouani yatangaje ko aziyamamariza umwanya wa perezida, ashyigikiwe n'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi ; ku ya 15 Werurwe yeguye ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Ingabo. Mu matora yo ku ya 22 Kamena 2019, yatsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 52,01%, akurikirwa na Biram Dah Abeid wagize 18,59%. Yarahiriye kuyobora igihugu ku ya 1 Kanama 2019.\nIryo hererekanyabubasha ryafashwe nk'iry'amateka, kuko ryari irya mbere mu mahoro hagati y'abaperezida babiri batowe kuva Moritaniya yabona ubwigenge mu 1960. Abakuru b'ibihugu cumi n'umwe bitabiriye umuhango w'irahira rye.\nManda ya mbere.\nGhazouani yavuguruye urwego rw'ubutasi (GSI) kandi afata ubuyobozi bw'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi. Yatandukanye n'imiyoborere ya mbere ye, atangiza ibiganiro n'imiryango itegamiye kuri leta ndetse n'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi ; ndetse Biram Dah Abeid ubwe yashimye iyo nzira. Yashyize imbere ubumwe bw'Abanyamoritaniya.\nUmubano we na Mohamed Ould Abdel Aziz warazambye: mu 2020, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yatangije iperereza ku micungire y'umutungo wa leta ku butegetsi bwa Abdel Aziz, maze uwo wahoze ari perezida akatirwa n'urukiko mu Ukuboza 2023.\nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, Moritaniya iyobowe na Ghazouani ifatwa nk'umufatanyabikorwa w'ingenzi w'ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba mu kurwanya iterabwoba mu karere ka Sahel; kuva mu 2011, nta gitero cy'iterabwoba cyabaye ku butaka bwayo. Imbere mu gihugu, ubutegetsi bwe bwatangije gahunda y'ubwishingizi bw'indwara kuri bose. Yanishyuye ikiguzi cyo kuvuza umuhanzikazi Salka Mint Sneid.\nKuva muri Gashyantare 2024 kugeza muri Gashyantare 2025, Ghazouani yabaye umuyobozi w'Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe.\nManda ya kabiri.\nMuri Mata 2024, yatangaje ko aziyamamariza manda ya kabiri. Mu matora yo ku ya 29 Kamena 2024, yatsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 56,1%, nk'uko byatangajwe ku ya 1 Nyakanga 2024, maze yongera kurahira ku ya 1 Kanama 2024.\nMu Ukwakira 2024, yitabiriye inama y'ibihugu bya BRICS yabereye i Kazan mu Uburusiya, ahahurira na Perezida Vladimir Putin. Muri Nyakanga 2025, yakiriwe muri White House mu nama yahuje Perezida Donald Trump n'abakuru b'ibihugu bimwe bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba.\nUbuzima bwite.\nGhazouani akomoka mu muryango w'Abasufi kandi akurikira umurongo wa Maliki mu idini rya Isilamu. Yashakanye na Mariem Mint Mohamed Fadel Ould Dah, umuganga w'amenyo mu gisirikare ; bafitanye abana batandatu. Umugore we azwiho guharanira uburenganzira bw'abana bafite indwara ya \"autisme\", cyane cyane binyuze mu kigo Centre Zayed."}
{"id": "23208", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23208", "title": "Dharam Gokhool", "text": "Dharambeer Gokhool, uzwi cyane nka Dharam Gokhool (yavutse ku ya 25 Ukwakira 1949 i Plaine des Roches), ni umwarimu wa kaminuza akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Morise, Perezida wa munani wa Repubulika ya Morise kuva mu Ukuboza 2024. Umwe mu bayoboke b'Ishyaka ry'Abakozi (\"Parti travailliste\"), yabaye umudepite, umuyobozi w'umujyi wa Vacoas-Ph\u0153nix, Minisitiri w'Uburezi (2005\u20132008) na Minisitiri w'Inganda, Ubumenyi n'Ubushakashatsi (2008\u20132010). Yatowe n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ku bwumvikane bwa bose ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2024.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nGokhool yavutse ku ya 25 Ukwakira 1949 mu mudugudu wa Plaine des Roches, muri Morise, mu muryango w'Abahindu. Se, Manilall Gokhool, yari umukozi usanzwe, naho nyina, Koshila Gokhool, yitaga ku rugo. Yakuriye mu muryango w'abakozi bo mu cyaro, ariko umuryango we umutera inkunga yo kwiga.\nYize mu ishuri rya leta rya Roches Noires, aho yafatwaga nk'umunyeshuri w'indashyikirwa, hanyuma mu ishuri rya leta rya Mapou. Mu 1975, yarangije amasomo muri Kaminuza ya Delhi mu Ubuhinde, maze agaruka muri Morise. Yabaye umwarimu muri Kaminuza ya Morise, ahabwa imyanya itandukanye irimo iy'umwarimu wungirije (\"associate professor\") n'umuyobozi (\"dean\") w'ishami ry'amategeko n'imiyoborere. Leta y'Ubufaransa yamugize \"officier\" mu Rutonde rw'icyubahiro witwa \"Palmes acad\u00e9miques\".\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nGokhool yatangiye umwuga wa politiki mu 1976. Mu 1980, yinjiye mu ishyaka rya Mouvement militant mauricien (MMM). Mu 1982, yatorewe kuba umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ku rutonde rw'ihuriro rya MMM n'Ishyaka rya Gisosiyalisiti rya Morise (PSM), ryatsinze amatora uwo mwaka ku bwiganze busesuye. Nyuma y'icikamo ry'ihuriro rya MMM na PSM, Gokhool yagumye muri MMM, ariko atsindwa mu matora ya 1983 mu ntara y'itora ya Piton-Rivi\u00e8re-du-Rempart. Mu 1991, yagarutse mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ku rutonde rw'ihuriro rya MMM na Mouvement socialiste militant (MSM); ariko muri iyo manda, yimukiye mu Ishyaka ry'Abakozi.\nKuva mu 1991 kugeza mu 1993, yabaye umuyobozi (\"maire\") w'umujyi wa Vacoas-Ph\u0153nix. Kuva mu 1993 kugeza mu 1994, yabaye umunyamabanga wihariye w'inteko (\"parliamentary private secretary\"). Mu Ishyaka ry'Abakozi, yabaye umunyamabanga ushinzwe ubuyobozi mu 2003, hanyuma umunyamabanga mukuru kuva mu 2004 kugeza mu 2005.\nMuri guverinoma ya kabiri ya Minisitiri w'Intebe Navin Ramgoolam, Gokhool yabaye Minisitiri w'Uburezi kuva mu 2005 kugeza mu 2008, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Inganda, Ubumenyi n'Ubushakashatsi kuva mu 2008 kugeza mu 2010. Nyuma y'amatora ya 2014, yiyamamarije kuba visi-perezida, ariko ntiyatorwa.\nPerezida wa Morise.\nKu ya 6 Ukuboza 2024, nyuma y'irangira rya manda ya Prithvirajsing Roopun, Gokhool yatowe n'abagize Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ku bwumvikane bwa bose ngo abe Perezida wa munani wa Repubulika ya Morise, kuri manda y'imyaka itanu. Iryo tora ryaturutse ku bwumvikane hagati y'imitwe ya politiki ikomeye mu Nteko, kandi ryagaragaje isura ye nk'umuntu uhuza bose, wemerwa n'impande zose za politiki.\nMuri Morise, umwanya wa perezida ahanini ni uw'icyubahiro n'uwo kurinda Itegeko Nshinga, kuko ububasha nyubahirizategeko buri mu maboko ya Minisitiri w'Intebe n'Inama y'Abaminisitiri. Gokhool yashyize imbere uburezi, ubumwe n'uburinganire, yiyemeza kuba umurinzi w'Itegeko Nshinga n'ikimenyetso cy'ubumwe bw'Abanyamorise bose. Yarahiriye kuyobora igihugu ku ya 7 Ukuboza 2024 mu ngoro ya State House i R\u00e9duit, mu muhango witabiriwe na Minisitiri w'Intebe, abagize guverinoma, abayobozi b'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi n'abahagarariye imiryango itandukanye; yahawe kandi impeta y'icyubahiro ya \"Grand Commander of the Order of the Star and Key of the Indian Ocean\" (GCSK). Muri iyo nama imwe y'Inteko, Robert Hungley yatorewe kuba visi-perezida we.\nKu ya 11 Werurwe 2025, Gokhool yakiriye Minisitiri w'Intebe w'Ubuhinde, Narendra Modi, mu rugendo rw'akazi muri Morise. Mu muhango wabereye i Port-Louis, yahaye Modi impeta y'icyubahiro ya GCSK, icyubahiro gisumba ibindi gihabwa abasivili muri Morise, amushimira uruhare rwe mu gushimangira umubano w'ibihugu byombi. Muri urwo ruzinduko, Modi yasuye State House, aho Gokhool yamweretse ubusitani bw'ibimera bivura bya \"Ayurveda\"."}
{"id": "23209", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23209", "title": "Daniel Chapo", "text": "Daniel Francisco Chapo (yavutse ku ya 6 Mutarama 1977 i Inhaminga) ni umunyamategeko akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Mozambike, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 15 Mutarama 2025. Umuyoboke w'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi rya FRELIMO, yabaye guverineri w'intara ya Inhambane kuva mu 2016 kugeza mu 2024, hanyuma aba umunyamabanga mukuru w'iryo shyaka n'umukandida waryo mu matora ya perezida ya 2024. Ni we mukandida wa mbere wa FRELIMO ku mwanya wa perezida wavutse nyuma y'ubwigenge bwa Mozambike mu 1975. Itsinzi ye mu matora ya 2024 yanenzwe cyane n'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, kandi yakurikiwe n'imyigaragambyo yahitanye abantu benshi.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nChapo yavutse ku ya 6 Mutarama 1977 i Inhaminga, mu ntara ya Sofala. Yize amashuri abanza i Inhaminga (1982\u20131985) no mu karere ka Dondo (1986\u20131987), amashuri yisumbuye mu karere ka Dondo (1988\u20131996), hanyuma mu ishuri ryisumbuye Samora Machel i Beira (1997\u20131998). Yize amategeko muri Kaminuza Eduardo Mondlane i Maputo, ayirangiza mu 2000. Mu 2004, yabaye noteri. Mu 2014, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu micungire y'iterambere muri Kaminuza Gatolika ya Mozambike.\nKuva mu 1997 kugeza mu 1998, yari umunyamakuru kuri Radiyo Miramar i Beira, hanyuma kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2004 asoma amakuru kuri Televiziyo Miramar mu murwa mukuru. Mu 2005, yagizwe umubitsi w'impapuro z'ubutaka (\"conservateur\") i Nacala-Porto. Yimenyereje umwuga mu rugaga rw'abavoka (2007\u20132008), kandi mu 2009 yigishije ubumenyi bwa politiki n'amategeko nshinga muri Kaminuza Nderabarezi ya Maputo.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nChapo yinjiye muri politiki mu ishyaka rya FRELIMO mu 2009, ubwo yagirwaga umuyobozi w'akarere ka Nacala-a-Velha. Mu 2015, yabaye umuyobozi w'akarere ka Palma.\nGuverineri wa Inhambane.\nKu ya 4 Werurwe 2016, Chapo yagizwe guverineri w'intara ya Inhambane, mu majyepfo y'igihugu. Nyuma y'ivugurura ry'uburyo abaguverineri bashyirwaho, yatorewe uwo mwanya mu matora rusange yo ku ya 15 Ukwakira 2019.\nUmukandida ku mwanya wa perezida.\nKu ya 5 Gicurasi 2024, komite nkuru ya FRELIMO yamutoye ku majwi 225 (94%) ngo abe umukandida w'ishyaka mu matora ya perezida ya 2024, asimbura Filipe Nyusi wari urangije manda ze zemewe n'Itegeko Nshinga. Yatsinze cyane cyane Roque Silva Samuel, wari umunyamabanga mukuru wa FRELIMO. Kubera ko atari azwi cyane, gutorwa kwe kwatunguye benshi. Ku ya 13 Gicurasi, yagizwe umunyamabanga mukuru w'agateganyo w'ishyaka. Yeguye ku mwanya wa guverineri, maze ubwegure bwe bwemezwa n'inteko y'intara ku ya 23 Gicurasi, kugira ngo yitegure amatora yo ku ya 9 Ukwakira ; yasimbuwe na Eduardo Mussanhane, perezida w'inteko y'intara ya Inhambane.\nChapo ni we mukandida wa mbere wa FRELIMO ku mwanya wa perezida wavutse nyuma y'ubwigenge bwa Mozambike, bwabonetse mu 1975 nyuma y'ubukoloni bwa Porutigali. Kubera ubwiganze bwa FRELIMO muri politiki y'igihugu, yafatwaga nk'uzatsinda amatora.\nAmatora ya 2024 n'impaka.\nKu ya 24 Ukwakira 2024, komisiyo y'amatora ya Mozambike yatangaje ko Chapo yatsinze amatora n'amajwi 71%. Ariko ayo matora yaranzwe n'ibirego by'uburiganya n'ibitagenze neza byinshi. Ishyaka PODEMOS ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi ryanze ibyavuye mu matora, ritangaza ibarura ryaryo bwite ryerekanaga ko Ven\u00e2ncio Mondlane yatsinze n'amajwi 53%. Ibyavuye mu matora byanashidikanyijweho n'Inama y'Abepiskopi Gatolika ya Mozambike n'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi, mu gihe imyigaragambyo yo kubyamagana yahitanye nibura abantu 250, abenshi muri bo bakaba abigaragambyaga barashwe na polisi n'ingabo. Ku ya 23 Ukuboza 2024, Inama y'Itegeko Nshinga yemeje itsinzi ye, ariko imugenera amajwi 65,17%.\nPerezida wa Mozambike.\nNubwo imyigaragambyo yakomeje, Chapo yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Mozambike ku ya 15 Mutarama 2025. Ku ya 18 Mutarama 2025, yagize Maria Benvinda Levy Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nChapo yashakanye na Gueta Selemane Chapo, bafitanye abana bane. Ni Umukristo."}
{"id": "23210", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23210", "title": "Netumbo Nandi-Ndaitwah", "text": "Ndemupelila Netumbo Nandi-Ndaitwah (yavutse ku ya 29 Ukwakira 1952 i Onamutai), uzwi cyane ku izina rya NNN, ni umunyapolitiki wa Namibiya, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 21 Werurwe 2025. Ni we mugore wa mbere wabaye Perezida wa Namibiya. Umuyoboke w'ishyaka rya SWAPO kuva afite imyaka 14, yamaze imyaka myinshi mu buhungiro mbere y'ubwigenge, hanyuma aba umudepite kuva mu 1990. Yabaye minisitiri mu nzego zitandukanye, Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga (2012\u20132024), Visi-Minisitiri w'Intebe (2015\u20132024), na Visi-Perezida wa Repubulika (2024\u20132025). Mu 2017, yabaye umugore wa mbere watorewe kuba visi-perezida wa SWAPO, kandi ni we mugore wa mbere iryo shyaka ryatanze nk'umukandida ku mwanya wa perezida.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nNetumbo Nandi yavutse ku ya 29 Ukwakira 1952 i Onamutai, muri Afurika y'Amajyepfo-Uburengerazuba (ubu ni Namibiya), hafi y'urubibe rw'intara za Ohangwena na Oshana. Ababyeyi be ni Justina Nekoto Shaduka-Nandi na Petrus Nandi. Se yari umupasiteri w'Itorero ry'Abangilikani. Ni uwa cyenda mu bana 13. Yize mu ishuri ry'Abangilikani rya St. Mary's Mission i Odibo.\nYatangiye ibikorwa bya politiki akiri ingimbi, yinjira muri SWAPO mu 1966, afite imyaka 14. Bidatinze, yabaye umuyobozi w'urugaga rw'urubyiruko rwa SWAPO, rwarwanyaga ubukoloni bwa Afurika y\u2019Epfo; ibyo byatumye ahigwa, bimuhatira kwihisha.\nMu 1973, yagiye mu buhungiro muri Zambiya, aho yakoze ku cyicaro gikuru cya SWAPO i Lusaka kugeza mu 1975. Kuva mu 1975 kugeza mu 1976, yize mu ishuri rikuru ry'urubyiruko rw'Abakomunisiti (Komsomol) mu Bumwe bw'Abasoviyeti. Mu 1987, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya nyuma ya kaminuza mu buyobozi n'imicungire ya leta muri Glasgow College of Technology, mu Bwongereza; mu 1988, abona indi mu mibanire mpuzamahanga muri Kaminuza ya Keele, hanyuma mu 1989 abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu bumenyi bwa dipolomasi muri iyo kaminuza.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMbere y'ubwigenge.\nKuva mu 1976 kugeza mu 1978, yari intumwa yungirije ya SWAPO muri Zambiya, hanyuma intumwa nkuru yayo muri icyo gihugu kugeza mu 1980. Kuva mu 1980 kugeza mu 1986, yari intumwa nkuru ya SWAPO muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ifite icyicaro i Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya. Yabaye umwe mu bagize komite nkuru ya SWAPO kuva mu 1976 kugeza mu 1986.\nMu butegetsi bwa Namibiya yigenga.\nNi umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Namibiya kuva mu 1990. Yabaye Visi-Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1996, na perezida w'urugaga rw'abagore rwa Namibiya (NANAWO) kuva mu 1991 kugeza mu 1994. Kuva mu 1996 kugeza mu 2000, ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Sam Nujoma, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru w'ishami rishinzwe iby'abagore mu biro bya Perezida, ahuza ibikorwa bya leta n'iby'abikorera mu guteza imbere gahunda zifasha abagore n'abana. Muri icyo gihe, Namibiya yashyizeho politiki y'igihugu y'uburinganire (1997), itegeko ry'uburinganire bw'abashakanye (1996) n'itegeko rirwanya gufata ku ngufu (2000), ryemera ko gufata ku ngufu bishobora no kubaho hagati y'abashakanye.\nMu 2000, yagizwe Minisitiri ushinzwe iby'Abagore n'Imibereho myiza y'Abana. Muri uwo mwanya, yashyigikiye itegeko rirwanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo ryo mu 2003. Kuva mu 2005 kugeza mu 2010, yabaye Minisitiri w'Itangazamakuru, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Ibidukikije n'Ubukerarugendo kugeza mu Ukuboza 2012, ubwo yagirwaga Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga (minisiteri yaje kwitwa iy'Imibanire Mpuzamahanga n'Ubufatanye).\nMu Werurwe 2015, Perezida Hage Geingob yamugize Visi-Minisitiri w'Intebe, akomeza no kuba Minisitiri w'Imibanire Mpuzamahanga n'Ubufatanye. Muri SWAPO, ari muri komite nkuru no mu biro bya politiki, kandi ni umunyamabanga ushinzwe itangazamakuru n'ubukangurambaga, bigatuma aba umwe mu bavugizi b'ingenzi b'iryo shyaka.\nVisi-Perezida n'amatora ya 2024.\nMu Ugushyingo 2022, yongeye gutorerwa kuba visi-perezida wa SWAPO, bigatuma aba umukandida ushoboka cyane w'ishyaka mu matora ya perezida ya 2024. Mu Werurwe 2023, yatangajwe ku mugaragaro nk'umukandida wa SWAPO. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa Perezida Geingob muri Gashyantare 2024, Nangolo Mbumba wamusimbuye yamugize Visi-Perezida wa Repubulika ku ya 4 Gashyantare 2024; ni we mugore wa mbere wabaye kuri uwo mwanya.\nKu ya 3 Ukuboza 2024, komisiyo y'amatora yamutangaje nk'uwatsinze amatora ya perezida, aba umugore wa mbere watorewe kuyobora Namibiya. Yagize amajwi 683 560 (58,7%), atsinda Panduleni Itula na McHenry Venaani.\nPerezida wa Namibiya.\nYarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Namibiya ku ya 21 Werurwe 2025, asimbura Nangolo Mbumba. Mu ijambo yavuze arahira, yiyemeje gushyira imbere guhanga imirimo, agamije imirimo mishya 500 000, cyane cyane mu buhinzi, uburobyi, ubuhanzi na siporo.\nMuri Mata 2025, yatangaje ko guhera mu 2026 leta izatanga amashuri makuru na kaminuza ku buntu mu bigo bya leta. Ku ya 27 Mata 2025, yirukanye Minisitiri w'Ubuhinzi, Uburobyi, Amazi n'Ivugurura ry'Ubutaka, Mac-Albert Hengari, nyuma y'uko afatwa akekwaho ruswa, ashinjwa kugerageza gucecekesha umugore wavugaga ko yamufashe ku ngufu.\nIbitekerezo bye.\nNandi-Ndaitwah aharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore n'uburinganire bw'ibitsina muri Namibiya. Ariko bamwe mu bamunenga bavuga ko afite ibitekerezo gakondo; mu kiganiro cyo mu 2022, umusesenguzi wa politiki Henning Melber yavuze ko atigeze ashyigikira uburenganzira bw'imyororokere cyangwa kurengera abaryamana bahuje ibitsina. Arwanya gukuramo inda, uretse mu bihe bidasanzwe cyane.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye na Jenerali Liyetona (wavuye mu kazi) Epaphras Denga Ndaitwah, wahoze ari umugaba mukuru w'Ingabo za Namibiya ; bafitanye abana batatu. Akunda ibikorwa by'abana mu baturage no gusoma. Izina rya NNN akunze kwitwa rikoreshwa cyane na bagenzi be bo muri politiki.\nIbihembo.\nYahawe igihembo cy'Umuyobozi wa Politiki w'Umwaka muri Afurika n'icy'Umuyobozi w'Umugore w'Umwaka muri Afurika n'ikinyamakuru \"African Leadership Magazine\", ndetse n'igihembo cy'ubuyobozi bw'ibitekerezo (\"thought leadership\") mu bihembo by'iterambere rirambye bya Namibiya. Mu 2024, yahawe igihembo cy'ubuyobozi buhuza ibisekuru mu nama ya Nala Feminist. Yahawe kandi impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro na Kaminuza ya Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "23211", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23211", "title": "Bola Tinubu", "text": "Bola Ahmed Adekunle Tinubu (yavutse ku ya 29 Werurwe 1952 i Lagos) ni umunyapolitiki wa Nijeriya, Perezida wa 16 w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2023. Mbere yaho, yabaye senateri wa Lagos y'Iburengerazuba mu gihe cya Repubulika ya Gatatu (1992\u20131993), hanyuma aba Guverineri wa Leta ya Lagos kuva mu 1999 kugeza mu 2007. Nyuma y'amashuri y'icungamari muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, yakoreye ibigo bikomeye birimo Mobil, mbere yo kwinjira muri politiki. Yahungiye mu mahanga ku butegetsi bwa gisirikare bwa Sani Abacha, aharanira kugaruka kwa demokarasi. Nyuma yo kuva ku mwanya wa guverineri, yagize uruhare rukomeye mu ishingwa ry'ishyaka rya All Progressives Congress (APC) mu 2013, maze atsinda amatora ya perezida ya 2023. Ku butegetsi bwe, yakuyeho inkunga leta yatangaga ku bikomoka kuri peteroli kandi avugurura cyane politiki y'ubukungu, ariko ahura n'ibirego byinshi bya ruswa n'impaka ku byavuye mu matora.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nTinubu yavukiye i Lagos mu muryango w'Abayisilamu b'ubwoko bw'Abayoruba. Ni umuhungu wa Abibatu Mogaji, wari \"\u00ccy\u00e1l'\u1ecd\u0301j\u00e0\" (umuyobozi w'abacuruzikazi) wa Lagos. Amasoko yizewe yemeza ko yavutse mu 1952, nubwo abatavuga rumwe na we bavuga ko akuze kurushaho, kandi amasoko amwe akagaragaza ko imyaka ye itigeze yemezwa neza.\nYize mu ishuri ribanza rya St. John's i Aroloya, muri Lagos, hanyuma muri Children Home School i Ibadan. Mu 1975, yagiye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, yiga muri Richard J. Daley College i Chicago hanyuma muri Chicago State University, aho yize icungamari n'imicungire. Yakoze imirimo itandukanye, nko koza amasahani, kurinda nijoro no gutwara tagisi, kugira ngo abone amafaranga y'ishuri. Mu 1979, yarangije amasomo ahabwa impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu bucuruzi n'imiyoborere, afite amanota y'icyubahiro (\"summa cum laude\").\nUmwuga mbere ya politiki.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amashuri, Tinubu yabaye umucungamari mu bigo by'Abanyamerika Arthur Andersen, Deloitte na GTE Services Corporation. Yimukiye i Londres, aho yakoreye Mobil Oil UK, hanyuma mu myaka ya 1980 aba umuyobozi mukuru akaba n'umubitsi muri Mobil Producing Nigeria. Yaje kureka ako kazi kugira ngo yinjire muri politiki byuzuye.\nIntangiriro y'umwuga wa politiki.\nTinubu yatangiye politiki mu 1991, yinjira mu Ishyaka rya Demokarasi Gisosiyalisiti (SDP), anashyigikira kandidatire ya Moshood Abiola. Mu 1992, yatorewe kuba senateri uhagarariye Lagos y'Iburengerazuba; muri Sena, yayoboye komisiyo ishinzwe amabanki, imari n'ingengo y'imari.\nNyuma y'iseswa ry'ibyavuye mu matora ya perezida yo ku ya 12 Kamena 1993, yabaye umwe mu bashinze ihuriro riharanira demokarasi rya National Democratic Coalition (NADECO), ryasabaga ko demokarasi igaruka kandi Abiola akemerwa nk'uwatsinze ayo matora. Nyuma y'ifatwa ry'ubutegetsi na Jenerali Sani Abacha, Tinubu yafashwe kenshi, arafungwa, aterwa ubwoba, bimuhatira guhunga igihugu. Yamaze mu buhungiro kuva mu 1994 kugeza mu 1998, akomeza guharanira demokarasi ari muri NADECO, agaruka nyuma y'urupfu rwa Abacha.\nGuverineri wa Leta ya Lagos (1999\u20132007).\nMu matora ya 1999, yatsinze amatora y'ibanze y'ishyaka Alliance for Democracy (AD), maze muri Mutarama 1999 atorerwa kuba Guverineri wa Leta ya Lagos ; yatangiye imirimo ku ya 29 Gicurasi 1999. Mu 2003, yongeye gutorwa, aba guverineri wenyine wa AD wongeye gutorwa mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba bw'igihugu, mu gihe izindi ntara zose zo muri ako karere zegukanywe n'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi rya PDP.\nKu butegetsi bwe, yashimiwe guhangana n'umubyigano w'imodoka mu mihanda, kunoza ikusanywa ry'imyanda no kurwanya ibyaha by'ubugizi bwa nabi bukoranye ubuhanga, kandi yatangije imishinga minini y'ibikorwa remezo. Yahawe ibihembo byinshi, birimo icya guverineri mwiza muri Nijeriya mu 2000. Yagiranye amakimbirane akomeye na guverinoma nkuru ya Olusegun Obasanjo, ku bijyanye n'ishyirwaho ry'inzego 37 nshya z'ibanze muri Lagos; ayo makimbirane yatumye guverinoma nkuru ifatira amafaranga yagenewe izo nzego, ariko Urukiko rw'Ikirenga ruza gutegeka ko asubizwa. Manda ye yarangiye ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2007, asimburwa na Babatunde Fashola, wari umuyobozi w'ibiro bye.\nNubwo atari akiri guverineri, Tinubu yakomeje kugira ijambo rikomeye muri politiki ya Lagos, cyane cyane mu guhitamo abamusimbura. Ni yo mpamvu akunze kwitwa \u00abUmubyeyi wa batisimu wa Lagos\u00bb (\"Godfather of Lagos\").\nHagati ya 2007 na 2023.\nNyuma y'itsinzi ya PDP mu matora ya 2007, Tinubu yagize uruhare mu biganiro byo guhuza amashyaka atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Muri Gashyantare 2013, yari umwe mu bashinze ishyaka rya All Progressives Congress (APC), ryavutse ku ihuzwa ry'amashyaka akomeye atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi.\nMu 2014, yashyigikiye kandidatire ya Muhammadu Buhari ; yifuzaga kuba umukandida we ku mwanya wa visi-perezida, ariko uwo mwanya uhabwa Yemi Osinbajo, inshuti ye. Mu 2015, Buhari yatsinze amatora, bwa mbere perezida uri ku butegetsi muri Nijeriya atsindwa n'umukandida w'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Tinubu yafatwaga nk'umuyobozi utemewe ku mugaragaro wa APC ; muri Gashyantare 2018, Buhari yamushinze kuyobora komite y'ubwiyunge y'iryo shyaka, kugira ngo akemure amakimbirane yari arimo.\nAmatora ya 2023.\nKu ya 10 Mutarama 2022, Tinubu yatangaje ko aziyamamariza umwanya wa perezida. Ku ya 8 Kamena 2022, yatsinze amatora y'ibanze ya APC n'amajwi 1 271, atsinda Visi-Perezida Yemi Osinbajo na Rotimi Amaechi. Yahisemo Kashim Shettima nk'umukandida we ku mwanya wa visi-perezida.\nKu ya 1 Werurwe 2023, komisiyo y'amatora (INEC) yatangaje ko Tinubu yatsinze amatora ya perezida ku cyiciro cya mbere, n'amajwi 8 794 726 (36,6%), arusha Atiku Abubakar wa PDP (6 984 520) na Peter Obi w'Ishyaka ry'Abakozi (6 101 533). Ayo matora yaranzwe n'ibirego byo kugura amajwi, gutera ubwoba abatora, ibitero ku biro by'itora n'uburiganya. Abakandida batatu bakomeye batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi banze ibyavuye mu matora, basaba ko asubirwamo.\nPerezida wa Nijeriya.\nTinubu yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Nijeriya ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2023 ku kibuga cya Eagle Square i Abuja, mu muhango witabiriwe n'abakuru b'ibihugu benshi. Ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2023, yatorewe kuyobora Umuryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO).\nAmavugurura y'ubukungu.\nMu ijambo yavuze arahira, Tinubu yatangaje ivanwaho ry'inkunga leta yatangaga ku bikomoka kuri peteroli. Ibyo byateje izamuka rikabije ry'ibiciro bya lisansi, maze ihuriro ry'abakozi (NLC) rihamagarira imyigaragambyo, nyuma iza guhagarikwa kubera ibiganiro na guverinoma. Iyo nkunga yatwaraga leta hafi miliyari 10 z'amadolari ku mwaka, kandi ivanwaho ryayo ryashimwe na Banki y'Isi.\nKu ya 9 Kamena 2023, yahagaritse ku mirimo Godwin Emefiele, guverineri wa Banki Nkuru ya Nijeriya, wahise afatwa na polisi y'ubutasi. Nyuma y'iminsi itanu, banki nkuru yakuyeho imbogamizi ku ivunjisha, bituma ifaranga rya \"naira\" rigera ku gaciro karyo kari hasi kurusha ibindi byose. Amavugurura ye y'ubukungu, akunze kwitwa \"Tinubunomics\", afatwa nk'akomeye kurusha ayabayeho kuva demokarasi yagaruka.\nUmutekano n'ubuyobozi.\nKu ya 19 Kamena 2023, yagize Nuhu Ribadu Umujyanama mu by'Umutekano w'Igihugu, maze asimbuza abayobozi bakuru b'ingabo zose n'inzego z'umutekano. Uwo munsi kandi, yasheshe inama z'ubuyobozi z'ibigo byose bya leta.\nMu mpera za Nzeri 2025, ubutasi bwa gisirikare bwavumbuye umugambi wo guhirika ubutegetsi bwe; abasirikare 16 barafashwe, kandi umutambagiro wa gisirikare w'umunsi w'ubwigenge wo ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2025 urasubikwa. Igisirikare cyabanje guhakana ayo makuru, kivuga ko ifatwa ryabo ryari irya disipulini. Ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2025, Tinubu yasimbuje abayobozi bakuru b'ingabo.\nMu Ugushyingo 2025, Perezida Donald Trump wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika yashinje Nijeriya kunanirwa kurinda Abakristo ihohoterwa, ategeka ingabo z'Amerika kwitegura ibikorwa bya gisirikare muri icyo gihugu. Tinubu yahakanye ibyo birego, avuga ko guverinoma ye irinda abaturage bose hatitawe ku idini. Ku ya 25 Ukuboza 2025, ku busabe bwa guverinoma ya Nijeriya, Amerika yagabye igitero ku mutwe wa Leta ya Kisilamu (\"\u00c9tat islamique\") mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'igihugu.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nUrugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga nka perezida rwabaye i Paris, mu Ubufaransa, muri Kamena 2023, yitabiriye inama mpuzamahanga ku bijyanye n'imari. Muri Kanama 2023, nyuma ya kudeta yabereye muri Nigeri, yashyigikiye igitekerezo cy'ubutabazi bwa gisirikare, maze abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi barabinenga. Mu Ukuboza 2025, yemereye ingabo za Nijeriya gutabara Bene, nyuma y'igerageza rya kudeta ryibasiye Perezida Patrice Talon.\nAmatora ya 2027.\nKu ya 22 Gicurasi 2025, ishyaka rya APC ryamutanze nk'umukandida waryo mu matora ya perezida ya 2027. Komisiyo y'amatora (INEC) yemeje kandidatire ye, hamwe na Kashim Shettima nk'umukandida ku mwanya wa visi-perezida.\nIbirego bya ruswa.\nMu 1993, leta y'Amerika yafatiriye amafaranga yari kuri konti ze muri Amerika, ivuga ko hari impamvu zifatika zo gukeka ko akomoka ku icuruzwa rya heroyine; Tinubu yumvikanye na leta y'Amerika, yemera gutakaza amadolari agera ku 460 000. Muri Mata 2007, guverinoma nkuru yamujyanye imbere y'urukiko rushinzwe imyitwarire y'abayobozi (\"Code of Conduct Tribunal\"), imushinja gukoresha konti 16 zo mu mahanga mu buryo butemewe ; urubanza rwaje guteshwa agaciro ku mpamvu za tekiniki. Muri Mutarama 2009, komisiyo ishinzwe kurwanya ibyaha by'ubukungu (EFCC) yamuhanaguyeho ibyaha byo kunyereza umutungo no kwezwa kw'amafaranga.\nUbuzima bwite.\nTinubu ni Umuyisilamu. Mu 1987, yashakanye na Oluremi Tinubu, wahoze ari senateri uhagarariye Lagos yo Hagati ; bafitanye abana batatu. Afite kandi abandi bana batatu yabyaye mbere ; umwe muri bo, Jide Tinubu, yapfiriye i Londres ku ya 31 Ukwakira 2017. Afite amazina abiri y'icyubahiro gakondo: \"Asiwaju\" wa Lagos na \"Jagaba\" wa Borgu."}
{"id": "23212", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23212", "title": "Carlos Vila Nova", "text": "Carlos Manuel Vila Nova (yavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 1959 i Neves) ni injeniyeri akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Sawo Tome na Purensipe, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 2 Ukwakira 2021. Mbere yo kwinjira muri politiki, yamaze imyaka myinshi mu rwego rw'amahoteli n'ubukerarugendo. Yabaye Minisitiri w'Imirimo ya Leta (2010\u20132012) na Minisitiri w'Ibikorwa Remezo, Umutungo Kamere n'Ibidukikije (2014\u20132018) muri guverinoma za Minisitiri w'Intebe Patrice Trovoada. Yatowe ari umukandida w'ishyaka rya Action d\u00e9mocratique ind\u00e9pendante (ADI) mu 2021, maze yongera gutorwa mu 2026.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nCarlos Manuel Vila Nova yavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 1959 i Neves, umujyi uri mu karere ka Lemb\u00e1, ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru y'ikirwa cya S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9. Mu 1985, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ubunyeniyeri mu itumanaho muri Kaminuza ya Oran, muri Aligeriya. Agarutse mu gihugu, yayoboye ishami ry'ikoranabuhanga mu kigo cya leta gishinzwe ibarurishamibare.\nUmwuga mu bukerarugendo.\nMu 1988, yavuye mu kazi ka leta, aba umuyobozi ushinzwe ubucuruzi muri Hotel Miramar, yari hoteli yonyine mu gihugu icyo gihe. Mu 1992, yagizwe umuyobozi w'iyo hoteli, hanyuma mu 1997 aba umuyobozi wa Hotel Pousada Boa Vista. Yashinze kandi ikigo cy'ingendo cyitwa Mistral Voyages. Yakomeje gukora mu bukerarugendo kugeza yinjiye muri politiki mu 2010.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nNyuma y'itsinzi ya ADI mu matora y'abadepite yo mu 2010, Minisitiri w'Intebe Patrice Trovoada yamugize Minisitiri w'Imirimo ya Leta n'Umutungo Kamere muri guverinoma ya 14 ishingiye ku Itegeko Nshinga. Guverinoma yatakaje icyizere cy'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko mu 2012. Ubwo ADI yongeraga kubona ubwiganze busesuye mu matora ya 2014, Vila Nova yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ibikorwa Remezo, Umutungo Kamere n'Ibidukikije, umwanya yagumyeho kugeza ADI itsinzwe amatora ya 2018. Muri ayo matora, yatorewe kuba umudepite mu karere ka \u00c1gua Grande.\nPerezida wa Sawo Tome na Purensipe.\nAmatora ya 2021.\nMu matora ya perezida ya 2021, Perezida Evaristo Carvalho wari ku butegetsi, na we wo muri ADI, ntiyongeye kwiyamamaza, maze iryo shyaka ritanga Vila Nova nk'umukandida waryo. Yagize amajwi 39% ku cyiciro cya mbere, hanyuma atsinda icyiciro cya kabiri n'amajwi agera kuri 57\u201358%, imbere ya Guilherme Posser da Costa w'ishyaka MLSTP-PSD. Ku ya 14 Nzeri 2021, urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ko ari we perezida watowe, maze arahira ku ya 2 Ukwakira 2021.\nAmakimbirane na Trovoada.\nKu ya 6 Mutarama 2025, Vila Nova yirukanye Minisitiri w'Intebe Patrice Trovoada na guverinoma ye, avuga ko Trovoada yamaraga igihe kirekire adahari kandi guverinoma ye ikananirwa gukemura ibibazo byinshi. Trovoada yavuze ko iryo yirukanwa ritemewe n'amategeko kandi rinyuranyije n'Itegeko Nshinga. Vila Nova yabanje gushyiraho Minisitiri w'Ubutabera, Ilza Amado Vaz, nka Minisitiri w'Intebe, ariko ahita yegura. Hanyuma yashyizeho Am\u00e9rico Ramos, utaremejwe na ADI, bituma anengwa kwirengagiza ubwiganze bw'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko.\nManda ya kabiri.\nMu matora ya perezida yo ku ya 19 Nyakanga 2026, Vila Nova yongeye gutorwa ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 55,94%, yiyamamaje nk'umukandida wigenga ashyigikiwe na MLSTP-PSD, atsinda Nito Abreu washyigikiwe na ADI, wagize amajwi 41,42%.\nMuri Werurwe 2026, hamwe na Minisitiri w'Intebe Am\u00e9rico Ramos n'itsinda ry'abashoramari mpuzamahanga Aequatoris, yatangaje umushinga wo gushinga ikigo cy'imari cya S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 (\"S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 Financial Centre\"), agace k'ubucuruzi kadasoreshwa kagamije gukurura ibigo mpuzamahanga bitanga serivisi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nVila Nova yashakanye na Maria de F\u00e1tima Afonso Vila Nova, bafitanye abakobwa babiri."}
{"id": "23213", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23213", "title": "Bassirou Diomaye Faye", "text": "Bassirou Diomaye Diakhar Faye (yavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1980 i Ndiaganiao), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Diomaye, ni umunyapolitiki wa Senegali, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 2 Mata 2024. Yahoze ari umugenzuzi w'imari ya leta n'umuyobozi w'ihuriro ry'abakozi, hanyuma aba umunyamabanga mukuru w'ishyaka rya PASTEF. Yafunzwe amezi agera kuri cumi n'umwe, afungurwa iminsi mike mbere y'amatora ya perezida ya 2024, aho yasimbuye Ousmane Sonko wari wangiwe kwiyamamaza. Yatsinze ayo matora ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 54,28%, aba perezida muto kurusha abandi bose mu mateka ya Senegali, n'umukandida wa mbere utavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi utsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere. Manda ye yaranzwe n'ikibazo gikomeye cy'imyenda ya leta n'amakimbirane na Minisitiri w'Intebe Sonko, uwo yaje kwirukana mu 2026. Kuva muri Nyakanga 2026, ayobora Umuryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO).\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nBassirou Diomaye Diakhar Faye yavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1980 i Ndiaganiao, mu karere ka M'bour, mu ntara ya Thi\u00e8s. Akomoka mu bwoko bw'Abaserere. Yakuriye mu cyaro kandi akunze kugaragaza ko yishimira inkomoko ye. Se, Samba Faye, yari umuyoboke w'igihe kirekire w'Ishyaka rya Gisosiyalisiti rya Senegali. Sekuru yarwanye ku ruhande rw'Ubufaransa mu Ntambara ya Mbere y'Isi Yose, nyuma afungwa n'abakoloni b'Abafaransa kubera ko yaharaniraga ishingwa ry'ishuri ryisumbuye i Ndiaganiao, ari na ryo Faye yaje kwigamo.\nYize amashuri abanza mu mudugudu w'iwabo, ayisumbuye i M'Bour, abona impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye mu 2000. Yize amategeko muri Kaminuza Cheikh-Anta-Diop i Dakar, abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\"), hanyuma mu 2004 yinjira mu ishuri rikuru ry'ubuyobozi (ENA) rya Senegali. Yabaye umugenzuzi w'imari ya leta mu ishami ry'imisoro n'ubutaka, aho yamenyaniye na Ousmane Sonko. Yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru w'ihuriro ry'abakozi b'imisoro n'ubutaka.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nFaye yinjiye mu ishyaka rya Patriotes africains du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal pour le travail, l'\u00e9thique et la fraternit\u00e9 (PASTEF) kuva ryashingwa mu 2014. Mu gihe Ousmane Sonko yari umuyobozi n'isura nyamukuru y'iryo shyaka, Faye we yari umwubatsi waryo, ashinzwe ibitekerezo by'ishyaka n'imitunganyirize yaryo y'imbere. Yagize uruhare mu gutegura gahunda ya Sonko mu matora ya perezida ya 2019, aho Sonko yabaye uwa gatatu n'amajwi hafi 16%. Mu 2021, ubwo Sonko yafungwaga, Faye yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru wa PASTEF. Mu matora y'inzego z'ibanze ya 2022, yiyamamarije kuyobora komine ya Ndiaganiao, ariko atsindwa na Tening S\u00e8ne wo mu ishyaka rya Perezida Macky Sall.\nIfungwa n'irekurwa.\nKu ya 14 Mata 2023, Faye yafatiwe i Dakar, akurikiranyweho \u00abgukwirakwiza amakuru y'ibihuha, gusuzugura abacamanza no gusebya urwego rwa leta\u00bb, nyuma y'ubutumwa yanditse ku mbuga nkoranyambaga anenga abacamanza bari bihutiye kuburanisha Sonko mu bujurire. Nyuma yaho, yongerewe ibindi byaha birimo \u00abgushishikariza abantu kwigomeka\u00bb, bituma afungwa igihe kitazwi.\nMuri Gashyantare 2024, Perezida Macky Sall yagerageje gusubika amatora, ariko ibyo byateje imyigaragambyo ikomeye, maze Inama y'Itegeko Nshinga iburizamo iryo subikwa. Guverinoma yashyikirije Inteko itegeko ry'imbabazi rusange, ryatumye abantu babarirwa mu magana bafunzwe kubera politiki barekurwa. Iryo tegeko ryanenzwe na bamwe kuko ryahaga imbabazi n'abagize uruhare mu guhohotera abigaragambyaga hagati ya 2021 na 2024. Faye na Sonko barekuwe muri Werurwe 2024, iminsi mike mbere y'amatora.\nAmatora ya perezida ya 2024.\nMu Ugushyingo 2023, kubera ko bitari bizwi niba Sonko azemererwa kwiyamamaza, PASTEF yatanze Faye nk'umukandida waryo nubwo yari afunzwe. Ku ya 20 Mutarama 2024, Inama y'Itegeko Nshinga yasohoye urutonde rwa nyuma rw'abakandida, Sonko atarimo; ariko kandidatire ya Faye yemejwe kuko atari yarigeze akatirwa. Sonko yahise atangaza ko amushyigikiye, ndetse n'uwahoze ari Perezida Abdoulaye Wade n'ishyaka rye PDS baramushyigikira ; umukandida Cheikh Tidiane Dieye na we yamuvaniyeho kandidatire ye.\nGahunda ye yiswe \u00abUmushinga wa Senegali yigenga, iboneye kandi itera imbere\u00bb. Yiyamamaje ari kumwe na Sonko, munsi y'intero \u00ab\"Diomaye mooy Sonko\"\u00bb (\u00abDiomaye ni Sonko\u00bb), yiyemeza guhanga imirimo, kurwanya ruswa no gusuzuma bundi bushya amasezerano yo mu rwego rw'ingufu. Yanatangaje umutungo we, asaba abandi bakandida kubigenza batyo.\nMu matora yo ku ya 24 Werurwe 2024, Faye yatsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 54,28%. Umukandida w'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi, Amadou Ba, na Perezida Macky Sall bemeye gutsindwa bamushimira. Ku myaka 44, yabaye perezida muto kurusha abandi bose watorewe kuyobora Senegali, umukandida wa mbere utavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi utsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere kuva igihugu cyabona ubwigenge mu 1960, akaba na perezida wa mbere ufite abagore barenze umwe ku mugaragaro.\nPerezida wa Senegali.\nIntangiriro ya manda.\nFaye yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Senegali ku ya 2 Mata 2024, asimbura Macky Sall, yiyemeza kurwanya ruswa no kuvugurura ubukungu. Uwo munsi, yagize Ousmane Sonko Minisitiri w'Intebe, maze guverinoma nshya ishyirwaho ku ya 5 Mata. Ku ya 3 Mata, yategetse igenzura ry'urwego rw'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro, peteroli na gaze.\nUrugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga yarukoreye muri Moritaniya, aho yahuriye na Perezida Mohamed Ould Ghazouani. Muri Gicurasi 2024, yasuye Gineya na Mali, ahura na Mamadi Doumbouya na Assimi Go\u00efta, agaragaza ubushake bwo kugarura Mali, Burukina Faso na Nigeri muri CEDEAO. Ukwezi kwe kwa mbere ku butegetsi kwaranzwe no koroshya imihango ya leta, guca icyuho cyo gufata imyanya myinshi icyarimwe, no gutangaza raporo za kera ku buriganya na ruswa.\nKu ya 12 Nzeri 2024, mu gihe yari afitanye amakimbirane n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yari yiganjemo abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Faye yasheshe Inteko, ategeka amatora y'abadepite yo ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 2024. PASTEF yatsinze ayo matora ku bwiganze busesuye.\nIkigo cy'ubushakashatsi Carnegie Endowment cyagaragaje ko ubutegetsi bwe bwasubije agaciro uburenganzira bw'ibanze bwari bwarahungabanyijwe ku butegetsi bwamubanjirije, ariko kinavuga ko itangazamakuru ryakomeje gukorerwa igitutu, harimo no gukumira bimwe mu bitangazwa (\"censure\"). Muri Nyakanga 2025, yitabiriye inama yahuje Perezida Donald Trump n'abakuru b'ibihugu bimwe bya Afurika muri White House.\nIkibazo cy'imyenda ya leta.\nMu mpera za 2024, guverinoma ye yashyize ahagaragara amakosa yo mu icungamari yakozwe na guverinoma yabanje, n'umwenda munini igihugu cyari gifite utari waratangajwe. Amanota y'ubushobozi bwo kwishyura ya Senegali yaramanuwe, kandi Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari (FMI) gihagarika inguzanyo yacyo. Umwenda wa leta wongeye kubarwa, uva kuri 65% ugera kuri 111% by'umusaruro mbumbe w'igihugu, bituma Senegali iba kimwe mu bihugu bifite umwenda munini kurusha ibindi muri Afurika. Muri Kanama 2025, perezida na minisitiri w'intebe batangaje gahunda yo kuzahura ubukungu n'imibereho, igamije kubona miliyari 6 000 z'amafaranga ya CFA mu myaka itatu, ahanini binyuze mu kongera imisoro no kugabanya amafaranga leta isohora.\nGutandukana na Sonko.\nGuhera mu 2025, havutse amakimbirane hagati ya Faye na Minisitiri w'Intebe Ousmane Sonko, cyane cyane ku bijyanye n'ishyirwaho ry'abayobozi bamwe n'uburyo bwo kwishyura umwenda wa leta. Ayo makimbirane yarushijeho gukara mu 2026, mu gihe cy'ikibazo cy'imari no guhangana kw'aba bombi ku matora ya perezida ataha. Ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2026, Faye yirukanye Sonko ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Intebe, amusimbuza impuguke mu by'ubukungu Ahmadou Al Aminou L\u00f4. Guverinoma nshya, yashyizweho ku ya 1 Kamena 2026, yagizwe ahanini n'abantu batari mu mashyaka n'abo mu miryango itegamiye kuri leta, nta ruhare rwa PASTEF. Ku ya 25 Nyakanga 2026, Faye yashinze ishyaka rishya ryitwa Kiiraay \u2013 Les Patriotes r\u00e9publicains.\nUmuyobozi wa CEDEAO.\nKu ya 19 Nyakanga 2026, mu nama ya 69 y'abakuru b'ibihugu n'aba guverinoma yabereye i Freetown, Faye yagizwe umuyobozi wa CEDEAO, asimbura Julius Maada Bio.\nIbitekerezo bya politiki.\nFaye avuga ko aharanira impinduka mu miyoborere no gukunda Afurika (\"panafricanisme\") bishingiye ku bitekerezo by'ibumoso, agamije gusubiza Senegali ubusugire bwayo; bamwe mu basesenguzi babona ko ibyo bigaragaza ubushake bwo kwitandukanya n'ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba, cyane cyane Ubufaransa. Yiyemeje kugabanya ububasha bwa perezida no kugarura umwanya wa visi-perezida. Yifuza kandi ivugurura ry'ifaranga rya CFA ku rwego rw'akarere, bitashoboka igihugu kigashyiraho ifaranga ryacyo bwite. Ashyigikiye gusubiramo amasezerano ya leta n'ibigo by'ubucuruzi mu rwego rw'ingufu, ubucukuzi n'uburobyi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nFaye afite abagore babiri. Umugore we wa mbere, Marie Khone Faye, ukomoka i Ndiaganiao, ni Umukristo ; bafitanye umukobwa umwe n'abahungu batatu, umwe muri bo akaba yaritiriwe Ousmane Sonko. Umugore we wa kabiri, Absa Faye, bashakanye mu 2023 i Keur Massar, ni Umuyisilamu; bafitanye umukobwa umwe. Mu gihe cy'akaruhuko, akunda ubuhinzi mu mirima y'iwabo, kandi yandika imivugo."}
{"id": "23214", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23214", "title": "Patrick Herminie", "text": "Patrick Herminie (yavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1963 i Baie Sainte-Anne, ku kirwa cya Praslin) ni umuganga akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Seyishele, Perezida wa gatandatu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 26 Ukwakira 2025. Mbere yo kwinjira muri politiki byuzuye, yakoze imyaka myinshi muri Minisiteri y'Ubuzima. Yabaye umudepite kuva mu 1993, aba Perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Seyishele kuva mu 2007 kugeza mu 2016, hanyuma ayobora ishyaka rya United Seychelles (US), ishyaka rikomeye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, kuva mu 2021. Mu matora ya perezida ya 2025, yatsinze Perezida Wavel Ramkalawan wari ku butegetsi ku cyiciro cya kabiri.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nPatrick Herminie yavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1963 mu bitaro bya Baie Sainte-Anne, ku kirwa cya Praslin, ikirwa cya kabiri mu bunini muri Seyishele. Ni uwa kane mu bana batanu. Nyina, Christa Herminie, yitaga ku rugo, naho se, Louis Herminie, yari umupolisi. Nyuma y'imyaka mike, umuryango we wimukiye ku kirwa cya Mah\u00e9.\nYize mu ishuri ry'abahungu rya Seychelles College, aho yanabaye kapiteni w'ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abato. Nyuma yaho, yize ubuvuzi muri Kaminuza ya Charles i Prague, muri Cekosolovakiya, abona impamyabumenyi y'ubuganga mu 1990.\nUmwuga mu buvuzi.\nAgarutse muri Seyishele, Herminie yabaye umuganga mu bitaro bya Victoria mu 1990, hanyuma umuganga mukuru mu 1992. Mu 1995, yagizwe umuyobozi w'ishami ry'isuku y'ibidukikije muri Minisiteri y'Ubuzima; muri uwo mwaka, yahawe buruse ya Chevening na leta y'Ubwongereza, abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu buzima rusange muri Kaminuza ya Leeds. Mu 1996, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe gukumira no kurwanya indwara, hanyuma mu 1998 umuyobozi mukuru w'ishami ry'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze muri Minisiteri y'Ubuzima, umwanya yagumyeho kugeza mu 2003.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nHerminie yatangiye politiki mu 1992, ubwo yagirwaga umwe mu bagize komisiyo yateguye Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika ya Gatatu. Mu 1993, yatorewe kuba umudepite uhagarariye agace ka English River, yongera gutorwa mu 1998, 2002 na 2003. Kuva mu 1998, yabaye umuyobozi w'ibikorwa bya guverinoma mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko (umuyobozi w'abadepite b'ishyaka ryiganje), kandi yari mu bagize komite nkuru y'ishyaka ryari ku butegetsi, Seychelles People's Progressive Front.\nKuva mu 2007 kugeza mu 2016, Herminie yabaye Perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Seyishele. Mu 2012, yatorewe kuyobora inama y'abaperezida b'inteko zishinga amategeko z'ibihugu bya Commonwealth (CSPOC) mu karere ka Afurika, hanyuma hagati ya 2015 na 2016 ayobora iyo nama ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Nyuma y'itsinzi y'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi mu matora y'abadepite yo muri Nzeri 2016, yasimbuwe na Patrick Pillay ku ya 27 Nzeri 2016.\nKuva mu 2017 kugeza mu 2020, Herminie yayoboye inama y'ubuyobozi y'ikigo gishya cyo gukumira ikoreshwa ry'ibiyobyabwenge no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe ababaswe na byo (APDAR), cyashyizweho na Perezida Danny Faure, mu gihe Seyishele yari ihanganye n'icyorezo gikomeye cy'ikoreshwa rya heroyine. Ku ya 31 Mutarama 2021, yatorewe kuyobora ishyaka rya United Seychelles.\nIbirego by'uburozi.\nMu Ukwakira 2023, ubushinjacyaha bwa Seyishele bwashinje Herminie icyaha cy'uburozi (\"sorcellerie\"), nyuma y'uko imirambo ibiri itabuwe ivumburwa ku kirwa cya Mah\u00e9 muri Kanama 2023, maze izina rye rikaboneka muri telefone y'ukekwaho icyaha w'ibanze. Herminie yahakanye ibyo birego, avuga ko ari \u00abuguhiga abarozi kwa politiki\u00bb kwa Perezida Ramkalawan, kugamije kumubuza kwiyamamaza. Ku ya 15 Gashyantare 2024, ibyo birego byose byarateshejwe agaciro.\nAmatora ya perezida ya 2025.\nKu ya 4 Kamena 2024, ishyaka rye ryamutanze nk'umukandida waryo mu matora ya perezida ya 2025. Yibanze ku bibazo by'imibereho, yitirira umurage w'uwahoze ari Perezida France-Albert Ren\u00e9, maze yiyemeza kumanura imyaka y'izabukuru ikagera kuri 63, kugabanya ibiciro by'ingendo rusange ku kigero cya 40% no kongera inyunganizi z'ubwiteganyirize. Yashyigikiye kandi kugenzura cyane imishinga y'ubukerarugendo, yiyemeza guhagarika amasezerano yahaye umushoramari wo muri Qatar ikirwa cya Assomption. Mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'amatora cyabaye kuva ku ya 9 kugeza ku ya 11 Ukwakira 2025, yatsinze Perezida Wavel Ramkalawan n'amajwi 52,7%.\nPerezida wa Seyishele.\nKu ya 26 Ukwakira 2025, Herminie yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa gatandatu wa Repubulika ya Seyishele, mu muhango wabereye kuri sitade Linit\u00e9 i Victoria. Uwo muhango witabiriwe n'abayobozi b'ibihugu byinshi, barimo Visi-Perezida w'Ubuhinde, Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Morise na Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Tanzaniya. Mu ijambo rye, yasubiyemo intero ye yo kwiyamamaza, \u00abku bw'abenshi, si ku bw'abake\u00bb, yiyemeza kurwanya ubusumbane, guteza imbere ubuvuzi n'uburezi, no gutuma iterambere rigera ku Banyaseyishele bose. Guverinoma ye nshya, irimo abaminisitiri benshi bashya n'umubare w'abagore utarigeze ubaho, yitezwe kuba iya mbere mu mateka y'igihugu ifite uburinganire bw'abagabo n'abagore.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1991, Herminie yahuye na Veronique Sinon, baje gushyingiranwa. Bafitanye abana babiri: Venessa, umuganga, na Martin, injeniyeri."}
{"id": "23215", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23215", "title": "Julius Maada Bio", "text": "Julius Maada Wonie Bio (yavutse ku ya 12 Gicurasi 1964 i Tihun) ni umusirikare mukuru wavuye mu ngabo akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Siyera Lewone, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 4 Mata 2018. Afite ipeti rya burigadiye jenerali. Mu 1992, yari umwe mu basirikare bato bahiritse ubutegetsi bwa Perezida Joseph Momoh, maze mu 1996 ahirika mugenzi we Valentine Strasser, ayobora igihugu kuva ku ya 16 Mutarama kugeza ku ya 29 Werurwe 1996, afite imyaka 32 gusa, mbere yo gushyikiriza ubutegetsi Perezida watowe, Ahmad Tejan Kabbah. Nyuma yo kuva mu gisirikare, yabaye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, hanyuma agaruka muri politiki mu ishyaka rya Sierra Leone People's Party (SLPP). Yatsinzwe amatora ya perezida ya 2012, atsinda aya 2018, yongera gutorwa mu 2023. Ku butegetsi bwe, yashyizeho uburezi bw'ibanze n'ayisumbuye ku buntu kandi akuraho igihano cy'urupfu. Kuva muri Kamena 2025 kugeza muri Nyakanga 2026, yayoboye Umuryango w'Ubukungu w'Ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO).\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nJulius Maada Wonie Bio yavutse ku ya 12 Gicurasi 1964 mu mudugudu wa Tihun, mu karere ka Bonthe, mu ntara y'Amajyepfo ya Siyera Lewone. Ni umwana wa 33 mu bana 35 b'umutware gakondo Charlie Bio II. Ni Umusherboro (\"Sherbro\"), kandi ni Umukristo Gatolika.\nYatangiye amashuri abanza mu ishuri Gatolika rya Tihun, ayarangiriza i Pujehun, aho yabanaga na mukuru we Agnes wari umwarimu. Hanyuma yize imyaka irindwi mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya leta rya Bo (\"Bo School\"), ariharangiza mu 1984.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nMu 1985, Bio yinjiye mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Benguema, hafi ya Freetown, arirangiza mu Ukwakira 1987 afite ipeti rya su-liyetona. Yakoreye mu birindiro bya Lungi no mu karere ka Kambia, mu mutwe wari ushinzwe kurwanya magendu ku mupaka na Gineya.\nMu 1990, yoherejwe muri Liberiya mu ngabo za CEDEAO zishinzwe kugarura amahoro (ECOMOG), mu gihe cy'intambara y'abenegihugu yari imaze kuduka muri icyo gihugu. Nyuma y'umwaka umwe, yagaruwe muri Siyera Lewone kurwanya inyeshyamba za Revolutionary United Front (RUF), zari zatangiye gutera imidugudu yo ku mupaka na Liberiya muri Werurwe 1991.\nKudeta n'ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare.\nKu ya 29 Mata 1992, Bio yari umwe mu basirikare bato bayobowe na Kapiteni Valentine Strasser bahiritse ubutegetsi bwa Perezida Joseph Momoh, washinjwaga kuba yarateje intambara y'abenegihugu (1991\u20132002). Abo basirikare bashinze akanama ka gisirikare kayoboraga igihugu, National Provisional Ruling Council (NPRC), kayobowe na Strasser. Bio yabanje kuba umunyamabanga wa leta ushinzwe Amajyepfo i Bo, hanyuma ushinzwe itangazamakuru, nyuma aba visi-perezida wa NPRC. Nyuma yaho, yasabye imbabazi ku iyicwa ry'abantu bagera kuri makumyabiri ryabaye muri iyo kudeta.\nKu ya 16 Mutarama 1996, Bio yayoboye kudeta yahiritse Strasser, nyuma y'amakimbirane mu buyobozi bwa NPRC ku bijyanye no kumvikana n'inyeshyamba za RUF mbere y'amatora y'amashyaka menshi yari ateganyijwe muri Werurwe 1996. Strasser yahise yoherezwa mu buhungiro i Conakry, muri Gineya. Bio yagaruye amatora y'amashyaka menshi, maze muri Werurwe 1996 ashyikiriza ubutegetsi Ahmad Tejan Kabbah wari umaze gutorwa.\nNyuma y'igisirikare.\nNyuma yo kuva mu gisirikare mu 1996, Bio yimukiye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, aho yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu bibazo mpuzamahanga muri American University i Washington. Yayoboye kandi ikigo cy'ubujyanama n'ishoramari cyitwa International Systems Science Corporation.\nKugaruka muri politiki.\nMu 2005, Bio yinjiye mu ishyaka rya SLPP, ariyamamariza kuriyobora mu nama yaryo yabereye i Makeni, aba uwa gatatu. Mu 2011, yatowe nk'umukandida wa SLPP mu matora ya perezida ya 2012; yatsinzwe na Perezida Ernest Bai Koroma wari ku butegetsi, abona amajwi 37,4% kuri 58,7% ya Koroma, ariko ashimangira SLPP nk'ishyaka rikomeye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi. Nyuma yaho, yatangiye amasomo y'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bumenyi bw'amahoro muri Kaminuza ya Bradford, mu Bwongereza.\nPerezida wa Siyera Lewone.\nAmatora ya 2018.\nMu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'amatora ya perezida cyabaye ku ya 31 Werurwe 2018, Bio yatsinze Samura Kamara wo mu ishyaka ryari ku butegetsi, All People's Congress (APC), n'amajwi 51,8%. Yarahiriye kuba perezida ku ya 4 Mata 2018, nubwo uwo bari bahanganye yamaganaga ibyavuye mu matora.\nPolitiki y'imbere mu gihugu.\nMu kwezi kwe kwa mbere ku butegetsi, Bio yashyizeho uburezi bw'ibanze n'ayisumbuye ku buntu mu mashuri ya leta. Yahagaritse amasezerano y'inguzanyo ya miliyoni 400 z'amadolari yari yarasinywe na Koroma n'uBushinwa yo kubaka ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga gishya, kandi atangiza igenzura ry'amasezerano y'ubucukuzi n'ibigo bya leta byo ku butegetsi bwabanje. Guverinoma ye yashinje Koroma na guverinoma ye ruswa ikabije.\nMuri Gashyantare 2019, Bio yatangaje ibihe bidasanzwe kubera ubwiyongere bw'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, yongera ibihano ku cyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu; ibyo bihe bidasanzwe byavanyweho muri Kamena uwo mwaka. Mu 2022, yatangaje ko guverinoma ye ishyigikiye umushinga w'itegeko wagura uburenganzira bwo gukuramo inda. Muri Mutarama 2023, yasinye itegeko ry'uburinganire n'iterambere ry'abagore, risaba ko nibura 30% by'abakandida mu matora y'abadepite n'ay'inzego z'ibanze baba abagore.\nAbatavuga rumwe na we bamunenga kubera ubukungu bw'igihugu bwifashe nabi. Muri Kanama 2022, imyigaragambyo yatewe n'izamuka ry'ibiciro yasabaga ko yegura, ihitana abantu benshi ; Bio yayifashe nk'igerageza ryo guhirika ubutegetsi.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nMuri Nyakanga 2021, Bio yatumiwe mu nama mpuzamahanga ku burezi i Londres, kubera ibikorwa bye byo kwagura uburezi no guteza imbere ishuri ry'abakobwa. Muri Werurwe 2022, yasuye Viyetinamu. Muri Gicurasi 2023, yasabye ko intambara y'Uburusiya muri Ukraine ihagarara \u00abku bw'inyungu z'ikiremwamuntu\u00bb, avuga ko yizeye ko dipolomasi iyobowe n'abayobozi b'Afurika yafasha kuyirangiza.\nAmatora ya 2023.\nMu matora rusange yo muri Kamena 2023, Bio yongeye gutorwa ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 56,17%, imbere ya Samura Kamara. Ariko indorerezi z'imbere mu gihugu n'izo mu mahanga zanenze kudakorera mu mucyo mu ibarura ry'amajwi, kandi Kamara yanze kwemera ibyavuye mu matora. Iminsi mike mbere y'amatora, ku ya 21 Kamena 2023, imyigaragambyo yabereye imbere y'icyicaro cya APC yahitanye nibura umuntu umwe.\nJos Leijdekkers.\nMu ntangiriro za 2025, ibinyamakuru byinshi byatangaje ko Jos Leijdekkers, umucuruzi w'ikiyobyabwenge cya kokayine ukomoka mu Buholandi wakatiwe adahari igifungo cy'imyaka 24, yari amaze igihe aba muri Siyera Lewone. Hagaragaye amashusho amwerekana mu misa yabereye i Freetown ku ya 1 Mutarama 2025, yicaye inyuma ya Perezida Bio, ari kumwe n'umwe mu bakobwa ba Bio, bivugwa ko yashakanye na we. Leta y'Ubuholandi yagaragaje impungenge ku kuba abayobozi ba Siyera Lewone nta cyo bakoze ku bijyanye na we.\nUmuyobozi wa CEDEAO.\nKu ya 22 Kamena 2025, mu nama y'abakuru b'ibihugu yabereye i Abuja, muri Nijeriya, Bio yatorewe kuyobora CEDEAO. Yasimbuwe kuri uwo mwanya na Bassirou Diomaye Faye muri Nyakanga 2026.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBio ni Umukristo Gatolika. Umugore we, Fatima Bio, ni umukinnyi wa filime w'Umuyisilamu, ufite inkomoko muri Gambiya no muri Siyera Lewone. Bashyingiranwe mu 2013 i Londres, mu muhango wahuje amadini yombi; bafitanye umwana umwe. Bio afite abandi bana batatu yabyaye mu bushyingiranwe bwa mbere. Bamenyaniye mu 2012 i Londres."}
{"id": "23216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23216", "title": "Universit\u00e9 de l'Assomption au Congo", "text": "Universit\u00e9 de l'Assomption au Congo (UAC), mu Kinyarwanda Kaminuza y'Asomusiyo muri Kongo, ni ishuri rikuru ryigenga ry'amashuri makuru na kaminuza riherereye mu mujyi wa Butembo, mu ntara ya Kivu y'Amajyaruguru, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yashinzwe kandi iyoborwa n'Abasomusiyonisiti, umuryango w'abihayimana wa Kiliziya Gatolika.\nAmateka.\nMu 1982, Abasomusiyonisiti bakoreraga ubutumwa muri Diyosezi ya Butembo-Beni bashinze ishuri rya filozofiya ryitwa Philosophat Saint-Augustin de Bulengera, kugira ngo ritegure abihayimana bazakomeza kwiga tewolojiya. Kuva mu 1993 kugeza mu 2002, iryo shuri ryari ishami rya Butembo rya Philosophat Saint-Augustin y'i Kinshasa.\nMu 2002, bisabwe na Minisiteri y'Amashuri Makuru, ryahinduye izina riba Institut sup\u00e9rieur Emmanuel d'Alzon de Butembo (ISEAB). Kubera intambara z'inyeshyamba, abanyeshuri ntibari bagishobora kujya i Kinshasa, maze Minisiteri yemera ko ishuri ryakira n'abalayiki.\nKu wa 18 Mata 2003, iteka rya minisitiri ryemereye ishuri gutanga impamyabumenyi (graduat) muri filozofiya, mu bumenyi n'ubuhanga bw'iterambere, no mu itumanaho. Ku wa 22 Ugushyingo 2018, ISEAB yahindutse kaminuza yuzuye yitwa Universit\u00e9 de l'Assomption au Congo.\nImiyoborere.\nUAC iri munsi y'ubuyobozi bw'Abasomusiyonisiti. Yiyita kaminuza ya tekiniki yigenga ya Gatolika, ariko inyigisho zayo ntizishingiye ku idini. Mu 2023, umunyamabanga mukuru ushinzwe amasomo, Padiri Omer Kamate, yavuze ko ikibazo gikomeye ari ukubona abarimu bahoraho, kuko kaminuza ikoresha abarimu baturutse mu tundi turere.\nIkorana n'andi mashuri makuru, nka IFASIC mu itumanaho na Kaminuza ya Kinshasa (UNIKIN) mu yandi masomo.\nAmashami.\nKuva mu 2023, UAC ifite amashami (facult\u00e9s) atanu:\nKaminuza ifite kandi ishuri ry'ikirenga (\u00e9cole doctorale) n'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi.\nIbikorwaremezo.\nIkigo gikuru cya UAC kiri ku musozi wa Bulengera, ugerwaho n'umuhanda w'ibumba; ikindi kigo kiri i Kambali, hafi ya Radio Moto Butembo-Beni. Abanyeshuri biga itumanaho bimenyerereza kuri Radio na Televiziyo Moto. Kaminuza ifite kandi laboratwari y'ikoranabuhanga, laboratwari y'ibinyabuzima (biotechnologie), umurima wo gutubura insina, na gahunda yo gucunga imyanda, harimo gukora amapave mu masashe.\nAbanyeshuri n'amafaranga y'ishuri.\nMu 2023, UAC yari ifite abanyeshuri bagera kuri 900. Amafaranga yo kwiyandikisha ari hagati ya 340 na 500 by'amadolari y'Amerika, yishyurwa mu byiciro."}
{"id": "23217", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23217", "title": "Hassan Sheikh Mohamud", "text": "Hassan Sheikh Mohamud (mu Gisomali: \"Xasan Sheekh Maxamuud\"; yavutse ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 1955 i Jalalaqsi, mu ntara ya Hiiraan) ni umunyapolitiki akaba n'umwarimu wa kaminuza wa Somaliya, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva mu 2022, nyuma yo kuba yarakiyoboye bwa mbere kuva mu 2012 kugeza mu 2017. Mbere yo kwinjira muri politiki, yari umwarimu akaba n'umuyobozi muri SIMAD University, kaminuza yafatanyije gushinga i Mogadishu. Mu 2012, yatorewe n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko kuba perezida, maze ikinyamakuru \"Time\" kimushyira mu bantu 100 bavuga rikijyana ku isi mu 2013. Manda ye ya mbere yaranzwe n'ibitero by'umutwe wa al-Shabaab no kunengwa kubera ruswa n'ikoreshwa nabi ry'ububasha. Yatsinzwe mu 2017, ashinga ishyaka rya Union for Peace and Development, maze yongera gutorwa mu 2022. Mu 2026, kongererwa igihe kwa manda ye byateje impaka zikomeye.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nHassan Sheikh Mohamud yavukiye mu ntara ya Hiiraan. Se akomoka mu muryango w'Abagaal, umwe mu miryango migari y'Abahawiye, naho nyina akomoka mu muryango wa Hawadle. Yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye iwabo. Mu 1978, yimukiye i Mogadishu, aho yize imyaka itatu mu ishuri rikuru ry'ubumenyingiro, abona impamyabumenyi mu ikoranabuhanga mu 1981.\nMu 1986, yagiye mu Ubuhinde, yiga muri Kaminuza ya Bhopal (ubu yitwa Barkatullah University), aharangiriza impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu burezi bw'ubumenyingiro mu 1988. Mu 2001, yakurikiye amasomo y'ubuhuza n'ubwiyunge muri Eastern Mennonite University, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Mu Ukwakira 2022, yamuritse igitabo cy'ubushakashatsi bw'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD) mu mahoro, imiyoborere n'iterambere muri University for Peace, aba perezida wa mbere wa Somaliya ubikoze ari ku butegetsi.\nUmwuga mbere ya politiki.\nHassan yabanje kuba umwarimu mu ishuri ry'ubumenyingiro rya Lafole, hanyuma mu 1984 yinjira mu ishuri rikuru ryigisha abarimu b'ubumenyingiro rishamikiye kuri Kaminuza y'Igihugu ya Somaliya, aba umuyobozi w'ishami mu 1986. Ubwo intambara y'abenegihugu yadukaga mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, yagumye muri Somaliya, aba umujyanama w'imiryango itegamiye kuri leta n'ibigo by'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Kuva mu 1993 kugeza mu 1995, yari umukozi ushinzwe uburezi muri UNICEF mu majyepfo no hagati mu gihugu. Mu 1999, yafatanyije gushinga ikigo cy'imicungire n'ubuyobozi (SIMAD) i Mogadishu, cyaje kuba SIMAD University, akibera umuyobozi kugeza mu 2010. Yigishije kandi ikoranabuhanga muri Kaminuza ya Mogadishu.\nMu 2011, yashinze ishyaka rya Peace and Development Party (PDP), maze muri Mata 2011 aritorerwa kuriyobora. Muri Kanama 2012, yabaye umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko nshya ya Leta Yunze Ubumwe ya Somaliya.\nManda ya mbere (2012\u20132017).\nItorwa.\nKu ya 10 Nzeri 2012, abadepite bamutoreye kuba Perezida wa Somaliya. Mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'amatora, Perezida Sharif Sheikh Ahmed wari ku butegetsi yabaye uwa mbere n'amajwi 64, Hassan akurikiraho n'amajwi 60 ; mu cyiciro cya kabiri, Hassan yatsinze Sharif ku majwi 190 kuri 79. Nubwo habayeho ibirego bya ruswa n'igurwa ry'amajwi, Sharif yemeye ibyavuye mu matora. Itorwa rye ryashimwe n'umuryango mpuzamahanga, harimo Umuryango w'Abibumbye n'Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe. Yarahiriye kuba perezida ku ya 16 Nzeri 2012, maze ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2012 agira Abdi Farah Shirdon Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nIbitero byamwibasiye.\nKu ya 12 Nzeri 2012, iminsi ibiri nyuma yo gutorwa, abiyahuzi n'abantu bitwaje intwaro bagabye igitero kuri hoteli Jazeera i Mogadishu, aho yari ari mu nama n'intumwa z'amahanga; Hassan ntiyakomeretse, akomeza ijambo rye imbere y'abanyamakuru. Umutwe wa al-Shabaab wigambye icyo gitero. Ku ya 3 Nzeri 2013, igisasu cyaturikiye hafi y'imodoka zari ziherekeje perezida i Merca. Ku ya 7 Ukwakira 2015, abarwanyi ba al-Shabaab bishe mwishywa we, Dr Liban Osman, i Mogadishu. Ku ya 18 Werurwe 2025, al-Shabaab yongeye kugerageza kumwica ikoresheje ibisasu byatezwe ku muhanda hafi y'ingoro ya Villa Somalia.\nPolitiki y'imbere mu gihugu.\nUbutegetsi bwe bwashyize imbere guteza imbere serivisi z'ibanze nk'ubuzima n'uburezi, no kongera kubaka ibikorwa remezo birimo icyambu n'ikibuga cy'indege cya Mogadishu, imihanda, amashuri n'ibitaro. Guverinoma ye yasabye ko hakurwaho igihano cyo kubuza Somaliya kugura intwaro, cyari cyarashyizweho n'Akanama gashinzwe Umutekano ka Loni mu 1992, kugira ngo ingabo z'igihugu zibashe guhangana n'inyeshyamba z'abiyitirira Isilamu. Icyo gihano cyaroroshejwe by'agateganyo mu 2013, maze ku ya 5 Werurwe 2014 Akanama gashinzwe Umutekano kemeza ko iryo yoroshya rikomeza.\nMuri Mata 2013, yasubukuye ibiganiro by'ubwiyunge na Somaliland, intara yiyomoye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba, abisinyira i Ankara, muri Turukiya, na Perezida wa Somaliland Ahmed Mahamoud Silanyo. Muri Kanama 2013, guverinoma ye yasinye amasezerano y'ubwiyunge n'ubuyobozi bwigenga bwa Jubaland i Addis Abeba, muri Etiyopiya.\nManda ye ya mbere yaranzwe n'amakimbirane n'abaminisitiri b'intebe be: mu Ugushyingo 2013, yasabye Abdi Farah Shirdon kwegura, maze abadepite batangiza icyifuzo cyo kumweguza ; mu 2014, yagiranye andi makimbirane na Minisitiri w'Intebe Abdiweli Sheikh Ahmed ku bijyanye n'ivugurura rya guverinoma. Mu ntangiriro za 2016, ubutegetsi bwe bwagenzuraga igice gito cyane cy'igihugu, kandi ntiyabashije gukemura ikibazo cya Somaliland. Mu 2017, yatsinzwe amatora na Mohamed Abdullahi Mohamed \u00abFarmaajo\u00bb.\nManda ya kabiri (kuva mu 2022).\nKu ya 15 Gicurasi 2022, Hassan yongeye gutorwa kuba perezida, atsinda ku cyiciro cya gatatu Perezida Farmaajo wari ku butegetsi, wari waramutsinze mu 2017. Yiyemeje kugarura umutekano muri Somaliya, maze arahira ku ya 23 Gicurasi 2022. Ku ya 15 Kamena 2022, yagize Hamza Abdi Barre Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nKu ya 28 Ugushyingo 2024, mu makimbirane ku matora y'intara ya Jubaland, umucamanza wo muri iyo ntara yasohoye impapuro zo kumuta muri yombi, amushinja ubugambanyi no gushaka guteza intambara; guverinoma nkuru na yo yasohoye impapuro zo guta muri yombi Perezida wa Jubaland, Ahmed Madobe.\nMuri Gashyantare 2026, mu kiganiro na Al Jazeera, yamaganye iyemezwa rya Somaliland nk'igihugu kigenga ryakozwe na Isirayeli, avuga ko ari ukwivanga mu bibazo by'igihugu cye kandi ko Somaliya itazemera ko Isirayeli ishyira ikigo cya gisirikare muri Somaliland.\nKu ya 15 Gicurasi 2026, nubwo abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bavugaga ko manda ye irangiye uwo munsi, yatangaje ko Itegeko Nshinga ryavuguruwe ryongereye manda ya perezida kuva ku myaka ine ikagera ku myaka itanu, bityo manda ye ikazarangira ku ya 15 Gicurasi 2027.\nImpaka.\nManda ye ya mbere yanenzwe cyane kubera ruswa ikabije, kubuza itangazamakuru ubwisanzure no gukoresha nabi ububasha. Itsinda ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye rishinzwe kugenzura Somaliya ryashinje ubutegetsi bwe guha intwaro al-Shabaab, kandi raporo yo mu 2013 yavuze ko hari umugambi wo kunyereza umutungo wa leta.\nMuri Werurwe 2023, yagize umukobwa we, Jehan Hassan Sheikh Mohamud, umujyanama we mu bibazo mpuzamahanga, ibyo bikaba byarateje impaka, ndetse ambasaderi wa Somaliya muri Arabiya Sawudite yegura avuga ko yasuzuguwe n'abo hafi ya perezida.\nKu ya 30 Ugushyingo 2023, umuhungu we, Mohammed Hassan Sheikh Mohamud, yagonze umumotari w'Umunyaturukiya i Istanbul, ari mu modoka y'ambasade ya Somaliya; uwo mumotari yapfuye ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2023. Urukiko rwabanje kumukatira igifungo cy'imyaka ibiri n'igice, nyuma gihindurwa ihazabu.\nUbuzima bwite.\nHassan Sheikh Mohamud yashakanye na Qamar Ali Omar, bafitanye abana barindwi."}
{"id": "23218", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23218", "title": "Cyril Ramaphosa", "text": "Matamela Cyril Ramaphosa (yavutse ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 1952 i Soweto) ni umunyapolitiki akaba n'umucuruzi wa Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva muri Gashyantare 2018, akaba na perezida w'ishyaka rya African National Congress (ANC) kuva mu 2017. Yahoze ari impirimbanyi irwanya ivanguraruhu (\"apartheid\") n'umuyobozi w'ihuriro ry'abakozi bo mu birombe (NUM). Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, yari intumwa nkuru ya ANC mu mishyikirano yashyize iherezo kuri \"apartheid\", hanyuma ayobora Inteko Ishinga Itegeko Nshinga yateguye Itegeko Nshinga rya 1996. Nyuma yo kuva muri politiki mu 1996, yabaye umwe mu bacuruzi bakize kurusha abandi mu gihugu. Yagarutse muri politiki mu 2012, aba Visi-Perezida wa Repubulika kuva mu 2014 kugeza mu 2018, maze asimbura Jacob Zuma weguye. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2019 no mu 2024, ubwo ANC yatakazaga ubwiganze busesuye, bituma ashyiraho guverinoma y'ubumwe bw'igihugu. Yayoboye Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe kuva mu 2020 kugeza mu 2021.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nRamaphosa yavutse ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 1952 i Johannesburg, mu muryango woroheje ukomoka mu bwoko bw'Abavenda. Ni uwa kabiri mu bana batatu ba Erdmuth na Samuel Ramaphosa, wari umupolisi. Akiri umwana, agace k'iwabo karasenywe, umuryango we wimurirwa i Soweto. Yize mu mashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye i Soweto, hanyuma mu 1971 arangiriza amashuri yisumbuye i Sibasa, muri Venda.\nKu myaka 20, yatangiye kwiga amategeko muri Kaminuza y'Amajyaruguru (Turfloop). Yinjiye mu muryango w'abanyeshuri b'Abirabura (SASO), maze afungwa amezi cumi n'umwe mu 1974, yongera gufungwa mu 1976 nyuma y'imyivumbagatanyo ya Soweto. Yarangije amasomo y'amategeko muri Kaminuza ya Afurika y'Epfo (UNISA) mu 1981.\nIhuriro ry'abakozi no kurwanya \"apartheid\".\nMu 1981, Ramaphosa yabaye umujyanama mu by'amategeko w'ihuriro ry'amashyirahamwe y'abakozi (CUSA). Mu 1982, yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru w'ihuriro ry'abakozi bo mu birombe (National Union of Mineworkers, NUM) ryari rimaze gushingwa, aho yayoboye imyigaragambyo ikomeye yo mu 1987, yabaye nini kurusha izindi mu mateka y'igihugu.\nMu 1991, yatorewe kuba umunyamabanga mukuru wa ANC, iyobowe na Nelson Mandela, maze aba intumwa nkuru ya ANC mu mishyikirano yashyize iherezo kuri \"apartheid\". Nyuma y'amatora ya mbere ya demokarasi yo muri Mata 1994, ku ya 24 Gicurasi 1994 yatorewe kuyobora Inteko Ishinga Itegeko Nshinga, ayobora itegurwa ry'Itegeko Nshinga ryemejwe mu 1996. Bamwe bamufataga nk'uwo Mandela yifuzaga ko azamusimbura, ariko mu 1997 Thabo Mbeki ni we wamusimbuye ku buyobozi bwa ANC.\nUmwuga mu bucuruzi.\nNyuma yo kuva muri politiki mu 1996, Ramaphosa yabaye umucuruzi ukomeye, abifashijwemo na politiki yo guteza imbere Abirabura mu bukungu. Yashinze ikigo cy'ishoramari cya Shanduka, cyashoye imari mu birombe, mu mitungo itimukanwa no mu masosiyete nka McDonald's na Coca-Cola muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yabaye kandi umuyobozi w'inama y'ubutegetsi ya MTN n'umwe mu bagize iy'ikigo cy'ubucukuzi Lonmin. Mu 2018, umutungo we wagereranywaga n'amadolari arenga miliyoni 450.\nMu Kanama 2012, ubwo yari mu buyobozi bwa Lonmin, abakozi b'ikirombe cya Marikana bakoze imyigaragambyo, maze polisi irasa abacukuzi 34. Ramaphosa yanenzwe kuba yarashyigikiye ko polisi itabara; nubwo komisiyo y'iperereza yamugize umwere, mu 2017 yasabye imbabazi ku ruhare rwe muri ayo makuba.\nKugaruka muri politiki.\nMu Ukuboza 2012, Ramaphosa yagarutse muri politiki, atorerwa kuba visi-perezida wa ANC. Ku ya 3 Kamena 2014, yabaye Visi-Perezida wa Repubulika ku butegetsi bwa Jacob Zuma, anayobora komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe igenamigambi.\nKu ya 18 Ukuboza 2017, yatorewe kuyobora ANC n'amajwi 2 440, atsinda Nkosazana Dlamini-Zuma wagize amajwi 2 261. Icyo gihe, ANC yari mu bihe bikomeye: Perezida Zuma yari yugarijwe n'ibirego bya ruswa, ubushomeri bwari bugeze kuri 30%, kandi ubusumbane bwari bukabije.\nPerezida wa Afurika y'Epfo.\nManda ya mbere (2018\u20132024).\nMuri Gashyantare 2018, nyuma y'imishyikirano hagati ya ANC na Zuma, Zuma yeguye ku ya 14 Gashyantare 2018, amaze gukangishwa kweguzwa. Ku ya 15 Gashyantare 2018, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yatoreye Ramaphosa kuba Perezida wa Repubulika nta wundi bahatanye. Amasoko y'imari yahise yakira neza itorwa rye. Ku ya 26 Gashyantare 2018, yavuguruye guverinoma, akuramo abaminisitiri benshi bavugwagaho ibibazo ku butegetsi bwa Zuma, kandi agira David Mabuza Visi-Perezida.\nYashyigikiye ivugurura ry'ubutaka \u00abrikomeye\u00bb, maze mu mpera za Gashyantare 2018 Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yemeza umushinga wo kwambura ubutaka nta ngurane, hagamijwe gukosora ubusumbane bwasizwe na \"apartheid\". Muri Kanama 2018, yahagaritse umushinga wo kongera inganda z'ingufu za kirimbuzi, ashyira imbere ingufu zisubira.\nMu matora rusange yo muri Gicurasi 2019, ANC iyobowe na we yabonye amajwi 57,50%, amanota yo hasi kurusha ayo yari yarigeze kubona kugeza icyo gihe ; ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2019, Inteko yongeye kumutora kuba perezida. Ku ya 10 Gashyantare 2020, yafashe ubuyobozi bw'Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe, asimbuye Abdel Fattah al-Sissi. Yayoboye kandi uburyo igihugu cyahanganye n'icyorezo cya COVID-19, ndetse n'imyivumbagatanyo ya 2021, yabaye mibi kurusha izindi kuva \"apartheid\" irangiye.\nKu ya 11 Kanama 2021, imbere ya komisiyo yakoraga iperereza kuri ruswa yo ku butegetsi bwa Zuma, yemeye ko icyo gihe ruswa yari yarashinze imizi mu nzego za leta.\nManda ya kabiri (kuva mu 2024).\nMu matora rusange ya 2024, ANC yabonye amajwi 40,18% gusa, itakaza ubwiganze busesuye bwa mbere kuva \"apartheid\" irangiye; ishyaka rishya Umkhonto we Sizwe (MK) rya Jacob Zuma ryabaye irya gatatu. Ku ya 14 Kamena 2024, Inteko yongeye gutorera Ramaphosa kuba perezida, ashyigikiwe n'ishyaka rya Democratic Alliance n'andi mashyaka, maze ashyiraho guverinoma y'ubumwe bw'igihugu. Yarahiriye ku ya 19 Kamena 2024 i Pretoria.\nMuri Mutarama 2025, yasinye itegeko ryemerera leta kwambura ubutaka nta ngurane mu bihe bimwe, risimbura itegeko rya 1975 ryasabaga ko ba nyir'ubutaka bahabwa ingurane; iryo tegeko ryateje impaka ndetse no muri guverinoma ye. Muri uko kwezi, imiryango 25 y'abakorewe ibyaha mu gihe cya \"apartheid\" yareze guverinoma ye, iyishinja kudakora iperereza rihagije kuri ibyo byaha.\nKu ya 7 Ugushyingo 2025, nyuma y'uko Madagasikari yeguye ku buyobozi bw'Umuryango w'Iterambere ry'Afurika y'Amajyepfo (SADC), Ramaphosa yahawe kuwuyobora by'agateganyo.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nUrugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga nka perezida yarukoreye muri Angola muri Werurwe 2018. Ku ya 20 Werurwe 2018, yasuye Kigali, mu Rwanda, ahura na Perezida Paul Kagame baganira ku kuzahura umubano w'ibihugu byombi, maze ku munsi ukurikiyeho asinya amasezerano ya Kigali ashyiraho isoko rusange ry'Afurika (ZLECAf). Muri Nyakanga 2018, yakiriye inama y'ibihugu bya BRICS i Johannesburg.\nNyuma y'igitero cy'Uburusiya muri Ukraine mu 2022, Ramaphosa yanze kwamagana Uburusiya cyangwa kubufatira ibihano, avuga ko kutagira aho abogamira ari ngombwa ngo abashe guhuza impande zombi. Muri Kamena 2023, yayoboye intumwa z'abakuru b'ibihugu by'Afurika zasuye Kyiv na Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg zitwaje umugambi w'amahoro, ariko Perezida Vladimir Putin awanga.\nRamaphosa yasabye ko intambara ya Gaza ihagarara, anenga ikumira ry'ibiribwa n'ibindi bikenerwa muri Gaza. Ku ya 29 Ukuboza 2023, Afurika y'Epfo yareze Isirayeli mu Rukiko Mpuzamahanga rw'Ubutabera (CIJ), iyishinja jenoside.\nMuri Mutarama 2025, nyuma y'urupfu rw'abasirikare 13 b'Afurika y'Epfo bari mu butumwa bw'amahoro mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Minisitiri w'Ingabo wa Afurika y'Epfo yavuze ko Ramaphosa yari yaburiye Leta y'u Rwanda ko ibitero bikomeje byafatwa nk'\u00abitangazwa ry'intambara\u00bb. Ramaphosa yanditse ku rubuga rwa X ashinja ingabo z'u Rwanda kuba ari zo zabishe ; Leta y'u Rwanda yarabihakanye.\nKu ya 21 Gicurasi 2025, Ramaphosa yakiriwe muri White House na Perezida Donald Trump, mu gihe umubano w'ibihugu byombi wari warajemo agatotsi nyuma y'uko Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika zihaye ubuhungiro Abanyafurika y'Epfo b'Abazungu (Abafurikaneri) 59, zivuga ko batotezwa, ndetse no kubera itegeko ryo kwambura ubutaka.\nImpaka.\nMuri Kamena 2019, hatangijwe iperereza ku nkunga yahawe n'ikigo cy'ubucuruzi mu gihe cyo kwiyamamariza kuyobora ANC mu 2017. Yahuye kandi n'abamurwanya muri ANC, bari bagishyigikiye Jacob Zuma.\nMuri Kamena 2022, uwahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru w'ubutasi yatanze ikirego amushinja ko muri Gashyantare 2020 yahishe ubujura bwabereye mu murima we wa Phala Phala, aho abajura bari bibye amadolari menshi yari ahishwe mu ntebe. Mu Ugushyingo 2022, komisiyo y'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yavuze ko hari impamvu zihagije zo kuganira ku kumweguza, ariko muri Werurwe 2023 umuvunyi (\"Public Protector\") yavuze ko nta mategeko yishe. Mu Ukwakira 2024, amashyaka abiri atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi yitabaje Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga asaba ko iyo dosiye isubukurwa. Muri Nyakanga 2026, urukiko rwahagaritse by'agateganyo inzira yo kumweguza yari yatangijwe n'Inteko, mu gihe ategereje igisubizo ku cyifuzo cye cyo kujuririra raporo ivuga ko yaba yarishe Itegeko Nshinga.\nUbuzima bwite.\nRamaphosa yashakanye na Tshepo Motsepe, mushiki w'umuherwe Patrice Motsepe; afite abana bane. Ikinyamakuru \"Forbes\" cyamushyize mu bacuruzi bakize kurusha abandi mu gihugu, kandi ni we Munyafurika y'Epfo w'Umwirabura wa mbere wabaye umuherwe ufite miliyari."}
{"id": "23219", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23219", "title": "Salva Kiir", "text": "Salva Kiir Mayardit (yavutse ku ya 13 Nzeri 1951 i Akon, mu karere ka Gogrial) ni umusirikare akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Sudani y\u2019Amajyepfo, Perezida wa mbere w'icyo gihugu kuva cyabona ubwigenge ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2011. Akomoka mu bwoko bw'Abadinka. Yinjiye mu nyeshyamba za Anyanya mu ntambara ya mbere y'abenegihugu ya Sudani, hanyuma aba umwungirije wa John Garang mu mutwe wa Sudan People's Liberation Army (SPLA) mu ntambara ya kabiri. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa Garang mu 2005, yamusimbuye ku buyobozi bwa SPLA, aba Perezida w'akarere kigenga ka Sudani y'Amajyepfo na Visi-Perezida wa mbere wa Sudani kugeza mu 2011. Ubutegetsi bwe bwaranzwe n'intambara y'abenegihugu yatangiye mu 2013 hagati y'abamushyigikiye n'aba Riek Machar wahoze ari visi-perezida we, yahitanye abantu bagera ku 400 000, ndetse n'ibirego bikomeye byo guhohotera uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nSalva Kiir yavukiye mu mudugudu wa Akon, mu muryango w'aborozi b'Abadinka bo mu gace ka Awan-Chan, mu karere ka Gogrial, muri leta ya Warrap; icyo gihe ako gace kari mu Sudani yategekwaga n'Abongereza n'Abanyamisiri. Ni uwa munani mu bana icyenda ba nyina (abahungu batandatu n'abakobwa batatu). Se, Kuethpiny Thiik Atem (wapfuye mu 2007), yari umworozi w'inka wo mu muryango wa Payum, akagira abagore batatu n'abana 16; nyina, Awiei Rou Wol, yari umuhinzi wo mu muryango wa Payii.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nMu 1967, Kiir yinjiye mu nyeshyamba za Anyanya zarwaniraga ubwigenge bw'amajyepfo ya Sudani mu ntambara ya mbere y'abenegihugu. Ubwo amasezerano ya Addis Abeba yasinywaga mu 1972, yari umusirikare mukuru wo ku rwego rwo hasi, maze yinjizwa mu ngabo za Sudani nk'uko ayo masezerano yabiteganyaga. Mu 1983, ubwo intambara ya kabiri y'abenegihugu yadukaga, yinjiye mu mutwe wa Sudan People's Liberation Movement (SPLM) washinzwe na John Garang n'ingabo zawo, SPLA, aba umwungirije wa Garang. Mu 1997, yayoboye ingabo za SPLA mu gitero cyiswe \"Operation Thunderbolt\", cyatumye SPLA yigarurira igice kinini cy'intara ya Equatoria y'Iburengerazuba. Mu 2004, ibihuha by'uko yaba agiye kuvanwa ku mwanya w'umugaba mukuru wa SPLA byenda gucamo uwo mutwe ibice.\nMbere y'ubwigenge.\nNyuma y'amasezerano y'amahoro rusange (\"Comprehensive Peace Agreement\") yo muri Mutarama 2005, Garang yabaye Visi-Perezida wa Sudani, ariko apfa azize impanuka y'indege ya kajugujugu ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2005. Ku ya 11 Kanama 2005, Kiir yamusimbuye, aba Perezida w'akarere kigenga ka Sudani y'Amajyepfo na Visi-Perezida wa mbere wa Repubulika ya Sudani. Yafatwaga nk'uharanira ubwigenge kurusha Garang. Mu Ukwakira 2009, yavuze ko kamarampaka yari iteganyijwe izaba ari uguhitamo hagati yo kuba \u00abumuturage wo ku rwego rwa kabiri mu gihugu cyawe\u00bb cyangwa \u00abumuntu wigenga mu gihugu cyawe kigenga\u00bb.\nMu matora ya Mata 2010, yongeye gutorerwa kuyobora Sudani y'Amajyepfo n'amajwi 93%; nubwo ayo matora yanenzwe n'indorerezi mpuzamahanga, iyo tsinzi yafashwe nk'intambwe ya mbere iganisha ku kwigenga. Perezida Omar El Bechir yongeye kumugira Visi-Perezida wa mbere wa Sudani.\nPerezida wa Sudani y'Amajyepfo.\nUbwigenge.\nMuri kamarampaka yabaye kuva ku ya 9 kugeza ku ya 15 Mutarama 2011, 98,83% by'abatoye bahisemo ubwigenge. Ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2011, Sudani y'Amajyepfo yabaye igihugu cyigenga, Kiir aba Perezida wacyo wa mbere. Mu ijambo rye ry'irahira, yasabye abaturage \u00abkubabarira nubwo tutazibagirwa\u00bb akarengane bakorewe na Sudani y'amajyaruguru, anatangaza imbabazi rusange ku mitwe yari yararwanyije SPLM. Nyuma y'ibyumweru bike, yaburiye abasirikare n'abapolisi ko gufata ku ngufu, iyicarubozo n'ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu bizakurikiranwa n'inkiko.\nPolitiki y'imbere mu gihugu.\nMuri Kamena 2013, yahagaritse ku mirimo abaminisitiri babiri bakekwagaho ruswa. Kuva mu mpera za 2012, nyuma y'ibihuha by'umugambi wo guhirika ubutegetsi, yavuguruye mu buryo butigeze bubaho ubuyobozi bwa guverinoma, ishyaka n'ingabo, yirukana abajenerali benshi. Muri Nyakanga 2013, yasheshe guverinoma yose, yirukana na Visi-Perezida Riek Machar, wari watangaje ko azahatanira umwanya wa perezida mu matora ya 2015. Machar yavuze ko iyo ari intambwe igana ku gitugu.\nHagati y'Ukuboza 2011 na Gashyantare 2012, imirwano hagati y'Abanuweri ba Lou n'Abamurle yahitanye abantu bagera kuri 800; kubura ubutabera kuri ubwo bwicanyi byanenzwe cyane. Ku butegetsi bwe kandi, abanyamakuru benshi barishwe: mu 2015, umunyamakuru Moi Peter Julius yarashwe i Juba, iminsi itatu nyuma y'uko Kiir avuga mu ruhame amagambo yafashwe nk'iterabwoba ku banyamakuru, kandi abanyamakuru batanu ba radiyo Raja FM bishwe mu gitero cyagabwe ku modoka bari barimo. Muri Mutarama 2023, abakozi batandatu b'ikigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru batawe muri yombi nyuma y'ikwirakwizwa ry'amashusho yerekana perezida mu muhango wo gutaha umuhanda, amashusho yateje impungenge ku buzima bwe; barekuwe nta cyaha baregwa.\nIntambara y'abenegihugu.\nKu ya 15 Ukuboza 2013, nyuma y'inama y'ishyaka SPLM, imirwano yadukiye i Juba mu ngabo zirinda perezida. Bukeye, Kiir yashinje Machar n'abandi bayobozi gutegura kudeta, ibyo Machar yahakanye. Ibyo byabaye intangiriro y'intambara y'abenegihugu, yarimo n'amakimbirane ashingiye ku moko hagati y'Abadinka (ubwoko bwa Kiir) n'Abanuweri (ubwoko bwa Machar). Kugeza muri Mata 2018, iyo ntambara yari imaze guhitana abantu bagera ku 400 000. Mu 2017, ibice bimwe by'igihugu byibasiwe n'inzara, imiryango mpuzamahanga ivuga ko yatewe n'abantu kubera intambara ; abayobozi ba Loni bashinje guverinoma ya Kiir kubuza ko ibiribwa bigera mu duce tumwe.\nNyuma y'amasezerano y'agahenge yasinywe i Khartoum muri Kamena 2018, byemejwe ko Machar asubira ku mwanya wa Visi-Perezida wa mbere. Muri Nyakanga 2018, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yongereye manda ya Kiir imyaka itatu, kugeza mu 2021. Muri Kanama 2018, andi masezerano yasinyiwe i Khartoum yashyizeho guverinoma y'inzibacyuho, Kiir aha imbabazi Machar n'indi mitwe yitwaje intwaro, maze ku ya 12 Nzeri 2018 amasezerano y'amahoro asinyirwa i Addis Abeba. Nyuma y'ibiganiro byinshi, guverinoma y'ubumwe bw'igihugu yashyizweho ku ya 12 Werurwe 2020.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nMu Ukwakira 2011, Kiir yatangaje ko Sudani y'Amajyepfo isabye kwinjira mu Muryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EAC). Mu Ukuboza 2011, yasuye Isirayeli ayishimira inkunga yahaye inyeshyamba mu ntambara ya mbere y'abenegihugu.\nMuri Werurwe 2012, ingabo za Sudani y'Amajyepfo zateye ikigo cy'ubucukuzi bwa peteroli cya Heglig, ku mupaka na Sudani, bituma habaho intambara ngufi ku mupaka. Ku ya 27 Nzeri 2012, Kiir na Perezida Omar El Bechir basinyiye i Addis Abeba amasezerano umunani yatumye ibyoherezwa mu mahanga bya peteroli bisubukurwa, hashyirwaho n'agace katarimo ingabo ku mupaka.\nNyuma y'itangira ry'intambara y'abenegihugu, Kiir yashinje Umuryango w'Abibumbye n'imiryango y'ubutabazi gushyigikira Machar. Ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 2023, yatorewe kuyobora Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba mu gihe cy'umwaka umwe. Ku ya 5 Nyakanga 2023, yari yatangaje ko aziyamamariza amatora ya perezida.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKiir ni Umukristo Gatolika. Mu 2006, ubwo yasuraga White House, Perezida George W. Bush yamuhaye ingofero y'umukara yo mu bwoko bwa \"stetson\"; kuva icyo gihe, ntajya agaragara mu ruhame atayambaye."}
{"id": "23220", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23220", "title": "Abdel Fattah al-Burhan", "text": "Abdel Fattah al-Burhan Abdelrahman al-Burhan (yavutse ku ya 11 Nyakanga 1960 i Gandatu) ni umusirikare mukuru wa Sudani, uyoboye icyo gihugu kuva mu 2019. Nyuma y'impinduramatwara yo muri Mata 2019 yahiritse Perezida Omar El Bechir, yagizwe umuyobozi w'akanama ka gisirikare k'inzibacyuho, hanyuma ayobora Inama y'Ubusugire y'Inzibacyuho yari ihuriweho n'abasirikare n'abasivili. Mu Ukwakira 2021, yakoze kudeta ihirika guverinoma ya gisivili ya Minisitiri w'Intebe Abdallah Hamdok, maze yongera gushyiraho Inama y'Ubusugire ayobora. Kuva muri Mata 2023, ayoboye ingabo za Sudani mu ntambara y'abenegihugu zihanganyemo n'umutwe wa Rapid Support Forces (RSF). Mu Mutarama 2025, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika zamufatiye ibihano.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nAbdel Fattah al-Burhan yavutse mu 1960 mu mudugudu wa Gandatu, mu majyaruguru ya Khartoum, mu muryango w'Abasufi wo mu bwoko bw'Abajaalin. Yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye iwabo n'i Shendi, hanyuma yinjira mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Sudani. Yakurikiye amahugurwa ya gisirikare mu Misiri no muri Yorudaniya.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nAl-Burhan yatangiye ari umusirikare mu ngabo zirinda imipaka, aza kuziyobora; yarwanye mu ntambara ya Darfur no mu ntambara ya kabiri y'abenegihugu ya Sudani, anaba umuyobozi w'ingabo mu karere ka Darfur. Yabaye umugaba wungirije w'ibikorwa by'ingabo zirwanira ku butaka, hanyuma mu 2018 aba umugaba w'ingabo zirwanira ku butaka. Yateguye kohereza ingabo za Sudani muri Yemeni mu ntambara y'abenegihugu yaho, akaba ari na we wahuzaga Sudani na Arabiya Sawudite na Nyarabu Zunze Ubumwe. Muri Gashyantare 2019, mu gihe cy'imyigaragambyo yamaganaga ubutegetsi bwa Omar El Bechir, yagizwe umugenzuzi mukuru w'ingabo, ahabwa ipeti rya jenerali liyetona.\nUbuyobozi bw'inzibacyuho.\nAkanama ka gisirikare k'inzibacyuho.\nKu ya 12 Mata 2019, al-Burhan yasimbuye Ahmed Awad Ibn Auf ku buyobozi bw'akanama ka gisirikare k'inzibacyuho kari kamaze gushyirwaho nyuma yo guhirika Omar El Bechir. Bitandukanye n'uwo yasimbuye, ntiyafatwaga nk'inkingi y'ubutegetsi bwa kera. Yategetse ko abari bafunzwe na El Bechir barekurwa, kandi yizeza ko inzibacyuho itazarenza imyaka ibiri. Urugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga yarukoreye mu Misiri, ahura na Perezida Abdel Fattah al-Sissi, hanyuma muri Nyarabu Zunze Ubumwe.\nKu ya 3 Kamena 2019, inzego z'umutekano, zirimo umutwe wa RSF, zatatanyije ku ngufu abigaragambyaga bari bakambitse imbere y'icyicaro gikuru cy'ingabo i Khartoum. Abantu benshi bararashwe, imirambo imwe iterwa mu ruzi rwa Nili, kandi imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu yavuze ko abantu amagana bakorewe iyicarubozo n'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina. Nyuma y'ubwo bwicanyi, ibiganiro n'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi byarahagaze, kandi interineti irahagarikwa, ibyo Human Rights Watch yise \u00abihohoterwa rikomeye ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu\u00bb.\nInama y'Ubusugire y'Inzibacyuho.\nKu ya 20 Kanama 2019, nyuma y'amasezerano hagati y'abasirikare n'ihuriro ry'abasivili, hashyizweho Inama y'Ubusugire y'Inzibacyuho igizwe n'abantu cumi n'umwe, iyobowe na al-Burhan; yarahiye bukeye bwaho. Amasezerano y'amahoro ya Juba yo mu Ukwakira 2020 yongereye igihe cy'inzibacyuho, bituma al-Burhan akomeza kuyobora iyo nama aho kuyivaho muri 2021 nk'uko byari biteganyijwe.\nMuri Gashyantare 2020, al-Burhan yahuriye i Entebbe, muri Ubugande, na Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Isirayeli Benjamin Netanyahu. Yagize uruhare rukomeye mu isubukurwa ry'umubano hagati ya Sudani na Isirayeli, ryemejwe ku ya 23 Ukwakira 2020, nubwo ritavugwagaho rumwe muri guverinoma no mu baturage; yarisobanuraga avuga inyungu z'ubukungu, cyane cyane kuvanwa kwa Sudani ku rutonde rw'Amerika rw'ibihugu bishyigikira iterabwoba.\nKudeta ya 2021.\nKu ya 25 Ukwakira 2021, al-Burhan yayoboye kudeta yahiritse guverinoma ya gisivili: Minisitiri w'Intebe Abdallah Hamdok n'abaminisitiri benshi barafashwe, hatangazwa ibihe bidasanzwe, interineti irahagarikwa, kandi imyigaragambyo ishyigikira ubutegetsi bwa gisivili iramagurwa. Ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 2021, yashyizeho Inama y'Ubusugire nshya ayobora. Ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 2021, Hamdok yasubijwe ku mwanya we ku bw'amasezerano n'amashyaka y'abasivili, ariko yegura muri Mutarama 2022. Mu mwaka wakurikiye kudeta, abigaragambyaga 117 barishwe.\nNyuma ya kudeta, al-Burhan yashyize abayoboke b'imitwe ya Kisilamu bari bakomeye ku butegetsi bwa El Bechir mu nzego z'ubutegetsi, cyane cyane mu ngabo. Muri Gashyantare 2023, yahuye na Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga w'Uburusiya, Sergey Lavrov.\nIntambara y'abenegihugu.\nKu ya 15 Mata 2023, umutwe wa Rapid Support Forces (RSF) uyobowe na Jenerali Mohamed Hamdan Dagalo \u00abHemedti\u00bb, wari umwungirije, wagabye ibitero ku birindiro by'ingabo mu gihugu hose, uvuga ko wigaruriye ingoro ya perezida n'ikibuga cy'indege cya Khartoum. Al-Burhan yamaze amezi menshi agotewe ku cyicaro gikuru cy'ingabo i Khartoum, kugeza muri Kanama 2023 ubwo yavanwagayo akajya i Port-Soudan, aho guverinoma ye ikorera kuva icyo gihe. Bivugwa ko RSF yahawe inkunga na Libiya, Nyarabu Zunze Ubumwe n'umutwe w'Abarusiya wa Wagner.\nMuri Nyakanga 2024, al-Burhan yarokotse igitero cy'indege itagira umupilote cyagabwe ku kigo cya gisirikare cya Gebeit, aho yari yitabiriye umuhango wo gusoza amasomo y'abasirikare; abantu batanu barapfuye.\nKu ya 16 Mutarama 2025, Minisiteri y'Imari ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika yamufatiye ibihano, imushinja kwibasira abasivili n'ibikorwa remezo byabo, kubuza ubutabazi kugera ku baturage, kwanga kwitabira ibiganiro by'amahoro no guhungabanya inzira igana ku butegetsi bwa gisivili. Muri Kanama 2025, intumwa ye yasuye Isirayeli igamije kwihutisha ivugururwa ry'umubano w'ibihugu byombi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAl-Burhan afite umugore n'abana batatu. Ku ya 6 Werurwe 2024, umuhungu we, Mohammed, yakomeretse bikomeye mu mpanuka y'ipikipiki i Ankara, muri Turukiya, apfa ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2024."}
{"id": "23221", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23221", "title": "Samia Suluhu Hassan", "text": "Samia Suluhu Hassan (yavutse ku ya 27 Mutarama 1960 muri Zanzibar) ni umunyapolitiki wa Tanzaniya, Perezida wa gatandatu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 19 Werurwe 2021. Ni we mugore wa mbere wabaye Perezida wa Tanzaniya. Umuyoboke w'ishyaka riri ku butegetsi rya Chama Cha Mapinduzi (CCM), yabanje kuba minisitiri muri guverinoma ya Zanzibar (2000\u20132010), hanyuma aba umudepite na Minisitiri wa Leta ushinzwe ibibazo by'Ubumwe (2010\u20132015). Mu 2015, yabaye umugore wa mbere wabaye Visi-Perezida wa Tanzaniya, iruhande rwa John Magufuli, maze amusimbura nyuma y'urupfu rwe muri Werurwe 2021. Mu ntangiriro ya manda ye, yafatwaga nk'umuntu uharanira impinduka n'ubwisanzure, ariko amatora ya 2025, yatsinze n'amajwi 97,66% nyuma y'uko ishyaka rikomeye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi ribujijwe kwitabira, yakurikiwe n'imyigaragambyo yahosheshejwe ku ngufu, bituma ubutegetsi bwe bufatwa n'abasesenguzi benshi nk'ubw'igitugu.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nSamia Suluhu yavutse ku ya 27 Mutarama 1960 muri Sultani ya Zanzibar, ku mwarimu n'umugore we; nyuma y'imyaka ine, Zanzibar yihuje na Tanganyika bibyara Tanzaniya. Yarangije amashuri yisumbuye mu 1977, atangira gukora nk'umwanditsi mu biro, muri Minisiteri y'Igenamigambi n'Iterambere.\nYakomeje amasomo igihe gito: mu 1986, yabonye impamyabumenyi mu buyobozi bwa leta mu ishuri rikuru ry'imicungire y'iterambere (ubu ni Mzumbe University). Kuva mu 1992 kugeza mu 1994, yize muri Kaminuza ya Manchester, mu Bwongereza, abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya nyuma ya kaminuza mu bukungu. Mu 2015, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu iterambere ry'ubukungu bw'abaturage, binyuze muri gahunda ihuriweho na Open University of Tanzania na Southern New Hampshire University.\nMu 1988, yabaye umukozi ushinzwe iterambere muri guverinoma ya Zanzibar, hanyuma ayobora umushinga w'Ishami rya Loni ryita ku biribwa (PAM). Mu myaka ya 1990, yayoboye urwego rugenzura imiryango itegamiye kuri leta muri Zanzibar.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMu 2000, Samia Suluhu yinjiye mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Zanzibar ku rutonde rwa CCM, maze Perezida Amani Abeid Karume amugira Minisitiri w'Umurimo w'Urubyiruko, Abagore n'Abana. Muri uwo mwanya, yakuyeho itegeko ryabuzaga abakobwa babyaye gusubira mu ishuri. Ni we mugore wenyine wari minisitiri ukomeye muri guverinoma, kandi bagenzi be b'abagabo bakunze kutamuha agaciro kubera ko ari umugore. Mu 2005, yongeye gutorwa, agirwa Minisitiri w'Ubukerarugendo, Ubucuruzi n'Ishoramari.\nMu 2010, yatorewe kuba umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'igihugu, uhagarariye Makunduchi, n'amajwi arenga 80%. Perezida Jakaya Kikwete yamugize Minisitiri wa Leta ushinzwe ibibazo by'Ubumwe. Mu 2014, yatorewe kuba visi-perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Itegeko Nshinga yari ishinzwe gutegura Itegeko Nshinga rishya.\nVisi-Perezida.\nMuri Nyakanga 2015, umukandida wa CCM ku mwanya wa perezida, John Magufuli, yamuhisemo nk'umukandida ku mwanya wa visi-perezida, bitunguranye kuko hari abanyapolitiki bakomeye kurusha we ; ni we mugore wa mbere wahawe uwo mwanya mu mateka y'ishyaka. Batsinze amatora, maze ku ya 5 Ugushyingo 2015 arahirira kuba umugore wa mbere ubaye Visi-Perezida wa Tanzaniya. Mu 2020, bongeye gutorwa, nubwo indorerezi zigenga zavuze ko habayeho uburiganya.\nPerezida wa Tanzaniya.\nKujya ku butegetsi.\nKu ya 17 Werurwe 2021, Samia Suluhu yatangaje kuri televiziyo urupfu rwa Perezida Magufuli, wari umaze igihe atagaragara mu ruhame. Yarahiriye kuba perezida ku ya 19 Werurwe 2021, kugira ngo arangize manda ya kabiri ya Magufuli. Bivugwa ko hari ibice by'ishyaka byagerageje kumubuza kuba perezida. Yabaye umugore wa mbere uyoboye Tanzaniya, n'umuntu wa kabiri ukomoka muri Zanzibar ubaye perezida, nyuma ya Ali Hassan Mwinyi. Yagize Philip Mpango Visi-Perezida, yirukana abari inkoramutima za Magufuli, kandi yegera uwahoze ari Perezida Jakaya Kikwete.\nManda ya mbere.\nBitandukanye n'uwo yasimbuye wahakanaga uburemere bw'icyorezo cya COVID-19, Samia Suluhu yafashe ingamba zo kukirwanya: yategetse akato k'iminsi 14 ku bagenzi baturuka mu bihugu byagaragayemo ubwoko bushya bwa virusi, maze muri Nyakanga 2021 Tanzaniya yinjira muri gahunda ya COVAX yo gukingira. Yiyemeje kurangiza imishinga minini yatangijwe na Magufuli, irimo umuhanda wa gari ya moshi n'urugomero rw'amashanyarazi, no kugeza amashanyarazi n'amazi meza mu byaro. Yashyize imbere ubukerarugendo n'ishoramari ry'abanyamahanga, ndetse mu 2021 akina muri filime \"The Royal Tour\" igamije kumenyekanisha Tanzaniya. Mu 2022, ikinyamakuru \"Time\" cyamushyize mu bantu 100 bavuga rikijyana ku isi.\nMu ntangiriro ya manda ye, yafatwaga nk'umuntu uharanira demokarasi kurusha Magufuli. Yarekuye imfungwa za politiki, ahura n'abayobozi b'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, kandi yemerera ibinyamakuru byari byarafunzwe kongera gukora. Umuyobozi w'ishyaka rya Chadema, Freeman Mbowe, wari wafashwe muri 2021 ashinjwa iterabwoba, yararekuwe ibyaha bivanwaho, maze muri Werurwe 2022 ahura na perezida. Muri Gashyantare 2022, i Buruseli, yahuye na Tundu Lissu, umukandida wa Chadema mu matora ya 2020 wari mu buhungiro. Mu 2023, yakuyeho itegeko ryabuzaga amashyaka gukora inama rusange. Muri Kanama 2021, amagambo yavuze ku isura y'abakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru b'abagore yateje impaka.\nAmatora ya 2025 n'igitugu.\nMuri Mutarama 2025, CCM yamutanze nk'umukandida wayo mu matora rusange yo mu Ukwakira 2025. Ishyaka rikomeye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Chadema, ryabujijwe kwitabira amatora, kandi umuyobozi waryo, Tundu Lissu, arafatwa ashinjwa ubugambanyi. Yatangajwe nk'uwatsinze amatora n'amajwi agera kuri 97%, maze ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 2025 arahira mu muhango utarimo abaturage. Indorerezi z'Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe zavuze ko ayo matora atubahirije amahame y'akarere n'ay'isi.\nIbyavuye mu matora byakurikiwe n'imyigaragambyo n'imvururu zahosheshejwe ku ngufu, interineti irahagarikwa. Imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu yashinje guverinoma ye gutegeka ko abasivili baraswa amasasu nyayo; Chadema yavuze ko yabaruye abantu bagera ku 1 000 bishwe, yita ibyo byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Raporo za Loni zavuze ko abantu amagana bapfuye. Guverinoma yemeye ko hari abapfuye, ariko ivuga ko imibare y'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi \u00abikabije cyane\u00bb.\nAbasesenguzi benshi babona ko ubutegetsi bwe bwahindutse ubw'igitugu ; \"The Economist\" yavuze mu 2025 ko abantu benshi batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi baburiwe irengero. Muri Mutarama 2026, umuryango Index on Censorship wamwise \u00abUmunyagitugu w'umwaka wa 2025\u00bb kubera ihonyorwa ry'ubwisanzure bwo kuvuga.\nItegeko Nshinga rya Tanzaniya ntirimwemerera kongera kwiyamamaza mu 2030, kuko yabaye perezida asimbuye uwari ku butegetsi hasigaye imyaka irenga itatu ngo manda irangire.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1978, Samia Suluhu yashakanye na Hafidh Ameir Hassan, impuguke mu buhinzi; bafitanye abahungu batatu n'umukobwa umwe. Umukobwa wabo, Mwanu Hafidh Ameir, ni umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Zanzibar. Umugabo we yapfuye azize indwara y'umutima ku ya 7 Nzeri 2026, ashyingurwa i Kizimkazi, muri Zanzibar."}
{"id": "23222", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23222", "title": "Jean-Lucien Savi de Tov\u00e9", "text": "Jean-Lucien Kwassi Lanyo Savi de Tov\u00e9 (yavutse ku ya 7 Gicurasi 1939 i Lom\u00e9) ni umunyapolitiki akaba n'umukozi wa leta wa Togo, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2025. Yahoze ari umwe mu batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, afungwa ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma, hanyuma aza kwinjira muri guverinoma nka Minisitiri w'Ubucuruzi, Inganda n'Ubukorikori kuva mu 2005 kugeza mu 2007. Yabaye visi-perezida w'ishyaka rya Convergence patriotique panafricaine (CPP). Mu Gicurasi 2025, nyuma y'ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga ryahinduye Togo igihugu kiyoborwa n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, yatowe n'Inteko ku bwumvikane bwa bose ku mwanya wa perezida, ubu wabaye uw'icyubahiro, mu gihe ububasha bwinshi bwahawe Perezida w'Inama y'Abaminisitiri, Faure Gnassingb\u00e9. Afite imyaka 86, ni we muntu ukuze kurusha abandi wabaye Perezida wa Togo.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nSavi de Tov\u00e9 yavukiye i Lom\u00e9, mu muryango w'Abewe. Yize amategeko muri Kaminuza ya Bordeaux, mu Ubufaransa, hanyuma abona impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bumenyi bwa politiki muri Sorbonne, n'impamyabumenyi mu bushakashatsi ku iterambere ry'ubukungu muri Kaminuza ya Naples, mu Butaliyani.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nNyuma ya kudeta ya gisirikare yo muri Mutarama 1967, ku ya 6 Gashyantare 1967 yagizwe umunyamabanga mukuru wa Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga, afite imyaka 28. Mu 1969, ubwo Perezida Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma yashingaga ishyaka rimwe ryonyine ryemewe, Rassemblement du peuple togolais (RPT), Savi de Tov\u00e9 yararyinjiyemo. Mu 1974 no mu 1975, yasimbuwe ku mwanya w'umunyamabanga mukuru.\nAshinjwa kugira uruhare mu mugambi wo guhirika ubutegetsi hamwe n'abandi banyapolitiki barimo Gilchrist Olympio, ku ya 12 Nyakanga 1979 yasohorewe impapuro zo kumuta muri yombi, arafungwa. Muri Kanama 1979, we n'abandi bantu bane bahamwe n'icyaha, akatirwa igifungo cy'imyaka icumi.\nMu 1986, yavuye muri RPT, maze yitabira imyigaragambyo ya 1990\u20131991 yasabaga ko amashyaka menshi yemerwa. Amashyaka menshi amaze kwemerwa mu 1991, yashinze ishyaka rya Parti des d\u00e9mocrates pour l'unit\u00e9 (PDU), kandi agira uruhare rukomeye mu Nama y'Igihugu yo muri Nyakanga\u2013Kanama 1991 yashyizeho guverinoma y'inzibacyuho.\nKu ya 22 Werurwe 1993, mu nama yabereye i Cotonou, muri Bene, ihuriro ry'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi ryamutanze nka Minisitiri w'Intebe mu mwanya wa Joseph Kokou Koffigoh, ryashinjaga gukorana cyane na Perezida Eyad\u00e9ma ; ariko guverinoma yanze iryo shyirwaho. Mu 1994, yiyamamarije kuba umudepite nk'umukandida wigenga, ariko ntiyatorwa.\nMu 1999, PDU yihuje n'andi mashyaka abiri, UTD na UTS, bibyara ishyaka rya Convergence patriotique panafricaine (CPP) riyobowe na Edem Kodjo, maze Savi de Tov\u00e9 aba visi-perezida wa mbere waryo. Muri Kamena 2005, yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ubucuruzi, Inganda n'Ubukorikori, akomeza kuri uwo mwanya muri guverinoma ya Yawovi Agboyibo. Mu izina rya CPP, yasinye amasezerano ya politiki yasoje ibiganiro hagati y'Abanyatogo byo mu 2006. Mu matora y'abadepite yo mu Ukwakira 2007, yari uwa mbere ku rutonde rwa CPP mu karere ka Zio, ariko ishyaka ntiryabona umwanya n'umwe. Mu Ukuboza 2007, yavanywe muri guverinoma. Ku ya 27 Gicurasi 2009, yagizwe perezida w'urwego ruhoraho rw'ibiganiro n'ubwumvikane (CPDC).\nPerezida wa Togo.\nMuri Gicurasi 2024, Togo yemeje Itegeko Nshinga rishya ryahinduye igihugu kiyoborwa na perezida kikaba kiyoborwa n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko. Ububasha bwinshi bwa perezida bwahawe umwanya mushya wa Perezida w'Inama y'Abaminisitiri, naho umwanya wa Perezida wa Repubulika uba uw'icyubahiro, utorwa n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko kuri manda y'imyaka ine ishobora kongerwa rimwe.\nKu ya 3 Gicurasi 2025, Savi de Tov\u00e9 yatowe ku bwumvikane bwa bose n'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko n'Inteko Nshingamategeko (Sena) bahuriye hamwe. Yarahiye uwo munsi, aba perezida wa mbere wa Repubulika ya Gatanu ya Togo, asimbura Faure Gnassingb\u00e9 wabaye Perezida w'Inama y'Abaminisitiri, akaba ari we ufite ububasha bwinshi bw'ubuyobozi. Kubera ko yarahiye habura iminsi ine ngo yuzuze imyaka 86, ni we perezida ukuze kurusha abandi mu mateka ya Togo."}
{"id": "23223", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23223", "title": "Ka\u00efs Sa\u00efed", "text": "Ka\u00efs Sa\u00efed (mu Cyarabu: \u0642\u064a\u0633 \u0633\u0639\u064a\u062f; yavutse ku ya 22 Gashyantare 1958 i Tunis) ni umunyapolitiki akaba n'impuguke mu mategeko nshinga wa Tunisiya, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 23 Ukwakira 2019. Yamaze imyaka myinshi ari umwarimu w'amategeko muri kaminuza, ndetse n'umwe mu bayobozi b'ishyirahamwe ry'Abanyatunisiya b'impuguke mu mategeko nshinga. Mu 2019, yiyamamaje nk'umukandida wigenga, azwiho kuba inyangamugayo, maze atsinda icyiciro cya kabiri cy'amatora n'amajwi 72,7%. Mu Nyakanga 2021, mu bihe by'ihagarara rya politiki n'icyorezo cya COVID-19, yiyambuye ububasha bwose, yirukana guverinoma kandi ahagarika Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, nyuma arayisesa, ibyo abamurwanya n'abasesenguzi benshi bise kudeta. Mu 2022, yakuyeho Itegeko Nshinga rya 2014, ashyiraho irindi ryemejwe na kamarampaka, riha ububasha bwinshi umukuru w'igihugu. Afatwa n'abenshi nk'umunyagitugu, yongeye gutorwa mu 2024 mu matora yaranzwe n'ubwitabire buke cyane.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nKa\u00efs Sa\u00efed ni umuhungu wa Moncef Sa\u00efed, wari umukozi muri Minisiteri y'Imari, na Zakia Bellagha, wo mu muryango w'abakire b'i Tunis wari umugore wita ku rugo; umuryango we wari uwo mu cyiciro cyo hagati. Se wabo, Hicham Sa\u00efed, yabaye umuganga wa mbere ubaga abana muri Tunisiya. Yize amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rizwi rya Sadiki.\nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nSa\u00efed yize amategeko, akaba impuguke mu mategeko nshinga, nubwo atigeze abona impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. Yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru w'ishyirahamwe ry'Abanyatunisiya b'impuguke mu mategeko nshinga kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1995, hanyuma visi-perezida waryo. Yayoboye ishami ry'amategeko ya leta muri Kaminuza ya Sousse kuva mu 1994 kugeza mu 1999, hanyuma yigisha mu ishami ry'ubumenyi bw'amategeko na politiki rya Tunis kuva mu 1999 kugeza agiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 2018. Yanabaye impuguke mu bunyamabanga bukuru bw'Umuryango w'Ibihugu by'Abarabu (1989\u20131990) n'umwe mu bagize itsinda ry'impuguke ryasuzumye umushinga w'Itegeko Nshinga rya Tunisiya mu 2014.\nKwinjira muri politiki.\nSa\u00efed yagize uruhare mu mpinduramatwara ya Tunisiya yo mu 2010\u20132011. Ku ya 15 Mutarama 2011, umunsi umwe nyuma y'ihunga rya Perezida Zine el-Abidine Ben Ali, yasabye ko hashyirwaho inteko ishinga itegeko nshinga. Yashyigikiye ko Inteko Ishinga Amategeko isimburwa n'inteko igizwe n'abatowe mu buryo butaziguye, bashingiye ku turere, kandi bashobora kwamburwa manda yabo. Kuva mu 2013, yitabiriye inama nyinshi z'urubyiruko, maze mu 2016 hashingwa umutwe wa Mouassissoun wo gushyigikira imishinga ye.\nAmatora ya 2019.\nMu matora ya perezida ya 2019, Sa\u00efed yiyamamaje nk'umukandida wigenga, akoresha amafaranga make cyane, ashingira ku isura y'umuntu woroheje kandi uvuga Icyarabu cy'ubuvanganzo. Gahunda ye yibanze ku kurwanya ruswa no kubahiriza Itegeko Nshinga. Kubera imvugo ye itajegajega, bamwita \u00abRobocop\u00bb. Abenshi mu bamutoye bari urubyiruko rwize.\nYabaye uwa mbere mu cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 18,40%, akurikirwa n'umucuruzi Nabil Karoui (15,58%), wari ufunzwe. Mu cyiciro cya kabiri, yatsinze n'amajwi 72,71% kuri 27,29% ya Karoui. Nk'uko umusesenguzi Micha\u00ebl Ayari abivuga, Sa\u00efed yagaragazaga ubunyangamugayo n'urugamba rwo kurwanya ruswa, n'ibyiringiro byatakaye byo mu 2011.\nPerezida wa Tunisiya.\nIntangiriro ya manda.\nKu ya 23 Ukwakira 2019, Sa\u00efed yarahiriye imbere y'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, yiyemeza kurwanya iterabwoba no kurinda uburenganzira bw'abagore, maze yakira ububasha bwa perezida ahawe na Mohamed Ennaceur wari perezida w'agateganyo. Yanze gutura mu ngoro ya perezida ya Carthage, ahitamo kuguma mu nzu ye bwite.\nYashinze Habib Jemli, umukandida w'ishyaka rya Kisilamu Ennahdha, gushyiraho guverinoma, ariko Inteko yanga guverinoma ye muri Mutarama 2020. Hanyuma yashyizeho Elyes Fakhfakh, wahawe icyizere n'Inteko ku ya 27 Gashyantare 2020, ariko yegura muri Nyakanga 2020. Ku ya 25 Nyakanga 2020, yashinze Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu, Hichem Mechichi, gushyiraho guverinoma, yemejwe ku ya 2 Nzeri 2020. Muri Mutarama 2021, yanze kwakira indahiro y'abaminisitiri bashya Mechichi yari yashyizeho, avuga ko bamwe bakekwagaho ruswa. Muri Mata 2021, yanze gushyira umukono ku itegeko ryashyiragaho Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga.\nIyigarurira ry'ububasha mu 2021.\nKu ya 25 Nyakanga 2021, umunsi w'Ibirori bya Repubulika, ibihumbi by'abigaragambyaga basabye iseswa ry'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, mu gihe icyorezo cya COVID-19 cyari gikomeje gukaza umurego. Muri iryo joro, yitwaje ingingo ya 80 y'Itegeko Nshinga, Sa\u00efed yirukanye guverinoma ya Mechichi, ahagarika imirimo y'Inteko, akuraho ubudahangarwa bw'abadepite, kandi atangaza ko azayobora igihugu akoresheje amateka. Ennahdha yahise ibyita \u00abkudeta\u00bb, kandi abasesenguzi benshi n'impuguke mu mategeko babyemeranyaho. Ku ya 22 Nzeri 2021, yemeje mu iteka ko yiyambitse ububasha bwo gushyiraho amategeko. Ku ya 29 Nzeri 2021, yashinze Najla Bouden gushyiraho guverinoma, aba umugore wa mbere ubaye Minisitiri w'Intebe muri Tunisiya no mu bihugu by'Abarabu.\nKu ya 30 Werurwe 2022, abadepite 120 bateraniye mu nama y'ikoranabuhanga batora ko ingamba zidasanzwe zihagarara; uwo munsi, Sa\u00efed yasheshe Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, anakangisha abadepite gukurikiranwa n'inkiko. Mu ntangiriro za 2023, polisi yafashe abantu benshi bo mu ihuriro rikomeye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, Front de salut national. Kubera ibyo, abenshi bamwita \u00abperezida ufite ububasha bukabije\u00bb cyangwa umunyagitugu.\nItegeko Nshinga rya 2022.\nKu ya 30 Kamena 2022, Sa\u00efed yatangaje umushinga w'Itegeko Nshinga rishya riha ububasha bwinshi umukuru w'igihugu, kandi rivuga ko Isilamu ari intego ya leta n'isoko y'amategeko. Komisiyo Mpuzamahanga y'Abanyamategeko yavuze ko iyo nzira inyuranyije n'amategeko kandi itarimo ubunyangamugayo. Muri kamarampaka yo ku ya 25 Nyakanga 2022, abagera kuri 92\u201393% by'abatoye bemeje iryo Tegeko Nshinga, ariko ubwitabire bwari buke cyane.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nSa\u00efed afitanye umubano mwiza na Aligeriya ya Abdelmadjid Tebboune, yegera ibihugu by'Ikigobe nka Nyarabu Zunze Ubumwe, kandi ari hafi ya Perezida wa Misiri, Abdel Fattah al-Sissi. Muri Kanama 2022, yakiriye nk'umukuru w'igihugu Brahim Ghali, umuyobozi w'umutwe wa Polisario, bituma Maroke na Tunisiya bihamagaza ba ambasaderi babyo. Hagati ya 2023 na 2024, yakiriye kenshi Minisitiri w'Intebe w'Ubutaliyani, Giorgia Meloni, wageragezaga kumvikana na we ku bijyanye no kurwanya abimukira binjira mu Burayi mu buryo butemewe. Ku ya 12 Mata 2023, yasubukuye umubano wa dipolomasi na Siriya. Arwanya yivuye inyuma kugirana umubano na Isirayeli, avuga ko byaba ari \u00abubugambanyi bukomeye\u00bb.\nManda ya kabiri.\nMu matora ya perezida yo ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2024, Sa\u00efed yongeye gutorwa n'amajwi 90,69%. Muri Mata 2025, ibihano bikomeye by'igifungo byahawe abantu bagera kuri mirongo ine, barimo abanyapolitiki, abavoka n'abanyamakuru, mu rubanza rw'\u00abumugambi wo guhungabanya umutekano wa leta\u00bb, byanenzwe n'Ibiro bya Komiseri Mukuru wa Loni ushinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu, kimwe n'Ubufaransa n'Ubudage; Sa\u00efed yabyise \u00abukwivanga gukabije\u00bb. Muri Nyakanga 2026, ikinyamakuru cyo mu Butaliyani \"Il Foglio\" cyatangaje ko yaba yajyanywe mu bitaro, ariko perezidansi ntiyabyemeza.\nIbitekerezo n'imyanya afata.\nIbitekerezo bye bya gakondo ntibishingiye ku idini, ariko \"Le Monde\" imushyira mu murongo w'abaharanira ubumwe bw'Abarabu. Arwanya ko abagore bazungura kimwe n'abagabo, kandi ashyigikiye igihano cy'urupfu. Avuga ko ubutinganyi ari ikibazo cy'umuntu ku giti cye, ariko ko budakwiriye kugaragara mu ruhame. Itegeko Nshinga rya 2022 rivuga ko Tunisiya ari kimwe mu bihugu bigize umuryango w'Abayisilamu (\"oumma\").\nKu ya 21 Gashyantare 2023, Sa\u00efed yavuze ko abimukira baturuka muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara ari \u00abumugambi w'ubugizi bwa nabi\u00bb ugamije guhindura imiterere y'abaturage ba Tunisiya ; \"Le Monde\" na \"Le Point\" byavuze ko ayo magambo ashingiye ku gitekerezo cya \u00abugusimbuzwa gukomeye\u00bb (\"grand remplacement\"). Nyuma y'iryo jambo, abimukira benshi bo muri Afurika yo munsi ya Sahara batakaje akazi n'aho kuba, kandi nibura 1 300 muri bo bajyanywe na polisi ku mipaka na Libiya na Aligeriya, basigwa mu butayu.\nMu 2023, ibura ry'amazi ritewe n'imihindagurikire y'ibihe ryatumye guverinoma ishyiraho igabanywa ry'amazi mu turere tumwe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nSa\u00efed yashakanye n'umucamanza Ichraf Chebil, bamenyaniye muri kaminuza ya Sousse aho yari umunyeshuri we; bafitanye abana batatu. Umuvandimwe we, Naoufel Sa\u00efed, na we ari muri politiki kandi aramushyigikira. Akunda umuziki wa kera w'Abarabu n'ubugeni bwo kwandika Icyarabu; amabaruwa ye yandikishije intoki mu nyandiko nziza ya Maghreb yaravuzwe cyane."}
{"id": "23224", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23224", "title": "Hakainde Hichilema", "text": "Hakainde Hichilema (yavutse ku ya 4 Kamena 1962), uzwi cyane ku nyuguti \u00abHH\u00bb no ku izina rya \u00abBally\u00bb, ni umucuruzi, umworozi akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Zambiya, Perezida wa karindwi w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 24 Kanama 2021. Ayobora ishyaka rya United Party for National Development (UPND) kuva mu 2006. Yabaye umuyobozi w'ibigo by'ubugenzuzi bw'imari Coopers and Lybrand na Grant Thornton muri Zambiya, mbere yo kwinjira muri politiki. Yatsinzwe amatora ya perezida inshuro eshanu, harimo aya 2015 n'aya 2016 yatsinzwe na Edgar Lungu ku kinyuranyo gito. Mu 2017, yafunzwe amezi ane ashinjwa ubugambanyi, ifungwa ryamaganywe cyane mu gihugu no mu mahanga. Yatsinze amatora ya 2021 ku cyiciro cya mbere, yongera gutorwa mu 2026.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'umwuga.\nHichilema yavukiye mu mudugudu wo mu karere ka Monze, ku ya 4 Kamena 1962. Yahawe buruse yo kwiga muri Kaminuza ya Zambiya, ayirangiza mu 1986 afite impamyabumenyi mu bukungu n'imicungire y'ubucuruzi, hanyuma abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (MBA) mu mari n'ingamba z'ubucuruzi muri Kaminuza ya Birmingham, mu Bwongereza. Yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa Coopers and Lybrand Zambia kuva mu 1994 kugeza mu 1998, hanyuma uwa Grant Thornton Zambia kuva mu 1998 kugeza mu 2006. Ni umwe mu bantu bakize muri Zambiya, kandi ni uwa kabiri mu borozi b'inka benshi mu gihugu.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMu 2006, nyuma y'urupfu rwa Anderson Mazoka, Hichilema yatorewe kuyobora ishyaka rya UPND, ndetse n'ihuriro ry'amashyaka atavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, United Democratic Alliance (UDA). Mu matora ya perezida yo mu 2006, ashyigikiwe n'uwahoze ari Perezida Kenneth Kaunda, yabaye uwa gatatu n'amajwi agera kuri 25%. Mu matora yo mu 2008, yakurikiye urupfu rwa Perezida Levy Mwanawasa, yongeye kuba uwa gatatu n'amajwi 19,7%. Mu 2009, UPND yagiranye amasezerano n'ishyaka rya Patriotic Front rya Michael Sata, ariko asenyuka mu 2011.\nMu matora ya perezida yo muri Mutarama 2015, yatsinzwe na Edgar Lungu ku kinyuranyo gito cy'amajwi 27 757 (1,66%), maze avuga ko ayo matora yaranzwe n'uburiganya. Muri Kanama 2016, yongeye gutsindwa na Lungu ku kinyuranyo gito (47,6% kuri 50,4%).\nIfungwa ryo mu 2017.\nKu ya 11 Mata 2017, abapolisi binjiye ku ngufu iwe, baramufata, ashinjwa ubugambanyi no gushaka guhirika ubutegetsi, nyuma y'uko imodoka zari zimuherekeje zivugwaho kwanga guha inzira iz'umukuru w'igihugu. Abenshi babonaga ko icyo cyari ikosa ryo mu muhanda gusa, kidashobora gufatwa nk'ubugambanyi. Abapolisi bakoresheje imbaraga z'umurengera, bangiza inzu ye kandi bakubita abakozi be. Nyuma, Hichilema yavuze ko yafunzwe wenyine iminsi umunani nta biryo, nta mazi kandi akorerwa iyicarubozo.\nIfungwa rye ryamaganywe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi, abepiskopi Gatolika ba Zambiya ndetse n'abanyapolitiki bo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Uwahoze ari Perezida wa Nijeriya, Olusegun Obasanjo, n'Umunyamabanga Mukuru wa Commonwealth, Patricia Scotland, bamusuye muri gereza, mu gihe Perezida Lungu yatangaje ibihe bidasanzwe. Ku ya 16 Kanama 2017, ibyaha yashinjwaga byavanyweho, maze ararekurwa, ibyo byakiranwa ibyishimo mu gihugu hose. Muri Ukwakira 2017, umuryango Friedrich Naumann wamuhaye igihembo cy'ubwisanzure muri Afurika (\"Africa Freedom Award\").\nMu Ugushyingo 2017, inyandiko zizwi nka \"Paradise Papers\" zagaragaje ko yari umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'ubucukuzi AfNat Resources, cyanditswe muri Bermuda, igihugu kizwiho kudasoresha cyane ; amakuru nk'ayo yari yaragaragaye no mu nyandiko za \"Panama Papers\".\nPerezida wa Zambiya.\nMu matora yo ku ya 12 Kanama 2021, Hichilema yatsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 59%, arusha Perezida Lungu wari ku butegetsi amanota arenga makumyabiri. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Zambiya ku ya 24 Kanama 2021, kuri sitade ya National Heroes i Lusaka, afite Mutale Nalumango nka visi-perezida.\nAvuga ko ari \u00abumuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe kwamamaza\u00bb igihugu, akora ingendo nyinshi zo kumenyekanisha ubukungu bwa Zambiya mu mahanga. Muri Gicurasi 2022, yashimiye ishoramari rinini mu bucukuzi bw'umuringa n'ubwa nikeli, kandi Zambiya isinyana na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo amasezerano yo guteza imbere inganda za batiri z'amashanyarazi. Mu 2022, we na Perezida wa Tanzaniya, Samia Suluhu Hassan, bemeranyije kuvugurura umuhanda wa gari ya moshi wa TAZARA. Muri uwo mwaka, Zambiya yatoye yamagana igitero cy'Uburusiya muri Ukraine mu Muryango w'Abibumbye. Mu 2022, yitabiriye inama y'abakuru b'ibihugu bya Commonwealth i Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu Ukwakira 2024, yirukanye abacamanza batatu b'Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga. Ku ya 4 Kamena 2026, yasinye itegeko rituma uburezi bw'ubuntu buba uburenganzira buhoraho.\nMu matora rusange ya 2026, yongeye gutorwa ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 60,5%, imbere ya Brian Mundubile wagize 37,9%. Nyuma y'amatora, abanyapolitiki benshi batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, barimo Mundubile, barafunzwe bashinjwa ubugambanyi, naho umunyapolitiki Mutotwe Kafwaya yicirwa mu gikorwa cya polisi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nHichilema yashakanye na Mutinta, bafitanye abana batatu. Ni umuyoboke w'Itorero ry'Abadiventisiti b'Umunsi wa Karindwi."}
{"id": "23225", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23225", "title": "Emmerson Mnangagwa", "text": "Emmerson Dambudzo Mnangagwa (yavutse ku ya 15 Nzeri 1942 i Shabani, ubu ni Zvishavane) ni umunyapolitiki wa Zimbabwe, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 2017. Akunze kwitwa \u00ab\"Ngwena\"\u00bb cyangwa \u00ab\"Garwe\"\u00bb (\u00abIngona\u00bb mu Gishona). Yabaye impirimbanyi y'ubwigenge, afungwa imyaka icumi n'ubutegetsi bw'abakoloni ba Rodeziya. Nyuma y'ubwigenge mu 1980, yabaye umufatanyabikorwa wa hafi wa Robert Mugabe, ahabwa imyanya myinshi ikomeye muri guverinoma, harimo Minisitiri ushinzwe Umutekano w'Igihugu mu gihe cy'ubwicanyi bwa \"Gukurahundi\", bukaba bukimuvugwaho. Yabaye Visi-Perezida wa mbere kuva mu 2014 kugeza mu 2017, ubwo Mugabe yamwirukanaga; nyuma y'iminsi mike, kudeta y'igisirikare yatumye Mugabe yegura, Mnangagwa amusimbura. Yatsinze amatora yateje impaka yo mu 2018 n'ayo mu 2023, kandi ubutegetsi bwe bufatwa na benshi nk'ubw'igitugu.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nDambudzo Mnangagwa yavutse ku ya 15 Nzeri 1942 i Shabani, umujyi w'ubucukuzi muri Rodeziya y'Amajyepfo, ubukoloni bw'Abongereza. Ababyeyi be, Mafidhi na Mhurai Mnangagwa, bari abahinzi bo mu bwoko bw'Abakalanga, bufitanye isano n'Abashona. Sekuru yari mu rukiko rw'umwami w'Abandebele Lobengula, akarwanya Abongereza.\nMu 1952, se yagiranye amakimbirane n'umukozi w'ubukoloni wari wafatiriye amatungo y'abaturage, bituma umuryango wimukira muri Rodeziya y'Amajyaruguru (ubu ni Zambiya). Mnangagwa yakomereje amashuri i Mumbwa, hanyuma yiga imyuga y'ubwubatsi i Kafue no muri Hodgson Technical College, aho yirukanywe mu 1960 azira ibikorwa bya politiki.\nUrugamba rwo kubohora igihugu.\nMu 1962, Mnangagwa yinjiye mu ishyaka rya Zimbabwe African People's Union (ZAPU), maze ajya muri Tanganyika (ubu ni Tanzaniya), hanyuma mu Misiri guhabwa imyitozo ya gisirikare. Muri Kanama 1963, yinjiye mu ishyaka rishya rya Zimbabwe African National Union (ZANU). Yoherejwe mu Ubushinwa mu ngabo za ZANLA, aho yize ibitekerezo bya Marx muri Kaminuza ya Pekin, ahabwa imyitozo y'urugamba n'iy'ubutasi ; umubano yagiranye n'Ubushinwa wakomeje kwiyongera. Mu 1964, agarutse muri Tanganyika, yashinze itsinda ryitwa \u00abItsinda ry'Ingona\u00bb (\"Crocodile Group\").\nMuri Mutarama 1965, iryo tsinda ryagabye ibitero mu burasirazuba bwa Rodeziya, rinangiza ibikoresho bya gari ya moshi hafi ya Fort Victoria (ubu ni Masvingo). Mnangagwa yarafashwe, yemera icyaha nyuma yo gukorerwa iyicarubozo, ahamwa n'icyaha. Abavoka be bavuze ko yari akiri muto, bityo ntiyakatirwa urwo gupfa, ahubwo akatirwa igifungo cy'imyaka icumi. Yafungiwe muri gereza zitandukanye, harimo iya Khami, aho yamaze imyaka irenga itandatu ari kumwe n'abandi bayobozi b'ubwigenge, barimo Robert Mugabe, maze baba inshuti magara. Amaze kurekurwa, yirukanwe muri Zambiya, yiga amategeko muri Kaminuza ya Zambiya, ayakora imyaka ibiri, hanyuma ajya muri Mozambike kwifatanya na ZANU, aho yabaye umwungirije akaba n'umurinzi wa Mugabe.\nUmwuga wa politiki nyuma y'ubwigenge.\nKuva ubwigenge bwa Zimbabwe mu 1980 kugeza mu 1988, Mnangagwa yabaye Minisitiri ushinzwe Umutekano w'Igihugu, ayobora n'urwego rw'ubutasi (CIO). Muri icyo gihe, kuva mu 1983 kugeza mu 1987, burigade ya gatanu y'ingabo za Zimbabwe, yari yaratojwe na Koreya ya Ruguru, yishe abasivili b'Abandebele bari hagati ya 20 000 na 30 000 mu ntara ya Matabeleland, mu bwicanyi buzwi nka \"Gukurahundi\". Mnangagwa ahakana uruhare urwo ari rwo rwose muri ubwo bwicanyi, ariko benshi, barimo ibihugu by'amahanga, abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi n'imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu, bamushinja kuba yarabugizemo uruhare rukomeye. Mu ijambo yavuze muri Werurwe 1983, yagereranyije abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi n'udukoko (\"cockroaches\" na \"bugs\") dukeneye kwicishwa umuti wica udukoko. Muri icyo gihe, yashimangiye umubano n'ingabo n'inzego z'ubutasi, zikomeje kumubera inkingi.\nKuva mu 1988 kugeza mu 2000, yabaye Minisitiri w'Ubutabera, anaba Minisitiri w'Imari w'agateganyo kuva mu Ugushyingo 1995 kugeza muri Mata 1996. Kuva mu 2000 kugeza mu 2005, yabaye Perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Imiturire yo mu Byaro kuva mu 2005 kugeza mu 2009, n'uw'Ingabo kuva mu 2009 kugeza mu 2013. Yagize uruhare rukomeye mu bikorwa by'urugomo byaranze amatora ya perezida yo mu 2008, ubwo yayoboraga ubukangurambaga bwa Mugabe, kandi abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bamushinje kugira uruhare mu rugomo rw'amatora ya 2013. Mu 2007, guverinoma yavuze ko yavumbuye umugambi w'abasirikare wo guhirika Mugabe no gushinga Mnangagwa gushyiraho guverinoma, ariko Mnangagwa avuga ko ntacyo yari abiziho.\nVisi-Perezida no kwirukanwa.\nMu Ukuboza 2014, Mnangagwa yasimbuye Joice Mujuru ku mwanya wa Visi-Perezida wa mbere wa Zimbabwe, afatwa nk'ushobora gusimbura Mugabe wari ugeze mu zabukuru. Ariko Mugabe yifuzaga ko umugore we, Grace Mugabe, ari we umusimbura. Ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 2017, Mugabe yirukanye Mnangagwa ku mwanya wa visi-perezida amushinja \u00abkutaba indahemuka\u00bb, ibyo bitashimishije ingabo ; Mnangagwa ahungira muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo.\nKudeta ya 2017.\nKu ya 15 Ugushyingo 2017, Jenerali Sibusiso Moyo yatangarije kuri televiziyo y'igihugu ko ingabo zifashe imihanda kugira ngo \u00abzivane mu nzira abagizi ba nabi bari hafi ya Perezida Mugabe\u00bb ; Mugabe n'umugore we bafungiwe iwabo n'ingabo. Ku ya 19 Ugushyingo, komite nkuru ya ZANU\u2013PF yakuye Mugabe ku buyobozi bw'ishyaka, imusimbuza Mnangagwa, inamutanga nk'umukandida wayo mu matora ya 2018. Ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 2017, Mugabe yeguye kugira ngo yirinde kweguzwa n'Inteko.\nPerezida wa Zimbabwe.\nManda ya mbere.\nMnangagwa yagarutse muri Zimbabwe ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 2017, maze arahirira kuba Perezida ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 2017. Bukeye, urukiko rwemeje ko kudeta yari ihuje n'Itegeko Nshinga. Ku ya 30 Ugushyingo 2017, yashyizeho guverinoma igizwe n'abayoboke ba ZANU\u2013PF n'abasirikare babiri, barimo Sibusiso Moyo, wagizwe Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga. Ku ya 27 Ukuboza 2017, yagize Constantino Chiwenga na Kembo Mohadi ba visi-perezida. Yahaye amezi atatu abari barahishe amafaranga mu mahanga mu buryo butemewe kuyagarura mu gihugu, kandi yiyemeza kuvugurura politiki y'ubutaka kugira ngo bamwe mu bahinzi b'Abazungu bambuwe ubutaka bawusubizwe. Yagaragaje ubushake bwo kongera kubana neza n'ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba no kugaruka muri Commonwealth.\nMuri Kamena 2018, mu gihe cy'ubukangurambaga bw'amatora i Bulawayo, igisasu cyatewe aho yari ari, ariko arokoka nta kibazo, mu gihe abandi bayobozi, barimo ba visi-perezida be bombi, bakomeretse. Ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2018, yatsinze amatora ya perezida ku kinyuranyo gito ku cyiciro cya mbere. Nelson Chamisa, umukandida w'ihuriro MDC, yanze ibyavuye mu matora, maze imyigaragambyo ikurikiraho ihitana abantu batandatu barashwe n'ingabo. Ku ya 24 Kanama 2018, Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwemeje ibyavuye mu matora, maze arahira ku ya 26 Kanama.\nMuri Mutarama 2019, izamuka ry'ibiciro bya lisansi rya 130% ryateje imyigaragambyo mu gihugu hose; inzego z'umutekano zayihoshesheje ku ngufu, abantu 12 barapfa kandi amagana arafatwa. Muri Werurwe 2021, Perezida Joe Biden wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika yanenze ubutegetsi bwe kubera guhohotera abaturage no kudakora amavugurura ya demokarasi, yongera ibihano Amerika yari yarafatiye Zimbabwe. Mu 2023, iperereza ry'itangazamakuru ryagaragaje urusobe rw'icuruzwa rya zahabu mu buryo bwa magendu rifitanye isano n'abantu ba hafi ye.\nManda ya kabiri.\nMuri Kanama 2023, Mnangagwa yongeye gutorwa n'amajwi 52,6%, ariko abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bavuga ko ayo matora atagenze neza. Ku ya 4 Werurwe 2024, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika zamufatiye ibihano, we n'umugore we Auxillia, Visi-Perezida Chiwenga n'abandi, kubera ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu, ruswa n'icuruzwa ry'amabuye y'agaciro mu buryo bwa magendu. Ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2024, yasinye itegeko rikuraho igihano cy'urupfu ku byaha byinshi, maze ibihano by'urupfu by'imfungwa zose bihindurwa igifungo.\nKu ya 2 Nzeri 2024, yatangaje ko atazashaka manda ya gatatu mu 2028. Ariko mu 2025, abahoze barwana urugamba rwo kubohora igihugu basabye ko yegura, mu gihe ibihuha byavugaga ko ashaka kongera igihe cye ku butegetsi. Ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2025, inama ya ZANU\u2013PF i Mutare yemeje icyifuzo cyo kongera manda ye kugeza mu 2030 binyuze mu ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga, maze muri Kamena 2026 imitwe yombi y'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yemeza ivugurura ryongera manda ya perezida kuva ku myaka itanu ikagera ku myaka irindwi.\nIbitekerezo bya politiki.\nMnangagwa arwanya yivuye inyuma igihano cy'urupfu, acyita \u00abigitutsi ku cyubahiro cya muntu\u00bb; \"La Croix\" ihuza uwo murongo n'uko na we ubwe yari yarigeze kugikatirwa akiri muto.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMnangagwa ni Umukristo w'Umuvanjeliste, akaba umuyoboke w'Itorero rya United Family International Church. Yashatse kabiri, kandi afite abana cumi n'umunani n'abuzukuru barenga icumi. Umugore we wa mbere, Jayne Matarise, bashakanye mu 1973, bakabyarana abana batandatu, yapfuye ku ya 31 Mutarama 2002 azize kanseri. Ikinyamakuru \"Time\" cyamushyize mu bantu 100 bavuga rikijyana ku isi mu 2018."}
{"id": "23228", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23228", "title": "Hepatite", "text": "Hepatite ni indwara itera umwijima kubyimba. Ishobora kwibasira umwijima gusa cyangwa se ikaba yatera izindi ndwara nko; kuzana udusebe no gucika k\u2019umwijima (fibrosis), cirrhosis na kanseri y\u2019umwijima."}
{"id": "23229", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23229", "title": "Umusonga", "text": "Umusonga ni indwara yo kubyimba mu bihaha yibasira cyane cyane udusaho duto tw\u2019umwuka tuzwi nka alveoli. Ibimenyetso bikunze kuba birimo inkorora ikura cyangwa yumye, kubabara mu gatuza, umuriro, no kugorwa no guhumeka. Uburemere bw'iyi ndwara burahindagurika.\nUbusanzwe umusonga uterwa n'ubwandu bwa virusi cyangwa bagiteri, kandi akenshi uterwa n'izindi mikorobe, imiti imwe n'imwe cyangwa indwara zimwe na zimwe nk'indwara ziterwa n'umubiri. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo indwara ya cystic fibrosis, indwara idakira y\u2019ibihaha (COPD), indwara ya sickle cell, asima, diyabete, umutima unanirwa, amateka yo kunywa itabi, ubushobozi buke bwo gukorora (nk'igihe umuntu arwaye indwara yo mu bwonko), hamwe n'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri budakora neza. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku bimenyetso no ku isuzuma ry'umubiri. Imirasire yo mu gituza, ibizamini by'amaraso, no gupima amatembabuzi y'amata bishobora gufasha kwemeza ko indwara yanduye. Iyi ndwara ishobora gushyirwa mu byiciro hakurikijwe aho yavuye, nko kwandurira mu bitaro cyangwa kwakorewe mu muryango cyangwa kwandurira mu bitaro. \nUrukingo rwo kwirinda ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bw'umusonga rurahari. Ubundi buryo bwo kwirinda burimo gukaraba intoki no kutanywa itabi. Uburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru. Umusonga w\u2019ibihaha bikekwa ko uterwa na bagiteri uvurwa n\u2019imiti yica udukoko. Iyo umusonga ukabije, umuntu wafashwe n\u2019indwara muri rusange ajyanwa mu bitaro. Uburyo bwo kuvura umwuka wa ogisijeni bushobora gukoreshwa iyo urugero rwa ogisijeni ruri hasi.\nBuri mwaka, umusonga wibasira abantu bagera kuri 450\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu ku isi (7% by'abaturage) kandi bigatera impfu zigera kuri miliyoni 4. Mu kinyejana cya 20, ubwo imiti yica udukoko n'inkingo byatangiraga gukoreshwa, ubuzima bwarushijeho kuba bwiza cyane. Nyamara, mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, ndetse no mu bakuze cyane, abakiri bato cyane n'abarwayi badakira, umusonga uracyari intandaro y'impfu nyinshi. Umusonga ukunze kugabanya igihe cyo kubabara mu bantu bari hafi gupfa, bityo witwa \"inshuti y'uyu musaza\". "}
{"id": "23230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23230", "title": "Ketamine", "text": "Ketamine ni umuti ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu gutangiza no kubungabunga ikinya. Bitera umuntu kumva ameze nk'uwihebye mu gihe bigabanya ububabare, gutuza no kwibagirwa. Izindi ngamba zirimo kugabanya ububabare mu bitaro by\u2019inyongera no kuvura ububabare n\u2019agahinda. Imikorere y'umutima, guhumeka, n'imikorere y'imiyoboro y'ubuhumekero muri rusange bikomeza gukora neza. Ingaruka zikunze gutangira mu minota itanu iyo zitanzwe hakoreshejwe urushinge, kandi zimara iminota 25."}
{"id": "23231", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23231", "title": "Imirire mibi", "text": "Imirire mibi ni indwara iterwa no kurya indyo aho intungamubiri imwe cyangwa nyinshi zidahagije cyangwa zikaba nyinshi cyane ku buryo indyo itera ibibazo by'ubuzima. Bishobora kuba birimo karori, poroteyine, karubohidrati, ibinure, vitamine cyangwa imyunyungugu.\nIntungamubiri zidahagije zitwa imirire mibi cyangwa indyo yuzuye mu gihe irenze urugero zitwa imirire mibi. Imirire mibi ikunze gukoreshwa mu gusobanura imirire mibi aho umuntu adahabwa karori, poroteyine, cyangwa intungamubiri zihagije. Iyo umuntu atwite cyangwa mbere y\u2019imyaka ibiri, bishobora kumuviramo ibibazo bidashira mu mikurire y\u2019umubiri n\u2019iy\u2019ubwonko. Kubura indyo yuzuye, bizwi nka inzara, bishobora kugira ibimenyetso birimo: uburebure bugufi, umubiri muto, imbaraga nke cyane, no kubyimba amaguru n'inda. Abantu bakunze kwandura indwara kandi bakunze kugira ibicurane. Ibimenyetso by'ibura ry'intungamubiri biterwa n'intungamubiri ntoya zibura.\nKurya nabi akenshi biterwa no kutagira ibiryo byiza bihagije byo kurya. Ibi bikunze kujyana n'ibiciro by'ibiribwa biri hejuru ndetse n'ubukene. Kutanywa ibere bishobora gutera indwara nyinshi zandura nka: indwara yo mu gifu, umusonga, malariya, na serumu, ibyo bikaba byongera ibyifuzo by\u2019intungamubiri. Hari ubwoko bubiri bw'ingenzi bw'imirire mibi: imirire mibi iterwa na poroteyine n'ingufu no kubura indyo yuzuye. Imirire mibi iterwa n'ingufu za poroteyine ifite imiterere ibiri ikomeye: marasmus (kubura poroteyine na karori) na kwashiorkor (kubura poroteyine gusa). Ibura ry\u2019intungamubiri rikunze kugaragara ririmo: kubura icyuma, iyode na vitamine A. Mu gihe cyo gutwita, bitewe n\u2019uko umubiri ukeneye byinshi, kubura ibinure bishobora kwiyongera. Mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, imirire irenze urugero mu buryo bw'umubyibuho ukabije itangiye kugaragara mu miryango imwe n'iy'abantu badafite imirire myiza. Izindi mpamvu zitera imirire mibi zirimo kwiyica intege no kubagwa bariyatric.\nImbaraga zo kunoza imirire ni zimwe mu nzira nziza zo gufasha mu iterambere. Konsa bishobora kugabanya igipimo cy'imirire mibi n'impfu mu bana, kandi imbaraga zo guteza imbere uyu muco zikongera igipimo cy'uko abana bonsa. Ku bana bato, gutanga ibiryo (usibye amashereka) hagati y'amezi atandatu n'imyaka ibiri byongera umusaruro. Hari kandi ibimenyetso byiza bishyigikira ko abagore batwite ndetse no mu bana bato bo mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere bahabwa intungamubiri nyinshi. Kugira ngo abantu babikeneye cyane babone ibiribwa, haba mu gutanga ibiribwa no gutanga amafaranga kugira ngo abantu bagure ibiribwa mu masoko yo mu gace batuyemo, biragira akamaro. \nKugaburira abanyeshuri gusa ku ishuri ntibihagije. Gukemura ikibazo cy\u2019imirire mibi ikabije mu rugo rw\u2019umuntu ukoresheje ibiryo bivura byiteguye gukoreshwa birashoboka cyane. Ku bantu bafite imirire mibi ikomeye iterwa n'izindi ngorane z'ubuzima, ni byiza kuvurirwa mu bitaro. Ibi akenshi bikubiyemo gucunga isukari nke mu maraso n'ubushyuhe bw'umubiri, gukemura ikibazo cyo kubura amazi mu mubiri, no kugaburira buhoro buhoro. Imiti isanzwe ikoreshwa mu kurwanya indwara zandura akenshi irasabwa kubera ko hari ibyago byinshi byo kwandura. Ingamba z'igihe kirekire zirimo: kunoza ubuhinzi, kugabanya ubukene, kunoza isuku, no guteza imbere abagore.\nHari abantu 821\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu bafite imirire mibi ku isi mu 2018 (10.8% by'abaturage bose). Iri ni igabanuka rya 176\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu kuva mu 1990 ubwo 23% bari bafite imirire mibi, ariko hiyongeraho abantu bagera kuri 36\u00a0miliyoni kuva mu 2015, ubwo 10.6% bari bafite imirire mibi. Mu 2012, byagaragaye ko abandi bantu miliyari bari badafite vitamine n'imyunyungugu. Mu 2015, imirire mibi iterwa n\u2019ingufu za poroteyine yagaragaye ko yahitanye abantu 323.000\u2014igabanuka ugereranyije n\u2019abapfuye 510.000 mu 1990. Izindi ntungamubiri zibura, zirimo kubura iyode no kubura amaraso mu by\u2019ubutare, zitera izindi mfu 83.000. Mu 2010, imirire mibi ni yo yabaye intandaro ya 1.4% by'imyaka yose y'ubuzima yahinduwe n'ubumuga. Hafi kimwe cya gatatu cy'impfu mu bana bivugwa ko ziterwa n'imirire mibi, nubwo impfu zidakunze kwitwa ko ari zo. Mu 2010, byavuzwe ko byagize uruhare mu rupfu rw\u2019abagore n\u2019abana bagera kuri miliyoni 1.5, nubwo bamwe bavuga ko umubare wabo ushobora kuba urenga 3\u00a0miliyoni. Indi 165 y'inyongera\u00a0Abana miliyoni babarirwaga mu kigero cyo kugabanuka mu mikurire bitewe n\u2019imirire mibi mu 2013. Kubura imirire myiza bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Hari amatsinda amwe afite igipimo cyo hejuru cy\u2019ababura imirire myiza, harimo abagore\u2014cyane cyane iyo batwite cyangwa bonsa\u2014 abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka itanu, ndetse n\u2019abageze mu za bukuru. Ku bageze mu za bukuru, imirire mibi ikunze kugaragara bitewe n\u2019ibintu by\u2019umubiri, imitekerereze n\u2019imibereho."}
{"id": "23232", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23232", "title": "Thomas Sankara", "text": "Thomas Isidore No\u00ebl Sankara (yavutse ku ya 21 Ukuboza 1949 i Yako, apfa yishwe ku ya 15 Ukwakira 1987 i Ouagadougou) yari umusirikare akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyaburukina, wayoboye Volta ya Ruguru, yaje kwitwa Burukina Faso, kuva mu 1983 kugeza mu 1987. Yari umuyoboke w'ibitekerezo bya gikomunisiti, uharanira ubwigenge nyabwo bw'Afurika, kurengera ibidukikije n'uburenganzira bw'abagore. Mu myaka ine yamaze ku butegetsi, yayoboye impinduramatwara yiswe \u00abimpinduramatwara ya demokarasi n'abaturage\u00bb, irwanya ruswa, iteza imbere ubuhinzi, ubuzima n'uburezi, kandi ituma igihugu cyihaza mu biribwa; ariko nanone ubutegetsi bwe bwahohoteye amashyirahamwe y'abakozi n'amashyaka amwe atavuga rumwe na bwo. Ni we wahinduye izina ry'igihugu \u00abVolta ya Ruguru\u00bb ryasizwe n'abakoloni, akacyita \u00abBurkina Faso\u00bb, bisobanura \u00abigihugu cy'abantu b'inyangamugayo\u00bb. Yiciwe muri kudeta yayobowe na mugenzi we Blaise Compaor\u00e9, waje gukatirwa igifungo cya burundu mu 2022 kubera urwo rupfu. Kugeza ubu, afatwa n'urubyiruko rwinshi rwa Afurika nk'intwari, akitwa \u00abChe Guevara w'Afurika\u00bb.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nThomas Sankara yavutse ku ya 21 Ukuboza 1949 i Yako, muri Volta ya Ruguru yategekwaga n'Ubufaransa. Se yari Umusilmi-Mosi ukomoka mu mudugudu wa Sito\u00e8ga, naho nyina akaba Umumosi ukomoka i Ziniar\u00e9. Se, wahoze ari umusirikare mu ngabo z'Ubufaransa akaba yarafashwe mpiri mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, yaje kuba umujandarume ushinzwe ubuvuzi. Yakuriye mu muryango w'Abakristo Gatolika, afite abavandimwe benshi.\nYize amashuri yisumbuye i Bobo-Dioulasso, hanyuma mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Kadiogo i Ouagadougou. Yahawe amasomo y'abasirikare bakuru mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Yaound\u00e9, muri Kameruni, hanyuma mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Antsirabe, muri Madagasikari, aho yize ubumenyi bwa politiki, ubukungu n'ubuhinzi. Muri Madagasikari, yabonye impinduramatwara yo mu 1972 yahiritse Perezida Philibert Tsiranana, bimutera igitekerezo cy'\u00abimpinduramatwara ya demokarasi n'abaturage\u00bb.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nYagarutse muri Volta ya Ruguru mu 1973 afite ipeti rya su-liyetona, ashinzwe gutoza abasirikare bashya; yashimangiraga ko \u00abumusirikare udafite uburere bwa politiki bukunda igihugu aba ari umugizi wa nabi uteganyijwe\u00bb. Mu 1974, yamenyekanye cyane mu ntambara yahuje igihugu cye na Mali. Mu 1976, yagizwe umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'igihugu cy'imyitozo y'abakomando i P\u00f4. Hamwe na Blaise Compaor\u00e9, Henri Zongo na Jean-Baptiste Lingani, yashinze ihuriro ry'abasirikare bakuru b'abakomunisiti.\nKwinjira muri politiki.\nMuri Nzeri 1981, Sankara yagizwe Umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe Itangazamakuru muri guverinoma ya Koloneli Saye Zerbo, ariko yegura ku ya 21 Mata 1982 kubera ikurwaho ry'uburenganzira bwo kujya mu myigaragambyo y'abakozi, avuga kuri televiziyo ati: \u00abIshyano ku bacecekesha abaturage\u00bb. Nyuma ya kudeta yo ku ya 7 Ugushyingo 1982 yashyize ku butegetsi Jean-Baptiste Ou\u00e9draogo, Sankara yagizwe Minisitiri w'Intebe muri Mutarama 1983. Yatangaje ku mugaragaro ko ashaka guca umubano wa \u00abgikoloni gishya\u00bb na Ubufaransa, kandi atumira umuyobozi wa Libiya, Mouammar Kadhafi. Ku ya 17 Gicurasi 1983, yarirukanywe, afungirwa iwe, bivugwa ko byatewe n'igitutu cy'Ubufaransa.\nPerezida wa Burukina Faso.\nImpinduramatwara yo mu 1983.\nImyigaragambyo y'abaturage yashyigikiwe n'amashyaka y'ibumoso n'amashyirahamwe y'abakozi yatumye arekurwa. Ku ya 4 Kanama 1983, abasirikare bo mu kigo cya P\u00f4 bayobowe na Blaise Compaor\u00e9 binjiye i Ouagadougou, maze Sankara aba Perezida w'Inama y'Igihugu y'Impinduramatwara. Ku ya 4 Kanama 1984, igihugu cyiswe Burkina Faso.\nUbutegetsi bwe bwambuye abatware gakondo ububasha bwabo, bubuha Komite zirengera Impinduramatwara (CDR), zari zishinzwe umutekano, uburere bwa politiki, isuku n'ubukungu mu turere. Ariko izo komite zashinjwe kwitwara nk'imitwe yitwaje intwaro itera ubwoba, ndetse no guhohotera amashyirahamwe y'abakozi. Muri Kamena 1984, abantu barindwi bashinjwaga umugambi wo guhirika ubutegetsi barishwe nyuma yo gukatirwa n'urukiko rwa gisirikare.\nPolitiki y'ubukungu n'imibereho.\nSankara yagabanyije amafaranga leta yakoreshaga mu mirimo isanzwe, ashyira imbere ishoramari; abaminisitiri bategetswe kugendera mu modoka zoroheje za Renault 5 aho kugendera mu modoka z'agaciro kenshi. Yashakaga ubukungu butishingikiriza ku mfashanyo z'amahanga, avuga ko \u00abuguha ibyo kurya ari na we ugutegeka\u00bb. Mu 1986, Burkina Faso yageze ku ntego yo guha buri muntu amafunguro abiri n'amazi litiro icumi ku munsi, maze intumwa ya Loni ishinzwe uburenganzira ku biribwa ivuga ko yatsinze inzara. Abakozi ba leta bashishikarijwe kwambara imyenda gakondo, \"Faso dan fani\".\nKuva mu 1983 kugeza mu 1985, abaturage miliyoni ebyiri bakingiwe imbasa, mugiga n'iseru, kandi ubutegetsi bwe bwubatse amazu menshi n'ibikorwa remezo. Mu kurwanya ubutayu, yatangije gahunda yo gutera ibiti miliyoni nyinshi no guca ibikorwa byo gutema amashyamba no gutwika ibihuru. Yashyize imbere kandi uburezi, mu gihugu cyari gifite abaturage 90% batazi gusoma no kwandika.\nMu guharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore, yakuyeho inkwano n'umuco wo guhererekanya abapfakazi, ashyiraho imyaka ntarengwa yo gushyingirwa, abuza gukeba abakobwa kandi arwanya ubuharike.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, Sankara yanenze uburyo bw'imari ku isi, Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari (FMI) na Banki y'Isi, kandi Burkina Faso ntiyafashe inguzanyo za FMI. Mu nama y'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika (OUA) yabereye i Addis Abeba muri Nyakanga 1987, yavuze ijambo ryamamaye, ahamagarira ibihugu by'Afurika kwanga hamwe kwishyura imyenda. Yanenze cyane politiki y'Ubufaransa muri Afurika, by'umwihariko mu ruzinduko rwa Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand i Ouagadougou mu Ugushyingo 1986 ; inkunga y'Ubufaransa yagabanutseho 80% hagati ya 1983 na 1985. Yagiranye umubano mwiza na Cuba, yohereza urubyiruko rugera kuri 600 kwigayo, ndetse na Jerry Rawlings wa Gana na Mouammar Kadhafi. Mu 1985, intambara ngufi yamuhuje na Mali ku bijyanye n'akarere ka Agacher.\nIyicwa rye.\nKuva mu 1985, umubano wa Sankara na Blaise Compaor\u00e9 warazambye cyane, kugeza ubwo batari bakivugana. Ku mugoroba wo ku ya 15 Ukwakira 1987, ubwo Sankara yari mu nama n'abagize ibiro bye mu nyubako ya Conseil de l'Entente i Ouagadougou, itsinda ry'abasirikare ryinjiye, ryica abamurindaga, hanyuma rimwica hamwe n'abandi bantu cumi na babiri. Nk'uko uwarokotse wenyine, Alouna Traor\u00e9, abivuga, Sankara yasohotse mbere y'abandi amanitse amaboko, avuga ati: \u00abNtimunyeganyege, ni jye bashaka\u00bb. Muri iryo joro, Blaise Compaor\u00e9 yafashe ubutegetsi, maze Sankara n'abo bapfanye bashyingurwa rwihishwa mu irimbi rya Dagno\u00ebn.\nIperereza n'urubanza.\nMu 2006, Komite ya Loni ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu yamaganye kuba nta rubanza cyangwa iperereza byari byarakozwe na leta ya Burukina Faso kuri urwo rupfu. Nyuma y'ihirikwa rya Compaor\u00e9 mu 2014, umupfakazi wa Sankara, Mariam, yagarutse i Ouagadougou ku ya 14 Gicurasi 2015 kubazwa n'umucamanza. Ku ya 25 Gicurasi 2015, hatangiye gutaburura imibiri ikekwa kuba iya Sankara n'abo bapfanye ; isuzuma ryagaragaje ko umubiri we warashwe amasasu arenga icumi. Mu Ukuboza 2015, ubutabera bwa gisirikare bwasohoye impapuro mpuzamahanga zo guta muri yombi Compaor\u00e9, wari mu buhungiro muri Kote Divuwari. Mu 2017, Perezida Emmanuel Macron w'Ubufaransa yemeye ko inyandiko z'ibanga z'Ubufaransa zerekeye urwo rupfu zishyikirizwa ubutabera bwa Burukina Faso.\nUrubanza rwatangiye ku ya 11 Ukwakira 2021. Ku ya 6 Mata 2022, Blaise Compaor\u00e9 yahamwe n'icyaha cyo gutegeka iyicwa rya Sankara, akatirwa adahari igifungo cya burundu, kimwe na Gilbert Diend\u00e9r\u00e9.\nUmurage.\nSankara afatwa n'abatari bake muri Afurika nk'intwari, kandi akunze kugereranywa na Che Guevara na Patrice Lumumba. Mu 2019, ishusho ye yubatswe aho yiciwe i Ouagadougou. Mu 2023, guverinoma ya Burukina Faso yamushyize mu ntwari z'igihugu, kandi umuhanda munini wa Ouagadougou witwaga Boulevard Charles de Gaulle uhabwa izina rye. Mu 2025, Sankara n'abo bapfanye bashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu mva yubatswe aho bari biciwe, ku Conseil de l'Entente.\nUbuzima bwite.\nSankara yashakanye na Mariam Sankara, babyarana abahungu babiri, Philippe na Auguste."}
{"id": "23233", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23233", "title": "Roch Marc Christian Kabor\u00e9", "text": "Roch Marc Christian Kabor\u00e9 (yavutse ku ya 25 Mata 1957 i Ouagadougou) ni umucungamari w'amabanki akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyaburukina, wabaye Perezida wa Burukina Faso kuva ku ya 29 Ukuboza 2015 kugeza ahiritswe n'igisirikare ku ya 24 Mutarama 2022. Yize ubukungu mu Bufaransa, ayobora banki ya Banque internationale du Burkina (BIB), hanyuma aba minisitiri inshuro nyinshi ku butegetsi bwa Blaise Compaor\u00e9. Yabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe kuva mu 1994 kugeza mu 1996, mu gihe cy'igabanywa ry'agaciro k'ifaranga rya CFA, hanyuma aba Perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko kuva mu 2002 kugeza mu 2012. Mu 2014, yavuye mu ishyaka rya Compaor\u00e9, ashinga ishyaka rya Mouvement du peuple pour le progr\u00e8s (MPP). Yatsinze amatora ya perezida ya 2015 ku cyiciro cya mbere, aba perezida wa mbere mu myaka 49 utari ufitanye isano n'igisirikare, yongera gutorwa mu 2020. Ubutegetsi bwe bwaranzwe n'ibitero by'imitwe y'iterabwoba, maze muri Mutarama 2022 ahirikwa na kudeta iyobowe na Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nKabor\u00e9 yavukiye i Ouagadougou, mu muryango w'Abamosi b'Abakristo Gatolika. Se, Charles Bila Kabor\u00e9, yari umwarimu waje kuba Minisitiri w'Imari n'uw'Ubuzima ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Maurice Yam\u00e9ogo, hanyuma visi-guverineri wa Banki Nkuru y'Ibihugu bya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba (BCEAO). Yize amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rya Saint-Jean-Baptiste-de-la-Salle i Ouagadougou, kuva mu 1968 kugeza mu 1975. Yize ubukungu muri Kaminuza ya Dijon, mu Ubufaransa, ahabona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri mu 1979 n'iy'icyiciro cya gatatu mu micungire mu 1980. Muri icyo gihe, yari umuyoboke w'ihuriro ry'abanyeshuri b'Abirabura b'Abanyafurika mu Bufaransa (FEANF).\nUmwuga mu mabanki na politiki.\nAgarutse mu gihugu, mu gihe cy'impinduramatwara ya Thomas Sankara, Kabor\u00e9 yari umuyoboke w'umutwe wa politiki w'ibumoso, ULC-R. Mu 1984, afite imyaka 27, yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru wa Banque internationale du Burkina (BIB), imwe mu banki nkuru z'igihugu, kugeza muri Nzeri 1989. Muri uwo mwaka, Perezida Blaise Compaor\u00e9 yamugize Minisitiri w'Ubwikorezi n'Itumanaho. Mu 1992, yatorewe kuba umudepite uhagarariye intara ya Kadiogo, hanyuma aba Minisitiri w'Imari n'Igenamigambi kuva mu 1992 kugeza mu 1993.\nKu ya 20 Werurwe 1994, nyuma y'igabanywa ry'agaciro k'ifaranga rya CFA ryateje izamuka rikabije ry'ibiciro, Compaor\u00e9 yamugize Minisitiri w'Intebe. Muri Gashyantare 1996, ubwo ishyaka rishya rya Congr\u00e8s pour la d\u00e9mocratie et le progr\u00e8s (CDP) ryashingwaga, yeguye ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Intebe, aba visi-perezida wa mbere w'iryo shyaka n'umujyanama wihariye wa perezida. Ku ya 6 Kamena 2002, yatorewe kuyobora Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, asimbura M\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9 Traor\u00e9, kandi yongera gutorerwa uwo mwanya mu 2007. Muri Kanama 2003, yabaye perezida wa CDP.\nKuva muri CDP no gushinga MPP.\nMu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2010, Kabor\u00e9 yagiye ashyirwa ku ruhande muri CDP. Ku ya 6 Mutarama 2014, we n'abandi bayobozi bakomeye b'ishyaka, Simon Compaor\u00e9 na Salif Diallo, beguye muri CDP, bamagana imiyoborere idaha abandi ijambo n'umugambi wo guhindura Itegeko Nshinga kugira ngo Blaise Compaor\u00e9 ashobore kongera kwiyamamaza mu 2015. Ku ya 25 Mutarama 2014, bashinze ishyaka rya Mouvement du peuple pour le progr\u00e8s (MPP), riyoborwa na Kabor\u00e9. Mu mpera z'Ukwakira 2014, imyigaragambyo y'abaturage yahiritse Blaise Compaor\u00e9.\nPerezida wa Burukina Faso.\nMu matora ya perezida yo ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 2015, Kabor\u00e9 yatsinze ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 53,49%, imbere ya Z\u00e9phirin Diabr\u00e9. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku ya 29 Ukuboza 2015, asimbura Michel Kafando wari perezida w'inzibacyuho. Yagize Paul Kaba Thi\u00e9ba Minisitiri w'Intebe, ndetse afata n'inshingano za Minisitiri w'Ingabo kugeza mu 2017.\nIbyumweru bibiri nyuma yo kurahira, ku ya 15 Mutarama 2016, igitero cy'iterabwoba cyagabwe kuri resitora na hoteli i Ouagadougou, cyigambwe n'umutwe wa Al-Qa\u00efda mu Majyaruguru ya Afurika (AQMI), gihitana abantu mirongo itatu. Ibindi bitero byakurikiyeho mu majyaruguru y'igihugu, hafi y'imipaka na Mali na Nigeri. Guverinoma ye yashyizeho ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubutasi, kandi Burukina Faso ifatanya n'ibihugu by'akarere mu itsinda rya G5 Sahel. Muri Mutarama 2019, Minisitiri w'Intebe Thi\u00e9ba yeguye, asimburwa na Christophe Dabir\u00e9. Ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 2020, Kabor\u00e9 yongeye gutorwa ku cyiciro cya mbere n'amajwi 57,87%.\nIhirikwa ry'ubutegetsi.\nKu ya 14 Ugushyingo 2021, abarwanyi b'imitwe ya kisilamu bateye ikigo cya gisirikare cya Inata, bica abasirikare 53 n'abasivili 4; ibyo byateje imyigaragambyo isaba ko Kabor\u00e9 yegura, kubera ko ubutegetsi bwe bwananiwe kurinda abaturage. Ku ya 23 Mutarama 2022, abasirikare bigometse, maze bukeye Kabor\u00e9 afatwa, ahirikwa ku butegetsi, Itegeko Nshinga rihagarikwa, maze Liyetona-Koloneli Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba aba umukuru w'igihugu. Umutwe wa gisirikare wakoze kudeta watangaje ibaruwa yanditswe n'intoki n'uwahoze ari perezida, yegura \u00abku bw'inyungu z'igihugu\u00bb. Nk'uko Perezida wa Kote Divuwari, Alassane Ouattara, abivuga, Kabor\u00e9 yahisemo kwegura kugira ngo yirinde imirwano hagati y'abasirikare. Yabanje gufungirwa mu kigo cya gisirikare, hanyuma iwe ; nyuma y'igitutu cya CEDEAO, yararekuwe muri Mata 2022.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKabor\u00e9 yashakanye na Sika Bella Kabor\u00e9, bamenyaniye mu Bufaransa ari abanyeshuri; bashyingiranwe mu 1982, bafitanye abana batatu."}
{"id": "23234", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23234", "title": "Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba", "text": "Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba (yavutse mu Mutarama 1981 i Ouagadougou) ni umusirikare w'Umunyaburukina, wafite ipeti rya liyetona-koloneli, wabaye Perezida w'inzibacyuho wa Burukina Faso kuva ku ya 31 Mutarama kugeza ku ya 30 Nzeri 2022. Ku ya 24 Mutarama 2022, ayoboye umutwe wa gisirikare wiswe Mouvement patriotique pour la sauvegarde et la restauration (MPSR), yahiritse ku butegetsi Perezida Roch Marc Christian Kabor\u00e9, amushinja kunanirwa kurwanya imitwe y'iterabwoba. Nyuma y'amezi umunani gusa, ku ya 30 Nzeri 2022, na we yahiritswe n'undi musirikare, Kapiteni Ibrahim Traor\u00e9, maze ahungira muri Togo. Muri Mutarama 2026, yafatiwe i Lom\u00e9, yoherezwa muri Burukina Faso, aho akurikiranyweho ibyaha bitandukanye.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nDamiba yavukiye i Ouagadougou mu Mutarama 1981. Yize mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Kadiogo (\"Prytan\u00e9e militaire de Kadiogo\"), mu kiciro cyo mu 1992, no mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Georges Namoano i P\u00f4. Yarangije amasomo mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Paris (\"\u00c9cole militaire\"), aho yahuriye na Mamadi Doumbouya, waje kuyobora Gineya. Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu bumenyi bw'ibyaha yakuye muri Conservatoire national des arts et m\u00e9tiers (CNAM) i Paris, n'impamyabumenyi y'impuguke mu micungire, ubuyobozi n'ingamba za gisirikare. Kuva mu 2010 kugeza mu 2020, yitabiriye amahugurwa menshi ya gisirikare yateguwe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, nk'imyitozo ya Flintlock.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nDamiba yahoze ari umwe mu bagize umutwe w'abarinzi ba perezida (\"R\u00e9giment de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 pr\u00e9sidentielle\", RSP) wa Blaise Compaor\u00e9, awuvamo mu 2011 nyuma y'imyivumbagatanyo y'abasirikare. Mu 2019, yatanze ubuhamya mu rubanza rw'abagize uruhare muri kudeta yo mu 2015.\nKuva mu 2015 kugeza mu 2019, yayoboye abasirikare mu turere twa Sahel (i Dori) n'Amajyaruguru (i Ouahigouya), aho imitwe y'abarwanyi ba kisilamu yakoreraga. Mu 2021, yasohoye igitabo kivuga ku rugamba rwo kurwanya iterabwoba, \"Arm\u00e9es ouest-africaines et terrorisme: r\u00e9ponses incertaines ?\". Yamenyekanye kubera ibikorwa bye mu rugamba rwo kurwanya iyo mitwe, ndetse asaba ko guverinoma yakwitabaza abacancuro b'Abarusiya bo mu itsinda rya Wagner, ariko guverinoma ya Kabor\u00e9 irabyanga. Mu Ukuboza 2021, nyuma y'igitero cy'iterabwoba ku kigo cya Inata cyahitanye abajandarume benshi, Perezida Kabor\u00e9 yamugize umuyobozi w'akarere ka gatatu ka gisirikare, karimo Ouagadougou, Manga, Koudougou na Fada N'Gourma.\nPerezida w'inzibacyuho.\nKu ya 24 Mutarama 2022, Damiba yayoboye kudeta yahiritse Perezida Kabor\u00e9 na Minisitiri w'Intebe Lassina Zerbo. Abasirikare batangaje iseswa ry'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko na guverinoma, n'ihagarikwa ry'Itegeko Nshinga. Iyo kudeta yakiriwe neza n'abaturage benshi, bamwe bazamura amabendera y'Uburusiya. Ku ya 31 Mutarama, itegeko shingiro ryagaruye Itegeko Nshinga, rimuha umwanya wa Perezida ; Inama y'Itegeko Nshinga yamwemeje ku ya 10 Gashyantare, maze arahira ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2022. Ku ya 1 Werurwe, hemejwe amasezerano y'inzibacyuho y'imyaka itatu, maze ku ya 3 Werurwe agira Albert Ou\u00e9draogo Minisitiri w'Intebe.\nNubwo yari yiyemeje kugarura umutekano, ubutegetsi bwe ntibwashoboye gutsinda imitwe y'iterabwoba, yaje kugenzura hafi 40% by'igihugu muri Nzeri 2022. Nyuma y'ibitero bikomeye, ku ya 12 Nzeri 2022 yirukanye Minisitiri w'Ingabo, yifatira iyo minisiteri. Yakunze kugaragara yambaye ingofero itukura, bamwe babona ko yigana Thomas Sankara.\nIhirikwa n'ubuhungiro.\nKu ya 30 Nzeri 2022, abasirikare batishimiye imiyoborere ye, bayobowe na Kapiteni Ibrahim Traor\u00e9, baramuhiritse. Ubutegetsi bushya bwabanje kumushinja kugerageza guhungira mu kigo cya gisirikare cy'Abafaransa kugira ngo ategure kudeta, ibyo arabihakana. Ku ya 2 Ukwakira 2022, nyuma y'ubuhuza bw'abayobozi b'amadini n'aba gakondo, yemeye kwegura, asaba ingwate zirindwi, zirimo umutekano we n'uw'abamushyigikiye, maze ahungira muri Togo.\nMuri Nyakanga 2024, yandikiye Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 ibaruwa agaragaza impungenge ku iyongera ry'umutekano muke n'ihohoterwa rishobora gukorerwa abasivili. Muri Nzeri 2024, ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare bwamushinje gutegura umugambi wo guhirika ubutegetsi, maze mu Ugushyingo 2024 avanwa mu ngabo hamwe n'abandi basirikare bakuru 15. Ku ya 16 Mutarama 2026, yafatiwe i Lom\u00e9, yoherezwa muri Burukina Faso, aho akurikiranyweho ibyaha birimo kunyereza umutungo wa leta n'ibikorwa byo guhungabanya umutekano."}
{"id": "23235", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23235", "title": "Blaise Compaor\u00e9", "text": "Blaise Compaor\u00e9 (yavutse ku ya 3 Gashyantare 1951 i Ziniar\u00e9) ni umusirikare akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyaburukina, wabaye Perezida wa Burukina Faso kuva mu 1987 kugeza mu 2014, akaba ari we wayoboye icyo gihugu igihe kirekire kurusha abandi. Yari inshuti magara n'umwungirije wa Thomas Sankara, wamugize Minisitiri w'Ubutabera mu 1985, ariko ku ya 15 Ukwakira 1987 ayobora kudeta yaguyemo Sankara, maze afata ubutegetsi. Yasimbuje politiki y'impinduramatwara ya Sankara iyo yise \u00abikosora\u00bb, agarura umubano mwiza n'Ubufaransa na Kote Divuwari. Yatsinze amatora ya 1991, 1998, 2005 na 2010, atafatwaga nk'ayakozwe mu bwisanzure n'ubutabera. Mu Ukwakira 2014, umugambi we wo guhindura Itegeko Nshinga kugira ngo yongere kwiyamamaza wateje imyigaragambyo ikomeye y'abaturage, bimuhatira kwegura no guhungira muri Kote Divuwari. Muri Mata 2022, yakatiwe adahari igifungo cya burundu, nyuma yo guhamwa n'icyaha cyo kugira uruhare mu iyicwa rya Sankara.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nBlaise Compaor\u00e9 yavukiye i Ziniar\u00e9, mu majyaruguru ya Ouagadougou, ku ya 3 Gashyantare 1951. Ni imfura mu bana barindwi; se, Bila Maurice Compaor\u00e9, yari yarabaye umusirikare mu ngabo z'Abafaransa mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. Yize mu ishuri Gatolika i Fada N'Gourma, hanyuma i Ouagadougou. Nyuma y'urupfu rw'ababyeyi be, yabaye inshuti magara y'umuryango wa Thomas Sankara, ndetse se wa Sankara amufata nk'umwana we.\nMu 1971, nyuma y'imyigaragambyo y'abanyeshuri, yinjijwe ku ngufu mu gisirikare, maze ahitamo kuwugira umwuga. Mu 1973, yinjiye mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare rya Yaound\u00e9, muri Kameruni, hanyuma akurikirana amahugurwa menshi mu Ubufaransa no muri Maroke. Mu 1981, yabaye umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'igihugu cy'imyitozo y'abakomando i P\u00f4, maze mu 1982 aba kapiteni.\nMu butegetsi bwa Sankara.\nKu ya 4 Kanama 1983, Compaor\u00e9 yayoboye abasirikare b'i P\u00f4 bashyize Thomas Sankara ku butegetsi. Ku butegetsi bwa Sankara, yari umwungirije, umwe mu bagize Inama y'Igihugu y'Impinduramatwara, Minisitiri wa Leta muri Perezidansi, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Ubutabera kuva mu 1985. Mu ntambara ya Agacher na Mali yo mu Ukuboza 1985, yayoboye abasirikare ba Burukina Faso.\nPerezida wa Burukina Faso.\nKudeta yo mu 1987.\nKu ya 15 Ukwakira 1987, Compaor\u00e9 yafashe ubutegetsi muri kudeta yaguyemo Thomas Sankara n'abandi bantu cumi na babiri. Yavuze ko Sankara \u00abyagambaniye impinduramatwara\u00bb, atangiza politiki y'\u00abikosora\u00bb (\"rectification\"), yagaruye umubano mwiza na Kote Divuwari n'Ubufaransa. Nyuma y'igihe gito, abandi bahoze ari bagenzi be mu butegetsi bwa Sankara, Henri Zongo na Jean-Baptiste Boukary Lingani, barishwe bashinjwa umugambi wo kumuhirika. Mu Mata 2006, Komite ya Loni ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu yamaganye Burukina Faso kubera kwanga gukora iperereza ku rupfu rwa Sankara.\nAmatora.\nMu 1989, Compaor\u00e9 yashinze ishyaka rya Organisation pour la d\u00e9mocratie populaire/Mouvement du travail (ODP/MT), ryaje kwihuza n'andi mashyaka cumi n'abiri, rikabyara Congr\u00e8s pour la d\u00e9mocratie et le progr\u00e8s (CDP) ku ya 5 Gashyantare 1996. Ku ya 1 Ukuboza 1991, yatorewe kuba Perezida mu matora yanzwe n'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, abaturage 25% gusa bakaba ari bo bitabiriye. Yongeye gutorwa ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 1998. Iminsi mike nyuma y'ayo matora, ku ya 13 Ukuboza 1998, umunyamakuru Norbert Zongo, wakoraga iperereza ku rupfu rw'umushoferi wa murumuna wa perezida, Fran\u00e7ois Compaor\u00e9, yiciwe hamwe n'abandi bantu batatu; urwo rupfu rwateje imyigaragambyo ikomeye.\nMu 2005, nubwo Itegeko Nshinga ryavuguruwe mu 2000 ryagabanyaga manda za perezida, Inama y'Itegeko Nshinga yamwemereye kongera kwiyamamaza, maze ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 2005 yongera gutorwa n'amajwi 80,35%. Mu matora yo mu Ugushyingo 2010, yatorewe manda ya nyuma n'amajwi 80,15%. Mu 2011, urupfu rw'umunyeshuri wakubiswe n'abapolisi i Koudougou rwateje imyigaragambyo n'imyivumbagatanyo y'abasirikare mu gihugu hose.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nUbutegetsi bwa Compaor\u00e9 bwashinjwe gushyigikira imitwe yitwaje intwaro mu karere: bwafashije Charles Taylor mu ntambara y'abenegihugu ya Liberiya, buhereza intwaro inyeshyamba za RUF muri Siyera Lewone, kandi bushyigikira inyeshyamba za Forces nouvelles muri Kote Divuwari. Nanone kandi, Compaor\u00e9 yabaye umuhuza mu bibazo by'akarere: yayoboye ibiganiro hagati y'Abanyatogo mu 2006, ibiganiro byatumye hasinywa amasezerano y'amahoro ya Ouagadougou hagati ya Laurent Gbagbo na Guillaume Soro ku ya 4 Werurwe 2007, ndetse n'ibiganiro bijyanye na kudeta yo muri Mali mu 2012. Mu 2014, BBC yavuze ko yari umufatanyabikorwa ukomeye w'Ubufaransa na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika mu karere.\nImpinduramatwara yo mu 2014.\nMu Ukwakira 2014, Compaor\u00e9 yashakaga guhindura ingingo ya 37 y'Itegeko Nshinga, igabanya umubare wa manda za perezida, kugira ngo yiyamamarize manda ya gatanu mu 2015. Ku ya 30 Ukwakira 2014, ubwo Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yiteguraga gutora iryo vugurura, imyigaragambyo ikomeye yadutse i Ouagadougou no mu yindi mijyi; abigaragambyaga batwitse inyubako y'Inteko, maze ihohoterwa ry'inzego z'umutekano rihitana nibura abantu 30. Bukeye, ku ya 31 Ukwakira 2014, Compaor\u00e9 yeguye, kuko ingabo zitari zikimushyigikiye. Afashijwe n'Ubufaransa, yahungiye muri Kote Divuwari, aho yahawe ubwenegihugu.\nUrubanza rw'iyicwa rya Sankara.\nKuva mu Ukuboza 2015, ubutabera bwa gisirikare bwa Burukina Faso bwasohoye impapuro mpuzamahanga zo kumuta muri yombi kubera uruhare akekwaho mu iyicwa rya Sankara. Muri Mata 2021, yarezwe adahari, maze urubanza rutangira ku ya 11 Ukwakira 2021 ; Compaor\u00e9 yanze kujya kuburanira i Ouagadougou, kandi Kote Divuwari ntiyashoboraga kumwohereza kuko ari umwenegihugu wayo. Ku ya 6 Mata 2022, yahamwe n'ibyaha byo kugira uruhare mu bwicanyi no guhungabanya umutekano w'igihugu, akatirwa adahari igifungo cya burundu.\nMuri Nyakanga 2022, Compaor\u00e9 yagarutse by'igihe gito muri Burukina Faso ku butumire bwa Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba, ariko ntiyatabwa muri yombi, hanyuma asubira muri Kote Divuwari. Muri uko kwezi, mu ibaruwa yashyizwe ahagaragara, yasabye imbabazi Abanyaburukina, atavuze neza ibyaha yakoze.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1985, Compaor\u00e9 yashakanye na Chantal Terrasson de Foug\u00e8res, Umufaransa-Umunyakotedivuwari; bafitanye umukobwa umwe, Djamila. Kuva yahunga, aba i Abidjan."}
{"id": "23236", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23236", "title": "Robert Mugabe", "text": "Robert Gabriel Karigamombe Mugabe (yavutse ku ya 21 Gashyantare 1924 i Kutama, apfa ku ya 6 Nzeri 2019 i Singapore) yari umunyapolitiki wa Zimbabwe, wabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe kuva mu 1980 kugeza mu 1987, hanyuma Perezida wa Repubulika kuva mu 1987 kugeza mu 2017. Umwarimu wari ufite ibitekerezo bya gikomunisiti, yafatanyije gushinga ishyaka rya Zimbabwe African National Union (ZANU), maze ayobora urugamba rw'inyeshyamba rwo kurwanya ubutegetsi bw'Abazungu bake bwa Ian Smith muri Rodeziya, bimugira umwe mu \u00abbabyeyi b'ubwigenge\u00bb bwa Zimbabwe. Mu myaka ya mbere y'ubutegetsi bwe, yateje imbere cyane uburezi n'ubuzima, ariko ashinjwa ubwicanyi bwa \"Gukurahundi\" bwibasiye Abandebele mu myaka ya 1980. Kuva mu myaka ya 2000, ivugurura ry'ubutaka ryambuye ku ngufu abahinzi b'Abazungu, ihonyorwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu, ubushomeri n'izamuka rikabije ry'ibiciro byashegeshe igihugu, bituma ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba bimufatira ibihano. Mu Ugushyingo 2017, afite imyaka 93, yahatiwe kwegura nyuma ya kudeta y'igisirikare, maze apfa nyuma y'imyaka ibiri.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nRobert Mugabe yavukiye ku ya 21 Gashyantare 1924, akurira mu misiyoni Gatolika y'Abayezuwiti ya Kutama, mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Salisbury (ubu ni Harare). Se, wari waraturutse muri Nyasaland (ubu ni Malawi), yataye umuryango Mugabe afite imyaka icumi, maze arerwa na nyina, Umushona. Yakuze akunda gusoma no kwiga.\nAmaze kuba umwarimu afite imyaka 17, yize icyongereza n'amateka muri Kaminuza ya Fort Hare, muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, aho yahuriye n'abayobozi b'ahazaza nka Julius Nyerere na Kenneth Kaunda; yarangije mu 1951. Nyuma yaho, yabonye impamyabumenyi zindi zirimo iy'ubukungu muri Kaminuza ya Londres, yize ari kure. Yigishije muri Zambiya, hanyuma i Accra, muri Gana, aho yahuriye na Sally Hayfron, waje kuba umugore we.\nUrugamba rwo kubohora igihugu.\nMu 1960, Mugabe yagarutse muri Rodeziya y'Amajyepfo afite ibitekerezo bya gikomunisiti, yinjira mu ishyaka rya Joshua Nkomo ryaje kwitwa Zimbabwe African People's Union (ZAPU). Mu 1963, yashinze ishyaka rye bwite, ZANU, hamwe na Ndabaningi Sithole na Herbert Chitepo, aba umunyamabanga mukuru waryo. ZAPU na ZANU byakomeje gutandukanywa n'amoko: Abandebele ku ruhande rumwe, Abashona ku rundi. Mu 1964, Mugabe yarafashwe, afungwa imyaka icumi; muri gereza, yize amategeko, maze mu 1974 aba umuyobozi wa ZANU. Muri icyo gihe, umuhungu we w'imyaka itatu yarapfuye, ariko ubutegetsi bwa Ian Smith bwanga ko ajya kumushyingura.\nAmaze kurekurwa mu Ugushyingo 1974, Mugabe yahungiye muri Mozambike, aho yayoboye ingabo za ZANU, ZANLA, mu ntambara y'inyeshyamba yo kurwanya ubutegetsi bwa Ian Smith, afashijwe na FRELIMO. Iyo ntambara yahitanye abantu bari hagati ya 20 000 na 30 000. Mu Ukuboza 1979, amasezerano ya Lancaster House yatumye habaho amatora y'amoko yose mu 1980, ariko akomeza guha Abazungu uburenganzira bwihariye, harimo kimwe cya gatanu cy'imyanya mu Nteko n'umwanya wabo ku butaka mu gihe cy'imyaka icumi. Muri Werurwe 1980, ishyaka rya ZANU ryatsinze amatora, ryegukana imyanya 57 kuri 80 yagenewe Abirabura.\nMinisitiri w'Intebe (1980\u20131987).\nKu ya 18 Mata 1980, Zimbabwe ibonye ubwigenge, Mugabe yabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe, mu gihe Canaan Banana yabaye Perezida. Mu ijambo rye, yasabye ubwiyunge, avuga ko ikibi gikomeza kuba ikibi, cyaba gikozwe n'Umuzungu ku Mwirabura cyangwa n'Umwirabura ku Muzungu; yashyize n'abaminisitiri babiri b'Abazungu muri guverinoma. Mu 1982, Salisbury yahinduriwe izina iba Harare. Ubutegetsi bwe bwashoye imari nyinshi mu buzima n'uburezi: hagati ya 1980 na 1988, umubare w'abana bakingiwe wavuye kuri 25% ugera kuri 67%, kandi abiga mu mashuri abanza bariyongera cyane nyuma y'uko uburezi bw'ibanze buba ubuntu.\nMu 1983, imyivumbagatanyo mu ntara ya Matabeleland yashyize iherezo ku bufatanye bwa ZANU na ZAPU. Mugabe yohereje burigade ya gatanu y'ingabo, yari yaratojwe n'abarimu bo muri Koreya ya Ruguru; mu bikorwa byiswe \"Gukurahundi\", abasivili b'Abandebele babarirwa mu bihumbi barishwe. Mu 1987, amasezerano y'amahoro yatumye ZAPU yihuza na ZANU, havuka ishyaka rya ZANU\u2013PF, maze Mugabe aba Perezida ufite ububasha bwagutse, umwanya wa Minisitiri w'Intebe ukurwaho.\nPerezida wa Zimbabwe (1987\u20132017).\nImyaka ya 1990.\nMu 1988, Mugabe yagize Joshua Nkomo visi-perezida. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, yemeye amabwiriza ya FMI na Banki y'Isi, agabanya amafaranga leta isohora n'imirimo myinshi ya leta, ibyo byateje ubushomeri n'umujinya mu baturage. Mu 1998, mu ntambara ya kabiri ya Kongo, yohereje abasirikare 20 000 gushyigikira Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nIvugurura ry'ubutaka.\nIgihe Mugabe yafataga ubutegetsi, 40% by'ubutaka bwo guhinga byari mu maboko y'abahinzi b'Abazungu 6 000. Mu 2000, kamarampaka ku Itegeko Nshinga rishya ryari kwemera kwambura ubutaka nta ngurane yatsinzwe n'amajwi 54,7%; ariko Mugabe yashyize mu bikorwa iryo vugurura akoresheje imitwe y'abiyita abahoze ari abarwanyi, bigarurira imirima, bamwe mu bahinzi b'Abazungu baricwa. Abazungu benshi bavuye mu gihugu: umubare wabo wavuye ku 250 000 mu 1980 ugera ku 40 000 mu 2015. Iryo vugurura ryagabanyije cyane umusaruro w'ubuhinzi, maze igihugu cyari kizwiho kohereza ibigori mu mahanga gitangira kubitumiza. Mugabe yanavuze amagambo menshi yafashwe nk'ay'ivangura rishingiye ku ruhu ryibasira Abazungu.\nIgitugu n'ibihano mpuzamahanga.\nKuva mu 2000, ubutegetsi bwe bwakaje ihonyorwa ry'abatavuga rumwe na bwo, cyane cyane ishyaka rishya rya Movement for Democratic Change (MDC) rya Morgan Tsvangirai, n'ubwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru. Mu 2005, mu gikorwa cyiswe \"Murambatsvina\", abantu bagera ku 700 000 birukanwe mu nzu zabo i Harare. Mu 2002, ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba byamufatiye ibihano, kandi Zimbabwe ihagarikwa mu Muryango wa Commonwealth, maze mu 2003 Mugabe ayivanamo burundu. Yamaganwe na Desmond Tutu, wamwise \u00abigisekeje cy'umunyagitugu w'Umunyafurika\u00bb, nubwo bamwe mu bayobozi b'Afurika bakomeje kumushyigikira kubera urugamba rwe rwo kurwanya ubukoloni. Yarwanyaga yivuye inyuma abaryamana bahuje ibitsina.\nUbukungu bw'igihugu bwarashegeshwe: mu 2008, izamuka ry'ibiciro ryageze hafi kuri 165 000% ku mwaka, kandi bane mu bantu bakuru batanu nta kazi bari bafite.\nAmatora ya 2008 n'aya 2013.\nMu matora ya perezida yo mu 2008, icyiciro cya mbere cyatsinzwe na Morgan Tsvangirai n'amajwi 47,9%, kuri 43,2% ya Mugabe. Nyuma y'urugomo rwakorewe abamushyigikiye, Tsvangirai yavuye mu cyiciro cya kabiri, maze Mugabe atorwa wenyine; Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe wavuze ko ayo matora atubahirije amahame ya demokarasi, usaba ko hashyirwaho guverinoma y'ubumwe. Ku ya 31 Nyakanga 2013, Mugabe yongeye gutorwa, nubwo hagaragaye amakosa menshi. Mu Ukuboza 2014, yirukanye Visi-Perezida Joice Mujuru, amusimbuza Emmerson Mnangagwa.\nKudeta yo mu 2017.\nMu 2017, Mugabe wari umaze kugira imyaka 93, yagaragaje ubushake bwo kuzasimburwa n'umugore we, Grace Mugabe. Ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 2017, yirukanye Visi-Perezida Mnangagwa, ibyo bitashimishije ingabo. Ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 2017, ingabo zafashe ubutegetsi, Mugabe n'umugore we bafungirwa iwabo. Ku ya 18 Ugushyingo, ibihumbi by'abaturage bigaragambije i Harare basaba ko yegura, maze ku ya 19 Ugushyingo ZANU\u2013PF imwirukana ku buyobozi bwayo. Ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 2017, ubwo Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yatangiraga inzira yo kumweguza, Mugabe yatanze ibaruwa yegura, asimburwa na Mnangagwa.\nNyuma y'ubutegetsi n'urupfu.\nMnangagwa yamwise \u00abumubyeyi w'igihugu\u00bb, kandi itariki y'amavuko ye, 21 Gashyantare, igirwa umunsi w'ikiruhuko. Ariko Mugabe yakomeje kuvuga ko yahiritswe na kudeta. Ku ya 6 Nzeri 2019, yaguye mu bitaro i Singapore, aho yari amaze amezi ane avurwa kanseri, afite imyaka 95. Nyuma y'impaka hagati ya guverinoma n'umuryango we, yashyinguwe mu mudugudu w'iwabo wa Kutama ku ya 28 Nzeri 2019. ZANU\u2013PF yamuhaye icyubahiro cy'\u00abintwari y'igihugu\u00bb.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1961, Mugabe yashakanye na Sally Hayfron, wakomokaga muri Gana; umwana wabo w'umuhungu, Michael, yapfuye mu 1966. Sally yapfuye mu 1992, maze mu 1996 Mugabe ashakana na Grace Marufu, bari bafitanye abana babiri, Bona na Robert, kandi babyarana undi mwana, Chatunga, mu 1997. Yari Umukristo Gatolika."}
{"id": "23237", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23237", "title": "Mobutu Sese Seko", "text": "Mobutu Sese Seko Kuku Ngbendu wa Za Banga (amazina y'amavuko: Joseph-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Mobutu; yavutse ku ya 14 Ukwakira 1930 i Lisala, apfa ku ya 7 Nzeri 1997 i Rabat) yari umusirikare akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyekongo, wayoboye Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuva mu 1965, akayihindurira izina ikitwa Zayire mu 1971, kugeza mu 1997. Yafashe ubutegetsi muri kudeta yo mu 1965, ashyiraho ubutegetsi bw'ishyaka rimwe, Mouvement populaire de la r\u00e9volution (MPR), n'umuco wo kumuramya. Mu rwego rwa politiki y'\u00abumwimerere\u00bb (\"authenticit\u00e9\"), yahinduye amazina y'igihugu, ay'umugezi n'ay'ifaranga, ndetse n'amazina y'abaturage. Ku butegetsi bwe, uburenganzira bwa muntu bwarahonyowe cyane, kandi ruswa yari ikabije ku buryo ubutegetsi bwe bwiswe \u00abubutegetsi bw'abajura\u00bb (\"kleptocratie\"). Mu gihe cy'Intambara y'Ubutita, ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba, cyane cyane Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, Ubufaransa n'Ububiligi, byaramushyigikiye kubera ko yarwanyaga ubukomunisiti. Muri Gicurasi 1997, inyeshyamba za AFDL ziyobowe na Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila zaramuhiritse, maze apfira mu buhungiro muri Maroke nyuma y'amezi atatu.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nJoseph-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Mobutu yavukiye i Lisala mu 1930, mu bwoko bw'Abangbandi. Nyina, Marie Madeleine Yemo, yari umukozi wo mu rugo, naho se, Alb\u00e9ric Gbemani, yari umutetsi w'umucamanza w'Umubiligi. Se yapfuye Mobutu afite imyaka umunani. Yize mu ishuri ry'abafurere Gatolika i Coquilhatville (ubu ni Mbandaka) ; yakundaga gusoma ibitabo by'amateka.\nMu 1950, yinjiye mu ngabo z'abakoloni (\"Force publique\"), aho yabaye su-ofisiye, akazivamo mu 1956. Nyuma yaho, yabaye umunyamakuru mu kinyamakuru \"L'Avenir\" cy'i L\u00e9opoldville (ubu ni Kinshasa). Mu 1957, yahuye na Patrice Lumumba, maze mu ntangiriro za 1960 yinjira mu ishyaka rye, Mouvement national congolais (MNC).\nKujya ku butegetsi.\nMuri Nyakanga 1960, igihugu kibona ubwigenge, Mobutu yabaye umunyamabanga wa leta muri guverinoma ya Patrice Lumumba, hanyuma umugaba wungirije w'ingabo. Mu gihe cy'amakimbirane hagati ya Lumumba na Perezida Joseph Kasa-Vubu, ku ya 14 Nzeri 1960 Mobutu yakoze kudeta ya mbere, ahirika guverinoma ya Lumumba yari yaratowe, ashyigikiwe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika n'Ububiligi; guverinoma yashyizeho yatanze Lumumba muri Katanga, aho yiciwe ku ya 17 Mutarama 1961. Muri Mutarama 1961, yagizwe jenerali-majoro. Mu 1964\u20131965, ingabo zayobowe na Mobutu, zifashijwe n'Abanyamerika, zatsinze imyivumbagatanyo y'aba Simba n'iya Kwilu yari yigaruriye igice kinini cy'igihugu.\nKu ya 24 Ugushyingo 1965, Mobutu yakoze kudeta ya kabiri yahiritse Perezida Kasa-Vubu, afata ubutegetsi ubwe. Yatangaje ko nta bikorwa by'amashyaka bizabaho mu myaka itanu. Ububiligi na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika ni byo byabaye ibya mbere mu kwemera ubutegetsi bwe.\nPerezida wa Zayire.\nUbutegetsi bw'ishyaka rimwe.\nMuri Kamena 1966, abahoze ari abaminisitiri bane, barimo uwahoze ari Minisitiri w'Intebe \u00c9variste Kimba, bamanitswe mu ruhame, bashinjwa umugambi wo guhirika ubutegetsi. Mu 1967, yashinze ishyaka rimwe ryemewe, Mouvement populaire de la r\u00e9volution (MPR), rifite intero ivuga ko ritari \u00abiburyo cyangwa ibumoso\u00bb. Amashyirahamwe y'abakozi yahujwe mu rimwe rigenzurwa na leta. Yashyizeho imitwe myinshi y'ingabo ishinzwe kumurinda, nka Division sp\u00e9ciale pr\u00e9sidentielle. Mu matora, yatorwaga ku majwi hafi yose; mu matora amwe, amajwi yarenze umubare w'abatora banditse. Mu 1983, yiyitiriye ipeti rya mareshali.\nPolitiki y'\u00abumwimerere\u00bb.\nMu 1971, Mobutu yahinduye izina ry'igihugu, iry'umugezi wa Kongo n'iry'ifaranga, abyita \u00abZayire\u00bb. Yategetse abaturage gufata amazina y'Abanyafurika aho kuba ay'Abakristo, maze mu 1972 na we yiyita Mobutu Sese Seko Kuku Ngbendu wa Za Banga, bisobanura \u00abintwari ishobora byose, igenda itsinda\u00bb. Yaretse imyambaro ya gisirikare, yambara ikote ryiswe \"abacost\" (\u00abhasi ikoti\u00bb) n'ingofero y'uruhu rw'ingwe.\nRuswa n'ubukungu.\nMu myaka ya mbere, ubukungu bwari bwifashe neza kubera umutungo kamere w'igihugu, ariko imishinga minini ihenze, igabanuka ry'igiciro cy'umuringa n'ubwigarurire bw'ibigo by'abanyamahanga bwiswe \u00abzairianisation\u00bb mu 1973 byashegeshe ubukungu. Mobutu yashyizeho uburyo bwo kugura abamushyigikira binyuze mu gutanga imyanya n'amafaranga, kandi ruswa iba ikintu gisanzwe mu nzego zose. Abaturage benshi bari mu bukene, mu gihe we yakusanyije umutungo ugereranywa hagati ya miliyoni 50 na miliyari 5 z'amadolari. Mu 1991, ikinyamakuru \"The Washington Post\" cyavuze ko yanyereje hafi miliyari 5 z'amadolari. Yari afite amazu y'agaciro kenshi mu Burayi, ndetse yubakisha ingoro i Gbadolite, yiswe \u00abVersailles y'ishyamba\u00bb, n'ikibuga cy'indege gishobora kwakira indege ya Concorde, yakundaga gukodesha mu ngendo ze.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nMobutu yari inshuti ikomeye y'ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba mu kurwanya ubukomunisiti muri Afurika, ashyigikirwa cyane na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, Ubufaransa n'Ububiligi. Yagiranye kandi umubano ukomeye na Afurika y'Epfo y'ivanguraruhu, Isirayeli n'uBushinwa. Mu ntambara y'abenegihugu ya Angola, yashyigikiye inyeshyamba za FNLA na UNITA zarwanyaga MPLA. Mu 1977 no mu 1978, ubwo inyeshyamba zaturutse muri Angola zateraga intara ya Shaba, Ubufaransa n'Ububiligi byohereje ingabo zo kumutabara. Perezida Ronald Reagan yamushimiye mu 1983.\nIhirikwa n'urupfu.\nIntambara y'Ubutita imaze kurangira, ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba byaretse kumushyigikira. Muri Mata 1990, yemeye amashyaka menshi, maze Inama y'Igihugu yashyizeho itangira kunenga ubutegetsi bwe. Mu 1993, igihugu cyari gifite guverinoma ebyiri, imwe imushyigikiye n'indi iyobowe na \u00c9tienne Tshisekedi.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994, abasirikare n'abarwanyi bayigizemo uruhare bahungiye mu burasirazuba bwa Zayire, bitwikira impunzi, bituma akarere kose kajya mu mutekano muke. Mu 1996, inyeshyamba za Alliance des forces d\u00e9mocratiques pour la lib\u00e9ration du Congo (AFDL), ziyobowe na Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila kandi zishyigikiwe n'u Rwanda n'Ubugande, zatangiye intambara ya mbere ya Kongo. Nubwo Nelson Mandela yagerageje kumuhuza na Kabila, inyeshyamba zinjiye i Kinshasa ku ya 17 Gicurasi 1997, maze ku ya 23 Gicurasi igihugu cyongera kwitwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMobutu yabanje guhungira muri Togo, ariko Perezida Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma amusaba kuvayo nyuma y'iminsi mike ; yahise ajya i Rabat, muri Maroke. Ku ya 7 Nzeri 1997, yaguye i Rabat azize kanseri ya porositate, afite imyaka 66, ashyingurwa mu irimbi ry'Abakristo ry'uwo mujyi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1955, Mobutu yashakanye na Marie-Antoinette Gbiatibwa Yetene, wapfuye mu 1977; mu 1980, yashakanye na Bobi Ladawa. Yari afite abana benshi; umuhungu we w'imfura, Nyiwa, yateguraga kuzamusimbura, yapfuye mu 1994. Umwe mu bahungu be, Nzanga Mobutu, yaje kuba umunyapolitiki."}
{"id": "23238", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23238", "title": "Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila", "text": "Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila (yavutse ku ya 27 Ugushyingo 1939 i Jadotville, ubu ni Likasi, apfa yishwe ku ya 16 Mutarama 2001 i Kinshasa), uzwi ku izina rya \u00ab\"Mzee\"\u00bb (\u00abUmukambwe\u00bb mu Giswahili), yari inyeshyamba akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyekongo, Perezida wa gatatu wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuva mu 1997 kugeza yishwe mu 2001. Yamenyekanye mu myaka ya 1960 nk'umwe mu barwanyaga ubutegetsi, mu myivumbagatanyo y'aba Simba, maze kuva mu 1967 kugeza mu 1986 ayobora agace k'inyeshyamba ka Fizi, mu Kivu y'Amajyepfo. Mu 1996, yabaye umuyobozi w'umutwe w'inyeshyamba wa AFDL, washyigikiwe n'u Rwanda n'Ubugande, wahiritse Mobutu Sese Seko mu ntambara ya mbere ya Kongo, maze ahindura izina ry'igihugu, Zayire, kigasubirana izina rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu 1998, yategetse ingabo z'amahanga kuva mu gihugu, bituma intambara ya kabiri ya Kongo itangira. Muri Mutarama 2001, yiciwe n'umwe mu barinzi be, maze asimburwa n'umuhungu we, Joseph Kabila.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nKabila yavukiye i Jadotville (ubu ni Likasi), muri Katanga, nubwo andi masoko avuga ko yavukiye i Baudouinville (ubu ni Moba). Se yari Umuluba, nyina akaba Umulunda. Yize amashuri yisumbuye i \u00c9lisabethville (ubu ni Lubumbashi); bivugwa ko yize no mu mahanga, i Paris, Tachkent, Belgrade cyangwa Dar es Salaam, ariko nta bimenyetso byabyo byabonetse.\nIbikorwa bya politiki n'inyeshyamba.\nNyuma y'ubwigenge bwa Kongo mu 1960, ubwo Katanga yiyomoraga iyobowe na Mo\u00efse Tshombe, Kabila yari umwe mu bayobozi b'urubyiruko rw'ishyaka Balubakat, rwarwanyije uko kwiyomora. Mu 1963, yinjiye mu Komite y'Igihugu yo Kwibohora (CNL), ihuriro ry'abashyigikiye Patrice Lumumba, maze yoherezwa mu burasirazuba bwa Kongo gutegura imyivumbagatanyo, yari igice cy'iyitwaga iy'aba Simba. Mu 1965, yahuye n'impinduramatwara w'Umunyakiba Che Guevara, wari waje gufasha inyeshyamba; Guevara yavuze ko Kabila yari afite imico y'umuyobozi w'abaturage, ariko amunenga kutagaragaza ubushake buhagije mu mpinduramatwara no gukunda kuba kure y'urugamba.\nMu 1967, Kabila yashinze ishyaka rya Parti de la r\u00e9volution populaire (PRP), maze ashyiraho mu misozi ya Fizi-Baraka, muri Kivu y'Amajyepfo, agace kigenga kayoborwaga n'ibitekerezo bya gikomunisiti, gashyigikiwe n'uBushinwa. Yashinjwe kwigwizaho umutungo binyuze mu bucuruzi bwa zahabu n'amahembe y'inzovu. Ako gace karasenyutse mu myaka ya 1980, maze Kabila ararigiswa. Muri icyo gihe, yagiranye umubano n'abayobozi b'akarere, barimo Yoweri Museveni na Julius Nyerere, bamumenyekanishije kuri Paul Kagame.\nIntambara ya mbere ya Kongo.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994, abasirikare n'abarwanyi bayigizemo uruhare bahungiye muri Zayire, bituma inkambi z'impunzi zo ku mupaka ziba ibirindiro by'abarwanyi bashakaga gusubira gutera u Rwanda. Leta y'u Rwanda yafataga izo nkambi nk'ikibazo gikomeye cy'umutekano. Mu Ukwakira 1996, umutwe wa Alliance des forces d\u00e9mocratiques pour la lib\u00e9ration du Congo-Za\u00efre (AFDL) washinzwe n'abanyapolitiki bane b'Abanyekongo bari mu buhungiro, ushyigikiwe n'u Rwanda, Ubugande na Angola; Kabila yabanje kuba umuvugizi wawo, hanyuma muri Mutarama 1997 aba umuyobozi wawo. Mu mezi make, AFDL yigaruriye igihugu hafi cyose. Nyuma y'ibiganiro by'amahoro byananiranye, Mobutu yahunze igihugu ku ya 16 Gicurasi 1997, maze ku ya 17 Gicurasi Kabila yitangaza Perezida. Yahinduye izina ry'igihugu, Zayire, kigasubirana izina rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, maze arahira ku ya 29 Gicurasi 1997.\nPerezida (1997\u20132001).\nKabila yatangaje ko amatora atazaba mbere y'imyaka ibiri. Nubwo bamwe mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba babanje kumufata nk'umuyobozi w'\u00abigisekuru gishya\u00bb, abamunenga bavugaga ko imiyoborere ye itandukanye gake n'iya Mobutu, irangwa n'igitugu, ruswa n'ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu, ndetse ko yashakaga gushyiraho umuco wo kumuramya. Yafunze abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, barimo \u00c9tienne Tshisekedi, n'abanyamakuru.\nMuri Nyakanga 1998, Kabila yategetse ingabo z'u Rwanda n'iz'Ubugande zari zaramufashije gufata ubutegetsi kuva mu gihugu. Ibyo byatumye intambara ya kabiri ya Kongo itangira: u Rwanda n'Ubugande byashyigikiye imitwe y'inyeshyamba ya Rassemblement congolais pour la d\u00e9mocratie (RCD) na Mouvement de lib\u00e9ration du Congo (MLC), mu gihe Angola, Namibiya na Zimbabwe byashyigikiye Kabila. Mu 1999, yasheshe AFDL, ashyiraho Komite z'ubutegetsi bw'abaturage (CPP).\nIyicwa rye.\nKu ya 16 Mutarama 2001, Kabila yarasiwe mu biro bye, mu ngoro ya Palais de Marbre i Kinshasa, n'umwe mu barinzi be, Rashidi Mizele, wahise yicwa. Guverinoma yatangaje ko yari akiri muzima ubwo yajyanwaga kuvurirwa muri Zimbabwe, maze itangaza urupfu rwe ku ya 18 Mutarama ; ariko Minisitiri w'Ubuzima wari uhari yavuze ko yapfiriye aho. Nyuma y'icyumweru, umurambo we wagaruwe muri Kongo, maze umuhungu we, Joseph Kabila, aba Perezida ku ya 26 Mutarama 2001.\nIperereza ryatumye abantu 135, barimo abana bane, baburanishwa n'urukiko rwa gisirikare; mu Mutarama 2003, Koloneli Eddy Kapend, mubyara wa Kabila wafatwaga nk'uwayoboye umugambi, n'abandi 25 bakatiwe igihano cy'urupfu, kitigeze gishyirwa mu bikorwa. Abantu benshi bemeza ko urwo rubanza rwaranzwe n'amakosa, kandi ko benshi mu bakatiwe bari abere. Muri Mutarama 2021, Perezida F\u00e9lix Tshisekedi yababariye abakatiwe bose, barimo Eddy Kapend.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKabila yashakanye na Sifa Mahanya, babyarana abana benshi, barimo impanga Joseph na Jaynet Kabila."}
{"id": "23239", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23239", "title": "Messan Hilaire Locoh-Donou", "text": "Messan Hilaire Locoh-Donou (yapfuye ku wa 4 Ukwakira 2026 i Lom\u00e9) yari umwubatsi (\"architecte\"), inzobere mu igenamigambi ry'imijyi, umwarimu na rwiyemezamirimo mu by'amahoteli ukomoka muri Togo.\nAmashuri n'umwuga.\nYize mu ishuri rikuru ry'ubugeni rya Paris (\"\u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des beaux-arts\"), hanyuma asubira muri Togo gukora umwuga w'ubwubatsi. Mu 1973 yashinze i Lom\u00e9 ikigo AUBA gikora ibijyanye n'ubwubatsi, igenamigambi ry'imijyi n'inyigo za tekiniki. Mu nyubako yagizemo uruhare harimo icyicaro cy'icyahoze ari \"Banque togolaise pour le commerce et l'industrie\" (BTCI). Yigishije ubwubatsi imyaka myinshi mu ishuri EAMAU (\"\u00c9cole africaine des m\u00e9tiers de l'architecture et de l'urbanisme\") i Lom\u00e9. Kuva mu 1986 kugeza mu 1996 yayoboye Urugaga rw'abubatsi bo muri Togo (\"Ordre national des architectes du Togo\").\nAmahoteli.\nYashinze i Lom\u00e9 hoteli Eda-Oba, ifite ibyumba bigera kuri 200, aho gufatira amafunguro n'ibyumba by'inama. Mu gihe cy'icyorezo cya COVID-19, igabanuka ry'abakerarugendo ryatumye iyo hoteli ihagarika ibikorwa byayo mu 2021.\nIzindi nshingano.\nYabaye perezida wa Rotary Club ya Lom\u00e9, anaba guverineri w'akarere 9100 ka Rotary International mu 1998\u20131999. Yapfiriye i Lom\u00e9 ku wa 4 Ukwakira 2026."}
{"id": "23240", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23240", "title": "Joseph Kabila", "text": "Joseph Kabila Kabange (yavutse ku wa 4 Kamena 1971 i Hewa Bora II, muri teritwari ya Fizi, mu ntara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyepfo) ni umunyapolitiki w\u2019Umukongomani wabaye Perezida wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuva ku wa 26 Mutarama 2001 kugeza ku wa 24 Mutarama 2019. Kuva mu 2019 ni senateri ubuziraherezo.\nNi umuhungu wa Perezida Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila, yamusimbuye nyuma y\u2019uko yicwa ku wa 16 Mutarama 2001, mu gihe cy\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri ya Kongo. Afite imyaka 29, ni we Perezida muto kurusha abandi wayoboye igihugu. Yashinze ishyaka PPRD (\"Parti du peuple pour la reconstruction et la d\u00e9mocratie\") mu 2002, ayobora Guverinoma y\u2019inzibacyuho nyuma y\u2019amasezerano y\u2019amahoro ya Pretoria, atorwa mu 2006, yongera gutorwa mu 2011 mu matora yanenzwe cyane.\nAshimirwa kuba yararangije Intambara ya Kabiri ya Kongo no kugarura umutekano mu gice kinini cy\u2019igihugu, nubwo intambara yakomeje mu burasirazuba. Ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu bwikubye inshuro eshanu ku butegetsi bwe, ariko ubukire ntibwasaranganyijwe, kandi ubutegetsi bwe bwaranzwe n\u2019igitugu, ruswa n\u2019ihohoterwa ry\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu. Kuba amatora yari ateganyijwe mu 2016 yarasubitswe byateje ikibazo gikomeye cya politiki. Mu 2019 yasimbuwe na F\u00e9lix Tshisekedi mu ihererekanya ry\u2019ubutegetsi rya mbere ry\u2019amahoro mu mateka y\u2019igihugu, nubwo amatora ya 2018 yashidikanyijweho cyane.\nKuva mu 2023, ubutegetsi bwa Kinshasa bumushinja gushyigikira ihuriro AFC/M23. Arabihakana. Mu 2025 ubudahangarwa bwe bwakuweho, maze urukiko rwa gisirikare rumukatira igihano cy\u2019urupfu adahari. Mu 2026 yafatiwe ibihano na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika.\nUbuto n\u2019amashuri.\nJoseph Kabila na mushiki we w\u2019impanga Jaynet Kabila bavutse ku wa 4 Kamena 1971 i Hewa Bora II, mu misozi ya Fizi. Ni bamwe mu bana icumi ba Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila n\u2019umugore we Sifa Mahanya. Icyo gihe se yayoboraga umutwe w\u2019inyeshyamba zarwanyaga ubutegetsi bwa Mobutu Sese Seko muri Kivu y\u2019Amajyepfo.\nMu mpera z\u2019imyaka ya 1970, umuryango wahungiye muri Tanzaniya, aho yize amashuri abanza n\u2019ayisumbuye i Mbeya no i Dar es Salaam. Kubera ko se yari umwanzi w\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Mobutu, yitwaga irindi zina, \"Hippolyte Kanambe Mtwale\", kugira ngo atamenyekana. Yakuze avuga neza Icyongereza n\u2019Igiswahili, ariko ubwo yabaga Perezida ntiyari azi neza Igifaransa cyangwa Ilingala. Yize kandi muri Kaminuza ya Makerere muri Ubugande.\nInkomoko ye yabaye impaka: abatavuga rumwe na we bavugaga ko nyina yari Umututsi wo mu Rwanda cyangwa ko atari umwana wa Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila. Nta bimenyetso simusiga byigeze bibigaragaza. Guverinoma yasohoye amafoto y\u2019umuryango n\u2019ubuhamya bwa Sifa Mahanya bwemeza ko ari nyina. Umushakashatsi Erik Kennes, mu gitabo cye ku buzima bwa Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila, na we yemeje ko ari umwana wa Kabila na Sifa Mahanya.\nMu gisirikare (1996\u20132001).\nMu Ukwakira 1996, se yatangije urugamba rwa AFDL rwo guhirika Mobutu, rwashyigikiwe n\u2019u Rwanda, Ubugande na Angola. Joseph Kabila yinjiye muri urwo rugamba, atozwa n\u2019umusirikare w\u2019Umunyarwanda James Kabarebe. Yayoboye umutwe w\u2019ingabo za AFDL, kandi bivugwa ko yari ari mu rugamba rwo gufata Kisangani. Nyuma y\u2019intsinzi ya AFDL muri Gicurasi 1997, yakomereje amasomo ya gisirikare muri Kaminuza y\u2019Igisirikare cy\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ubushinwa i Beijing.\nYagizwe umwungirije w\u2019umugaba mukuru w\u2019ingabo za Kongo (FAC), ahabwa ipeti rya jenerali majoro. Intambara ya Kabiri ya Kongo itangiye muri Kanama 1998, yabaye umugaba mukuru w\u2019ingabo by\u2019igihe gito, asimburwa na Eddy Kapend mu Ukwakira 1998. Mu 2000 yabaye umugaba mukuru w\u2019ingabo zirwanira ku butaka.\nPerezida wa Repubulika (2001\u20132019).\nInzibacyuho (2001\u20132006).\nNyuma y\u2019iyicwa rya se ku wa 16 Mutarama 2001, abari bamukikije bahisemo Joseph Kabila ngo amusimbure. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku wa 26 Mutarama 2001. Icyo gihe yari atazwi cyane, kandi yari ayoboye igihugu cyari hafi gusenyuka, igice cy\u2019uburasirazuba cyigaruriwe n\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019iz\u2019Ubugande. Mu cyumweru cya mbere yasuye Washington, Paris na Buruseli, ahura na Perezida Paul Kagame i Washington.\nMuri Gashyantare 2001 yasubukuye amasezerano y\u2019amahoro ya Lusaka, yemerera ingabo za MONUC kuza mu gihugu, kandi muri Gicurasi 2001 akuraho itegeko ryabuzaga amashyaka ya politiki. Ibiganiro hagati y\u2019Abakongomani byatumye mu 2003 hashyirwaho Guverinoma y\u2019inzibacyuho, yarimo abayobozi b\u2019imitwe ibiri minini y\u2019inyeshyamba babaye ba visi-perezida. Ku wa 28 Werurwe 2004, abashyigikiye Mobutu bagerageje guhirika ubutegetsi bwe ariko birananirana.\nManda ya mbere (2006\u20132011).\nMu 2006 yatsinze amatora ya perezida mu cyiciro cya kabiri, ahanganye na Jean-Pierre Bemba. Abatavuga rumwe na we bamushinjaga kutaba Umukongomani, ariko Urukiko rw\u2019Ikirenga ntirwabyemeye. Mu Ugushyingo 2008, umuryango Human Rights Watch watangaje ko abantu barenga 500 bishwe, abandi barenga 1 000 bagafungwa bakanakorerwa iyicarubozo kuva amatora ya 2006 abaye.\nManda ya kabiri (2011\u20132016).\nMu 2011 komisiyo y\u2019amatora (CENI) yatangaje ko yongeye gutsinda, ariko umukandida w\u2019ishyaka ritavuga rumwe na Leta, \u00c9tienne Tshisekedi, yanze ibyavuye mu matora. Ikigo Carter Center n\u2019indorerezi z\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi bavuze ko amatora yaranzwe n\u2019amakosa menshi kandi atizewe. Ku wa 22 Werurwe 2013, ubutegetsi bwatangaje ko bwaburijemo umugambi wo kumwica no guhirika ubutegetsi.\nUbukungu.\nUbwo yageraga ku butegetsi, umwenda w\u2019igihugu wanganaga na 150 % by\u2019umusaruro mbumbe w\u2019igihugu; nyuma waragabanutse cyane. Ubukungu bwikubye inshuro eshanu ku butegetsi bwe, ariko izamuka ryabwo ryagabanutse mu myaka ye ya nyuma. Ubukire bwavuye mu mabuye y\u2019agaciro (kobalti, diyama, zahabu) ntibwasaranganyijwe, kandi igihe yavaga ku butegetsi abaturage benshi bari bakiri munsi y\u2019umurongo w\u2019ubukene.\nUburenganzira bwa muntu.\nKu wa 22 Nyakanga 2015, Kenneth Roth, umuyobozi wa Human Rights Watch, yanenze cyane uburyo ubutegetsi bwa Kabila bwahohoteraga ababunenga. Inzego zashinjwaga ihohotera zirimo Ingabo zirinda Perezida (\"Garde r\u00e9publicaine\"), igipolisi gishinzwe guhosha imyigaragambyo (LENI) n\u2019urwego rw\u2019iperereza (ANR), rwashinjwaga gushimuta abatavuga rumwe na Leta, abanyamakuru n\u2019abaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu. Mu 2016, Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika n\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi byafatiye ibihano abayobozi icyenda ba gisivili n\u2019aba gisirikare. Mu Ugushyingo 2018, iperereza rya RFI n\u2019ikinyamakuru \"Le Monde\" ryagaragaje ko ubutegetsi bwagize uruhare mu iyicwa ry\u2019impuguke ebyiri z\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye muri Werurwe 2017.\nIbirego bya ruswa.\nKabila n\u2019umuryango we, cyane cyane mushiki we Jaynet n\u2019umugore we Olive Lembe, bari bafite cyangwa bayoboraga ibigo birenga 70 by\u2019ubucuruzi, birimo amabanki n\u2019ibirombe, byinjizaga amamiliyoni amagana y\u2019amadolari. Mu Ugushyingo 2021, iperereza ry\u2019ibinyamakuru byinshi ryiswe \"Congo Hold-Up\" ryashinje umuryango wa Kabila kunyereza miliyoni 138 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari ya Leta hagati ya 2013 na 2018, ufashijwe n\u2019ishami rya banki BGFIBank muri Kongo. Minisitiri w\u2019Ubutabera yahise asaba ko hatangizwa iperereza.\nIkibazo cya politiki n\u2019ihererekanya ry\u2019ubutegetsi (2016\u20132019).\nItegeko Nshinga ryamubuzaga kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu, kandi manda ye yagombaga kurangira ku wa 20 Ukuboza 2016. Amatora yarasubitswe, maze Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rumwemerera kuguma ku butegetsi, nubwo abatavuga rumwe na Leta n\u2019amahanga babyamaganye. Ku gitutu cy\u2019imbere mu gihugu n\u2019icy\u2019amahanga, ku wa 8 Kanama 2018 yatangaje ko atazongera kwiyamamaza, ashyigikira Emmanuel Ramazani Shadary nk\u2019umukandida w\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019ubutegetsi.\nAmatora yo ku wa 30 Ukuboza 2018 yateje impaka nyinshi. Martin Fayulu yanze ibyavuyemo, naho Inama y\u2019Abepiskopi Gatolika (CENCO), yari ifite indorerezi 40 000, yavuze ko bidahuye n\u2019ibyo yabonye. Indorerezi zigenga zemeje ko Fayulu ari we watsinze, kandi ko Kabila yahisemo gutangaza intsinzi y\u2019umukandida wari kumufasha kurusha abandi. Muri Mutarama 2019, F\u00e9lix Tshisekedi yemejwe n\u2019Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga, arahirira kuba Perezida.\nNyuma y\u2019ubuperezida.\nKabila yavuye ku butegetsi ku wa 25 Mutarama 2019, aba senateri ubuziraherezo, ahabwa izina rya \u00abPerezida w\u2019icyubahiro\u00bb. Ihuriro rye FCC (\"Front commun pour le Congo\") ryari rifite ubwiganze mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, muri Sena no mu ntara, maze akekwa kugumana ubutegetsi mu ibanga. Yagiye kuba mu isambu ye ya Kingakati, hafi ya Kinshasa.\nMu Ukuboza 2020, Tshisekedi yasheshe ubufatanye na FCC, akurura abadepite benshi ba Kabila mu ihuriro rishya ryitwa \u00abUnion sacr\u00e9e\u00bb. Perezida w\u2019Inteko Jeannine Mabunda yakuweho ku wa 10 Ukuboza 2020, naho Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe Sylvestre Ilunga Ilunkamba yeguzwa n\u2019Inteko ku wa 27 Mutarama 2021.\nMu Ukuboza 2023, nyuma yo kwanga kwitabira amatora, yavuye muri Kongo mu ibanga. Yongeye kugaragara muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo muri Mutarama 2024, aho yavugaga ko akora ubushakashatsi bwa dogitora muri Kaminuza ya Johannesburg.\nIbirego bijyanye na M23.\nMu 2021, umutwe wa M23 wongeye gufata intwaro mu burasirazuba bwa Kongo. Leta ya Kongo n\u2019impuguke za Loni bavuga ko ushyigikiwe n\u2019u Rwanda, ariko u Rwanda rurabihakana. Muri Werurwe 2024, Augustin Kabuya, umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ishyaka UDPS rya Perezida, yashinje Kabila gushyigikira M23 n\u2019Ihuriro AFC rya Corneille Nangaa. Abo ku ruhande rwa Kabila bamaganye ibyo birego bavuga ko ari ugukura amaso y\u2019abaturage ku byo Leta yananiwe. Muri Kanama 2024, Perezida Tshisekedi na we yamushinje gutegura imyivumbagatanyo, ariko ishyaka rye ribyita ibinyoma.\nMuri Gashyantare 2025, Kabila yasohoye inyandiko mu kinyamakuru \"Sunday Times\", anenga Tshisekedi amushinja kuba nyirabayazana w\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019uburasirazuba. Muri Mata 2025, Minisitiri w\u2019Umutekano yahagaritse ibikorwa bya PPRD, Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutabera isaba ko akurikiranwa n\u2019imitungo ye igafatirwa. Ku wa 22 Gicurasi 2025, Sena yamwambuye ubudahangarwa. Ku wa 25 Gicurasi 2025, yageze i Goma, umujyi wari mu maboko ya AFC/M23, ahura n\u2019abayobozi b\u2019amadini ari kumwe n\u2019umuvugizi wa M23.\nUrubanza n\u2019igihano cy\u2019urupfu.\nUrubanza rwe rwatangiye ku wa 25 Nyakanga 2025 imbere y\u2019Urukiko Rukuru rwa Gisirikare i Kinshasa, ariko ntiyitaba. Yashinjwaga ubugambanyi, ibyaha by\u2019intambara, ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu no kugira uruhare mu mutwe w\u2019abigometse, kubera uruhare bivugwa ko yagize mu ishingwa rya AFC. Bamwe babonye urwo rubanza nk\u2019intambwe mu kubahiriza amategeko, abandi barimo ishyaka rye na Mo\u00efse Katumbi bavuga ko ari uburyo bwa politiki bwo kumukura mu nzira. Ku wa 30 Nzeri 2025 yakatiwe adahari igihano cy\u2019urupfu, ategekwa no kwishyura Leta miliyari 33 z\u2019amadolari.\nMuri Mata 2026, Ishami rishinzwe kugenzura imitungo y\u2019abanyamahanga (OFAC) rya Minisiteri y\u2019Imari ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ryamufatiye ibihano, rimushinja gushaka guhungabanya Leta ya Kongo ashyigikira M23 na AFC.\nIcyubahiro.\nSitade ya Kalemie, mu ntara ya Tanganyika, yitiriwe izina rye."}
{"id": "23241", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23241", "title": "John Magufuli", "text": "John Pombe Joseph Magufuli (29 Ukwakira 1959 \u2013 17 Werurwe 2021) yari umunyapolitiki w\u2019Umunyatanzaniya wabaye Perezida wa gatanu wa Tanzaniya kuva mu 2015 kugeza apfuye mu 2021, amezi make nyuma yo kongera gutorerwa manda ya kabiri. Mbere yaho yari yarabaye minisitiri inshuro nyinshi, cyane cyane uw\u2019Imirimo rusange, aho yamenyekanye ku izina rya \u00abTingatinga\u00bb (\u00abbulldozer\u00bb mu Giswahili) kubera kubaka imihanda myinshi. Kuva mu 2019 kugeza mu 2020 yayoboye Umuryango w\u2019Iterambere ry\u2019Afurika y\u2019Amajyepfo (SADC).\nYatowe ku isezerano ryo kurwanya ruswa no kugabanya amafaranga Leta isesagura, ashora imari nyinshi mu bikorwa remezo. Ku butegetsi bwe, ubukungu bwa Tanzaniya bwazamutse ku kigero cya 6 % ku mwaka, igihugu kiva mu cyiciro cy\u2019ibihugu bikennye cyane. Icyakora ubutegetsi bwe bwaranzwe n\u2019igitugu: ubwisanzure bw\u2019itangazamakuru n\u2019ubwo kuvuga byarabujijwe, abatavuga rumwe na Leta baratotezwa. Mu gihe cy\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19, yahakanye uburemere bwacyo, ahagarika ibipimo n\u2019ingamba z\u2019ubuzima. Yapfuye ku wa 17 Werurwe 2021; Leta yavuze ko yazize indwara y\u2019umutima. Yasimbuwe na Visi-Perezida we, Samia Suluhu Hassan.\nUbuto n\u2019amashuri.\nJohn Magufuli yavukiye mu muryango ukennye mu 1959 i Chato, mu majyaruguru y\u2019uburengerazuba bwa Tanzaniya (icyo gihe yitwaga Tanganyika), ku nkengero z\u2019ikiyaga cya Victoria. Akiri umwana yaragiraga inka, akanacuruza amata n\u2019amafi kugira ngo afashe umuryango we.\nYize amashuri abanza i Chato kuva mu 1967 kugeza mu 1974, akomereza mu iseminari ya Katoke i Biharamulo no muri Lake Secondary School, hanyuma muri Mkwawa High School. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere mu burezi (shimi n\u2019imibare) muri Kaminuza ya Dar es Salaam mu 1988, iy\u2019icyiciro cya gatatu (\"master\") mu 1994 n\u2019iy\u2019ikirenga (dogitora) mu bya shimi mu 2009. Yari Umukirisitu Gatolika.\nUrugendo rwa politiki.\nYabanje kuba umwarimu w\u2019ubumenyi bwa shimi n\u2019imibare mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Sengerema, nyuma akora nk\u2019umuhanga mu bya shimi muri koperative Nyanza Cooperative Union kuva mu 1989 kugeza mu 1995. Mu 1995 yatorewe kuba umudepite uhagarariye Chato mu ishyaka Chama Cha Mapinduzi (CCM), ishyaka ryiganje mu gihugu, ahita agirwa Minisitiri wungirije w\u2019Imirimo rusange.\nYabaye Minisitiri w\u2019Imirimo rusange (2000\u20132005), Minisitiri w\u2019Ubutaka n\u2019Imiturire (2006\u20132008), Minisitiri w\u2019Ubworozi n\u2019Uburobyi (2008\u20132010), yongera kuba Minisitiri w\u2019Imirimo rusange (2010\u20132015). Muri icyo gihe ni bwo yahawe izina rya \u00abTingatinga\u00bb kubera kubaka imihanda mishya.\nPerezida wa Repubulika.\nAmatora ya 2015.\nKu wa 12 Nyakanga 2015, CCM yamutoranyije nk\u2019umukandida wayo ku mwanya wa Perezida, nyuma y\u2019amatora y\u2019ibanze yari arimo abakandida 38. Mu matora yo ku wa 25 Ukwakira 2015, yahanganye na Edward Lowassa wari ushyigikiwe n\u2019amashyaka atavuga rumwe na Leta, atsinda n\u2019amajwi 58 %. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku wa 5 Ugushyingo 2015, asimbura Jakaya Kikwete, naho Samia Suluhu aba Visi-Perezida.\nKugabanya amafaranga ya Leta no kurwanya ruswa.\nAkigera ku butegetsi, yafashe ingamba zo kugabanya amafaranga Leta isesagura: yabujije abayobozi ingendo zitari ngombwa zo mu mahanga n\u2019ingendo z\u2019indege mu cyiciro cy\u2019icyubahiro, agabanya ingengo y\u2019imari y\u2019ibirori, anagabanya ingano y\u2019intumwa zijya mu nama mpuzamahanga. Umushahara we yawugabanyije uva ku madolari 15 000 ugera ku 4 000 ku kwezi. Mu 2015 yahagaritse ibirori by\u2019umunsi w\u2019ubwigenge, avuga ko ari \u00abigisebo gukoresha amafaranga menshi twizihiza imyaka 54 y\u2019ubwigenge mu gihe abaturage bacu bicwa na kolera\u00bb, ahubwo amafaranga ashyirwa mu bikorwa by\u2019isuku byo kurwanya kolera. Guverinoma ye yari igizwe na minisiteri 19 aho kuba 30.\nKu wa 12 Mata 2016, urugendo rwe rwa mbere mu mahanga yarukoreye mu Rwanda, aho yahuye na Perezida Paul Kagame, batangiza ikiraro gishya n\u2019umupaka uhuriweho wa Rusumo, anitabira kwibuka ku nshuro ya 22 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUbukungu n\u2019ibikorwa remezo.\nTanzaniya yavuguruye amategeko agenga amasezerano y\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro, yiha uburenganzira bwo kuyasubiramo cyangwa kuyasesa mu gihe habayeho uburiganya. Impaka z\u2019imisoro n\u2019ikigo Acacia Mining, cyashinjwaga guhisha ingano nyakuri ya zahabu yacukurwaga, zarangiye Tanzaniya ihawe 16 % by\u2019imigabane mu birombe byacyo. Mu 2017 yabujije kohereza mu mahanga amabuye y\u2019agaciro atatunganyijwe. Icyakora, umunyapolitiki utavuga rumwe na Leta Zitto Kabwe yavuze ko iyo politiki yateye ubwoba abashoramari kandi igacogoza izamuka ry\u2019ubukungu.\nGuverinoma ye yashoye imari mu bikorwa remezo binini: umuhanda wa gari ya moshi (\"Standard Gauge Railway\"), urugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi rwa Julius Nyerere rwagombaga gukuba kabiri amashanyarazi y\u2019igihugu, imihanda n\u2019ibiraro byinshi, ndetse no kongerera ubushobozi sosiyete y\u2019indege ya Air Tanzania. Ku butegetsi bwe, ubukungu bwazamutse ku kigero cya 6 % ku mwaka nk\u2019uko Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy\u2019Imari (IMF) kibivuga, maze mu 2020 Tanzaniya iva mu cyiciro cy\u2019ibihugu bifite amikoro make ijya mu cy\u2019ibifite amikoro aciriritse.\nIgitugu n\u2019ubwisanzure.\nNubwo ishyaka rimwe ryari ryarayoboye igihugu kuva cyabona ubwigenge, Tanzaniya yafatwaga nk\u2019igihugu kirimo demokarasi ugereranyije. Nyuma y\u2019amatora ya 2015, aho abatavuga rumwe na Leta bari babonye 40 % by\u2019amajwi, Magufuli yatangiye guhashya itangazamakuru, abatavuga rumwe na Leta n\u2019abo bahanganye mu ishyaka rye. Itegeko rirwanya ibyaha bikorerwa kuri murandasi ryakoreshejwe mu gufunga abantu bashinjwa \u00abgutuka Perezida\u00bb ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Kuva mu 2016, televiziyo esheshatu, radiyo 21 n\u2019ibinyamakuru byinshi byarahagaritswe bishinjwa kunenga ubutegetsi. Muri Werurwe 2018, abayobozi batandatu b\u2019ishyaka Chadema, barimo umuyobozi waryo Freeman Mbowe, barafashwe. Muri Nzeri 2018, yasabye abaturage kutitabira kuboneza urubyaro, ibyo bikanengwa n\u2019imiryango irimo Amnesty International.\nMu matora ya 2020, yongeye gutorwa ku majwi 84 %, naho ishyaka rye ritwara hafi 99 % by\u2019imyanya mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko. Indorerezi nyinshi mpuzamahanga zavuze ko ayo matora yaranzwe n\u2019uburiganya, ifatwa ry\u2019abakandida n\u2019abigaragambya, n\u2019ifungwa ry\u2019imbuga nkoranyambaga.\nIcyorezo cya COVID-19.\nMu gihe cy\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19, Magufuli yanze gufata ingamba z\u2019ubuzima zafatwaga ahandi ku isi, ategeka ko ibipimo bihagarara. Yavuze ko \u00abvirusi yarimbuwe n\u2019Imana kubera amasengesho y\u2019Abanyatanzaniya\u00bb, kandi avuga ko ibipimo byakorewe ku ihene, ku ipapayi no ku ntama byagaragaje ko byanduye. Yanagaragaje ko adashira amakenga inkingo zakorewe mu Burayi no muri Amerika, ahitamo kwiringira amasengesho. Imibare y\u2019abanduye yarekeye gutangazwa, naho Tanzaniya isubira inyuma mu rutonde rw\u2019ubwisanzure bw\u2019itangazamakuru rwa \"Reporters sans fronti\u00e8res\", iva ku mwanya wa 75 mu 2015 igera ku wa 124 mu 2020.\nUrupfu.\nKuva mu mpera za Gashyantare 2021, ntiyongeye kugaragara mu ruhame, maze abatavuga rumwe na Leta n\u2019abanyamakuru bamwe bavuga ko yanduye COVID-19. Ku wa 17 Werurwe 2021, Visi-Perezida Samia Suluhu yatangaje kuri televiziyo ko Magufuli yapfuye afite imyaka 61, azize indwara y\u2019umutima mu bitaro bya Emilio Mzena i Dar es Salaam. Samia Suluhu yahise amusimbura ku butegetsi.\nMu mpera za Werurwe, imihango yo kumusezeraho yitabiriwe n\u2019abakuru b\u2019ibihugu byinshi by\u2019Afurika. Ku kibuga cya Uhuru i Dar es Salaam, abantu bagera kuri 40 bapfiriye mu mubyigano. Umurambo we wajyanywe i Zanzibar, Mwanza na Geita, ushyingurwa i Chato aho yavukiye.\nUmunyamakuru Khalifa Said yavuze ko umurage we utavugwaho rumwe: bamwe bamubona nk\u2019intwari yarwanyije ruswa n\u2019ubukoloni bushya bw\u2019ibigo by\u2019amahanga, abandi bakamubona nk\u2019umunyagitugu wasuzuguye amahame ya demokarasi."}
{"id": "23242", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23242", "title": "Uhuru Kenyatta", "text": "Uhuru M\u0169igai Kenyatta (yavutse ku wa 26 Ukwakira 1961 i Nairobi) ni umunyapolitiki w\u2019Umunyakenya wabaye Perezida wa kane wa Kenya kuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2022. Ni umuhungu wa Jomo Kenyatta, Perezida wa mbere wa Kenya. Mbere yo kuba Perezida, yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019abatavuga rumwe na Leta mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko (2003\u20132007), Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe wungirije (2008\u20132013) na Minisitiri w\u2019Imari.\nPerezida Daniel arap Moi yamuhisemo nk\u2019uzamusimbura, ariko yatsinzwe na Mwai Kibaki mu matora ya 2002. Mu 2012, Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga (CPI) rwamushinje ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu bifitanye isano n\u2019imvururu zakurikiye amatora ya 2007. Yatorewe kuba Perezida mu 2013 afatanyije na William Ruto, aba Perezida wa mbere uri ku butegetsi witabye CPI mu 2014; nyuma ibirego bye byaje guhagarikwa kubera kubura ibimenyetso bihagije. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2017 nyuma y\u2019uko Urukiko rw\u2019Ikirenga ruteshje agaciro amatora ya mbere.\nManda ye yaranzwe n\u2019ibikorwa remezo, ariko kandi n\u2019amahano ya ruswa n\u2019umwenda w\u2019igihugu wiyongereye. Mu 2021, izina rye n\u2019iry\u2019umuryango we byagaragaye mu nyandiko za \"Pandora Papers\". Mu 2022 yasimbuwe na William Ruto. Kuva mu 2025 ni umuhuza mu biganiro by\u2019amahoro muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUbuto n\u2019amashuri.\nUhuru Kenyatta yavutse ku wa 26 Ukwakira 1961, ari umwana wa Jomo Kenyatta n\u2019umugore we wa kane, Mama Ngina Kenyatta. Umuryango we ni Abakikuyu. Izina rye \u00abUhuru\u00bb risobanura \u00abubwigenge\u00bb mu Giswahili, kandi yaryiswe mu gihe Kenya yiteguraga kubona ubwigenge. Yize muri St Mary\u2019s School i Nairobi, kandi hagati ya 1979 na 1980 yakoze muri banki ya Kenya Commercial Bank. Se yapfuye afite imyaka 16. Yize ubukungu na siyansi za politiki muri Amherst College muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Agarutse muri Kenya, yashinze ikigo cyohereza ibikomoka ku buhinzi mu mahanga.\nUrugendo rwa politiki.\nMu matora ya 1997, yiyamamarije kuba umudepite wa Gatundu y\u2019Amajyepfo, aho se yigeze guhagararira, ariko aratsindwa. Mu 1999, Perezida Moi yamushyize ku buyobozi bw\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Ubukerarugendo cya Kenya. Mu 2001 yagizwe umudepite, aba Minisitiri w\u2019Inzego z\u2019ibanze.\nMu 2002, Moi yatumye ishyaka KANU rimutoranya nk\u2019umukandida waryo ku mwanya wa Perezida, bituma bamwe mu bayobozi b\u2019iryo shyaka barivamo. Yatsinzwe na Mwai Kibaki, abona 31 % by\u2019amajwi, maze aba umuyobozi w\u2019abatavuga rumwe na Leta mu Nteko. Mu 2005 yatorewe kuyobora KANU. Mu matora ya 2007 yashyigikiye Kibaki. Nyuma y\u2019imvururu zakurikiye ayo matora, hashyizweho Guverinoma y\u2019ubumwe aho Raila Odinga yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe, naho Kenyatta aba Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe wungirije akaba na Minisitiri w\u2019Ubucuruzi muri Mata 2008, nyuma aba Minisitiri w\u2019Imari muri Mutarama 2009.\nMu 2012, CPI yamushinje ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu byakozwe mu mvururu zakurikiye amatora ya 2007, maze yegura ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w\u2019Imari ku wa 26 Mutarama 2012, ariko akomeza kuba Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe wungirije.\nPerezida wa Repubulika.\nManda ya mbere (2013\u20132017).\nMu matora yo ku wa 4 Werurwe 2013, ahagarariye ihuriro Jubilee afatanyije na William Ruto, yatsinze Raila Odinga ku majwi 50,07 %. Odinga yajuririye Urukiko rw\u2019Ikirenga, ariko ku wa 30 Werurwe 2013 urukiko rwemeje ku bwumvikane busesuye ko amatora yari yemewe. Yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku wa 9 Mata 2013.\nKu wa 8 Ukwakira 2014, yitabye CPI, aba Perezida wa mbere uri ku butegetsi witabye urwo rukiko. Ku wa 5 Ukuboza 2014, umushinjacyaha mukuru Fatou Bensouda yatangaje ko ibirego bimuhagaritsweho kubera kubura ibimenyetso bihagije, ariko avuga ko iperereza ryabangamiwe cyane, harimo gutoteza no gukangisha abatangabuhamya.\nMu myaka yakurikiyeho yongeye kwakirwa neza ku rwego mpuzamahanga, ariko manda ye yaranzwe n\u2019amahano ya ruswa n\u2019izamuka ry\u2019ubukungu ritari ku rwego rwari rwitezwe. Mu 2015, ubwo Perezida Barack Obama yasuraga Nairobi agasaba ko abaryamana bahuje ibitsina bubahwa, Kenyatta yasubije ko \u00abbigoye guhatira abantu ibyo batemera ubwabo\u00bb.\nManda ya kabiri (2017\u20132022).\nMu matora yo muri Kanama 2017, yongeye guhangana na Raila Odinga, atangazwa ko yatsinze n\u2019amajwi 54 %. Ku wa 1 Nzeri 2017, Urukiko rw\u2019Ikirenga rwateshje agaciro ayo matora, ruvuga ko atakozwe hakurikijwe Itegeko Nshinga, rutegeka ko haba andi mu minsi 60. Odinga yasabye ko komisiyo y\u2019amatora ivugururwa, hanyuma ku wa 10 Ukwakira 2017 atangaza ko akuyemo kandidatire ye. Mu matora yo ku wa 26 Ukwakira 2017, Kenyatta yatsinze n\u2019amajwi 98 %, ariko abatoye bari 39 % gusa. Urukiko rw\u2019Ikirenga rwanze ibirego byayarwanyaga ku wa 20 Ugushyingo 2017, maze arahira ku wa 28 Ugushyingo 2017.\nKu wa 31 Mutarama 2018, Odinga yirahije nka \u00abPerezida w\u2019abaturage\u00bb, maze Leta ihagarika televiziyo eshatu zari zerekanye uwo muhango. Ku wa 9 Werurwe 2018, Kenyatta na Odinga bagiranye amasezerano y\u2019ubwiyunge azwi nka \u00abhandshake\u00bb. Umushinga we wo kuvugurura Itegeko Nshinga (BBI) waje gufatwa nk\u2019utemewe n\u2019amategeko n\u2019Urukiko Rukuru muri Gicurasi 2021, ibyo bishimangirwa n\u2019Urukiko rw\u2019Ubujurire muri Kanama 2021.\nMu 2021, amapfa yateje inzara ikomeye, abantu barenga miliyoni 2,5 bahura n\u2019ibura ry\u2019ibiribwa; yabyise \u00abicyago cy\u2019igihugu\u00bb, ariko anengwa kuba ubutabazi bwaratinze. Mu Ukwakira 2021, akajagari ka Mukuru Kwa Njenga i Nairobi kasenywe kugira ngo umuhanda waguke, abantu bagera ku 40 000 basigara batagira aho kuba.\nMu 2022 yasimbuwe na Visi-Perezida we William Ruto. Nk\u2019uko \"International Crisis Group\" ibivuga, yasize ubukungu bumeze nabi, burangwa n\u2019izamuka ry\u2019ibiciro n\u2019umwenda wiyongereye.\nPandora Papers.\nMu Ukwakira 2021, Kenyatta n\u2019abantu batandatu bo mu muryango we, barimo nyina Mama Ngina na murumuna we Muhoho, bagaragaye mu nyandiko za \"Pandora Papers\" nk\u2019abafite ibigo n\u2019imitungo yihishe mu bihugu bisonera imisoro. Bari bafite nibura miliyoni 30 z\u2019amadolari muri ibyo bigo, harimo n\u2019umuryango (\"fondation\") w\u2019ibanga muri Panama. Ibyo byanenzwe cyane kuko byanyuranyaga n\u2019\u00abintambara yo kurwanya ruswa\u00bb yavugaga ko ayoboye.\nNyuma y\u2019ubuperezida.\nKu wa 8 Gashyantare 2025, mu nama idasanzwe y\u2019abakuru b\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EAC) n\u2019uw\u2019Afurika y\u2019Amajyepfo (SADC), yagizwe umwe mu bahuza mu biganiro by\u2019amahoro muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
