{"id": "23244", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23244", "title": "Inkombe za Lom\u00e9", "text": "Inkombe za Lom\u00e9 (mu Gifaransa: \"Plages de Lom\u00e9\") ni inkombe z'umusenyi ziri ku nkengero z'umurwa mukuru wa Togo, Lom\u00e9, ku Kigobe cya Gineya. Zirambuye ku birometero byinshi hagati y'icyambu cya Lom\u00e9 mu burasirazuba n'uduce twa Baguida, Kp\u00e9m\u00e9 na An\u00e9ho.\nImiterere.\nZirangwa n'umusenyi woroshye, inyanja ikunze kugira imiraba n'imigezi ikomeye. Ikirere ni icy'ubushyuhe bwo mu turere dushyuha, kiri hagati ya 25 \u00b0C na 30 \u00b0C umwaka wose. Ibice bimwe by'inkombe byibasiwe n'isuri, ihangana na yo ikorwa binyuze muri gahunda y'akarere ya WACA (\"West Africa Coastal Areas Management Program\").\nIbikorwa.\nInkombe zikoreshwa mu uburobyi gakondo, mu myidagaduro, mu mikino nk'umupira w'amaguru wo ku musenyi, \"surf\" na \"kitesurf\", ndetse no mu ubukerarugendo. Ni hamwe mu hantu nyamukuru abatuye umujyi baruhukira, kubera ko Lom\u00e9 ifite pariki nke. Mu duce twa Kp\u00e9m\u00e9 na An\u00e9ho, inyenzi zo mu nyanja ziza kuhatera amagi mu bihe bimwe by'umwaka.\nAmateka.\nKu nkombe za Lom\u00e9 hari ibisigazwa by'ikiraro cy'icyuma kinjira mu nyanja (\"wharf\"), cyubatswe hagati ya 1901 na 1904 ku gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'Abadage, gifite uburebure bwa metero 300. Cyakoreshwaga mu gupakurura no gupakira ibicuruzwa n'abagenzi kugeza ubwo icyambu cya Lom\u00e9 cyafungurwaga mu 1964.\nUmutekano.\nKubera imigezi n'imiraba ikomeye, koga ahatarinzwe bishobora guteza akaga."}
{"id": "23245", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23245", "title": "Amasumo ya Yikpa", "text": "Amasumo ya Yikpa ni itsinda ry'amasumo y'amazi aherereye muri kantoni ya Yikpa, muri perefegitura ya Danyi, mu Ntara ya Plateaux, muri Togo, hafi y'umupaka na Gana. Atunzwe n'uruzi rwa Agumatsa, akaba ari amwe mu masumo maremare kurusha ayandi mu gihugu, kandi ni ahantu nyaburanga h'ingenzi mu bukerarugendo bwo mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba bwa Togo.\nAho aherereye n'imiterere.\nAmasumo ari ku misozi miremire ya Danyi, nko mu birometero 30 mu majyaruguru ya Kpalim\u00e9. Kugera aho ari bikorwa n'amaguru, unyuze mu tuyira two mu ishyamba duca mu mirima ya kawa na kakawo. Ako karere kazwiho imisozi ihanamye, ibimera byinshi n'ikirere gitose gikwiranye n'amashyamba y'inzitane.\nAha hantu harimo amasumo abiri afite uburebure bubarirwa hagati ya metero 70 n'izirenga 100, bitewe n'ibipimo byo mu karere. Isumo rimwe riri ku ruhande rwa Togo, mu gihe irindi rikomereza muri Gana, aho rizwi ku izina ry'amasumo ya Wli. Amasumo akora ikidendezi kamere abantu bashobora kogeramo. Ibidukikije biyakikije birimo urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima rutandukanye rugizwe n'inyoni, udukoko n'inkende.\nAmateka n'agaciro k'umuco.\nAbaturage b'aho bafata Amasumo ya Yikpa nk'ahantu hatagatifu. Ahuzwa n'imyemerere gakondo ijyanye no kwisukura, uburumbuke no kurindwa mu buryo bw'umwuka. Kera hakorerwaga imihango n'ibirori bitandukanye. Kantoni ya Yikpa yatuwe kuva kera n'imiryango y'Abewe yaturutse mu buhunzi bwa Nots\u00e9, kimwe mu bihe bikomeye mu mateka y'ubwoko bw'Abewe. Imidugudu iriho ubu yagiye ishingwa buhoro buhoro hagati y'ibihe byabanjirije ubukoloni n'iby'ubukoloni.\nUbukerarugendo no kubungabunga ibidukikije.\nMuri iki gihe, amasumo ni hamwe mu hantu h'ingenzi h'ubukerarugendo bubungabunga ibidukikije mu Ntara ya Plateaux. Gusura aha hantu bikunze kuyoborwa n'abayobozi b'ingendo bo mu karere ndetse na komite y'umudugudu ishinzwe imicungire. Ibikorwa bihakorerwa birimo gutembera n'amaguru, koga, kumenya ibimera by'aho no kwitegereza imisozi. Iterambere ry'ubukerarugendo rigamije guhuza kubungabunga ibidukikije n'iterambere ry'ubukungu bw'akarere.\nKubera ko aha hantu horoshye kwangirika, abaturage bashyizeho ingamba zo kugabanya ingaruka ku bidukikije, cyane cyane kugenzura uko abantu binjira, gusana tuyira no gukangurira abashyitsi kubaha ibidukikije."}
{"id": "23246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23246", "title": "Hydrocephalus", "text": "Hydrocephalus ni indwara aho amazi yo mu bwonko (CSF) yiyongera mu bwonko. Ibi bikunze gutera kwiyongera k'umuvuduko mu gahanga. Abantu bakuze bashobora kugira ikibazo cyo kuribwa umutwe, kutabona neza, kutabasha kwifata mu nkari, impinduka mu miterere y'umubiri, cyangwa ubumuga bwo mu mutwe. Ku bana bato, bishobora kugaragara nk'ubwiyongere bwihuse bw'umutwe. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kuruka, gusinzira, gukubita no kumanuka amaso.\nHydrocephalus ishobora guterwa n'ubumuga bwo kuvukana cyangwa ikavuka nyuma y'ubuzima. Ubusembwa bujyanye n'igihe umuntu avukana burimo ubusembwa bw'imiyoboro y'ubwonko n'ibivamo stenosis y'amazi. Izindi mpamvu zirimo meningite, ibibyimba byo mu bwonko, imvune mu bwonko, kuva amaraso imbere mu mutima, no kuva amaraso munsi y'umugongo. Ubwoko bune bwa hydrocephalus ni itumanaho, kudatumana, \"ibyuka bivamo umwuka\", n'umuvuduko usanzwe. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bikorwa hakoreshejwe isuzuma ry'umubiri no gukoresha amashusho y'abaganga.\nHydrocephalus ikunze kuvurwa no kubagwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa shunt. Uburyo bwitwa ventriculostomy ya gatatu ni amahitamo kuri bamwe. Ingorane ziterwa na shunts zishobora kuba zirimo kuvoma amazi menshi, kuvoma amazi make, kwangirika k'ibikoresho, kwandura indwara, cyangwa kuziba. Ibi bishobora gusaba gusimburwa. Ibisubizo biratandukanye, ariko abantu benshi bafite shunt babaho ubuzima busanzwe. Hatabayeho kuvurwa, urupfu cyangwa ubumuga buhoraho bishobora kubaho.\nHafi umwe kugeza kuri babiri ku bana 1,000 bavutse bafite indwara ya hydrocephalus. Igipimo mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere gishobora kuba kiri hejuru. Igipimo cy\u2019umuvuduko usanzwe wa hydrocephalus gifatwa nk\u2019abantu 5 kuri 100.000, aho igipimo kigenda cyiyongera uko imyaka igenda ishira. Ibisobanuro bya Hippocrates ku ndwara ya hydrocephalus byatangiye mu myaka irenga 2.000 ishize. Ijambo \"hydrocephalus\" rikomoka ku kigereki, risobanura 'amazi' na, risobanura 'umutwe'."}
{"id": "23247", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23247", "title": "Tingban-Paab", "text": "Tingban-Paab ni umunsi mukuru gakondo wizihizwa buri mwaka mu Grand T\u00f4ne (akarere ka Savanes, mu majyaruguru ya Togo) n'Abamoba, Abagourma, Abamossi, Abapeulh n'andi moko bafitanye isano. \nUgaragaza isozwa ry'isarura, ukaba umwanya wo gushimira abakurambere n'imyuka irinda (\"Tingbana\"). Uba ku wa gatandatu wa kabiri w'Ukuboza muri perefegitura za T\u00f4ne, Tandjouar\u00e9, Cinkass\u00e9, Kpendjal na Kpendjal-Ouest. Izina risobanura \u00abituro rituwe abakurambere\u00bb (\"Tingban\": urutambiro; \"Paab\": ituro).\nUko wizihizwa.\nKubera ko Imana (\"Yendu\") itiyambazwa mu buryo butaziguye, abaturage bashimira abakurambere n'imyuka irinda uburinzi n'umusaruro mwiza. Ibirori birimo amaturo gakondo, imbyino n'umuziki, kumurika umusaruro w'ubuhinzi no gusangira amafunguro gakondo, hakiyongeraho imikino n'amasengesho mu nsengero no mu misigiti. Uyu munsi ushimangira ubumwe, uraga umuco urubyiruko kandi uzamura ubukungu n'ubukerarugendo by'akarere.\nWizihizwaga buri mwaka kuva hagati mu myaka ya 2000 (muri 2019 wizihizwaga ku nshuro ya 14 ikurikiranye), nyuma ya 2019 uhagarikwa kubera Covid-19 n'umutekano muke, wongera kuba ku ya 13 Ukuboza 2025 i T\u00f4ne, witabiriwe n'abayobozi bakuru b'igihugu n'intumwa zaturutse muri Ghana na Burkina Faso."}
{"id": "23248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23248", "title": "Udusimba tw'ibiheri", "text": "Udusimba tw'ibiheri ni ubwoko bw'udukoko dutungwa n'amaraso y'abantu, akenshi nijoro. Kurumwa kwazo bishobora gutera ingaruka nyinshi ku buzima zirimo uduheri ku ruhu, ingaruka zo mu mutwe, n'ibimenyetso by'ubwivumbure. Kurumwa udusimba tw'ibiheri bishobora gutera impinduka ku ruhu kuva ku duce tutagaragara kugeza ku duto tw'umutuku kugeza ku dusebe twinshi. Ibimenyetso bishobora gufata iminota cyangwa iminsi kugira ngo bigaragare kandi muri rusange hari ubwoba bugaragara. Hari abantu bashobora kumva bananiwe cyangwa bafite umuriro. Ubusanzwe, ibice by'umubiri bidatwikiriye birafatwa n'ingaruka kandi akenshi kurumwa gatatu bikurikirana. Ukurumwa n'udukoko two mu buriri ntabwo bizwi ko twanduza indwara iyo ari yo yose. Ingorane zishobora kuba zidakunze kuba zirimo ahantu hari uruhu rwapfuye cyangwa vasculitis.\nUdusimba tw'ibiheri duterwa ahanini n'ubwoko bubiri bw'udukoko two mu bwoko bwa \"Cimex\": \"Cimex lectularius\" (udukoko dusanzwe two mu buriri) na \"Cimex hemipterus\", cyane cyane mu turere dushyuha. Ingano yabo iri hagati ya 1 na 7\u00a0mm. Bikwirakwira mu kugendagenda hagati y\u2019ahantu hahegereye cyangwa mu gutwarwa mu bintu by\u2019umuntu ku giti cye. Kwandura indwara akenshi ntibikunze guterwa n\u2019isuku nke ariko bikunze kugaragara cyane mu duce turimo ubucucike bwinshi. Gusuzuma indwara bikubiyemo gushaka udukoko no kugaragaza ibimenyetso bihuye na byo. udusimba tw'ibiheri tumara igihe kinini ahantu hijimye kandi hihishe nko mu migozi ya matelas cyangwa mu mipfunyari y'urukuta.\nUbuvuzi bugamije ibimenyetso. Gukuraho udukoko two mu buriri mu rugo akenshi biragoye, kimwe mu bituma udukoko two mu buriri dushobora kumara umwaka wose tutarigaburira. Gusubiramo ubuvuzi bw'urugo bishobora kuba ngombwa. Ubu buryo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba bukubiyemo gushyushya icyumba kugeza kuri mu gihe kirenga iminota 90, gusukura isuku kenshi, kumesa imyenda ku bushyuhe bwinshi, no gukoresha imiti yica udukoko itandukanye.\nudusimba tw'ibiheri tuboneka mu turere twose tw\u2019isi. Igipimo cy'ubwandu bw'ibicurane kirakunze kugaragara, nyuma y'ubwiyongere kuva mu myaka ya 1990. Impamvu nyazo z\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019iyi ndwara ntizisobanutse neza; inyigisho zirimo kwiyongera kw\u2019ingendo z\u2019abantu, guhanahana ibikoresho byakoreshejwe kenshi, kwibanda cyane ku kurwanya utundi dukoko, no kongera ubudahangarwa bw\u2019imiti yica udukoko. udusimba tw'ibiheri tuzwiho kuba udukoko duto mu bantu mu myaka ibihumbi ishize."}
{"id": "23249", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23249", "title": "Amitriptyline", "text": "Amitriptyline, igurishwa ku izina rya Elavil n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura indwara nyinshi zo mu mutwe. Ibi birimo indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba no guhangayika, hamwe n'indwara idakunze kugaragara yo kudakora neza (ADHD) na indwara yo gucika intege. Izindi ngamba zirimo kwirinda indwara ya migraine, kuvura ububabare bw'imitsi nka fibromyalgia na neuralgia yo mu gihe cy'imitsi, ndetse no kudasinzira cyane. Iri mu bwoko bwa tricyclic antidepressant (TCA) kandi imikorere yayo nyayo ntabwo isobanutse neza. Amitriptyline ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kutabona neza, umunwa wumye, umuvuduko muke w'amaraso uhagaze, gusinzira no kutagira impatwe. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo gucika intege, ibyago byinshi byo kwiyahura ku bantu bari munsi y'imyaka 25, kubura inkari, glaucoma, n'ibibazo byinshi by'umutima. Ntibikwiye gufatwa hamwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bwa MAO cyangwa umuti wa cisapride. Amitriptyline ishobora guteza ibibazo iyo ifashwe mu gihe cyo gutwita. Gukoresha mu gihe cyo konsa bisa nkaho ari byiza ku rugero runaka. \nAmitriptyline yavumbuwe mu 1960 yemezwa n'Ikigo gishinzwe ibiribwa n'imiti muri Amerika (FDA) mu 1961. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cy'igurishwa ry'ibicuruzwa mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere yari hagati ya 0.01 na 0.04 by'amadolari ya Amerika kuri dose. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igura hafi amadolari y'Amerika 0.20 kuri buri dose. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 87 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n\u2019abaganga barenga miliyoni icyenda. "}
{"id": "23250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23250", "title": "Heroine", "text": "Heroine, izwi kandi nka diamorphine n'andi mazina, ni umuti ukoreshwa cyane nk'umuti wo kwidagadura kubera ingaruka zawo z'ibyishimo. Ikoreshwa mu buvuzi mu bihugu byinshi mu kugabanya ububabare cyangwa mu kuvura indwara ya opioid. Ubusanzwe iterwa, akenshi mu mitsi, ariko ishobora no kunyobwa, gushongeshwa, cyangwa guhumeka. Ingaruka zitangira vuba kandi zimara amasaha make.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kwiheba mu myanya y'ubuhumekero (kugabanuka k'ubuhumekero), kuma mu kanwa, gusinzira, kudakora neza mu mutwe, impatwe, no kuba imbata. Ingaruka mbi zo gukoresha inshinge zishobora kuba zirimo ibibyimba, imiyoboro y'umutima yanduye, indwara ziterwa n'amaraso, na pneumonia. Nyuma y'amateka yo gukoresha opioid igihe kirekire, ibimenyetso byo kuyireka bishobora gutangira mu masaha make uhereye igihe wayikoresheje bwa nyuma. Iyo itewe mu mitsi, heroine igira ingaruka zikubye kabiri cyangwa gatatu z'umuti wa morphine ungana. Ubusanzwe iza ari ifu y'umweru cyangwa iy'umukara.\nKuvura ubusinzi bwa heroine akenshi bikubiyemo uburyo bwo kuvura imyitwarire n'imiti. Imiti ishobora kuba irimo buprenorphine, methadone, cyangwa naltrexone. Kunywa heroine irenze urugero bishobora kuvurwa na naloxone. Bigereranyijwe ko hari abantu 17\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana bw'ibiyobyabwenge, muri yo heroine ikaba ari yo ikunze kugaragara cyane, kandi gukoresha opioid byahitanye abantu 122.000. Umubare w\u2019abakoresha heroine ku isi yose mu 2015 bikekwa ko wiyongereye muri Afurika, Amerika na Aziya kuva mu 2000. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, abantu bagera kuri 1.6% bagiye bakoresha heroine mu gihe runaka, aho abantu 950.000 bayikoresheje mu mwaka ushize. Iyo abantu bapfa kubera gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge birenze urugero, ibiyobyabwenge akenshi biba ari opioid ndetse akenshi bikaba ari heroine.\nHeroine yakozwe bwa mbere na CR Alder Wright mu 1874 ivuye muri morphine, umusaruro karemano wa opium poppy. Ku rwego mpuzamahanga, heroine igenzurwa hakurikijwe gahunda ya I n'iya IV z'Amasezerano Mpuzamahanga ku Biyobyabwenge, kandi muri rusange bitemewe n'amategeko gukora, gutunga, cyangwa kugurisha nta ruhushya. Mu 2016 hakozwe toni zigera kuri 448 za heroine. Mu 2015, Afuganisitani yakoraga hafi 66% by'umuti uhumanya ikirere ku isi. Heroine itemewe ikunze kuvangwa n'ibindi bintu nka isukari, sitashi, kafeyine, quinine, cyangwa indi miti nka fentanyl."}
{"id": "23251", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23251", "title": "Ekpessosso", "text": "Ekpessosso (nanone witwa Ep\u00e9-Ekp\u00e9 cyangwa Ifatwa ry'ibuye ritagatifu) ni umuhango ukorwa buri mwaka n'Abaguin bo mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Togo, bizihiza umwaka mushya gakondo. Kuva mu 2025, uri ku Rutonde ruhagarariye umurage ndangamuco udafatika w'abantu bose wa UNESCO.\nUmuhango.\nUkorwa buri kwezi kwa Nzeri i Glidji, mu ntara ya Lacs. Mu ishyamba ritagatifu rya Gbatsom\u00e9, abaherezabitambo bakuru basohora ibuye ritagatifu; ibara ryaryo rifatwa nk'ubutumwa bw'imana ku mwaka ukurikiyeho. Umuhango urimo kwiyeza, kwambaza abakurambere, ifunguro ry'ubumwe na karinavali.\nAmateka.\nAmateka avugwa mu kanwa avuga ko Abaguin baturutse mu karere ka Accra (muri Ghana) mu kinyejana cya 17, bagashinga ubwami i An\u00e9ho na Glidji.\nKwandikwa muri UNESCO.\nKu wa 11 Ukuboza 2025, i New Delhi, Ekpessosso yanditswe ku rutonde rwa UNESCO. Ni cyo kintu cya gatatu cya Togo kiri kuri urwo rutonde."}
{"id": "23252", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23252", "title": "Endometriosis", "text": "Endometriosis ni indwara aho uturemangingo gisa n'ibiri muri endometrium, urwego rw'ingirabuzimafatizo rusanzwe rutwikira imbere muri nyababyeyi, rukurira hanze yarwo. Akenshi ibi biba ku dusabo tw\u2019intanga, imiyoboro y\u2019inda, n\u2019ingirangingo zikikije nyababyeyi n\u2019intanga ngore; icyakora, mu bihe bidasanzwe bishobora no kugaragara mu bindi bice by\u2019umubiri. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi ni ububabare bw'ikibuno no kutabyara. Hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abarwaye bafite ububabare budakira mu kibuno, mu gihe 70% by'ububabare bubaho mu gihe cy'imihango. Ububabare mu gihe cy'imibonano mpuzabitsina nabwo bukunze kugaragara. Ubugumba bubaho kugeza kuri kimwe cya kabiri cy'abagore barwaye. Ibimenyetso bidakunze kugaragara birimo ibimenyetso byo mu nkari cyangwa mu mara. Abagore bagera kuri 25% nta bimenyetso bagira. Endometriosis ishobora kugira ingaruka ku mibereho no mu mitekerereze.\nImpamvu ntirasobanuka neza. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo kuba ufite amateka y\u2019iyi ndwara mu muryango. Uduce twa endometriosis duva amaraso buri kwezi, bigatera kubyimba no gukomereka. Ibibyimba biterwa na endometriosis si kanseri. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku bimenyetso bihujwe n'ishusho y'abaganga ; icyakora, biopsy ni bwo buryo bwizewe bwo gusuzuma indwara. Izindi mpamvu zitera ibimenyetso nk'ibi zirimo indwara yo kubyimba mu kibuno, indwara yo kurakara mu mara, cystite yo mu kibuno, na fibromyalgia. Endometriosis ikunze kwigwa nabi, kandi abagore bakunze kubwirwa nabi ko ibimenyetso byabo ari ibisanzwe cyangwa ko ari ibintu byoroheje.\nIbimenyetso by'ukuri bigaragaza ko gukoresha imiti ikoreshwa mu kuboneza urubyaro igabanya ibyago byo kurwara endometriosis. Gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri no kwirinda kunywa inzoga nyinshi nabyo bishobora kuba uburyo bwo kwirinda. Nta muti uhari wo kuvura indwara ya endometriosis, ariko uburyo butandukanye bwo kuvura bushobora kongerera ibimenyetso. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo imiti igabanya ububabare, imiti igabanya ububabare cyangwa kubagwa. Umuti w'ububabare usabwa akenshi ni umuti urwanya ububabare utari uwa steroide (NSAID), nka naproxen. Gufata ikinini cyo kuboneza urubyaro buri gihe cyangwa gukoresha icyuma gishyirwa mu mura gifite progestogen nabyo bishobora kuba ingirakamaro. Umuti ugabanya imisemburo ya gonadotropin (agonist ya GnRH) ushobora kongera ubushobozi bw'abatabyara bwo gutwita. Gukuraho endometriosis bishobora gukoreshwa mu kuvura abafite ibimenyetso bidashoboka mu bundi buryo bwo kuvura.\nEndometriosis yibasira hafi 10% by'abagore bari mu kigero cyo kubyara. Icyigereranyo kimwe kivuga ko abantu miliyoni 10.8 ari bo bagizweho ingaruka ku isi yose. Andi masoko avuga ko abagore bari hagati ya 6\u201310% ari bo bibasiwe n\u2019iki kibazo. Endometriosis ikunze kugaragara cyane ku bantu bari mu kigero cy'imyaka mirongo itatu na mirongo ine; icyakora, ishobora gutangira ku bakobwa bafite imyaka umunani. Bitera impfu nke. Endometriosis yamenyekanye bwa mbere ko ari indwara itandukanye mu myaka ya 1920. Mbere y'icyo gihe, endometriosis na adenomyosis byatekerezwagaho hamwe. Ntibiramenyekana neza uwasobanuye bwa mbere iyi ndwara."}
{"id": "23253", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23253", "title": "Ihungabana ryo mu mutwe nyuma yo kubyara", "text": "Indwara yo mu mutwe nyuma yo kubyara (PPP) iterwa no gutangira gutunguranye ibimenyetso byo mu mutwe nyuma gato yo kubyara, akenshi mu byumweru bibiri nyuma yo kubyara ariko mu gihe kitarenze ibyumweru 4. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubona cyangwa guhumurirwa ibintu bitariho (ibintu bitagaragara), ibitekerezo bidashoboka ko biba ukuri (ibintu bidafite ishingiro), imitekerereze idasanzwe (mania), kwiheba, guhangayika, cyangwa urujijo. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo ibitekerezo bitagenda neza, kugorwa no gusinzira, hamwe n'imitekerereze n'ubwenge bihindagurika. Muri rusange, umuntu ubwe ntasobanukiwe neza uburemere bw'iyi ndwara. Abarenga kimwe cya kabiri cy'abanduye nyuma baza gusanganwa indwara ya bipolar.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana, nubwo ishobora kuba ifitanye isano n'impinduka mu misemburo, ibibazo by'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri, ndetse n'imiterere y'uturemangingo. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo gutwita bwa mbere, gusaza, kubura ibitotsi, n'amateka y'umuntu ku giti cye cyangwa mu muryango we arwaye PPP cyangwa indwara ya bipolar. Imihangayiko mu buzima isa nkaho ntacyo ikora, ndetse n'ibimenyetso bifatika ku bibazo byo gutwita ntibigaragara. Nta bikoresho byo gusuzuma cyangwa gusuzuma bihari; bikorwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso bigaragara, bigenzurwa n'ibipimo biri muri DSM-V nyuma yo gukuraho izindi mpamvu zishobora kuba zarabayeho. Mu gitabo cy\u2019isuzuma n\u2019ibarurishamibare ku ndwara zo mu mutwe, Umubumbe wa V (DSM-V TR) kiri mu gihe gito cy\u2019indwara yo mu mutwe aho \"peripartum itangira\", aho kuba ikintu cyihariye.\nBifatwa nk'ikibazo cyo mu mutwe gisaba kujya mu bitaro byihutirwa. Uburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo imiti nka lithium, benzodiazepines, na antipsychotics, ndetse no kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe hakoreshejwe electroconvulsive therapy (ECT). Mu gihe umugore yigeze kugira umuti wa lithium, ashobora gutangira gukoreshwa mu buryo bwo kwirinda ako kanya nyuma yo kubyara. Ibimenyetso byo mu mutwe, cyane cyane ibyo kwibeshya ko umuntu atamenye neza, bitera impungenge ku mutekano w'umwana na nyina; iyo ndwara ikaba yatuma umwana apfa muri 4% by'abanduye ndetse ikaba ishobora no kwiyahura na nyina. Gutandukana Gutandukana bibaho kugeza kuri 20%. \nIhungabana ryo mu mutwe nyuma yo kubyara ribaho ku mwana 1 kugeza kuri 2 ku bana 1000 bavutse. Igipimo kigaragara kimwe mu mico itandukanye no mu byiciro bitandukanye by'imibereho. Kenshi na kenshi, igaragara mu gihe umuntu arwaye indwara ya bipolar izwi cyangwa nshya, izwi nka nyuma yo kuvuka. Iyi ndwara yasobanuwe kuva mu 400 mbere ya Yesu na Hippocrates."}
{"id": "23254", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23254", "title": "Igifu", "text": "Igifu ni ukubyimba kw'uruti rw'igifu. Bishobora kubaho nk'igihe gito cyangwa bikaba igihe kirekire. Nta bimenyetso bishobora kubaho ariko iyo ibimenyetso bigaragaye, ububabare bukunze kugaragara ni ububabare bwo mu nda yo hejuru. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kugaragara birimo isesemi no kuruka, kubyimba inda, kubura ubushake bwo kurya no kuribwa mu gifu. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kuva amaraso mu gifu, ibisebe byo mu gifu, n'ibibyimba byo mu gifu. Iyo habayeho ibibazo by\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri, uturemangingo dutukura duke duterwa no kubura vitamine B12 ihagije, indwara izwi nka anemia itera indwara.\nImpamvu zikunze kugaragara zirimo kwandura \"Helicobacter pylori\" no gukoresha imiti igabanya ubushyuhe itari steroide (NSAIDs). Impamvu zidakunze kugaragara zirimo inzoga, kunywa itabi, kokayine, indwara zikomeye, ibibazo by\u2019umubiri udafite ubushobozi bwo kwirwanaho, kuvurwa hakoreshejwe imirasire n\u2019indwara ya Crohn. Endoskopi, ubwoko bwa X-ray buzwi nka \" upper gastrointestinal series\", ibizamini by'amaraso, n'ibizamini by'umwanda bishobora gufasha mu gusuzuma indwara. Ibimenyetso bya gastritis bishobora kuba ikimenyetso cy'indwara y'umutima ifata imitsi. Izindi ndwara zifite ibimenyetso bisa zirimo kubyimba kwa pancreas, ibibazo by'agasabo k'inkari, n'indwara y'ibisebe byo mu gifu.\nKwirinda ni ukwirinda ibintu bitera indwara. Ubuvuzi burimo imiti nka antacids, H2 blockers, cyangwa proton pump inhibitors. Mu gihe cy'igitero gikomeye, kunywa lidocaine ifite viscous bishobora gufasha. Iyo indwara ya gastritis iterwa na NSAIDs, ishobora guhagarara. Iyo \"H. pylori\" ihari ishobora kuvurwa hakoreshejwe imiti ivanze ya antibiyotike nka amoxicillin na clarithromycin. Ku bafite ikibazo cyo kubura amaraso mu mubiri, imiti igabanya ubukana bwa Vitamine B12 irasabwa kunyobwa cyangwa guterwa inshinge. Abantu bakunze kugira inama yo kwirinda ibiryo bibabangamira.\nBivugwa ko indwara ya gastrite yibasira hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abantu ku isi yose. Mu 2013 habayeho abarwayi bashya bagera kuri miliyoni 90 b'iyi ndwara. Uko abantu bagenda bakura niko indwara irushaho kugaragara. Iyo ndwara, hamwe n\u2019indwara isa nayo mu gice cya mbere cy\u2019amara kizwi nka duodenitis, yahitanye abantu 50.000 mu 2015. \"H. pylori\" yavumbuwe bwa mbere mu 1981 na Barry Marshall na Robin Warren."}
{"id": "23255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23255", "title": "Mastoidite", "text": "Mastoidite ni indwara ifata uturemangingo tw\u2019umwuka turi mu gahanga inyuma y\u2019ugutwi. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba umutuku, kubyimba, no kubabara inyuma y'ugutwi hamwe n'umuriro n'ububabare mu matwi. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo meningite, ububabare bwo mu mutwe, na venous sinus thrombosis.\nIndwara ya mastoidite ikunze kugaragara nk'ingaruka z'ubwandu bwo mu gutwi ko hagati. Ibintu bishobora gutera ingorane birimo imikorere mibi y'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bishingiye ku bimenyetso n'isuzuma. Gusuzuma ingoma yo mu matwi akenshi bigaragaza amabyi. Gufata amashusho y\u2019ubuvuzi bishobora kuba ingirakamaro mu bihe bitazwi neza.\nUbuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko nka ceftriaxone cyangwa vancomycin mu mitsi. Izindi ngamba zishobora gusabwa zirimo gukata ingoma yo mu matwi, imiyoboro ya tympanostomy, cyangwa gucibwamo mastoidectomy. Indi miti ishobora gukoreshwa irimo steroide.\nIndwara ya mastoidite ntikunze kubaho, yibasira abana bagera kuri 2.7 ku bana 100.000 buri mwaka. Abana, cyane cyane abari munsi y'imyaka 2, ni bo bibasirwa cyane kurusha abantu bakuru. Mbere y\u2019uko haboneka imiti yica udukoko n\u2019urukingo rwa pneumococcal, indwara yari ikunze kugaragara cyane."}
{"id": "23256", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23256", "title": "Salbutamol", "text": "Salbutamol, izwi kandi ku izina rya albuterol kandi igurishwa nka Ventolin mu yandi mazina, ni umuti ufungura inzira z'ubuhumekero zo hagati n'izinini mu bihaha. Ikoreshwa mu kuvura asima, harimo indwara ya asima, kugabanuka k'imitsi y'amaraso bitewe n'imyitozo ngororamubiri, ndetse n'indwara zidakira zo mu bihaha (COPD). Ishobora kandi gukoreshwa mu kuvura urugero rwinshi rwa potasiyumu mu maraso. Salbutamol ikoreshwa mu buryo busanzwe hamwe n'icyuma gihumeka cyangwa imvange, ariko iboneka no mu binini, mu mazi no mu mitsi. Itangira ry'imikorere y'iyi mashini ihumekwa rikunze kuba mu minota 15 kandi rimara amasaha abiri kugeza kuri atandatu.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kunyara, kuribwa umutwe, gutera k'umutima vuba, kuzerera no kumva uhangayitse. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kwiyongera kwa bronchospasm, umutima utera nabi, hamwe n'urugero rwa potasiyumu mu maraso. Ishobora gukoreshwa mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa, ariko umutekano wayo nturasobanuka neza. Ni agonisti y\u2019ikirahure cya \u03b22 adrenergic receptor ikora vuba, ikora mu gutuma imitsi yoroherwa n\u2019imyakura igenda neza.\nSalbutamol yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha patenti mu 1966 mu Bwongereza, itangira kugurishwa mu Bwongereza mu 1969. Yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1982. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Salbutamol iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cyo kugurisha mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere cy'umuti uhumeka ufite dose 200 kiri hagati na. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ni hagati na ku giciro gisanzwe cy'ukwezi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa cumi ukoreshwa cyane muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni 50."}
{"id": "23257", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23257", "title": "Impatwe", "text": "Kwihagarika impatwe bivuga kwihagarika amara gake cyangwa bigoye gutambuka. Imboro ikunze gukomera kandi yumye. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubabara mu nda, kubyimba inda, no kumva nk'aho umuntu atararangiza burundu inzira y'amara. Ingorane ziterwa no kutagira impatwe zishobora kuba zirimo hemorrhoids, imiyoboro y'ikibuno cyangwa imyakura. Inshuro isanzwe yo kwituma amara mu bantu bakuru ni hagati ya gatatu ku munsi na gatatu mu cyumweru. Abana bakunze kugira amara inshuro eshatu kugeza kuri enye ku munsi mu gihe abana bato bakunze kugira amara abiri kugeza kuri atatu ku munsi.\nImpatwe ifite impamvu nyinshi. Impamvu zikunze kugaragara zirimo kugenda buhoro kw'imyenge mu mara, indwara yo mu mara iterwa n'imitsi, n'indwara zo mu gice cy'imbere cy'uruti rw'umura. Indwara zifitanye isano nazo zirimo, diyabete, indwara ya Parkinson, indwara ya celiac, indwara ya gluten idaterwa na celiac, kanseri y'inkondo y'umura, diverticulitis, n'indwara y'amara iterwa n'ububabare. Imiti ijyanye no kuvura impatwe irimo imiti igabanya ubukana bw'impatwe, imiti igabanya aside imwe n'imwe, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'imiyoboro ya kalisiyumu, hamwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bw'impatwe. Mu bafata imiti igabanya ubukana bw'ibiyobyabwenge (opioids) bagera kuri 90% barwara impatwe. Kwihagarika impatwe bihangayikishije cyane iyo umuntu agabanutse ibiro cyangwa afite amaraso make, amaraso ari mu mwanda, hari amateka y'indwara y'ububyimbirwe bw'amara cyangwa kanseri y'amara mu muryango we, cyangwa se bitangiye gushya ku muntu ukuze.\nUburyo bwo kuvura impatwe biterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru n'igihe zimaze. Ingamba zishobora gufasha zirimo kunywa ibinyobwa bihagije, kurya fibre nyinshi, no gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri. Iyo ibi bidakora neza, imiti yoroshya uburozi y\u2019umuti utuma umubiri urushaho gukora neza, umuti utuma umubiri urushaho gukora neza, umuti woroshya umwijima, umuti woroshya umwijima, cyangwa ubwoko bw\u2019amavuta yo kwisiga ashobora kuba ari ngombwa. Imiti yoroshya ububabare muri rusange ikoreshwa mu gihe ubundi bwoko bw'imiti budakora neza. Ubundi buryo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo biofeedback cyangwa mu bihe bidasanzwe byo kubaga.\nMuri rusange, igipimo cy\u2019indwara yo kutagira impatwe mu baturage ni 2\u201330 ku ijana. Mu bageze mu zabukuru baba mu kigo cyita ku bageze mu za bukuru, igipimo cy\u2019indwara yo kutagira impatwe kiri hagati ya 50\u201375%. Abantu bakoresha, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, arenga ku miti ivura impatwe buri mwaka."}
{"id": "23258", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23258", "title": "Ikirenge cy'ikirenge", "text": "Ikirenge cy'ikirenge ni indwara ivuka aho ikirenge kimwe cyangwa byombi bizunguruka imbere no hepfo. Ikirenge n'ukuguru byafashwe bishobora kuba bito ugereranije n'ibindi. Hafi 50% by'abarwayi b'ikirenge kibabara ibirenge byombi. Akenshi, ntabwo bifitanye isano n'ibindi bibazo. Iyo hatabayeho kuvurwa, ikirenge gikomeza kuba kibi, kandi abantu bagenda ku mpande z'ibirenge byabo. Ibi bishobora gutera ububabare no kugorwa no kugenda.\nImpamvu nyayo akenshi ntimenyekana. Ibintu byombi bigize imiterere y\u2019umubiri n\u2019ibidukikije byizewe ko bibigiramo uruhare. Iyo impanga imwe isa ifashwe, hari amahirwe angana na 33% ko indi nayo izafatwa. Uburyo bw'ibanze butuma imitsi cyangwa ingingo zo hasi zihungabana, bigatera ingingo gufungana. Izindi ndwara zikunze kugaragara kuri 20% by'igihe, aho ikunze kugaragara cyane ari arthrogryposis na myelomeningocele. Isuzuma rishobora gukorwa igihe umuntu avuka binyuze mu gusuzuma cyangwa mbere yo kuvuka mu gihe cyo gusuzuma hakoreshejwe ultrasound.\nUburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura akenshi ni uburyo bwa Ponseti. Ibi bikubiyemo kwimura ikirenge ukagishyira mu mwanya mwiza hanyuma ugatera icyuma, ibyo bigasubirwamo buri cyumweru. Iyo umutsi wo mu nda umaze kumera neza, umutsi wo mu nda wa Achilles ukunze gucibwa, kandi imishumi irashyirwaho kugeza ku myaka ine. Mu ntangiriro, igitambaro cyo gupfuka amaguru cyambarwa hafi buri gihe hanyuma kikambarwa nijoro gusa. Mu manza zigera kuri 20%, hakenewe ubundi buryo bwo kubaga. Ubuvuzi bushobora gukorwa n'abatanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi batandukanye kandi muri rusange bushobora kugerwaho mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere nta bushobozi buke.\nIkirenge kibaho ku bana 1 kugeza kuri 4 mu bana 1.000 bavutse ari bazima, bigatuma kiba kimwe mu bibazo bikunze kugaragara ku maguru. Hafi 80% by'abanduye bagaragara mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere aho abantu batabona ubuvuzi buhagije. Ikirenge cy'umugongo gikunze kugaragara cyane mu bana b'imfura n'abahungu. Bikunze kugaragara cyane mu baturage ba Maori, kandi ntibikunze kugaragara cyane mu Bashinwa."}
{"id": "23259", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23259", "title": "Chloramphenicol", "text": "Ingaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, no gucibwamo. Ni gake cyane hashobora kubaho kugabanuka k'umusemburo w'amagufwa, bikaba byaviramo urupfu. Kugira ngo ugabanye ibyago byo kugira ingaruka mbi, igihe cyo kuvurwa kigomba kuba gito uko bishoboka kose. Abantu bafite ibibazo by'umwijima cyangwa impyiko bashobora gukenera dose nke. Ku bana bato, indwara izwi nka \"gray baby syndrome\" ishobora kubaho, bigatuma igifu kibyimba kandi umuvuduko w'amaraso ukaba muke. Gukoresha iyo ndwara hafi yo gutwita no mu gihe cyo konsa ubusanzwe ntibyemewe. Chloramphenicol ni umuti urwanya udukoko twinshi ukunze guhagarika gukura kwa bagiteri binyuze mu guhagarika ikorwa rya poroteyine.\nChloramphenicol yavumbuwe nyuma yo gukurwa muri \"Streptomyces venezuelae\" mu 1947. Imiterere yayo ya shimi yamenyekanye kandi yakozwe bwa mbere mu buryo bw'ubukorano mu 1949, bituma iba antibiyotike ya mbere yakorewe aho gukurwa mu turemangingo duto. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cy\u2019umuti uterwa mu mitsi mu bihugu biri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere ni hagati y\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika 0.40\u20131.90. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igipimo cyo guterwa mu mitsi kigura hafi $41.47."}
{"id": "23260", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23260", "title": "Sclerosis y'ibibyimba", "text": "Indwara ya sclerosis y'ibibyimba (TS) ni indwara iterwa n'uturemangingo itera kwiyongera kw'ibibyimba bitari kanseri mu bwonko no mu zindi ngingo nk'umutima, amaso, ibihaha n'uruhu. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe birimo gucika intege, ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, gutinda mu mikurire, ibibazo by'imyitwarire, na autisme. Ibibazo bikunze gutangira mu mwaka wa mbere w'ubuzima; nubwo bishobora kubaho nyuma. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo ibibazo by'impyiko n'ibihaha.\nIterwa n'impinduka mu miterere ya gene ya \"TSC1\" cyangwa \"TSC2\", ari na yo ikora poroteyine hamartine na tuberin, uko bikurikirana. Nubwo ishobora kuragwa n'ababyeyi b'umuntu mu buryo busanzwe bwo kwigira ku mubiri, inyinshi muri zo ziba mu gihe cy'imikurire mishya. Izi poroteyine zifatwa nk'izigabanya gukura kwa kanseri. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bishingiye ku bimenyetso kandi bigashyigikirwa n'amashusho y'abaganga. Bishobora kandi kwemezwa no gupima imiterere y'uturemangingo.\nNta muti uhari, ubuvuzi bufasha mu buryo busanzwe. Ibikorwa bishobora kuba birimo ubuvuzi bw'umubiri, ubuvuzi bw'akazi, ubuvuzi bwo kuvuga, n'ubuvuzi bw'imyitwarire. Imiti igabanya igicuri, nka vigabatrin, ishobora gukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe. Ingaruka z'igihe kirekire zirahindagurika kandi biterwa n'uburemere bw'ibimenyetso.\nIndwara ya sclerosis y'ibibyimba ishobora kwibasira abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 2 ku isi yose. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ifata abana bagera kuri 1 ku bana 6.000; mu gihe idakunze kugaragara cyane mu Burayi. Abagabo n'abagore barwara indwara imwe. Byasobanuwe bwa mbere n'umuhanga mu by'imitsi w'Umufaransa D\u00e9sir\u00e9-Magloire Bourneville mu 1880. Izina ryerekeza ku kubyimba kudasanzwe mu bwonko, bishobora kuba bimeze nk'ibirayi."}
{"id": "23261", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23261", "title": "Croup", "text": "Croup, izwi kandi nka laryngotracheobronchitis, ni ubwoko bw'indwara zo mu myanya y'ubuhumekero zikunze guterwa na virusi. Ubwandu butera kubyimba imbere mu muyoboro w'amaraso, ibyo bikaba bibangamira guhumeka neza kandi bigatera ibimenyetso bisanzwe byo \" gukorora \", stridor, n'ijwi rituje. Umuriro n'izuru riva nabyo bishobora kuba biriho. Ibi bimenyetso bishobora kuba byoroheje, biri hagati, cyangwa bikomeye. Akenshi bitangira cyangwa bikarushaho kuba bibi nijoro kandi ubusanzwe bifata umunsi umwe cyangwa ibiri.\nIndwara ya Croup ishobora guterwa na virusi nyinshi zirimo parainfluenza na virusi ya grippe. Ni gake cyane biterwa n'ubwandu bwa bagiteri, buzwi nka tracheitis ya bagiteri. Ubusanzwe indwara ya Croup ipimwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso nyuma y\u2019uko impamvu zishobora kuba zikomeye kurushaho, nka epiglottitis cyangwa umubiri wo mu nzira z\u2019ubuhumekero, zitagaragaye. Ubushakashatsi bw'inyongera\u2014nk'ibipimo by'amaraso, X-rays, no gupima\u2014ubusanzwe ntabwo bikenewe.\nAbantu benshi barwara indwara ya croup bashobora kwirindwa binyuze mu gukingira ibicurane na diphtheria. Ubusanzwe Croup ivurwa n'umuti umwe wa steroide ukoreshejwe mu kanwa (dexamethasone ku gipimo cya 0.15 kugeza 0.6 mg/kg). Mu bihe bikomeye cyane, epinephrine ihumekwa na yo ishobora gukoreshwa. Kwinjira mu bitaro ni ngombwa ku muntu umwe kugeza kuri batanu ku ijana by'abarwayi.\nIndwara ya Croup ni indwara ikunze kwibasira abana bagera kuri 15% mu gihe runaka. Akenshi bibaho hagati y'amezi 6 n'imyaka 5 ariko bishobora kugaragara gake cyane ku bana bafite imyaka cumi n'itanu. Bikunze kugaragara gato ku bagabo kurusha abagore. Bikunze kubaho mu gihe cy'umuhindo. Mbere yo gukingirwa, indwara yo mu nda yakundaga guterwa na diphtheria kandi akenshi yahitanaga abantu. Iyi mpamvu ubu irakunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba bw'Isi bitewe n'uko urukingo rwa diphtheria rwagenze neza."}
{"id": "23262", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23262", "title": "Kubabara umugongo wo hasi", "text": "Ububabare bwo mu mugongo wo hasi (LBP) ni indwara ikunze kugaragara ku mitsi, imitsi, n'amagufwa y'umugongo. Ububabare bushobora gutandukana uhereye ku kubabara gukabije guhoraho kugeza ku kumva ubabaye mu buryo butunguranye. Ishobora gushyirwa mu byiciro hakurikijwe igihe imara nk'ububabare bukabije (ububabare bumara munsi y'ibyumweru 6), ububabare budahoraho (ibyumweru 6 kugeza kuri 12), cyangwa ububabare budakira (ibyumweru birenga 12). Iyi ndwara ishobora gushyirwa mu byiciro hakurikijwe impamvu nyamukuru nk'ububabare buterwa n'imikorere, ububabare buterwa n'imikorere, cyangwa ububabare buterwa n'imvugo. Ibimenyetso akenshi biragenda neza mu byumweru bike uhereye igihe byatangiriye, aho abantu 40\u201390% baba bakize neza mu byumweru bitandatu.\nMu bihe byinshi, impamvu yihariye itera iyi ndwara ntabwo imenyekana cyangwa ngo ishakishwe, aho ububabare bukekwa ko buterwa n'ibibazo by'imikorere nk'imitsi cyangwa ingingo. Niba ububabare budashira iyo umuntu avuwe mu buryo busanzwe cyangwa bugaherekezwa n' \"ibimenyetso bitukura\" nko kugabanya ibiro mu buryo budasobanutse, umuriro, cyangwa ibibazo bikomeye byo kumva cyangwa kugenda, hashobora kuba ngombwa ko hakorwa isuzuma ryinyongera kugira ngo hamenyekane ikibazo gikomeye cy\u2019ingenzi. Kenshi na kenshi, ibikoresho byo gufata amashusho nka X-ray computed tomography ntabwo bifite akamaro kandi bifite ingaruka zabyo. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, gukoresha amashusho mu kuvura ububabare bwo hasi bwiyongereye. Ububabare bumwe na bumwe bw'umugongo wo hasi buterwa n'amadisiki yo mu gice cy'imbere cy'umutima yangiritse, kandi ikizamini cyo kuzamura amaguru agororotse ni ingirakamaro mu kumenya impamvu. Ku bafite ububabare budakira, uburyo bwo gutunganya ububabare bushobora gukora nabi, bigatera ububabare bwinshi bitewe n\u2019ibintu bitari bikomeye.\nKubanza gukoresha imiti idashingiye ku miti ni byiza. Imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara zo mu mutwe (NSAIDs) irasabwa niba idakora neza. Ibikorwa bisanzwe bigomba gukomeza uko ububabare bushoboka kandi imyitozo ngororamubiri ni ingirakamaro mu kubabara igihe kirekire. Imiti irasabwa mu gihe cyose ifasha. Hari ubundi buryo butandukanye buhari ku bantu badakira neza bakoresheje uburyo busanzwe bwo kuvurwa. Opioide ishobora kuba ingirakamaro niba imiti yoroheje y'ububabare idahagije, ariko muri rusange ntabwo isabwa kubera ingaruka mbi. Kubagwa bishobora kuba ingirakamaro ku bafite ububabare budakira buterwa n'amadisiki n'ubumuga cyangwa stenosis y'umugongo. Nta nyungu igaragara yabonetse ku zindi ndwara z\u2019ububabare bw\u2019umugongo wo hasi butari ubwazo. Ububabare bwo mu mugongo wo hasi bukunze kugira ingaruka ku byiyumvo, bishobora kongerwa n'inama cyangwa imiti igabanya ubukana. Byongeye kandi, hari uburyo bwinshi bwo kuvura bushobora gukoreshwa mu buryo bw\u2019umwimerere, ariko nta bimenyetso bihagije bihari kugira ngo umuntu abwizeze neza. Ibimenyetso by\u2019ubuvuzi bwa chiropractic no gukora ubuvuzi bw\u2019umugongo biravanze.\nHafi 9\u201312% by'abantu (632)\u00a0miliyoni) bafite LBP mu gihe runaka, kandi hafi 25% bavuga ko bayirwaye mu gihe runaka mu gihe cy'ukwezi kumwe. Abantu bagera kuri 40% bafite LBP mu gihe runaka mu buzima bwabo, aho biteganijwe ko bagera kuri 80% mu bantu bo mu bihugu byateye imbere. Ingorane akenshi zitangira hagati y'imyaka 20 na 40. Abagabo n'abagore bagerwaho n'ingaruka zingana. Ububabare bw'umugongo wo hasi bukunze kugaragara cyane ku bantu bari hagati y'imyaka 40 na 80, kandi umubare w'abantu barwaye wiyongera uko abaturage bagenda bakura."}
{"id": "23263", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23263", "title": "Uburyo bwo kuvura imisemburo", "text": "Uburyo bwo kuvura imisemburo (HRT), buzwi kandi nka ubuvuzi bw'imisemburo mu gihe cyo gucura, ni uburyo bwo kuvura imisemburo bukoreshwa mu kuvura ibimenyetso bifitanye isano no gucura. Ibi birimo ubushyuhe bwinshi, ibyuya byo mu ijoro, kuma kw'imyanya ndangagitsina, n'ibibazo byo kwiyumva nabi. Muri rusange ni uburyo bwo kuvura ibi bimenyetso busabwa Gukoresha muri rusange mu kwirinda ibibazo by'ubuzima by'igihe kirekire, nka kanseri, indwara z'umutima, cyangwa indwara yo gucika kw'amagufwa, ntibyemewe. Gukoresha bigirwa inama y'igihe gito kandi bishobora gukorwa mu nzira zitandukanye.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo indwara y'agasabo k'inkari, gucika imitsi, kunanirwa kwihagarika inkari, no kugabanya amaraso; ariko nta gihinduka mu byago byose byo kugira ingaruka mbi cyangwa urupfu. Ibimenyetso by'ishingiro bishyigikira inyungu nini kurusha ingaruka mbi ku bari munsi y'imyaka 60. Gukoresha iyi miti ntibyemewe ku bantu bafite ibibazo by'umwijima cyangwa kanseri y'ibere. Irimo estrogen na progestogen. Progestogen ikoreshwa, keretse iyo nyababyeyi yakuweho, kugira ngo hirindwe ibyago byinshi byo kurwara kanseri y'inkondo y'umura. Androgens, kimwe na testosterone, rimwe na rimwe na zo zirakoreshwa.\nUburyo bwo kuvura imisemburo bukoreshwa kuva mu myaka ya 1890. Guhera mu 2024, ibiciro muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika biratandukanye kuva kuri 10 USD kugeza kuri 500 USD, bitewe n'ubwoko. Kwinjira kwa estrogen, estradiol, mu rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi ya OMS byamaganywe mu 2023, hamwe n'inama zo gutekereza cyane ku kuyishyiramo. Gusimbuza imisemburo isa n\u2019iy\u2019ibinyabuzima byamamaye cyane mu myaka ya za 2000 aho bavugaga ko ari \"umwimerere\" cyane; icyakora, inyungu n\u2019umutekano ntibirasobanuka neza, kandi kuyikoresha ntibyemewe."}
{"id": "23264", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23264", "title": "\u00c9lie Sagatwa", "text": "\u00c9lie Sagatwa (yapfuye ku ya 6 Mata 1994 i Kigali) yari umusirikare w'Umunyarwanda ufite ipeti rya koloneli mu Ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR). Yari umunyamabanga wihariye wa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana kandi yari mu bantu ba hafi b'ubutegetsi bwe mbere ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Yaguye mu ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida ryabaye ku ya 6 Mata 1994.\nUbuzima bwe.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\n\u00c9lie Sagatwa yari koloneli mu Ngabo z'u Rwanda (\"Forces arm\u00e9es rwandaises\", FAR). Yakoraga nk'umunyamabanga wihariye wa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana.\nNk'uko Human Rights Watch ibivuga, Sagatwa yari umwe mu bantu bari bafite ijambo rikomeye mu bari hafi ya Perezida, nubwo atagaragaraga cyane nk'abandi bayobozi ba politiki cyangwa b'ubukungu b'ubutegetsi. Iyo raporo kandi ivuga ko Ingabo zirinda Umukuru w'Igihugu (\"Garde pr\u00e9sidentielle\"), umutwe wari ufite intwaro nyinshi kandi wigenga cyane mu Ngabo z'u Rwanda, wari uyobowe na Koloneli Sagatwa kugeza apfuye.\nAkazu.\n\u00c9lie Sagatwa avugwa mu bagize \"Akazu\", izina ryahawe itsinda ry'abantu ba hafi ya Perezida Habyarimana n'umugore we Agathe Kanziga, abashakashatsi benshi babona nk'itsinda ryari rifite ububasha bukomeye mu butegetsi bwa Repubulika ya Kabiri y'Rwanda.\nUbushakashatsi bwa Alison Des Forges kuri Human Rights Watch bumugaragaza nk'umwe mu bantu bo mu bari hafi ya Perezida bakoreraga inyuma y'amarido y'ubutegetsi. Mu buhamya bwatanzwe imbere y'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR) rwakoreraga mu mujyi wa Arusha muri Tanzaniya, na ho avugwa nk'umunyamabanga wihariye wa Perezida Habyarimana.\nUrupfu.\nKu ya 6 Mata 1994, \u00c9lie Sagatwa yari mu ndege \"Dassault Falcon 50\" yari itwaye Perezida w'u Rwanda Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana na Perezida w'Uburundi Cyprien Ntaryamira, hamwe n'umugaba mukuru w'Ingabo z'u Rwanda, Jenerali D\u00e9ogratias Nsabimana. Iyo ndege yarashwe na misile igihe yari yegereye ikibuga cy'indege cya Kigali i Kanombe, maze abari bayirimo bose barapfa.\nUrutonde rw'abagenzi rugaragaza \u00c9lie Sagatwa nka koloneli akaba n'umunyamabanga wihariye wa Perezida. Ikigo \"Bureau of Aircraft Accidents Archives\" na cyo kimubara mu bagenzi baguye muri iyo mpanuka.\nIhanurwa ry'iyo ndege rifatwa nk'imbarutso ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda, yakozwe n'abahezanguni b'Abahutu barimo Interahamwe."}
{"id": "23265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23265", "title": "Patrick de Saint-Exup\u00e9ry", "text": "Patrick de Saint-Exup\u00e9ry (yavutse ku ya 16 Nzeri 1962) ni umunyamakuru akaba n'umwanditsi w'Umufaransa. Azwi cyane ku nkuru yanditse ku Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda no ku bitabo bivuga ku ruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri iyo jenoside.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye itangazamakuru afite imyaka 19, akorera \"France-Soir\" na \"L'Express\", maze kuva mu 1989 aba umunyamakuru w'amakuru y'amahanga wa \"Le Figaro\". Yatangaje inkuru zo muri Liberiya, Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Kambodiya, Irani, Rwanda n'ahandi, kandi kuva mu 2000 kugeza mu 2004 yari umunyamakuru wa \"Le Figaro\" mu Uburusiya. Mu 1991 yahawe igihembo cya \"Prix Albert-Londres\".\nMu 2008 yashinze, afatanyije na Laurent Beccaria, ikinyamakuru \"XXI\", na nyuma \"Ebdo\" mu 2017, cyahagaze mu 2018.\nU Rwanda.\nMu 1994 yageze mu Rwanda anyuze ku ruhande rwa FPR-Inkotanyi, hanyuma mu gihe cy\"'Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\" ari kumwe n'ingabo z'Abafaransa, yibonera ibyabereye i Bisesero. Inkuru yanditse icyo gihe no mu 1998 zatumye Inteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Ubufaransa ishyiraho komisiyo yo gucukumbura ku Rwanda.\nMu 2004 yasohoye igitabo \"L'Inavouable: la France au Rwanda\", cyongeye gusohoka mu 2009 cyitwa \"Complices de l'inavouable\". Abajenerali Christian Quesnot na \u00c9ric de Stabenrath bamureze gusebanya kubera icyo gitabo, maze inkiko zimuhamya icyo cyaha. Mu 2021, mu gitabo \"La Travers\u00e9e\", yanyomoje igitekerezo cy'uko habayeho \u00abjenoside ya kabiri\u00bb."}
{"id": "23266", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23266", "title": "Aminadabu Birara", "text": "Aminadabu Birara (1926 \u2013 25 Kamena 1994) yari umworozi w'Umunyarwanda wo mu misozi ya Bisesero, uzwiho kuba yarayoboye ubwirwanaho bw'Abatutsi i Bisesero mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Yiciwe muri iyo misozi ku ya 25 Kamena 1994.\nUbuzima.\nAminadabu Birara yavukiye i Bisesero, mu misozi y'Iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, mu 1926. Yari umworozi kimwe n'abagabo benshi bo muri ako karere. Yarokotse ubwicanyi bwibasiye Abatutsi mu 1959, 1962, 1963 no mu 1973, bituma aba umuntu wubashywe mu karere kubera ubunararibonye bwe mu kurinda Abatutsi ba Bisesero.\nUbwirwanaho bwa Bisesero.\nJenoside itangiye muri Mata 1994, Abatutsi ibihumbi bahungiye mu misozi ya Bisesero. Birara, wari ufite imyaka 68, yabaye umwe mu bayobozi b'ubwirwanaho. Yasabye abaturage kujya ku mpinga z'imisozi kugira ngo babone abateye kandi babatere amabuye, ashyiraho n'amatsinda y'abarwanyi bitwaje amacumu, amabuye n'inkoni. Ayo matsinda yari ashyizwe ahantu hatandukanye ku misozi, Birara akayahuza.\nYiciwe i Bisesero ku ya 25 Kamena 1994, ahitanywe n'igisasu cya gerenade. Abantu barenga 50 000 biciwe i Bisesero, abarokotse bakaba batageze ku 1 000.\nKwibukwa.\nKu ya 19 Ugushyingo 2021, Inama Njyanama y'umujyi wa Paris yemeje ku bwumvikane bwa bose ko ahantu hamwe mu karere ka 18 ka Paris hitirirwa Aminadabu Birara. \"Place Aminadabu-Birara\" yatashywe ku ya 13 Gicurasi 2022, iba ahantu ha cumi na hamwe mu Bufaransa hibukirwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23267", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23267", "title": "Kaminuza Yigenga y'Ibihugu by'Ibiyaga Bigari y'i Butembo", "text": "Kaminuza Yigenga y'Ibihugu by'Ibiyaga Bigari y'i Butembo (mu Igifaransa: \"Universit\u00e9 libre des pays des Grands Lacs de Butembo\", ULPGL-Butembo) ni kaminuza yigenga y'abaporotesitanti iri i Butembo, mu Intara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nYatangiye mu 2001 ari ishami rya ULPGL y'i Goma, iza guhabwa ubwigenge mu 2011. Ifite amashami atandatu.\nAmateka.\nULPGL ikomoka i Goma, aho mu 1985 hashinzwe Ishuri Rikuru rya Tewolojiya y'Abaporotesitanti (ISTP), ryashinzwe n'amatorero atandatu yo mu Itorero rya Kristo muri Kongo (ECC), nyuma riza kuba kaminuza.\nIshami ry'i Butembo ryafunguwe mu 2001, ritangirana na tewolojiya, hakurikiraho andi mashami hagati ya 2002 na 2016. Kuva mu 2007 rikorera mu gace ka Makomo. Ryahawe ubwigenge mu 2011, rikaba ikigo cyigenga cy'amashuri makuru cyemewe na Leta.\nAmashami.\nULPGL-Butembo ifite amashami atandatu:\nInshingano n'ubushakashatsi.\nInshingano yayo ni gutanga ubumenyi n'ubushakashatsi bufite ireme, ifatanyije n'abaturage bo hafi yayo, hagamijwe iterambere rusange. Intego yayo ni \"Foi, Science, Action\" (Ukwizera, Ubumenyi, Igikorwa).\nMu 2026, ishami ry'ubuhinzi ryagerageje, rifatanyije n'ishyirahamwe SYDIP, ubwoko bushya bw'ibirayi ku murima w'igerageza wa kaminuza."}
{"id": "23268", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23268", "title": "Christian Quesnot", "text": "Christian Quesnot (yavutse ku ya 24 Gicurasi 1938 i Vire) ni jenerali w'Umufaransa. Kuva mu 1991 kugeza mu 1995 yayoboye ibiro bya gisirikare bya Perezida w'Ubufaransa Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand, bituma agira uruhare rukomeye muri politiki ya gisirikare y'Ubufaransa mu Rwanda mbere no mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nYinjiye mu gisirikare mu 1960 mu ishami ry'ubwubatsi (\"G\u00e9nie\"), aba injeniyeri w'imihanda n'ibiraro. Yakoze cyane mu mutwe w'abasirikare b'abaparakomando b'ubwubatsi (17e RGP), ayobora ibikorwa bya gisirikare muri Cade (1979\u20131980) no mu murwa mukuru wa Libani, Beyrouth (1983\u20131984). Yabaye jenerali mu 1987, nyuma aba jenerali w'ingabo (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9ral d'arm\u00e9e\") mu 1995.\nUruhare mu Rwanda.\nKuva muri Mata 1991 kugeza muri Nzeri 1995, Quesnot yari umuyobozi w'ibiro bya gisirikare bya Perezida Mitterrand. Mbere ya jenoside, yafataga FPR-Inkotanyi nk'\u00abAbakhmer b'abirabura\u00bb bashaka gushinga \u00abTutsiland\u00bb kuva muri Ubugande kugeza mu Uburundi. Mu nyandiko yandikiye Perezida mu gihe cya jenoside, yasabye ko Ubufaransa bukomeza gushyigikira ubutegetsi bwariho mu Rwanda.\nMu 2008, raporo ya Komisiyo Mucyo yamushyize ku rutonde rw'abantu 33 b'Abafaransa bavugwaho kugira uruhare rukomeye muri jenoside. Yareze Minisitiri w'Ubutabera w'u Rwanda, Tharcisse Karugarama, icyaha cyo gusebanya, ariko icyo kirego nticyagira icyo kigeraho. Yareze kandi umunyamakuru Patrick de Saint-Exup\u00e9ry kubera igitabo \"Complices de l'inavouable\", maze mu 2014 urukiko ruhamya Saint-Exup\u00e9ry icyaha cyo gusebanya.\nNyuma y'igisirikare.\nMu 1995 yagizwe umuyobozi w'ikigo SISIE (\"Services Industries Strat\u00e9gies International et Environnement\"). Kugeza muri Mata 2008 yayoboraga ikinyamakuru \"D\u00e9fense nationale et s\u00e9curit\u00e9 collective\"."}
{"id": "23269", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23269", "title": "Charles Habonimana", "text": "Charles Habonimana (yavutse mu 1982) ni umwanditsi n'umuyobozi w'Umunyarwanda warokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. \nNi we wanditse igitabo cy'ubuhamya \"Moi, le dernier Tutsi\" (2019), kandi mu 2020 yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo \"Rwanda Airports Company\" gishinzwe ibibuga by'indege mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima.\nCharles Habonimana yavukiye i Mayunzwe, mu Akarere ka Ruhango (Intara y'Amajyepfo), mu muryango w'abahinzi w'abana icyenda. Jenoside itangira yari afite imyaka 12. Ababyeyi be, batandatu mu bavandimwe be n'abenshi mu muryango we barishwe; we na mushiki we Yvonne ni bo bonyine barokotse. Yarokotse kubera ko umuyobozi w'abicanyi bo mu gace yari yafashe icyemezo cyo kumugumisha ari muzima nk'\u00abUmututsi wa nyuma\u00bb, ngo azereke ab'igihe kizaza uko Abatutsi basaga.\nNyuma ya jenoside yakomeje amashuri, abona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri muri Kaminuza Yigenga ya Kigali (ULK) n'iy'icyiciro cya gatatu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nYakoze imirimo itandukanye y'ubuyobozi, harimo kuba umuyobozi w'abakozi mu kigo EUCL gishinzwe ingufu. Ku ya 25 Kamena 2020, Perezida Paul Kagame yamugize umuyobozi mukuru wa \"Rwanda Airports Company\".\nKwibuka.\nKuva mu 2012 kugeza mu 2016 yayoboye GAERG, umuryango w'abahoze ari abanyeshuri ba kaminuza barokotse jenoside, kandi akunze gutanga ubuhamya mu bihe bya Kwibuka.\nMu 2019 yasohoye, afatanyije na Daniel Le Scornet, igitabo \"Moi, le dernier Tutsi\" (Plon), kivuga ku iyicwa ry'umuryango we n'iry'Abatutsi bo mu cyaro cye. Cyamuritswe i Kigali muri Mata 2019, kandi cyagarutsweho n'itangazamakuru ndetse n'ubushakashatsi ku nkuru z'abana barokotse jenoside."}
{"id": "23270", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23270", "title": "Milgitha K\u00f6sser", "text": "Milgitha K\u00f6sser (1936 \u2013 Gashyantare 2016) yari umubikira w'Umudage wakoreye mu Rwanda, ayobora ivuriro rya Kaduha. Azwiho kuba yarabaye umutangabuhamya w'ubwicanyi bwabereye kuri paruwasi ya Kaduha mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, no kuba yarakusanyije inyandiko n'amafoto byabwo.\nUbuzima.\nMilgitha K\u00f6sser yabaga i Kaduha, muri Perefegitura ya Gikongoro (ubu ni mu Akarere ka Nyamagabe). Kuva mu 1973 yayoboraga ivuriro rya Kaduha, ryari hamwe na paruwasi, amashuri n'ibitaro byatashywe mu 1986.\nJenoside i Kaduha.\nMu gihe cya jenoside, yanze kuva ku ivuriro yari ashinzwe. Yiboneye ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi ku ya 21 Mata 1994 muri kiliziya, mu nyubako za paruwasi no hafi yazo. Mu rwibutso rwa Kaduha hashyinguwe imibiri y'abantu 47 311.\nKu ya 23 Kamena 1994, abana bari bahishwe mu ivuriro bavanywe yo n'umuryango \"Terre des hommes\", yari yaburiye ubwo yanyuraga mu Uburundi mbere yo gusubira mu Budage ku ya 26 Kamena 1994.\nInyandiko yakusanyije.\nNyuma ya jenoside, yakoze alubumu y'amafoto 193 yo kuva mu 1992 kugeza mu 1995, igaragaza ubwicanyi, isenywa ry'inyubako n'ihohoterwa ry'imibiri n'ahantu h'ubutagatifu. Umuhanga mu mateka H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Dumas yifashishije iyo alubumu mu bushakashatsi bwe kuri Kaduha. Ku ya 12 Gicurasi 2006, yakoze urutonde rw'abantu 103 barokokeye ku ivuriro, barimo abana 74."}
{"id": "23271", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23271", "title": "Thierry Prungnaud", "text": "Thierry Prungnaud (yavutse ku ya 5 Gicurasi 1956 i Poitiers) ni umujandarume w'Umufaransa wahoze mu mutwe w'intore wa GIGN. Yamenyekanye ku buhamya bwe ku ruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, aho yari mu \"Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\", ndetse no ku gitero cyo kubohora abari bafashwe bugwate mu ndege ya \"Air France\" i Marignane ku ya 26 Ukuboza 1994.\nMu Rwanda.\nMbere ya jenoside, Prungnaud yahuguye mu Rwanda umutwe w'Ingabo zirinda Umukuru w'Igihugu (GISGP), wari wubakiye ku miterere ya GIGN. Mu 1994 yari mu \"Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\".\nMu 2012 yasohoye, afatanyije n'umunyamakuru Laure de Vulpian, igitabo \"Silence turquoise\", ashinja ingabo z'Ubufaransa kuba zararetse abasivili b'Abatutsi bakicwa. Avuga ko yasuzuguye amabwiriza bityo agashobora kurokora Abatutsi amagana. Jenerali Jean-Claude Lafourcade, wayoboraga \"Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\", yahakanye ibyo avuga. Ubuhamya bwe nyuma bwashimangiwe n'undi musirikare w'Umufaransa, Guillaume Ancel.\nIgitero cya Marignane.\nKu ya 26 Ukuboza 1994, ku kibuga cy'indege cya Marignane hafi ya Marseille, yabaye umujandarume wa kabiri winjiye mu ndege ya \"Air France\" (urugendo 8969) yari yafashwe bugwate n'abarwanyi ba GIA. Yakomerekejwe n'amasasu arindwi n'igisasu cya gerenade, ariko abasha guhagarika batatu muri bane mu bari bafashe bugwate abantu, ararokoka. Muri filime \"L'Assaut\" (2011), uruhare rwe rwakinwe na Vincent Elbaz.\nImidari.\nYahawe imidari myinshi, irimo \"L\u00e9gion d'honneur\" (ku rwego rwa \"officier\", 2022), \"M\u00e9daille militaire\", \"Croix de la Valeur militaire\" n'Umudari w'Igihugu w'Amahoro w'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "23272", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23272", "title": "Paul Barril", "text": "Paul Barril (yavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1946 i Vinay) ni kapiteni w'Umufaransa wahoze mu ijandarumori, wungirije umuyobozi w'umutwe w'intore wa GIGN. Nyuma yashinze ibigo byigenga by'umutekano. Azwi cyane kubera impaka zishingiye ku ruhare rwe mu Rwanda mbere no mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1974 kugeza mu 1982 yari umwungirije wa Christian Prouteau mu buyobozi bwa GIGN; mu 1979 yoherejwe muri Arabiya Sawudite gufasha guhosha ifatwa ry'Umusigiti Mutagatifu wa Maka. Mu 1982 yafatanyije na Prouteau gushinga ishami rirwanya iterabwoba ryo mu biro bya Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand. Nyuma yo kuva mu gisirikare, yashinze ibigo by'umutekano \"Epsylon\" na \"SECRETS\", akorera ibihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika, harimo Kote Divuwari.\nUruhare mu Rwanda.\nBarril yivugaga ko yari umujyanama wa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana. Mu 1989 yitabajwe mu ivugurura ry'inzego z'iperereza z'u Rwanda, kandi yari hafi y'umugore wa Perezida, Agathe Habyarimana, n'abagize Akazu.\nNyuma y'ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida, Agathe Habyarimana yamuhaye akazi ko gukora iperereza kuri icyo gitero. Yabwiye itangazamakuru ko afite \u00abagasanduku k'umukara\u00bb k'indege, ndetse ashyigikira igitekerezo cy'uko FPR-Inkotanyi ari yo yagabye icyo gitero; nyuma, mu 2012, yahakanye ko yigeze agira ako gasanduku.\nKu ya 28 Gicurasi 1994, mu gihe cya jenoside, yasinyanye na Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Guverinoma y'agateganyo, Jean Kambanda, amasezerano yo gutanga intwaro n'amasasu no guhugura abasirikare. Ayo masezerano yabonetse mu isaka ryakozwe iwe n'umucamanza Marc Tr\u00e9vidic mu 2012. Ku ya 25 Kamena 2013, imiryango FIDH, LDH na Survie yamureze icyaha cy'ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside, maze ku ya 27 Kamena 2013 ubucamanza bw'i Paris butangiza iperereza. Iryo perereza ntiryageze ku rubanza."}
{"id": "23273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23273", "title": "Vincent Duclert", "text": "Vincent Duclert (yavutse ku ya 26 Gashyantare 1961 i Neuilly-sur-Seine) ni umuhanga mu mateka w'Umufaransa, umwarimu n'umugenzuzi mukuru w'uburezi. \nNi inzobere muri jenoside, cyane cyane jenoside yakorewe Abanyarumeniya na Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda, ndetse no mu kibazo cya Dreyfus. \nKuva mu 2019 kugeza mu 2021 yayoboye komisiyo y'abahanga mu mateka yashyizweho na Perezida w'Ubufaransa Emmanuel Macron ngo isesengure uruhare rw'Ubufaransa mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu mateka muri Kaminuza ya Paris 1 Panth\u00e9on-Sorbonne mu 2009, ku nyandiko ivuga ku ruhare rw'abahanga mu kibazo cya Dreyfus. Yigishije mu ishuri rikuru \"\u00c9cole des hautes \u00e9tudes en sciences sociales\" (EHESS), kandi kuva mu 2017 ayobora ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi Cespra. Mu 2013 yagizwe umugenzuzi mukuru w'uburezi bw'igihugu.\nYanditse ibitabo byinshi ku kibazo cya Dreyfus, kuri Jean Jaur\u00e8s no kuri jenoside yakorewe Abanyarumeniya. Mu 2016 yayoboye ubutumwa bwo kwiga ku bushakashatsi no ku myigishirize ya jenoside mu Bufaransa.\nKomisiyo ku Rwanda.\nKu ya 5 Mata 2019, Perezida Emmanuel Macron yamushyize ku buyobozi bwa komisiyo y'abahanga mu mateka ishinzwe gusesengura, hifashishijwe ububiko bw'inyandiko z'Ubufaransa, uruhare rw'Ubufaransa mu Rwanda hagati ya 1990 na 1994. Kuba abahanga nka St\u00e9phane Audoin-Rouzeau na H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Dumas batari muri iyo komisiyo byateje impaka.\nKu ya 26 Werurwe 2021, komisiyo yashyikirije Perezida raporo yayo, izwi nka \u00abRaporo Duclert\u00bb. Iyo raporo yemeza ko Ubufaransa bufite \u00abinshingano zikomeye kandi ziremereye\u00bb mu byabaye, ariko igahakana ko bwagize ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside. Duclert yavuze ko ubuyobozi bw'Ubufaransa butigeze bwumva neza uko ibintu byari bimeze, bwirengagiza imiburo ku ihezanguni ry'ubutegetsi bwa Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, kandi yamaganye igitekerezo cya \u00abjenoside ebyiri\u00bb."}
{"id": "23274", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23274", "title": "Jean Hatzfeld", "text": "Jean Hatzfeld (yavutse ku ya 14 Nzeri 1949 muri Madagasikari) ni umunyamakuru akaba n'umwanditsi w'Umufaransa. Yamenyekanye cyane ku nkuru z'intambara yanditse, cyane cyane ku ntambara yo muri Bosiniya, no ku ruhererekane rw'ibitabo by'ubuhamya ku Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, byanditswe ashingiye ku buhamya bw'abarokotse n'abicanyi bo mu misozi ya Nyamata.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nNi umwuzukuru w'umuhanga mu mateka ya kera witwa na we Jean Hatzfeld. Yakuriye i Chambon-sur-Lignon mu Bufaransa, umudugudu wamenyekanye kubera kwakira no guhisha Abayahudi ibihumbi mu gihe cy'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi.\nMu 1975 yatangiye gukorera ikinyamakuru \"Lib\u00e9ration\" nk'umunyamakuru w'imikino, nyuma aba umunyamakuru w'amakuru mpuzamahanga. Urugendo rwe rwa mbere i Beyrouth muri Libani rwatumye aba umunyamakuru w'intambara; mu myaka 22 yatangaje inkuru ku ntambara zo muri Afurika, mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati no muri Bosiniya.\nIbitabo ku Rwanda.\nYageze mu Rwanda nk'umunyamakuru nyuma gato ya jenoside, atangazwa no kubona uko itangazamakuru ryananiwe kumva guceceka kw'abarokotse. Yahisemo kumara igihe kinini i Nyamata, mu Bugesera, akorana n'Abatutsi barokotse.\nBimwe muri ibyo bitabo byahinduwe mu ndimi nyinshi, ndetse bikinwa no mu makinamico. \"Une saison de machettes\" yahawe ibihembo bya \"Femina essai\" na \"Joseph Kessel\" mu 2003, naho \"La Strat\u00e9gie des antilopes\" ihabwa \"Prix M\u00e9dicis\" mu 2007."}
{"id": "23275", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23275", "title": "Boniface Ngulinzira", "text": "Boniface Ngulinzira (12 Nyakanga 1950 \u2013 11 Mata 1994) yari umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwanda, umwe mu bashinze ishyaka MDR rivuguruye ritavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bwa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana. Nka Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga (1992\u20131993), yayoboye intumwa za Guverinoma mu mishyikirano y'amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha na FPR-Inkotanyi. Yiciwe i Nyanza ya Kicukiro ku ya 11 Mata 1994, mu ntangiriro za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUmwuga.\nNgulinzira yari umuhanga mu ndimi n'uburezi. Kuva mu 1974 yakoze mu Biro by'Uburezi (\"Bureau p\u00e9dagogique\"), aba umuyobozi wabyo mu 1984\u20131985, nyuma aba umuyobozi mukuru w'umuco muri Minisiteri y'Amashuri Makuru (1985\u20131989), n'umunyamabanga mukuru ushinzwe uburezi mu biro bya Perezida wa Repubulika (1989\u20131991). Mu 1991\u20131992 yayoboye inama y'ubuyobozi ya ORINFOR. Nyuma ya minisiteri, yabaye umwarimu w'indimi z'Afurika muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwa politiki.\nUbwo amashyaka menshi yemerwaga mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, yari mu bashinze MDR rivuguruye. Mu 1991 yirukanywe mu biro bya Perezida, nyuma yo kubazwa impamvu yinjiye mu ishyaka ritari MRND. Mu 1992 yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ububanyi n'Amahanga muri Guverinoma ihuriweho n'amashyaka, bityo ayobora intumwa za Leta mu mishyikirano ya Arusha.\nAbashyigikiye Habyarimana bamushinje \u00abkugurisha igihugu\u00bb kuri FPR; mu ijambo rye ry'urwango ryo ku Kabaya mu 1992, Le\u00f3n Mugesera yamwise \u00abinyenzi\u00bb. Muri Mata 1993, Minisitiri w'Intebe mushya Agathe Uwilingiyimana yamusabye kuguma kuri minisiteri, ariko arabyanga; amasezerano ya Arusha yashyizweho umukono muri Kanama 1993.\nUrupfu.\nKu ya 7 Mata 1994, nyuma y'ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida, Ngulinzira n'umuryango we bahungiye mu ishuri ETO Kicukiro, aho ingabo z'Ababiligi za MINUAR zari zikambitse. Ku ya 11 Mata 1994, izo ngabo zavuye kuri ETO, zisiga impunzi zigera ku 3 000 mu maboko y'Interahamwe n'abasirikare. Abo bantu, barimo Ngulinzira, bajyanywe i Nyanza ya Kicukiro baricwa. Umugore we n'abana be barokotse jenoside. Ashyinguye mu Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro.\nMu 2004, umuryango we n'abandi barokokeye kuri ETO bareze Leta y'Ububiligi. Mu 2018, Urukiko rw'Ubujurire rw'i Buruseli rwemeje ko icyemezo cyo kuva kuri ETO cyafashwe n'ubuyobozi bwa MINUAR, atari ubw'Ububiligi."}
{"id": "23276", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23276", "title": "Antoine Mugesera", "text": "Antoine Mugesera ni umushakashatsi akaba n'umwanditsi w'Umunyarwanda, inzobere mu mateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda. Yahoze ari perezida w'umuryango Ibuka uharanira inyungu z'abarokotse jenoside.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nAntoine Mugesera yavukiye kandi akurira mu Rwanda. Nyuma ya jenoside, yibanze ku bushakashatsi ku mateka y'u Rwanda, cyane cyane ku gihe cyabanjirije jenoside yo mu 1994. Ubushakashatsi bwe bwerekana amateka n'impamvu zatumye jenoside ishoboka, binyuze mu itotezwa ryakorewe Abatutsi kuva mu 1959.\nYayoboye umuryango Ibuka, kandi atanga ubuhamya ku butwari bwa Damas Gisimba, warokoreye abana n'abandi bantu benshi mu kigo cye cy'imfubyi i Nyamirambo mu gihe cya jenoside."}
{"id": "23277", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23277", "title": "Jean Varret", "text": "Jean Varret (yavutse mu 1935 i Paris) ni jenerali w'Umufaransa, wahoze ayobora ishami ry'ubufatanye mu bya gisirikare (\"Mission militaire de coop\u00e9ration\"). \nYarwanyije politiki ya Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand mu Rwanda mbere ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, ava mu gisirikare mu 1993. \nMu 2021, raporo ya komisiyo yayobowe na Vincent Duclert yemeje ko imiburo ye yari ifite ishingiro.\nUmwuga.\nAkomoka mu muryango w'abasirikare, yize mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya La Fl\u00e8che no muri Saint-Cyr. Mu myaka 40 y'umwuga we mu bakomando b'abaparakomando, yakoreye muri Aligeriya, Gabon, Santrafurika no muri Cade. Nyuma yayoboye \"Centre des hautes \u00e9tudes militaires\", maze Perezida Mitterrand amushyira ku buyobozi bw'ubufatanye mu bya gisirikare n'ibihugu by'Afurika.\nU Rwanda.\nNk'umuyobozi w'ubufatanye mu bya gisirikare, yaburiye ubutegetsi bw'i Paris ku ihezanguni ry'ubutegetsi bwa Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, ariko ntiyumvwa. Yavuye ku mirimo ye mu 1993, yanga kwikorera uruhare mu byemezo by'Ibiro bya Perezida ku Rwanda.\nMu 2021, raporo ya komisiyo ya Duclert yagaragaje ko imiburo ye yari ifite ishingiro; Varret yavuze ko iyo raporo \u00abituma havaho impaka z'ubusa zamaze imyaka 26\u00bb. Muri Gicurasi 2021, yaherekeje Perezida Emmanuel Macron mu Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali. Mu 2023 yasohoye, afatanyije n'umunyamakuru Laurent Larcher, igitabo \"Souviens-toi\" cy'ibyo yibuka."}
{"id": "23279", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23279", "title": "Kaminuza y'Abadivantisiti ya Lukanga", "text": "Kaminuza y'Abadivantisiti ya Lukanga (mu Gifaransa: \"Universit\u00e9 adventiste de Lukanga\", UNILUK) ni kaminuza yigenga y'Idini ry'Abadivantitsi b'umunsi wa Karindwi iri i Lukanga, hafi y'umujyi wa Butembo, mu Intara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yakomotse ku ishami rya Kaminuza ya Griggs ryafunguwe mu 1994, yemererwa gukora mu 1996, ihabwa uburenganzira budasubirwaho mu 2006.\nAmateka.\nInkomoko.\nIkigo cy'Abadivantisiti cya Lukanga cyashinzwe mu 1965. Mu 1975 cyemewe nk'ishuri ryisumbuye n'iry'amashuri makuru ritanga impamyabumenyi mu burezi, hamwe n'amasomo abiri ya tewolojiya. Mu 1990 hiyongeraho ikigo cy'imyuga.\nIshami rya Kaminuza ya Griggs (1994\u20131996).\nMu 1994, Kaminuza y'Abadivantisiti yo muri Afurika yo Hagati (AUCA) yari i Mudende mu Rwanda yarafunze kubera Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Abanyeshuri ba tewolojiya bari mu mwaka wa nyuma bakiriwe i Lukanga. Mu Ukwakira 1994, Kaminuza ya Griggs (yigishaga ku iyakure) yafunguye i Lukanga ishami rya tewolojiya, rifite abanyeshuri bagera kuri mirongo ine, riyobowe na Kasay Bisogho Laurent.\nIshingwa rya kaminuza (1995\u20131996).\nIgitekerezo cyo gushinga kaminuza i Lukanga cyaganiriweho i Douala ku wa 6 Kamena 1995, no muri Abidjan ku wa 14 Ugushyingo 1995. Iteka ryo ku wa 22 Gashyantare 1996 ryayemereye gukora. Umwaka wa mbere w'amashuri watangiye ku wa 15 Ukwakira 1996, ufite abanyeshuri bagera ku 100, mu mashami arimo tewolojiya, ubukungu n'indimi. Umuyobozi wayo wa mbere yari Jose Dial.\nImyaka y'intambara (1997\u20132003).\nKaminuza yakomeje gukora mu gihe cy'intambara ya AFDL n'iy'inyeshyamba zakurikiyeho. Yigeze kwitwa \"Adventist Wallace University\", mu rwego rwo kwibuka Elton Wallace. Abanyeshuri ba mbere bahawe impamyabumenyi muri Gicurasi 1998. Ikigo cyagabweho igitero n'aba Ma\u00ef-Ma\u00ef ku wa 18 Werurwe 2001, kandi mu 2003 hashyizweho agace katarangwamo intambara karinzwe na MONUC.\nIterambere (2002\u20132022).\nMu mpera za 2002, kaminuza yashyizwe munsi ya Diviziyo y'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'iyo Hagati y'Itorero. Ivuriro (\"polyclinique\") ryafunguwe ku wa 27 Gicurasi 2007. Guhera mu 2008, amashami yose yageze ku rwego rwa \"licence\". Mu 2010, abanyeshuri bo mu mashami yafunzwe i Lubumbashi, Kinshasa na Kananga bimuriwe i Lukanga. Ishuri ry'ubuvuzi (\"techniques m\u00e9dicales\") ryemerewe gukora ku wa 29 Kanama 2021.\nUburenganzira bwo gukora.\nIteka rya Perezida ryayihaye uburenganzira budasubirwaho ryasinywe ku wa 12 Kamena 2006 (n\u00b0 06/0106). Ku rwego rw'itorero, yemewe n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Abadivantisiti rishinzwe kwemeza amashuri (AAA) ku wa 7 Mata 2005.\nAmasomo.\nKaminuza itanga amasomo ku rwego rwa \"licence\" na \"master\", mu by'ubuzima rusange, ubuforomo, uburezi n'imitekerereze, tewolojiya, ubuhinzi, ikoranabuhanga, ubukungu n'imari, n'imirire. Ifitanye isano na ISTM Lukanga na ISTA Lukanga."}
{"id": "23280", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23280", "title": "Kaminuza ya Leta ya Semuliki", "text": "Kaminuza ya Leta ya Semuliki (mu gifaransa: \"Universit\u00e9 officielle de Semuliki\", mu magambo ahinnye UOS) ni ishuri rikuru rya Leta riherereye mu mujyi wa Beni, mu Intara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2004, ikaba ari yo kaminuza ya Leta yonyine mu karere ka Beni.\nAmateka.\nKaminuza ya Leta ya Semuliki yashinzwe mu 2004. Ikora ishingiye ku iteka rya Minisitiri n\u00b0102/MINESU/CAB.MIN/MML/KOB/2011 ryo ku wa 21 Mata 2011. Yashyizweho kugira ngo ihaze icyifuzo cy\u2019urubyiruko rw\u2019umujyi n\u2019akarere ka Beni cyo kubona amashuri makuru ya Leta hafi yarwo, mu karere gakunze kurangwa n\u2019umutekano muke n\u2019ubwigunge. Ifatwa nk\u2019iyo kaminuza ya Leta yonyine mu karere ka Beni.\nImiterere n\u2019amasomo.\nKuva hakoreshwa gahunda ya LMD (\"Licence-Master-Doctorat\"), amashami (\"facult\u00e9s\") ya kaminuza asigaye yitwa \"domaines\", naho amashami mato (\"d\u00e9partements\") akitwa \"fili\u00e8res\".\nMu 2021, kaminuza yari ifite amashami umunani: amategeko, ubukungu, ubuhinzi, ubuvuzi, farumasi, itumanaho, ubuhanga bwa mudasobwa, n\u2019ubumenyi mbonezamubano, politiki n\u2019ubutegetsi. Itanga amasomo mu by\u2019amategeko, ubumenyi bwa politiki n\u2019ubutegetsi, imibanire mpuzamahanga, itangazamakuru n\u2019itumanaho, ubuhanga bw\u2019ubwubatsi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga (\"polytechnique\"), ubuhinzi, ubukungu n\u2019icungamutungo.\nUbuyobozi.\nKaminuza iyoborwa na komite y\u2019ubuyobozi igizwe n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru (\"recteur\"), umunyamabanga mukuru ushinzwe amasomo, umunyamabanga mukuru ushinzwe ubutegetsi n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe ingengo y\u2019imari. Mu Gashyantare 2021, komite y\u2019ubuyobozi yari iyobowe na \"recteur\" Jos\u00e9 Wambale Mulwahili. Nyuma yaho, Porofeseri Jean-Baptiste Paluku Ndavaro, inzobere mu by\u2019itangazamakuru n\u2019itumanaho, yavuzwe nk\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wayo.\nImbogamizi.\nKaminuza ikorera mu karere kugarijwe n\u2019umutekano muke. Mu 2018, itangira ry\u2019umwaka w\u2019amashuri i Beni ryatinze ukwezi kose kubera ibitero by\u2019umutwe witwaje intwaro wa ADF; amasomo yongeye gutangira ku wa 19 Ugushyingo mu byumba by\u2019amashuri bya UOS.\nMuri Gashyantare 2021, mu gihe cy\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19, abakozi ba kaminuza (abarimu, abakozi bo mu butegetsi, abatekinisiye n\u2019abakozi basanzwe) bakoze imyigaragambyo bashinja komite y\u2019ubuyobozi kunyereza umutungo, ibyo ibiro by\u2019umuyobozi mukuru byahakanaga. Ku wa 22 Werurwe 2021, habaye umwuka mubi hagati y\u2019abanyeshuri n\u2019ubuyobozi ubwo amasomo yasubukurwaga, imbere y\u2019intumwa z\u2019inama y\u2019ubutegetsi ya za kaminuza (CAU).\nUmwaka w\u2019amashuri wa 2024\u20132025 watangijwe ku mugaragaro, itangira ryawo ryemezwa n\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru ushinzwe amasomo."}
{"id": "23281", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23281", "title": "Mburugu", "text": "Mburugu ni indwara yandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina iterwa na bagiteri \"ya Treponema pallidum\" subspecies \"pallidum\". Birashoboka ko nta bimenyetso bihari. Bitabaye ibyo, biratandukanye bitewe n'icyiciro muri bine kirimo (icy'ibanze, icya kabiri, icyahishe, n'icya gatatu). \nIcyiciro cya mbere gikunze kugaragaramo chancre imwe (igisebe cyo ku ruhu gikomeye, kidatera ububabare, kandi kidatera gushyuha akenshi kiri hagati ya santimetero imwe cyangwa ebyiri (1\u00a0cm) na 2\u00a0cm) mu murambararo nubwo hashobora kuba hari ibisebe byinshi. Muri Mburugu ya kabiri, habaho uduheri twinshi, akenshi dufata ibiganza n'ibirenge. Hashobora kandi kuba hari ibisebe mu kanwa cyangwa mu gitsina. Mu ndwara ya syphilis igaragara mu gihe cy'imyaka myinshi, ibimenyetso byayo ni bike cyangwa ntibigaragare na gato. Muri Mburugu yo mu cyiciro cya gatatu, hari ishinya (ibibyimba byoroshye bitari kanseri), ibibazo by'imitsi, cyangwa ibimenyetso by'umutima. Sirifi izwi nka \" umuyigana ukomeye \" kuko ishobora gutera ibimenyetso bisa n'ibindi ndwara byinshi.\nIndwara ya syphilis ikunze gukwirakwira binyuze mu mibonano mpuzabitsina. Ishobora kandi kwanduzwa n'umubyeyi ku mwana mu gihe atwite cyangwa avutse, bigatera syphilis kuvukana. Izindi ndwara ziterwa na bagiteri \"ya Treponema\" zirimo yaws (ubwoko \"busanzwe\"), pinta (ubwoko busanzwe \"bwa carateum\"), na syphilis idakomoka ku gitsina (ubwoko busanzwe \"bwa endemicum\"). Izi ndwara eshatu ntabwo akenshi zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina. Ubusanzwe isuzuma rikorwa hakoreshejwe ibizamini by'amaraso; bagiteri zishobora no kumenyekana hakoreshejwe mikorosikopi y'umurima w'umwijima. Ikigo gishinzwe kurwanya no gukumira indwara (Amerika) gisaba abagore bose batwite kwipimisha.\nIngaruka zo kwandura syphilis mu mibonano mpuzabitsina zishobora kugabanuka hakoreshejwe agakingirizo ka latex cyangwa polyurethane. Mburugu ishobora kuvurwa neza hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko. Antibiyotike ikunzwe cyane mu manza nyinshi ni benzathine benzylpenicillin iterwa mu mitsi. Ku bantu bafite allergie ikomeye ya penisiline, doxycycline cyangwa tetracycline bashobora gukoreshwa. Ku bantu bafite neurosyphilis, benzylpenicillin cyangwa ceftriaxone ni byo byiza. Mu gihe cyo kuvurwa, abantu bashobora kugira umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, no kubabara imitsi, ibyo bikaba ari ingaruka izwi nka Jarisch-Herxheimer.\nMu 2022, abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 8 banduye sirupe ku bantu bakuru bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 49 ku isi yose. Mu myaka 20 ishize hagaragaye ukwiyongera gukomeye kw'abandura ku isi. Mu 2015, hafi 45.4\u00a0abantu miliyoni banduye syphilis, hamwe n\u2019abanduye miliyoni esheshatu. Mu mwaka wa 2015, byateje impfu zigera ku 107.000, zigabanuka ugereranyije n\u2019izari 202.000 mu 1990. \nNyuma yo kugabanuka cyane bitewe n\u2019uko penisiline yabonekaga mu myaka ya 1940, igipimo cy\u2019ubwandu cyariyongereye kuva mu ntangiriro z\u2019ikinyejana mu bihugu byinshi, akenshi kikajyana na virusi itera SIDA. Ibi bikekwa ko biterwa n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019ubusambanyi, uburaya, igabanuka ry\u2019ikoreshwa ry\u2019udukingirizo, n\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina idahwitse mu bagabo bakorana imibonano mpuzabitsina n\u2019abagabo."}
{"id": "23282", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23282", "title": "Indwara y'Impiswi", "text": "impiswi ni indwara ikunze kwandura iterwa n'itsinda rya virusi. Ubusanzwe bitangirana n'umuriro no kumva utameze neza muri rusange. Ibi bikurikirwa n'umunsi umwe cyangwa ibiri nyuma y'aho habayeho utudomo cyangwa utubyimba dushobora kugaragara ku biganza, ku birenge no ku kanwa ndetse rimwe na rimwe n'amaguru, ku matako no mu nda. Ibimenyetso bikunze kugaragara nyuma y'iminsi 2-6 umuntu yanduye iyi virusi. Ubusanzwe ibibyimba bihita byisubiraho ubwabyo mu gihe cy'icyumweru kimwe. Kubura inzara n'ibinono by'urutoki bishobora kubaho nyuma y'ibyumweru bike, ariko bizasubira gukura uko igihe kigenda gihita.\nVirusi zandura binyuze mu gukoranaho n'umuntu ku giti cye, binyuze mu mwuka uturuka mu gukorora no mu mwanda w'umuntu wanduye. Ibintu byanduye nabyo bishobora gukwirakwiza indwara. Virusi ya Coxsackie A16 ni yo ikunze kugaragara cyane, naho virusi ya enterovirus 71 ikaba ari yo ikunze kugaragara cyane. Izindi ndwara za coxsackievirus na enterovirus na zo zishobora kuba ari zo zitera. Hari abantu bashobora kwanduzanya virusi nubwo nta bimenyetso by'indwara bafite. Izindi nyamaswa ntizirimo. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishobora gukorwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso. Rimwe na rimwe, ikizamini cyo mu muhogo cyangwa mu ntebe gishobora gupimwa virusi.\nGukaraba intoki bishobora gukumira ikwirakwira ry\u2019iyi ndwara, kandi abanduye ntibagomba kujya ku kazi, ku irerero cyangwa ku ishuri. Nta miti cyangwa urukingo birwanya virusi bihari, ariko hari ingamba zo guteza imbere iyi ndwara. Inshuro nyinshi nta buvuzi bwihariye busaba. Imiti yoroshye y'ububabare nka ibuprofen cyangwa gel yo kuvura indwara zo mu kanwa ishobora gukoreshwa. Rimwe na rimwe, abana badashobora kunywa bihagije bahabwa amazi yo mu mitsi. Ni gake cyane, meningite cyangwa encephalitis ishobora gutuma indwara irushaho kuba mbi.\nHFMD ibaho mu bice byose by'isi. Ikunze kugaragara mu ndwara nto zifata abana bato mu mashuri y'incuke cyangwa mu mashuri y'incuke. Icyorezo gikomeye cyatangiye kugaragara muri Aziya kuva mu 1997. Akenshi bibaho mu mezi y'impeshyi, icyi n'impeshyi. Ubusanzwe bibaho mu bana bari munsi y'imyaka itanu, ariko rimwe na rimwe bishobora kubaho no mu bantu bakuru. HFMD ntigomba kwitiranywa n'indwara y'uburenge (izwi kandi nka indwara y'ibirenge), yibasira cyane amatungo."}
{"id": "23284", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23284", "title": "Damas Gisimba", "text": "Damas Gisimba Mutezintare (15 Ukwakira 1961 \u2013 4 Kamena 2023) yari Umunyarwanda wayoboraga ikigo cy'imfubyi cya Gisimba i Nyamirambo, mu mujyi wa Kigali. Mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, yahishe kandi arokora abantu bagera kuri 400, abenshi muri bo bakaba bari abana. Yahawe ibihembo bitandukanye, birimo Umudari w'Umurinzi.\nUbuzima.\nDamas Gisimba yavukiye i Goma, muri Zayire (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo), akaba imfura mu muryango we. Se, Pierre-Chrysologue Gisimba, yari yarahunze u Rwanda nyuma yo kwamagana ku mugaragaro ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi mu 1959; umuryango wamaze imyaka igera kuri 20 mu buhungiro.\nAbabyeyi be, Peter na Dancilla Gisimba, bashinze ikigo cy'imfubyi i Nyamirambo mu 1980, gitangirana n'abana 18. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa se mu 1986, Damas yabaye umuyobozi w'icyo kigo.\nUruhare muri Jenoside.\nJenoside itangiye muri Mata 1994, Gisimba yacumbikiye mu kigo abantu bahigwaga, abahisha no mu gisenge cy'inzu, kandi yanga ko Interahamwe zibageraho. Igihe abicanyi bagabaga igitero, umumisiyoneri w'Umunyamerika Carl Wilkens yaraje arabafasha, maze abari bahahungiye bimurirwa ahatekanye. Abo Gisimba yarokoye barimo abana basaga 300 n'abantu bakuru bagera kuri 80.\nNyuma ya Jenoside.\nIkigo cyakomeje kwakira imfubyi kugeza ubwo Leta itegetse ko gifungwa mu 2012; cyahindutse urwibutso n'ikigo gifasha abana mu masomo (\"Gisimba Memorial Centre\"). Mu 2018, umufotozi w'Umunyamerika Brandon Stanton yakusanyije amafaranga yo kubaka ibigo bya Gisimba mu Rwanda no muri Ubugande.\nUrupfu.\nDamas Gisimba yapfuye ku wa 4 Kamena 2023 mu bitaro bya Nyarugenge i Kigali, afite imyaka 61. Yashyinguwe ku wa 10 Kamena 2023 mu irimbi rya Rusororo, nyuma ya misa yabereye muri paruwasi ya Mutagatifu Karoli Lwanga i Nyamirambo."}
{"id": "23288", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23288", "title": "C\u00e9lestin Hakizimana", "text": "C\u00e9lestin Hakizimana (wavutse ku wa 14 Kanama 1963) ni umupadiri w'Umunyarwanda wa Kiliziya Gatolika, wagizwe Umwepiskopi wa Diyosezi Gatolika ya Gikongoro mu 2014. Mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, yari umuyobozi w'ikigo cya Saint-Paul i Kigali, aho yafashije kurokora Abatutsi bagera ku 2 000 bari bahahungiye.\nUbuzima n'amashuri.\nC\u00e9lestin Hakizimana yavukiye muri paruwasi ya Saint Famille i Kigali, ku wa 14 Kanama 1963. Yize amashuri yisumbuye mu iseminari nto ya Mutagatifu Visenti i Rulindo (1977\u20131983) n'i Ndera (1983\u20131984), hanyuma yiga filozofiya na tewolojiya mu Iseminari Nkuru ya Nyakibanda i Butare. Yahawe ubupadiri ku wa 21 Nyakanga 1991. Kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2010, yakoze amasomo y'ikirenga i Napoli mu Ubutaliyani, abona impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (dogitora) muri tewolojiya.\nImirimo.\nNyuma yo guhabwa ubupadiri, yabaye padiri wungirije i Rutongo (1991\u20131992), ahagararira uburezi gatolika muri diyosezi (1992\u20131994), hanyuma ayobora ikigo cy'igihugu cya Saint-Paul i Kigali (1994\u20131996). Kuva mu 1998 kugeza mu 2003 yayoboye umuryango GEMECA-Rwanda, naho kuva mu 2011 aba Umunyamabanga Mukuru w'Inama y'Abepiskopi Gatolika mu Rwanda.\nKu wa 26 Ugushyingo 2014, Papa Fransisiko yamugize Umwepiskopi wa Gikongoro; yahawe ubwepiskopi ku wa 24 Mutarama 2015, kuri sitade ya Nyagisenyi i Gikongoro. Kuva ku wa 16 Werurwe 2018 kugeza ku wa 25 Werurwe 2021, yanayoboye by'agateganyo Diyosezi ya Cyangugu nk'umuyobozi wa Kitumwa.\nUruhare muri Jenoside.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside, Padiri Hakizimana yari ku kigo cya Saint-Paul i Kigali, aho Abatutsi bagera ku 2 000 bahungiye mu gihe cy'amezi arenga abiri. Yabahaye ibyo kurya n'amazi, ahagarara ku irembo yambaye ikanzu kugira ngo yamagane Interahamwe, kandi ahisha urutonde rw'impunzi, aha abicanyi urutonde rw'amazina y'impimbano. Yahaga Interahamwe amafaranga, ibyo kurya n'ibyo kunywa ngo zidakora ubwicanyi, nyamara zagarukaga kenshi zigatwara abantu bagera kuri 20 zikajya kubicira ahandi. Abari basigaye barokowe n'ingabo za FPR-Inkotanyi.\nYashimiwe ibikorwa bye, ahabwa umudari, inka icumi n'izindi mpano."}
{"id": "23289", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23289", "title": "Joseph Niyomugabo", "text": "Joseph Niyomugabo (1941 \u2013 Mata 1994) yari umupadiri w'Umunyarwanda wa Kiliziya Gatolika, wayoboraga paruwasi ya Cyanika (Gikongoro). Mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, yanze gutererana Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri paruwasi ye, maze yicwa n'abicanyi.\nUbuzima.\nJoseph Niyomugabo yavukiye muri komini Muko, i Gikongoro, mu 1941. Yize mu iseminari nto ya Kabgayi guhera mu 1956, hanyuma mu Iseminari Nkuru ya Nyakibanda; yize filozofiya i Roma na tewolojiya mu Ububiligi, aba umupadiri ku wa 28 Nyakanga 1968 i Orval, mu Bubiligi.\nMu 1973, kubera ihohoterwa ryakorerwaga Abatutsi, yahungiye i Bujumbura mu Uburundi hamwe n'abanyeshuri yigishaga, agumana na bo kugeza mu 1976. Nyuma yaho yize i Paris muri Kaminuza ya Sorbonne (1976\u20131979). Yigishije kandi ayobora iseminari nto ya Kansi, akora muri paruwasi ya Gisagara, hanyuma muri Nzeri 1985 aba padiri mukuru wa paruwasi ya Cyanika.\nUruhare muri Jenoside.\nMbere ya Jenoside, Padiri Niyomugabo yari azwi nk'umubwiriza wamaganaga ivangura ryakorerwaga Abatutsi, bigatuma abategetsi b'aho bamwanga. Muri Mata 1994, ubwo abandi bapadiri bahungiraga i Butare, we yanze gutererana impunzi z'Abatutsi zari zahungiye kuri paruwasi ya Cyanika, nubwo bagenzi be bamusabaga kugenda. Yaziteyeho ibyo kurya, amazi n'aho kuba.\nUrupfu.\nNyuma y'ubwicanyi bwabereye i Cyanika ku wa 21 Mata 1994, yihishe mu bubiko bw'imiti bw'ikigo nderabuzima. Ku wa 24 Mata 1994 yarafashwe, arakorerwa iyicarubozo maze aricwa. Ikinyamakuru \"The New Times\" cyo kivuga ko yishwe ku wa 21 Mata 1994. Nyina, abavandimwe be n'abandi bo mu muryango we na bo bishwe muri Jenoside.\nImibiri ye yabonetse muri Mutarama 1995, maze ishyingurwa mu cyubahiro mu rwibutso rwa Cyanika ku wa 26 Gashyantare 2012.\nKwibuka.\nMuri Mata 2012, umuryango African Rights washyize ahagaragara raporo imwibuka ishingiye ku buhamya bw'abarokotse. Abarokotse basabye ko ubutwari bwe bwamenyekana na Kiliziya Gatolika, u Rwanda n'amahanga."}
{"id": "23290", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23290", "title": "Pentobarbital", "text": "Pentobarbital ni umuti wakoreshejwe mu kuvura indwara y'igicuri, gushyuha gukabije, kuvura ibibazo byo gusinzira by'igihe gito, kubaga, no gutera umuntu muri koma. Ikoreshwa mu gutera imitsi cyangwa imitsi. Uburyo bwo kuvura hakoreshejwe umunwa bwarahagaritswe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Itangira mu munota umwe iyo ishyizwe mu mitsi, mu minota 25 iyo igeze mu mitsi. Iyo ishyizwe mu mitsi ingaruka zimara iminota 15.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, kuruka, no kuribwa umutwe. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zirimo kurota mu mutwe, gukoresha nabi, guhagarika guhumeka, no kubura umwuka. Gukoresha ntabwo byemewe mu gihe utwite. Iri mu muryango w'imiti ya barbiturate. Ikora binyuze mu kongera imikorere ya GABA mu bwonko.\nPentobarbital yatangiye gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1930 na John Lundy. Zakoreshejwe nabi cyane mu myaka ya 1970 kandi zizwi nka \"amakoti y'umuhondo\" bitewe n'ibara ryazo. Ikoreshwa mu kwica inyamaswa mu buryo bw\u2019uburozi ndetse no muri leta zimwe na zimwe zo muri Amerika mu kwica abanyabyaha. Urupfu rwa Marilyn Monroe mu 1962 rwatewe no kunywa pentobarbital na chloral hydrate birenze urugero. "}
{"id": "23291", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23291", "title": "Icyorezo cy'umusonga", "text": "Indwara y'ibihaha ni indwara ikomeye iterwa n'agakoko kitwa \"Yersinia pestis\". Ibimenyetso birimo umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, guhumeka nabi, kubabara mu gatuza no gukorora. Ubusanzwe bitangira nyuma y'iminsi itatu kugeza kuri irindwi nyuma yo kugaragara. Ni bumwe mu bwoko butatu bw'indwara y'ibicurane, ubundi bubiri bukaba indwara y'ibicurane n'indwara y'ibicurane.\nUbwoko bw'indwara y'ibihaha bushobora kubaho nyuma y'ubwandu bwa mbere bw'indwara y'ibihaha cyangwa sepsis. Bishobora kandi guterwa no guhumeka ibitonyanga by\u2019umwuka biturutse ku wundi muntu cyangwa injangwe yanduye indwara y\u2019ibihaha. Itandukaniro riri hagati y\u2019ubwoko bw\u2019indwara ya plague ni aho yanduriye; mu ndwara ya plague y\u2019ibihaha, indwara iba mu bihaha, mu ndwara ya plague y\u2019ibihaha, no mu ndwara ya septicemic iri mu maraso. Gupima ni ugupima amaraso, amatembabuzi, cyangwa amazi yo mu gace k'imitsi.\nNubwo inkingo zirimo gukorwa, mu bihugu byinshi ntabwo ziraboneka ku isoko. Kwirinda ni ukwirinda gukora ku mbeba zanduye, abantu, cyangwa injangwe. Birasabwa ko abanduye bashyirwa mu kato ku bandi. Icyorezo cy'ibihaha kivura hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko.\nIcyorezo cya Denda kigaragara mu mbeba muri Afurika, Amerika na Aziya. Icyorezo cy'umusonga ni kibi cyane kandi ntigikunze kugaragara nk'icyorezo cy'umusonga. Umubare wose w\u2019abantu banduye ubwoko bwose bw\u2019indwara y\u2019icyorezo mu 2013 wari 783. Iyo icyorezo cy\u2019ibihaha kidavuwe, hafi ya buri gihe kiba cyica. Bamwe bakeka ko indwara y\u2019ibihaha ya diyabete ari yo ahanini yateye indwara y\u2019umwijima yahitanye abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 50 mu myaka ya 1300. "}
{"id": "23292", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23292", "title": "Indwara yo kudakora neza mu mutwe", "text": "Indwara yo kudakora neza kw'ibitekerezo (ADHD) ni indwara yo mu mutwe yo mu bwoko bw'imikurire y'ubwonko. Irangwa no kugorwa no kwita ku bintu, gukora ibintu byinshi cyane, no gukora utitaye ku ngaruka zishobora guterwa n\u2019imyaka y\u2019umuntu. Bamwe mu bantu bafite ADHD nabo bagaragaza ingorane zo kugenzura amarangamutima cyangwa ibibazo bijyanye n'imikorere y'ubuyobozi. Kugira ngo umuntu amenye ibimenyetso, ibimenyetso bigomba kugaragara mbere y'uko ageza ku myaka cumi n'ibiri, bikamara amezi arenga atandatu, kandi bigatera ibibazo nibura ahantu habiri (nk'ishuri, mu rugo, cyangwa mu myidagaduro). Ku bana, ibibazo byo kwita ku bana bishobora gutuma badatsinda neza mu ishuri. Byongeye kandi, hari isano iri hagati y\u2019izindi ndwara zo mu mutwe n\u2019ikoreshwa nabi ry\u2019ibiyobyabwenge. Nubwo bitera ubumuga, cyane cyane muri sosiyete ya none, abantu benshi bafite ADHD bashobora gukomeza kwita ku mirimo babona ko ishimishije cyangwa ifite akamaro (izwi nka hyperfocus).\nNubwo ari indwara yo mu mutwe ikunze kwigwaho cyane mu bana n'ingimbi n'abangavu, impamvu nyayo ntabwo izwi mu bihe byinshi. Ibintu bigize imiterere y\u2019umubiri (genetic factors) bivugwa ko bigize hafi 75% by\u2019ibyago. Kwibasirwa na nikotine mu gihe utwite bishobora guteza akaga ku bidukikije. Bisa nkaho bitajyanye n'uburyo bwo kurera cyangwa guhana. Igira ingaruka ku bana bagera kuri 5\u20137% iyo bapimwe hakoreshejwe ibipimo bya DSM-IV na 1\u20132% iyo bapimwe hakoreshejwe ibipimo bya ICD-10. Kugeza mu 2015, byagaragaye ko byagize ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni 51.1 ku isi yose. Igipimo kirasa hagati y\u2019ibihugu kandi ahanini giterwa n\u2019uburyo cyasuzumwe. ADHD ikunze kugaragara ku bahungu inshuro ebyiri kurusha ku bakobwa, nubwo akenshi iyo ndwara ifatwa nk'aho idakunze kwirengagizwa ku bakobwa kuko ibimenyetso byayo bitandukanye n'iby'abahungu. Abantu bagera kuri 30\u201350% basanzwe barwaye indwara mu bwana bakomeza kugira ibimenyetso kugeza bakuze, naho hagati ya 2\u20135% by'abantu bakuru bakagira iyo ndwara. Ku bantu bakuru, umuntu ashobora kubura umutuzo mu mutima aho kugira umuvuduko mwinshi. Akenshi bakuramo ubuhanga bwo guhangana n'ibibazo, ibyo bikaba bibafasha mu bibazo bimwe cyangwa byose bafite. Iyi ndwara ishobora kugorana kuyitandukanya n'izindi ndwara, ndetse no kuyitandukanya n'ibikorwa byinshi bikiri mu rugero rw'imyitwarire isanzwe.\nInama ku bijyanye no gucunga ADHD ziratandukanye bitewe n'ibihugu kandi akenshi zikubiyemo uburyo bumwe na bumwe bwo kubagira inama, guhindura imibereho, n'imiti. Amabwiriza y\u2019Ubwongereza atanga inama gusa ku miti nk\u2019uburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura abana bafite ibimenyetso bikomeye, kandi ko imiti igomba kwitabwaho ku bafite ibimenyetso biri hagati banze cyangwa bananirwa kunoza iyo bahawe inama, nubwo ku bantu bakuru imiti ari uburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura. Amabwiriza ya Kanada na Amerika atanga inama ku bijyanye no gucunga imyitwarire ku bana bari mu kigero cy'incuke mu gihe imiti n'ubuvuzi bw'imyitwarire hamwe nabyo bigirwa inama nyuma y'ibyo. Kuvura hakoreshejwe imiti itera imbaraga bigira akamaro nibura ku myaka 14\u00a0amezi; icyakora, ingaruka z'igihe kirekire ntizisobanutse neza kandi hari ingaruka zishobora kubaho.\nIbitabo by'ubuvuzi byagaragaje ibimenyetso bisa n'ibya ADHD kuva mu kinyejana cya 18. ADHD, uburyo ipimwa, n'uburyo ivurwa byafashwe nk'ibitavugwaho rumwe kuva mu myaka ya 1970. Ibiganiro byagiye bireba abaganga, abarimu, abashyiraho amategeko, ababyeyi, n'itangazamakuru. Ingingo zirimo impamvu za ADHD n'ikoreshwa ry'imiti itera imbaraga mu kuvura. Abatanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi benshi bemera ko ADHD ari indwara nyayo mu bana no mu bantu bakuru, kandi impaka mu muryango w\u2019abahanga zishingiye ahanini ku buryo ipimwa n\u2019uburyo ivurwa. Iyi ndwara izwi nka ADD kuva mu 1980 kugeza mu 1987, mu gihe mbere yaho izwi nka hyperkinetic reaction of childhood."}
{"id": "23293", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23293", "title": "Indwara ya Ehlers-Danlos", "text": "Indwara za Ehlers-Danlos (EDS) ni itsinda ry'indwara zidasanzwe ziterwa n'uturemangingo. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo ingingo zifunguye, ububabare bw'ingingo, uruhu rusa neza, n'inkovu zidasanzwe. Ibi bishobora kugaragara mu gihe cyo kuvuka cyangwa mu bwana. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo gucika kw'imitsi ifunganye, gucika kw'ingingo, gucika kw'imitsi ifunganye, ububabare budakira, cyangwa osteoarthritis ikiri kare.\nEDS iterwa n'ihindagurika ry'uturemangingo turenga 19 dutandukanye tubaho igihe umuntu avuka. Ingirabuzimafatizo runaka yagizweho ingaruka niyo igena ubwoko bwa EDS. Hari ubwo indwara zimwe na zimwe zituruka ku guhinduka gushya kugaragara mu gihe cy'ivuka rya mbere, mu gihe izindi zivuka mu buryo busanzwe cyangwa busanzwe. Ubusanzwe, izi mpinduka zitera inenge mu miterere cyangwa mu gutunganya poroteyine ya kolajeni. Isuzuma rikunze gushingira ku bimenyetso kandi ryemezwa n'ibizamini bya genetiki cyangwa biopsy y'uruhu. Ariko, mu ntangiriro abantu bashobora gufatwa nabi mu ndwara ya hypochondriase, kwiheba, cyangwa indwara y'umunaniro udashira.\nNta muti uzwi uhari. Ubuvuzi bufasha mu buryo busanzwe. Ubuvuzi bw'umubiri kandi gutera inkunga ingingo bishobora gufasha gukomeza imitsi no gushyigikira ingingo. Nubwo bumwe mu bwoko bwa EDS butuma umuntu abaho neza, ubwo bugira ingaruka ku mitsi y'amaraso muri rusange bugabanya igihe cyo kubaho.\nEDS yibasira nibura umuntu umwe ku bantu 5.000 ku isi. Iteganyagihe riterwa n'indwara runaka. Gutembera cyane byasobanuwe bwa mbere na Hippocrates mu mwaka wa 400 mbere ya Yesu. Izi ndwara zitiriwe abaganga babiri, Edvard Ehlers wo muri Danemark na Henri-Alexandre Danlos wo mu Bufaransa, bazivuze mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20. "}
{"id": "23294", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23294", "title": "Indwara ya Asperger", "text": "Indwara ya Asperger (AS), izwi kandi nka Asperger's, ni indwara y'iterambere irangwa n'ingorane zikomeye mu mibanire n'abandi no mu itumanaho ritari iryo mu magambo, hamwe n'imyitwarire n'ibyo umuntu akunda bitagira akagero kandi bisubirwamo. Kubera ko indwara yoroheje ya autism spectrum (ASD), itandukanye n'izindi ASD bitewe n'ururimi n'ubwenge bisanzwe. Nubwo bidakenewe kugira ngo umuntu amenye indwara, gukoresha imvugo mu buryo budasanzwe no kuyikoresha mu buryo budasanzwe ni ibintu bisanzwe. Ibimenyetso bikunze gutangira umuntu atarageza ku myaka ibiri kandi akenshi bimara ubuzima bwe bwose.\nImpamvu nyayo ya Asperger ntabwo izwi. Nubwo ahanini irazwe, imiterere y\u2019uturemangingo ntabwo iramenyekana neza. Ibintu bidukikije nabyo bikekwa ko bigira uruhare. Gusuzuma ubwonko ntabwo byagaragaje indwara isanzwe ishingiyeho. Mu 2013, gusuzuma indwara ya Asperger byakuwe mu \"gitabo cy\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe\" (DSM-5), kandi abantu bafite ibi bimenyetso ubu bashyizwe mu ndwara ya autism spectrum hamwe na autisme n\u2019indwara y\u2019iterambere isanzwe itavuzwe ukundi (PDD-NOS). Iracyari mu cyiciro mpuzamahanga cy\u2019indwara (ICD-11) nk'ubwoko bw'indwara ya autism spectrum.\nNta buryo bumwe bwo kuvura, kandi ubushobozi bw'ibikorwa runaka bugaragazwa n'amakuru make gusa. Ubuvuzi bugamije kugabanya gahunda zo gukora ibintu kenshi cyangwa zisubiramo, no kunoza ubuhanga bwo kuvugana no gukora ibintu mu buryo bugoye. Ingamba zishobora kuba zirimo guhugura abantu mu bijyanye n'imibanire n'abandi, ubuvuzi bushingiye ku myitwarire mu bwenge, ubuvuzi bw'umubiri, ubuvuzi bwo kuvuga, amahugurwa ku babyeyi, n'imiti ivura ibibazo bifitanye isano, nk'amarangamutima cyangwa imihangayiko. Abana benshi barakura neza uko bakura, ariko ibibazo byo mu mibanire n'abandi no mu itumanaho akenshi birakomeza. Bamwe mu bashakashatsi n'abantu bafite ikibazo cya autisme bashyigikiye impinduka mu myumvire ku gitekerezo cy'uko indwara ya autisme ari itandukaniro aho kuba indwara igomba kuvurwa cyangwa gukira.\nMu 2015, indwara ya Asperger yagaragaye ko yibasiwe n\u2019abantu miliyoni 37.2 ku isi. Indwara ya Autism yibasira abagabo cyane kurusha abagore, kandi abagore bakunze kuyisanga mu myaka iri imbere. Iyi ndwara yitiriwe umuganga w\u2019abana wo muri Otirishiya witwa Hans Asperger, wavuze mu 1944 ku bana yareraga bagorwaga no kugirana ubucuti, batumvaga ibimenyetso cyangwa ibyiyumvo by\u2019abandi, baganiraga ku ruhande rumwe ku byo bakunda, kandi bakaba bari abantu badakunda. Igitekerezo cya none cya Asperger syndrome cyabayeho mu 1981 kandi cyanyuze mu gihe cyo gukwirakwira. Byabaye isuzuma risanzwe mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990. Ibibazo byinshi n'impaka biracyari byinshi. Hari gushidikanya niba bitandukanye na autisme ikora neza (HFA). Impamvu imwe ni uko igipimo cy'abantu bagizweho ingaruka kitaramenyekana neza."}
{"id": "23295", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23295", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyumba", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyumba ni urwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Gishamvu, mu Karere ka Huye, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda. Rwibutsa Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994, kandi rushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize iyo Jenoside.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyumba ni hamwe mu hantu hibukirwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Karere ka Huye. Rukoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kwibuka, guha icyubahiro abishwe no gusaba ko imibiri yabo itarashyingurwa mu cyubahiro yaboneka igashyingurwa.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Abatutsi bo mu gace ka Gishamvu no mu bice biyegereye bishwe muri ubwo bwicanyi. Nyuma ya Jenoside, imibiri y'abishwe yashyinguwe mu rwibutso rwa Nyumba, rukaba ahantu ho kubibuka no guha icyubahiro abazize Jenoside.Nk'uko byatangajwe mu gikorwa cyo kwibuka ku wa 20 Mata 2023, imibare yari mu bitabo by'Umuryango uharanira inyungu z'abacitse ku icumu rya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi (IBUKA) mu Murenge wa Gishamvu yerekanaga ko urwibutso rwa Nyumba rwari rushyinguyemo imibiri 59.999. Iyo mibare yatangajwe muri icyo gikorwa ikeneye kugereranywa n'inyandiko zemewe z'ubuyobozi bw'urwibutso.\nIgikorwa cyo kwibuka cyo mu 2023.\nKu wa 20 Mata 2023, ku Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyumba habereye igikorwa cyo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 29 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.Iki gikorwa cyitabiriwe n'abayobozi batandukanye, barimo Guverineri w'Intara y'Amajyepfo, Alice Kayitesi, abayobozi b'Akarere ka Huye, abahagarariye inzego z'umutekano, abahagarariye amadini n'abaturage.Muri icyo gikorwa, hashyinguwe mu cyubahiro imibiri 383 y'abantu bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Nk'uko byatangajwe n'abayobozi, imwe muri iyo mibiri yari yaravanywe mu irimbi ryo mu Janja, mu Kagari ka Nyakibanda, indi iboneka mu bice bitandukanye byo mu Murenge wa Gishamvu no mu Murenge wa Ngera, mu Karere ka Nyaruguru.Igikorwa cyaranzwe no kwibuka abazize Jenoside, gutanga ubuhamya n'ibiganiro ku mateka ya Jenoside, gushyira indabo ku rwibutso no gushyingura imibiri yabonetse."}
{"id": "23296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23296", "title": "Indwara ya Parkinson", "text": "Indwara ya Parkinson (PD), cyangwa Parkinson gusa, ni indwara ifata igihe kirekire yo mu bwonko bwo hagati ikagira ingaruka cyane cyane ku mikorere y'umubiri. Uko indwara igenda irushaho kwiyongera, ibimenyetso bitari ibyo mu mitsi bigenda birushaho kugaragara. Ibimenyetso bikunze kugaragara buhoro buhoro. Mu ntangiriro z'iyi ndwara, ibimenyetso bigaragara cyane ni ukunyeganyega, gukomera, kugenda buhoro, no kugorwa no kugenda. Gutekereza kandi ibibazo by'imyitwarire nabyo bishobora kubaho. Indwara yo mu mutwe (Dementia) biba ibisanzwe mu gihe indwara igeze mu cyiciro cya kabiri. Ihungabana kandi imihangayiko nayo ikunze kugaragara, ikaba igaragara ku bantu barenga kimwe cya gatatu cy'abafite PD. Ibindi bimenyetso birimo ibibazo byo kumva, gusinzira, n'amarangamutima. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi by'imitsi y'umubiri byitwa \" parkinsonism \", cyangwa \"parkinsonian syndrome\".\nImpamvu y'indwara ya Parkinson ntabwo izwi, ariko bikekwa ko iterwa n'ibintu bigize imiterere y'umubiri ndetse n'ibidukikije. Abafite umuntu wo mu muryango wabo wanduye bafite amahirwe menshi yo kurwara iyi ndwara ubwabo. Hari kandi ibyago byinshi ku bantu bahura n'imiti yica udukoko no mu bakomeretse ku mutwe mbere, mu gihe hari ibyago bike ku banywa itabi n'abanywa ikawa cyangwa icyayi. Ibimenyetso by'iyi ndwara bituruka ku rupfu rw'uturemangingo two mu gace k'ubwonko gafite igice cy'ubwonko cyo hagati. Ibi bituma dopamine idahagije muri aka gace k'ubwonko. Impamvu y'uru rupfu rw'uturemangingo ntabwo isobanutse neza, ariko ikubiyemo kwirundanya kwa poroteyine mu mibiri ya Lewy mu mitsi y'ubwonko. Gusuzuma indwara zisanzwe ahanini bishingiye ku bimenyetso, hamwe n'ibizamini nka neuroimaging bikoreshwa kugira ngo harebwe izindi ndwara.\nNta muti uhari wo kuvura indwara ya Parkinson. Ubuvuzi bugamije kunoza ibimenyetso. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi bwa mbere bukorwa hakoreshejwe imyitozo ngororamubiri n'imiti irwanya parkinson ya levodopa (L-DOPA), hanyuma hagakurikiraho imiti igabanya ubukana bwa dopamine iyo levodopa idafite imbaraga. Uko indwara ikomeza kwiyongera kandi uturemangingo tw\u2019ubwonko dukomeza gutakaza ubushobozi, iyi miti iragabanuka, mu gihe kimwe itera ikibazo kirangwa no kwihinahina ku bushake. Indyo n'uburyo bumwe na bumwe bwo kuvura indwara byagaragaje ko bifite akamaro mu kugabanya ibimenyetso. Kubaga hakoreshejwe microelectrodes kugira ngo ubwonko burusheho gukanguka byakoreshejwe mu kugabanya ibimenyetso by'imikorere y'umubiri mu bihe bikomeye aho imiti idakora neza. Ibimenyetso by'ubuvuzi ku bimenyetso bya PD bifitanye isano no kudakora, nko kubura ibitotsi n'ibibazo by'amarangamutima, ntabwo bikomeye cyane.\nMu 2015, PD yibasiwe n\u2019abantu miliyoni 6.2, bituma abantu bagera ku 117.400 bapfa ku isi yose. Indwara ya Parkinson ikunze kugaragara ku bantu barengeje imyaka 60, muri bo hafi kimwe ku ijana nibo bayirwaye. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore ku kigereranyo cya 3:2. Iyo igaragaye ku bantu batarageza ku myaka 50, yitwa PD yo mu ntangiriro. Impuzandengo y'igihe umuntu azakomeza kubaho nyuma yo gupimwa ni hagati y'imyaka 7 na 15. Iyi ndwara yitiriwe umuganga w\u2019Umwongereza James Parkinson, wasohoye ibisobanuro birambuye bya mbere mu gitabo cyitwa \"An Essay on the Shaking Palsy\", mu 1817. Ubukangurambaga mu ruhame burimo Umunsi Mpuzamahanga wa Parkinson (ku isabukuru ya James Parkinson, 11 Mata) no gukoresha agati k'umutuku nk'ikimenyetso cy'indwara. Abantu barwaye Parkinson bongereye ubumenyi ku iyi ndwara barimo icyamamare mu iteramakofe Muhammad Ali, umukinnyi wa filime Michael J. Fox, umukinnyi wa siporo mu mikino Olempike Davis Phinney, n'umukinnyi wa filime Alan Alda. "}
{"id": "23297", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23297", "title": "Icyorezo cya Bubonic", "text": "Icyorezo cya Bubonic ni kimwe mu bwoko butatu bw'icyorezo giterwa na bagiteri \"Yersinia pestis\". Nyuma y'umunsi umwe kugeza kuri irindwi uhuye na bagiteri, ibimenyetso bisa n'ibicurane biragaragara. Ibi bimenyetso birimo umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, no kuruka. Utunyangingo tw\u2019amaraso tubyimba kandi tubabaza tuba ahantu hegereye aho bagiteri yinjiye mu ruhu. Rimwe na rimwe, utunyangingo twa lymph twabyimbye dushobora gucika.\nUbwoko butatu bw'icyorezo ni ingaruka z'inzira yanduriyemo: indwara ya bubonic, indwara ya septicemic, n'indwara ya pneumonical. Indwara ya Bubonic ikwirakwizwa cyane cyane n'udusimba twanduye duturuka ku nyamaswa nto. Bishobora kandi guterwa no guhura n'amazi yo mu mubiri aturuka ku nyamaswa yapfuye yanduye indwara y'ibyorezo. Mu bwoko bwa plague ya bubonic, bagiteri zinjira mu ruhu binyuze mu kurumwa n'udusimba hanyuma zigaca mu miyoboro ya lymphatic zijya mu gace k'imiyoboro ya lymphatic, bigatuma zibyimba. Gusuzuma indwara bikorwa habonetse bagiteri mu maraso, mu mihogo, cyangwa mu mazi ava mu tunyangingo tw\u2019imitsi.\nKwirinda ni ugukoresha ingamba z\u2019ubuzima rusange nko kudafata inyamaswa zapfuye mu turere twakunze kugaragaramo icyorezo. Inkingo ntibyagaragaye ko ari ingirakamaro cyane mu gukumira indwara z'ibyorezo. Antibiyotike nyinshi zifite akamaro mu kuvura, harimo streptomycin, gentamicin, na doxycycline. Iyo hatabayeho kuvurwa, indwara y'ibicurane ihitana 30% kugeza 90% by'abanduye. Iyo bibayeho, akenshi urupfu rubaho mu minsi icumi. Iyo umuntu avuwe, ibyago byo gupfa ni hafi 10%. Ku isi yose hagati ya 2010 na 2015 hagaragaye abantu 3248 banduye iyi ndwara, ikaba yahitanye abantu 584. Ibihugu bifite umubare munini w\u2019abanduye ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Madagasikari na Peru.\nIcyorezo cyateye icyorezo cy\u2019abirabura cyakwirakwiriye muri Aziya, i Burayi na Afurika mu kinyejana cya 14, kikica abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 50. Ibi byari hagati ya 25% na 60% by'abaturage b'i Burayi. Kubera ko icyorezo cyahitanye abaturage benshi bakoraga, imishahara yariyongereye bitewe n'ibyifuzo by'abakozi. Bamwe mu bahanga mu by'amateka babona ko ibi ari ihinduka rikomeye mu iterambere ry'ubukungu bw'u Burayi. Iyi ndwara kandi ni yo yateye icyorezo cya Justinian cyaturutse mu bwami bw\u2019Abaroma bw\u2019Iburasirazuba mu kinyejana cya 6, ndetse n\u2019icyorezo cya gatatu cyibasira Ubushinwa, Mongoliya, n\u2019Ubuhinde cyaturutse mu Ntara ya Yunnan mu 1855. Ijambo \"bubonic\" rikomoka ku ijambo ry'Ikigiriki \u03b2\u03bf\u03c5\u03b2\u03ce\u03bd, risobanura \"igituba\". Ijambo \" buboes \" rikoreshwa kandi mu kuvuga ku tunyangingo tw\u2019imitsi twabyimbye."}
{"id": "23298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23298", "title": "Jean de Dieu Kamuhanda", "text": "Jean de Dieu Kamuhanda (wavutse ku wa 3 Werurwe 1953) ni umunyapolitiki w\u2019Umunyarwanda wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019Amashuri Makuru n\u2019Ubushakashatsi mu bya Siyansi muri Guverinoma y\u2019inzibacyuho mu 1994. Yahamijwe n\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) icyaha cya Jenoside n\u2019icyaha cyo kurimbura abantu nk\u2019icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu, kubera uruhare rwe mu bwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi mu gace ka Gikomero mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. Ku wa 19 Nzeri 2005, Urugereko rw\u2019Ubujurire rwa ICTR rwemeje igihano cy\u2019igifungo cya burundu yari yarakatiwe.\nAmateka.\nMu ntangiriro za Mata 1994, nyuma gato y\u2019uko Jenoside yo mu Rwanda itangiye, Kamuhanda yatanze ikiganiro i Gikomero aho yagaragaje ko ubwicanyi bw\u2019Abatutsi i Gikomero bwari butaratangira kandi ko yari yiteguye gutanga intwaro zari kuba ngombwa kugira ngo ubwicanyi bube bwarakorewe aho. Mu gusoza ijambo rye, yahaye abari aho imbunda, gerenade n'imihoro, kandi yavuze ko azakurikirana abaturage ba Gikomero kugira ngo arebe ko ubwicanyi bwatangiye. Ku itariki ya 12 Mata 1994, Kamuhanda yahaye abapolisi amabwiriza ku mitwe y\u2019Interahamwe yo gutangira kwica Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu ishuri ry\u2019itorero ry\u2019Abaporotesitanti i Gikomero.\nMu mpera za Nyakanga, Kamuhanda yahungiye mu Bufaransa. Abisabwe n'umushinjacyaha wa TPIR, yatawe muri yombi n'abayobozi b'Abafaransa i Bourges ku ya 26 Ugushyingo 1999. Ku itariki ya 7 Werurwe 2000, yoherejwe muri gereza ya TPIR i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya.\nMu rubanza rwe, Kamuhanda yahamijwe icyaha cya jenoside n'icyaha cyo gutsembatsemba nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Yagizwe umwere ku byaha byo gucura umugambi wo gukora jenoside, gufata ku ngufu nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu, n'ibyaha by'intambara n'ibindi bikorwa bibi nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Igihano cye cyemejwe n'Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rwa TPIR ku ya 19 Nzeri 2005, maze ku ya 7 Ukuboza 2008 yoherezwa muri Mali kurangiriza igihano cye."}
{"id": "23299", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23299", "title": "Pascal Simbikangwa", "text": "Simbikangwa yavukiye i Karago mu mwaka wa 1959. Mu mwaka wa 1986, yagize ubumuga nyuma yo gukora impanuka y\u2019imodoka. Yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019urwego rw\u2019ubutasi rw\u2019u Rwanda, ndetse anaba kapiteni mu ngabo zirinda Perezida, mu gihe yari akiri muri uwo mwanya w\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019ubutasi. \nYakomeje kuba muri iyo myanya mu gihe cya jenoside, ahunga u Rwanda mu mpera z'impeshyi yo mu 1994. Simbikangwa yabanje guhungira mu birwa bya Comoros. Mu 2008, yasabye ubuhungiro bwa politiki muri Mayotte. Yatawe muri yombi ku ya 28 Ukwakira 2008 azira guhimba impapuro. Yaburanishijwe mu Bufaransa hakurikijwe itegeko ry\u2019Ubufaransa ryemerera umuntu wese ushinjwa ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu koherezwayo. \nIburanisha rya 2014.\nMu rubanza rwe rwo mu 2014 mu Bufaransa, Simbikangwa yavuzweho kuba inshuti magara na mubyara wa Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, wishwe byateje amakimbirane ashingiye ku moko mu Rwanda. Abashinjacyaha bagaragaje ko Simbikangwa yari umunyamigabane ukomeye muri Free Radio-Televiziyo ya Milles Collines, imwe mu nzego zikomeye za poropagande y\u2019Abahutu, yasabaga ku mugaragaro ko habaho jenoside. Simbikangwa yashinjwe kandi afatwa nk'umunyabyaha kubera gukora urutonde rw'abayobozi b'Abatutsi n'Abahutu bari kwibasirwa n'itsembabwoko. Simbikangwa yahamwe n'icyaha ku ya 14 Werurwe 2014 cyo \" ubufatanyacyaha mu itsembabwoko n'ubufatanyacyaha mu byaha byibasiye inyokomuntu.\" Yakatiwe imyaka 25\u00a0imyaka myinshi mu gifungo. "}
{"id": "23300", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23300", "title": "Icyorezo (indwara)", "text": "Indwara ya plague ni indwara yandura iterwa na bagiteri \"Yersinia pestis\". Ibimenyetso birimo umuriro, gucika intege no kuribwa umutwe. Ubusanzwe ibi bitangira nyuma y'umunsi umwe kugeza kuri irindwi nyuma yo guhura n'ikiyobyabwenge. Mu buryo bwa bubonic, hariho no kubyimba kw'uturemangingo twa lymph, mu gihe mu buryo bwa septicemic, uturemangingo dushobora guhinduka umukara tugapfa, kandi mu buryo bwa pneumonic, guhumeka nabi, inkorora no kubabara mu gituza bishobora kubaho.\nIcyorezo cya Bubonic na Septicemia muri rusange gikwirakwizwa no kurumwa n'udusimba cyangwa gukora ku nyamaswa yanduye. Ubwoko bw'indwara y'ibihaha muri rusange ikwirakwira hagati y'abantu binyuze mu kirere binyuze mu bitonyanga byandura. Ubusanzwe isuzuma rikorwa binyuze mu gusanga bagiteri mu mazi ava mu gace k'imitsi, mu maraso cyangwa mu mashoka. \nAbari mu kaga gakomeye bashobora gukingirwa. Abahuye n'indwara y'ibihaha bashobora kuvurwa n'imiti yo kuyirinda. Iyo yanduye, ivurwa hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko n'ubuvuzi bufasha. Ubusanzwe imiti igabanya ubukana ikubiyemo uruvange rwa gentamicin na fluoroquinolone. Ingaruka zo gupfa iyo umuntu avuwe ni hafi 10% mu gihe iyo atavuwe ari hafi 70%. \nKu isi yose, abantu bagera kuri 600 bandura iyi ndwara buri mwaka. Mu 2017, ibihugu byagaragayemo abarwayi benshi harimo Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Madagasikari na Peru. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ubwandu rimwe na rimwe bubera mu byaro, aho bivugwa ko bagiteri zikwirakwira mu mbeba. Mu mateka byagaragaye mu cyorezo gikomeye, aho kizwi cyane ari cyo cyorezo cy\u2019umwijima cyo mu kinyejana cya 14, cyahitanye abantu barenga miliyoni 50."}
{"id": "23301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23301", "title": "Alprazolam", "text": "Alprazolam, igurishwa ku izina rya Xanax, n'izindi, ni benzodiazepine ikora vuba. Ikoreshwa cyane mu kuvura indwara zo guhangayika mu gihe gito, cyane cyane indwara y'ubwoba cyangwa indwara yo guhangayika rusange (GAD). Izindi ngamba zirimo kuvura isesemi iterwa na chemotherapy, hamwe n'ubundi buryo bwo kuvura. Iterambere rya GAD ribaho muri rusange mu cyumweru kimwe. Alprazolam muri rusange ifatwa n'umunwa. \nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, kwiheba, kuribwa umutwe, kumva unaniwe, umunwa wumye, no kugira ibibazo byo kwibuka. Bimwe mu biruhuko n'umunaniro bishobora koroha mu minsi mike. Bitewe n'impungenge zo gukoresha nabi imiti, bamwe ntibasaba alprazolam nk'uburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura indwara y'ubwoba. Ibimenyetso byo kureka cyangwa kongera kugaruka bishobora kubaho iyo ikoreshwa rigabanutse mu buryo butunguranye; kugabanya buhoro buhoro igipimo mu byumweru cyangwa amezi bishobora kuba ngombwa. Izindi ngaruka zidasanzwe zirimo kwiyahura, bishobora guterwa no kubura ubushobozi bwo kwifata. Alprazolam, kimwe n'izindi benzodiazepines, ikora binyuze muri GABA A receptor.\nAlprazolam yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1971, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1981. Alprazolam ni ikiyobyabwenge kigenzurwa na Schedule IV kandi ni ikiyobyabwenge gikunze gukoreshwa nabi. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cyo kugurisha muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za kuri dose imwe mu 2018. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 21 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni 25. "}
{"id": "23302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23302", "title": "Athanase Seromba", "text": "Athanase Seromba (wavutse mu 1963) ni umupadiri wa Kiliziya Gatolika w\u2019Umunyarwanda wahamijwe icyaha cya jenoside n\u2019ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu yakoze mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nYari padiri mukuru wa Paruwasi ya Nyange, aho Abatutsi bari hagati ya 1.500 na 2.000 biciwe muri kiliziya mu 1994. Nyuma yo kwihisha mu Ubutaliyani ku izina ry\u2019irihimbano, yishyikirije Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) mu 2002, maze mu 2008 akatirwa igifungo cya burundu.\nUruhare muri jenoside.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Seromba yari padiri mukuru wa Paruwasi Gatolika ya Nyange, mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibuye, mu burengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda (ubu ni mu Akarere ka Ngororero). Abatutsi bari hagati ya 1.500 na 2.000 bari bahungiye muri kiliziya ye. Urukiko rwemeje ko yemeye ko kiliziya isenywa na buldozeri abari bayihungiyemo bakiri imbere, bigamije atari ukwica abantu benshi gusa, ahubwo no kurimbura Abatutsi nk\u2019ubwoko.\nGuhungira mu Butaliyani.\nMuri Nyakanga 1994, Seromba yahunze u Rwanda. Abihayimana Gatolika bamufashije kujya mu Ubutaliyani, guhindura izina no gukomeza ubupadiri muri paruwasi ya San Martino a Montughi, hafi y\u2019umujyi wa Florence, yiyita Anastasio Sumba Bura.\nUrubanza.\nKu gitutu cya Carla Del Ponte, wari umushinjacyaha mukuru wa ICTR, Seromba yishyikirije urwo rukiko ku ya 6 Gashyantare 2002. Ku ya 8 Gashyantare 2002, yahakanye ibyaha yaregwaga: jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside, umugambi wo gukora jenoside, n\u2019itsembatsemba nk\u2019icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Urubanza rwe rwatangiye ku ya 20 Nzeri 2004 imbere y\u2019Urugereko rwa Gatatu rw\u2019urwo rukiko. Ku ya 13 Ukuboza 2006, yahamijwe gufasha mu gukora jenoside n\u2019itsembatsemba, akatirwa igifungo cy\u2019imyaka 15.\nIcyo cyemezo cyarajuririwe. Ku ya 12 Werurwe 2008, Urugereko rw\u2019Ubujurire rwasanze uruhare rwe rurenze ubufatanyacyaha, rumuhamya icyaha cyo gukora jenoside n\u2019itsembatsemba, maze rumukatira igifungo cya burundu.\nIgifungo.\nKu ya 27 Kamena 2009, Seromba yimuriwe muri Bene kugira ngo arangirize igihano cye muri gereza ya Akpro-Miss\u00e9r\u00e9t\u00e9, hafi y\u2019umujyi wa Porto-Novo."}
{"id": "23303", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23303", "title": "Gabapentin", "text": "Gabapentin, igurishwa ku izina rya Neurontin n'indi, ni umuti ugabanya ububabare bw'imitsi ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe, ububabare bw'imitsi, ubushyuhe, n'indwara yo kuruhuka kw'amaguru. Irasabwa nk'umwe mu miti myinshi yo ku rwego rwa mbere ivura ububabare bw'imitsi buterwa n'indwara ya diyabete, neuralgia yo mu gihe cy'imitsi, n'ububabare bw'imitsi yo mu gice cyo hagati. Hafi 15% by'abantu barwaye indwara ya diyabete cyangwa indwara ya neuralgia nyuma y'imitsi bafite inyungu ifatika. Ibimenyetso mu bundi bwoko bwinshi bw'ububabare ntibihagije. Gabapentin ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira no kuzerera. Ingaruka mbi zirimo kwiyongera k'ibyago byo kwiyahura, imyitwarire mibi, n'ibiyobyabwenge. Ntabwo birasobanuka neza niba ari byiza mu gihe utwite cyangwa wonsa. Ingano nto ni zo zisabwa abantu bafite imikorere mibi y'impyiko. Gabapentin ni gabapentinoid. Ifite imiterere ya molekile isa n\u2019iya aside \u03b3-aminobutyric (GABA) kandi ikora mu kubuza imiyoboro imwe n\u2019imwe ya kalisiyumu.\nGabapentin yemejwe bwa mbere gukoreshwa mu 1993. Kuva mu 2004, iboneka nk'umuti usanzwe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika Igiciro cy'ibicuruzwa byinshi mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere yari hafi ku kwezi; muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, yari hagati y'amadolari y'Amerika 100 na 200. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa cumi n'umwe ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni 46. Mu myaka ya 1990, Parke-Davis, ishami rya Pfizer, yatangiye gukoresha uburyo butandukanye butemewe n'amategeko kugira ngo ashishikarize abaganga bo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika gukoresha gabapentin mu buryo butemewe. Bishyuye amamiliyoni y'amadolari kugira ngo batunganye imanza zijyanye n'ibi bikorwa."}
{"id": "23304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23304", "title": "Methylphenidate", "text": "Methylphenidate, igurishwa ku izina ry'ubucuruzi rya Ritalin n'indi, ni umuti utera imbaraga ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara yo kudakora neza kw'ibitekerezo (ADHD) na narcolepsy. Ni umuti wa mbere uvura ADHD. Ishobora gufatwa mu kanwa cyangwa igasigwa ku ruhu. Imiti itandukanye igira igihe gitandukanye cy'ingaruka.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara za methylphenidate zirimo kugorwa no gusinzira, kugabanuka k'ubushake bwo kurya, guhangayika no kugabanya ibiro. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zishobora kuba zirimo psychosis, allergie, guhagarara igihe kirekire, gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge, n'ibibazo by'umutima. Bivugwa ko Methylphenidate ikora mu gukumira dopamine na norepinephrine reuptake by\u2019imitsi ikoresha neurons. Methylphenidate ni umuti utera imbaraga mu mitsi (CNS) ukomoka ku bwoko bwa phenethylamine na piperidine.\nMethylphenidate yakozwe bwa mbere mu 1944, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1955. Yagurishijwe bwa mbere na sosiyete yo mu Busuwisi yitwa CIBA, ubu ikaba ari Novartis Corporation. Bivugwa ko mu 2013, dose miliyari 2.4 za methylphenidate zafashwe ku isi yose. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 47 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 16. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy\u2019umuti usohoka ako kanya kiri munsi ya 0.30$ kuri dose imwe mu 2018. "}
{"id": "23305", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23305", "title": "Sclerosis nyinshi", "text": "Multiple sclerosis (MS) ni indwara itera gukuraho myelin aho ibice bikingira uturemangingo tw\u2019imitsi mu bwonko no mu ruti rw\u2019umugongo byangirika. Uku kwangirika kubangamira ubushobozi bw'ibice by'imitsi bwo kohereza ibimenyetso, bigatera ibimenyetso bitandukanye, harimo ibibazo by'umubiri, ibyo mu mutwe, ndetse rimwe na rimwe n'ibibazo byo mu mutwe. Ibimenyetso byihariye bishobora kuba birimo kureba kabiri, guhuma mu jisho rimwe, intege nke z'imitsi ndetse no kunanirwa kumva cyangwa guhuza imikorere y'umubiri. MS ifata imiterere itandukanye, ibimenyetso bishya bibaho mu bitero byihariye (uburyo bwo gusubira inyuma) cyangwa bikiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita (uburyo bukomeza kwiyongera). Hagati y\u2019ibitero, ibimenyetso bishobora gucika burundu; icyakora, ibibazo by\u2019imitsi bidashira akenshi birakomeza, cyane cyane uko indwara ikomeza kwiyongera.\nNubwo impamvu idasobanutse neza, imikorere y\u2019ibanze ikekwa ko ari ukurimbuka kw\u2019ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri cyangwa kunanirwa kw\u2019uturemangingo dukora myelin. Impamvu zivugwa zirimo imiterere y\u2019umubiri no kuba byaterwa n\u2019ubwandu bwa virusi nka virusi ya Epstein-Barr. Ubusanzwe indwara ya MS ipimwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso n'ibimenyetso byayo ndetse n'ibisubizo by'ibizamini by'ubuvuzi.\nNta muti uzwi uvura indwara ya sclerosis nyinshi. Uburyo bwo kuvura bugerageza kunoza imikorere y'umubiri nyuma y'igitero no gukumira ibitero bishya. Imiti ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ya MS, nubwo ifite akamaro gake, ishobora kugira ingaruka mbi kandi ntibemererwe neza. Ubuvuzi bw'umubiri bishobora gufasha abantu mu bushobozi bwabo bwo gukora. Abantu benshi bahitamo ubundi buryo bwo kuvura nubwo nta bimenyetso bigaragaza akamaro kabwo. Ingaruka z'igihe kirekire ziragoye kumenya; ingaruka nziza zikunze kugaragara ku bagore, abarwara iyi ndwara bakiri bato, abasubiranyemo, ndetse n'ababanje guhura n'ibitero bike. Icyizere cy'ubuzima ugereranije, ubusanzwe buri munsi y\u2019imyaka itanu kugeza ku icumi ugereranije n\u2019abaturage badafite icyo bahungabanyije.\nIndwara ya sclerosis nyinshi ni indwara ikunze kugaragara cyane iterwa n\u2019ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri ifata uturemangingo tw\u2019imitsi yo hagati. Mu 2015, abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 2.3 bagizweho ingaruka ku isi, aho igipimo gitandukanye cyane mu turere dutandukanye no mu baturage batandukanye. Muri uwo mwaka, abantu bagera ku 18.900 bapfuye bazize indwara ya MS, bavuye ku 12.000 mu 1990. Iyi ndwara ikunze gutangirira hagati y\u2019imyaka makumyabiri na mirongo itanu kandi ikunze kugaragara ku bagore inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagabo. MS yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1868 n'umuhanga mu by'imitsi w'Umufaransa Jean-Martin Charcot. Izina \"multiple sclerosis\" risobanura inkovu nyinshi za glial (cyangwa sclerae - cyane cyane plaque cyangwa ibisebe) zikura ku ngingo yera y'ubwonko n'umugongo. Uburyo bushya bwo kuvura no gusuzuma indwara burimo gukorwa."}
{"id": "23306", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23306", "title": "Wenceslas Munyeshyaka", "text": "Wenceslas Munyeshyaka (wavutse ku ya 30 Nyakanga 1958 i Butare) ni Umunyarwanda wahoze ari umupadiri wa Kiliziya Gatolika. Mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, yari padiri kuri paruwasi ya Sainte-Famille i Kigali, aho Abatutsi benshi bari barahungiye.\nMu 2006, urukiko rwa gisirikare rwo mu Rwanda rwamukatiye adahari igifungo cya burundu, rumuhamije icyaha cya jenoside. Mu Ubufaransa, aho yahungiye kuva mu 1994, inkiko zafashe icyemezo cyo kutamuburanisha (\"non-lieu\") kubera ibimenyetso bidahagije, icyo cyemezo kiba ntakuka mu 2019. Mu 2023, yambuwe burundu ubupadiri na Papa Fransisko, nyuma y'uko yemeye ko yabyaye umwana.\nUbuzima.\nMunyeshyaka yavukiye muri komine Ngoma, muri Perefegitura ya Butare. Nyina, F\u00e9licit\u00e9 Mukarukaka, yari Umututsi, naho se, Gabriel Ngiruwonsanga, yari Umuhutu.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside.\nMu 1994, Munyeshyaka yari padiri kuri paruwasi ya Sainte-Famille i Kigali, aho impunzi zibarirwa mu bihumbi zari zahungiye. Abarokotse n'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR) bamushinja kuba yarafatanyije n'Interahamwe mu gutoranya no kuzishyikiriza Abatutsi bari bahahungiye, ndetse no gufata abagore ku ngufu. Muri Kamena 1994, abanyamakuru bamusanze yambaye ikoti ririnda amasasu kandi afite imbunda ku mukandara.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, yahungiye i Goma muri Zayire, ku ya 2 Kanama 1994 ashyira umukono ku ibaruwa abapadiri b'Abanyarwanda bari bahungiye i Goma bandikiye Papa Yohani Pawulo wa II, ihakana Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu Bufaransa.\nYageze mu Bufaransa muri Nzeri 1994. Kuva mu 2001 kugeza mu 2021, yakoreye umurimo w'ubupadiri muri diyosezi ya \u00c9vreux, i Gisors, anaba umushumba w'abaskuti.\nMuri Werurwe 2021, diyosezi ya \u00c9vreux yamubujije gukomeza umurimo w'ubupadiri no gutanga amasakramentu, nyuma y'uko yemeye ko afite umuhungu wavutse mu 2010. Ku ya 23 Werurwe 2023, Papa Fransisko yamwambuye burundu ubupadiri, nta bujurire bushoboka.\nImanza.\nMu Rwanda.\nMu Ugushyingo 2006, urukiko rwa gisirikare rw'u Rwanda rwamukatiye adahari igifungo cya burundu, rumuhamije jenoside no gufata ku ngufu. Yaburanishijwe hamwe na Jenerali Laurent Munyakazi, na we wakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Urukiko rwemeje ko bafatanyije gushyikiriza abicanyi Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Sainte-Famille.\nImbere ya TPIR.\nMu 2005, TPIR yamushinje jenoside, gufata ku ngufu, itsembatsemba, ubwicanyi n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Hashingiwe ku mpapuro zo kumuta muri yombi za TPIR, yafatiwe i Gisors ku ya 20 Nyakanga 2007, arekurwa n'urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris ku ya 1 Kanama 2007. Yongeye gufatwa ku ya 5 Nzeri 2007, nyuma arekurwa ategekwa kwitaba ubutabera. Ku ya 20 Ugushyingo 2007, TPIR yohereje dosiye ye mu butabera bw'u Bufaransa.\nMu Bufaransa.\nIkirego cya mbere cyatanzwe mu Bufaransa muri Nyakanga 1995. Mu 1996, urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i N\u00eemes rwemeje ko inkiko z'u Bufaransa zidafite ububasha bwo kumuburanisha, ariko Urukiko rusesa imanza rwasheshe icyo cyemezo ku ya 6 Mutarama 1998. Ku ya 8 Kamena 2004, Urukiko rw'Uburayi rurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu rwahamije u Bufaransa gutinza uru rubanza, rubisabwe na Yvonne Mutimura, umwe mu barega.\nMuri Kanama 2015, umushinjacyaha wa Paris, Fran\u00e7ois Molins, yasabye ko urubanza ruhagarikwa, avuga ko iperereza ritabashije kugaragaza ibikorwa byihariye bimuhamya uruhare muri jenoside. Ku ya 2 Ukwakira 2015, abacamanza b'iperereza bafashe icyemezo cyo kutamuburanisha. Bemeje ko yagaragazaga ibitekerezo by'urwango kandi yari afitanye umubano mwiza n'abasirikare n'Interahamwe, ariko ko ibyo bidahagije ngo bimuhamye uruhare mu byaha byakozwe. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yanenze icyo cyemezo.\nIcyo cyemezo cyemejwe n'urukiko rw'ubujurire rw'i Paris ku ya 21 Kamena 2018, maze ku ya 30 Ukwakira 2019 Urukiko rusesa imanza rurakemeza, bihagarika burundu ikurikiranwa rye mu Bufaransa."}
{"id": "23307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23307", "title": "Glioblastoma", "text": "Glioblastoma, izwi kandi nka glioblastoma multiforme (GBM), ni yo kanseri ikaze cyane itangirira mu bwonko. Mu ntangiriro, ibimenyetso bya glioblastoma ntabwo ari byo byihariye. Bishobora kuba birimo kuribwa umutwe, impinduka mu miterere y'umuntu, isesemi n'ibimenyetso bisa n'iby'indwara yo mu bwonko. Ibimenyetso bikunze kwiyongera vuba kandi bishobora kwiyongera bikagera aho umuntu ata ubwenge.\nImpamvu y\u2019icyorezo cya glioblastoma ntabwo izwi. Ibintu bidasanzwe bishobora gutera ibyago birimo indwara zikomoka ku ngirabuzimafatizo, nka neurofibromatosis na Li-Fraumeni syndrome, ndetse n'ubuvuzi bwakozwe mbere bushingiye ku mirasire. Glioblastomas zigize 15% by'ibibyimba byose byo mu bwonko. Bishobora gutangirira ku tunyangingo tw\u2019ubwonko dusanzwe cyangwa bigakura bivuye kuri astrocytoma iriho yo mu rwego rwo hasi. Ubusanzwe indwara iterwa no guhuza CT scan, MRI scan na tissue biopsy.\nNta buryo buzwi bwo kwirinda kanseri. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi busaba kubagwa, nyuma hagakoreshwa imiti igabanya ubukana n'imirasire. Umuti wa temozolomide ukunze gukoreshwa nk'igice cya chimiotherapie. Steroid nyinshi zishobora gukoreshwa mu kugabanya kubyimba no kugabanya ibimenyetso. Gukuraho ikibyimba cyane bifitanye isano no kuramba kwacyo.\nNubwo kanseri yavuwe neza cyane, ikunze kugaruka. Igihe gisanzwe cyo kubaho nyuma yo gupimwa ni amezi 12 kugeza kuri 15, aho abantu bari munsi ya 3 kugeza kuri 7% bamara igihe kirenze imyaka itanu. Iyo umuntu atavuwe, kubaho kwe ni amezi atatu. Ni kanseri ikunze kugaragara cyane itangirira mu bwonko ikaba n'ikibyimba cya kabiri gikunze kugaragara cyane mu bwonko, nyuma ya meningioma. Abantu bagera kuri 3 ku 100.000 barwara iyi ndwara buri mwaka. Akenshi bitangira mu myaka 64 kandi bikunze kugaragara ku bagabo kurusha abagore. Ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri irimo kwigwa nk'uburyo bwo kuvura kanseri."}
{"id": "23308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23308", "title": "Indwara ya Down", "text": "Down syndrome, izwi kandi nka trisomie 21, ni indwara iterwa n'uko kopi ya gatatu ya chromosome 21 cyangwa igice cyayo kiba kirimo cyangwa se igice cyayo. Ubusanzwe bifitanye isano no gutinda gukura kw'umubiri, ubumuga bwo mu mutwe bworoheje kugeza ku buringaniye, hamwe n'imiterere y'isura iranga umuntu. Igipimo mpuzandengo cy'ubwenge cy'umuntu mukuru urwaye Down syndrome ni 50, bingana n'ubushobozi bwo mu mutwe bw'umwana w'imyaka 8 cyangwa 9, ariko ibi bishobora gutandukana cyane.\nAbabyeyi b'umuntu wanduye ubusanzwe baba bameze neza mu buryo bw'uturemangingo. Amahirwe ariyongera kuva kuri 0.1% ku babyeyi bafite imyaka 20 kugera kuri 3% ku bafite imyaka 45. Kromosomu y'inyongera ikekwa ko ibaho ku bw'impanuka, nta gikorwa kizwi cy'imyitwarire cyangwa ikintu kidashingiye ku bidukikije gihindura amahirwe. Indwara ya Down syndrome ishobora kumenyekana mu gihe cyo gutwita binyuze mu gupima mbere yo gutwita, hagakurikiraho gupima indwara cyangwa nyuma yo kubyara hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo kwitegereza no gupima imiterere y'umubiri. Kuva aho igikorwa cyo gupima gitangiriye, inda ziterwa n'ibizamini akenshi zirahagarikwa. Gusuzuma buri gihe ibibazo by'ubuzima bikunze kugaragara muri Down syndrome ni byiza mu buzima bwose bw'umuntu.\nNta muti uhari wa Down syndrome. Uburezi n'ubuvuzi bukwiye byagaragaye ko bitera imbere ireme ry'ubuzima. Bamwe mu bana bafite indwara ya Down syndrome biga mu masomo asanzwe yo ku ishuri, mu gihe abandi bakeneye uburezi bwihariye kurushaho. Hari abantu bamwe barwaye Down syndrome barangiza amashuri yisumbuye, abandi bake biga amashuri yisumbuye. Mu gihe cy'ubukure, hafi 20% muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bakora akazi gahembwa mu buryo runaka, benshi bakaba bakeneye ahantu ho gukorera hihishe. Ubufasha mu bibazo by'imari n'amategeko bukunze gukenerwa. Imyaka yo kubaho ni hagati ya 50 na 60\u00a0imyaka myinshi mu bihugu byateye imbere hamwe n'ubuvuzi bukwiye. \nDown syndrome ni kimwe mu bintu bikunze kugaragara mu miterere ya chromosome mu bantu. Bibaho ku bana bagera kuri 1 mu 1000 bavuka buri mwaka. Mu 2015, indwara ya Down syndrome yagaragaye mu bantu miliyoni 5.4 ku isi yose, bituma impfu 27.000 zigabanuka ugereranyije n\u2019impfu 43.000 zabaye mu 1990. Yitiriwe umuganga w\u2019Umwongereza witwa John Langdon Down, wasobanuye neza iyi ndwara mu 1866. Bimwe mu bintu bigize iyi ndwara byasobanuwe mbere na Jean-\u00c9tienne Dominique Esquirol, umuganga w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe w\u2019Umufaransa mu 1838, n\u2019umuganga w\u2019Umufaransa \u00c9douard S\u00e9guin mu 1844. Impamvu y\u2019uturemangingo itera Down syndrome yavumbuwe mu 1959."}
{"id": "23309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23309", "title": "Kokayine", "text": "Kokayine, izwi kandi nka coke, ni ikiyobyabwenge gikomeye gikoreshwa cyane mu kwidagadura. Akenshi irashongeshwa, igahumekwa nk'umwotsi, cyangwa igashonga hanyuma igashyirwa mu mitsi. Ingaruka zo mu mutwe zishobora kuba zirimo gutakaza aho umuntu ahuriye n'ukuri, kumva afite ibyishimo byinshi, cyangwa guhangayika. Ibimenyetso by'umubiri bishobora kuba birimo gutera k'umutima cyane, ibyuya, n'amaso manini. Dose nyinshi zishobora gutera umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hejuru cyane cyangwa ubushyuhe bw'umubiri. Ingaruka zitangira mu masegonda make nyuma y'iminota mike yo gukoreshwa kandi zimara hagati y'iminota itanu na mirongo icyenda. Kokayine ifite umubare muto w\u2019imiti yemewe ikoreshwa mu buvuzi nko kugabanya ububabare no kugabanya kuva amaraso mu gihe cyo kubaga amazuru.\nKokayine irakurura abantu bitewe n\u2019ingaruka igira ku nzira y\u2019ubugororangingo mu bwonko. Nyuma y'igihe gito cyo kuyikoresha, hari ibyago byinshi byo kuba umuntu ashobora kuyikoresha. Gukoresha kwayo byongera ibyago byo kurwara indwara zo mu bwonko, indwara z\u2019umutima zifata imitsi, ibibazo by\u2019ibihaha ku bayinywa, ndetse n\u2019urupfu rutunguranye rw\u2019umutima. Kokayine igurishwa mu muhanda ikunze kuvangwa n'imiti igabanya ububabare, ibinyampeke, quinine, cyangwa isukari, ibyo bikaba bishobora gutera uburozi bw'inyongera. Nyuma yo gufata doze inshuro nyinshi, umuntu ashobora kuba afite ubushobozi buke bwo kumva ibyishimo no kunanirwa cyane.\nKokayine ikora mu kubuza kongera kwinjiza serotonin, norepinephrine, na dopamine. Ibi bituma ubwonko bugira uruhare runini mu mikorere y\u2019ubwonko. Bishobora kwambuka byoroshye umugozi uva mu maraso n'ubwonko kandi bishobora gutuma umugozi usenyuka. Mu 2013, ibiro 419 byakozwe mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko. Bivugwa ko isoko ritemewe rya kokayine riri hagati ya miliyari 100 na miliyari 500 z'amadolari ya Amerika buri mwaka. Iyo habayeho gukomeza gutunganya, kokayine ishobora gukorwa ikoresheje kokayine.\nKokayine ni yo kiyobyabwenge bitemewe n'amategeko cya kabiri gikoreshwa cyane ku isi, nyuma ya cannabis. Abantu bari hagati ya miliyoni 14 na 21 bakoresha uyu muti buri mwaka. Ikoreshwa ryabyo riri hejuru cyane muri Amerika ya Ruguru, rigakurikirwa n'i Burayi na Amerika y'Epfo. Hagati ya kimwe cya gatatu ku ijana by'abantu bo mu bihugu byateye imbere bagiye bakoresha kokayine mu gihe runaka mu buzima bwabo. Mu 2013, ikoreshwa rya kokayine ryagize ingaruka ku buryo butaziguye ku rupfu rw\u2019abantu 4.300, ugereranyije n\u2019abapfuye 2.400 mu 1990. Yitirirwa igiti cya koka cyakuwemo. Amababi y'iki gihingwa yakoreshejwe n'Abanya-Peru kuva kera. Kokayine yakuwe ku mababi bwa mbere mu 1860. Kuva mu 1961, Amasezerano Mpuzamahanga ku Biyobyabwenge asaba ibihugu gufata kokayine nk'icyaha cyo kwidagadura."}
{"id": "23310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23310", "title": "Indwara ya Marfan", "text": "Indwara ya Marfan (MFS) ni indwara iterwa n'uturemangingo (genetic disorder) igira ingaruka ku ngingo zihuza umubiri. Abafite iyo ndwara bakunze kuba barebare kandi bananutse, bafite amaboko maremare, amaguru, intoki n'amano. Akenshi kandi bagira ingingo zoroshye kandi zifite scoliosis. Ingorane zikomeye cyane zirimo umutima na aorta, hamwe n'ibyago byinshi byo gucika intege kwa valve ya mitral na aneurysm ya aorta. Ibihaha, amaso, amagufwa, n'igipfundikizo cy'umugongo nabyo bikunze kwibasirwa. Uburemere bw'ibimenyetso biratandukanye.\nMFS iterwa n'impinduka muri \"FBN1\", imwe mu ngirabuzimafatizo zikora fibrillin, bigatuma habaho ingirabuzimafatizo zidasanzwe. Ni indwara ifata umubiri cyane (autosomal dominant disorder). Hafi 75% by'igihe, iyi ndwara iragwa n'umubyeyi ufite iyi ndwara, mu gihe 25% by'igihe ari impinduka nshya. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku gupima indwara hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa molekile cyangwa ibipimo bya Ghent. \nNta muti uzwi uvura MFS. Benshi mu bafite iyi ndwara bagira igihe cyo kubaho gisanzwe iyo bavuwe neza. Gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana bwa beta blockers nka propranolol cyangwa atenolol, cyangwa se iyo itihanganirwa, imiti igabanya ubukana bwa calcium channel blockers cyangwa ACE inhibitors. Kubagwa bishobora kuba ngombwa kugira ngo usanwe umuyoboro w'amaraso cyangwa usimbuze umuyoboro w'umutima. Kwirinda gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri isaba imbaraga nyinshi birasabwa.\nUmuntu umwe kuri 5,000 kugeza kuri 1 kuri 10,000 afite MFS. Bibaho kimwe ku bagabo no ku bagore. Igipimo cy'iyi ndwara kirasa hagati y'amoko no mu turere dutandukanye tw'isi. Yitiriwe abaganga b'indwara z'abana b'Umufaransa Antoine Marfan, wayisobanuye bwa mbere mu 1896. "}
{"id": "23311", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23311", "title": "Lisdexamfetamine", "text": "Lisdexamfetamine, igurishwa ku izina rya Vyvanse n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara yo kudakora neza kw'ibitekerezo (ADHD) ku bantu barengeje imyaka itanu ndetse no ku ndwara yo kurya cyane ku bantu bakuru. Lisdexamfetamine ifatwa mu kanwa. Mu Bwongereza ubusanzwe ntabwo ikundwa cyane kurusha methylphenidate. Ingaruka zabyo muri rusange zitangira mu masaha 2 kandi zimara amasaha 12.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kubura ubushake bwo kurya, guhangayika, impiswi, gusinzira nabi, kurakara no kugira isesemi. Ingaruka mbi zidasanzwe ariko zikomeye zirimo kurwara indwara yo kwishima (mania), urupfu rutunguranye rw'umutima ku bafite ibibazo by'umutima, hamwe n'indwara yo mu mutwe (psychosis). Bifite amahirwe menshi yo gukoresha nabi nk'uko DEA ibivuga. Indwara ya Serotonin bishobora kubaho iyo bikoreshejwe hamwe n'indi miti imwe n'imwe. Gukoresha iyo miti mu gihe cyo gutwita bishobora kwangiza umwana kandi kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo konsa ntibyemewe n'uwabikoze. Lisdexamfetamine ni umuti utera inshinge zo mu bwonko (CNS) ukora nyuma yo guhinduka dextroamphetamine n'umubiri. Mu rwego rwa shimi, lisdexamfetamine igizwe na aside amine -lysine, ifatanye na dextroamphetamine.\nLisdexamfetamine yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2007. Kubona ibikoresho mu Bwongereza buri kwezi bitwara Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Ubuzima cy\u2019Ubwongereza amafaranga agera kuri \u00a3 58 Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 264. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 91 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni umunani. Ni ikintu kigenzurwa na Gahunda ya II mu Bwongereza n'ikintu kigenzurwa na Gahunda ya II muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika."}
{"id": "23312", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23312", "title": "Trazodone", "text": "Trazodone, igurishwa ku mazina menshi y\u2019ibirango, ni umuti uvura indwara zifata imitsi. Ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba, indwara zo guhangayika, ingorane zo gusinzira, ndetse n'indi miti, no kurwara inzoga. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuma mu kanwa, kumva nta cyo ushoboye, kuruka no kuribwa umutwe. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zishobora kuba zirimo kwiyahura, kwiheba, gutera k'umutima ku buryo butari bwo, no guhagarara igihe kirekire bitewe n'uburwayi. Ntabwo birasobanuka neza niba gukoresha iyi miti mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa nta kibazo bifite. Ni ikintu kigizwe na phenylpiperazine cyo mu bwoko bwa serotonin antagonist na reuptake inhibitor (SARI). Trazodone ifite ingaruka zo gutuza.\nTrazodone yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1981. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ikiguzi cya NHS mu Bwongereza ni hafi \u00a37.46 ku kwezi guhera mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cyo kugurisha ku giciro kinini ni hafi 4.53 ku kwezi guhera mu 2018. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 30 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 22."}
{"id": "23313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23313", "title": "Anthrax", "text": "Anthrax ni indwara iterwa na bagiteri yitwa \"Bacillus anthracis\". Bishobora kubaho mu buryo bune: uruhu, ibihaha, amara, n'urushinge. Ibimenyetso bitangira hagati y'umunsi umwe n'amezi arenga abiri nyuma yo kwandura. Uruhu rugaragara nk'urusenda ruto rufite kubyimba bikikije akenshi bihinduka igisebe kidababaza gifite hagati y'umukara. Uburyo bwo guhumeka bugaragaza umuriro, ububabare mu gituza, no kubura umwuka. Imiterere y'amara igaragaza impiswi ishobora kuba irimo amaraso, ububabare bwo mu nda, isesemi no kuruka. Uburyo bwo guterwamo urushinge bugaragaza umuriro n'ikibyimba aho umuti watewe. \nAnthrax ikwirakwira iyo ikoze ku dukoko twa bagiteri, dukunze kugaragara mu bikomoka ku nyamaswa byandura. Gukoraho ni uguhumeka, kurya, cyangwa unyuze mu gace k'uruhu kavunitse. Ntabwo akenshi ikwirakwira mu bantu mu buryo butaziguye. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo abantu bakorana n'inyamaswa cyangwa ibikomoka ku matungo, abagenzi, abakozi ba posita, n'abasirikare. Isuzuma rishobora kwemezwa no kubona antibody cyangwa uburozi mu maraso cyangwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gupima icyitegererezo cyavuye aho umuntu yanduye. \nUrukingo rwa Anthrax irasabwa abantu bafite ibyago byinshi byo kwandura. Gukingira inyamaswa indwara ya anthrax birasabwa mu turere twagaragayemo ubwandu mbere. Gufata imiti ya antibiyotike nka ciprofloxacin, levofloxacin, na doxycycline mu mezi abiri nyuma yo kuyikoresha bishobora no gukumira kwandura. Iyo habayeho kwandura, ubuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko ndetse n'uburozi bushobora kuba burwanya uburozi. Ubwoko n'umubare wa antibiyotike zikoreshwa biterwa n'ubwoko bw'ubwandu. Antitoxin irasabwa abantu bafite ubwandu bwinshi.\nNubwo indwara idakunze kugaragara, anthrax y\u2019abantu, iyo ibayeho, ikunze kugaragara cyane muri Afurika no muri Aziya yo hagati n\u2019iy\u2019amajyepfo. Iboneka kenshi mu majyepfo y'Uburayi kurusha ahandi ku mugabane, kandi ntabwo ikunze kugaragara mu majyaruguru y'Uburayi na Amerika ya Ruguru. Ku isi yose, nibura abarwayi 2.000 babaho mu mwaka, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bagera kuri babiri mu mwaka. Indwara z'uruhu zirenga 95% by'abanduye. Iyo hatabayeho kuvurwa, ibyago byo gupfa biturutse ku ndwara ya anthrax y'uruhu ni 24%. Ku ndwara zo mu mara, ibyago byo gupfa ni 25 kugeza kuri 75%, mu gihe anthrax y'ubuhumekero ipfa iri hagati ya 50 na 80%, nubwo yavurwa. Kugeza mu kinyejana cya 20, indwara za anthrax zahitanaga abantu n'inyamaswa ibihumbi amagana buri mwaka. Indwara ya Anthrax yakozwe nk'intwaro n'ibihugu byinshi. Mu nyamaswa zirya ibimera, kwandura indwara bibaho iyo zirya cyangwa zihumeka utubuto tw\u2019uturemangingo mu gihe zirisha. Inyamaswa zishobora kwandura iyo ziriye inyamaswa zanduye."}
{"id": "23314", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23314", "title": "Emmanuel Rukundo", "text": "Emmanuel Rukundo (wavutse ku ya 1 Ukuboza 1959) ni umupadiri w\u2019Umugatolika w\u2019Umunyarwanda, wahamijwe icyaha cya jenoside n\u2019ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) mu 2009 kubera uruhare rwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nRukundo yavukiye i Kabgayi, Intara ya Gitarama, mu Rwanda. Yahawe ubupadiri muri Kiliziya Gatolika y'i Roma mu 1991. Mu 1993, yabaye umupadiri mu gisirikare cy'u Rwanda.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Rukundo yari umuyobozi wa Seminari Nto ya Mutagatifu L\u00e9on i Gitarama. Nk\u2019uko byagaragajwe n\u2019ibyavuye mu rubanza rwaburanishijwe n\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR), yategetse abasirikare b\u2019Abahutu gushimuta no kwica impunzi z\u2019Abatutsi zari zahungiye kuri Seminari ya Mutagatifu L\u00e9on. Afatanyije n\u2019abasirikare b\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda, yanagize uruhare mu gushimuta no kwica Madamu Rudahunga, ndetse no gukubita bikomeye abana be babiri n\u2019abandi basivili babiri b\u2019Abatutsi. Byongeye kandi, Rukundo yahamwe n\u2019icyaha cyo guhohotera ku gitsina umukobwa ukiri muto w\u2019Umututsikazi.\nNyuma ya jenoside, Rukundo yahungiye mu Busuwisi, aho yahawe ubuhungiro nk'impunzi. Yatawe muri yombi n'abayobozi b'Ubusuwisi muri Nyakanga 2001 nyuma y'aho Urukiko rwa TPIR rumaze gusohora impapuro zimufunga. Rukundo yaburanye mu Rukiko rw'Ikirenga rw'Ubusuwisi, ariko urubanza rwe rwaraciwe, maze ku ya 20 Nzeri 2001 yoherezwa Arusha muri Tanzaniya, kuburana na TPIR.\nUrubanza rwa Rukundo rwatangiye ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 2006, rurangira muri Gashyantare 2008. Muri Gashyantare 2009, Urugereko rw'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rwa TPIR rwamuhamije icyaha kimwe cya jenoside n'ibyaha byinshi by'ubwicanyi nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu. Urugereko rw'iremezo rwamukatiye igifungo cy'imyaka 25, ariko cyagabanijwe kigera ku myaka 23 mu Ukwakira 2010.\nMuri Nyakanga 2016, Rukundo yasabye ICTR kurekura hakiri kare kubera ko yari amaze igihe gito afunzwe, maze mu Kuboza 2016, arekurwa muri gereza yo muri Mali ari kumwe na Ferdinand Nahimana, amaze imyaka 16 muri 23 yakatiwe."}
{"id": "23315", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23315", "title": "Sertraline", "text": "Sertraline, igurishwa ku izina rya Zoloft n'indi, ni umuti ugabanya ubukana bw'indwara zo mu bwoko bwa serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI). Ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba, indwara yo guhangayika, indwara yo guhangayika nyuma yo guhungabana, indwara yo kudakora ku mutima mbere yo gusezera, n'indwara yo guhangayika mu mibanire y'abantu. Sertraline ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka zikunze kugaragara zirimo impiswi, imikorere mibi mu mibonano mpuzabitsina, no kugira ibibazo byo gusinzira. Ingaruka mbi zirimo kwiyongera k'ibyago byo kwiyahura ku bari munsi y'imyaka 25 ndetse n'indwara ya serotonin. Ntibirasobanuka neza niba gukoresha iyi miti mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa nta kibazo bifite. Ntibikwiye gukoreshwa hamwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bwa MAO. Bivugwa ko Sertraline ikora mu kongera ingaruka za serotonin mu bwonko.\nSertraline yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1991, igurishwa bwa mbere na Pfizer. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi yatanzwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima nk'umuti usimbura fluoxetine. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cyo kugurisha ku giciro kinini ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 1.50 ku kwezi guhera mu 2018. Mu 2016, ni wo muti ukunze kwandikirwa abantu benshi bo mu mutwe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, hamwe n\u2019imiti irenga miliyoni 37 yanditswe na muganga. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 14 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ufite imiti irenga miliyoni 38."}
{"id": "23316", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23316", "title": "Umuriro wa Dengue", "text": "Dengue fever ni indwara iterwa n'umubu iterwa na virusi ya dengue. Ibimenyetso bikunze gutangira nyuma y'iminsi itatu kugeza kuri cumi n'ine nyuma yo kwandura. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo umuriro mwinshi, kuribwa umutwe, kuruka, kubabara imitsi n'ingingo, ndetse no kugira uduheri ku ruhu. Gukira muri rusange bifata iminsi ibiri kugeza kuri irindwi. Mu ngero nke z'abarwayi, iyi ndwara ihinduka indwara ikomeye ya dengue, izwi kandi nka dengue hemorrhagic fever, bigatuma habaho kuva amaraso, urugero ruto rw'ibinure mu maraso n'amaraso ava, cyangwa ikaba indwara ya dengue shock syndrome, aho umuvuduko w'amaraso uba uri hasi cyane.\nDengue ikwirakwizwa n'ubwoko butandukanye bw'imibu y'ingore yo mu bwoko bwa \"Aedes\", cyane cyane \"A. aegypti\". Iyi virusi ifite ubwoko butanu; kwandura ubwoko bumwe akenshi bitanga ubudahangarwa bw'ubuzima bwose kuri ubwo bwoko, ariko ubundi bugatanga ubudahangarwa bw'igihe gito. Kwandura indwara nyuma y\u2019ubundi bwoko byongera ibyago bikomeye byo kurwara indwara. Hari ibizamini byinshi bihari kugira ngo byemezwe ko indwara yanduye harimo no kumenya abasirikare b\u2019umubiri banduye virusi cyangwa RNA yayo.\nUrukingo rwa dengue rwemewe kandi ruboneka ku isoko mu bihugu byinshi. Guhera mu 2025, urukingo rusabwa gusa ku bantu basanzwe baranduye, cyangwa mu baturage bafite igipimo kinini cy\u2019ubwandu mbere bafite imyaka 6 kugeza kuri 16. Ubundi buryo bwo kwirinda burimo kugabanya aho imibu ihurira no kugabanya ibyago byo kurumwa. Ibi bishobora gukorwa binyuze mu gukuraho cyangwa gupfuka amazi ahagaze no kwambara imyenda itwikira igice kinini cy'umubiri. Kuvura indwara ya dengue ikabije birafasha kandi bikubiyemo gutanga amazi mu kanwa cyangwa mu mitsi ku ndwara yoroheje cyangwa iri hagati. Ku ndwara zikomeye cyane, guterwa amaraso bishobora kuba ngombwa. Abantu bagera kuri kimwe cya kabiri cya miliyoni bakenera kwakirwa mu bitaro buri mwaka. Parasetamol (acetaminophen) ni yo isabwa aho gukoresha imiti igabanya ububabare itari iya steroide (NSAIDs) kugira ngo igabanye umuriro kandi igabanuke ububabare ku ndwara ya dengue bitewe n\u2019uko ibyago byo kuva amaraso biyongera bitewe no gukoresha NSAID. \nDengue yabaye ikibazo cy\u2019isi yose kuva mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y\u2019Isi Yose kandi ikunze kugaragara mu bihugu birenga 120, cyane cyane mu majyepfo y\u2019uburasirazuba bwa Aziya, Aziya y\u2019Epfo na Amerika y\u2019Epfo. Hagati ya 100 na 400\u00a0abantu miliyoni bandura buri mwaka kandi abagera ku 40.000 barapfa. Mu 2019, umubare w\u2019abandura wariyongereye cyane. Ibisobanuro bya mbere by'icyorezo ni ibyavuye mu 1779. Impamvu ya virusi n'ikwirakwira ryayo byasobanuwe mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20. Uretse kurandura imibu, hari n'akazi ko gufata imiti igamije kurwanya virusi. Ifatwa nk'indwara yo mu turere dushyuha yirengagijwe."}
{"id": "23317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23317", "title": "VIH/SIDA", "text": "Agakoko gatera SIDA gakwirakwizwa cyane cyane no gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina idakingiye (harimo no gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina mu kibuno no mu kanwa), guterwa amaraso yanduye, inshinge zo mu bwoko bwa \u201chypodermic\u201d, no kuva kuri nyina kugeza ku mwana mu gihe atwite, abyara cyangwa yonsa. Amwe mu mazi yo mu mubiri, nk'amacandwe, ibyuya n'amarira, ntabwo yanduza virusi. VIH ni kimwe mu bigize itsinda rya virusi zizwi nka retroviruses.\nUburyo bwo kwirinda burimo imibonano mpuzabitsina itekanye, gahunda zo guhererekanya inshinge, kuvura abanduye, kwirinda mbere na nyuma yo guhura n'icyorezo, no gukebwa kw'abagabo. Indwara ku mwana ishobora kwirindwa binyuze mu guha umubyeyi n'umwana imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi itera SIDA. Nta muti cyangwa urukingo bihari; icyakora, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara ishobora kugabanya igihe cy'uburwayi kandi igatuma umuntu abaho ubuzima busanzwe. Ubuvuzi bugirwa inama yo guhita butangira gupimwa. Hatabayeho kuvurwa, igihe mpuzandengo cyo kubaho nyuma yo kwandura ni 11\u00a0imyaka.\nMu 2021, abantu bagera kuri 38\u00a0Abantu miliyoni ku isi babana n'ubwandu bwa virusi itera SIDA kandi hapfuye abantu 650.000. Abagera kuri miliyoni 20.6 muri bo baba mu burasirazuba no mu majyepfo ya Afurika. Hagati y'igihe SIDA yamenyekanye (mu ntangiriro za 1980) na 2018, iyi ndwara yateye abantu bagera kuri 32\u00a0miliyoni z'abapfuye ku isi yose. VIH/SIDA ifatwa nk'icyorezo \u2014icyorezo kigaragara mu gace kanini kandi kirimo gukwirakwira cyane. Agakoko gatera SIDA kavuye ku zindi nyamaswa z\u2019inkende kagera ku bantu bo muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba bwo hagati mu ntangiriro kugeza hagati mu kinyejana cya 20. SIDA yamenyekanye bwa mbere n\u2019Ikigo cya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika gishinzwe kurwanya no gukumira indwara (CDC) mu 1981 kandi icyayiteye\u2014ubwandu bwa virusi itera SIDA\u2014yamenyekanye mu ntangiriro z\u2019ikinyejana.\nVIH/SIDA yagize ingaruka zikomeye kuri sosiyete, haba nk'indwara ndetse n'ivangura. Iyi ndwara kandi igira ingaruka zikomeye ku bukungu. Hari ibitekerezo byinshi bitari byo kuri VIH/SIDA, nko kwizera ko ishobora kwanduzwa no gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina mu buryo busanzwe. Iyi ndwara imaze kuvugwaho impaka nyinshi zijyanye n'amadini, harimo n'uko Kiliziya Gatolika ifata icyemezo cyo kudashyigikira ikoreshwa ry'agakingirizo mu kwirinda. Yakuruye ibitekerezo mpuzamahanga by\u2019ubuvuzi na politiki ndetse n\u2019inkunga nini kuva yamenyekana mu myaka ya 1980."}
{"id": "23318", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23318", "title": "Indwara ya Lyme", "text": "Indwara ya Lyme, izwi kandi nka Lyme borreliosis, ni indwara yandura iterwa na bagiteri \"ya Borrelia\" ikwirakwizwa n'udukoko. Ikimenyetso gikunze kugaragara cy'ubwandu ni ahantu hagaragara ubutuku ku ruhu, hazwi nka erythema migrans, hagaragara aho inkende yarumwe nyuma y'icyumweru kimwe ibaye. Ubusanzwe ibibyimba ntibiba bishyushye cyangwa ngo bibabaza. Hafi 70\u201380% by'abantu banduye barwara uduheri. Izindi ndwara zo mu ntangiriro zishobora kuba zirimo umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, umunaniro no kubyimba kw'imitsi. Akenshi birakemuka muri iki cyiciro. Iyo batavuwe, bamwe bashobora kubura ubushobozi bwo kwimura uruhande rumwe cyangwa byombi rw'isura, kubabara ingingo, kuribwa umutwe cyane hamwe no gukomera kw'ijosi, cyangwa gutera umutima mu gifu, n'ibindi. Nyuma y'amezi cyangwa imyaka, ububabare bw'ingingo no kubyimba bishobora kubaho kenshi. Rimwe na rimwe, abantu bagira ububabare bwo kurasa cyangwa kuribwa mu maboko no ku maguru. Nubwo bavuwe neza, abantu bagera kuri 10 kugeza kuri 20% bagira ububabare mu ngingo, ibibazo byo kwibuka no kunanirwa byibuze amezi atandatu.\nIndwara ya Lyme yandurira mu bantu binyuze mu kurumwa n'udusimba twanduye two mu bwoko bwa \"Ixodes\". Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, udukoko duhangayikishije akenshi tuba turi mu bwoko bwa \"Ixodes scapularis\", kandi tugomba gushyirwaho nibura amasaha 36 mbere yuko bagiteri ikwirakwira. Mu Burayi, udukoko two mu bwoko bwa \"Ixodes ricinus\" dushobora gukwirakwiza bagiteri vuba cyane. Muri Amerika ya Ruguru, bagiteri \"Borrelia burgdorferi\" na \"Borrelia mayonii\" ni byo bitera indwara ya Lyme. Mu Burayi no muri Aziya, \"Borrelia afzelii\" na \"Borrelia garinii\" nazo zitera indwara. Iyi ndwara isa nkaho idakwirakwira hagati y\u2019abantu, izindi nyamaswa, cyangwa binyuze mu biribwa. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso bitandukanye, amateka y\u2019uko umuntu yahuye n\u2019udukoko, ndetse no gupima uturemangingo tw\u2019umubiri mu maraso. Ibizamini by'amaraso akenshi biba ari bibi mu ntangiriro z'indwara. Gupima udukoko ku giti cyatwo ntabwo ari ingirakamaro. \nKwirinda birimo imbaraga zo gukumira kurumwa n'udukoko nko kwambara imyenda yo gupfuka amaboko n'amaguru, no gukoresha imiti yica udukoko ishingiye kuri DEET. Gukoresha imiti yica udukoko kugira ngo ugabanye umubare w'udukoko nabyo bishobora kugira akamaro. Udukoko dushobora gukurwaho hakoreshejwe udupira two gukururaho udupira. Iyo agakoko kakuweho kari kuzuye amaraso, doxycycline imwe ishobora gukoreshwa mu gukumira ubwandu, ariko muri rusange ntibyemewe kuko ubwandu bukunze kugaragara. Iyo habayeho ubwandu, imiti myinshi igabanya ubukana irakora neza, harimo doxycycline, amoxicillin, azithromycin, ceftriaxone, na cefuroxime. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi busanzwe bumara ibyumweru bibiri cyangwa bitatu. Hari abantu bagira umuriro n'ububabare bw'imitsi n'ingingo nyuma yo kuvurwa, ibyo bikaba bishobora kumara umunsi umwe cyangwa ibiri. Ku bantu bagaragaza ibimenyetso bidashira, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara ya antibiyotike mu gihe kirekire ntiyagaragaye ko ari ingirakamaro. \nIndwara ya Lyme ni yo ndwara ikunze gukwirakwizwa n'udusimba mu majyaruguru y'isi. Bivugwa ko yibasira abantu 300.000 buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika n'abantu 65.000 ku mwaka mu Burayi. Kwandura indwara bikunze kugaragara cyane mu mpeshyi no mu ntangiriro z'impeshyi. Indwara ya Lyme yasuzumwe nk'indwara yihariye ku nshuro ya mbere mu 1975 i Old Lyme, muri Connecticut. Mbere yitiranyijwe n'indwara ya rubagimpande y'abana. Bagiteri irimo yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1981 na Willy Burgdorfer. Ibimenyetso bidakira nyuma yo kuvurwa birasobanuwe neza kandi bizwi nka \"syndrome y'indwara ya Lyme nyuma yo kuvurwa\" (PTLDS). PTLDS itandukanye n'indwara ya Lyme idakira; ijambo ritagishyigikiwe n'abahanga mu bya siyansi kandi rikoreshwa mu buryo butandukanye n'amatsinda atandukanye. Bamwe mu batanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi bavuga ko PTLDS iterwa n'ubwandu buhoraho, ariko ibi ntibyizerwa ko ari ukuri kuko nta kimenyetso cy'ubwandu buhoraho gishobora kuboneka nyuma yo kuvurwa bisanzwe. Urukingo rw'indwara ya Lyme rwagurishijwe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika hagati ya 1998 na 2002, ariko rwakuwe ku isoko kubera ko rwagurishijwe nabi. Ubushakashatsi burakomeje kugira ngo hakorwe inkingo nshya."}
{"id": "23319", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23319", "title": "Sineseti", "text": "Synesthesia ni ikintu aho gukangura inzira imwe y'ibyumviro cyangwa iy'ubwenge binatuma habaho ubunararibonye butunguranye mu yindi nzira y'ibyumviro cyangwa iy'ubwenge. Ibintu bikunze gukangura ni inyuguti, imibare, cyangwa amagambo; naho ibintu bikunze kugaragara ni amabara cyangwa imiterere. Izindi ngero zishobora kuba zirimo iminsi, umuziki, uburyohe, cyangwa abantu. Abantu bashobora kuba bafite ubwoko burenze bumwe.\nImpamvu ntirasobanuka neza. Indwara zishobora kuvuka kare mu buzima cyangwa zikavuka nyuma y\u2019impanuka. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo amateka y'umuryango, gutakaza ubushobozi bwo kumva nk'ubuhumyi, n'ibintu nka aside lysergic diethylamide (LSD). Abagera kuri 40% by'abarwayi bafite uwo bafitanye isano yo ku rwego rwa mbere wafashwe n'iyi ndwara. Uburyo bw'ibanze bushobora kuba bukubiyemo kugabanuka kw'imitsi ibuza ubwonko cyangwa kugabanuka kw'imitsi ihuza. Haracyari ikiganiro gikomeje ku buryo bwiza bwo gusobanura iyo ndwara.\nHagati ya 2% na 20% by'abantu bagerwaho n'iki kibazo ku rugero runaka. Abagabo n'abagore basa nkaho bagerwaho n'ingaruka zimwe. Iyi ndwara ishobora kugira akamaro mu gutunganya ubwenge nko kugira ubushobozi bwo guhanga udushya. Bamwe bayikoresheje kugira ngo ifashe mu gufata mu mutwe.\nUrubanza rwa mbere rwanditswe rushobora kuba urwo mu 1690 rwanditswe n'umuhanga mu bya filozofiya John Locke, wavuze ku mugabo w'impumyi wabonye ibara ry'umutuku ubwo yumvaga ijwi ry'impanda. Ariko, bamwe barahakana niba ibyo Locke yavuze ari urugero nyakuri rw'imimerere cyangwa ari ikigereranyo. Inkuru ya mbere y\u2019ubuvuzi ivugwaho kuba yaranditswe n\u2019umuganga w\u2019Umudage witwa Georg Tobias Ludwig Sachs mu 1812. Iri jambo rikomoka ku Kigiriki cya kera, bisobanura \"hamwe\", na, bisobanura \" ibyiyumvo \". Abafite amateka maremare y'ibyo bintu bazwi nka synesthetes."}
{"id": "23320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23320", "title": "Guhagarika imitsi y'ibihaha", "text": "Kuziba kw'imitsi y'ibihaha (PE) ni ukuziba kw'imitsi y'amaraso mu bihaha bitewe n'ikintu cyavuye ahandi mu mubiri kinyuze mu maraso (embolism). Ibimenyetso bya PE bishobora kuba birimo kubura umwuka, kubabara mu gatuza cyane cyane iyo umuntu ahumeka, no gukorora amaraso. Ibimenyetso by'amaraso yapfutse mu kaguru bishobora no kugaragara, nko kuguru gutukura, gushyuha, kubyimba no kubabara. Ibimenyetso bya PE birimo urugero rwa ogisijeni mu maraso ruke, guhumeka vuba, umutima utera cyane, ndetse rimwe na rimwe n'umuriro muto. Indwara zikomeye zishobora gutera gucika intege, umuvuduko w'amaraso ugabanuka cyane, ndetse n'urupfu rutunguranye.\nUbusanzwe PE iterwa no kuzura kw'amaraso mu kaguru kakajya mu bihaha. Ibyago byo kuvura amaraso byiyongera bitewe na kanseri, kuryama igihe kirekire ku buriri, kunywa itabi, gucika intege mu bwonko, indwara zimwe na zimwe zikomoka ku ngirabuzimafatizo, imiti ikomoka kuri estrogen, gutwita, umubyibuho ukabije, ndetse na nyuma yo kubagwa. Igice gito cy'ibibazo biterwa no kwiyongera k'umwuka, ibinure, cyangwa amazi yo mu nda. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso n'ibimenyetso bihujwe n'ibisubizo by'ibizamini. Iyo ibyago biri hasi, ikizamini cy'amaraso kizwi nka D-dimer gishobora kugaragaza ko nta kibazo kirimo. Bitabaye ibyo, CT pulmonary angiography, isuzuma ry\u2019imitsi mu bihaha, cyangwa ultrasound y\u2019amaguru bishobora kwemeza ko ari byo byagaragaye. Hamwe na hamwe, thrombosis y'imitsi yo mu bwonko iteye imbere na PE bizwi nka thromboembolism y'imitsi yo mu bwonko (VTE). \nMu bikorwa byo gukumira indwara ya PE harimo gutangira kwimuka vuba bishoboka nyuma yo kubagwa, gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri yo hasi mu gihe cyo kwicara, no gukoresha imiti igabanya amaraso nyuma yo kubagwa ubwoko bumwe na bumwe. Ubuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya amaraso nka heparin, warfarin cyangwa imwe muri iyo miti igabanya amaraso mu kanwa (DOACs). Ibi bigirwa inama yo kubikoresha nibura amezi atatu. Indwara zikomeye zishobora gusaba ko habaho thrombolysis hakoreshejwe imiti nka tissue plasminogen activator (tPA) itangwa mu mitsi cyangwa binyuze muri catheter, kandi zimwe zishobora gusaba kubagwa (pulmonary thrombectomy). Niba imiti igabanya amaraso idakwiye, ushobora gukoresha akayunguruzo k'agateganyo ka vena cava. \nIndwara yo mu bihaha yibasira abantu bagera ku 430.000 buri mwaka mu Burayi. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, abantu bari hagati ya 300.000 na 600.000 bandura buri mwaka, bigatuma impfu ziri hagati ya 50.000 na 200.000. Igipimo cy\u2019indwara y\u2019igitsina gabo n\u2019igitsina gore kirangana. Bigenda birushaho kuba byinshi uko abantu bagenda bakura. "}
{"id": "23321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23321", "title": "Elizaphan Ntakirutimana", "text": "Elizaphan Ntakirutimana (1924 \u2013 22 Mutarama 2007) yari umushumba w\u2019Umunyarwanda w\u2019Itorero ry\u2019Abadivantisiti b\u2019Umunsi wa Karindwi. Ni we mupadiri wa mbere wahamwe n'icyaha cyo kugira uruhare runini mu buyobozi muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994.\nMuri Gashyantare 2003, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda rwahamije Ntakirutimana n'umuhungu we Dr. G\u00e9rard, umuganga warangije amasomo ye muri Amerika mbere yo kugaruka mu Rwanda, icyaha cyo gufasha no gushyigikira jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu byakorewe mu Rwanda mu 1994. Urukiko rwasanze byaragaragaye nta gushidikanya ko Ntakirutimana, na we wo mu bwoko bw\u2019Abahutu, yari yaratwaye abagabye igitero bitwaje intwaro abajyana mu kigo cya Mugonero, aho bishe amagana y\u2019impunzi z\u2019Abatutsi. Ntakirutimana yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka 10. Yahamijwe icyaha hashingiwe ku nkuru z\u2019abatangabuhamya babonye. Ingero nyinshi z'ibyaha byahamijwe zateshejwe agaciro mu bujurire ariko igihano cyatanzwe nticyahindutse. Yarekuwe ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2006, nyuma yo kumara imyaka 10 afunzwe cyangwa muri gereza, maze arapfa mu kwezi kwakurikiyeho. \nIbaruwa yari yandikiwe Ntakirutimana n\u2019abapasiteri b\u2019Abadivantisiti b\u2019Umunsi wa Karindwi b\u2019Abatutsi, akaba yarayeretse umwanditsi Philip Gourevitch, ni yo yahaye umutwe igitabo cya Gourevitch cyasohotse mu 1998, cyitwa We Wish to Inform You That Tomorrow We Will Be Killed With Our Families (Turifuza kukumenyesha ko ejo tuzicwa turi kumwe n\u2019imiryango yacu). Icyo gitabo gishinja Ntakirutimana kugira uruhare mu rupfu rw\u2019impunzi."}
{"id": "23322", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23322", "title": "Oxycodone", "text": "Oxycodone, igurishwa ku izina rya OxyContin n'indi, ni umuti wa opioid ukoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare buri hagati kugeza ku bukomere. Ubusanzwe ifatwa mu kanwa, kandi iboneka mu buryo bworoshye kandi bugenzurwa. Gutangira kugabanya ububabare bitangira mu minota 15 bikamara amasaha agera kuri atandatu iyo umuti utangiye gusohoka ako kanya. Mu Bwongereza, iboneka hakoreshejwe inshinge. Ibikoresho bivanze biraboneka kandi hamwe na parasetamol (acetaminophen), ibuprofen, naloxone, na aspirine.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo impatwe, isesemi, gusinzira, isereri, uburyaryate, kuma mu kanwa no kubira ibyuya. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kuba umuntu urwaye indwara yo mu mutwe, kwiheba mu myanya y'ubuhumekero (kugabanuka k'umuvuduko w'amaraso), no kugabanuka k'umuvuduko w'amaraso. Abantu bafite ubwivumbure kuri codeine bashobora no kuba bafite ubwivumbure kuri oxycodone. Gukoresha oxycodone mu gihe cyo gutwita bigaragara ko nta kibazo kirimo. Kureka opioid bishobora kubaho iyo bihagaritswe vuba. Oxycodone ikora binyuze mu gukora receptor ya \u03bc-opioid. Iyo inyowe mu kanwa, igira ingaruka zikubye inshuro 1.5 z'ingano ingana na morphine. \nOxycodone yakozwe bwa mbere mu Budage mu 1916 ivanywe muri thebaine. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi yatanzwe n'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima nk'umusimbura wa morphine. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cya buri dose kiri munsi ya 0.30$ y'Amerika mu 2018. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 52 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 15. Oxycodone yabaye ikiyobyabwenge gikunze gukoreshwa cyane. Hari imiti myinshi igabanya ubukana bw'ihohoterwa iboneka, urugero nk'iyo ivanze na naloxone."}
{"id": "23323", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23323", "title": "Ubwoba bw'agoraphobia", "text": "Agoraphobia ni indwara yo guhangayika irangwa n'ibimenyetso by'ihungabana mu bihe aho umuntu abona ko aho atuye hatari umutekano kandi nta buryo bworoshye bwo kubihunga. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo ahantu hafunguye, ubwikorezi rusange, amaduka, cyangwa kuba hanze y'urugo rwabo gusa. Kuba muri ibi bihe bishobora gutera ubwoba. Ibimenyetso bigaragara hafi buri gihe iyo ikibazo kibonetse kandi bikamara amezi arenga atandatu. Abazagira ingaruka bazakora ibishoboka byose kugira ngo birinde ibi bibazo. Mu bihe bikomeye abantu bashobora kunanirwa burundu kuva mu ngo zabo.\nAgoraphobia bikekwa ko iterwa n'uruvange rw'ibintu bigize imiterere y'umubiri n'ibidukikije. Iyi ndwara ikunze kugaragara mu miryango, kandi ibintu bibabaza cyangwa bibabaza nko gupfa k'umubyeyi cyangwa guterwa bishobora kuba imbarutso. Muri DSM-5, agoraphobia ishyirwa mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubwoba hamwe n\u2019ubwoba bwihariye hamwe n\u2019ubwoba bwo mu mibanire. Izindi ndwara zishobora gutera ibimenyetso nk'ibyo zirimo guhangayika mu gihe umuntu atandukana n'undi, indwara yo guhangayika nyuma y'ihungabana, n'indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba. Abarwaye bafite ibyago byinshi byo kwiheba no kurwara indwara yo gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge.\nIyo hatabayeho kuvurwa, ntabwo ari byiza ko agoraphobia ikemuka. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe ubwoko bw'ubujyanama bwitwa \" cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT). CBT iratanga igisubizo ku bantu bagera kuri kimwe cya kabiri. Agoraphobia yibasira abantu bakuru bagera kuri 1.7%. Abagore bibasirwa inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagabo. Iyi ndwara ikunze gutangirira mu bwana bw\u2019umuntu, ikagabanuka cyane mu gihe cy\u2019izabukuru. Ni gake cyane ku bana. Ijambo \"agoraphobia\" rikomoka ku rurimi rw'ikigereki, bisobanura \" ikibanza rusange,\" na, bisobanura \"ubwoba.\" "}
{"id": "23324", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23324", "title": "Indwara yo kudahuza n'abandi", "text": "Indwara yo kudahuza n'abandi (ASPD cyangwa APD) ni indwara y'imibanire irangwa no kwirengagiza uburenganzira bw'abandi igihe kirekire. Akenshi hari amateka y\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi, kubeshya kenshi, gutegura nabi, imyitwarire mibi, kutita ku mutekano w\u2019abandi, no kutita ku bandi nyuma yo kubagirira nabi. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo ubushomeri no kwiyahura.\nIbintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo amateka y'umuryango, ubukene, n'ihohoterwa ry'abana cyangwa abatarubakiwe. Ibimenyetso bigaragara kuva umuntu afite nibura imyaka 15 kandi ikibazo cy\u2019imyitwarire kigaragara mbere y\u2019iyo myaka. Gusuzuma indwara ku mugaragaro bisaba ko umuntu aba afite imyaka irenga 17. Ibimenyetso by'indwara yo kudahuza abantu nabyo byavuzwe ko ari indwara yo mu mutwe, sociopathy, na disorder de personality (DPD). Ni indwara y\u2019imiterere y\u2019umuntu yo mu itsinda rya B.\nNta buryo bwihariye bwo kuvura, hashyirwaho imbaraga zigamije kunoza ibimenyetso. Kujyanwa mu bitaro ntibyagaragaye ko ari ingirakamaro. ASPD yagize ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri 0.2% kugeza kuri 3.3% mu mwaka runaka. Abagabo bibasirwa n\u2019indwara inshuro eshatu kurusha abagore. Mu bagabo bafite inzoga ziterwa no gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge, igipimo cy\u2019indwara gishobora kuba kirenze 70%. Iyi ndwara ishobora kugabanuka uko umuntu agenda akura. Abahuye n\u2019iki kibazo bashobora gupfa bazize urugomo."}
{"id": "23325", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23325", "title": "Indwara ya Guillain-Barr\u00e9", "text": "Indwara ya Guillain-Barr\u00e9 (GBS) ni intege nke z'imitsi zitangira vuba bitewe n'uko ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri bwangiza uturemangingo tw'imitsi yo mu gice cy'imbere cy'umubiri. Ubusanzwe, impande zombi z'umubiri ziba zirimo, kandi ibimenyetso bya mbere ni impinduka mu buryo umuntu yumva cyangwa agira ububabare akenshi mu mugongo hamwe n'intege nke z'imitsi, bitangirira ku birenge no ku biganza, akenshi bigakwirakwira mu maboko no hejuru y'umubiri. Ibimenyetso bishobora kugaragara mu gihe cy'amasaha menshi cyangwa ibyumweru bike. Mu gihe cy\u2019ihungabana rikomeye, iyi ndwara ishobora gushyira ubuzima mu kaga, aho abantu bagera kuri 15 ku ijana bagira intege nke mu mitsi yo guhumeka, bityo bikaba ngombwa ko bahumeka hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa \"mechanical breath\". Bamwe bagerwaho n'impinduka mu mikorere y'imitsi ikora ku buryo bworoshye, ibyo bikaba byatera indwara ziterwa n'umuvuduko w'amaraso n'umutima.\nNubwo impamvu itazwi, imikorere yayo ishingiye ku ndwara y\u2019ubwirinzi bw\u2019umubiri aho ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri bwibasira imitsi yo mu mpande z\u2019umubiri mu buryo butari bwo maze bukangiza ubwishingizi bwa myelin. Hari igihe ubu burwayi bw'umubiri buterwa n'ubwandu cyangwa, akenshi bitewe no kubagwa, kandi gake cyane bitewe no gukingirwa. Ubusanzwe indwara iterwa n'ibimenyetso n'ibimenyetso, binyuze mu gukuraho izindi mpamvu, kandi igashyigikirwa n'ibizamini nko kwiga uburyo imitsi ikora ndetse no gusuzuma amazi yo mu bwonko. Hari ubwoko butandukanye bushingiye ku bice by'intege nke, ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi ku mitsi ndetse no kuba hari ubudahangarwa bumwe na bumwe bw'umubiri. Ishyirwa mu cyiciro cya polyneuropathy ikabije.\nKu bantu bafite intege nke cyane, kuvurwa vuba hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya ubukana bw\u2019umubiri (immunoglobulines) cyangwa plasmapheresis, hamwe n\u2019ubuvuzi bufasha, bizatuma abantu benshi bakira neza. Gukira bishobora gufata ibyumweru kugeza ku myaka, hafi kimwe cya gatatu kikaba gifite intege nke zidashira. Ku isi yose, impfu ziba hafi 7.5% by'abazirwaye. Indwara ya Guillain-Barr\u00e9 ikunze kugaragara, ku bantu 100.000 buri mwaka, umuntu umwe cyangwa babiri barwaye indwara nk'iyo. Imboro zombi ndetse n'ibice byose by'isi bifite igipimo kimwe cy'indwara. Iyi ndwara yitiriwe abaganga b'indwara z'imitsi b'Abafaransa Georges Guillain na Jean Alexandre Barr\u00e9, basobanuye iyi ndwara hamwe n'umuganga w'Umufaransa Andr\u00e9 Strohl mu 1916."}
{"id": "23326", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23326", "title": "Indwara y'umuntu ugoranye", "text": "Indwara y'umuntu urwaye indwara yo mu bwonko (SPS) iterwa no gukomera kw'imitsi no gucika intege bigakomeza kwiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Bigira ingaruka cyane cyane ku gituza, amaboko n'amaguru. Gucika intege bishobora guterwa n'ijwi, gukorakoraho, cyangwa amarangamutima. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo imiterere mibi, kuvunika amagufwa, ububabare budakira, no kugwa kenshi.\nAkenshi impamvu ntiramenyekana neza, nubwo bikekwa ko hari uburyo bwo kurwanya indwara ziterwa n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri. Abantu benshi bahura n'izindi ndwara ziterwa n'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri, nka diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1. Nibisanzwe bibaho nk'indwara ya paraneoplastic. Gusuzuma akenshi ni ukumenya ko hari ubudahangarwa bwinshi cyane bwa aside glutamic decarboxylase (GAD) mu maraso cyangwa mu mazi yo mu bwonko. Electromyography bishobora kandi kuba ingirakamaro.\nIbimenyetso bishobora kuvurwa n'imiti nka diazepam, baclofen, cyangwa gabapentin. Immunoglobulin cyangwa plasmapheresis yo mu mitsi na byo bishobora gufasha. Muri rusange bitera ubuzima bubi, bigatuma umuntu agira ihungabana cyangwa imihangayiko. Icyizere cy'ubuzima kiragabanuka.\nIndwara y\u2019umuntu uhorana ubumuga ikunze kugaragara, ikaba igaragara ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe. Indwara ikunze kugaragara cyane hagati y\u2019imyaka 20 na 60, nubwo ishobora kugaragara ku bana mu buryo budasanzwe. Abagore bibasirwa inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagabo. Iyi ndwara yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1956 na Frederick Moersch na Henry Woltman."}
{"id": "23327", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23327", "title": "Kanseri y'inkondo y'umura", "text": "Kanseri y'inkondo y'umura (CRC), izwi kandi nka kanseri y'amara, kanseri y'inkondo y'umura, cyangwa kanseri y'inkondo y'umura, ni ukwiyongera kw'uturemangingo tudasanzwe mu mara cyangwa mu mara manini. Ifite ubushobozi bwo kwinjira cyangwa gukwirakwira mu bindi bice by'umubiri. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo amaraso mu mwanda, impinduka mu mara, kugabanya ibiro, kumva umunaniro, no kubabara mu nda.\nKanseri nyinshi zo mu mara ziterwa n'izabukuru n'imibereho, aho umubare muto cyane w'abandura uterwa n'indwara zikomoka ku ngirabuzimafatizo. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera iyi ndwara zirimo imirire, umubyibuho ukabije, kunywa itabi, no kutagira imyitozo ngororamubiri. Ibintu byongera ibyago birimo inyama zitukura, inyama zatunganyijwe, n'inzoga. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera ibyago zirimo kuvurwa hakoreshejwe imirasire mu kibuno, n'indwara zo kubyimba amara Indwara ya Crohn na colitis y'ibisebe. Zimwe mu ndwara z\u2019uturemangingo dushobora gutera kanseri y\u2019inkondo y\u2019umura zirimo polyposis yo mu muryango na kanseri y\u2019inkondo y\u2019umura idakomoka ku mara; icyakora, izi ni munsi ya 5% by\u2019abanduye. Ubusanzwe itangira nk'ikibyimba kitarimo indwara, akenshi mu buryo bwa polyp, iyo igenda ihinduka kanseri. Kanseri zo mu mara zishobora kugabanywamo ibice bitandukanye n'aho zibera mu mara: uruhande rw'iburyo, uruhande rw'ibumoso n'urw'inyuma.\nKanseri y'amara ishobora gupimwa hakoreshejwe icyitegererezo cy'amara mu gihe cyo gupima sigmoidoscopy cyangwa colonoscopy. Hanyuma hagakurikiraho isuzuma ry\u2019abaganga kugira ngo hamenyekane niba indwara yarakwirakwiriye. Gusuzuma ifite akamaro mu gukumira no kugabanya impfu ziterwa na kanseri y'inkondo y'umura. Gusuzuma, hakoreshejwe bumwe mu buryo butandukanye, birasabwa guhera ku myaka 45 kugeza kuri 75. Mu gihe cyo gupima colonoscopy, polyps nto zishobora gukurwaho iyo zibonetse. Iyo habonetse polyp nini cyangwa ikibyimba, hashobora gukorwa biopsy kugira ngo harebwe niba ari kanseri. Aspirine n'indi miti igabanya ububyimbirwe itari steroide bigabanya ibyago byo kubyimba. Nubwo bimeze gutyo, ikoreshwa ryabyo muri rusange ntiryifuzwa kubera ingaruka mbi.\nUburyo bwo kuvura kanseri y'inkondo y'umura bushobora kuba burimo uburyo bwo kubaga, gukoresha imirasire, imiti ivura kanseri ndetse n'uburyo bwo kuvura hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga. Kanseri zifungiye mu rukuta rw'amara zishobora gukira hakoreshejwe kubagwa, mu gihe kanseri yakwirakwiriye cyane idakunze kuvurwa, aho uburyo bwo kuyivura bugamije kunoza ubuzima n'ibimenyetso by'indwara. Ku ndwara zo mu gace zigaragara hakiri kare, igipimo cyo kubaho mu myaka itanu ni hafi 90%, ariko iyo kanseri imaze gukwirakwira, igabanuka ikagera kuri 14%. Igipimo cy'imyaka 5 yo kubaho muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika kiri hafi 65%. Amahirwe yo kubaho ku muntu ku giti cye aterwa n\u2019uko kanseri igeze ku rugero, niba kanseri yose ishobora gukurwaho hakoreshejwe kubagwa ndetse n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019umuntu muri rusange.\nKanseri y'inkondo y'umura ni yo kanseri ikunze kugaragara cyane mu mara. Mu 2020, habayeho abarwayi bashya miliyoni 1.93 n'abapfuye 916.000 bazize iyi ndwara. Bigize hafi 10% by'abarwayi bose. Ni kanseri ya gatatu ikunze kugaragara cyane mu bagabo no ku mwanya wa kabiri mu bagore. Ntabwo bikunze kugaragara ku bagore kurusha abagabo. Bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu byateye imbere, aho abarenga 65% by'abanduye baboneka."}
{"id": "23328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23328", "title": "Fluoxetine", "text": "Fluoxetine, igurishwa ku mazina y\u2019ibirango bya Prozac na Sarafem n\u2019ibindi, ni umuti ugabanya ubukana bw\u2019indwara zo mu bwoko bwa serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI). Ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba, (OCD), bulimia nervosa, indwara yo gucika intege, n'indwara yo kudakora ku mutima mbere yo gushyingirwa. Bishobora kugabanya ibyago byo kwiyahura ku bantu barengeje imyaka 65. Yanakoreshejwe mu kuvura gusohora imburagihe. Fluoxetine ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kubura ibiribwa, gusinzira nabi, kudakora neza mu mibonano mpuzabitsina, kubura ubushake bwo kurya, kuma mu kanwa, kubyimba no kurota inzozi zidasanzwe. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zirimo serotonin syndrome, mania, igicuri, ibyago byinshi byo kwiyahura ku bantu bari munsi y'imyaka 25, ndetse n'ibyago byinshi byo kuva amaraso. Iyo ihagaritswe mu buryo butunguranye, indwara yo kwiheba ishobora gutera guhangayika, isereri, n'impinduka mu buryo umuntu yumva. Ntibirasobanuka neza niba ari byiza mu gihe utwite. Niba waramaze gufata umuti, byaba byiza gukomeza mu gihe cyo konsa. Imikorere yayo ntabwo isobanutse neza ariko bikekwa ko ifitanye isano no kongera imikorere ya serotonin mu bwonko.\nFluoxetine yavumbuwe na Eli Lilly and Company mu 1972, itangira gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1986. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cy\u2019igurishwa ry\u2019ibicuruzwa mu bihugu biri mu nzira y\u2019amajyambere kiri hagati ya 0.01 na 0.04 ku munsi guhera mu 2014. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igura hafi 0.85 ku munsi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 31 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 21."}
{"id": "23329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23329", "title": "Propofol", "text": "Propofol, yamamazwa nka Diprivan, mu yandi mazina, ni umuti ukora vuba utuma umuntu agabanuka mu bwenge ndetse no kubura kwibuka ibyabaye. Imikoreshereze yayo irimo gutangiza no kubungabunga uburyo bwo gusinziriza indwara rusange, gusinziriza abantu bakuru bafite umwuka uhagije, no gusinziriza indwara. Ikoreshwa kandi ku ndwara ya status epilepticus iyo indi miti itarakora. Itangwa binyuze mu gutera mu mitsi, kandi ingaruka ntarengwa zigera ku minota ibiri kugira ngo iboneke kandi akenshi imara iminota itanu kugeza ku icumi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara za propofol zirimo umuvuduko w'umutima utari mwiza, umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi, kumva ubushyuhe aho umuntu atewe ndetse no guhagarika guhumeka. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo gucika intege, kwandura indwara ziterwa no gukoresha nabi, kuba imbata, ndetse no kugira indwara ya propofol infusion syndrome iyo ikoreshejwe igihe kirekire. Uyu muti usa nkaho ufite umutekano wo kuwukoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita ariko ntabwo wasuzumwe neza kugira ngo uwukoreshe muri iki kibazo. Ntibyemewe gukoreshwa mu gihe cyo kubagwa. Si umuti ugabanya ububabare, bityo imiti ya opioid nka morphine nayo ishobora gukoreshwa, ariko niba ihora ikenewe cyangwa idakenewe ntibirasobanuka neza. Bikekwa ko Propofol ikora nibura igice cyayo binyuze muri receptor ya GABA.\nPropofol yavumbuwe mu 1977 yemererwa gukoreshwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1989. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima kandi iraboneka nk'umuti rusange. Igiciro cya buguzi mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya 0.61 na 8.50 USD kuri buri kapu. Byitwaga amata ya amnesia (ikinamico ku ' mata ya magnesia '), bitewe n'uko ikoreshwa mu mitsi rimeze nk'amata. Propofol ikoreshwa kandi mu buvuzi bw'amatungo mu gusinziriza. "}
{"id": "23330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23330", "title": "Myasthenia gravis", "text": "Myasthenia gravis (MG) ni indwara y'imitsi ifata imitsi mu gihe kirekire iganisha ku ntege nke z'imitsi mu buryo butandukanye. Imitsi ikunze kwibasirwa cyane ni iyo mu maso, mu maso no mu mitsi yo kumira. Bishobora gutuma umuntu abona ibintu bibiri, amaso ye akagira amagufwa, avuga nabi, ndetse akagenda nabi. Gutangira bishobora kuba mu buryo butunguranye. Abarwaye akenshi baba bafite thymus nini cyangwa bakagira thymoma.\nMyasthenia gravis ni indwara iterwa n\u2019uturemangingo tw\u2019umubiri dukingira cyangwa tugasenya uduce twa nikotine acetylcholine aho imitsi n\u2019imitsi bihurira. Ibi birinda imitsi gutera imitsi gucika intege. Imiti imwe ishobora kongera intege nke. Ni gake cyane, inenge y\u2019uturemangingo mu mikoranire y\u2019imitsi itera indwara nk\u2019iyo izwi nka myasthenia yo mu maraso. Abana b'ababyeyi bafite indwara ya myasthenia bashobora kugira ibimenyetso mu mezi yabo ya mbere y'ubuzima, bizwi nka myasthenia y'impinja. Gusuzuma bishobora gushyigikirwa n'ibizamini by'amaraso ku byerekeye uturemangingo twihariye, ikizamini cya edrophonium, cyangwa inyigo yo kuyobora imitsi.\nMuri rusange, indwara ya Myasthenia gravis ivurwa n'imiti izwi nka acetylcholinesterase inhibitors nka neostigmine na pyridostigmine. Imiti igabanya ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri, nka prednisone cyangwa azathioprine, nayo ishobora gukoreshwa. Gukuraho thymus bishobora kongerera ibimenyetso mu bihe bimwe na bimwe. Plasmapheresis na immunoglobulin yo mu mitsi ishobora gukoreshwa mu gihe habayeho kugurumana gutunguranye kw'indwara. Iyo imitsi yo guhumeka icitse intege cyane, hashobora kuba ngombwa guhumeka hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa \"mechanical air conditioner\". Iyo imiti ibuza acetylcholinesterase ikoreshejwe mu muyoboro ishobora gufatwa by'agateganyo kugira ngo igabanye imyuka y'ubuhumekero.\nMG ifata abantu 50 kugeza kuri 200 kuri miliyoni. Ivurwa vuba mu bantu batatu kugeza kuri 30 kuri miliyoni buri mwaka. Gusuzuma indwara biri kugenda birushaho kwiyongera bitewe no kwiyongera k'ubumenyi. Ikunze kugaragara cyane ku bagore bari munsi y'imyaka 40 no ku bagabo bari hejuru y'imyaka 60. Ni ibidasanzwe ku bana. Iyo umuntu avuwe, abenshi mu barwaye babayeho ubuzima busanzwe kandi bafite igihe cyo kubaho gisanzwe. Iryo jambo rikomoka ku kigereki \"mys\" \"muscle\" na \"astheneia\" \"weakness\", naho mu kilatini \"gravis\" \"serious\"."}
{"id": "23331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23331", "title": "Callixte Mbarushimana", "text": "Callixte Mbarushimana (24 Nyakanga 1963 - 4 Ukwakira 2026) yari Umukozi w\u2019Abahutu n\u2019Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye (1992 \u2013 2001) bivugwa ko yagize uruhare muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994. Ku itariki ya 28 Nzeri 2010, Mbarushimana yashinjwe n'Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha (ICC) i La Haye ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara bivugwa ko byakorewe muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu 2009. Yatawe muri yombi mu Bufaransa mu Ukwakira 2010 yoherezwa muri ICC ku ya 25 Mutarama 2011. Ariko, yarekuwe ku ya 23 Ukuboza 2011 kubera ko ICC yasanze nta bimenyetso bihagije byo kumushinja.\nBivugwa ko yagize uruhare muri Jenoside yo mu Rwanda.\nMbarushimana bivugwa ko yayoboye kandi akagira uruhare mu iyicwa ry\u2019abantu 32 mu 1994, barimo n\u2019abakozi ba Loni yahawe inshingano zo kurinda. Yirukanwe muri Loni mu 2001 ariko mu 2004 yatsinze urubanza rwasabaga indishyi zo kwirukanwa kwe. \nMbarushimana yinjiye muri Loni mu 1992, akomeza kuba umukozi kugeza mu 2001 akorera muri Angola na Kosovo. Mu gihe cya Jenoside, Mbarushimana yasigiwe inshingano zo gutanga ibikoresho n'inkunga ku bakozi b'igihugu ba Loni bari basigaye inyuma nyuma y'uko Loni yirukanye abakozi mpuzamahanga b'abasivili. Callixte Mbarushimana, izina ridasanzwe nk'imyaka yabanjirije Jenoside, azwiho kwitabira imyigaragambyo yo kwamagana Abatutsi. Byongeye kandi, ibimenyetso byakusanyijwe n'itsinda rya TPIR ryateguraga inyandiko y'ibirego bimushinja byagaragaje ko mbere y'intambara yatoje umutwe w'ingabo ku giti cye. Mbarushimana ashinjwa kuba atari yarashyikirije ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda imodoka n\u2019ibikoresho bya Loni (urugero: Interahamwe) cyangwa igisirikare gusa, ahubwo anashinjwa kugira uruhare rutaziguye mu kwica no gutanga amategeko yo kwica abantu mu gihe cya jenoside. Mu bakozi ba Loni bivugwa ko Mbarushimana yaba yarishe harimo Florence Ngirumpatse, umuyobozi w\u2019abakozi ku biro by\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye i Kigali. \nUbwo umushakashatsi ku byaha by\u2019intambara Tony Grieg yakoraga ubushakashatsi ku rubanza rwa Mbarushimana, yabajije nibura abantu 20 babonye ubwo bwicanyi maze yemeza ko Mbarushimana yagize uruhare rutaziguye. Ariko, Mbarushimana ntiyigeze ashinjwa ibyo byaha, wenda kubera ko atari afatwa nk'umwe mu bateguye ubwicanyi. \nYashinjwe n'Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha.\nKu ya 11 Ukwakira 2010, Mbarushimana yatawe muri yombi mu Bufaransa hashingiwe ku mpapuro zo kumuta muri yombi zatanzwe n\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha (ICC), akurikiranyweho ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n\u2019ibyaha by\u2019intambara bivugwa ko byakorewe mu ntara za Kivu, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (RDC).\nIzo mpapuro zo kumuta muri yombi zishingiye ku bitero byinshi bivugwa ko byagabwe n\u2019ingabo za FDLR ku basivili bo muri Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru na Kivu y\u2019Amajyepfo mu mwaka wa 2009. Abacamanza b\u2019urukiko bavuze ko hari impamvu zifatika zituma bakeka ko Mbarushimana, wari Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa wa FDLR, yagize uruhare muri ibyo bitero. Mu byaha yashinjwaga harimo ubwicanyi, iyicarubozo, gufata ku ngufu, gutoteza n\u2019ibindi bikorwa by\u2019ubugome.\nInyandiko y\u2019ibirego yanavugaga ko Mbarushimana yagize uruhare muri gahunda yari igamije guteza ikibazo gikomeye cy\u2019ubutabazi n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage, kugira ngo FDLR ibone imbaraga za politiki.\nKu itariki ya 25 Mutarama 2011, Mbarushimana yoherejwe mu Rukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha kugira ngo akurikiranweho icyaha i La Haye. Umushinjacyaha Luis Moreno-Ocampo yasohoye itangazo aho yibukije ko FDLR ya Mbarushimana ari yo yateje intambara zo muri Kongo kandi ko abakobwa n'abagore bagiye bahura n'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina mu gihe cy'imyaka hafi ibiri ishize. Yavuze ko, kubera ICC, \"gufata ku ngufu bitagishobora gukoreshwa nk'intwaro y'intambara\". \nYarekuwe.\nKu itariki ya 16 Ukuboza 2011, Urugereko rwa Mbere rw\u2019Iremezo rwa ICC, ku bwiganze bwa babiri kuri umwe, rwatesheje agaciro ibirego byaregwaga Mbarushimana, rushingiye ku kuba nta bimenyetso bihagije byari bihari byo kwemeza ko yagize uruhare mu byaha by\u2019intambara muri Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru n\u2019iy\u2019Amajyepfo. Ubujurire bwa Porokireri bwo kureka gufungurwa byihuse bwanzwe ku ya 23 Ukuboza, maze Mbarushimana arekurwa uwo munsi. Ku itariki ya 30 Gicurasi 2012, Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rwa ICC narwo rwanze ubujurire bw'Umushinjacyaha ku cyemezo cyo kutamukurikirana. \nUrugendo rugana mu Bufaransa.\nKu itariki ya 7 Mata 2024, Perezida w\u2019u Rwanda Paul Kagame yashinje Mbarushimana kuba \u201cyaratanze ku bicanyi\u201d mubyara wa Paul Kagame. Kagame yagize ati: \u201cNyuma yakomeje akazi ke mu Muryango w\u2019Abibumbye imyaka myinshi, ndetse na nyuma y\u2019uko ibimenyetso bimushinja bigaragaye.\u201d \u201cAracyari umuntu wigenga, ubu aba mu Bufaransa\u201d. Ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2024, ubutabera bw'u Bufaransa bwakuyeho ibirego byaregwaga Mbarushimana, wakurikiranyweho ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. \nUrupfu.\nMbarushimana yapfiriye mu Bufaransa afite imyaka 63 ku ya 4 Ukwakira 2026. "}
{"id": "23332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23332", "title": "Udukoko tw'agakoko k'ingirabuzimafatizo", "text": "Ikibyimba cya ganglion ni ikibyimba cyuzuye amazi gifitanye isano n'agahu k'ingingo cyangwa umutsi. Akenshi biba inyuma y'ukuboko hagakurikiraho imbere y'ukuboko. Gutangira kwandura akenshi bimara amezi menshi. Ubusanzwe nta bindi bimenyetso bihari. Hari igihe ububabare cyangwa ibinya bishobora kubaho. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo indwara ya carpal tunnel syndrome.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana. Bikekwa ko uburyo bw'ibanze bukoresha gusohora membrane ya synovial. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo gymnastics. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku gusuzuma urumuri rumurikira mu gisebe ari rwo rushyigikira. Gufata amashusho mu buvuzi bishobora gukorwa kugira ngo harebwe izindi mpamvu zishobora kubaho.\nUburyo bwo kuvura burimo gutegereza witonze, gukata ingingo yangiritse, gukurura urushinge, cyangwa kubagwa. Hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'igihe bakemura ubwabo. Abantu bagera kuri 3 ku bantu 10.000 bashya barwara ganglion yo mu kuboko cyangwa ku kuboko buri mwaka. Zikunze kugaragara cyane mu bagore bakiri bato n'abageze mu zabukuru. Kugerageza kuvura igisebe ukoresheje igitabo birabujijwe."}
{"id": "23333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23333", "title": "Diphtheria", "text": "Diphtheria ni indwara iterwa na bagiteri ya \"Corynebacterium diphtheriae\". Ibimenyetso bishobora gutandukana kuva ku byoroheje kugeza ku bikomeye. Ubusanzwe bitangira nyuma y'iminsi ibiri kugeza kuri itanu nyuma yo kugaragara. Ibimenyetso akenshi biza buhoro buhoro, bitangirana no kubabara mu muhogo no kugira umuriro. Mu bihe bikomeye, ibara ry'umukara cyangwa umweru ritangira kugaragara mu muhogo. Ibi bishobora kuziba inzira y'ubuhumekero no gutera inkorora ikaze nk'uko bigenda mu gihe cy'ikibuno. Ijosi rishobora kubyimba igice bitewe n'uturemangingo tw'imitsi twinshi. Hari ubwoko bwa diphtheria bufata uruhu, amaso cyangwa imyanya ndangagitsina. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo myocarditis, kubyimba kw'imitsi, ibibazo by'impyiko, n'ibibazo byo kuva amaraso bitewe n'urugero ruto rw'ibinure mu maraso. Myocarditis ishobora gutera umuvuduko udasanzwe w'umutima, kandi kubyimba kw'imitsi bishobora gutera ubumuga.\nIndwara ya diphtheria ikunze gukwirakwira hagati y'abantu binyuze mu gukoranaho cyangwa binyuze mu kirere. Ishobora kandi gukwirakwizwa n'ibintu byanduye. Hari abantu batwara iyi bagiteri nta bimenyetso bafite, ariko bashobora kuyikwirakwiza no kuyikwirakwiza ku bandi. Ubwoko butatu bw'ingenzi bwa \"C. diphtheriae\" butera ubukana butandukanye bw'indwara. Ibimenyetso biterwa n'uburozi bukorwa n'iyo bagiteri. Gusuzuma indwara bishobora gukorwa hashingiwe ku kuntu umuhogo ugaragara byemejwe n'ubushakashatsi bw'ibinyabuzima. Ubwandu bwabanje bushobora kutarinda ubwandu bw'ejo hazaza.\nUrukingo rwa diphtheria rufite akamaro mu kwirinda kandi ruboneka mu buryo butandukanye. Dose eshatu cyangwa enye, zitangwa hamwe n'urukingo rwa tetanasi n'urukingo rwa pertussis, ni zo zisabwa mu bwana. Izindi doze z'urukingo rwa diphtheria-tetanus zisabwa buri myaka icumi. Uburinzi bushobora kwemezwa hapimwa urugero rw'uburozi mu maraso. Diphtheria ishobora kwirindwa ku bantu bahuye n\u2019iyi ndwara ndetse bakayivurwa n\u2019imiti igabanya ubukana bwa erythromycin cyangwa benzylpenicillin. Hari igihe hakenerwa tracheotomy kugira ngo hafungurwe inzira y'ubuhumekero mu gihe cy'uburwayi bukomeye.\nMu 2015, abarwayi 4.500 bagaragaye ku mugaragaro ku isi yose, bagabanutse ugereranyije n\u2019abagera ku 100.000 mu 1980. Abantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe bafatwa n\u2019iyi ndwara buri mwaka mbere y\u2019imyaka ya 1980. Diphtheria ubu ikunze kugaragara cyane muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara, mu Buhinde no muri Indoneziya. Mu 2015, byagize ingaruka ku rupfu rw\u2019abantu 2.100, rugabanuka ugereranyije n\u2019abapfuye 8.000 mu 1990. Mu turere aho bikigaragara cyane, abana ni bo bibasirwa cyane. Ni gake cyane mu bihugu byateye imbere bitewe n\u2019inkingo zikwirakwira ariko zishobora kongera kugaragara mu gihe igipimo cy\u2019inkingo cyagabanutse. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, abantu 57 banduye bagaragaye hagati ya 1980 na 2004. Urupfu rubaho kuri 5% kugeza kuri 10% by'abayirwaye. Iyi ndwara yavuzwe bwa mbere mu kinyejana cya 5 mbere ya Yesu na Hippocrates. Iyi bagiteri yamenyekanye mu 1882 na Edwin Klebs."}
{"id": "23334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23334", "title": "Semaglutide", "text": "Semaglutide, igurishwa ku mazina y\u2019ikirango cya Ozempic n\u2019ibindi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2 n\u2019umubyibuho ukabije. Nubwo bishobora gukoreshwa hamwe, ntabwo bikundwa cyane kuruta metformin. Binoza kugenzura isukari mu maraso, bigabanya ibyago byo kurwara indwara z'umutima, kandi bigabanya ibyago byo kugira ibibazo by'impyiko. Ikoreshwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa inshinge munsi y'uruhu.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, kuruka, impiswi, kubabara mu nda, no kuribwa mu nda. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo ketoacidosis ya diyabete, isukari nke mu maraso, na pancreatitis. Hari impungenge ko gukoresha iyo myitozo mu gihe utwite bishobora kwangiza umwana kandi ko kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo konsa bidasabwa. Ikora nka peptide-1 imeze nka glucagon y'umuntu (GLP-1) kandi yongera irekurwa rya insuline, igabanya irekurwa rya glucagon, kandi igatinda gusohora igifu.\nSemaglutide yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2017. Yakozwe na Novo Nordisk. Ni wo muti wa mbere wa GLP-1 ushobora gufatwa n'umunwa. Mu Bwongereza, 2 mg yo guterwa inshinge itwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a373 mu 2020. Aya mafaranga muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika agura hafi 850 USD mu 2021. Yabaye umuti rusange muri Kanada mu 2026."}
{"id": "23335", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23335", "title": "Cyclobenzaprine", "text": "Cyclobenzaprine, igurishwa ku izina ry\u2019ikirango cya Flexeril n\u2019indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura imitsi iterwa n\u2019indwara z\u2019imitsi n\u2019amagufwa zitangira gutunguranye. Nta kamaro gafite mu ndwara zo mu bwonko zitera indwara zo mu bwonko. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ntabwo byemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe kirenze ibyumweru bike.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuribwa umutwe, kumva umunaniro, isereri no kuma mu kanwa. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo gutera k'umutima ku buryo budasanzwe. Nta kimenyetso cy'ingaruka mbi zigaragara mu gihe cyo gutwita, ariko ntabwo byizwe neza muri aba bantu. Ntibikwiye gukoreshwa hamwe n'umuti ugabanya ubukana bwa MAO. Uburyo bikora ntabwo birasobanutse neza.\nCyclobenzaprine yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1977. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cya buri dose kiri munsi ya 0.05$ y'Amerika mu 2018. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 43 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 17. Ntabwo yari iboneka mu Bwongereza mu 2012."}
{"id": "23336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23336", "title": "Sulfure ivanze n'amazi", "text": "Sulfure ikoreshwa nk'umuti uvura ibihumyo n'inda; harimo umutwe, umubiri, n'inda zo mu gitsina. Izindi ngaruka zirimo ibiheri, rosacea, tinea, ibiheri, na seborrheic dermatitis. Bishyirwa ku ruhu.\nIngaruka mbi zirimo kuba impumuro mbi ishobora gutera dermatitis. Gukoresha bisa nkaho ari byiza mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa, keretse hafi y'ibere. Ishobora kwihanganirwa kurusha peroxide ya benzoyl. Ikora nk'ikintu gitera keratolytic kandi ikica bagiteri, udukoko, n'ibihumyo. Mu rwego rwa shimi, ni octasulfur isanzwe (S 8).\nSulfure ifite amateka yo gukoreshwa mu buvuzi kuva nibura mu gihe cya Hippocrates. Nubwo itaremerwa ku mugaragaro kugira ngo ikoreshwe mu buvuzi bwihariye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, irashobora kuboneka ku giciro cya muganga guhera mu 2020. Yemerewe gukoreshwa muri Arabiya Sawudite. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi yatanzwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima nk'umusimbura wa benzyl benzoate. Bishobora kandi kwiyongeraho farumasi. Muri rusange ntabwo bihenze. Mu buvuzi ni bwo bwoko bwa sulfure bukoreshwa cyane. "}
{"id": "23337", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23337", "title": "Ondansetron", "text": "Ondansetron, igurishwa ku izina rya Zofran, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu gukumira isesemi no kuruka biterwa na kanseri, imiti ivura imirasire, cyangwa kubagwa. Ifite akamaro kandi mu kuvura indwara yo mu gifu. Ntacyo bikora ku kuvura kuruka guterwa n'indwara yo mu mutwe. Ishobora gutangwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa mu mitsi cyangwa mu mitsi. \nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo impiswi, kuribwa mu nda, kuribwa umutwe, gusinzira no gushyukwa. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zirimo gutinda kwa QT no kugira allergie ikomeye. Bisa nkaho ari byiza mu gihe cyo gutwita ariko ntabwo byizweho neza muri iri tsinda. Ni serotonin 5-HT 3 receptor antagonist. Nta ngaruka bigira kuri za receptors za dopamine cyangwa za muscarinic. \nOndansetron yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1984, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1990. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cy'umuti uterwa mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati na 0.76 kuri buri dose. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika igura hafi 1.37 kuri buri piritsi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 83 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n\u2019abaganga barenga miliyoni icyenda. "}
{"id": "23338", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23338", "title": "Indwara y'umutima", "text": "Indwara y'umutima (MI), izwi kandi nk'indwara y'umutima, ibaho iyo amaraso atembera cyangwa agahagarara mu gice cy'umutima, bigatera kwangirika kw'imitsi y'umutima. Ikimenyetso gikunze kugaragara ni ububabare bwo mu gituza cyangwa kubabara mu gatuza bishobora kugera mu rutugu, mu kuboko, mu mugongo, mu ijosi cyangwa mu rwasaya. Akenshi biba hagati cyangwa ibumoso bw'igituza kandi bikamara iminota irenga mike. Ubwo burwayi bushobora rimwe na rimwe kumva nk'umuriro ushyuha. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubura umwuka, isesemi, kumva nta cyo ushoboye, ibyuya bikonje cyangwa kumva unaniwe. Abantu bagera kuri 30% bafite ibimenyetso bidasanzwe. Abagore bakunze kugaragara badababara mu gituza ahubwo bababara mu ijosi, mu kuboko cyangwa bakumva bananiwe. Mu bantu barengeje imyaka 75, abagera kuri 5% barwaye indwara ya MI badafite ibimenyetso byinshi cyangwa nta na kimwe bagaragaje. Indwara ya MI ishobora gutera umutima guhagarara nabi, umutima utera nabi, umutima uhungabana cyangwa umutima ugahagarara. \nIndwara nyinshi zo mu mutwe ziterwa n'indwara y'imitsi ifata imitsi y'umutima. Ibintu bishobora gutera indwara birimo umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, kunywa itabi, diyabete, kudakora imyitozo ngororamubiri, umubyibuho ukabije, cholesterol nyinshi mu maraso, indyo mbi no kunywa inzoga nyinshi. Ubusanzwe, imikorere y\u2019imitsi y\u2019umutima ifunga burundu bitewe no gucika kw\u2019imitsi ya atherosclerotic plaque. Ntabwo zikunze guterwa no kubabara mu mitsi y'umutima, bishobora guterwa na kokayine, stress ikomeye mu byiyumvo ndetse n'ubukonje bukabije, n'ibindi. Ibipimo byinshi ni ingirakamaro mu gufasha mu gusuzuma indwara, harimo electrocardiograms (ECGs), ibizamini by'amaraso, na angiography y'umutima. ECG, ari na yo nyandiko igaragaza imikorere y'amashanyarazi y'umutima, ishobora kwemeza ko umutima urwaye indwara ya occlusion myocardial infarction (OMI) iyo hari ST elevation MI (STEMI) cyangwa STEMI ingana nayo. Ibipimo by'amaraso bikunze gukoreshwa birimo troponin na creatine kinase MB idakunze gukoreshwa.\nKuvura indwara ya MI ni ingenzi cyane. Asipirine ni uburyo bwo kuvura bwihuse umuntu ukekwaho kuba afite MI. Nitroglycerin cyangwa opioids bishobora gukoreshwa mu gufasha kubabara mu gatuza; icyakora, ntabwo byongera umusaruro muri rusange. Ogisijeni y'inyongera irasabwa ku bantu bafite ogisijeni nke cyangwa bafite ikibazo cyo guhumeka nabi. Muri STEMI, uburyo bwo kuvura bugerageza gusubiza amaraso mu mutima kandi burimo uburyo bwo kuvura indwara z\u2019umutima (PCI), aho imitsi ifunguka igashobora kuba ifite stent, cyangwa thrombolysis, aho kuziba kw\u2019imitsi gukurwaho hakoreshejwe imiti. Abantu bafite indwara ya NSTEMI (non-ST elevation myocardial infarction) akenshi bavurwa na heparin yoroshya amaraso, hamwe n'ikoreshwa rya PCI ku bantu bafite ibyago byinshi. Ku bantu bafite ubumuga bwo kuziba kw'imitsi myinshi y'umutima na diyabete, kubagwa imitsi y'umutima (CABG) bishobora kuba ari byiza aho kubagwa angioplasty. Nyuma yo kuvurwa indwara ya MI, guhindura imibereho, hamwe no kuvurwa igihe kirekire na aspirine, beta blockers na statins, ni byo bikunze kuba byiza.\nKu isi yose, mu 2015 habaye indwara z\u2019umutima zigera kuri miliyoni 15.9 Abantu barenga miliyoni 3 bari bafite ST elevation MI, naho abarenga miliyoni 4 bari bafite NSTEMI. STEMIs ikunze kugaragara ku bagabo inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagore. Abantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe bagira MI buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Mu bihugu byateye imbere, ibyago byo gupfa ku bantu barwaye STEMI ni hafi 10%. Igipimo cya MI ku myaka runaka cyaragabanutse ku isi hagati ya 1990 na 2010. Mu 2011, MI yari imwe mu ndwara eshanu za mbere zihenze cyane mu gihe cyo kurara mu bitaro muri Amerika, aho yatwaye hafi miliyari 11.5 z'amadolari ku bantu 612.000 barara mu bitaro. "}
{"id": "23339", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23339", "title": "Meloxicam", "text": "Meloxicam, igurishwa ku izina rya Mobic n'indi, ni umuti urwanya ububyimbirwe utari steroide (NSAID) ukoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare n'ububyimbirwe mu ndwara za rubagimpande na osteoarthritis. Ikoreshwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa mu mitsi. Birasabwa ko ikoreshwa mu gihe gito gishoboka kandi ku gipimo gito.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kubabara mu nda, kuzungera, kubyimba, kuribwa umutwe, no kugira ibisebe. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo indwara z'umutima, gucika imitsi, ibibazo by'impyiko, n'ibisebe byo mu gifu. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihembwe cya gatatu cy'uburumbuke. Ibuza cyclooxygenase-2 (COX-2) kurusha uko ibuza cyclooxygenase-1 (COX-1). Iri mu muryango w\u2019ibinyabutabire bya oxicam kandi ifitanye isano rya hafi na piroxicam.\nMeloxicam yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1977, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2000. Yakozwe na Boehringer Ingelheim, ariko iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ikiguzi cya buri dose kiri munsi ya 0.02$ ya Amerika. Mu Bwongereza igura ibiro bigera kuri 0.13. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 38 ukunze kwakirwa cyane muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho urenga 19imiti ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ya kanseri ingana na miliyoni imwe. "}
{"id": "23340", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23340", "title": "Clonazepam", "text": "Clonazepam, igurishwa munsi y'ikirango cya Klonopin n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu gukumira no kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe, indwara y'ubwoba, n'indwara yo kwimuka izwi nka akathisia. Ni umuti utuma umuntu aruhuka wo mu bwoko bwa benzodiazepine. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ingaruka zitangira mu isaha imwe kandi zimara hagati y'amasaha atandatu na cumi n'abiri.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, kudahuza neza kw'ingingo, no guhindagurika. Kuyikoresha igihe kirekire bishobora gutera kwihanganira, kutayikoresha, ndetse no kutayikoresha mu buryo butunguranye. Kuzibasira bibaho kuri kimwe cya gatatu cy'abantu bafata clonazepam mu gihe kirenze ibyumweru bine. Hari ibyago byinshi byo kwiyahura, cyane cyane ku bantu bamaze kwiheba. Iyo ikoreshejwe mu gihe cyo gutwita ishobora kwangiza umwana. Clonazepam ifatana na GABA A receptors, bityo yongera ingaruka za aside \u03b3-aminobutyric (GABA) igabanya ubukana bw'imitsi. \nClonazepam yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha patenti mu 1960, itangira kugurishwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1975 ivuye muri Roche. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cyo kugurisha ku giciro kinini mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya 0.01 na 0.07 by'amadolari y'Amerika kuri buri piritsi. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ibinini bigura hafi $0.40 buri kimwe. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 34 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 20. Mu bice byinshi by'isi ikunze gukoreshwa nk'ikiyobyabwenge cyo kwidagadura."}
{"id": "23341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23341", "title": "Helicobacter pylori", "text": "Ubwandu bwa \"Helicobacter pylori\" ni ubwandu, akenshi bwo mu gifu, buterwa na bagiteri ya \"Helicobacter pylori\". Akenshi nta bimenyetso bihari; ariko bishobora gutera indwara ya gastritis (kubyimba mu gifu) kuri 25% cyangwa ibisebe byo mu gifu kuri 10%. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubabara mu nda, isesemi, no gushya umutima. Kwandura bifitanye isano kandi na gastritis itera atrophic, kanseri y'igifu, na lymphoma ya MALT (mucosal associated-lymphoid-type).\nBikekwa ko ikwirakwira cyane cyane binyuze mu nzira y'umwanda uva mu kanwa, ndetse wenda no mu kanwa. Ibintu bishobora gutera iyi ndwara birimo kuba mu gace kasanzwemo iyi ndwara n'ubukene. \"Helicobacter pylori\" ni bagiteri ifite imiterere y\u2019agarama gafite imiterere y\u2019umurabyo, ikora nk\u2019inkoni. Isuzuma rikorwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa 'urea breath test', 'fecal antigen assay', 'rapid urease test', cyangwa 'tissue biopsy '. Serology bishobora kugaragaza ubwandu bw'ubu cyangwa ubwandu bwa kera.\nAbantu badafite ibimenyetso ntibakenera ubuvuzi bwihariye. Bitabaye ibyo, hashobora gukoreshwa imvange y'umuti ugabanya ubukana bwa proton pump inhibitor (PPI), amoxicillin, metronidazole, na clarithromycin. Andi mahitamo arimo PPI, bismuth subsalicylate, metronidazole, na tetracycline. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi bumara iminsi 14. Urukingo rwa H. pylori rurimo gukorwa kuva mu 2015.\nBivugwa ko 60% by'abatuye isi banduye iyi ndwara mu 2015, ibi bikaba bikunze kugaragara mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Gutangira akenshi biba mu bwana. Abana bari munsi y'imyaka 10 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bagera kuri 5% barwaye iyi ndwara. Mu myaka ibarirwa muri za mirongo ishize, ibipimo byagabanutse mu bihugu byinshi. Iyi bagiteri yamenyekanye bwa mbere mu 1982 n'abaganga bo muri Ositaraliya Barry Marshall na Robin Warren."}
{"id": "23342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23342", "title": "Phencyclidine", "text": "Phencyclidine cyangwa phenylcyclohexyl piperidine (PCP), izwi kandi nka angel dust n'andi mazina, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu ngaruka zawo zihindura ubwenge. PCP ishobora gutera kubona ibintu mu buryo butari bwo, kumva amajwi mu buryo butari bwo, ndetse no kugira imyitwarire mibi. Nk'ikiyobyabwenge gikoreshwa mu kwidagadura, akenshi kinyobwa, ariko gishobora kunyobwa mu kanwa, kunyobwa, cyangwa guterwa inshinge. Ishobora kandi kuvangwa n'urumogi cyangwa itabi.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo gucika intege, koma, kuba umuntu arwaye indwara yo kwiyahura, ndetse no kwiyongera k'ibyago byo kwiyahura. Ibitekerezo by'ibyabaye bishobora kubaho nubwo ikoreshwa rihagaze. Mu rwego rwa shimi, PCP ni kimwe mu bigize itsinda rya arylcyclohexylamine, kandi mu rwego rwa farumasi, ni umuti ugabanya ububabare. PCP ikora cyane cyane nk'umurwanya wa NMDA receptor. \nPCP ikoreshwa cyane muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Nubwo ikoreshwa ryabyo ryageze ku rwego rwo hejuru mu myaka ya 1970, hagati ya 2005 na 2011, habayeho ukwiyongera kw'abasura ibitaro byihutirwa bitewe n'uyu muti. Mu mwaka wa 2017 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika abantu bagera kuri 1% mu mwaka wa cumi n'ibiri bavuze ko bakoresheje PCP mu mwaka ushize mu gihe 2.9% by'abari hejuru y'imyaka 25 bavuze ko bayikoresheje mu gihe runaka mu buzima bwabo. \nPCP yakozwe bwa mbere mu 1926 ijyanwa ku isoko nk'umuti ugabanya ububabare mu myaka ya 1950. Gukoreshwa kwayo ku bantu ntibyemewe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1965 bitewe n\u2019ingaruka mbi nyinshi mu gihe gukoreshwa kwayo ku nyamaswa byo byemejwe mu 1978. Byongeye kandi, ketamine yavumbuwe kandi yihanganirwa neza nk'umuti ugabanya ububabare. PCP ishyirwa mu cyiciro cy\u2019umuti wa gahunda ya kabiri muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Hari imiti myinshi ikomoka kuri PCP yagurishijwe kugira ngo ikoreshwe mu kwidagadura no mu buryo butari ubwo kwa muganga."}
{"id": "23343", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23343", "title": "Urwikekwe rwa Tripophobia", "text": "Urwikekwe rwa Tripophobia ni ukwanga kubona amatsinda cyangwa imiterere y'umwobo muto cyangwa utubyimba. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo ishozi, ubwoba, cyangwa guhangayika. Hashobora kandi kuba hari isesemi cyangwa uburyaryate bifitanye isano.\nUrugero rw'ibintu bitera ikibazo birimo ubuki, imbuto z'umuhondo, n'udupira hejuru y'igikombe cya kawa. Nubwo bitazwi ku mugaragaro nk'indwara yo mu mutwe itandukanye nko mu 2018, bishobora gufatwa nk'ubwoba bwihariye iyo habayeho ubwoba bukabije n'agahinda. Bitekerezwa ko ari ubwirinzi bw\u2019ihindagurika ku dukoko two hanze cyangwa inyamaswa z\u2019uburozi bwabaye bwinshi cyane. Uburyo bwo kuvura umuntu ahura n'ikibazo ni uburyo bushoboka bwo kuvura.\nIbimenyetso bimwe na bimwe iyo urebye ikintu nk'igishishwa cy'imbuto ya lotus biba ku bantu bagera kuri 16%, abagore bakaba bibasirwa cyane kurusha abagabo. Ijambo \"trypophobia\" ryahimbwe n'umuntu witabiriye urubuga rwo kuri interineti mu 2005, riva ku ijambo ry'Ikigereki \"trypo\" risobanura \"gucukura imyobo\" na \"phobos\" risobanura \"ubwoba\". Byabaye ingingo ikunzwe cyane ku mbuga nkoranyambaga mu myaka ya za 2000. Ubushakashatsi bwemewe bwatangiye ahagana mu 2010 bukorwa n'abahanga mu by'imitekerereze ya muntu Geoff Cole na Arnold Wilkins."}
{"id": "23344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23344", "title": "Methocarbamol", "text": "Methocarbamol, igurishwa ku izina rya Robaxin n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare bw'imitsi n'amagufwa by'igihe gito. Ishobora gukoreshwa hamwe n'ikiruhuko, ubuvuzi bw'umubiri, n'imiti igabanya ububabare. Ntibikunze gukoreshwa cyane mu gihe umuntu ababara umugongo wo hasi. Ikoreshwa mu buryo buke mu kuvura indwara ya rubagimpande na palsy yo mu bwonko. Ingaruka muri rusange zitangira mu gihe cy'iminota mirongo itatu. Ifatwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa mu mitsi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuribwa umutwe, gusinzira, kunyerera. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kurwara indwara ya anaphylaxis, ibibazo by'umwijima, urujijo, no gucika intege. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa. Gukoreshwa n'abageze mu za bukuru bifatwa nk'ibishobora guteza akaga gakomeye. Methocarbamol ni umuti ugabanya imitsi mu mubiri. Uburyo bikora ntabwo birasobanutse neza, ariko bisa nkaho bitagize ingaruka ku mitsi mu buryo butaziguye.\nMethocarbamol yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1957. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ihendutse cyane mu 2016. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 178 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni eshatu. "}
{"id": "23345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23345", "title": "Indwara ya Sj\u00f6gren", "text": "Sj\u00f6gren syndrome (SjS, SS) ni indwara y\u2019igihe kirekire ifata ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri ikagira ingaruka ku ngirabuzimafatizo zikora ubushuhe mu mubiri. Ibimenyetso by'ibanze ni umunwa wumye n'amaso yumye. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo uruhu rwumye, kumagara mu gitsina, inkorora idakira, gucika intege mu maboko no mu maguru, kumva unaniwe, kubabara imitsi n'ingingo, ndetse n'ibibazo bya tiroyide. Abarwaye indwara ya lymphoma nabo bafite ibyago byinshi (5%) byo kurwara iyi ndwara.\nNubwo impamvu nyayo idasobanutse neza, bikekwa ko iterwa n\u2019uruvange rw\u2019uturemangingo n\u2019ikintu gitera ibidukikije nko kwandura virusi cyangwa bagiteri. Bishobora kubaho hatitawe ku bindi bibazo by'ubuzima (syndrome ya Sj\u00f6gren y'ibanze) cyangwa bitewe n'indi ndwara y'imitsi ihuza (syndrome ya Sj\u00f6gren y'inyongera). Ububyimbirwe butera kwangiza buhoro buhoro imitsi. Gusuzuma indwara bikorwa hifashishijwe biopsy y'uturemangingo dukora ubushuhe no gupima amaraso hashakishwa ubudahangarwa bwihariye. Mu gihe cyo gusuzuma indwara, ubusanzwe haba hari lymphocytes mu turemangingo.\nUbuvuzi bushingira ku bimenyetso by'umuntu. Ku maso yumye, hashobora kugeragezwa imiti igabanya ububyimbirwe, ikoreshwa mu gufunga imiyoboro y'amarira. Ku munwa wumye, hashobora gukoreshwa chewing gum (byaba byiza idafite isukari), kunywa amazi, cyangwa ikindi kintu gisimbura amacandwe. Ku bantu bafite ububabare mu ngingo cyangwa mu mitsi, ibuprofen ishobora gukoreshwa. Imiti ishobora gutera ubwivumbure, nka antihistamines, nayo ishobora guhagarikwa.\nIyi ndwara yasobanuwe mu 1933 na Henrik Sj\u00f6gren, wahawe izina ryayo; icyakora, hari ibisobanuro byinshi byatanzwe mbere ku bantu bafite ibimenyetso. Hagati ya 0.2% na 1.2% by'abaturage nibo bibasiwe, kimwe cya kabiri cyabo bafite icyiciro cya mbere n'igice cya kabiri. Abagore bibasirwa inshuro zigera ku icumi kurusha abagabo. Nubwo iyi ndwara ikunze gutangirira mu myaka yo hagati, umuntu uwo ari we wese ashobora kuyigiraho ingaruka. Muri abo badafite izindi ndwara ziterwa n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri, igihe cyo kubaho ntigihinduka."}
{"id": "23346", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23346", "title": "Tirzepatide", "text": "Tirzepatide, igurishwa ku mazina ya Mounjaro na Zepbound, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2 n'umubyibuho ukabije, hamwe n'imirire n'imyitozo ngororamubiri.\nUtangwa binyuze mu rushinge munsi y'uruhu rimwe mu cyumweru.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nTirzepatide, igurishwa ku izina rya Mounjaro na Zepbound, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2 n'umubyibuho ukabije. Ikoreshwa hamwe n'imirire n'imyitozo ngororamubiri. Itangwa binyuze mu gutera urushinge munsi y'uruhu buri cyumweru.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, impiswi, impatwe, no kubabara mu nda. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo pancreatitis, gastroparesis, isukari nke mu maraso, ingaruka z'ubwivumbure, n'indwara y'agasabo k'inkari. Gukoresha iyo ndwara mu gihe utwite bishobora kwangiza umwana. Ni peptide-1 imeze nka glucagon (GLP-1) kandi ikaba ikora ku buryo glucose idakoresha glucose kandi yongera irekurwa rya insuline mu biribwa.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nTirzepatide yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, i Burayi, n'Ubwongereza mu 2022. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bigura hafi 1.000 USD mu byumweru 4 kugeza mu 2022."}
{"id": "23347", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23347", "title": "Indwara y'ibihaha idakira", "text": "Indwara y'ibihaha idakira (\"COPD\" cyangwa \"BPCO\") ni indwara y'ibihaha irangwa n'ibibazo by'ubuhumekero bimara igihe kirekire n'umwuka utembera nabi mu bihaha. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi ni ukubura umwuka n'inkorora idakira.\nImpamvu ikunze kuyitera ni ukunywa itabi; ishobora kwirindwa hagabanywa ibyago.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara y'ibihaha idakira (COPD) ni ubwoko bw'indwara y'ibihaha idakira irangwa n'ibibazo by'ubuhumekero bw'igihe kirekire n'umwuka mubi utembera neza. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi birimo kubura umwuka no gukorora hamwe n'amaseru. COPD ni indwara ikomeza kwiyongera, bivuze ko ikunze kwiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Amaherezo, ibikorwa bya buri munsi nko kugenda cyangwa kwambara biragorana. Bronchitis idakira na emphysema ni amagambo ya kera akoreshwa ku bwoko butandukanye bwa COPD. Ijambo \"bronchitis idakira\" riracyakoreshwa mu gusobanura inkorora ikora nibura amezi atatu buri mwaka mu gihe cy'imyaka ibiri. Abafite bene iyo nkorora baba bafite ibyago byinshi byo kurwara COPD. Ijambo \"emphysema\" rikoreshwa kandi ku kuba hari umwuka udasanzwe cyangwa indi myuka mu ngingo.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ikunze kugaragara ni ukunywa itabi, aho umubare muto w\u2019abandura uterwa n\u2019ibintu nk\u2019ihumana ry\u2019ikirere n\u2019imiterere y\u2019uturemangingo. Mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, imwe mu mpamvu zikunze gutera ihumana ry'ikirere ni umuriro ushyushya n'umuriro utetse udakoresha umwuka mwiza. Kugaragara kuri ibi bintu bitera ububabare igihe kirekire bitera ububabare mu bihaha, bigatuma inzira z'ubuhumekero zigabanuka kandi ingingo z'ibihaha zigasenyuka. Isuzuma rishingiye ku mwuka mubi utembera nk'uko bipimwa n'ibizamini by'imikorere y'ibihaha. Bitandukanye na asima, kugabanuka k'umwuka ntabwo birushaho kuba byiza iyo hakoreshejwe umuti ugabanya ubushyuhe.\nKwirinda n'ubuvuzi.\nInshuro nyinshi zishobora kwirindwa mu kugabanya ibyago byo guhura nabyo. Ibi birimo kutanywa itabi no kunoza ubwiza bw'umwuka wo mu nzu no hanze. Nubwo kuvurwa bishobora kugabanya ubukana, nta muti uzwi. Uburyo bwo kuvura burimo guhagarika kunywa itabi, inkingo, no kuvura indwara z'ubuhumekero. Umuti wa mbere ugabanya ububabare bw'imitsi muri rusange ni LAMA, hamwe na LABA na steroid zihumekwa zongewemo iyo bikenewe. Hari abantu bashobora kungukirwa no kuvurwa mu buryo bw'igihe kirekire hakoreshejwe ogisijeni cyangwa guterwa ibihaha. Ku bantu bafite ibihe bikomeye byo kurwara, hashobora kuba ngombwa gukoresha imiti myinshi, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara, ndetse no kujya mu bitaro.\nIkwirakwira.\nGuhera mu 2015, COPD yibasiye abantu bagera kuri 174.5\u00a0miliyoni z'abantu (12% by'abaturage ku isi). Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, bibasira abantu 6% by'abantu. Ubusanzwe igaragara ku bantu barengeje imyaka 40. Abagabo n'abagore bakunze kwibasirwa n'iyi ndwara. Mu 2015, byateye 3.2\u00a0miliyoni z'impfu, zirenga 90% mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, zazamutse zivuye kuri 2.4\u00a0miliyoni z'abapfuye mu 1990. Biteganyijwe ko umubare w'impfu uziyongera bitewe n'umubare w'abanywa itabi uri hejuru mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, ndetse n'abaturage bakuze mu bihugu byinshi. Byatumye habaho ikiguzi cy\u2019ubukungu cya $2.1 y\u2019Amerika.\u00a0tiriyari mu 2010."}
{"id": "23348", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23348", "title": "Polio", "text": "Polio (\"poliomyelitis\") ni indwara yandura iterwa na virusi ya polio. Ku bantu bake mu bayanduye, imitsi icika intege bigatuma umuntu amugara.\nIshobora kwirindwa hakoreshejwe urukingo rwa polio; nta muti uyikiza uhari.\nIbimenyetso.\nPolio, mu magambo ahinnye ya poliomyelitis, ni indwara yandura iterwa na virusi ya polio. Mu bantu bagera kuri 0.5 ku ijana, imitsi iracika intege bigatuma umuntu atabasha kugenda. Ibi bishobora kubaho mu masaha make cyangwa iminsi mike. Intege nke akenshi ziba ku maguru, ariko zishobora kudakunze kuba ku mitsi yo mu mutwe, mu ijosi no mu gituza. Abantu benshi barakira neza. Ku bafite intege nke z'imitsi, abana bagera kuri 2 kugeza kuri 5 ku ijana na 15 kugeza kuri 30 ku ijana by'abantu bakuru barapfa. Ku bantu bose banduye, kugeza kuri 70% by'abanduye nta bimenyetso bibaho. Abandi 25 ku ijana bafite ibimenyetso bito nk'umuriro n'ububabare mu muhogo, naho abagera kuri 5 ku ijana bafite umutwe, kubabara ijosi ndetse no kubabara amaboko n'amaguru. Aba bantu bakunze gusubira mu buzima busanzwe mu cyumweru kimwe cyangwa bibiri. Nyuma y'imyaka myinshi yo gukira, indwara ya post-polio ishobora kubaho, igatera intege nke z'imitsi nk'uko umuntu yari afite mu gihe cy'ubwandu bwa mbere.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nVirusi ya polio ikunze kwandurira mu muntu inyuze mu mwanda wanduye winjira mu kanwa. Ishobora kandi gukwirakwizwa n'ibiryo cyangwa amazi arimo umwanda w'abantu kandi idakunze gukwirakwizwa n'amacandwe yanduye. Abanduye bashobora gukwirakwiza iyi ndwara mu gihe cy'ibyumweru bitandatu nubwo nta bimenyetso bihari. Iyi ndwara ishobora kuvurwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gusanga virusi mu mwanda cyangwa se hakaboneka ubudahangarwa bwayo mu maraso. Iyi ndwara ibaho mu buryo busanzwe ku bantu gusa.\nKwirinda n'ubuvuzi.\nIyi ndwara ishobora kwirindwa hakoreshejwe urukingo rwa polio; icyakora, hakenewe doze nyinshi kugira ngo igire ingaruka nziza. Ikigo cya Amerika gishinzwe kurwanya no gukumira indwara gitanga inama yo kongera urukingo rwa polio ku bagenzi n'abatuye mu bihugu aho iyi ndwara ibera. Iyo umuntu yanduye nta muti wihariye ahabwa. Mu 2018, hagaragaye abantu 33 barwaye polio yo mu gasozi n'abantu 104 barwaye polio ikomoka ku rukingo. Ibi byagabanutse ugereranyije n\u2019abantu 350.000 banduye mu 1988. Mu 2024, indwara yo mu gasozi yakwirakwijwe mu bantu muri Afuganisitani na Pakisitani gusa. Mu 2024 hagaragaye abantu 98 barwaye polio yo mu gasozi n'abantu nibura 190 barwaye polio ikomoka ku rukingo.\nAmateka.\nIndwara ya Poliomyelitis imaze imyaka ibihumbi ibaho, igaragazwa n'ubuhanzi bwa kera. Iyi ndwara yamenyekanye bwa mbere nk'indwara yihariye n'umuganga w'Umwongereza Michael Underwood mu 1789. Virusi iyitera yamenyekanye bwa mbere mu 1908 n'inzobere mu by'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri yo muri Otirishiya Karl Landsteiner n'umufasha we, Erwin Popper. Icyorezo gikomeye cyatangiye kugaragara mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19 mu Burayi no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Mu kinyejana cya 20, yabaye imwe mu ndwara zihangayikishije abana cyane muri utwo duce. Urukingo rwa mbere rwa polio rwakozwe mu myaka ya 1950 na Jonas Salk, hanyuma nyuma gato, Albert Sabin akora urukingo rwo kunywa."}
{"id": "23349", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23349", "title": "Pancreatite", "text": "Pancreatite (\"pancreatitis\") ni indwara irangwa no kubyimba kwa pancreas, urugingo ruri inyuma y'igifu rukora imisemburo y'igogora n'indi misemburo.\nImpamvu zikunze kuyitera ni utubuye two mu ruhago rw'indurwe no kunywa inzoga nyinshi.\nIbimenyetso.\nPancreatite ni indwara irangwa no kubyimba kwa pancreas. Pancreas ni urugingo runini ruri inyuma y'igifu rukora imisemburo ikora igogora n'imisemburo myinshi. Hari ubwoko bubiri bw'ingenzi: pancreatitis ikaze, na pancreatitis idakira. Ibimenyetso by'indwara ya pancreatitis birimo kubabara mu nda yo hejuru, isesemi no kuruka. Ububabare bukunze kujya mu mugongo kandi akenshi buba bukomeye. Mu ndwara ya pancreatitis ikabije, umuriro ushobora kugaragara, kandi ibimenyetso bikunze kugaragara mu minsi mike. Mu gihe cy\u2019indwara ya pancreatitis idakira, umuntu ashobora kugabanya ibiro bitewe n\u2019ibinure, ndetse no gucibwamo. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kwandura, kuva amaraso, diyabete, cyangwa ibibazo by'izindi ngingo.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ebyiri zikunze gutera pancreatitis ikabije ni imisemburo y\u2019induru ifunga umuyoboro w\u2019induru usanzwe nyuma y\u2019uko umuyoboro w\u2019induru winjiye; hamwe no kunywa inzoga nyinshi. Izindi mpamvu zirimo gukomereka mu buryo butaziguye, imiti imwe n'imwe, indwara nka mumps, na kanseri. Pancreatitis idakira ishobora kugaragara bitewe na pancreatitis ikabije. Akenshi biterwa no kunywa inzoga nyinshi imyaka myinshi. Izindi mpamvu zirimo ibinure byinshi mu maraso, kalisiyumu nyinshi mu maraso, imiti imwe n'imwe, hamwe n'indwara zimwe na zimwe za genetiki, nka cystic fibrosis, n'izindi. Kunywa itabi byongera ibyago byo kurwara pancreatitis ikabije n'iy'igihe kirekire. Gusuzuma pancreatitis ikabije bishingiye ku kwiyongera gutatu mu maraso ya amylase cyangwa lipase. Mu ndwara ya pancreatitis idakira, ibi bizamini bishobora kuba bisanzwe. Gufata amashusho nk'imashini zipima ikoranabuhanga (ultrasound) na CT scan nabyo bishobora kuba ingirakamaro.\nUbuvuzi.\nPancreatitis ikabije ikunze kuvurwa n'amazi yo mu mitsi, imiti igabanya ububabare, ndetse rimwe na rimwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara. Ubusanzwe kurya no kunywa ntibyemewe, kandi umuyoboro wa nasogastric ushyirwa mu gifu. Uburyo buzwi nka endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography (ERCP) bushobora gukorwa kugira ngo hasuzumwe umuyoboro wa distal common bile no gukuraho ibuye ry\u2019agakoko mu gihe rihari. Ku bafite utubuye tw\u2019agasabo, akenshi nabyo birakurwa. Mu ndwara ya pancreatitis idakira, uretse ibyavuzwe haruguru, kugaburira by'agateganyo binyuze mu muyoboro wa nasogastric bishobora gukoreshwa kugira ngo haboneke intungamubiri zihagije. Guhindura imirire igihe kirekire no gusimbuza enzymes za pancreas bishobora kuba ngombwa. Kandi rimwe na rimwe hakorwa operasiyo yo gukuraho ibice bya pancreas.\nIkwirakwira.\nKu isi yose, mu 2015 habayeho abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 8.9 barwaye pancreatitis. Ibi byagize ingaruka ku rupfu rw\u2019abantu 132.700, ugereranyije n\u2019abapfuye 83.000 mu 1990. Pancreatitis ikabije igaragara ku bantu bagera kuri 30 kuri 100.000 buri mwaka. Abantu bashya barwaye pancreatitis idakira bavuka ku bantu bagera kuri 8 ku bantu 100.000 buri mwaka, ubu bakaba bagera kuri 50 ku bantu 100.000 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Bikunze kugaragara ku bagabo kurusha abagore. Akenshi pancreatitis idakira itangira hagati y'imyaka 30 na 40 mu gihe idakunze kugaragara ku bana. Pancreatitis ikabije yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu isuzuma ry\u2019umurambo mu 1882, mu gihe Pancreatitis idakira yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1946."}
{"id": "23350", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23350", "title": "Diverticulitis", "text": "Diverticulitis ni indwara yo mu nda irangwa no kubyimba kw'udufuka tudasanzwe (\"diverticula\") dushobora kuboneka ku rukuta rw'amara manini.\nIkunze kugaragara ku bantu bakuze, cyane cyane mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba bw'Isi.\nIbimenyetso.\nDiverticulitis, cyane cyane diverticulitis yo mu mara, ni indwara yo mu gifu irangwa no kubyimba kw'udupfunyika tudasanzwe - diverticula - dushobora gukwirakwira mu rukuta rw'amara manini. Ibimenyetso bikunze kuba birimo ububabare bwo mu nda yo hasi buterwa no gutangira gutunguranye, ariko bushobora no kubaho mu minsi mike. Hashobora kandi kugira isesemi ; no gucibwamo cyangwa kuribwa mu nda. Umuriro cyangwa amaraso mu gitereko bigaragaza ko hari ikibazo. Ibitero bisubirwamo bishobora kubaho.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nImpamvu zitera diverticulitis ntizizwi neza. Ibintu bishobora gutera iyi ndwara birimo umubyibuho ukabije, kutagira imyitozo ngororamubiri, kunywa itabi, kuba ufite amateka mu muryango wawe yarayirwaye, no gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana itari iya steroide (NSAIDs). Uruhare rw'indyo idafite fibre nyinshi nk'ikintu gishobora gutera ibyago ntabwo rurasobanuka neza. Kugira udufuka mu mara manini tudatwitswe bizwi nka diverticulosis. Kubyimba bibaho hagati ya 10% na 25% mu gihe runaka, kandi biterwa n'ubwandu bwa bagiteri. Gupima indwara akenshi bikorwa hakoreshejwe CT scan, nubwo ibizamini by'amaraso, colonoscopy, cyangwa urwego rwo hasi rw'igifu nabyo bishobora kuba ingirakamaro. Indwara zitandukanye zirimo indwara y'umura irakarishye.\nKwirinda n'ubuvuzi.\nIngamba zo kwirinda zirimo guhindura ibintu bishobora gutera ikibazo nko kubyibuha cyane, kudakora imyitozo ngororamubiri, no kunywa itabi. Mesalazine na rifaximin bisa nkaho ari ingirakamaro mu gukumira ibitero ku bafite ikibazo cyo kurwara indwara ya diverticulosis. Kwirinda imbuto n'imbuto nk'uburyo bwo kwirinda ntibikiri ngombwa kuko nta gihamya kigaragaza ko bigira uruhare mu gutera ububyimbirwe mu miyoboro y'amazi. Ku ndwara ya diverticulitis yoroheje, imiti yica udukoko ikoreshwa mu kanwa no mu mirire y\u2019amazi ikunze kuba isabwa; nubwo ibi bisa nkaho bitagira ingaruka ku ngaruka. Ku ndwara zikomeye, imiti yica udukoko iterwa mu mitsi, kwakirwa mu bitaro no kuruhuka amara yose bishobora kuba inama. Probiyotike bifite agaciro katazwi neza. Ingorane nko kumera ibibyimba, kumera fistula, no gutobora amara bishobora gusaba kubagwa.\nIkwirakwira.\nIyi ndwara ikunze kugaragara mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba bw'Isi kandi ntikunze kugaragara muri Afurika na Aziya. Mu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba bw'isi, abantu bagera kuri 35% bafite indwara ya diverticulose mu gihe yibasira munsi ya 1% by'abo mu cyaro cya Afurika, kandi hagati ya 4 na 15% bashobora kurwara diverticulose. Muri Amerika ya Ruguru n'i Burayi ububabare bwo mu nda bukunze kuba ibumoso bwo hasi (sigmoid colon), mu gihe muri Aziya bukunze kuba iburyo (ascending colon). Iyi ndwara irushaho kwiyongera uko abantu bakura, cyane cyane iyo umuntu arengeje imyaka 50. Byarushijeho kugaragara mu bice byose by'isi. Mu 2003 mu Burayi, byahitanye abantu bagera ku 13.000. Ni yo ndwara ikunze kugaragara cyane mu mara. Ibiciro bijyana n'indwara ya diverticular byari hafi miliyari 2.4 z'amadolari y'Amerika ku mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2013."}
{"id": "23351", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23351", "title": "Morphine", "text": "Morphine ni umuti ukomeye ugabanya ububabare wo mu bwoko bwa \"opio\u00efde\", uboneka mu buryo kamere mu kimera cya \"pavot\" (\"Papaver somniferum\").\nIkoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare bukabije, kandi iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nMorphine ni umuti w'ububabare wo mu muryango wa opio\u00efde uboneka mu buryo busanzwe mu bimera n'inyamaswa zitandukanye, harimo n'abantu. Ikora ku buryo butaziguye ku buryo bworoshye bwo kugabanya ububabare (CNS) kugira ngo igabanye ibyiyumvo by'ububabare. Irashobora gufatwa haba ku bubabare bukabije ndetse no ku bubabare budakira. Ikunze gukoreshwa ku bubabare buterwa n'indwara y'umutima ifata imitsi ndetse no mu gihe cyo kubyara. Ishobora gutangwa mu kanwa, mu guterwa mu mitsi, mu guterwa munsi y'uruhu, mu mitsi, mu mwanya ukikije uruti rw'umugongo, cyangwa mu buryo bw'inyuma. Ingaruka ntarengwa igerwaho nyuma ya saa 20\u00a0iminota iyo itanzwe mu mitsi na nyuma ya 60\u00a0iminota iyo itanzwe mu kanwa, mu gihe igihe cy'ingaruka ari 3\u20137\u00a0amasaha. Hari kandi n'imiti ikora igihe kirekire.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zikomeye zirimo kugabanuka k'imbaraga zo guhumeka no kugabanuka k'umuvuduko w'amaraso. Morphine irakunda kubagwa kandi ikunze gukoreshwa nabi. Iyo ingano igabanutse nyuma yo kuyikoresha igihe kirekire, ibimenyetso byo kureka opioid bishobora kugaragara. Ingaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, kuruka no kunyara. Ni ngombwa kwitonda iyo ukoresheje umuti wa morphine mu gihe utwite cyangwa wonsa, kuko ushobora kugira ingaruka ku mwana.\nAmateka.\nMorphine yabanje gukurwaho hagati ya 1803 na 1805 na Friedrich Sert\u00fcrner. Muri rusange, iki kintu gikunze kwitwa \"toute\" ni cyo cya mbere gitandukanya ikintu gifatika n'ibimera. Merck yatangiye kuyicuruza mu buryo bw'ubucuruzi mu 1827. Morphine yakoreshejwe cyane nyuma y\u2019ivumburwa rya siringi igabanya uruhu mu 1853 1855. Sert\u00fcrner yabanje kwita iki kintu \"Morphium\" izina ry'imana y'inzozi z'Abagereki, Morpheus, kuko gifite umwihariko wo gutera ibitotsi.\nUko ikorwa.\nIsoko nyamukuru ya morphine ni ukwitandukanya n'icyatsi cya poppy cya opium poppy. Mu 2013, hakozwe toni zigera kuri 523 za morphine. Amatoni agera kuri 45 yakoreshejwe mu kuvura ububabare, yikubye inshuro enye mu myaka makumyabiri ishize. Uburyo bwinshi bwo gukoresha iyi ntego bwari mu bihugu byateye imbere. Hafi 70 ku ijana bya morphine ikoreshwa mu gukora indi miti nka hydromorphone, oxymorphone, na heroine. Ni umuti wo mu cyiciro cya kabiri muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, Icyiciro cya A mu Bwongereza, n'Igiciro cya I muri Kanada. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Morphine igurishwa mu mazina menshi y'ubucuruzi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 155 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni enye."}
{"id": "23352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23352", "title": "Thalidomide", "text": "Thalidomide, igurishwa ku mazina nka Thalomid na Contergan, ni umuti ukoreshwa uyu munsi mu kuvura kanseri zimwe na zimwe (nka \"multiple myeloma\") n'ingorane z'ibibembe.\nYashyizwe ku isoko mu 1957 mu Budage, iza kumenyekana cyane kubera ubumuga bukomeye yateye abana b'ababyeyi bayifashe batwite.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nThalidomide, igurishwa ku izina ry\u2019ikirango cya Thalomid n\u2019indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura kanseri zitandukanye zirimo indwara ya myeloma nyinshi, indwara ya graft-versus-host, hamwe n\u2019indwara nyinshi z\u2019uruhu zirimo n\u2019ingorane z\u2019ibibembe. Nubwo yakoreshejwe mu ndwara zitandukanye zifitanye isano na virusi itera SIDA, ikoreshwa nk'iryo rifitanye isano no kwiyongera kwa virusi. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, kurwara ibisebe no kuzerera. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zirimo indwara ya tumor lysis syndrome, kuzura kw'amaraso, no kurwara indwara z'imitsi yo mu gice cy'umubiri. Gukoresha iyo utwite bishobora kwangiza umwana, harimo no gutuma ingingo z'umubiri zihinduka nabi. Ku bagabo bafata imiti, agakingirizo ni byiza niba abo bashakanye bashobora gutwita. Ni umuti uvura ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri kandi ukorana n'uburyo butandukanye burimo gukangura uturemangingo twa T no kugabanya ikorwa rya TNF-\u03b1.\nAmateka.\nThalidomide yashyizwe ku isoko bwa mbere mu 1957 mu Budage bw'Iburengerazuba, aho yabonekaga ku giciro cyayo. Ubwo yasohorwaga bwa mbere, thalidomide yatewe inkunga yo guhangayika, gusinzira nabi, \"guhangayika\", no gusara mu gitondo. Nubwo byagaragaye ko ari byiza mu gihe cyo gutwita, impungenge ku bijyanye n'ubumuga bwo kuvukana zagaragaye mu 1961 maze imiti ikurwa ku isoko mu Burayi muri uwo mwaka. Umubare w\u2019abantu bose bagizweho ingaruka n\u2019ikoreshwa ry\u2019iyi mashini mu gihe cyo gutwita ubarirwa mu 10.000, muri bo abagera kuri 40% bapfuye ahagana mu gihe cyo kuvuka. Abarokotse bari bafite ibibazo by'amaguru, amaso, inzira z'inkari n'umutima. Kwinjira kwayo ku isoko rya Amerika byabujijwe na Frances Kelsey wo muri FDA. Ubusembwa bw'imiti ya thalidomide bwatumye habaho iterambere ry'amategeko n'igenzura ry'imiti mu bihugu byinshi.\nMuri iki gihe.\nYemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1998. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Mu Bwongereza, NHS itwara amafaranga agera kuri \u00a31,194 ku kwezi guhera mu 2018. Aya mafaranga muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika agura hafi amadolari y'Amerika 9,236 kugeza mu 2019."}
{"id": "23353", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23353", "title": "Metformin", "text": "Metformin, igurishwa ku mazina nka Glucophage, ni wo muti wa mbere ukoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2, cyane cyane ku bantu bafite umubyibuho ukabije.\nIfatwa mu kanwa, kandi iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nMetformin, igurishwa ku izina ry'ubucuruzi rya Glucophage n'indi, ni wo muti wa mbere uvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2, cyane cyane ku bantu bafite umubyibuho ukabije. Ikoreshwa kandi mu kuvura indwara y'imirerantanga ifite udufuka twinshi (\"polycystic ovary syndrome\"). Ntabwo bifitanye isano no kongera ibiro. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nMetformin muri rusange yihanganirwa neza. Ingaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo impiswi, isesemi, no kubabara mu nda. Ifite ibyago bike byo gutera isukari nke mu maraso. Urugero rw'aside lactic mu maraso ni ikibazo gikomeye iyo umuti ukoreshejwe ku rugero runini cyane cyangwa utanzwe ku bantu bafite ibibazo bikomeye by'impyiko. Ntibyemewe ku bantu bafite indwara zikomeye z'umwijima. Nubwo nta ngaruka zigaragara zishobora guterwa no kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita, insuline muri rusange ni yo ikundwa cyane kuri diyabete yo mu gihe cyo gutwita. Metformin ni umuti wa biguanide ugabanya isukari nyinshi mu mubiri. Ikora mu kugabanya umusaruro wa glucose ukorwa n'umwijima no kongera ubushobozi bwa insuline mu ngingo z'umubiri.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nMetformin yavumbuwe mu 1922. Umuganga w\u2019Umufaransa Jean Sterne yatangiye kwiga ku bantu mu myaka ya 1950. Yashyizwe mu Bufaransa mu 1957 no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1995. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Metformin ni wo muti ukoreshwa cyane kuvura diyabete unyobwa. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cya buguzi mu bihugu byateye imbere cyari hagati 0.20 na 6 ku kwezi. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igura hagati ya 5 na 25 USD ku kwezi. Mu Bwongereza, ikinini gisanzwe cya 500 mg kigura hafi \u00a30.03, naho ubundi bwoko bukaba buhenze cyane. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa kane ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n\u2019abaganga barenga miliyoni 78."}
{"id": "23354", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23354", "title": "Tifusi", "text": "Tifusi (\"typhus\") ni itsinda ry'indwara zandura ziterwa na bagiteri, zikwirakwizwa n'udusimba nk'inda, imbaragasa n'uburondwe. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe ni umuriro, kuribwa umutwe n'uduheri ku ruhu.\nNta rukingo ruraboneka ku isoko; ivurwa n'imiti nka doxycycline.\nIbimenyetso.\nTifusi, izwi kandi nka fever ya tifusi, ni itsinda ry'indwara zandura zirimo tifusi isanzwe, tifusi yo mu bwoko bwa scrub, na tifusi yo mu bwoko bwa murine. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe birimo umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, no kugira ibisebe. Ubusanzwe ibi bitangira nyuma y'icyumweru kimwe cyangwa bibiri nyuma yo guhura n'iki cyorezo.\nImpamvu.\nIndwara ziterwa n'ubwoko bwihariye bw'ubwandu bwa bagiteri. Indwara ya tifusi iterwa na \"Rickettsia prowazekii\" ikwirakwizwa n'indwara z'umubiri, scrub tifusi iterwa na \"Orientia tsutsugamushi\" ikwirakwizwa na chiggers, naho tifusi ya murine iterwa na \"Rickettsia typhi\" ikwirakwizwa na flas.\nKwirinda n'ubuvuzi.\nKuri ubu nta rukingo ruraboneka ku isoko. Kwirinda ni ukugabanya kwibasirwa n'udukoko dukwirakwiza iyi ndwara. Uburyo bwo kuvura bukoreshwa n'umuti uvura udukoko witwa doxycycline. Indwara ya tifusi ikunze kugaragara iyo habayeho isuku nke n'ubwinshi bw'abantu. Nubwo byahoze ari ibisanzwe, ubu ni gake cyane. Indwara ya typhus iterwa n'ibiyobyabwenge iboneka mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Aziya, mu Buyapani no mu majyaruguru ya Ositaraliya. Murine typhus iboneka mu turere dushyuha n'utwo muri tropike ku isi.\nAmateka.\nTifusi yasobanuwe kuva nibura mu 1528 nyuma ya Yesu. Iri zina rikomoka ku ijambo ry'Ikigiriki \"t\u00fbphos\" (\u03c4\u03cd\u03c6\u03bf\u03c2) risobanura ubuhuha, risobanura uko imitekerereze y'abanduye imeze. Nubwo \"tifoyide\" bivuga \"bisa na tifoyide\", tifoyide na tifoyide ni indwara zitandukanye ziterwa n'ubwoko butandukanye bwa bagiteri."}
{"id": "23357", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23357", "title": "Umunwa upfutse n'akanwa gapfutse", "text": "Umunwa upfutse n'akanwa gapfutse (\"cleft lip and cleft palate\") ni itsinda ry'ubumuga bwo kuvukana aho umunwa wo hejuru cyangwa igisenge cy'akanwa bitifunze neza, bigasigaramo umwenge.\nBishobora kuvurwa neza no kubagwa, akenshi mu mezi cyangwa imyaka ya mbere y'ubuzima bw'umwana.\nIbimenyetso.\nUmunwa upfutse n'akanwa gapfutse, izwi kandi nka orofacial cleft, ni itsinda ry'indwara zirimo cleft lip, cleft palate, hamwe na zombi hamwe. Umunwa upfundikiye urimo umwenge mu munwa wo hejuru ushobora kugera mu mazuru. Umwobo ushobora kuba ku ruhande rumwe, ku mpande zombi, cyangwa hagati. Impumuro y'akanwa iba iyo mu gisenge cy'umunwa harimo umwenge ujya mu mazuru. Izi ndwara zishobora gutera ibibazo byo kurya, ibibazo byo kuvuga, ibibazo byo kutumva, no kwandura indwara zo mu matwi kenshi. Igihe kitarenze kimwe cya kabiri iyo ndwara ifitanye isano n'izindi ndwara.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nIminwa n'akanwa bipfutse ni ingaruka z'uko ingingo zo mu maso zidahuye neza mu gihe cyo gukura. Bityo rero, ni ubwoko bw'ubumuga umuntu avukana. Impamvu ntabwo izwi mu bihe byinshi. Ibintu bishobora gutera indwara birimo kunywa itabi mu gihe utwite, diyabete, umubyibuho ukabije, umubyeyi ukuze, n'imiti imwe n'imwe (nk'imwe ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe). Iminwa ipfutse n'akanwa gapfutse bishobora gupimwa mu gihe utwite hakoreshejwe isuzuma rya ultrasound.\nUbuvuzi.\nUmunwa upfutse cyangwa upfutse mu kanwa ushobora kuvurwa neza ukoresheje kubagwa. Ibi bikunze gukorwa mu mezi make ya mbere y'ubuzima ku minwa ifunguka, na mbere y'amezi cumi n'umunani ku minwa ifunguka. Ubuvuzi bw'imivugire kandi ubuvuzi bw'amenyo nabwo bushobora gukenerwa. Iyo habayeho ubuvuzi bukwiye, ibisubizo biba byiza.\nIkwirakwira.\nIminwa n'akanwa bipfutse bibaho ku bana 1 kugeza kuri 2 ku bana 1000 bavutse mu bihugu byateye imbere. Iminwa ipfutse ikunze kugaragara ku bagabo inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagore, mu gihe iminwa idafite iminwa ipfutse ikunze kugaragara ku bagore. Mu 2017, byagize ingaruka ku mfu zigera ku 3.800 ku isi, zigabanuka ugereranyije n\u2019impfu 14.600 mu 1990. Iyi ndwara yahoze yitwa \"urukwavu-iminwa\" kubera ko isa n'urukwavu cyangwa urukwavu, ariko ubu iryo jambo muri rusange rifatwa nk'iryangiza."}
{"id": "23358", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23358", "title": "Kanseri y'uruhago", "text": "Kanseri y'uruhago ni ubwoko bwa kanseri ifata uruhago rw'inkari. Ikimenyetso cyayo gikunze kugaragara ni amaraso mu nkari.\nKunywa itabi ni yo mpamvu ikomeye ishobora kuyitera; ivurwa hakurikijwe urwego igezeho.\nIbimenyetso.\nKanseri y'uruhago ni ubwoko ubwo aribwo bwose bwa kanseri ikomoka ku ngingo z'uruhago. Ni indwara aho uturemangingo dukura mu buryo budasanzwe kandi tukaba dushobora gukwirakwira no mu bindi bice by'umubiri. Ibimenyetso birimo amaraso mu nkari, kubabara iyo umuntu arimo kunyara, no kubabara umugongo wo hasi.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nIbintu bishobora gutera kanseri y'uruhago birimo kunywa itabi, amateka y'umuryango, uburyo bwo kuvura hakoreshejwe imirasire mbere, kwandura indwara z'uruhago kenshi, no guhura n'ibintu bimwe na bimwe bihumanya ikirere. Ubwoko bukunze kugaragara cyane ni kanseri y'impinduka mu turemangingo. Izindi ndwara zirimo kanseri y\u2019urusenda rwa squamous na kanseri y\u2019urusenda rwa adenocarcinoma. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bikorwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa cystoscopy hamwe na biopsy y'ingirabuzima fatizo. Iterambere rya kanseri rigaragazwa no gucibwa umuyoboro w'inkari no gupima amashusho y'abaganga.\nUbuvuzi.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'urwego rwa kanseri. Bishobora kuba birimo uburyo bwo kubaga, gukoresha imirasire, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara cyangwa ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri. Uburyo bwo kubaga bushobora kuba bukubiyemo gucibwamo umuyoboro w'inkari, gukuraho igice cy'uruhago cyangwa burundu, cyangwa kugabanya inkari. Igipimo cy\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019imyaka itanu muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ni 77%, Kanada ni 75%, naho Uburayi ni 68%.\nIkwirakwira.\nKanseri y'uruhago, mu 2018, yibasiwe n'abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 1.6 ku isi, aho abantu bashya 549.000 banduye iyi kanseri n'impfu 200.000. Imyaka yo gutangira akenshi iba hagati y'imyaka 65 na 84. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore. Mu 2018, igipimo kinini cya kanseri y'inkari cyagaragaye mu Burayi bw'Amajyepfo n'iy'Iburengerazuba, hagakurikiraho Amerika y'Amajyaruguru aho abantu 15, 13, na 12 banduye kuri buri muntu 100,000. Igipimo cyo hejuru cy\u2019impfu za kanseri y\u2019uruhago cyagaragaye muri Afurika y\u2019Amajyaruguru no muri Aziya y\u2019Iburengerazuba, hagakurikiraho Uburayi bw\u2019Amajyepfo."}
{"id": "23359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23359", "title": "Lipedema", "text": "Lipedema ni indwara irangwa no kwiyongera kudasanzwe kw'ibinure munsi y'uruhu ku maguru yombi, rimwe na rimwe no ku maboko, ikunze kuzana ububabare.\nIbasira cyane cyane abagore; nta muti uyikiza uhari, ariko ubuvuzi bushobora gufasha.\nIbimenyetso.\nLipedema ni ukwiyongera kw'amaguru yombi bitewe n'ubwiyongere bw'ibinure munsi y'uruhu, ibyo bikaba bidakwiranye. Ububabare n'ibisebe byoroshye nabyo bishobora kubaho kandi ibimenyetso muri rusange birushaho kwiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Ibirenge muri rusange ntibigira ingaruka; nubwo rimwe na rimwe amaboko abigira ingaruka. Abagore bafite ibiro ibyo ari byo byose bashobora kuba bafite iyo ndwara. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kwiheba.\nImpamvu.\nNubwo impamvu itazwi, bikekwa ko ishingiye ku ngirabuzimafatizo n'ibintu bifitanye isano n'imisemburo. Akenshi bikunze kugaragara mu miryango. Nibura mu ntangiriro sisitemu y'imitsi iba isanzwe. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso n'isuzuma. Izindi ndwara zisa nazo zirimo kubyimba kw'amaguru na lymphedema. Akenshi ifatwa nabi nk'umubyibuho ukabije.\nUbuvuzi.\nNubwo nta muti uhari, ubuvuzi bushobora gufasha. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo indyo yuzuye n'imyitozo ngororamubiri kugira ngo ukomeze kugira ibiro byiza; ariko iyi ndwara akenshi irarwanya kugabanya ibiro. Amasogisi yo gukanda bishobora gufasha mu kubabara no mu bushobozi bwo kugenda. Gukoresha liposuction bishobora gufasha mu bimenyetso bikomeye.\nIkwirakwira.\nBivugwa ko indwara ya Lipedema yibasira abagore bagera kuri 11% muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Bibaho hafi ya hose ku bagore. Gutangira gutya akenshi biba mu gihe cy'ubugimbi, gutwita, cyangwa gucura. Iyi ndwara yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1940, ibipimo bya mbere byo gusuzuma indwara byashyizweho mu 1951."}
{"id": "23360", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23360", "title": "Indwara y'imico ikwiye kwirindwa", "text": "Indwara y'imico yo kwigunga (\"avoidant personality disorder\", AvPD) ni indwara y'imico irangwa no gutinya cyane kwangwa n'abandi no kumva umuntu adashoboye, bigatuma yirinda guhura n'abandi mu kazi no mu buzima busanzwe.\nIvurwa ahanini hakoreshejwe ubuvuzi bw'ibiganiro.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara yo kwirinda imico (AvPD) ni indwara y\u2019imico irangwa n\u2019uburyo bwo gutinya cyane kwangwa n\u2019abandi no kumva ko umuntu adashoboye. Ibi bituma abantu birinda gukorana n'abandi haba mu kazi no mu mibereho yabo. Ibimenyetso bigaragara nibura mu gihe umuntu akuze. Indwara ijyana nayo ishobora kuba irimo kwiheba, gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge, n'ibibazo byo kurya.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nIbintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo amateka y'umuryango no kutitabwaho mu buryo bw'amarangamutima mu bwana. Gusuzuma bisaba ko ibimenyetso biba ku rugero rugira ingaruka ku mikorere no ku kwita ku mico n'amahame y'ubwoko. Ni indwara y\u2019imiterere y\u2019umuntu yo mu itsinda rya C. Bamwe babibona nk'ubwoko bukomeye bw'indwara yo guhangayika mu mibanire y'abantu.\nUbuvuzi n'ikwirakwira.\nUbuvuzi bushobora kuba burimo uburyo bwo kuvura imyitwarire mu buryo bw'ubwenge cyangwa uburyo bwo kuvura hagati y'abantu. Hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abantu barakira neza mu myaka 10. Abantu bagera kuri 2% nibo barwaye. Abagore n'abagabo basa nkaho bakunze kugira ingaruka zingana. Yatangijwe mu 1980 muri DSM III."}
{"id": "23361", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23361", "title": "Indwara ya Stevens-Johnson", "text": "Indwara ya Stevens-Johnson (\"Stevens\u2013Johnson syndrome\", SJS) ni ingaruka zikomeye zigaragara ku ruhu no ku duce tw'imbere tworoshye tw'umubiri, akenshi ziterwa n'imiti imwe n'imwe.\nIvurirwa mu bitaro, kandi ni indwara y'ibyihutirwa ishobora guhitana umurwayi.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara ya Stevens-Johnson (SJS) ni ubwoko bw'ingaruka zikomeye ku ruhu. Hamwe na \"toxic epidermal necrolysis\" (TEN) na \"Stevens-Johnson/toxic epidermal necrolysis\" (SJS/TEN), itera indwara zitandukanye, aho SJS idakabije cyane. Erythema multiforme (EM) muri rusange ifatwa nk'ikibazo cyihariye. Ibimenyetso bya mbere bya SJS birimo umuriro n'ibindi bimenyetso bisa n'ibicurane. Nyuma y'iminsi mike, uruhu rutangira kubyimba no gushibuka, rugakora ahantu hababaza. Uduce tw'imikaya, nk'umunwa, na byo bikunze kugaragara. Ingorane zirimo umwuma, sepsis, umusonga no kunanirwa kw'ingingo nyinshi.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ikunze kugaragara ni imiti imwe n'imwe nka lamotrigine, carbamazepine, allopurinol, antibiyotike za sulfonamide na nevirapine. Izindi mpamvu zishobora kuba zirimo indwara nka \"Mycoplasma pneumoniae\" na cytomegalovirus, cyangwa impamvu ishobora kutamenyekana. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo VIH/SIDA na lupus erythematosus.\nIsuzuma.\nIsuzuma rya syndrome ya Stevens-Johnson rishingiye ku kuba uruhu ruri munsi ya 10% by'umubiri rugira ingaruka. Bizwi nka TEN iyo uruhu rurenze 30% rugize ikibazo kandi bigafatwa nk'uburyo bwo hagati iyo 10\u201330% bigize ikibazo. Bikekwa ko SJS/TEN ikora ikoresheje uburyo bwo kuvura indwara zo mu bwoko bwa IV. Irimo kandi n'ingaruka z'imiti hamwe na eosinophilia n'ibimenyetso by'umubiri (DRESS syndrome), pustulosis ikabije ya exanthematous (AGEP) hamwe na toxic epidermal necrolysis mu itsinda ry'indwara zizwiho ingaruka zikomeye z'uruhu (SCARs).\nUbuvuzi n'ikwirakwira.\nUbusanzwe ubuvuzi bubera mu bitaro nko mu cyumba cy\u2019ubushye cyangwa icy\u2019indembe. Ibikorwa bishobora kuba birimo guhagarika icyayiteye, imiti igabanya ububabare, imiti igabanya ububabare, imiti igabanya ubukana, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara mu mitsi cyangwa imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara. Hamwe na TEN, SJS igira ingaruka ku muntu umwe kugeza kuri 2 kuri miliyoni buri mwaka. Indwara isanzwe iba munsi y'imyaka 30. Uruhu rukunze kongera gukura mu byumweru bibiri cyangwa bitatu; icyakora, gukira burundu bishobora gufata amezi. Muri rusange, ibyago byo gupfa ukoresheje SJS ni 5 kugeza 10%."}
{"id": "23362", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23362", "title": "Dapagliflozin", "text": "Dapagliflozin, igurishwa ku mazina nka Farxiga cyangwa Forxiga, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2, ukanakoreshwa ku barwayi bafite umutima unaniwe.\nIfatwa mu kanwa rimwe ku munsi.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nDapagliflozin, igurishwa ku izina rya Farxiga n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 2. Ikoreshwa kandi mu gihe umutima unaniwe hamwe n'igice cyo gusohora cyagabanutse. Mu ndwara ya diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1, ishobora gukoreshwa hamwe na insuline. Inyobwa mu kanwa rimwe ku munsi.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kwandura indwara zo mu nkari, indwara ziterwa n'ibihumyo mu kibuno, kwiyongera kw'inkari, isesemi, no kunyara. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo isukari nke mu maraso, cyane cyane iyo ikoreshejwe hamwe n'indi miti ya diyabete, umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi, Fournier gangrene, ingaruka z'ubwivumbure, na ketoacidosis ya diyabete. Gukoresha ntabwo byemewe mu gihe utwite cyangwa wonsa. Ni mu cyiciro cya gliflozin (SGLT2 inhibitor).\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nDapagliflozin yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2014. Byazanywe ku isoko bwa mbere na AstraZeneca. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi yatanzwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima nk'umuti usimbura empagliflozin. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bigura hafi amadorari 500 ku kwezi guhera mu 2020. Aya mafaranga atwara NHS mu Bwongereza agera ku biro 40. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 259 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni imwe."}
{"id": "23363", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23363", "title": "Hypertrophic cardiomyopathy", "text": "Hypertrophic cardiomyopathy (HCM) ni indwara y'umutima aho igice cy'umutima kibyimba nta mpamvu igaragara. Akenshi umuntu ayiragwa n'ababyeyi be, kandi ishobora gutera kunanirwa k'umutima cyangwa urupfu rutunguranye.\nIbimenyetso.\nHypertrophic cardiomyopathy (HCM) ni indwara y'umutima aho igice cy'umutima kibyimba nta mpamvu igaragara ihari. Ibimenyetso biratandukanye kuva ku kunanirwa, kubyimba amaguru, no kubura umwuka. Bishobora kandi gutera ububabare mu gituza cyangwa gucika intege. Ingorane zirimo kunanirwa k'umutima, umutima utera nabi, n'urupfu rutunguranye rw'umutima.\nImpamvu.\nAkenshi umuntu aragwa n'ababyeyi be. Akenshi biterwa n'impinduka mu turemangingo tumwe na tumwe twita ku gukora poroteyine z'imitsi y'umutima. Izindi mpamvu zishobora kuba zirimo indwara ya Fabry, Friedreich's ataxia, n'imiti imwe n'imwe nka tacrolimus. Ni ubwoko bwa cardiomyopathy, itsinda ry'indwara zifata cyane cyane imitsi y'umutima. Imitsi y'umutima ikomeye ituma umutima udashobora gusohora amaraso neza, kandi septum y'umutima ifite ubukana ishobora gutuma amaraso ava mu gice cy'ibumoso cy'umutima ajya mu gice cy'umutima (aorta) ndetse n'ingufu za mitral zigabanuka.\nIsuzuma n'ubuvuzi.\nGusuzuma indwara hakoreshejwe electrocardiogram na echocardiogram. Ibindi bizamini bishobora kuba birimo gupima stress no gupima imiterere y'umubiri. Abo mu muryango wawe bashobora gukorerwa isuzuma. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi butangirira kuri beta blockers, verapamil, na disopyramide. Utunyangingo tw'imitsi bikoreshwa witonze kuko bishobora kugabanya ingano y'amaraso yo mu nda y'ibumoso n'amazi asohoka. Umuti utera umutima gutera amaraso ushobora guterwa inkunga ku bantu bafite ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bw'umutima utera nabi. Kubagwa, mu buryo bwo kubagwa kwa septal myectomy cyangwa kubagwa umutima, bishobora gukorwa ku bantu batameze neza hakoreshejwe izindi ngamba. Iyo umuntu avuwe, ibyago byo gupfa azize iyi ndwara biri munsi ya 1% ku mwaka.\nIkwirakwira.\nHCM igira ingaruka ku muntu umwe kuri 200. Igipimo ku bagabo n'abagore kiri hafi kungana. Abantu b'ingeri zose bashobora kugerwaho n'ingaruka. Inyito ya mbere igezweho y\u2019iyi ndwara yanditswe na Donald Teare mu 1958."}
{"id": "23364", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23364", "title": "Encephalitis iraremba", "text": "Encephalitis lethargica (EL, izwi kandi nka \"indwara yo gusinzira\") ni ubwoko bw'ububyimbirwe bw'ubwonko butera umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, kureba kabiri no gucika intege. Yabaye icyorezo ku isi hose kuva mu 1916, kandi impamvu yayo ntiramenyekana.\nIbimenyetso.\nUbunebwe bwa Encephalitis (EL) ni ubwoko bw'ububyimbirwe bw'ubwonko bugaragazwa mu ntangiriro n'umuriro, kuribwa umutwe, kureba kabiri, uburwayi bwo mu mutwe, no gucika intege. Kenshi na kenshi, ibi bitera ko umuntu arwara koma buhoro buhoro. Indwara ya Parkinson cyangwa igicuri ishobora kugaragara mu myaka ikurikira indwara ya mbere.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana. Mu byo umuntu yatanga harimo indwara nk'ibicurane cyangwa ubwiyongere bw'umubiri. Nibura mu bihe bimwe na bimwe, iyi ndwara yagaragaye ko yakwirakwiriye hagati y\u2019abantu. Mu gihe cyo gutwita, umwana ashobora no kugira ingaruka. Uburyo bw'ibanze bwabaga burimo kubyimba ibice bimwe na bimwe by'ubwonko, mesencephalon na diencephalon. Gusuzuma byashingiye ku bimenyetso nyuma yo kwemeza ko hari abandi bantu bashobora kuba baranduye.\nUbuvuzi.\nUbuvuzi bushingira ku bimenyetso. Levodopa bishobora gutuma habaho iterambere rikomeye nubwo ari iry'igihe gito. Ibisubizo biterwa n'ingorane zijyanye nabyo. Hafi kimwe cya gatatu cy'abantu bapfuye. Benshi mu barokotse basizwe ubumuga buhoraho.\nAmateka n'ikwirakwira.\nIndwara z'ibyorezo indwara zabaye ku isi hose kuva mu 1916 kugeza mu 1930 kandi zagize ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni 5. Bikekwa ko icyorezo cyabayeho mbere, kandi kuva icyo gihe abantu batageze kuri 20 bamaze kugaragara. Iyi ndwara yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1917 na Constantin von Economo na Jean-Ren\u00e9 Cruchet. Nanone byitwa \"indwara yo gusinzira\" cyangwa \"indwara yo gusinzira\"; nubwo bitajyanye n'indwara yo gusinzira yandurira mu nzi za tsetse."}
{"id": "23365", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23365", "title": "Indwara ya Cushing", "text": "Indwara ya Cushing (\"Cushing's syndrome\") ni ihuriro ry'ibimenyetso bituruka ku kugira igihe kirekire glucocorticoid nyinshi mu mubiri, nka cortisol. Akenshi iterwa n'imiti nka prednisone, kandi indwara nyinshi zayo zishobora kuvurwa zigakira.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara ya Cushing ni ihuriro ry'ibimenyetso bituruka ku kuba umuntu ahora anywa glucocorticoids nka cortisol. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, umubyibuho ukabije wo mu nda ariko amaboko n'amaguru byoroshye, isura izengurutse, ikibyimba kiri hagati y'ibitugu, imitsi idakomeye n'amagufwa adakomeye. Impinduka mu ruhu zirimo kuma, kumera k'umusatsi mwinshi, isura itukura, ibisebe byo kunyara, ibiheri, n'uruhu rworoshye rukira nabi. Abagore bashobora kugira imihango idahwitse. Hari igihe hashobora kubaho impinduka mu byiyumvo, kuribwa umutwe, no kumva umunaniro udashira.\nImpamvu.\nIndwara ya Cushing iterwa n'imiti ikabije nka cortisol nka prednisone cyangwa ikibyimba gitera cyangwa kigatera ikorwa rya cortisol ikabije n'uturemangingo tw'inkende. Indwara ziterwa n'indwara ya pituitary adenoma zizwi nka Cushing's disease, ikaba ari yo mpamvu ya kabiri ikunze gutera indwara ya Cushing's syndrome nyuma y'imiti. Hari n'izindi kanseri nyinshi zishobora gutera indwara ya Cushing. Bimwe muri ibi bifitanye isano n'indwara z'umubiri nk'indwara nyinshi zo mu bwoko bwa 1 na Carney complex. Gusuzuma indwara bisaba intambwe nyinshi. Intambwe ya mbere ni ukugenzura imiti umuntu afata. Intambwe ya kabiri ni ugupima urugero rwa cortisol mu nkari, mu macandwe cyangwa mu maraso nyuma yo gufata dexamethasone. Iyo iki kizamini kidakunze kugaragara, cortisol ishobora gupimwa nijoro cyane. Iyo cortisol ikomeje kuba nyinshi, hashobora gukorwa isuzuma ry'amaraso rya ACTH.\nUbuvuzi.\nIndwara nyinshi zishobora kuvurwa no gukira. Iyo biterwa n'imiti, akenshi iyi miti ishobora kugabanuka buhoro buhoro iyo ikenewe cyangwa igahagarara buhoro buhoro. Iyo itewe n'ikibyimba, ishobora kuvurwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo kubaga, imiti ivura indwara ya kanseri, cyangwa imirasire. Iyo pituitary yagizweho ingaruka, hashobora kuba hakenewe indi miti kugira ngo isimbuze imikorere yayo yatakaye. Mu kuvurwa, igihe cyo kubaho gisanzwe kiba gisanzwe. Bamwe mu bo kubagwa bitabasha gukuraho ikibyimba cyose, bafite ibyago byinshi byo gupfa.\nIkwirakwira.\nAbantu bagera kuri babiri kugeza kuri batatu kuri miliyoni buri mwaka barayibasirwa. Ikunze kwibasira abantu bafite imyaka iri hagati ya 20 na 50. Abagore bibasirwa n\u2019iyi ndwara inshuro eshatu kurusha abagabo. Icyakora, urugero ruto rw'umusaruro ukabije wa cortisol nta bimenyetso bigaragara ni rwo rukunze kugaragara. Indwara ya Cushing yasobanuwe bwa mbere n'umuganga w'imitsi w'umunyamerika Harvey Cushing mu 1932. Indwara ya Cushing ishobora no kugaragara mu zindi nyamaswa zirimo injangwe, imbwa n'amafarashi."}
{"id": "23366", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23366", "title": "Indwara ya Prion", "text": "Indwara ya Prion (\"transmissible spongiform encephalopathy\", TSE) ni itsinda ry'indwara zo mu bwonko ziterwa na poroteyine zigoramye zitwa \"prion\", zitera gupfa k'uturemangingo tw'ubwonko. Nta buryo bwihariye bwo kuyivura cyangwa urukingo buhari, kandi zirica.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara ya Prion, izwi kandi nka transmissible spongiform encephalopathy (TSE), ni itsinda ry'indwara zo mu bwonko zitera gutakaza uturemangingo tw'ubwonko. Ibimenyetso bikunze kuba birimo kugorwa no gutekereza, impinduka mu miterere y'umubiri, n'ibibazo byo guhuza imikorere y'umubiri, ibyo bikaba birushaho kwiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kwihuta, gusinzira nabi, no gukubita ibisebe. Bishobora gufata imyaka myinshi uhereye igihe ibimenyetso bitangiye kugaragara. Ariko, iyo ibimenyetso bitangiye, urupfu rukunze kugaragara mu mezi cyangwa imyaka.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu nyamukuru ni poroteyine isanzwe ihari ariko igonganye, izwi nka prion, ituma poroteyine zisanzwe zigonganye. Iyi ndwara ishobora gutangira mu buryo butunguranye, igaterwa n'impinduka mu ngirabuzimafatizo umuntu akura ku babyeyi be, cyangwa igakwirakwira hagati y'abantu. Bishobora gukwirakwira binyuze mu gukora ku ngingo zanduye cyangwa ibikoresho by'ubuvuzi byanduye; ariko, ntibikwirakwira binyuze mu mwuka cyangwa mu buryo bwinshi bwo gukoranaho bisanzwe. Isuzuma rishobora gukeka ko rishingiye ku isuzuma kandi rikemezwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gusuzuma ubwonko. Bituma ubwonko bugira utwenge duto cyane, bigatuma bugaragara nk'aho ari nk'aho butwikiriwe na mikorosikopi.\nUbwoko.\nIndwara mu bantu zirimo indwara ya Creutzfeldt-Jakob (CJD), indwara ya Creutzfeldt-Jakob (vCJD), kuru, indwara ya prionopathy iterwa na poroteyine, indwara ya Gerstmann-Str\u00e4ussler-Scheinker, hamwe n'indwara yo kudasinzira neza. Indwara mu zindi nyamaswa zirimo indwara yo mu bwonko yitwa spongiform encephalopathy (BSE), scrapie, n'indwara yo gupfusha ubusa igihe kirekire. vCJD bikekwa ko iterwa no kurya inyama z'inka yanduye BSE.\nUbuvuzi n'ikwirakwira.\nNta buryo bwihariye bwo kuvura cyangwa urukingo buhari. Ubuyobozi ni ubuvuzi bushyigikira. Gukoresha uburyo busanzwe bwo koroshya indwara ntibituma prions zidandura, ahubwo hakoreshejwe bleach ikomeye mu buryo bwa sodium hypochlorite cyangwa ubushyuhe kugeza nibura kuri dogere 134.\u00a0\u00b0C irakenewe. Indwara za Prion ni gake cyane. Kuru ni yo ndwara ya mbere yemejwe nk'iyi, yasobanuwe mu 1957."}
{"id": "23367", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23367", "title": "Umwobo w'ibuye", "text": "Umwobo wa \"burr\" (\"tr\u00e9panation\") ni uburyo bwo kubaga bukorwa hacukurwa umwobo mu gihanga. Bukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura amaraso yireze mu mutwe (\"hematoma\"), kandi ni bumwe mu buryo bwo kubaga bwa kera cyane bwakozwe mu mateka.\nIcyo bikoreshwa.\nUmwobo wa Burr, uzwi kandi ku izina rya trepanation, ni uburyo bwo gukora umwobo unyuze mu gahanga. Ibi bikorwa mu kuvura hematoma ziri hejuru cyangwa munsi y'agahu gakomeye gapfuka ubwonko iyo habayeho impinduka hagati, igipimo cya Glasgow coma kiri munsi ya 8, kandi imboni y'ijisho rimwe yagutse. Nubwo akenshi bikorwa n'abaganga b'indwara z'ubwonko, bishobora gukorwa n'umuganga wihutirwa niba uwa mbere adahari.\nUko bikorwa.\nMuri rusange umuntu aterwa ikinya mbere yo gutangira. Aho amaraso yavuye byemezwa kuri CT scan kandi ubugari bw'agahanga kari hejuru y'umutwe bupimwe. Aho hantu ni ho kogoshwa, hagashyirwamo imiti yica udukoko, hanyuma hagaterwa lidocaine irimo epinephrine. Hakatwa uruhu kugeza ku igufwa, ahantu hareshya na santimetero 4. Ibi muri rusange bikorwa intoki ebyiri imbere n'intoki ebyiri hejuru y'umuyoboro w'ugutwi. Agakoresho ko kugarura uruhu gakoreshwa mu kugumisha uruhu rufunguye mu gihe agakoresho ko kuvoma gakoreshwa mu kunyura mu gahanga. Iyo amaraso afite epidural hematoma, ashobora gusohoka cyangwa agakenera gukururwa buhoro buhoro. Ku bijyanye na hematoma iri munsi y'agahu gapfuka ubwonko (\"dura mater\"), ako gahu kagomba guterurwa hakoreshejwe agakoresho gatyaye kandi kagacibwamo ishusho ya X.\nIngaruka n'amateka.\nAntibiyotike zigomba gutangwa kugira ngo hirindwe kwandura kandi umuntu agomba kwitabwaho by\u2019umwihariko binyuze mu kubaga ubwonko. Trepanation ni bwo bwoko bwa kera cyane bwo kubaga bufite ibimenyetso bigaragaza ko bwakozwe mu mateka. Abahanga mu by'imibereho y'abantu bemeza ko byabanje gukorwa ku bw'inyungu z'umwuka, igicuri, kuribwa umutwe, ibikomere byo mu mutwe, n'indwara zo mu mutwe."}
{"id": "23368", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23368", "title": "Kudafata umurego kw'igitsina cy'umugabo", "text": "Kudafata umurego kw'igitsina cy'umugabo (\"erectile dysfunction\", ED, cyangwa \"impotence\") ni ikibazo aho igitsina cy'umugabo kidakomera bihagije ngo akore imibonano mpuzabitsina ishimishije. Gishobora guterwa n'impamvu z'umubiri cyangwa izo mu mutwe, kandi kiravurwa.\nIbimenyetso.\nKudakora neza kw'imibonano mpuzabitsina (ED), nanone bita impotence, ni ubwoko bw'imibonano mpuzabitsina idakora neza aho igitsina kidakomera bihagije kugira ngo gikore imibonano mpuzabitsina ishimishije. Bishobora kuba ikibazo cy'igihe gito cyangwa kirekire. Bishobora kugira ingaruka ku mibereho y'umuntu bigatuma agira ihungabana, guhangayika cyangwa ubugumba.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nIbintu bishobora gutera indwara birimo diyabete, indwara z'umutima, umubyibuho ukabije, ibibazo by'impyiko, kunywa itabi, inzoga, guhangayika, n'imiti imwe n'imwe. Imiti ishobora kuba irimo imiti igabanya umuvuduko w'amaraso, imiti igabanya androgens, benzodiazepines, n'imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara zo kwiheba. Bishobora kandi kubaho nyuma y\u2019uburyo bumwe na bumwe nko kubagwa prostate. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso n'isuzuma.\nUbuvuzi.\nUbuvuzi bushobora kuba bukubiyemo gukemura impamvu zibitera, impinduka mu mibereho, no gutanga inama. Imiti nka sildenafil (umuti ubuza PDE5) ishobora gukoreshwa. Andi mahitamo ashobora kuba arimo alprostadil cyangwa penis pump. Niba izi ngamba zitari kubaga neza, mu buryo bwo gushyiramo igitsina cyangwa imitsi yo mu mitsi, bishobora kuba amahitamo. Ibisubizo biterwa n'impamvu.\nIkwirakwira n'amateka.\nKudakora neza kw'intanga ngabo birakunze kugaragara, bikagira ingaruka ku bagabo bagera kuri miliyoni 30 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Nubwo bigenda birushaho kwiyongera uko imyaka igenda ishira, ntabwo ari ikintu gisanzwe mu gusaza. Abagabo barengeje imyaka 40 bashobora kurwara iyi ndwara. Abantu ku isi yose baragerwaho n'ingaruka."}
{"id": "23369", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23369", "title": "Celecoxib", "text": "Celecoxib, igurishwa ku mazina nka Celebrex, ni umuti urwanya ububyimbirwe utari steroide (NSAID) wo mu bwoko bwa \"COX-2 inhibitor\". Ukoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare n'ububyimbirwe, cyane cyane mu ndwara za rubagimpande, kandi ufatwa mu kanwa.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nCelecoxib, igurishwa ku izina rya Celebrex n'indi, ni umuti ugabanya ubukana bwa COX-2 n'umuti urwanya ububyimbirwe utari steroide (NSAID). Ikoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare n'ububyimbirwe mu ndwara ya osteoarthritis, ububabare bukabije ku bantu bakuru, rubagimpande, ankylosing spondylitis, imihango ibabaza, na rubagimpande y'abana bato. Ishobora kandi gukoreshwa mu kugabanya ibyago byo kurwara adenomas zo mu maraso ku bantu bafite polyposis zo mu muryango. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ibyiza bikunze kugaragara mu isaha imwe.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kubabara mu nda, isesemi, no gucibwamo. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo indwara z'umutima, gucika imitsi mu gifu, gucika kw'igifu, kuva amaraso mu gifu, impyiko kunanirwa, no kubura umwuka. Gukoresha ntabwo byemewe ku bantu bafite ibyago byinshi byo kurwara indwara z'umutima. Ingaruka zabyo ni nk'izindi NSAID, nka ibuprofen na naproxen. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa mu gihe cyo konsa.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nCelecoxib yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1993, itangira gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1999. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ku kwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS munsi y'amapawundi 2 kugeza mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi $12.90. Mu 2011, yari imwe mu miti yagurishijwe cyane ya Pfizer, aho yagurishijwe miliyari 2.5 z'amadolari. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 106 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni zirindwi."}
{"id": "23370", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23370", "title": "Gutwitira hanze ya nyababyeyi", "text": "Gutwitira hanze ya nyababyeyi (\"ectopic pregnancy\") ni ikibazo cyo gutwita aho urusoro rwifata hanze ya nyababyeyi (umura). Ibimenyetso bikunze kugaragara ni ukubabara mu nda no kuva amaraso mu gitsina; ni ikibazo cyihutirwa gisaba kuvurwa vuba.\nIbimenyetso.\nGutwitira hanze ya nyababyeyi ni ikibazo cyo gutwita aho urusoro rwifata hanze y'umura. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe birimo kubabara mu nda no kuva amaraso mu gitsina, ariko abagore babarirwa munsi ya 50 ku ijana by'abanduye bafite ibi bimenyetso byombi. Ububabare bushobora gusobanurwa nk'ubukana bukabije, butoroshye, cyangwa buterwa n'ibisebe. Ububabare bushobora no gukwirakwira mu rutugu iyo habayeho kuva amaraso mu nda. Kuva amaraso menshi bishobora gutuma umutima utera cyane, gucika intege, cyangwa gutungurwa. Nubwo hari igihe kidasanzwe, umwana uri mu nda ntashobora kubaho.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nIbintu bishobora gutera gutwita hanze ya nyababyeyi birimo indwara yo kubyimba mu kibuno, akenshi iterwa n'ubwandu bwa chlamydia; kunywa itabi; kubagwa mbere mu miyoboro y'amaraso; amateka yo kutabyara; no gukoresha ikoranabuhanga ryifashishijwe mu kubyara. Abahoze batwita inda itarabyara bafite ibyago byinshi byo kubyara indi. Inyinshi mu nda zitwite hanze y'uruhu (90%) zibera mu muyoboro w'inda, bizwi nka \"tubal pregnancies\", ariko gutera inda bishobora no kubaho ku nkondo y'umura, ku dusabo tw'intanga, cyangwa mu nda. Gupima inda itwite mu nda akenshi bipimwa amaraso kugira ngo harebwe ko umuntu atwite (hCG) na ultrasound. Ibi bishobora gusaba ibizamini inshuro zirenze imwe. Ultrasound ikora neza iyo ikorewe mu gitsina. Izindi mpamvu zitera ibimenyetso nk'ibi zirimo: gukuramo inda, gucika kw'intanga ngore, na appendicitis ikabije.\nKwirinda n'ubuvuzi.\nKwirinda ni ukugabanya ibintu bishobora gutera indwara nka chlamydia binyuze mu gusuzuma no kuvura. Nubwo gutwita inda zimwe na zimwe zipfa kubyara bizashira nta kuvurwa, ubu buryo ntiburakorwa neza kugeza mu 2014. Gukoresha umuti wa methotrexate birakora kimwe no kubaga mu bihe bimwe na bimwe. By\u2019umwihariko bikora neza iyo beta-HCG iri hasi kandi ingano y\u2019inda isohoka mu nda ikaba ari nto. Kubagwa biracyasabwa iyo umuyoboro wacitse, umutima w'umwana uri mu nda utera nabi, cyangwa ibimenyetso by'ubuzima bw'umuntu bidahamye. Kubagwa bishobora gukorwa hakoreshejwe laparoscopic cyangwa hakoreshejwe incision nini, izwi nka laparotomy. Muri rusange ibisubizo ni byiza ku bagore bavurwa.\nIkwirakwira.\nIgipimo cy'inda ziterwa n'inda zitwite ku kigero cya 1% na 2% cy'ivuka ry'abana bavutse ari bazima mu bihugu byateye imbere, nubwo gishobora kuba kiri hejuru ya 4% mu bakoresha ikoranabuhanga rifasha mu kubyara. Ni yo mpamvu ikunze gutera impfu mu bagore mu gihembwe cya mbere cy'umubyibuho, hafi 10% by'impfu zose. Mu bihugu byateye imbere, ibyavuye mu iterambere byarazamutse mu gihe mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere akenshi bikomeza kuba bikennye. Ingaruka z'urupfu mu bihugu byateye imbere ziri hagati ya 0.1 na 0.3 ku ijana mu gihe mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere ziri hagati ya kimwe na bitatu ku ijana. Ibisobanuro bya mbere bizwi ku gutwita hanze y'umura ni ibyavuzwe na Al-Zahrawi mu kinyejana cya 11. Ijambo \"ectopic\" risobanura \"bitagaragara\"."}
{"id": "23371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23371", "title": "Indwara ya Serotonin", "text": "Indwara ya Serotonin (\"serotonin syndrome\", SS) ni itsinda ry'ibimenyetso bigaragara iyo umuntu afashe imiti imwe n'imwe yongera serotonin mu mubiri. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuva ku byoroheje kugeza ku bikomeye; ubuvuzi bwa mbere ni uguhagarika imiti yabiteye.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara ya Serotonin (SS) ni itsinda ry'ibimenyetso bishobora kubaho iyo umuntu afashe imiti cyangwa imiti imwe n'imwe itera serotonin. Ingano y'ibimenyetso ishobora kuva ku byoroheje kugeza ku bikomeye. Ibimenyetso mu bihe byoroheje birimo umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso no gutera cyane k'umutima; akenshi nta muriro urimo. Ibimenyetso mu bihe biri hagati birimo ubushyuhe bwinshi bw'umubiri, guhindagurika kw'imitekerereze, kwiyongera kw'imitekerereze, guhinda umushyitsi, ibyuya, amaso y'umubiri yagutse, no gucibwamo. Mu bihe bikomeye ubushyuhe bw'umubiri bushobora kwiyongera bukarenga. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo gucika intege no kuvunika imitsi cyane.\nImpamvu.\nIndwara ya Serotonin ikunze guterwa no gukoresha imiti cyangwa imiti ibiri cyangwa myinshi itera serotonin. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo inhibitor ya serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI), inhibitor ya serotonin norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor (SNRI), inhibitor ya monoamine oxidase (MAOI), imiti igabanya ubukana bwa tricyclic (TCAs), amfetamine, pethidine (meperidine), tramadol, dextromethorphan, buspirone, L-tryptophan, 5-HTP, St. John's wort, triptans, ecstasy (MDMA), metoclopramide, ondansetron, cyangwa kokayine. Bibaho hafi 15% by'ibipimo byo gukoresha SSRI birenze urugero. Ni ingaruka zishoboka zo kuba serotonin nyinshi ku buryo bworoshye bwo mu mitsi yo hagati (CNS). Ibimenyetso bitangira kugaragara mu munsi umwe nyuma yo kuba serotonin yiyongereyeho.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso by'umuntu n'amateka ye yo gukoresha imiti. Izindi ndwara zishobora gutera ibimenyetso nk'ibyo nka neuroleptic malignant syndrome, malignant hyperthermia, anticholinergic toxicity, heat stroke, na meningitis zigomba gukurwaho. Nta bipimo byo muri laboratwari bishobora kwemeza ko indwara yanduye.\nUbuvuzi.\nUbuvuzi bwa mbere bugizwe no guhagarika imiti ishobora kuba irimo uruhare. Ku bantu bafite ikibazo cyo guhangayika, imiti ya benzodiazepines ishobora gukoreshwa. Iyo ibi bidahagije, ushobora gukoresha umuti urwanya serotonin nka cyproheptadine. Ku bafite ubushyuhe bwinshi bw'umubiri, ingamba zo gukonjesha zishobora kuba ngombwa. Umubare w'abantu barwara indwara ya serotonin buri mwaka nturamenyekana neza. Iyo umuntu avuwe neza, ibyago byo gupfa biri munsi ya kimwe ku ijana. Urubanza rwa Libby Zion, uzwi cyane ko yapfuye azize indwara ya serotonin, rwatumye habaho impinduka mu mashuri yisumbuye y\u2019ubuganga muri Leta ya New York."}
{"id": "23372", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23372", "title": "Pica (indwara)", "text": "Pica ni indwara irangwa no kurarikira no kurya ibintu bitari ibiryo, nk'ubutaka, urubura, umusatsi cyangwa irangi. Ikunze kugaragara ku bana no ku bagore batwite.\nIbimenyetso n'ingaruka.\nPica ni indwara irangwa no gushaka no kurya ibintu bitafatwa nk'ibiryo. Muri rusange irari ni ibintu bimwe na bimwe byihariye nk'ubutaka, ibirayi bibisi, urubura, umusatsi, cyangwa irangi. Akenshi ibimenyetso bike biragaragara nubwo ububabare bwo mu nda bushobora kubaho rimwe na rimwe. Pica ishobora gutera uburozi bwa lisansi, kuziba igifu, kugabanuka k'uturemangingo dutukura mu maraso, cyangwa kwandura indwara ziterwa n'udukoko.\nUbuvuzi.\nKu bana basanzwe, pica mu gihe muri rusange biyemeza kwigisha ibikwiye kurya. Ubujyanama, harimo n'ubuvuzi bw'imyitwarire, nabyo bishobora kuba ingirakamaro. Iyo habayeho ikibazo cyo kubura icyuma gihagije, ibi bigomba kuvurwa.\nIkwirakwira.\nPica igira ingaruka ku bana n'abagore batwite bagera kuri 30%. Ku bana, ikunze kugaragara cyane ku bafite hagati y'amezi 18 n'imyaka 6. Ivugwa kuri pica ni iya Hippocrates mu myaka irenga 2.000 ishize. Iri jambo ryitiriwe igisasu gisanzwe (Pica pica) kirya ibintu bidasanzwe."}
{"id": "23373", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23373", "title": "Citalopram", "text": "Citalopram, igurishwa ku mazina nka Celexa, ni umuti uvura indwara y'agahinda wo mu bwoko bwa \"selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor\" (SSRI). Ifatwa mu kanwa, kandi yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1998.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nCitalopram, igurishwa ku izina rya Celexa n'izindi, ni umuti uvura indwara y'agahinda wo mu bwoko bwa serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI). Ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba, indwara yo kwiheba ishingiye ku bwenge, indwara yo gucika intege, no gutinya abantu. Ingaruka zo kugabanya ubukana bw'indwara zishobora gufata icyumweru kimwe kugeza kuri bine kugira ngo ziboneke. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, gusinzira nabi, ibibazo by'imibonano mpuzabitsina, kuzuyaza, kumva unaniwe, no kubira ibyuya. Ingaruka mbi zirimo kwiyongera k'ibyago byo kwiyahura ku bari munsi y'imyaka 25, serotonin syndrome, glaucoma, na QT prolongation. Ntibikwiye gukoreshwa ku muntu uri kuri MAO inhibitor. Indwara yo guhagarika kwiheba ishobora kubaho iyo ihagaritswe. Hari impungenge ko kuyikoresha mu gihe utwite bishobora kwangiza umwana.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nCitalopram yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1998. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi yatanzwe n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima nk'umuti usimbura fluoxetine. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Mu Bwongereza, igipimo gisanzwe gitwara NHS kiri munsi ya 20 GBP ku kwezi. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igura hagati ya 50 na 100 USD ku kwezi guhera mu 2016. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 26 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 24."}
{"id": "23374", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23374", "title": "Lidocaine", "text": "Lidocaine, izwi kandi nka lignocaine, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu gutera ikinya agace runaka k'umubiri (\"anesth\u00e9sie locale\"), ukanakoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zimwe na zimwe z'umutima zituma utera nabi. Yavumbuwe mu 1946, kandi iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nLidocaine, izwi kandi nka lignocaine, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu gutera ikinya mu gace runaka (anesthesia yo mu gace). Ikoreshwa kandi mu kuvura tachycardia y'imitsi no mu gukora imitsi ifungana. Hari umuti witwa Lidocaine uvanze n'umuti muto wa adrenaline (epinephrine) uboneka kugira ngo ufashe abantu kugira ibinya, ugabanye kuva amaraso, kandi utume ingaruka zo kugira ibinya zimara igihe kirekire. Iyo ikoreshejwe nk'umuti uterwa n'urushinge, lidocaine itangira gukora mu minota ine ikamara igice cy'isaha kugeza ku masaha atatu. Uruvange rwa Lidocaine rushobora kandi gushyirwa ku ruhu cyangwa mu ruhu kugira ngo rushire ububabare muri ako gace.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara mu gukoresha imiti igabanya ububabare harimo gusinzira, kunyaragura imitsi, urujijo, impinduka mu byo umuntu abona, kugira ibinya, kuribwa mu nda no kuruka. Bishobora gutera umuvuduko w'amaraso muke ndetse n'umuvuduko w'umutima utera mu buryo budasanzwe. Hari impungenge ko kuyitera mu ngingo bishobora guteza ibibazo kuri karitsiye. Muri rusange bisa nkaho ari byiza gukoreshwa mu gihe cyo gutwita. Ku bafite ibibazo by'umwijima, dose nke ishobora kuba ikenewe. Muri rusange ni byiza kuyikoresha ku bantu bafite ubwivumbure kuri tetracaine cyangwa benzocaine. Lidocaine ni umuti urwanya arrhythmia yo mu bwoko bwa Ib. Ibi bivuze ko bikora binyuze mu kuziba imiyoboro ya sodium bityo bigabanura umuvuduko wo kugabanuka k'umutima. Iyo ikoreshejwe mu gace runaka nk'ikintu gitera indwara, ubwonko bwo mu gace ntibushobora gutanga amakuru ku bwonko.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nLidocaine yavumbuwe mu 1946 itangira kugurishwa mu 1948. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cyo kugurisha ku bucuruzi mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere mu 2014 cyari hagati na 1.05 kuri buri gacupa ka mililitiro 20 k'umuti. Igurishwa munsi y'amazina menshi arimo Xylocaine. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 208 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni ebyiri."}
{"id": "23375", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23375", "title": "Tizanidine", "text": "Tizanidine, igurishwa ku mazina nka Zanaflex, ni umuti woroshya imitsi ukoreshwa mu kuvura imitsi ifunganye bitewe n'imvune y'umugongo cyangwa \"multiple sclerosis\". Ifatwa mu kanwa, kandi yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1996.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nTizanidine, igurishwa ku izina rya Zanaflex n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura imitsi idakora neza bitewe n'imvune y'umugongo cyangwa multiple sclerosis. Kugira ingaruka ku mikorere bisa nka baclofen cyangwa diazepam. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuma mu kanwa, gusinzira, gucika intege, no kuzerera. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo umuvuduko muke w'amaraso, ibibazo by'umwijima, indwara yo mu mutwe, no kwangirika k'umuvuduko wa QT. Ntabwo birasobanuka neza niba gukoresha imiti mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa ari nta kibazo. Ni agonisti ya \u03b12-adrenergic kandi uburyo ikora ntibusobanutse neza.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nTizanidine yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1996. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ku kwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri 3.45 \u00a3 mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 4.20. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 89 watanzwe cyane muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni icyenda."}
{"id": "23376", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23376", "title": "Deksamethasoni", "text": "Deksamethasoni (\"dexamethasone\") ni umuti wo mu bwoko bwa corticosteroid ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara nyinshi, zirimo rubagimpande, indwara z'uruhu, ubwivumbure bukomeye, asima n'indwara z'ibihaha. Yakozwe bwa mbere mu 1957, kandi iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nDexamethasone ni ubwoko bw'umuti wa corticosteroid. Ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara nyinshi, harimo ibibazo bya rubagimpande, indwara nyinshi z'uruhu, ubwivumbure bukomeye, asima, indwara idakira y'ibihaha, croup, kubyimba ubwonko, ububabare bw'amaso nyuma yo kubagwa amaso, ndetse n'imiti yica udukoko mu gituntu. Mu gihe imikorere y\u2019uturemangingo tw\u2019inkondo y\u2019umura idafite ubushobozi bwo gukora neza, igomba gukoreshwa hamwe n\u2019umuti ufite ingaruka nyinshi za mineralocorticoid nka fludrocortisone. Mu gihe cyo kubyara mbere y'igihe, ishobora gukoreshwa mu kunoza umusaruro w'umwana. Ishobora gufatwa mu kanwa, nk'urushinge mu mitsi, cyangwa ikayiterwa mu mitsi. Ingaruka za dexamethasone zikunze kugaragara mu munsi umwe kandi zimara iminsi itatu.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nKuyikoresha igihe kirekire bishobora gutera indwara y'imitsi, gutakaza amagufwa, indwara ya kataract, gukomereka byoroshye, cyangwa intege nke z'imitsi. Yakunze gukoreshwa mu kanwa mu gihe cyo gutwita kandi ntibyagaragaye ko itera ibibazo umwana. Ntibikwiye gufatwa mu gihe cyo konsa. Dexamethasone ifite ingaruka zo kurwanya ububyimbirwe no gukumira ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nDexamethasone yakozwe bwa mbere mu 1957, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1961. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Dexamethasone ntabwo ihenze. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, imiti y'ukwezi igura munsi y'amadolari 25 y'Amerika. Mu Buhinde, uburyo bwo kuvura abana bavutse mbere y'igihe butwara hafi amadolari y'Amerika 0.5. Iraboneka mu bice byinshi by'isi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 321 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni imwe."}
{"id": "23377", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23377", "title": "Indwara ya Costochondritis", "text": "Costochondritis (izwi kandi nka \"chest wall pain syndrome\") ni ububabare bwo mu gituza buturuka ku rukuta rw'igituza. Ubusanzwe iyi ndwara irashira uko igihe kigenda, nubwo ishobora kongera kugaruka; ivurwa ahanini n'imiti igabanya ububabare.\nIbimenyetso.\nCostochondritis ni ububabare bwo mu gituza ku rukuta rw'igituza Ububabare muri rusange buboneka aho umuntu ari kandi bushobora kongera kugaruka binyuze mu gusunika aho hantu. Uduce twinshi tw\u2019agatsi dushobora kuba turimo. Ububabare bushobora kwiyongera bitewe n'ingendo zimwe na zimwe no guhumeka cyane. Ububabare bushobora kuba bukabije cyangwa butoroshye. Ubusanzwe indwara ya Costochondritis irashira uko igihe kigenda, nubwo ishobora kongera kugaruka.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nIbintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri isubiramo cyangwa inkorora ibanje. Gusuzuma indwara bikubiyemo gukuraho izindi ndwara zishobora kugaragara nk'izo zirimo: indwara y'umutima, angina, kuribwa mu gifu, umusonga, na embolism y'ibihaha. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi muri rusange ni ibisanzwe. Bikekwa ko uburyo bw'ibanze bwo kubyimba buterwa no kubyimba. Iyo habayeho kubyimba, iyo ndwara yitwa Tietze's syndrome, ijambo rishobora gukoreshwa mu buryo bumwe ariko rigafatwa nk'indwara itandukanye.\nUbuvuzi n'ikwirakwira.\nKubabara mu gituza bifatwa nk'ikibazo cyihutirwa cy'ubuvuzi kugeza igihe indwara zishobora guteza akaga zizaba zitakiriho. Kuvura costochondritis bishobora kuba birimo kuruhuka, barafu n'ubushyuhe, parasetamol (acetaminophen), n'imiti igabanya ubushyuhe itari steroide (NSAIDs). Ibibazo bidakira bishobora gukemurwa hakoreshejwe physiotherapy cyangwa inshinge za steroid zo mu gace runaka. Costochondritis igaragara hagati ya 13 na 36% by'abantu bababara mu gatuza. Abana n'abantu bakuru bashobora kugerwaho n'ingaruka."}
{"id": "23378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23378", "title": "Op\u00e9ration Koundjoar\u00e9", "text": "Op\u00e9ration Koundjoar\u00e9 ni igikorwa cya gisirikare cya Togo cyatangiye ku wa 11 Nzeri 2018 mu Ntara ya Savanes, mu majyaruguru y'igihugu, kugira ngo gihangane n'imitwe y'abajihadi ituruka muri Sahel.\nKiyoborwa n'Ingabo za Togo, kigamije kurinda ubusugire bw'igihugu n'abaturage ku mipaka ya Burukina Faso na Bene.\nAmateka.\nIgikorwa cyashyizweho mu gihe umutekano wazambaga muri Sahel. Igitero gikomeye cyabaye mu ijoro ryo ku wa 10 rishyira ku wa 11 Gicurasi 2022 i Kpinkankandi: abasirikare 8 barapfuye, abandi 13 barakomereka. Muri Gicurasi 2026, igikorwa cyari kiyobowe na Koloneli Lati\u00e8mb\u00e9 Kombate.\nKwibuka.\nMu Mutarama 2025, abasirikare baguye muri iki gikorwa bahawe icyubahiro i Lom\u00e9, bambikwa nyuma y'urupfu umudari wa \"Ordre du Mono\"."}
{"id": "23379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23379", "title": "Tharcisse Sinzi", "text": "Tharcisse Sinzi ni Umunyarwanda warokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, umwarimu wa karate akaba n'umwanditsi.\nAzwiho kuba yarayoboye irwanaho ry'itsinda ry'Abatutsi ku musozi wa Songa, mu karere ka Butare, muri Mata 1994, no ku buhamya bwe bwasohotse mu gitabo \"Combattre\" yanditse afatanyije n'umunyamakuru w'Umufaransa Thomas Zribi.\nUbuzima.\nTharcisse Sinzi yavukiye mu muryango w'Abatutsi mu majyepfo y'Rwanda, mu karere ka Butare, mu gihe Abatutsi bakorerwaga ivangura. Se yamwise izina \u00abSinzi\u00bb, bisobanura ko atazi ahazaza h'abana b'Abatutsi muri icyo gihe.\nNubwo yahuye n'ivangura mu kwinjira mu mashuri yisumbuye, yakomeje amashuri, nyuma aza gukora nk'umukozi wa laboratwari mu Kigo cy'Ubushakashatsi mu by'Ubuhinzi (ISAR) i Songa, mu yahoze ari komini Rusatira. Mu mpera z'imyaka ya 1970 yatangiye gukina karate abitewe na mukuru we; yageze ku mukandara w'umukara n'amapeti yo hejuru (\"dan\"), aba umwe mu bazwi cyane muri uwo mukino mu Rwanda.\nIrwanaho rya Songa.\nJenoside itangiye muri Mata 1994, Sinzi yakoraga muri laboratwari ya ISAR Songa. Ku wa 13 Mata 1994, ubwo Interahamwe n'ingabo z'ubutegetsi bwariho zateraga Abatutsi bari bahungiye muri ako gace, yiyemeje gutegura irwanaho kugira ngo \u00abbadapfa batirwanaho\u00bb.\nAbaturage bo mu mudugudu we bamwiyungaho, bitwaje ibikoresho by'ubuhinzi, amabuye n'inkoni gusa. Yifashishije ubumenyi bwe muri karate, yashyize ku murongo irwanaho, akomeza ikinyabupfura n'icyizere cy'impunzi. Itsinda ryahungiye ku musozi wa Songa, aho Abatutsi ibihumbi baturutse ku misozi ikikije bahuriye. Nk'uko inkuru zasohotse zibivuga, abantu bagera ku 3 400 bahurira i Songa bayobowe na we. Ibitero byari kenshi kandi bikaze cyane iyo abajandarume bazaga bitwaje imbunda na gerenade. Nubwo hapfuye benshi, iryo rwanaho ryatumye abantu barenga ijana barokoka.\nNyuma ya jenoside.\nSinzi yarokotse jenoside, ariko benshi mu bagize umuryango we barishwe. Yakomeje gukora muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda, ku cyicaro cya Huye, nk'ushinzwe serivisi z'inyubako (\"Director of Estates\"), anakomeza kwigisha karate.\nYatanze ubuhamya ahantu henshi: mu bihe byo Kwibuka, mu nama z'amashyirahamwe y'abarokotse, no mu Burayi, harimo ku Nzu Ndangamateka ya Shoah (\"M\u00e9morial de la Shoah\") i Paris n'i Chambon-sur-Lignon mu Bufaransa.\nIgitabo \"Combattre\".\nMu 2025, inzu y'ibitabo Tallandier yasohoye \"Combattre. R\u00e9cit d'un r\u00e9sistant face au g\u00e9nocide des Tutsi\", yanditse afatanyije n'umunyamakuru akaba n'umuyobozi wa filime w'Umufaransa Thomas Zribi. Kivuga urugendo rwe kuva mu bwana bwaranzwe n'ivangura, kugeza ku irwanaho ryo mu 1994 no kwiyubaka nyuma ya jenoside, ndetse n'uburyo bwo kubaho nyuma yo kubura abe batari bake atagize urwango. Icyo gitabo cyabaye intandaro y'ibiganiro mbwirwaruhame ku kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, cyane cyane mu Bufaransa no mu Ububiligi."}
{"id": "23380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23380", "title": "Rom\u00e9o Dallaire", "text": "Rom\u00e9o Antonius Dallaire (yavutse ku wa 25 Kamena 1946 i Denekamp, mu Ubuholandi) ni umusirikare w'Umunyakanada wageze ku ipeti rya \"lieutenant-g\u00e9n\u00e9ral\", akaba n'umunyapolitiki n'umwanditsi.\nAzwi cyane kubera ko yari umuyobozi w'ingabo z'Umuryango w'Abibumbye zari mu butumwa bwa MINUAR mu Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Yagerageje gukangurira umuryango mpuzamahanga ibyaberaga mu Rwanda ariko ntiyumvwa. Ibyo yabonye yabyanditse mu gitabo \"Shake Hands with the Devil\" (\"J'ai serr\u00e9 la main du diable\").\nUbuzima.\nDallaire ni umuhungu wa Rom\u00e9o Louis Dallaire, wari umusirikare wo mu ngabo za Kanada, na Catherine Vermaessen, umuforomokazi w'Umuholandi. Yageze muri Kanada afite amezi atandatu, mu Ukuboza 1946, akurira i Montr\u00e9al.\nYinjiye mu ngabo za Kanada mu 1964, abona impamyabumenyi mu bumenyi (\"baccalaur\u00e9at\") mu Ishuri rya Gisirikare rya Saint-Jean, aba umusirikare mukuru mu mutwe w'imbunda nini (\"Artillerie royale canadienne\").\nUbutumwa bwa MINUAR mu Rwanda.\nMu Ukwakira 1993, Dallaire yoherejwe mu Rwanda nk'umuyobozi w'ingabo za MINUAR, ubutumwa bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye bwari bugamije gufasha igihugu gushyiraho guverinoma y'inzibacyuho ishingiye ku masezerano ya Arusha.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, indege ye imaze guhanurwa ku wa 6 Mata 1994, abahezanguni b'Abahutu bari ku butegetsi, bifashishije Interahamwe n'icengezamatwara rya radiyo RTLM, batangiye kwica Abatutsi n'Abahutu batavugaga rumwe na bo. Dallaire yari ayoboye ingabo nke zifite intwaro zoroheje, kandi yari yarategetswe kudakoresha ingufu keretse mu kwirwanaho. Abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi bari bashinzwe kurinda Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana bishwe n'ingabo zirinda Perezida (Urwibutso rw'Abasirikare b'Ababiligi); nyuma yaho Ububiligi bwakuyeho ingabo zabwo, MINUAR iracika intege. Mu minsi ijana, abantu hafi 800 000 barishwe.\nRaporo y'impuguke z'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika (OUA) yashimye ibikorwa bya Dallaire. Ariko yanenzwe na bamwe, barimo umunyamakuru Robin Philpot, ndetse no mu Bubiligi ku byerekeye urupfu rw'abasirikare b'Ababiligi.\nNyuma y'u Rwanda.\nAgarutse muri Kanada, yahawe imyanya ikomeye mu ngabo z'igihugu. Kuva yava mu Rwanda arwaye ihungabana (\"trouble de stress post-traumatique\"), ibyo byatumye ava mu ngabo ku wa 22 Mata 2000 kubera impamvu z'ubuzima. Mu 2003 yagize ati: \u00abAbantu ibihumbi magana inani bapfuye mu mpeshyi ya 1994, kandi nta n'umwe wagize icyo akora.\u00bb\nMu 2003 yasohoye igitabo \"Shake Hands with the Devil: The Failure of Humanity in Rwanda\", cyamuhesheje igihembo cya Guverineri Mukuru wa Kanada mu 2004. Muri Mata 2004, yatanze ubuhamya imbere y'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR) mu rubanza rwa Koloneli Th\u00e9oneste Bagosora.\nKu wa 25 Werurwe 2005, Minisitiri w'Intebe Paul Martin yamushyize muri Sena ya Kanada, aho yicaye nk'umunyamuryango w'ishyaka ry'Aba-Lib\u00e9raux. Yavuye muri Sena ku wa 17 Kamena 2014, kugira ngo yite ku bikorwa birwanya ikoreshwa ry'abana mu ntambara, ku basirikare bakomeretse no ku kwibuka imyaka 20 ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nIbihembo no mu buhanzi.\nDallaire ni \"officier\" w'Iteka rya Kanada (\"Ordre du Canada\"), \"commandeur\" w'Iteka ry'Ubutwari bwa Gisirikare, na \"grand officier\" w'Iteka ry'Igihugu rya Qu\u00e9bec.\nInkuru ye yakozwemo filime: \"Hotel Rwanda\" (2004), aho umukinnyi Nick Nolte akina umuntu ushingiye kuri we; filime mbarankuru \"Shake Hands with the Devil: The Journey of Rom\u00e9o Dallaire\" (2004); na filime \"Shake Hands with the Devil\" (2007) yafatiwe i Kigali, aho Roy Dupuis akina uruhare rwe."}
{"id": "23381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23381", "title": "Kaminuza Divina Gloria ya Butembo", "text": "Kaminuza Divina Gloria ya Butembo (mu Igifaransa: \"Universit\u00e9 Divina Gloria de Butembo\", impine: UDGB) ni ishuri rikuru na kaminuza byigenga biri i Butembo, mu ntara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nYashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2000, kandi yemewe na Minisiteri y'amashuri makuru na kaminuza.\nAmateka.\nUDGB yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2000, ikaba yemewe na Minisiteri y'amashuri makuru na kaminuza ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Iri mu mujyi wa Butembo, umwe mu mijyi ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru ufite kaminuza nyinshi.\nImiyoborere.\nUDGB iyoborwa n'umuyobozi mukuru (\"recteur\") Mathieu Kirongozi Bometa, yungirijwe n'umuyobozi wungirije (\"vice-recteur\") ushinzwe ubuyobozi, Kakule Mumbere Kasindi.\nAmashami.\nKaminuza ifite amashami arindwi:\nImyigishirize.\nAmasomo yigishwa mu Igifaransa. Kwinjira bisaba impamyabumenyi ya Leta (\"dipl\u00f4me d'\u00c9tat\") isoza amashuri yisumbuye. Umwaka w'amashuri utangira mu Ukwakira ukarangira muri Kamena, ukagabanywamo ibihembwe bibiri (Ukwakira\u2013Gashyantare na Werurwe\u2013Kamena). Kaminuza itanga impamyabumenyi za \"graduat\" na \"licence\", cyane cyane mu ikoranabuhanga mu icungamutungo, mu mitekerereze ya muntu no muri tewolojiya. Yakira abanyeshuri b'abahungu n'abakobwa.\nUbuzima bwa kaminuza.\nUDGB yakira ibikorwa byo gukangurira no guhugura abanyeshuri. Urugero, mu mwaka wa 2024, umuryango MAARIFA GLOBAL wahakoreye ikiganiro ku kamaro ko gukoresha ibicuruzwa bikorerwa iwabo, nk'uko wabikoze no mu zindi kaminuza za Butembo."}
{"id": "23383", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23383", "title": "Kubura ibitotsi", "text": "Kubura ibitotsi (\"insomnia\") ni indwara aho umuntu agira ingorane zo gufatwa n'ibitotsi cyangwa zo gukomeza gusinzira. Ikurikirwa no gusinzira ku manywa, imbaraga nke, kurakara n'agahinda.\nIshobora kubaho yonyine cyangwa igaterwa n'izindi ndwara, imiti cyangwa ibiyobyabwenge. Ivurwa mbere na mbere n'isuku y'ibitotsi no guhindura imibereho; ifata hagati ya 10% na 30% by'abantu bakuru.\nIbimenyetso.\nKubura ibitotsi ni indwara aho abantu bagira ikibazo cyo gusinzira. Bashobora kugira ingorane zo gufatwa n'ibitotsi, cyangwa zo gukomeza gusinzira igihe cyose babyifuza. Kubura ibitotsi bikunze gukurikirwa no gusinzira ku manywa, imbaraga nke, kurakara cyane, no kwiheba. Bishobora gutera ibyago byinshi byo impanuka z'ibinyabiziga, ndetse n'ibibazo byo kwibanda no kwiga. Kubura ibitotsi bishobora kumara igihe gito, bikamara iminsi cyangwa ibyumweru, cyangwa igihe kirekire, bikamara igihe kirenga ukwezi.\nImpamvu.\nKubura ibitotsi bishobora kubaho ku giti cyabyo cyangwa bigaterwa n'ikindi kibazo. Ibintu bishobora gutera kudasinzira birimo imihangayiko yo mu mutwe, ububabare budakira, kunanirwa k'umutima, hyperthyroidism, ikirungurira, indwara y'amaguru adatuza (\"restless legs syndrome\"), gucura, imiti imwe n'imwe, n'ibiyobyabwenge nka kafeyine, nikotine na alukolo. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera ibyago zirimo gukora akazi nijoro no guhumeka nabi mu gihe umuntu asinziriye.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku ngeso zo gusinzira no gusuzuma kugira ngo harebwe impamvu zibitera. Inyigo y'ibitotsi ishobora gukorwa kugira ngo harebwe ibibazo by'ibitotsi byihishe inyuma. Gusuzuma bishobora gukorwa hifashishijwe ibibazo bibiri: \"ese uhura n'ingorane zo gusinzira?\" na \"ese uhura n'ingorane zo gufatwa n'ibitotsi cyangwa gukomeza gusinzira?\" \nKuvura.\nIsuku y'ibitotsi no guhindura imibereho ni bwo buryo bwa mbere bwo kuvura indwara yo kudasinzira. Isuku yo gusinzira ikubiyemo kuryama buri gihe, kwishyira ku zuba ryinshi, icyumba gituje kandi cyijimye, no gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri ihoraho. Ubuvuzi bushingiye ku mitekerereze n'imyitwarire (\"CBT\") bushobora kongerwa kuri ibi. Nubwo ibinini bisinziriza bishobora gufasha, bifitanye isano n'impanuka zitera imvune, indwara yo kwibagirwa (\"dementia\") no kuba imbata yabyo. Iyi miti ntisabwa gukoreshwa mu gihe kirenze ibyumweru bine cyangwa bitanu. Akamaro n'umutekano by'ubuvuzi bw'ubundi buryo ntibirasobanuka neza.\nIkwirakwira.\nHagati ya 10% na 30% by'abantu bakuru bagira ikibazo cyo kudasinzira mu gihe runaka, naho abagera kuri kimwe cya kabiri cy'abantu bagira ikibazo cyo kudasinzira mu mwaka runaka. Abantu bagera kuri 6% bafite ikibazo cyo kubura ibitotsi kitatewe n'ikindi kibazo kandi kimara igihe kirenga ukwezi. Abantu barengeje imyaka 65 ni bo bibasirwa cyane kurusha abakiri bato. Abagore ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagabo.\nAmateka.\nIbisobanuro by'indwara yo kudasinzira bigaragara nibura mu Ubugereki bwa kera."}
{"id": "23384", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23384", "title": "Naloxone", "text": "Naloxone, igurishwa ku mazina nka Narcan, ni umuti uhagarika ingaruka za opioid nka morphine cyangwa heroyine. Ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu gutabara abantu bafashe opioid nyinshi, ubuhumekero bwabo bukagabanuka.\nIterwa mu mitsi, mu nyama cyangwa mu mazuru, kandi ikora mu minota mike. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rwa OMS kandi iboneka nk'umuti rusange.\nIkoreshwa.\nNaloxone ni umuti ukoreshwa mu guhagarika ingaruka za opioid. Ikunze gukoreshwa mu kurwanya kugabanuka k'ubuhumekero mu gihe umuntu yafashe opioid nyinshi (\"overdose\"). Naloxone ishobora kandi kuvangwa na opioid (mu kinini kimwe), kugira ngo igabanye ibyago byo gukoresha nabi opioid. Iyo itewe mu mutsi w'amaraso, ingaruka zitangira mu minota ibiri, naho iyo itewe mu nyama zitangira mu minota itanu. Indi nzira ishobora gutangwa ni ukuyitera mu mazuru y'umuntu. Ingaruka za naloxone zimara hagati y'igice cy'isaha n'isaha imwe. Hashobora kuba ngombwa gukoresha doze nyinshi, kuko igihe cy'imikorere ya opioid nyinshi kiruta icya naloxone.\nIngaruka mbi.\nKuyiha abantu babaswe na opioid bishobora gutera ibimenyetso byo guhagarika opioid, harimo kubura umutuzo, guhagarika umutima, isesemi, kuruka, umutima utera cyane, no kubira ibyuya. Kugira ngo hirindwe ibi, doze ntoya buri minota mike zishobora gutangwa kugeza igihe umusaruro wifuza ugezweho. Ku bantu bahoze bafite indwara z'umutima cyangwa bafata imiti igira ingaruka mbi ku mutima, habayeho ibindi bibazo by'umutima. Bigaragara ko nta kibazo iteza ku bagore batwite, nubwo yahawe umubare muto wabo.\nUko ikora.\nNaloxone ni umuti urwanya (\"antagonist\") imyakiriro ya opioid utarobanura. Ikora mu gusubiza inyuma ihungabana ry'urwungano rw'imyakura rwo hagati n'urw'ubuhumekero riterwa na opioid.\nAmateka.\nNaloxone yahawe ipatanti mu 1961, yemererwa kuvura abafashe opioid nyinshi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 1971. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS).\nIgiciro.\nNaloxone iraboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"generic\"). Igiciro cyayo mu bucuruzi bwinshi mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya $0.50 na $5.30 kuri doze. Uducupa twa naloxone ntabwo duhenze cyane (munsi y'amadolari 25) muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Mu 2020, igiciro cy'ipaki y'inshinge ebyiri zikoresha ubwazo (\"auto-injectors\") muri Amerika cyari $178. Igiciro cya 2018 cya NHS mu Ubwongereza ni hafi \u00a35 kuri doze. Muri Ositaraliya, doze imwe iboneka nta rupapuro rwa muganga, kandi igura AU$20; abafite dose eshanu bashobora kuzigura AU$40, zingana n'amadolari umunani kuri doze imwe."}
{"id": "23385", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23385", "title": "Osteogenesis imperfecta", "text": "Osteogenesis imperfecta (OI), izwi kandi nka indwara y'amagufwa acika intege, ni itsinda ry'indwara z'uruhererekane zituma amagufwa avunika byoroshye. Ishobora kandi gutera amaso afite ibara ry'ubururu, uburebure bugufi no kutumva neza.\nAhanini iterwa no kubura kolajeni yo mu bwoko bwa I. Nta muti uyikiza uhari, ariko ubuvuzi bufasha kwirinda no kuvura amavunika; ifata umuntu umwe ku bantu 15.000.\nIbimenyetso.\nOsteogenesis imperfecta (OI) ni itsinda ry'indwara ziterwa n'uturemangingo zifata cyane cyane amagufwa. Bituma amagufwa avunika byoroshye. Ubukana bwayo bushobora kuba buke cyangwa bukabije. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo ibara ry'ubururu mu gice cyera cy'amaso (\"sclera\"), uburebure bugufi, ingingo zirekuye cyane, kutumva neza, ibibazo byo guhumeka n'ibibazo by'amenyo. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo gucikamo kw'imitsi y'amaraso yo mu ijosi no kw'umutsi munini w'amaraso (\"aorta\").\nImpamvu n'ubwoko.\nIkibazo cy'ibanze akenshi ni icy'uturemangingo dufatanya umubiri (\"connective tissue\") bitewe no kubura kolajeni yo mu bwoko bwa I. Ibi bibaho mu bantu barenga 90% bitewe n\u2019impinduka mu miterere ya za jeni za \"COL1A1\" cyangwa \"COL1A2\". Ibi bibazo by\u2019uturemangingo akenshi biragwa n\u2019ababyeyi b\u2019umuntu mu buryo busanzwe cyangwa bigaterwa n\u2019impinduka nshya. Hari nibura ubwoko umunani bw'ingenzi, aho ubwoko bwa mbere ari bwo bworoheje cyane naho ubwoko bwa kabiri bukaba ari bwo bukabije cyane.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku bimenyetso kandi bishobora kwemezwa hakoreshejwe isuzuma rya kolajeni cyangwa irya ADN.\nKuvura.\nNta muti uhari. Kugira ubuzima bwiza, hakorwa imyitozo ngororamubiri kandi hirindwa kunywa itabi, bishobora gufasha mu kwirinda kuvunika. Ubuvuzi bushobora kuba burimo kwita ku magufwa yavunitse, imiti igabanya ububabare, ubuvuzi bw'umubiri, ibyuma bifasha amaguru (\"braces\") cyangwa amagare y'abafite ubumuga ndetse no kubagwa. Ubwoko bw'ubuganga bushyira inkoni z'icyuma mu magufwa maremare bushobora gukorwa kugira ngo ayakomeze. Hari ibimenyetso bike bishyigikira ikoreshwa ry'imiti yo mu bwoko bwa bisphosphonate.\nIkwirakwira.\nOI igira ingaruka ku muntu umwe kuri 15.000. Uko indwara izagenda biterwa n'ubwoko bwayo, ariko abantu benshi bagira ubuzima bwiza.\nAmateka.\nIyi ndwara yasobanuwe kuva mu bihe bya kera. Ijambo \"osteogenesis imperfecta\" ryatangiye gukoreshwa mu 1895 kandi risobanura irema ry'amagufwa ridatunganye."}
{"id": "23386", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23386", "title": "Gonorrhea", "text": "Gonorrhea, izwi kandi nka clap, ni indwara yandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina iterwa na bagiteri ya \"Neisseria gonorrhoeae\". Ishobora gutera ububabare iyo umuntu anyara no gusohora ibintu mu gitsina, ariko benshi mu bayirwaye nta bimenyetso bagira.\nYirindwa hakoreshejwe agakingirizo kandi ivurwa n'imiti ya antibiyotike, nubwo bagiteri zitangiye kwihanganira imiti imwe n'imwe.\nIbimenyetso.\nGonorrhea ni indwara yandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina (STI) iterwa na bagiteri ya \"Neisseria gonorrhoeae\". Kwandura bishobora kuba mu myanya ndangagitsina, mu kanwa no mu kibuno. Abagabo banduye bashobora kumva ububabare cyangwa ubushye iyo banyara, gusohora ibintu mu gitsina cyangwa kubabara mu mabya. Abagore banduye bashobora kumva ubushye iyo banyara, gusohora ibintu mu gitsina, kuva amaraso mu gitsina hagati y\u2019imihango, cyangwa kubabara mu nda yo hasi. Ingorane ku bagore zirimo ububyimbirwe bw'imyanya yo mu nda yo hasi (\"pelvic inflammatory disease\") naho ku bagabo zirimo kubyimba kwa \"epididymis\". Nyamara, benshi mu banduye nta bimenyetso bafite. Iyo idavuwe, gonorrhea ishobora gukwirakwira mu ngingo cyangwa mu dupfundikizo tw'umutima.\nUko yandura.\nGonorrhea yandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina n'umuntu wanduye. Ibi birimo imibonano mpuzabitsina yo mu kanwa, mu kibuno no mu gitsina. Ishobora kandi gukwirakwira kuva ku mubyeyi kugera ku mwana mu gihe cyo kubyara.\nIsuzuma.\nIsuzuma rikorwa hapimwa inkari, umuyoboro w'inkari (\"urethra\") ku bagabo, cyangwa inkondo y'umura ku bagore. Gupima abagore bose bakora imibonano mpuzabitsina kandi bari munsi y'imyaka 25 buri mwaka kimwe n'abafite abo baryamana bashya birasabwa; inama imwe irakurikizwa no ku bagabo bakora imibonano mpuzabitsina n'abagabo (MSM).\nKwirinda.\nIndwara ya Gonorrhea ishobora kwirindwa hakoreshejwe agakingirizo, imibonano mpuzabitsina n'umuntu umwe gusa utarandura, ndetse no kudakora imibonano mpuzabitsina.\nKuvura.\nUbusanzwe ubuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe ceftriaxone iterwa mu rushinge na azithromycin inyobwa. Bagiteri zatangiye kwihanganira imiti myinshi ya antibiyotike yakoreshejwe mbere kandi rimwe na rimwe hakenerwa doze nyinshi ya ceftriaxone. Gusubiramo ibizamini ni byiza amezi atatu nyuma yo kuvurwa. Abo umurwayi yaryamanye na bo mu mezi abiri ashize nabo bagomba kuvurwa.\nIkwirakwira.\nIndwara ya Gonorrhea yibasira hafi 0.8% by'abagore na 0.6% by'abagabo. Buri mwaka, abantu bari hagati ya miliyoni 33 na 106 bandura gonorrhea, mu bantu miliyoni 498 z\u2019abantu bandura indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina zivurwa \u2013 harimo na syphilis, chlamydia, na trichomoniasis. Kwandura indwara mu bagore akenshi bibaho iyo bakiri bato. Mu 2015, byateje impfu zigera kuri 700.\nAmateka.\nIbisobanuro by'iyi ndwara bigaragara kuva mu Isezerano rya Kera. Izina ry'ubu ryakoreshejwe bwa mbere n'umuganga w'Umugereki Galen mbere y'umwaka wa 200, wayise \"gutakaza intanga bitifuzwa\"."}
{"id": "23387", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23387", "title": "Hepatite C", "text": "Hepatite C ni indwara iterwa na virusi ya hepatite C (HCV) yibasira cyane cyane umwijima. Akenshi nta bimenyetso igaragaza mu ntangiriro, ariko uko imyaka ishira ishobora gutera cirrhose, kunanirwa k'umwijima cyangwa kanseri y'umwijima.\nYandurira ahanini mu guhura kw'amaraso. Nta rukingo rwayo ruhari, ariko imiti mishya ikiza abarenga 95% by'abarwayi; ku isi hari abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 71 bayirwaye.\nIbimenyetso.\nHepatite C ni indwara yandura iterwa na virusi ya hepatite C (HCV) yibasira cyane cyane umwijima. Mu gihe cyo kwandura bwa mbere abantu bakunze kugira ibimenyetso byoroheje cyangwa ntibagire ibimenyetso na bimwe. Rimwe na rimwe haboneka umuriro, inkari zijimye, ububabare bwo mu nda n'uruhu ruhinduka umuhondo. Iyi virusi ikomeza mu mwijima ku bantu bagera kuri 75% kugeza kuri 85% by'abanduye bwa mbere. Ubwandu budakira akenshi nta bimenyetso bugira mu ntangiriro. Ariko uko imyaka ishira, akenshi bitera indwara z'umwijima ndetse rimwe na rimwe na cirrhose. Mu bihe bimwe na bimwe, abafite cirrhose bazahura n'ingorane zikomeye nko kunanirwa k'umwijima, kanseri y'umwijima, cyangwa imiyoboro y'amaraso yagutse mu muhogo no mu gifu.\nUko yandura.\nHCV yandurira cyane cyane mu guhura kw'amaraso, nko mu gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge biterwa mu mitsi, ibikoresho byo kwa muganga bidasukuye neza, imvune zo guterwa n'inshinge mu buvuzi, no guterwa amaraso. Aho amaraso atangwa apimwa, ibyago byo kwandura binyuze mu guterwa amaraso biri munsi ya kimwe kuri miliyoni ebyiri. Ishobora kandi gukwirakwira kuva ku mubyeyi wanduye kugeza ku mwana we mu gihe cyo kuvuka. Ntikwirakwira binyuze mu gukoranaho bisanzwe. Ni imwe muri virusi eshanu zizwi za hepatite: A, B, C, D, na E.\nIsuzuma.\nIsuzuma rikorwa hapimwa amaraso, harebwa abasirikare b'umubiri (\"antibodies\") barwanya virusi cyangwa RNA yayo. Birasabwa gupima abantu bose bafite ibyago byo kuyandura.\nKwirinda.\nNta rukingo rwa Hepatite C ruhari. Kwirinda birimo ingamba zo kugabanya ingaruka mbi ku bantu bakoresha ibiyobyabwenge biterwa mu mitsi no gupima amaraso yatanzwe.\nKuvura.\nUbwandu budakira bushobora gukira ku barenga 95% hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi nka sofosbuvir cyangwa simeprevir. Peginterferon na ribavirin ni uburyo bwo kuvura bwakozwe mbere bwari bufite igipimo cyo gukira kiri munsi ya 50% kandi ingaruka mbi zikaba nyinshi. Ariko kubona uburyo bushya bwo kuvura bishobora kuba bihenze. Abarwaye cirrhose cyangwa kanseri y'umwijima bashobora gukenera guhindurirwa umwijima. Hepatite C ni imwe mu mpamvu nyamukuru zituma abantu bahindurirwa umwijima, nubwo virusi ikunze kugaruka nyuma yaho.\nIkwirakwira.\nAbantu bagera kuri miliyoni 71 (1%) ku isi yose bari barwaye hepatite C mu 2017. Mu 2013, habayeho abarwayi bashya bagera kuri miliyoni cumi n'imwe. Bikunze kugaragara cyane muri Afurika no muri Aziya yo Hagati n'iy'Iburasirazuba. Impfu zigera ku 167.000 ziturutse kuri kanseri y'umwijima n'impfu 326.000 ziturutse kuri cirrhose zatewe na hepatite C mu 2015.\nAmateka.\nKuba hariho indwara ya hepatite C \u2013 yashoboraga kumenyekana gusa nk\u2019ubwoko bw\u2019indwara ya hepatite itari A itari B \u2013 byagaragajwe mu myaka ya 1970 kandi byemejwe mu 1989. Virusi ya hepatite C yandura abantu n'impundu gusa."}
{"id": "23388", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23388", "title": "Midazolam", "text": "Midazolam, igurishwa ku mazina nka Versed, ni umuti wo mu bwoko bwa benzodiazepine ukoreshwa mu gutera ikinya, guturisha umurwayi, kuvura ingorane zo gusinzira n'ibitero by'igicuri.\nItera gusinzira, igabanya imihangayiko kandi ishobora gutera kwibagirwa ibibaye. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rwa OMS kandi ntihenze.\nIkoreshwa.\nMidazolam ni umuti wo mu bwoko bwa benzodiazepine ukoreshwa mu gutera ikinya, guturisha umurwayi mu gihe cy'ibikorwa by'ubuvuzi, kuvura ingorane zo gusinzira no guhagarika umutima gukabije. Ikora mu gutera gusinzira, kugabanya imihangayiko, no gutuma umuntu atabasha kubika ibyibukwa bishya. Ni ingirakamaro kandi mu kuvura ibitero by'igicuri (\"seizures\"). Midazolam ishobora gutangwa mu kanwa, mu mutsi w'amaraso, mu rushinge mu nyama, mu mazuru cyangwa mu itama. Iyo itewe mu mutsi w'amaraso, akenshi itangira gukora mu minota itanu; iyo itewe mu nyama, bishobora gufata iminota cumi n'itanu kugira ngo itangire gukora. Ingaruka zimara hagati y'isaha imwe n'esheshatu.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kugabanuka k'imbaraga zo guhumeka, umuvuduko w'amaraso ugabanuka, no gusinzira. Umubiri ushobora kumenyera ingaruka zayo, kandi ibimenyetso byo kuyireka bishobora kubaho nyuma yo kuyikoresha igihe kirekire. Ingaruka zidasanzwe, nko kongera ibikorwa, zishobora kubaho cyane cyane ku bana no ku bantu bakuze. Hari ibimenyetso byerekana ibyago iyo bikoreshejwe mu gihe cyo gutwita ariko nta bimenyetso byerekana ingaruka mbi iyo hakoreshejwe doze imwe mu gihe cyo konsa.\nUko ikora.\nIri mu bwoko bwa benzodiazepine bw'imiti kandi ikora mu kongera imikorere ya neurotransmitter ya GABA mu ubwonko.\nAmateka.\nMidazolam yahawe ipatanti mu 1974, itangira gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1982. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS) nk'umuti usimbura lorazepam.\nIgiciro n'amategeko.\nIraboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"generic\") kandi ntabwo ihenze cyane. Igiciro cy'agacupa mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere ni hafi 0.35$. Mu bihugu byinshi, ni umuti ugenzurwa n'amategeko."}
{"id": "23389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23389", "title": "Adenomyose", "text": "Adenomyose (\"adenomyosis\") ni indwara y'abagore aho urukuta rw'imbere rwa nyababyeyi rukurira mu rukuta rw'imitsi yayo. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi ni ukubabara mu gihe cy'imihango no kuva amaraso menshi, nubwo hari abatagira ibimenyetso.\nIshobora gutera ubugumba kandi ikunze kujyana na endometriosis. Ivurwa n'imiti igabanya ububabare, imisemburo cyangwa kubagwa; yibasira hagati ya 20% na 35% by'abagore.\nIbimenyetso.\nAdenomyose (\"adenomyosis\") ni indwara aho uturemangingo tw'urukuta rw'imbere rwa nyababyeyi (\"endometrium\") dukurira mu rukuta rw'imitsi ya nyababyeyi (\"myometrium\"). Ibimenyetso akenshi birimo kubabara mu gihe cy'imihango no kuva amaraso menshi mu mihango; ariko hari abarwayi batagira ibimenyetso. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo ububabare budakira mu nda yo hasi no kubabara mu mibonano mpuzabitsina. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo ubugumba, kandi akenshi ijyana na endometriosis.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ntirasobanuka neza. Ibintu byongera ibyago birimo umubyibuho ukabije, ibinini byo kuboneza urubyaro, kubagwa babyara (\"c\u00e9sarienne\"), gutwita mbere, no gukorerwa \"curetage\". Uburyo iterwa bushobora kuba bujyanye no gukomereka no gusanwa kw'aho endometrium ihurira na myometrium, cyangwa n'ibisigazwa by'imiyoboro ya M\u00fcller.\nIsuzuma.\nIndwara ikekwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso kandi ryemezwa hakoreshejwe ultrasound, MRI, cyangwa biopsy. Ishobora gufata agace gato cyangwa kanini ka nyababyeyi. Akenshi nyababyeyi irabyimba; nubwo atari kanseri.\nKuvura.\nIbimenyetso bishobora kugabanywa n'imiti igabanya ububabare n'ububyimbirwe (NSAIDs), ibinini byo kuboneza urubyaro, agapira ko mu mura (IUD) karimo imisemburo, cyangwa danazol. Ibikorwa by'ubuvuzi bishobora gufasha birimo gufunga imitsi y'amaraso igaburira nyababyeyi (\"uterine artery embolization\"), gutwika urukuta rw'imbere rwa nyababyeyi (\"endometrial ablation\") no kubagwa (\"myomectomy\"). Ku badashaka abandi bana, bashobora kubagwa bagakurwamo nyababyeyi (\"hysterectomy\").\nIkwirakwira.\nAdenomyosis ivugwa ko yibasira hagati ya 20% na 35% by'abagore. Bikunze kugaragara cyane ku bagore bari mu myaka ya nyuma yo kubyara, kandi akenshi isuzumwa ku bafite imyaka 40 kuzamura.\nAmateka.\nCarl von Rokitansky, inzobere mu isuzuma ry'indwara (\"pathologist\") wakoreraga mu bihugu bivuga Ikidage, yasobanuye bwa mbere iyi ndwara mu 1860. Iri jambo rikomoka kuri \"adenos\" risobanura \"gland\" (urugingo rukora amatembabuzi), \"myo\" risobanura imitsi, naho \"osis\" risobanura indwara."}
{"id": "23390", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23390", "title": "Kantano Habimana", "text": "Kantano Habimana (wapfuye ahagana mu 1998-2002), bakunze kwita Kantano, yari umunyamakuru (\"animateur\") kuri radiyo yo mu Rwanda RTLM, yagize uruhare runini mu guteza imbere jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nKimwe n'abandi banyamakuru b'iyi radiyo, Habimana yashishikarije urugomo rw'Abatutsi n'Abahutu batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi mu buryo busanzwe.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nItariki y\u2019amavuko ya Habimana n\u2019ibindi bisobanuro birambuye ku buzima bwe bwo hambere, mbere yo kwinjira muri RTLM, ntibizwi neza. Icyakora, amakuru ahari agaragaza ko yize itangazamakuru i Leningrad, umujyi ubu witwa Saint Petersburg, mu cyahoze ari Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Abasoviyeti, aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza (Masters). Nyuma yo kurangiza amasomo ye, yakoze mu binyamakuru byo mu Rwanda birimo \"Imvaho\" na \"Umurwanashyaka\".\nUmwuga kuri RTLM.\nUmukinnyi wa RTLM ukunzwe cyane mu bijyanye n'igihe cyo gutangaza amakuru, yakunze gukururwa n'uko \"yakundaga gukoresha ikoranabuhanga risekeje kandi ritangaje\". Mu gihe yamaze kuri radiyo, yamenyekanye kubera ubwiza bwe n'urwenya, kandi yamenyekanye kubera kuvuga cyane \"nk'aho abantu bari imbere ye\", ibyo bikaba byari byiza mu gukurura ibitekerezo byabo.\nHabimana akunze kwitwa \"animateur\" ikunzwe cyane ya RTLM ndetse n\"'animateur\" ifite umwanya munini wo kureba amashusho, aho ibice bye byagize hafi 33% by'ibiganiro bya radiyo. Mu by\u2019ukuri, mu bushakashatsi bumwe bwakozwe ku byerekeye abantu bwakozwe binyuze mu bushakashatsi bwakorewe mu Rwanda, Abahutu n\u2019Abatutsi babajijwe bavuze ko yari azwiho ubuhanga bwe mu kuvuga.\nMbere ya jenoside, Habimana yafataga umurongo uciriritse ku bibazo by\u2019ivanguramoko kurusha abayoboke benshi ba Hutu Power. Urugero, mu Ukuboza 1993, Habimana yavuze ibi bikurikira ubwo yari kuri radiyo:\"Si Abatutsi bose ari babi; bamwe muri bo ni babi. Si Abahutu bose ari beza, abandi ni babi. Mu moko, hari bamwe ari babi... Ibi bigaragaza ko kamere muntu ikomeje kuba imwe mu moko yose yo mu Rwanda, mu bagabo bose bo mu Rwanda. Ariko se ni nde muntu wishyize mu mutwe we ko RTLM yanga Abatutsi?\"\nAriko, mu gihe cya jenoside, Habimana yatangazaga aho aherereye neza, amazina na nimero za plaque by\u2019abaregwaga kuba ibyitso bya FPR, yashishikarizaga urugomo rwibasiwe ndetse akenshi n\u2019ubwicanyi ku bantu bavuzwe n\u2019imitwe nka Impuzamugambi n\u2019Interahamwe. Habimana yahaye abari aho inama ku buryo bwo kumenya Abatutsi, avuga ko uburebure bw'umuntu n'uko agaragara bishobora kugaragaza niba ari Abatutsi. Habimana yategetse abari bamuteze amatwi \"[kureba] uburebure bw'umuntu n'uko asa... Reba izuru rye rito hanyuma urimene\".\nUbuzima nyuma ya jenoside n'urupfu rwatangajwe.\nMu rubanza rwabereye mu rukiko mbere ya jenoside ku ya 15 Werurwe 1994, kubera \"gushishikariza abaturage kwiyemerera\", Habimana yavuze ko abatangazamakuru ba RTLM ari \"abantu bato\" ugereranije n'abayobozi ba RTLM nka Ferdinand Nahimana, bityo bakaba nta ruhare bagize muri jenoside.\nBivugwa ko Habimana yazize SIDA muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo hagati ya 1998 na 2002."}
{"id": "23391", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23391", "title": "Rumatisime ya rubagimpande", "text": "Rumatisime ya rubagimpande (\"rheumatoid arthritis\", RA) ni indwara idakira aho ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri bwibasira ingingo, cyane cyane iz'ibiganza n'intoki, zigashyuha, zikabyimba kandi zikababaza.\nImpamvu yayo ntizwi neza. Nta muti uyikiza, ariko imiti nka DMARDs ifasha kugabanya ukwiyongera kwayo; yibasira hagati ya 0.5% na 1% by'abantu bakuru mu bihugu byateye imbere, abagore kurusha abagabo.\nIbimenyetso.\nRumatisime ya rubagimpande (RA) ni indwara idakira aho ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri bwibasira umubiri ubwawo, igafata cyane cyane ingingo. Akenshi bitera ingingo zishyushye, zibyimba kandi zibabaza. Ububabare no kugagara kw'ingingo bikunze kwiyongera nyuma yo kuruhuka. Akenshi ifata ingingo z'ikiganza n'iz'intoki, kandi ingingo zimwe zifatwa ku mpande zombi z'umubiri. Iyi ndwara ishobora no gufata ibindi bice by'umubiri. Ibi bishobora gutuma amaraso aba make, ububyimbirwe hafi y'ibihaha n'ububyimbirwe hafi y'umutima. Umuriro n'imbaraga nke bishobora kuba biriho. Akenshi, ibimenyetso biza buhoro buhoro mu gihe cy'ibyumweru cyangwa amezi.\nImpamvu.\nNubwo impamvu itera rubagimpande itazwi neza, bikekwa ko iterwa n\u2019uruvange rw\u2019ibintu bigize imiterere y\u2019umubiri n\u2019ibidukikije. Uburyo ikora ni uko ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri bwibasira ingingo. Ibi bitera ububyimbirwe no kubyibuha k'uruhu rupfunyika urugingo (\"joint capsule\"). Bigira ingaruka kandi ku magufwa no ku ruhenengeri rw'ingingo (\"cartilage\").\nIsuzuma.\nIsuzuma rikorwa ahanini hashingiwe ku bimenyetso umuntu agaragaza n'ibyo muganga abona amusuzuma. Amafoto y'imirasire ya X n'ibizamini byo muri laboratwari bishobora gushyigikira isuzuma cyangwa gufasha gutandukanya iyi ndwara n'izindi zifite ibimenyetso bisa. Izindi ndwara zishobora kugaragara nk'izo zirimo lupus erythematosus, psoriatic arthritis, na fibromyalgia n'izindi.\nKuvura.\nIntego zo kuvura ni ukugabanya ububabare, kugabanya ububyimbirwe, no kunoza imikorere y'umuntu muri rusange. Ibi bishobora gufashwa no kuringaniza ikiruhuko n'imyitozo ngororamubiri, gukoresha ibyuma n'ibipfuko bifata ingingo (\"splints\", \"braces\"), cyangwa ibindi bikoresho bifasha umuntu. Imiti igabanya ububabare, stero\u00efdes na NSAIDs ikunze gukoreshwa mu gufasha ibimenyetso. Imiti ihindura imigendekere y'indwara (\"DMARDs\"), nka hydroxychloroquine na methotrexate, ishobora gukoreshwa mu kugerageza kugabanya ukwiyongera kw'indwara. Imiti ya DMARD y\u2019ibinyabuzima ishobora gukoreshwa iyo indwara itavurwa n'indi miti. Ariko, bishobora kugira ingaruka mbi nyinshi. Kubagwa kugira ngo ingingo zisanwe, zisimburwe cyangwa zifatanywe bishobora gufasha mu bihe bimwe na bimwe. Uburyo bwinshi bw'ubuvuzi busimbura (\"alternative medicine\") ntibushyigikiwe n'ibimenyetso. \nIkwirakwira.\nMu 2015, RA yibasiraga abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 24.5. Ibi biri hagati ya 0.5 na 1% by'abantu bakuru mu bihugu byateye imbere, aho 5 na 50 kuri 100.000 batangira kurwara iyi ndwara buri mwaka. Indwara akenshi itangira mu myaka yo hagati y'ubuzima kandi abagore bayirwara inshuro 2.5 kurusha abagabo. Yateje impfu 38.000 mu 2013, zivuye ku 28.000 mu 1990.\nAmateka.\nIbisobanuro bya mbere bya RA byatanzwe mu 1800 na Augustin Jacob Landr\u00e9-Beauvais (1772\u20131840) wo i Paris. Izina \"rheumatoid arthritis\" rikomoka mu kigereki, risobanura ingingo zifite amazi kandi zibyimbye."}
{"id": "23392", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23392", "title": "Mupirocin", "text": "Mupirocin, igurishwa ku mazina nka Bactroban, ni antibiyotike isigwa ku ruhu ivura indwara z'uruhu ziterwa na bagiteri, nka impetigo, ikanakoreshwa mu gukura MRSA mu mazuru.\nIkora ibuza bagiteri gukora poroteyine. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rwa OMS kandi ntihenze.\nIkoreshwa.\nMupirocin ni antibiyotike isigwa ku ruhu, ivura indwara z'uruhu nk'impetigo cyangwa folliculitis. Ishobora kandi gukoreshwa mu gukuraho \"Staphylococcus aureus\" itavurwa na methicillin (MRSA) iri mu mazuru ariko idatera ibimenyetso. Kubera impungenge z'uko bagiteri zayimenyera (\"resistance\"), kuyikoresha mu gihe kirenze iminsi icumi ntibisabwa. Ikoreshwa nk'amavuta (\"cream\" cyangwa \"ointment\") asigwa ku ruhu.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuryaryata n'uduheri aho yasizwe, kurwara umutwe n'isesemi. Kuyikoresha igihe kirekire bishobora gutuma ibihumyo byiyongera. Kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa bigaragara ko nta kibazo biteza.\nUko ikora.\nMupirocin iri mu miti yo mu bwoko bwa aside karubokisilike. Ikora mu kubuza ubushobozi bwa bagiteri bwo gukora poroteyine, ibi bikaba bikunze gutuma bagiteri ipfa.\nAmateka.\nMupirocin yavanywe bwa mbere muri bagiteri \"Pseudomonas fluorescens\" mu 1971. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS).\nIgiciro.\nIgiciro cyo kugurisha mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere ni hafi $2.10 ku gacupa (\"tube\") ka garama 15. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, umuti w'ubuvuzi bwose ugura hagati y\u2019amadolari 25 na 50. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 186 mu yandikwa kenshi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni eshatu."}
{"id": "23393", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23393", "title": "Ezetimibe", "text": "Ezetimibe, igurishwa ku mazina nka Zetia, ni umuti unyobwa ukoreshwa mu kugabanya cholesterol nyinshi mu maraso, akenshi hamwe na statin no guhindura imirire.\nIkora igabanya cholesterol yinjira mu mubiri inyuze mu mara. Yemerewe gukoreshwa mu 2002 kandi iboneka nk'umuti rusange.\nIkoreshwa.\nEzetimibe ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura cholesterol nyinshi mu maraso n'ibindi bibazo bimwe na bimwe by'ibinure mu maraso. Muri rusange ikoreshwa hamwe n'impinduka mu mirire hamwe na statin. Icyakora, statin ni zo zihabwa umwanya wa mbere. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Iraboneka kandi mu binini bivanze bya ezetimibe/simvastatin, ezetimibe/atorvastatin, na ezetimibe/rosuvastatin.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kwandura indwara zo mu myanya y'ubuhumekero yo hejuru, kubabara ingingo, impiswi, no kunanirwa. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zishobora kuba zirimo anaphylaxis, ibibazo by'umwijima, agahinda gakabije n'isenyuka ry'imikaya. Umutekano wo kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa ntusobanutse neza.\nUko ikora.\nEzetimibe ikora mu kugabanya kwinjiza cholesterol mu mara.\nAmateka.\nEzetimibe yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 2002.\nIgiciro.\nIraboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"generic\"). Mu 2019, mu Ubwongereza kuyikoresha ukwezi kumwe byatwaraga NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a326.21. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, iyi ngano igura hafi amadolari y'Amerika 5.85. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 151 mu yandikwa kenshi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni enye."}
{"id": "23394", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23394", "title": "Kureba hafi", "text": "Kureba hafi (\"myopia\") ni ikibazo cy'amaso aho urumuri rwibanda imbere ya retina, bigatuma umuntu atabona neza ibintu biri kure mu gihe abona neza ibiri hafi.\nGikosorwa n'amadarubindi, lentiye zishyirwa ku jisho cyangwa kubagwa. Ni cyo kibazo cy'amaso gikunze kugaragara ku isi, kikaba cyibasira abantu bagera kuri miliyari 1.5.\nIbimenyetso.\nKureba hafi ni indwara y'amaso aho urumuri rwibanda imbere ya retina aho kwibanda kuri yo. Ibi bituma ibintu biri kure biba bitagaragara neza mu gihe ibintu biri hafi bisa n'ibisanzwe. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kurwara umutwe no kunanirwa kw'amaso. Kureba hafi gukabije bifitanye isano n'ibyago byinshi byo gutandukana kwa retina (\"retinal detachment\"), kataract na glaucoma.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu nyamukuru ikekwa ko ari uruvange rw'ibintu bigize imiterere y'umubiri n'ibidukikije. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo gukora akazi gasaba kwibanda ku bintu byegereye, kumarana igihe kinini mu nzu, ndetse no kugira abo mu muryango bafite iki kibazo. Bifitanye isano kandi n'icyiciro cyo hejuru cy'ubukungu n'imibereho myiza. Ikibazo cy'ibanze ni uko ijisho riba rirerire cyane, cyangwa, gake, lentiye y'ijisho ikaba ifite imbaraga nyinshi cyane. Ni ubwoko bw'ikosa ryo kugoreka urumuri (\"refractive error\").\nIsuzuma.\nIsuzuma rikorwa hasuzumwa amaso.\nKwirinda.\nHari ibimenyetso bike bigaragaza ko ibyago byo kureba hafi bishobora kugabanuka iyo abana bato bamaranye igihe kinini hanze. Ibi bishobora kuba bifitanye isano no guhura n'urumuri rw'izuba.\nKuvura.\nKureba hafi bishobora gukosorwa n'amadarubindi, lentiye zishyirwa ku jisho (\"contact lenses\"), cyangwa kubagwa. Amadarubindi ni bwo buryo bworoshye kandi bwizewe bwo gukosora. Lentiye zishyirwa ku jisho zishobora gutuma umuntu areba ahantu hagutse, ariko zifitanye isano n'ibyago byo kwandura indwara. Kubagwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa refractive bihindura burundu imiterere ya korine (\"cornea\").\nIkwirakwira.\nKureba hafi ni cyo kibazo cy\u2019amaso gikunze kugaragara cyane kandi bivugwa ko kibasira abantu miliyari 1.5 (22% by\u2019abaturage). Igipimo cy'abayirwaye kiratandukanye cyane mu bice bitandukanye by'isi. Mu bantu bakuru, igipimo kiri hagati ya 15% na 49%. Abagore n'abagabo bayirwara ku kigero kimwe. Mu bana, bibasira 1% by'abaturage bo mu cyaro cya Nepal, 4% by'Abanyafurika y'Epfo, 12% by'Abanyamerika, na 37% mu mijyi imwe n'imwe minini yo mu Ubushinwa. Igipimo cyariyongereye kuva mu myaka ya 1950. Kureba hafi kudakosowe ni imwe mu mpamvu zikunze gutera ubumuga bwo kutabona ku isi hamwe n'indwara ya kataract, kwangirika kwa macular, no kubura vitamine A."}
{"id": "23395", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23395", "title": "Minoxidil", "text": "Minoxidil, igurishwa ku mazina nka Loniten na Rogaine, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, ufatwa mu kanwa, n'uruhara, usigwa ku ruhu.\nIkora yagura imiyoboro y'amaraso. Yemewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi kuva mu 1979 kandi iboneka nk'umuti rusange.\nIkoreshwa.\nMinoxidil ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso n'uruhara rusanzwe ku bagabo (\"male-pattern hair loss\"). Ku muvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, ikoreshwa gusa iyo ukabije kandi udashobora kugabanywa n'umuti wongera inkari (\"diuretic\") n'indi miti ibiri. Ku bijyanye n'uruhara, igira akamaro ku bagabo no ku bagore. Ku muvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, ifatwa mu kanwa mu gihe ku ruhara isigwa ku ruhu.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara iyo umuntu anyoye mu kanwa zirimo kubyimba, umutima utera vuba, kumera k'ubwoya bwinshi n'isesemi. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kugabanuka k'insoro z'amaraso zera, indwara ya Stevens-Johnson na angina. Ingaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara iyo zikoreshejwe ku ruhu zirimo kuryaryata no kwiyubura kw'uruhu aho yasizwe. Umutekano mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa ntusobanutse neza, kandi ntibisabwa kuyikoresha muri ibyo bihe.\nUko ikora.\nNk'umuti uvura umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, ikora mu kwagura imiyoboro y'amaraso. Uburyo ikora ku ruhara ntibusobanutse neza.\nAmateka.\nMinoxidil yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 1979.\nIgiciro.\nMuri Amerika, iboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"generic\") w'ibinini utangwa na muganga, naho isigwa ku ruhu igurwa nta rupapuro rwa muganga. Mu 2020, mu Ubwongereza, doze ya 5 mg ku munsi yatwaraga NHS amapawundi agera kuri 9 ku kwezi."}
{"id": "23396", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23396", "title": "Buprenorfine", "text": "Buprenorphine, igurishwa ku mazina nka Subutex, ni umuti wo mu bwoko bwa opioid ukoreshwa mu kuvura abantu babaswe na opioid ndetse n'ububabare bukabije cyangwa budakira.\nIshobora gufatwa munsi y'ururimi, mu nshinge cyangwa ku ruhu. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rwa OMS, ariko kandi ishobora gukoreshwa nabi nk'ikiyobyabwenge.\nIkoreshwa.\nBuprenorphine ni opioid ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara yo kubatwa na opioid (\"opioid use disorder\"), ububabare bukabije, n'ububabare budakira. Ishobora gukoreshwa munsi y'ururimi, mu itama, mu guterwa inshinge, nk'agapapuro komekwa ku ruhu (\"patch\"), cyangwa nk'agakoresho gashyirwa munsi y'uruhu (\"implant\"). Ku ndwara yo kubatwa na opioid, akenshi itangira iyo ibimenyetso byo kuyireka bitangiye, ndetse no mu minsi ibiri ya mbere yo kuvurwa umuntu akurikiranwa n'umuganga. Kuvanga buprenorphine na naloxone (Suboxone) birasabwa kugira ngo hirindwe ko ikoreshwa nabi iterwa mu nshinge. Ingaruka zayo zigera ku ntera yo hejuru nyuma y'isaha imwe, zikamara kugeza ku masaha 24.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kugabanuka k'ubuhumekero, gusinzira, kunanirwa kw'imvubura za adrenal (\"adrenal insufficiency\"), kwiyongera kw'igihe cya QT, umuvuduko w'amaraso muke, ubwivumbure bw'umubiri (\"allergy\") no kubatwa na opioid. Ku bigeze kugira ibitero by'igicuri (\"seizures\"), hari ibyago byo kongera kubigira. Ibimenyetso byo kuyireka nyuma yo guhagarika buprenorphine muri rusange ntibikabije cyane ugereranyije n'iby'indi miti ya opioid. Ntibirasobanuka neza niba kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita nta kibazo biteza, kandi kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo konsa ntibisabwa.\nUko ikora.\nBuprenorphine igira ingaruka ku bwoko butandukanye bwa opioid receptors mu buryo butandukanye. Bitewe n'ubwoko bwa receptor, ishobora kuba agonist, partial agonist, cyangwa antagonist.\nAmateka.\nBuprenorphine yahawe ipatanti mu 1965, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 1981. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS), nk'umuti ushobora gusimbura methadone. Mu 2017, muri Amerika handitswe impapuro z'imiti (\"prescriptions\") zigera kuri miliyoni 14.6 ziyisaba.\nIkoreshwa nabi n'igiciro.\nNi umuti ukunze gukoreshwa nabi, rimwe na rimwe mu mwanya wa heroine. Hari abayikoresha nk'ikiyobyabwenge bayitera mu nshinge cyangwa bayihumeka mu mazuru kubera umunezero udasanzwe (\"high\") itera. Muri Amerika, iri ku rutonde rwa gatatu (\"Schedule III\") rw'ibiyobyabwenge bigenzurwa. Mu 2021, doze ya 8 mg ku munsi ntiyari ihenze muri Amerika, kandi yatwaraga NHS mu Ubwongereza amapawundi ari munsi gato ya 2.50."}
{"id": "23397", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23397", "title": "Kunanirwa k'umutima", "text": "Kunanirwa k'umutima (\"heart failure\", HF) ni igihe umutima udashobora gupompa amaraso ahagije ngo umubiri ubone ibyo ukeneye. Ibimenyetso by'ingenzi ni ukubura umwuka, umunaniro ukabije no kubyimba amaguru.\nIkunze guterwa n'indwara z'imitsi y'umutima, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso n'izindi ndwara z'umutima. Ivurwa hahindurwa imibereho, hakoreshwa imiti n'ibikoresho byihariye; ni indwara ikwirakwiye ku isi kandi ishobora kwica.\nIbimenyetso.\nKunanirwa k'umutima ni igihe umutima udashobora gupompa bihagije kugira ngo amaraso akomeze gutembera neza kugira ngo umubiri ugere ku byo ukeneye. Ibimenyetso byo kunanirwa k'umutima bikunze kuba birimo guhumeka nabi, umunaniro ukabije, no kubyimba amaguru. Guhumeka nabi bikunze kwiyongera iyo umuntu akoze imyitozo ngororamubiri cyangwa aryamye, kandi bishobora kumubyutsa nijoro. Ubushobozi buke bwo gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri nabwo ni ikintu gikunze kugaragara. Ububabare bwo mu gituza, harimo na angina, ntabwo bukunze kubaho bitewe no kunanirwa k'umutima.\nImpamvu n'ubwoko.\nImpamvu zikunze gutera umutima gucika intege zirimo indwara z'imitsi y'umutima, harimo ihagarara ry'amaraso mu mutima (\"myocardial infarction\") ryabayeho mbere, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, umutima utera nabi (\"atrial fibrillation\", reba Arrhythmia), indwara z'udupfundikizo tw'umutima, kunywa inzoga nyinshi, kwandura, n'indwara y'imitsi y'umutima (\"cardiomyopathy\") itazwi icyayiteye. Ibi bitera umutima gucika intege bitewe no guhindura imiterere cyangwa imikorere y'umutima. Ubwoko bubiri bw'umutima unanirwa gukora neza mu gice cy'ibumoso cy'umutima - umutima unanirwa gukora neza hamwe n'igice cyo gusohora cyagabanutse (HFrEF), n'umutima unanirwa gukora neza hamwe n'igice cyo gusohora cyabugenewe (HFpEF) - bishingiye ku kuba ubushobozi bw'umutima bwo kwiyegeranya cyangwa bwo kuruhuka ari bwo bwagize ikibazo. Uburemere bw'indwara y'umutima bugaragazwa n'uburemere bw'ibimenyetso iyo umuntu akoze imyitozo ngororamubiri. Kunanirwa k'umutima si kimwe no kurwara umutima (aho igice cy'imitsi y'umutima gipfa) cyangwa guhagarara k'umutima (aho amaraso ahagarara burundu). Izindi ndwara zishobora kugira ibimenyetso bisa n'ibyo kunanirwa k'umutima birimo umubyibuho ukabije, impyiko zinanirwa gukora neza, ibibazo by'umwijima, kubura amaraso, n'indwara ya tiroyide.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso, ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi ku mubiri, no ku isuzuma ry\u2019umutima hakoreshejwe \"echocardiography\". Gupima amaraso, gupima umutima hakoreshejwe amashanyarazi, no gufotora igituza (\"radiography\") bishobora kuba ingirakamaro mu kumenya impamvu nyamukuru.\nKuvura.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'uburemere bw'indwara n'icyayiteye. Ku bantu bafite ikibazo cy\u2019umutima kidakira kandi gihoraho, ubusanzwe ubuvuzi bugizwe no guhindura imibereho yabo nko kureka kunywa itabi, gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri, no guhindura imirire, ndetse n\u2019imiti. Ku bantu bafite ikibazo cy'umutima giterwa n'imikorere mibi y'imitsi y'ibumoso, imiti yo mu bwoko bwa \"ACE inhibitors\", \"angiotensin receptor blockers\" cyangwa valsartan/sacubitril, hamwe na \"beta blockers\", ni yo isabwa. Ku bafite indwara zikomeye, imiti irwanya aldosterone, cyangwa hydralazine irimo nitrate ishobora gukoreshwa. Imiti yongera inkari (\"diuretics\", nka furosemide) ifasha kurinda kubika amazi mu mubiri n'ingaruka zabyo zo guhumeka nabi. Hari igihe, bitewe n'impamvu, igikoresho nk'icyuma gifasha umutima gutera (\"pacemaker\") cyangwa \"defibrillator\" ishyirwa mu mubiri (ICD) gishobora gushyirwamo. Mu bihe bimwe na bimwe biri hagati cyangwa bikomeye, ubuvuzi bwo guhuza imitere y'umutima (\"cardiac resynchronization therapy\", CRT) cyangwa kongera imbaraga umutima ukoresha wiyegeranya bishobora kugira akamaro. Igikoresho gifasha ibyumba by'umutima (\"ventricles\") gupompa (icy'ibumoso, icy'iburyo, cyangwa byombi), cyangwa rimwe na rimwe guhindurirwa umutima bishobora kuba inama ku bantu bafite indwara ikomeye ikomeza nubwo hari izindi ngamba zose.\nIkwirakwira.\nKunanirwa k'umutima ni indwara isanzwe, ihenze, kandi ishobora kwica. Mu 2015, byagize ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni 40 ku isi yose. Muri rusange abantu bakuru bagera kuri 2% bafite ikibazo cy'umutima kandi ku bafite imyaka irenga 65, iki kibazo kigera kuri 6\u201310%. Biteganyijwe ko umubare w'abayirwara uziyongera. Ingaruka z'urupfu ni hafi 35% mu mwaka wa mbere nyuma yo kurwara, mu gihe mu mwaka wa kabiri ibyago by'urupfu biri munsi ya 10% ku bakiriho. Uru rwego rw'ibyago byo gupfa rusa n'urwa kanseri zimwe na zimwe. Mu Ubwongereza, iyi ndwara ni yo mpamvu yateye 5% by'abantu bajyanwa mu bitaro byihutirwa.\nAmateka.\nKunanirwa k'umutima byamenyekanye kuva kera, aho \"Papyrus Ebers\" yabivuzeho ahagana mu 1550 mbere ya Yesu."}
{"id": "23398", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23398", "title": "Ikibazo cy'ukuri cyashyizwe ku ndi", "text": "Ikibazo cy'ukuri cyashyizwe ku ndi, kizwi cyane nka Munchausen syndrome by proxy (MSbP), ni indwara yo mu mutwe aho umuntu urera undi, akenshi umubyeyi ku mwana we, ahimba cyangwa ateza ibibazo by'ubuzima kuri uwo yitaho, akamugaragaza nk'urwaye.\nNi uburyo bwo guhohotera umwana bushobora kumukomeretsa burundu cyangwa kumwica. Ni gake ibaho, kandi mu birenga 95% by'ibibazo, ukora ibi ni nyina w'umwana.\nIbimenyetso.\nNi indwara aho umuntu wita ku wundi, akenshi umubyeyi ku mwana we, ahimba cyangwa ateza ibibazo by'ubuzima kuri uwo yitaho. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo gukomeretsa umwana cyangwa guhindura ibisubizo by'ibizamini. Hanyuma bagaragaza uwo muntu nk'urwaye cyangwa wakomeretse. Ibi bibaho nta nyungu yihariye ku muntu umwitaho. Umwana ashobora gukomereka burundu cyangwa agapfa.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana. Intego nyamukuru ishobora kuba iyo gushaka kwitabwaho no kuyobya abaganga. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo ingorane ziterwa no gutwita, no kuba umubyeyi yarahohotewe akiri umwana cyangwa afite indwara yo kwihimbira uburwayi ubwe (\"factitious disorder imposed on self\").\nIsuzuma.\nIsuzuma rishyigikirwa iyo gutandukanya umwana n'umurera bituma ibimenyetso bye bigabanuka, cyangwa iyo amashusho ya videwo yafashwe umurera atabizi abigaragaza. Abana bagirwaho ingaruka n'iyi ndwara baba bakorewe ihohoterwa ry'umubiri n'iry'ubuvuzi (\"medical child abuse\").\nKuvura.\nKuyivura bishobora gusaba ko umwana ashyirwa mu wundi muryango umurera by'agateganyo (\"foster care\"). Ubuvuzi bw'imitekerereze bushobora gufasha umurera iyo yemeye ko akeneye ubufasha.\nIkwirakwira.\nNtibizwi neza uko ikwirakwiye, ariko bigaragara ko ari gake. Mu birenga 95% by'ibibazo byabonetse, ukora ibi ni nyina w'umwana.\nAmateka.\nIyi ndwara yavuzwe bwa mbere mu 1977 na Roy Meadow. Iki kibazo gishobora gufatwa nk'icyaha."}
{"id": "23399", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23399", "title": "Protais Zigiranyirazo", "text": "Protais Zigiranyirazo (2 Gashyantare 1938 - 3 Kanama 2025), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Monsieur Zed cyangwa Bwana Z, yari umucuruzi w\u2019umunyarwanda akaba n\u2019umunyapolitiki wari Guverineri w\u2019intara ya Ruhengeri mu majyaruguru y\u2019uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda kuva mu 1974 kugeza mu 1989. Zigiranyirazo yari umwe mu bagize Akazu, itsinda ry\u2019abavandimwe n\u2019inshuti z\u2019uwahoze ari Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana washyigikiye ingengabitekerezo ya Hutu Power. Yashinjwe ibyaha by\u2019intambara mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994, amaherezo yagizwe umwere n\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda, nyuma yo kumara imyaka itandatu muri gereza.\nUbuzima bwa mbere n'umwuga.\nAbahutu bo mu bwoko, Zigiranyirazo yari umuvandimwe wa Agathe Kanziga na muramu wa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, wageze ku butegetsi mu Rwanda muri Coup d'\u00e9tat yo ku ya 5 Nyakanga 1973. Yari afitanye isano rikomeye n\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019Abahutu bw\u2019abanyapolitiki, abacuruzi n\u2019abasirikare bakuru nyuma yaho bagenzuraga igihugu.\nMu mwaka wa 1974, Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana yagize Protais Zigiranyirazo Guverineri wa Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, umwanya yamazeho imyaka igera kuri cumi n\u2019itanu. Muri icyo gihe, Zigiranyirazo yari azwiho kugira ububasha n\u2019inshingano bikomeye mu karere yayoboraga. Yari afite amazina y\u2019akabyiniriro arimo \u201cMonsieur Zed\u201d na \u201cLe Prince du Nord\u201d, bisobanura \u201cIgikomangoma cyo mu Majyaruguru\u201d.. \nMu 1989, Zigiranyirazo yeguye ku mirimo ye yo kuba guverineri kugira ngo abe umunyeshuri muri Universit\u00e9 du Qu\u00e9bec \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al (UQAM) i Montreal, muri Qu\u00e9bec, muri Kanada. Kuva icyo gihe yavuze ko yaretse ibikorwa byose bya politiki mu 1989.\nI Montreal mu 1993, Zigiranyirazo yahamijwe icyaha cyo gukangisha urupfu impunzi ebyiri z'Abatutsi, \"zamushinje kugira uruhare mu gutegura ubwicanyi bushingiye ku moko.\" Hanyuma yirukanywe muri UQAM no muri Kanada. \nNyuma yo kwirukanwa muri Kanada, Zigiranyirazo yasubiye mu Rwanda. Iyicwa rya muramu we Habyarimana ku ya 6 Mata 1994 ryateye imbere ibikorwa byaje gutuma haba jenoside mu Rwanda. Kuva igihe runaka nyuma ya 1994 kugeza Nyakanga 2001, Zigiranyirazo yabaga i Nairobi, muri Kenya.\nIbirego bya Jenoside.\nIbiro by'Umushinjacyaha w'Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) byashinje Zigiranyirazo gukora ibyaha mu mezi ya jenoside yo mu 1994, bivuga ko \"yategetse cyangwa yemereye ko hashyirwaho bariyeri hafi y'aho yari atuye hose... azi kandi agambiriye ko zizakoreshwa mu gikorwa cyo gutsemba no kwica. Protais Zigiranyirazo yakomeje ategeka abagabo bari kuri bariyeri kwica Abatutsi bose bageragezaga kunyura. Nyuma gato, kandi mu buryo buhoraho, abasirikare \"n'Interahamwe\" bishe abantu benshi mu ngo zabo kandi bica abantu bitwaga Abatutsi bagerageje kunyura kuri bariyeri.\"\nGufatwa no kwitaba urukiko.\nKu wa 9 Kamena 2001, Protais Zigiranyirazo yageze mu Bubiligi, akoresha umwirondoro utari uwe kugira ngo ahishe uwo ari we, maze asaba ubuhungiro. Igihe yari acumbitse mu kigo cyakira abasaba ubuhungiro, yamenyekanye n\u2019umuntu utaramenyekanye amazina. Ku wa 21 Nyakanga 2001, Zigiranyirazo yarafashwe arafungwa, abisabwe na Carla Del Ponte, wari Umushinjacyaha Mukuru w\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR). Ku itariki ya 4 Ukwakira 2001, guverinoma y'Ububiligi yamushyikirije TPIR.\nUbwo yitabaga urukiko bwa mbere mu Ukwakira 2001, yashinjwe ibyaha bibiri byibasiye inyokomuntu. Icyakora, ikirego aregwa cyarahinduwe mu gihe yari ategereje kwitaba urukiko bwa kabiri ku ya 25 Ugushyingo 2003. Inyandiko y'ibirego yavuguruwe yamushinje gukora jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi hagati ya Mata na Nyakanga 1994 i Kigali na Gisenyi. Urubanza rwakomeje mu gihe cy'imyaka igera kuri itanu, Zigiranyirazo afunzwe by'agateganyo. Ku ya 18 Ukuboza 2008, Urugereko rwa Mbere rw'Iremezo rwa III, rugizwe n'abacamanza In\u00e9s M\u00f3nica Weinberg de Roca wo muri Arijantine, Khalida Rashid Khan wo muri Pakisitani, na Lee Gacuiga Muthoga wo muri Kenya, bahamya Zigiranyirazo icyaha cya jenoside no gutsemba nk'ibyaha byibasiye inyoko muntu maze bamukatira igifungo cy'imyaka makumyabiri. Yahawe ishimwe kubera igihe yari amaze muri gereza ategereje kuburanishwa. \nUrupfu.\nZigiranyirazo yapfuye ku ya 3 Kanama 2025 mu rugo rwe i Niamey, muri Nijeri, aho yari atuye kuva yagirwa umwere. Yari afite imyaka 87. \nUmuryango we wari witeze ko ashyingurwa i Orl\u00e9ans mu Bufaransa, ariko urubanza rwo ku ya 26 Kanama, rwajuririwe ku ya 28 Kanama, rubuza uyu muhambwa, ruvuga ko hari ingaruka zishobora kubangamira umutekano w\u2019imbere mu gihugu. Haracyari hagomba gufatwa icyemezo cy'aho umuntu azashyingurwa. "}
{"id": "23400", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23400", "title": "Indwara ya bronchitis", "text": "Indwara ya bronchitis (\"bronchite\") ni ukubyimba kwa bronchi, inzira nini n'iziciriritse zinjiza umwuka mu bihaha, bigatera inkorora. Ishobora kuba ikabije, ahanini iterwa na virusi, cyangwa idakira, ahanini iterwa no kunywa itabi.\nBronchitis ikabije ni imwe mu ndwara zikunze kugaragara cyane; bronchitis idakira ikunze kujyana n'indwara y'ibihaha idakira (COPD).\nIbimenyetso.\nBronchitis ni ukubyimba kwa bronchi (inzira z'ubuhumekero nini n'iziciriritse) mu bihaha bitera inkorora. Ibimenyetso birimo gukorora ibikororwa, guhumeka bisifura, guhumeka nabi no kubabara mu gatuza. Bronchite ishobora kuba ikabije (\"acute\") cyangwa idakira (\"chronic\").\nBronchitis ikabije.\nBronchitis ikabije ubusanzwe irangwa n'inkorora imara ibyumweru bitatu, kandi izwi nk'ibicurane byo mu gatuza. Mu barenga 90% by'abarwayi, impamvu ni ubwandu bwa virusi. Izi virusi zishobora gukwirakwira mu mwuka iyo abantu bakoroye cyangwa bahuye nazo. Umubare muto w\u2019abarwayi uterwa n\u2019indwara za bagiteri nka \"Mycoplasma pneumoniae\" cyangwa \"Bordetella pertussis\". Ibintu bishobora gutera ingorane birimo umwotsi w'itabi, ivumbi, n'indi myanda y'umwuka. Kuvura indwara ya bronchitis ikabije akenshi bikubiyemo kuruhuka, parasetamol (acetaminophen), n'imiti igabanya ubukana itari iya steroide (NSAIDs) kugira ngo bifashe mu kugabanya umuriro.\nBronchitis idakira.\nBronchitis idakira isobanurwa nk'inkorora itanga ibikororwa, imara amezi atatu cyangwa arenga ku mwaka mu gihe cy'imyaka ibiri nibura. Abantu benshi barwaye bronchitis idakira bafite indwara idakira yo mu bihaha (COPD). Kunywa itabi ni yo mpamvu ikunze kugaragara cyane, hakaba hari n'izindi mpamvu nyinshi nko kwanduza ikirere n'imiterere y'uturemangingo bigira uruhare ruto.\nKuvura.\nUburyo bwo kuvura burimo kureka kunywa itabi, inkingo, gusubira mu buzima busanzwe, ndetse no gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana bw'imitsi n'imiti ikoreshwa mu guhumeka. Hari abantu bashobora kungukirwa no gukoresha umwuka wa ogisijeni mu gihe kirekire.\nIkwirakwira.\nBronchitis ikabije ni imwe mu ndwara zikunze kugaragara cyane. Abantu bakuru bagera kuri 5% barayirwaye naho abana bagera kuri 6% bagira nibura igice kimwe mu mwaka. Ni bwo bwoko bwa bronchitis bukunze kugaragara cyane. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, mu 2018, abantu miliyoni 9.3 basanzwe barwaye indwara ya bronchitis idakira."}
{"id": "23401", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23401", "title": "Umuriro w'umuhondo", "text": "Umuriro w'umuhondo (\"yellow fever\") ni indwara iterwa na virusi ikwirakwizwa n'imibu. Akenshi itera umuriro, kubabara umutwe n'imikaya, ariko ku bagera kuri 15% by'abarwayi yangiza umwijima, igatera uruhu rw'umuhondo.\nHari urukingo rwizewe ruyirinda. Ikunze kugaragara muri Afurika no muri Amerika y'Epfo, aho yateje impfu zigera ku 45.000 mu 2013.\nIbimenyetso.\nUmuriro w'umuhondo ni indwara iterwa na virusi, ikunze kumara igihe gito. Kenshi na kenshi, ibimenyetso birimo umuriro, ubukonje, kubura ubushake bwo kurya, isesemi, kubabara imitsi cyane cyane mu mugongo, no kuribwa umutwe. Ibimenyetso bikunze gukira mu minsi itanu. Mu bantu bagera kuri 15%, nyuma y'umunsi umwe ibimenyetso bigabanutse, umuriro uragaruka, bakababara mu nda, kandi kwangirika kw'umwijima gutangira gutera uruhu rw'umuhondo. Iyo ibi bibaye, ibyago byo kuva amaraso no kugira ibibazo by'impyiko biriyongera.\nImpamvu.\nIyi ndwara iterwa na virusi ya yellow fever kandi ikwirakwizwa no kurumwa n'umubu w'ingore wanduye. Ifata gusa abantu, izindi nyamaswa zo mu bwoko bw'inguge (\"primates\"), n'ubwoko butandukanye bw'imibu. Mu mijyi, ikwirakwizwa cyane cyane na \"Aedes aegypti\", ubwoko bw'umubu uboneka mu turere dushyuha n'utuyegereye. Iyi virusi ni virusi ya RNA yo mu bwoko bwa \"Flavivirus\".\nIsuzuma.\nIyi ndwara ishobora kugorana kuyitandukanya n'izindi ndwara, cyane cyane mu ntangiriro. Kugira ngo hemezwe ko umuntu ukekwa ayirwaye, hakenewe gupima amaraso hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa \"polymerase chain reaction\" (PCR).\nKwirinda.\nHari urukingo rwizewe kandi rufite akamaro rwo kurwanya umuriro w'umuhondo, kandi hari ibihugu bimwe na bimwe bisaba ko abagenzi bakingirwa. Izindi ngamba zo gukumira ubwandu zirimo kugabanya umubare w\u2019imibu yanduza. Mu turere aho umuriro w'umuhondo ikunze kugaragara, gusuzuma hakiri kare abanduye no gukingira igice kinini cy\u2019abaturage ni ingenzi kugira ngo hirindwe ibyorezo.\nKuvura.\nIyo umuntu yanduye, ubuvuzi bwibanda ku kuvura ibimenyetso, kuko nta muti wihariye urwanya virusi. Kugeza kuri kimwe cya kabiri cy'abarwara indwara ikomeye barapfa.\nIkwirakwira.\nMu 2013, umuriro w'umuhondo wateje indwara zikomeye zigera ku 127.000 n'impfu 45.000, hafi 90% by'izi ndwara zagaragaye mu bihugu bya Afurika. Abantu hafi miliyari imwe batuye mu gace k\u2019isi aho iyi ndwara ikunze kugaragara. Bikunze kugaragara mu turere dushyuha tw\u2019imigabane ya Amerika y\u2019Epfo na Afurika, ariko si muri Aziya. Kuva mu myaka ya 1980, umubare w'abarwayi b'umuriro w'umuhondo wakomeje kwiyongera. Bikekwa ko ibi biterwa n'uko abantu bake bafite ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri kuri iyi ndwara, abantu benshi batuye mu mijyi, abantu bimuka kenshi, kandi imihindagurikire y'ikirere yongera aho imibu iba.\nAmateka.\nIyi ndwara yatangiriye muri Afurika ikwirakwira muri Amerika y'Epfo hamwe n'ubucuruzi bw'abacakara mu kinyejana cya 17. Kuva mu kinyejana cya 17, ibyorezo byinshi bikomeye byagaragaye muri Amerika, Afurika no mu Burayi. Mu kinyejana cya 18 n'icya 19, umuriro w'umuhondo yafatwaga nk'imwe mu ndwara zandura ziteje akaga cyane. Mu 1927, virusi y'umuriro w'umuhondo yabaye virusi ya mbere y'abantu yashoboye gutandukanywa no kwigwa (\"isolated\")."}
{"id": "23402", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23402", "title": "Delirium tremens", "text": "Delirium tremens (DTs) ni ukuvangirwa mu mutwe gutunguranye kuba ku bantu bamaze igihe kinini banywa inzoga nyinshi iyo bazihagaritse. Itera guhinda umushyitsi, umutima utera nabi, kubira ibyuya no kubona ibitariho.\nIvurwa cyane cyane na benzodiazepine; iyo itavuwe, ishobora kwica kugeza kuri 40% by'abarwayi.\nIbimenyetso.\nDelirium tremens (DTs) ni ukuvangirwa mu mutwe gutunguranye, akenshi guterwa no kureka kunywa inzoga. Iyo bibaye, akenshi bitangira nyuma y'iminsi itatu ibimenyetso byo kureka inzoga bitangiye, bikamara iminsi ibiri cyangwa itatu. Ingaruka ku mubiri zishobora kuba zirimo kunyeganyega, guhinda umushyitsi, gutera k'umutima ku buryo budasanzwe, no kubira ibyuya. Abantu bashobora kandi kubona cyangwa kumva ibintu abandi bantu batabona (hallucination). Rimwe na rimwe, ubushyuhe bukabije bw'umubiri cyangwa ibitero by'igicuri (\"seizures\") bishobora gutera urupfu. Inzoga ni kimwe mu biyobyabwenge biteza akaga kenshi iyo umuntu abiretse.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nDelirium tremens ikunze kubaho gusa ku bantu bamaze igihe kirenga ukwezi banywa inzoga nyinshi. Ikibazo gisa n'iki gishobora kubaho iyo umuntu aretse benzodiazepine cyangwa barbiturate. Kureka ibiyobyabwenge bikangura umubiri nka kokayine ntibitera ingorane zikomeye z'ubuzima. Ku muntu ufite delirium tremens, ni ngombwa gusuzuma niba nta bindi bibazo bifitanye isano na yo afite, nko kubura electrolyte, pancreatitis, na hepatite iterwa n'inzoga.\nKwirinda.\nKuyirinda bikorwa havurwa ibimenyetso byo kureka inzoga.\nKuvura.\nIyo delirium tremens ibaye, kuvurwa byihuse kandi bikomeye bituma umurwayi amererwa neza. Kuvurirwa mu cyumba cy\u2019indembe gituje kandi gifite urumuri ruhagije ni byo bikunze gusabwa. Benzodiazepine ni yo miti y'ibanze; diazepam, lorazepam, chlordiazepoxide, na oxazepam zose zikunze gukoreshwa. Itangwa kugeza igihe umurwayi asinziriye buhoro. Haloperidol, umuti uvura indwara zo mu mutwe (\"antipsychotic\"), na wo ushobora gukoreshwa. Vitamine thiamine irasabwa. Iyo itavuwe, hagati ya 15% na 40% by'abarwayi barapfa. Muri iki gihe, abapfa bari hagati ya 1% na 4% by'abayirwaye.\nIkwirakwira.\nHafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abantu babaswe n'inzoga bagira ibimenyetso byo kuzireka iyo bagabanyije izo banywa. Muri abo, batatu kugeza kuri batanu ku ijana barwara delirium tremens cyangwa bakagira ibitero by'igicuri.\nAmateka n'izina.\nIzina delirium tremens ryakoreshejwe bwa mbere mu 1813; icyakora, ibimenyetso byasobanuwe neza kuva mu myaka ya 1700. Ijambo \"delirium\" ni iry'ikilatini risobanura \"kuva mu murongo w'isuka,\" ni ukuvuga ikigereranyo gikomoka ku buhinzi. Yitwa kandi \"shaking frenzy\" na \"Saunders-Sutton syndrome\". Ifite n'utundi tuzina twinshi mu Cyongereza, nka \"the shakes\", \"barrel-fever\", \"blue horrors\", \"bottleache\", \"bats\", \"drunken horrors\", \"elephants\", \"gallon distemper\", \"quart mania\" na \"pink spiders\"."}
{"id": "23403", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23403", "title": "Kubyimba kw'ibihaha", "text": "Kubyimba kw'ibihaha (\"pulmonary edema\") ni ukwirundanya kw'amazi menshi mu bihaha, bigatera kubura umwuka no gukorora ibikororwa birimo ifuro.\nAkenshi biterwa no kunanirwa k'umutima, ariko bishobora no guterwa no gukomereka kw'ibihaha. Bivurwa hakemurwa impamvu yabyo kandi umurwayi agafashwa guhumeka.\nIbimenyetso.\nKubyimba kw'ibihaha ni ukwirundanya kw'amazi menshi mu turemangingo no mu twumba tw'umwuka tw'ibihaha. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubura umwuka no gukorora ibikororwa birimo ifuro, rimwe na rimwe bivanze n'amaraso. Hashobora kumvikana amajwi adasanzwe mu bihaha (\"crackles\") cyangwa guhumeka bisifura. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kunanirwa guhumeka.\nImpamvu.\nBishobora guterwa no kunanirwa k'umutima (\"cardiogenic\") cyangwa gukomereka kw'ibihaha (\"non-cardiogenic\"). Kunanirwa k'umutima bishobora guterwa n'indwara y'umutima, indwara ya myocarditis, indwara z'udupfundikizo tw'umutima, cyangwa umutima utera nabi. Gukomereka mu bihaha bishobora kugaragara mu ndwara y'ubuhumekero ikabije (\"acute respiratory distress syndrome\", ARDS), kandi bigaterwa n'umusonga, pancreatitis, cyangwa guterwa amaraso menshi. Ibi bibangamira ihererekanya ry'imyuka mu bihaha.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara bishobora gushyigikirwa n'ibizamini byo muri laboratwari n'amafoto y'imbere mu mubiri (\"medical imaging\").\nKuvura.\nUbuvuzi bwibanda ku kunoza ibimenyetso no gukemura impamvu nyamukuru. Izindi ngamba zo kurwanya indwara yo mu bihaha iterwa n'umutima zishobora kuba zirimo imiti yongera inkari nka furosemide, imiti yagura imitsi y'amaraso nka nitroglycerin, no gufashwa guhumeka n'imashini hatinjijwe umuyoboro mu mubiri (\"non-invasive ventilation\"). Izindi ngamba zo kurwanya indwara yo mu bihaha idaterwa n\u2019umutima zirimo ubuvuzi bufasha nko guhabwa umwuka wa ogisijeni no guhumeka hakoreshejwe imashini (\"mechanical ventilation\").\nIkwirakwira.\nKubyimba kw'ibihaha birasanzwe. Ibiterwa n'umutima bifata abantu barenga miliyoni buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, mu gihe ibitaterwa n'umutima bifata abagera ku 190.000. Igipimo cy'abapfira mu bitaro cyagabanutse kuva kuri 60% mu myaka ya 1970 kugera kuri 30% mu myaka ya 1990.\nAmateka.\nKubyimba kw'ibihaha byavuzwe kuva nibura mu gihe cya Hippocrates ahagana mu mwaka wa 400 mbere ya Yesu. Ijambo edema rikomoka ku ijambo ry'ikigereki (\"o\u00edd\u0113ma\") bisobanura \"kubyimba\"."}
{"id": "23404", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23404", "title": "Scleroderma", "text": "Scleroderma ni itsinda ry'indwara aho ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri bwibasira umubiri ubwawo, bigatera impinduka ku ruhu, imiyoboro y'amaraso, imikaya n'ingingo z'imbere. Ikimenyetso nyamukuru ni uruhu rubyibuha rukanakomera.\nImpamvu yayo ntizwi kandi nta muti uyikiza uhari, ariko imiti ishobora kugabanya ibimenyetso. Ikunze gufata abagore kurusha abagabo, cyane cyane mu myaka yo hagati y'ubuzima.\nIbimenyetso.\nScleroderma ni itsinda ry'indwara aho ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri bwibasira umubiri ubwawo (\"autoimmune\"), zishobora gutera impinduka ku ruhu, imiyoboro y'amaraso, imitsi, n'ingingo z'imbere. Iyi ndwara ishobora kuba iherereye ku ruhu cyangwa ikaba yagera no ku zindi ngingo. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo uruhu rwabyibushye ahantu hamwe, kugagara kw'ingingo, umunaniro, ndetse n'amaraso adatembera neza mu ntoki cyangwa mu mano bitewe n'ubukonje. Ubwoko bumwe bw'iyi ndwara, buzwi nka CREST syndrome, bukunze gutera kwirundanya kwa calcium mu ruhu, \"Raynaud's syndrome\", ibibazo by'umuhogo, kubyibuha k'uruhu rw'intoki n'amano, ndetse n'uduce tw'imitsi mito y'amaraso yagutse.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana; icyakora, bamwe bakeka ko ishobora kuba iterwa n'uko ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri budakora neza. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo amateka y'umuryango, ibintu bimwe na bimwe bigize imiterere y'umubiri, ndetse no guhumeka umukungugu wa silika. Uburyo iterwa bukubiyemo gukura kudasanzwe kw'uturemangingo dufatanya umubiri (\"connective tissue\"), bikekwa ko ari ingaruka z\u2019uko ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri bwibasira ingingo nzima.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso, bigashyigikirwa n'ibizamini by'uruhu cyangwa amaraso.\nKuvura.\nNubwo nta muti uhari, kuvurwa bishobora gutuma ibimenyetso birushaho kuba byiza. Imiti ikoreshwa irimo imiti ya corticosteroids, methotrexate, n'imiti igabanya ububabare n'ububyimbirwe itari steroide (NSAIDs). Uko indwara izagenda biterwa n'ubukana bwayo. Abafite indwara ifata uruhu ahantu hamwe gusa muri rusange babaho igihe gisanzwe. Ku bafite indwara yakwiriye umubiri wose (\"systemic\"), icyizere cyo kubaho gishobora kuba imyaka 11 uhereye igihe yatangiriye. Urupfu rukunze guterwa n'ibibazo by'ibihaha, igogora, cyangwa umutima.\nIkwirakwira.\nBuri mwaka, abantu bagera kuri 3 kuri 100.000 bafatwa n'ubwoko bwa scleroderma bukwira umubiri wose. Iyi ndwara ikunze gutangirira mu myaka yo hagati. Abagore ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa n\u2019iyi ndwara kurusha abagabo.\nAmateka.\nIbimenyetso bya scleroderma byasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1753 na Carlo Curzio hanyuma bigaragazwa neza mu 1842. Iri jambo rikomoka ku magambo y'Ikigereki \"sklerosis\" risobanura \"gukomera\" na \"derma\" risobanura \"uruhu\"."}
{"id": "23405", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23405", "title": "Imipira y'ubururu", "text": "Udupira tw'ubururu ni ibyiyumvo bibabaza mu gitsina bitewe n'irari ry'imibonano mpuzabitsina rirambye ridafite iherezo. Ububabare burakabije cyane kandi impande zombi zirababara. Ku bagore bishobora kugira ingaruka ku gituba cyangwa ku gitsina. Nta gihamya ihari; icyakora, ikintu cyose gihinduka ubururu.\nUburyo bw\u2019ibanze bwavuzwe ko bukubiyemo umuvuduko ukabije w\u2019amaraso mu maraso, kuzura kw\u2019amazi mu gihe gito; icyakora, ibimenyetso bibyemeza ntibiraboneka. Ntabwo byemewe nk'indwara, kandi nta biganiro byinshi bihari mu nyandiko z'ubushakashatsi.\nNtabwo ari ikibazo gikomeye kandi gikemuka nta buvuzi bwihariye. Akenshi birashira mu masaha make cyangwa mbere yaho iyo habayeho orgasm. Guhuza igitsina bishobora kubaho binyuze mu kwikinisha kandi si impamvu yo gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina n'uwo mwashakanye. Kurangara, kwiyuhagira mu mazi akonje, cyangwa gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri nabyo bishobora gufasha.\nImipira y'ubururu yavuzwe na 56% by'abagabo na 42% by'abagore. Bikunze kwibasira abagabo bakiri bato. Ijambo \"imipira y'ubururu\" rikekwa ko ryaturutse muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ahagana mu 1920. Nubwo bitazwi cyane, igitsina cy\u2019abagore cyitwa \"ubururu bw'ubururu\" cyangwa \"ubururu bw'ibishyimbo\"."}
{"id": "23406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23406", "title": "Gupfa Kusinzira", "text": "Gusinzira nabi ni indwara idakunze kugaragara ituma umuntu abura ibitotsi. Ubusanzwe bitangira buhoro buhoro hanyuma bikarushaho kuba bibi uko igihe kigenda gihita. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo ibibazo byo mu mutwe, kudakora neza kw'ingingo, kugabanya ibiro, no kubira ibyuya byinshi. Iyo abantu barwaye basinziriye, bakunze kurota inzozi zikomeye. Urupfu muri rusange rubaho hagati y'amezi 6 na 36 uhereye igihe ibimenyetso bitangiriye.\nKubura ibitotsi ni indwara ifata ubwonko. Akenshi iterwa n'impinduka muri poroteyine PrP C. Iyi hinduka ry\u2019umubiri rikunze kuragwa n\u2019umubyeyi mu buryo busanzwe bwo kwiyanduza mu mubiri, buzwi nka \"fatal familial insomnities\" (FFI), nubwo rishobora kubaho gake mu buryo butunguranye nk\u2019ihinduka rishya, rizwi nka \"sporadic fatal insomnities\" (sFI). Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bushakashatsi bwo gusinzira, gupima PET, no gupima imiterere y'umubiri.\nNta muti uzwi wo kubura ibitotsi, ahubwo hashyirwaho imbaraga zigamije kunoza ibimenyetso by'indwara. Gusinzira nabi ni gake cyane. Abagabo n'abagore bakunze kwibasirwa n'iyi ndwara. Ubusanzwe indwara itangira hagati y\u2019imyaka 40 na 60. Umuntu wa mbere wanditswe ni Umutaliyani, wapfiriye i Venise mu 1765."}
{"id": "23407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23407", "title": "Utunyangingo tw'amaraso", "text": "Vasculitis ni itsinda ry'indwara ziterwa no kubyimba imiyoboro y'amaraso. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo umuriro, kugabanya ibiro, umunaniro, kuva amaraso no koroha kw'imitsi y'amaraso. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora gutandukana bitewe n'aho umuyoboro w'amaraso wafashwe n'ubwoko bw'umuyoboro w'amaraso wafashwe. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo gucika imitsi yo mu bwonko (stroke), indwara z'umutima, gucika kw'imitsi ifungana (aortic dissection), impyiko zinanirwa gukora neza, no gukorora amaraso.\nHari ubwoko burenga 30 bwa vasculitis, bushobora kuba buterwa n'imitsi, imitsi, cyangwa imiyoboro y'amaraso. Ubwoko bw'imitsi minini burimo arteritis nini (GCA), indwara ya Takayasu, n'indwara ya Behcet; ubwoko bw'imitsi iciriritse burimo indwara ya Kawasaki na polyarteritis nodosa (PAN); naho ubwoko bw'imitsi mito burimo polyangiitis nto na granulomatosis hamwe na polyangiitis (GPA). Ariko, hashobora kubaho isano hagati y\u2019aya matsinda.\nImpamvu akenshi ntizwi, nubwo hari abashobora guterwa n'ubwandu, imiti cyangwa indi ndwara. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago biterwa n'ikibazo kirimo. Uburyo bw'ibanze akenshi ni indwara y'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri aho neutrophils yinjira mu gice cy'imbere cy'imitsi. Isuzuma rishobora gukeka ko rishingiye ku bipimo by'amaraso, nka ESR cyangwa CRP, amashusho y'abaganga, na biopsy.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'ubwoko bw'indwara, nubwo akenshi ikoreshwa ari yo steroides mbere. Abantu bagera kuri 3 ku bantu 100.000 bashya barwara indwara ya vasculitis buri mwaka mu Burayi no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ku bantu barengeje imyaka 50, GCA ihitana abantu bagera kuri 24 kuri 100.000 buri mwaka. Ubwoko butandukanye bw'indwara bukunze kugaragara mu matsinda y'imyaka runaka. Muri rusange abagabo n'abagore barwara indwara imwe. Nubwo iyi ndwara yavuzwe kuva nibura mu kinyejana cya 11, ibisobanuro bya mbere birambuye byitirirwa Kussmaul na Maier mu 1866."}
{"id": "23408", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23408", "title": "Isukari nke mu maraso", "text": "Isukari nke mu maraso, ni ukugabanuka kw'isukari mu maraso kugera ku rugero ruri munsi y'urusanzwe. Ibi bishobora gutera ibimenyetso bitandukanye birimo kunanirwa kuvuga neza, kutavuga nabi, urujijo, guta ubwenge, gucika intege cyangwa urupfu. Ukumva ufite inzara, ibyuya, kuzuyaza no gucika intege bishobora no kugaragara. Ibimenyetso akenshi biza vuba.\nImpamvu ikunze kugaragara ni imiti ikoreshwa mu kuvura diyabete nka insuline na sulfonylureas. Ingaruka ziba nyinshi ku barwayi ba diyabete bariye bike kuruta uko bisanzwe, bagakora imyitozo ngororamubiri cyane kurusha uko bisanzwe cyangwa banyoye inzoga. Izindi mpamvu zirimo kunanirwa kw'impyiko, ibibyimba bimwe na bimwe (nka insulinoma), indwara z'umwijima, inzara, amakosa y'imikorere y'umubiri, hypoglycemia iterwa no kwiheba hamwe n'ibiyobyabwenge byinshi birimo n'inzoga. Isukari nke mu maraso ishobora kugaragara ku bana bari bazima kandi bamaze amasaha make batarya.\nIgipimo cya glucose gisobanura hypoglycemia kirahinduka. Ku bantu barwaye diyabete, urugero ruri munsi ya 3.9\u00a0mmol/L (70\u00a0mg/dL) ni indwara zisuzuma indwara. Ku bantu bakuru badafite diyabete, ibimenyetso by'isukari nke mu maraso, isukari nke mu maraso, no koroherwa iyo isukari yo mu maraso igarutse ku buryo busanzwe ni byo byemeza ko barwaye. Bitabaye ibyo, urwego ruri munsi ya 2.8 kugeza kuri 3.0\u00a0mmol/L (50 kugeza 55\u00a0mg/dL) nyuma yo kutarya cyangwa nyuma yo gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri ishobora gukoreshwa. Mu bana bavutse, urwego ruri munsi ya 2.2\u00a0mmol/L (40\u00a0mg/dL), cyangwa munsi ya 3.3\u00a0mmol/L (60\u00a0mg/dL) iyo ibimenyetso bigaragaye, bigaragaza ko umuntu afite hypoglycemia. Ibindi bizamini bishobora kuba ingirakamaro mu kumenya impamvu birimo urugero rwa insuline na peptide ya C mu maraso.\nKu bantu barwaye diyabete, kwirinda ni uguhuza ibiryo biribwa n'ingano y'imyitozo ngororamubiri n'imiti ikoreshwa. Iyo abantu bumva ko isukari yabo iri hasi mu maraso, ni byiza gupima hakoreshejwe icyuma gipima isukari. Hari abantu bamwe bagaragaza ibimenyetso bike by\u2019isukari nke mu maraso, kandi gupimwa buri gihe muri iri tsinda ni byiza. Uburyo bwo kuvura ni ukurya ibiryo birimo isukari nyinshi cyangwa gufata dextrose. Iyo umuntu adashobora gufata ibiryo mu kanwa, glukagoni iterwa cyangwa mu mazuru ishobora gufasha. Uburyo bwo kuvura budafite aho buhuriye na diyabete burimo no kuvura ikibazo cy\u2019ingenzi ndetse n\u2019indyo nziza. Ijambo \"hypoglycemia\" rimwe na rimwe rikoreshwa nabi mu kuvuga idiopathic postprandial syndrome, indwara ivugwaho rumwe ifite ibimenyetso bisa n'ibyo bibaho nyuma yo kurya ariko isukari isanzwe mu maraso."}
{"id": "23409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23409", "title": "Ubwivumbure bw'umutwe", "text": "Indwara yo mu mutwe (Cleidocranial dysostosis) (CCD), nanone yitwa cleidocranial dysplasia, ni indwara ivuka ikunze kwibasira amagufwa n'amenyo. Amagufwa yo mu ijosi akenshi aba adakuze neza cyangwa ntayo afite, ibyo bigatuma amatugu yegerana. Igice cy'imbere cy'agahanga akenshi ntigifunga kugeza nyuma, kandi abagirwaye akenshi baba ari bagufi ugereranyije n'ikigereranyo. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo agahanga kagaragara, amaso manini, amenyo adasanzwe, n'izuru rirambuye. Ibimenyetso biratandukanye mu bantu; icyakora, ubwenge ntabwo bukunze kugaragara.\nIyo ndwara umuntu ayikura ku babyeyi be cyangwa ikabaho nk'impinduka nshya. Iragwa mu buryo busanzwe bwo kwihitiramo. Biterwa n'inenge iri muri gene ya RUNX2 igira uruhare mu miterere y'amagufwa. Isuzuma rikekwaho hashingiwe ku bimenyetso na X-rays byemejwe n'ibizamini bya genetiki. Izindi ndwara zishobora gutera ibimenyetso nk'ibi zirimo indwara ya mandibuloacral dysplasia, pyknodysostosis, osteogenesis imperfecta, na Hajdu-Cheney syndrome.\nUbuvuzi burimo ingamba zo gushyigikira nko gukoresha igikoresho cyo kurinda umutwe n'ubuvuzi bw'amenyo. Kubagwa bishobora gukorwa kugira ngo hakosorwe ubumuga bumwe na bumwe bw'amagufwa. Icyizere cy'ubuzima muri rusange ni ibisanzwe.\nIgira ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe. Abagabo n'abagore bakunze kwibasirwa n'iyi ndwara. Ibisobanuro bya none by\u2019iyi ndwara byatangiye nibura mu 1896. Iri jambo rikomoka kuri \"cleido\" risobanura igufwa ryo mu mutwe, \"igufwa ryo mu mutwe\" rikomoka ku kigereki \u03ba\u03c1\u03b1\u03bd\u03b9\u1f40\u03c2 risobanura umutwe, naho \"dysostosis\" isobanura kurema igufwa ridasanzwe."}
{"id": "23410", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23410", "title": "Sciatica", "text": "Sciatica ni ububabare bumanuka mu kaguru buturutse mu mugongo wo hasi. Ubu bubabare bushobora kumanuka inyuma, inyuma, cyangwa imbere y'ukuguru. Gutangira gukurura akenshi bitunguranye nyuma y\u2019ibikorwa nko guterura ibintu biremereye, nubwo bishobora no gutangira buhoro buhoro. Ububabare bukunze kuvugwa nk'ubusasu. Ubusanzwe, ibimenyetso biba ku ruhande rumwe rw'umubiri gusa. Impamvu zimwe na zimwe zishobora gutera ububabare ku mpande zombi. Kubabara umugongo wo hasi rimwe na rimwe irahari. Intege nke cyangwa ibinya bishobora kubaho mu bice bitandukanye by'ukuguru n'ikirenge byafashwe.\nHafi 90% bya sciatica biterwa no gukomeretsa uruti rw'umugongo ku mizi y'imitsi yo mu ruhu cyangwa mu gice cyo hasi cy'umugongo. Spondylolisthesis, stenosis y'umugongo, indwara ya piriformis, ibibyimba byo mu kibuno, no gutwita ni izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera sciatica. Ikizamini cyo kuzamura amaguru agororotse gikunze gufasha mu gusuzuma indwara. Ikizamini kiba cyaragaragaje ko ari ukuri iyo, iyo ukuguru kuzamuwe mu gihe umuntu aryamye agaramye, ububabare butangira munsi y'ivi. Kenshi na kenshi amashusho y\u2019ubuvuzi ntabwo akenewe. Ariko, amashusho ashobora kuboneka iyo imikorere y'amara cyangwa uruhago igize ikibazo, habayeho gutakaza ibyiyumvo cyangwa intege nke cyane, ibimenyetso bikaba bimaze igihe kirekire, cyangwa hari impungenge z'ikibyimba cyangwa ubwandu. Ibintu bishobora kugaragara nk'ibyo ni indwara zo mu kibuno n'indwara nka shingles hakiri kare (mbere yo kumera ibisebe).\nUbusanzwe ubuvuzi bwa mbere bukoresha imiti igabanya ububabare. Ariko, ibimenyetso by'imiti igabanya ububabare n'imitsi igabanya ububabare birabura. Muri rusange abantu basabwa gukomeza gukora ibikorwa bisanzwe uko bashoboye kose. Akenshi igikenewe kugira ngo sciatica ikemuke ni igihe gusa; ku bantu bagera kuri 90% ibimenyetso birashira mu byumweru bitarenze bitandatu. Niba ububabare bukomeye kandi bugashira ibyumweru birenga bitandatu, kubagwa bishobora kuba amahitamo. Nubwo kubagwa akenshi byihutisha koroshya ububabare, ibyiza byabyo by'igihe kirekire ntibirasobanuka neza. Kubagwa bishobora kuba ngombwa iyo habayeho ingorane, nko kubura imikorere isanzwe y'amara cyangwa uruhago. Uburyo bwinshi bwo kuvura, harimo imiti ya corticosteroids, gabapentin, pregabalin, acupuncture, ubushyuhe cyangwa urubura, hamwe no gukoresha umugongo, bufite ibimenyetso bike cyangwa bike ku ikoreshwa ryabyo.\nBitewe n'uko byasobanuwe, munsi ya 1% kugeza kuri 40% by'abantu bagira sciatica mu gihe runaka. Sciatica ikunze kugaragara cyane hagati y'imyaka 40 na 59, kandi abagabo ni bo bayibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore. Iyi ndwara izwi kuva kera. Ikoreshwa rya mbere rizwi ry'ijambo \"sciatica\" ryatangiye mu 1451."}
{"id": "23411", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23411", "title": "Arrhythmia", "text": "Arrhythmia, izwi kandi nka arrhythmia y'umutima cyangwa arrhythmia y'umutima, ni itsinda ry'indwara aho umutima utera mu buryo butari bwo, wihuta cyane, cyangwa ugenda buhoro cyane. Umuvuduko w'umutima wihuta cyane - hejuru ya beats 100 ku munota ku bantu bakuru - witwa tachycardia, naho umuvuduko w'umutima ugenda buhoro cyane - munsi ya beats 60 ku munota - witwa bradycardia. Hari ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bwa arrhythmias butagira ibimenyetso. Ibimenyetso iyo bigaragaye bishobora kuba birimo gukubita cyane cyangwa kumva umutima uhagaze hagati y\u2019aho umutima utera. Mu bihe bikomeye cyane, hashobora kubaho kubabara umutwe, gucika intege, guhumeka nabi cyangwa kubabara mu gatuza. Nubwo ubwoko bwinshi bwa arrhythmia butari bukomeye, bumwe butera umuntu kugira ingorane nko gucika intege mu bwonko cyangwa kunanirwa k'umutima. Ibindi bishobora gutera urupfu rutunguranye.\nHari amatsinda ane y'ingenzi ya arrhythmia: extra beats, supraventricular tachycardias, ventricular arrhythmias na bradyarrhythmias. Imivuduko y'inyongera irimo kubyimba kw'imbere y'umutima, kubyimba kw'imitsi itaragera ndetse no kubyimba kw'amagufwa itaragera. Tachycardia yo mu gice cya kabiri cy'umutima irimo fibrillation y'umutima, flutter y'umutima na tachycardia yo mu gice cya gatatu cy'umutima. Indwara zo mu mitsi zirimo kugabanuka kw'imitsi mu mitsi no kugabanuka k'imitsi mu mitsi. Kudakora neza kw'umutima (Arrhythmias) biterwa n'ibibazo by'imikorere y'amashanyarazi mu mutima. Indwara zo kutagira umutima zishobora no kugaragara ku bana, ariko urwego rusanzwe rw'umuvuduko w'umutima ruratandukanye kandi ruterwa n'imyaka. Ibizamini byinshi bishobora gufasha mu gusuzuma indwara harimo electrocardiogram (ECG) na Holter monitor.\nIndwara nyinshi zo kutagira icyo zivuga zishobora kuvurwa neza. Uburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo imiti, uburyo bwo kwa muganga nko gushyiramo pacemaker ndetse no kubagwa. Imiti ivura umuvuduko w'umutima ushobora kuba urimo imiti igabanya ubukana bw'umutima (beta blockers) cyangwa imiti igerageza kugarura umuvuduko w'umutima usanzwe nka procainamide. Iri tsinda rya nyuma rishobora kugira ingaruka mbi zikomeye, cyane cyane iyo rifashwe igihe kirekire. Utwuma dukoresha imbaraga zifasha umutima gutera buhoro. Abafite umutima utari mwiza bakunze kuvurwa n'imiti igabanya amaraso kugira ngo bagabanye ibyago byo guhura n'ibibazo. Abafite ibimenyetso bikomeye by\u2019indwara yo kuruhuka kw\u2019umutima (arrhythmia) bashobora kuvurwa byihutirwa bakoresheje amashanyarazi agenzurwa mu buryo bwo kuvura indwara z\u2019umutima cyangwa indwara yo kuruhuka kw\u2019umutima (defibrillation).\nIndwara yo kutagira ubushake bwo kuruhuka (Arrhythmia) yibasira abantu babarirwa muri za miriyoni. Mu Burayi no muri Amerika ya Ruguru, guhera mu 2014, indwara ya atrial fibrillation yibasira abantu bagera kuri 2% kugeza kuri 3% by'abaturage. Gucika intege kw'imitsi no kugabanuka kw'imitsi byatumye abantu 112.000 bapfa mu 2013, ugereranyije n'abantu 29.000 mu 1990. Impfu z\u2019umutima zitunguranye ni zo zitera hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019impfu ziterwa n\u2019indwara z\u2019umutima n\u2019iz\u2019umutima ndetse n\u2019impfu zigera kuri 15% ku isi yose. Hafi 80% by'impfu zitunguranye z'umutima ziterwa no kugabanuka k'umutima mu mitsi. Indwara yo kutagira ubushake bwo kuruhuka (Arrhythmias) ishobora kubaho mu myaka iyo ari yo yose ariko ikunze kugaragara cyane mu bantu bakuze."}
{"id": "23412", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23412", "title": "Guanfacine", "text": "Guanfacine, igurishwa ku izina rya Tenex n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara yo kudakora neza kw'attention (ADHD) n'umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso. Ni uburyo bwo kuvura ADHD butari bwiza cyane ndetse n'umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, kuribwa mu nda, kuma mu kanwa, ibibazo by'imibonano mpuzabitsina, no kuribwa umutwe. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo guhangayika, umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi, kwiheba, n'ibibazo by'inkari. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa. Bisa nkaho bikora binyuze mu gukora kwa \u03b1 2A receptors mu bwonko bityo bigabanura imikorere y'urusobe rw'imitsi.\nGuanfacine yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1986. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ku kwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a360 mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi 7.11 USD. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 131 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni eshanu."}
{"id": "23413", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23413", "title": "Kuruka", "text": "Kuruka, bizwi kandi nka emesis, ni ugusohora ku ngufu ibiri mu nda binyuze mu kanwa cyangwa mu mazuru nta bushake. Bifitanye isano no kugira isesemi kandi akenshi bifata umunsi umwe cyangwa ibiri. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo umwuma, umuyaga uturuka ku ruhu, imikorere mibi ya electrolyte, kwangirika kw'amenyo, no gucika k'umuyoboro w'amaraso. Kuruka bitandukanye no kongera kunyara, kuko kongera kunyara bidasaba kubyimba igifu cyangwa isesemi.\nImpamvu zikunze kugaragara zirimo indwara y'igifu n'imiti imwe n'imwe cyangwa uburozi. Izindi mpamvu zirimo indwara ya cannabis hyperemesis syndrome, indwara yo kuruka cyclic, kuziba amara, hepatitis, kwiyongera k'umuvuduko mu bwonko, migraine, ibibazo byo kurya, ketoacidosis ya diyabete, isesemi, isesemi no kuruka cyangwa gutwita, appendicitis, na labyrinthite. Ku bana, impamvu zishobora kuba zirimo reflux, volvulus, pyloric stenosis, indwara yo mu nzira y'inkari, na intussusception.\nUbuvuzi burimo kugerageza kunywa ibinyobwa bihagije. Indwara zo kurwanya emergency kwishyura bikoreshwa mu kugabanya ibimenyetso. Hariho kandi ibimenyetso bimwe na bimwe bigaragaza ko umuntu ahumeka inzoga ya isopropyl. Iyo habayeho umwuma mu mubiri, amazi yo mu mitsi ashobora kuba ingirakamaro. Ibimenyetso biteye impungenge birimo kubabara mu nda cyane, amaraso mu birutsi, kuribwa umutwe cyane, ibimenyetso byo kubura amazi mu mubiri, no kuruka icyatsi. Kuruka ni yo mpamvu igera kuri 1.6% by'abagana abaganga b'imiryango muri Ositaraliya."}
{"id": "23414", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23414", "title": "Kanseri ya prostate", "text": "Kanseri ya porositate ni kanseri ikura muri porositate, imvubura iri mu buryo bw'imyororokere bw'abagabo. Kanseri nyinshi za prostate zikura buhoro buhoro; icyakora, zimwe zikura vuba. Uturemangingo twa kanseri dushobora gukwirakwira mu bice by'umubiri, cyane cyane mu magufwa no mu tunyangingo tw'amaraso. Mu ntangiriro bishobora kutagira ibimenyetso bitera. Mu ntambwe za nyuma, bishobora gutera ingorane zo kunyara, amaraso mu nkari cyangwa ububabare mu kibuno, umugongo, cyangwa iyo uri kunyara. Indwara izwi nka benign prostatic hyperplasia ishobora kugaragaza ibimenyetso bisa. Ibindi bimenyetso bya nyuma bishobora kuba birimo kumva unaniwe bitewe n'urugero ruto rw'uturemangingo dutukura mu maraso.\nIbintu byongera ibyago byo kurwara kanseri ya prostate birimo gusaza, amateka y'umuryango warwaye iyi ndwara, n'ubwoko bw'abantu. Hafi 99% by'abandura iyi ndwara biba ku bagabo barengeje imyaka 50. Kugira uwo mu muryango we wo ku rwego rwa mbere urwaye iyi ndwara byongera ibyago byikubye kabiri cyangwa gatatu. Izindi mpamvu zishobora kuba zirimo indyo irimo inyama nyinshi zatunganyijwe, inyama zitukura cyangwa amata cyangwa imboga zimwe na zimwe nke. Habonetse isano ifitanye isano na gonorrhea, ariko impamvu y'iyi sano ntiramenyekana. Ingaruka ziyongera zifitanye isano n'impinduka za BRCA. Kanseri ya porositate ipimwa hakoreshejwe biopsy. Gufata amashusho mu buvuzi bishobora gukorwa kugira ngo hamenyekane niba kanseri yarakwirakwiriye mu bindi bice by'umubiri.\nGusuzuma kanseri ya prostate biravugwaho rumwe. Antigen yihariye ya prostate Gupima (PSA) byongera uburyo bwo gupima kanseri, ariko biravugwaho rumwe niba binoza umusaruro. Gufata ibyemezo ukurikije amakuru bigirwa inama iyo bigeze ku gusuzuma abantu bafite imyaka 55 kugeza kuri 69. Ikizamini, iyo gikozwe, kiba gifite ishingiro ku bantu bafite igihe kirekire cyo kubaho. Nubwo imiti igabanya kanseri ya 5\u03b1-reductase isa nkaho igabanya ibyago byo kurwara kanseri y\u2019urwego rwo hasi, ntabwo igira ingaruka ku byago byo kurwara kanseri y\u2019urwego rwo hejuru bityo ntigomba kwirindwa. Kongeramo vitamine cyangwa imyunyu ngugu bisa nkaho ntacyo bigiraho ingaruka ku ngaruka.\nIbibazo byinshi bicungwa hakoreshejwe igenzura ryimbitse cyangwa gutegereza neza. Ubundi buryo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo kubaga, gukoresha imirasire, gukoresha imisemburo cyangwa imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara. Iyo bigaragaye gusa muri prostate, bishobora gukira. Ku bantu iyi ndwara yakwirakwiriye mu magufwa, imiti igabanya ububabare, bisphosphonates n'ubuvuzi bugamije, n'ibindi, bishobora kuba ingirakamaro. Ibisubizo biterwa n'imyaka y'umuntu n'izindi ngorane z'ubuzima ndetse n'uburyo kanseri ikabije kandi ikaba nini. Abagabo benshi barwaye kanseri ya prostate ntibapfa bazize iyo ndwara. Igipimo cy'imyaka 5 yo kubaho muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ni 98%. Ku isi yose, ni yo kanseri ya kabiri ikunze kugaragara cyane, ikaba n'impamvu ya gatanu y'impfu zikomoka kuri kanseri ku bagabo. Mu 2018, byagaragaye ku bagabo miliyoni 1.2 kandi byahitanye abantu 359.000. Ni yo kanseri ikunze kugaragara cyane mu bagabo mu bihugu 84, ikaba ikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu byateye imbere. Igipimo cyakomeje kwiyongera mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Gupima indwara byariyongereye cyane mu myaka ya 1980 na 1990 mu bice byinshi bitewe n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019ibizamini bya PSA. Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe ku bagabo bapfuye bazize impamvu zidahuye bwagaragaje ko kanseri ya prostate iri hagati ya 30% na 70% by'abafite imyaka irenga 60."}
{"id": "23415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23415", "title": "Indwara ya Scoliose", "text": "Scoliosis ni indwara aho umugongo w'umuntu uba ufite imiterere y'uruhande. Ubusanzwe uruhererekane rugira ishusho ya \"S\"- cyangwa \"C\" mu ngero eshatu. Muri bimwe, urugero rw'umuvuduko rurahamye, mu gihe mu bindi, ruriyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Ubusanzwe scoliosis yoroheje ntabwo itera ibibazo, ariko indwara zikomeye zishobora kubangamira guhumeka. Ubusanzwe, nta bubabare bubaho.\nImpamvu y\u2019icyorezo kinini ntiramenyekana, ariko bikekwa ko iterwa n\u2019uruvange rw\u2019ibintu bigize imiterere y\u2019umubiri n\u2019ibidukikije. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo n'abandi bagize umuryango bagizweho ingaruka. Bishobora kandi guterwa n'indi ndwara nko kubabara imitsi, indwara yo mu bwonko, indwara ya Marfan, n'ibibyimba nka neurofibromatosis. Isuzuma ryemezwa hakoreshejwe imirasire ya X. Scoliosis ikunze gushyirwa mu byiciro bibiri: aho umugongo uba uhagaze, cyangwa aho umugongo uri munsi uba usanzwe.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'urugero rw'uburemere, aho buherereye, n'impamvu. Imirongo mito ishobora kurebwa buri gihe. Uburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo gutera inkunga umubiri, imyitozo ngororamubiri yihariye, no kubaga. Igikoresho cyo gukingira kigomba gushyirwa ku muntu kandi kigakoreshwa buri munsi kugeza igihe gukura kurangiye. Imyitozo yihariye ishobora gukoreshwa kugira ngo igabanye ibyago byo kugabanuka kw'ibinure. Bishobora gukorwa byonyine cyangwa hamwe n'ubundi buryo bwo kuvura nko gusimbuza. Ibimenyetso bigaragaza ko gukoresha imiti igabanya ubukana bw'imirire, inyongeramusaruro, cyangwa imyitozo ngororamubiri bishobora gukumira ko indwara ikomeza kwiyongera ni bike cyane. Ariko, imyitozo ngororamubiri iracyasabwa kubera izindi nyungu zayo ku buzima.\nIndwara ya Scoliosis igaragara ku bantu bagera kuri 3%. Bikunze kubaho cyane hagati y'imyaka 10 na 20. Abagore bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagabo. Iri jambo rikomoka kuri risobanura \"guhindagurika\". "}
{"id": "23416", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23416", "title": "Gynecomastia", "text": "Gynecomastia ni ukwiyongera kw'ibere rimwe cyangwa yombi ku bagabo bitari kanseri. Bamwe bakoresha iri jambo gusa iyo kwiyongera kw'umubiri biterwa n'ingingo z'umubiri, kandi bagakoresha ijambo pseudogynaecomastia iyo kwiyongera kw'umubiri ari ingaruka z'ibinure byinshi. Rimwe na rimwe ububabare bushobora kugaragara. Iyi ndwara ishobora gutera ihungabana ryo mu mutwe.\nGynecomastia ishobora kuba isanzwe ku bana bavutse bitewe no guhura na estrogene n'umubyeyi, mu gihe cy'ubugimbi, no ku bagabo bakuze. Muri rusange izi manza ntizisaba andi maperereza. Bishobora kandi kujyana n'umubyibuho ukabije, indwara z'umwijima, impyiko zinanirwa gukora neza, kanseri zimwe na zimwe, indwara ya tiroyide, imiti imwe n'imwe n'imiti yo kwidagadura, indwara ya Klinefelter, hamwe n'imirire mibi. Uburyo bw'ibanze akenshi busaba kwiyongera kwa estrogen cyangwa kugabanuka k'urugero rwa androgen.\nIndwara zibaho mu gihe cy'ubugimbi muri rusange zishira mu myaka ibiri kandi zisaba gusa kwitabwaho. Iyo ndwara ikunze gukemuka iyo impamvu nyamukuru ikemutse. Imiti nka tamoxifens cyangwa clomiphene igira akamaro iyo ikoreshejwe hakiri kare. Mu bihe bimaze igihe kinini, kubagwa, nko gukata amavuta cyangwa gukata amenyo, ni bwo buryo bwonyine bufatika.\nGynecomastia yibasira abagabo bagera kuri 35% kandi ikunze kugaragara cyane hagati y'imyaka 50 na 69. Iboneka mu bana bavutse bagera kuri 90% na 60% by'abahungu mu gihe cy'ubwangavu. Ni yo mpamvu ikunze gutuma abagabo bashaka ubufasha bw'abaganga kubera ikibazo cy'ibere. Ibisobanuro by'iyi ndwara byanditswe na Galen mu kinyejana cya 2."}
{"id": "23417", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23417", "title": "Migraine", "text": "Migraine ni indwara isanzwe y'imyakura irangwa no kurwara umutwe kenshi, ubusanzwe mu gice kimwe cyawo, bishobora kumara kugeza ku minsi itatu. Ishobora kujyana n'isesemi, kuruka no kutihanganira urumuri cyangwa amajwi.\nIterwa n'uruvange rw'ibidukikije n'uturemangingo, kandi ifata abagore kurusha abagabo. Ivurwa hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya ububabare n'imiti yihariye; ifata hafi 15% by'abantu ku isi.\nIbimenyetso.\nMigraine ni indwara isanzwe y'imyakura irangwa no kurwara umutwe kenshi, ubusanzwe ufite ubukana buri hagati cyangwa bukabije. Ubusanzwe, umutwe ufata igice kimwe cy'umutwe, uteragura, kandi umara amasaha make kugeza ku minsi 3. Ibimenyetso bijyana nabyo bishobora kuba birimo isesemi, kuruka, no kumva urumuri, amajwi, cyangwa impumuro. Ububabare muri rusange burushaho kwiyongera iyo umuntu akoze imyitozo ngororamubiri. Abantu bagera kuri kimwe cya gatatu barwaye indwara bafite aura: ubusanzwe ni igihe gito cyo kutabona neza kigaragaza ko umutwe ugiye gufata vuba. Rimwe na rimwe, aura ishobora kubaho igakurikirwa n'umutwe muto cyangwa ntihagire umutwe na mba.\nImpamvu.\nBikekwa ko indwara ya Migraine iterwa n'uruvange rw'ibintu bifitanye isano n'ibidukikije n'uturemangingo. Hafi bibiri bya gatatu by'abarwayi bafite abo mu miryango yabo nabo bayirwaye. Ihindagurika ry'urugero rw'imisemburo naryo rishobora kugira uruhare, kuko indwara ya migraine igira ingaruka ku bahungu benshi gato kurusha abakobwa mbere y'ubwangavu n'abagore bakubye inshuro ebyiri cyangwa eshatu ugereranyije n'abagabo. Ibyago byo kurwara migraine bikunze kugabanuka mu gihe cyo gutwita no nyuma yo gucura. Uburyo indwara ikora ntabwo buzwi neza. Icyakora, bikekwa ko bifitanye isano n'imyakura n'imitsi y'amaraso yo mu bwonko.\nKuvura.\nUburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura ni ugukoresha imiti yoroheje igabanya ububabare nka ibuprofen na parasetamol (acetaminophen) ku ndwara y'umutwe, imiti ivura isesemi, no kwirinda ibintu byayitera. Imiti yihariye nka triptans cyangwa ergotamines ishobora gukoreshwa ku bantu imiti yoroheje y'ububabare idakora. Kafeyine ishobora kongerwa kuri ibi byavuzwe haruguru. Imiti iterwa mu mitsi (\"intravenous\") mu bitaro by'ubutabazi nayo irashyigikiwe. Imiti myinshi ni ingirakamaro mu gukumira ibitero by'indwara, birimo metoprolol, valproate, topiramate, na anti-CGRP monoclonal antibody.\nIkwirakwira.\nKu isi yose, abantu bagera kuri 15% bibasirwa n'indwara ya migraine. Akenshi bitangira mu gihe cy'ubugimbi kandi bikaba bibi cyane mu myaka yo hagati y'ubuzima. Mu 2016, ni imwe mu mpamvu zikunze gutera ubumuga.\nAmateka.\nIbisobanuro bya mbere bihuye na migraine biri mu nyandiko ya \"Papyrus Ebers\", yanditswe ahagana mu 1500 mbere ya Yesu mu Misiri ya kera. Ijambo \"migraine\" rikomoka mu kigereki \u1f21\u03bc\u03b9\u03ba\u03c1\u03b1\u03bd\u03af\u03b1 (\"hemikrania\"), 'ububabare mu gice cy'umutwe', kuva \u1f21\u03bc\u03b9- (\"hemi-\"), 'igice', na \u03ba\u03c1\u03b1\u03bd\u03af\u03bf\u03bd (\"kranion\"), 'igihanga'."}
{"id": "23418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23418", "title": "Selulite", "text": "Cellulite ni indwara iterwa na bagiteri ifata ibice by'imbere by'uruhu. Bigira ingaruka ku buryo bwihariye ku ruhu rw'uruhu n'ibinure biri munsi y'umubiri. Ibimenyetso birimo agace k'umutuku kagenda kiyongera mu bunini mu minsi mike. Imbibi z'agace k'umutuku muri rusange ntabwo ziba zityaye kandi uruhu rushobora kubyimba. Nubwo umutuku ukunda guhinduka umweru iyo hashyizweho igitutu, si ko bigenda buri gihe. Agace k'ubwandu gakunze kubabaza. Imiyoboro y'amaraso ishobora kugira ingaruka rimwe na rimwe, kandi umuntu ashobora kugira umuriro no kumva ananiwe.\nAmaguru n'isura ni byo bikunze kugaragara cyane, nubwo cellulitis ishobora kugaragara ku gice icyo ari cyo cyose cy'umubiri. Ukuguru gukunze kugira ingaruka nyuma yo kuvunika k'uruhu. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera ikibazo zirimo umubyibuho ukabije, kubyimba amaguru, no gusaza. Ku ndwara zo mu maso, akenshi si ko bibaho mbere y\u2019uko uruhu rucika. Bagiteri zikunze kwibasirwa cyane ni streptococci na \"Staphylococcus aureus\". Bitandukanye na cellulitis, erysipelas ni indwara ya bagiteri ifata ibice by'uruhu biri hejuru cyane, ikaba ifite agace k'umutuku gafite impande zisobanutse neza, kandi akenshi ifitanye isano n'umuriro. Ubusanzwe indwara iterwa n'ibimenyetso n'ibimenyetso byayo, mu gihe gupima uturemangingo bidakunze kubaho. Mbere yo gusuzuma indwara, indwara zikomeye nka infection y\u2019amagufwa cyangwa fasciitis yo mu igufwa igomba kwirengagizwa.\nUbusanzwe ubuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara zandurira mu mubiri, nka cephalexin, amoxicillin cyangwa cloxacillin. Abafite ubwivumbure bukomeye kuri penisiline bashobora guhabwa umuti witwa erythromycin cyangwa clindamycin. Iyo ikibazo kibangamiye S. aureus (MRSA) idashobora guterwa na methicillin, doxycycline cyangwa trimethoprim/sulfamethoxazole ishobora kandi kuba yagirwa inama. Hari impungenge zijyanye no kuba hari amashyira cyangwa ubwandu bwa MRSA bwabayeho mbere. Kuzamura agace kanduye bishobora kuba ingirakamaro, kimwe n'imiti yica ububabare.\nIngorane zishobora kubaho zirimo kurema ibibyimba. Abantu bagera kuri 95% barushaho kuba beza nyuma y'iminsi 7 kugeza ku 10 yo kuvurwa. Abarwaye diyabete, ariko, bakunze kugira ingaruka mbi kurushaho. Indwara ya selulite yagaragaye ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni 21.2 mu 2015. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika abantu bagera kuri 2 kuri buri 1.000 buri mwaka bafite ikibazo kigira ingaruka ku kirenge cyo hasi. Indwara ya selulite mu 2015 yahitanye abantu bagera ku 16.900 ku isi yose. Mu Bwongereza, indwara ya cellulitis ni yo yatumye 1.6% by'abantu bajyanwa mu bitaro."}
{"id": "23419", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23419", "title": "Clopidogrel", "text": "Clopidogrel, igurishwa ku izina ry'ubucuruzi rya Plavix n'indi, ni umuti ugabanya platelet ukoreshwa mu kugabanya ibyago byo kurwara indwara z'umutima na stroke ku bafite ibyago byinshi byo kurwara. Ikoreshwa kandi hamwe na aspirine mu ndwara z'umutima no nyuma yo gushyiramo stent yo mu mitsi y'umutima (uburyo bwo kuvura indwara zo mu mitsi). Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ingaruka zitangira mu gihe cy'amasaha abiri kandi zimara iminsi itanu.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuribwa umutwe, isesemi, gukomereka byoroshye, kuribwa no gushya. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zirimo kuva amaraso no kuvura indwara ya thrombocytopenic purpura. Nubwo nta kimenyetso cy'ingaruka mbi zituruka ku gukoresha iyo miti mu gihe cyo gutwita, kuyikoresha ntibyigwa neza. Clopidogrel iri mu bwoko bwa thienopyridine bw\u2019imiti igabanya ubukana bw\u2019amaraso. Ikora mu gukumira bidasubirwaho receptor yitwa P2Y 12 kuri platelets.\nClopidogrel yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1982, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1997. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Igiciro cy'igurishwa ry'ibicuruzwa mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere ni hagati y'amadolari y'Amerika 0.77\u201331.59 ku kwezi. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ukwezi kw'ubuvuzi kugura munsi y'amadolari 25 y'Amerika. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 40 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abantu barenga miliyoni 19."}
{"id": "23420", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23420", "title": "Baclofene", "text": "Baclofen, igurishwa ku izina rya Lioresal n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura imitsi idakora neza nko mu gukomereka k'umugongo cyangwa indwara ya sclerosis nyinshi. Ishobora kandi gukoreshwa mu kuvura imitsi no kubabara mu mitsi hafi y'iherezo ry'ubuzima. Ifatwa mu kanwa cyangwa igashyirwa mu muyoboro w'umugongo.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, gucika intege, no kuzerera. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kubaho iyo baclofen ihagaze vuba harimo gukubita no gucika intege. Gukoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita ntabwo bisobanutse neza mu gihe gukoresha mu gihe cyo konsa bishobora kuba ari byiza. Bikekwa ko bikora mu kugabanya imikorere y'uturemangingo tw'ubwonko.\nBaclofen yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1977. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ku gipimo cya 50mg ku munsi, gutanga ukwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a35.50 mu 2020. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 8.40. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 140 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni enye."}
{"id": "23421", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23421", "title": "Mathieu Ngirumpatse", "text": "Mathieu Ngirumpatse (wavutse mu 1939) ni umunyapolitiki w\u2019Umunyarwanda, wari perezida wa MRND. \nMu gihe cy\u2019amezi atatu mu 1994, Abatutsi bagera ku 800.000 bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda, mu gihe Abahutu batari bashyigikiye iyo Jenoside na bo bishwe. Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwagaragaje ko ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi bwari bushingiye ku mugambi wo kubarimbura. Ngirumpatse yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu ku ya 21 Ukuboza 2011 kubera uruhare rwe muri jenoside. "}
{"id": "23422", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23422", "title": "Umurenge wa Rukara", "text": "Umurenge wa Rukara ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rukara wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 231.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nUmurenge wa Rukara ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Kayonza.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rukara wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 176. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 231."}
{"id": "23423", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23423", "title": "Ferdinand Nahimana", "text": "Ferdinand Nahimana (wavutse ku ya 15 Kamena 1950) ni umuhanga mu by'amateka w'Umunyarwanda, wahamwe n'icyaha cyo gushishikariza abantu gukora jenoside kubera uruhare yagize muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nNahimana yari umwe mu bashinze radiyo ya Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines (RTLM), yatangazaga amakuru na poropagande byafashije mu guhuza ubwicanyi no gushishikariza urwango rwakorewe Abatutsi n'Abahutu baciriritse.\nUbuzima bwite.\nFerdinand Nahimana yavutse ku ya 15 Nyakanga muri komini Gatonde, muri perefegitura ya Ruhengeri. Yubatse afite abana bane. \nAfite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu mateka yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Paris Diderot. Hagati ya 1979 na 2007, yasohoye ibitabo byinshi n'inyandiko ku mateka y'u Rwanda.\nJenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nHakurikijwe amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha, yagizwe Minisitiri w'Uburezi bw'Amashuri Makuru ushinzwe Umuco n'Ubushakashatsi mu bya Siyansi. Nahimana yari umwe mu bagize ishyaka rya politiki rya Habyarimana, ishyaka ry\u2019aba-repubulikani riharanira demokarasi n\u2019iterambere. \nHagati ya 1979 na 1994, Nahimana bivugwa ko yanditse akanasohora inyandiko zishishikariza imyigaragambyo yo kurwanya Abatutsi n'Abahutu baciriritse. \nAmaze kwirukanwa muri Radiyo y'Igihugu y'u Rwanda mu 1993, yagize uruhare mu ishingwa rya RTLM, kandi nk'uko Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rubivuga, yabaye umuyobozi wayo. Kubera ubwo bufatanye, yashinjwe kuba \"yarashishikarije mu buryo butaziguye\" ubwicanyi. Hagati ya Mata 1993 na 31 Nyakanga 1994, Ferdinand Nahimana yashinjwe gutegura, kuyobora no gushyigikira ibiganiro bya RTLM. Umushinjacyaha wa TPIR yavuze ko \u201cyari azi gahunda n\u2019ingaruka izo gahunda zigira ku baturage\u201d. \nYanashinjwe kandi kuba yarateguye, abifashijwemo na murumuna we, inama hagati ya MRND n'igisirikare cy'Interahamwe muri Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, agamije kuganira ku bwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi n'Abahutu. \u00a0\nMuri Mata 1994, ubwo imvururu zatangiraga mu Rwanda nyuma y'iyicwa rya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, ambasade y'Ubufaransa yafashe Ferdinand Nahimana. Ku itariki ya 12 Mata, ambasade y'Ubufaransa yarahungishijwe maze Nahimana, hamwe n'umuryango we n'abandi bari barahahungiye, bajyanwa mu Burundi. Uburundi ntibwari bwiteguye kwakira iri tsinda ry'impunzi, bityo Nahimana yoherezwa mu ndege ku ya 17 Mata i Bukavu. [5] Nahimana n'izindi mpunzi basubijwe mu Rwanda ku ya 23 Mata. [6] Nahimana yaje gutabwa muri yombi muri Kameruni ku ya 27 Werurwe 1996. \nUrubanza n'igihano.\nFerdinand Nahimana yashinjwe gushishikariza abantu gukora Jenoside, aburanishwa n\u2019Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR), mu rubanza rwari rufitanye isano n\u2019uruhare rw\u2019itangazamakuru muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Yaburanye ari kumwe na Hassan Ngeze na Jean-Bosco Barayagwiza, na bo bari bafitanye isano na radiyo RTLM. Nahimana yahakanye ibyaha yashinjwaga, anavuga ko atari afite ububasha bwo kugenzura ibiganiro bya RTLM mu gihe cya Jenoside. Yagize ati: \u201cSinashoboraga kumenya RTLM yo muri icyo gihe n\u2019iyo yariho mbere ya tariki ya 6 Mata. Yari yarigaruriwe n\u2019abahezanguni, ubu bitwa intagondwa, bafite imyumvire n\u2019uburyo bwo gukora ibintu ntari nsangiye na bo.\u201d\". \n\"Imanza z'urwango mu itangazamakuru \" zavuzweho cyane kuko ari bwo bwa mbere kuva imanza za Nuremberg ziburanishwa nk'icyaha cy'intambara. Ku itariki ya 3 Ukuboza 2003, Ferdinand Nahimana yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu, icyaha cya jenoside, umugambi wo gukora jenoside, gushishikariza, mu buryo butaziguye kandi mu ruhame, gukora jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Hassan Ngeze nawe yahawe igihano cy'igifungo cya burundu, naho Jean Bosco Barayagwiza akatirwa igifungo cy'imyaka 35. Nubwo ibihano bishobora kugira ingaruka ku bwisanzure bw'itangazamakuru, Ikigo cy'Abanyamakuru Badafite Imipaka cyishimiye ibyavuye mu rubanza. \nNubwo umunyamategeko we w\u2019Umufaransa Jean-Marie Biju-Duval yavuze ko Nahimana, washinze Radio Television Libre des Mille Collines (RTLM), atakigize uruhare na ruto kuri radiyo guhera ku ya 6 Mata 1994, yakatiwe kubera inshingano ze nk\u2019umukozi mukuru muri RTLM.\nUyu muhanga mu by'amateka w'Umunyarwanda yahamijwe icyaha cyo kuba ntacyo yakoze kugira ngo ahagarike ibikorwa bibi bya radiyo ya RTLM nyuma y'itariki ya 6 Mata 1994, nk'uko urubanza rwabimutegetse, yari afite urwego rushinzwe abakozi ba radiyo.\nFerdinand Nahimana yajuririye icyaha cye, maze urubanza rwaburanishijwe n'Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rutangira ku ya 16 Mutarama 2007. Ku itariki ya 28 Ugushyingo 2007, Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rwamugabanyirije igihano cy'igifungo kigera ku myaka 30. Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rwatesheje agaciro bimwe mu byaha bye, cyane cyane ibyari byarabayeho mbere ya 1994. Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rwanatesheje agaciro umwanzuro wa mbere w'uko hari amasezerano hagati ya RTLM, CDR, na Kangura yo gufasha mu gukora jenoside. Bityo, yakuyeho ibirego byaregwaga Nahimana hakurikijwe ingingo ya 6 (1) ya Sitati, ariko ishyigikira ibyari bikubiye mu ngingo ya 6 (3)\u2014ni ukuvuga ibyo \"gushishikariza mu buryo butaziguye kandi mu ruhame gukora jenoside no gutoteza nk'icyaha cyibasiye inyokomuntu\" binyuze mu biganiro bya RTLM nyuma y'itariki ya 6 Mata 1994. Nk\u2019uko JusticeInfo.net ibivuga:\nMu Kuboza 2008, yimuriwe muri Mali ava Arusha muri Tanzaniya. Mu 2016, yararekuwe. \nImpaka ku cyaha cyo guhamwa n'icyaha.\nIgitabo cyo mu 2010 cyanditswe n'umunyamakuru akaba n'umuhanga mu by'amateka Herv\u00e9 Deguine kivuga ko impamvu zakoreshejwe mu rubanza rwa Nahimana zari zishingiye ku bimenyetso bike cyane uretse ko ari we washinze kandi akaba n'umwe mu ba nyiri radiyo, agaragaza ingingo n'ibimenyetso bifatika birwanya icyaha cye. Nubwo Deguine ubwe yagize uruhare mu guhamwa n'icyaha kwa Nahimana, asoza igitabo cye yemeza ko hashingiwe ku bimenyetso by'urukiko, Nahimana agomba kurekurwa. [10]"}
{"id": "23430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23430", "title": "Melatonine", "text": "Melatonin ni imisemburo irekurwa cyane cyane n'agace ka pineal gatunganya uruziga rw'ibitotsi n'ibikanguro. Nk'inyongeramusaruro mu mirire, ikunze gukoreshwa mu kuvura ibibazo byo gusinzira by'igihe gito, nko mu gihe cyo gutinda mu ndege cyangwa akazi ko ku kazi, kandi akenshi inyobwa mu kanwa. Nyamara, ibimenyetso by'akamaro kayo kuri iyi mikoreshereze ntabwo bikomeye. Isuzuma ryakozwe mu 2017 ryagaragaje ko gusinzira byatangiye kwihuta iminota itandatu iyo umuntu akoreshejwe ariko nta gihindutse cyagaragaye mu gihe cyose asinziriye. Umuti wa melatonin receptor agonist ramelteon ushobora gukora neza kimwe n'inyongeramusaruro za melatonin.\nIngaruka mbi zituruka ku nyongeramusaruro ni nkeya iyo umuntu ahawe dose nke mu gihe gito. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo gusinzira, kuribwa umutwe, isesemi, impiswi, no kurota inzozi zidasanzwe. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa. Gukoresha kandi ntibikwiye ku bantu bafite ibibazo by'umwijima.\nMu nyamaswa (harimo n'abantu), melatonin igira uruhare mu guhuza imikorere y'umubiri, harimo igihe cyo gusinzira no kubyuka, kugenzura umuvuduko w'amaraso, no kororoka kw'ibihe bitandukanye. Ingaruka nyinshi zayo ziterwa no gukora kwa receptor za melatonin, mu gihe izindi ziterwa n'uruhare rwayo nk'ingufu zirwanya uburozi. Mu bimera, bikora mu kurinda stress ya oxidative. Iboneka kandi mu biribwa bitandukanye. \nMelatonin yavumbuwe mu 1958. Igurishwa ku isoko muri Kanada na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika; mu Bwongereza, ni umuti utangwa na muganga gusa. Ibicuruzwa by'ukwezi bigura hagati y'amadolari ya Amerika 1 na 4 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Mu Bwongereza, ibicuruzwa bya buri kwezi bitwara NHS ibiro bigera kuri 15. Ntabwo byemewe n'Ikigo gishinzwe ibiribwa n'imiti muri Amerika (FDA) ku ikoreshwa ry'ubuvuzi iryo ari ryo ryose. Muri Ositaraliya no mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019u Burayi, ikoreshwa mu kugorana gusinzira ku bantu barengeje imyaka 54. Mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019u Burayi, ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zo kubura ibitotsi ku bana. Yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019u Burayi mu 2007."}
{"id": "23431", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23431", "title": "Haloperidol", "text": "Haloperidol, igurishwa ku izina ry'ubucuruzi rya Haldol n'indi, ni umuti usanzwe uvura indwara zo mu mutwe. Haloperidol ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ya schizophrenia, tics muri Tourette syndrome, mania muri bipolar disorder, isesemi no kuruka, delirium, agitations, acute psychosis, hamwe no kubona ibintu mu buryo butunguranye mu gihe cyo kureka inzoga. Ishobora gukoreshwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa mu mitsi cyangwa mu mitsi. Haloperidol isanzwe ikora mu minota 30 kugeza kuri 60. Umuti ukora igihe kirekire ushobora gukoreshwa nk'urushinge buri byumweru bine ku bantu barwaye schizophrenia cyangwa izindi ndwara zifitanye isano, bibagirwa cyangwa bakanga gufata umuti mu kanwa.\nHaloperidol ishobora gutera indwara yo kwimuka izwi nka tardive dyskinesia ishobora kuba ihoraho. Indwara y\u2019imitsi itera indwara ya Neuroleptic Malignant Syndrome hamwe no kongera igihe cya QT bishobora kubaho. Ku bantu bakuze bafite indwara yo mu mutwe iterwa no kwibagirwa, ibyago byo gupfa byiyongera. Iyo ifashwe mu gihe cyo gutwita ishobora guteza ibibazo ku mwana. Ntibikwiye gukoreshwa ku bantu barwaye indwara ya Parkinson.\nHaloperidol yavumbuwe mu 1958 na Paul Janssen. Yakozwe muri pethidine (meperidine). Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Ni wo muti usanzwe ukoreshwa cyane wo kurwanya indwara zo mu mutwe. Birahendutse cyane. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 296 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni imwe."}
{"id": "23432", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23432", "title": "Leptospirose", "text": "Leptospirose ni indwara iterwa na bagiteri \"Leptospira\", ikwirakwizwa cyane cyane n'inkari z'imbeba n'izindi nyamaswa. Ibimenyetso byayo bishobora kuba bike, nko kuribwa umutwe n'umuriro, cyangwa bikomeye, nko kuva amaraso mu bihaha cyangwa \"m\u00e9ningite\".\nIkunze kugaragara mu turere dushyuha, cyane cyane nyuma y'imvura nyinshi. Ivurwa n'imiti yica bagiteri, kandi buri mwaka yandura abantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe ku isi.\nIbimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso bishobora kuba bike (kuribwa umutwe, kuribwa imikaya n'umuriro) cyangwa bikomeye (kuva amaraso mu bihaha cyangwa \"m\u00e9ningite\"). Indwara ya Weil, ubwoko bukomeye bwa leptospirose, itera umuhondo (uruhu n'amaso bihinduka umuhondo), kunanirwa kw'impyiko no kuva amaraso. Kuva amaraso mu bihaha biterwa na leptospirose byitwa \u00ab\"syndrome\" ikomeye yo kuva amaraso mu bihaha\u00bb.\nImpamvu n'ikwirakwira.\nUbwoko burenga icumi bwa \"Leptospira\" butera indwara ku bantu. Inyamaswa zo mu gasozi n'izo mu rugo zishobora gukwirakwiza iyi ndwara, cyane cyane imbeba. Bagiteri yandurira ku bantu binyuze mu nkari z'inyamaswa, cyangwa mu mazi n'ubutaka byanduzwa n'izo nkari, iyo bigeze ku maso, ku munwa, ku mazuru cyangwa ku ruhu rwakomeretse.\nMu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere, ikunze kwibasira abahinzi n'abakene batuye ahantu hafite isuku nke. Mu bihugu bikize, ibaho nyuma y'imvura nyinshi cyangwa mu bikorwa byo hanze mu turere dushyuha kandi dutose.\nIsuzuma, kwirinda no kuvura.\nAkenshi isuzumwa hapimwa \"anticorps\" zirwanya bagiteri cyangwa ADN yayo mu maraso.\nKuyirinda bikubiyemo kwambara ibikoresho byo kwirinda igihe ukorana n'inyamaswa zishobora kuba zanduye, gukaraba nyuma yo gukora ku mbeba no kugabanya imbeba aho abantu batuye n'aho bakorera. \"Doxycycline\" ifasha kwirinda kwandura. Inkingo z'abantu zigira akamaro gake, naho iz'amatungo ziraboneka cyane. Uwanduye avurwa n'imiti yica bagiteri nka \"doxycycline\", \"p\u00e9nicilline\" cyangwa \"ceftriaxone\". Muri rusange, 5\u201310 % by'abarwayi barapfa, ariko iyo ibihaha byafashwe, ibyago byo gupfa bigera kuri 50\u201370 %.\nUko ikwirakwiye.\nBivugwa ko buri mwaka abantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe ku isi barwara leptospirose, abagera ku 58 900 bakayihitanwa na yo. Ikunze kugaragara mu turere dushyuha ariko ishobora kuboneka ahantu hose, kandi ibyorezo bishobora kuvuka nyuma y'imvura nyinshi. Yasobanuwe bwa mbere n'umuganga Adolf Weil mu 1886 mu Ubudage."}
{"id": "23433", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23433", "title": "Konsa", "text": "Konsa (mu Gifaransa: \"allaitement maternel\"; mu Cyongereza: \"breastfeeding\") ni uguha abana bato amata y'ibere ry'umubyeyi. Abahanga mu by'ubuzima basaba ko umwana atangira konka mu isaha ya mbere avutse, kandi akonka buri gihe abishatse.\nKonsa bigirira akamaro umwana n'umubyeyi: birinda umwana indwara nyinshi kandi bihendutse kurusha amata y'ifu. Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima usaba konsa gusa mu mezi atandatu ya mbere, hanyuma bigakomeza kugeza ku myaka ibiri cyangwa irenga.\nUko bikorwa.\nKonsa ni uguha abana bato amata y'ibere ry'umubyeyi. Bisabwa ko bitangira mu isaha ya mbere y'ubuzima bw'umwana, kandi bigakorwa kenshi uko umwana abishaka. Mu byumweru bya mbere, abana bashobora konka buri masaha abiri cyangwa atatu, buri gihe iminota icumi kugeza kuri cumi n'itanu kuri buri bere. Abana bakuru bonka gake. Ababyeyi bashobora gukama amata yabo kugira ngo azakoreshwe nyuma igihe konsa bidashoboka.\nAkamaro.\nKonsa bigirira akamaro kenshi umubyeyi n'umwana, amata y'ifu atabasha gutanga. Konsa abana benshi byashobora kurinda impfu z'abana bagera ku 820 000 bari munsi y'imyaka itanu buri mwaka ku isi. Bigabanya ibyago by'indwara z'ubuhumekero n'impiswi, haba mu bihugu bikennye cyangwa ibikize. Bigabanya kandi ibyago bya asima, aleriji z'ibiryo na diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1, bishobora kongera imikurire y'ubwonko no kugabanya ibyago byo kubyibuha bikabije umuntu amaze gukura. Ababyeyi bashobora kumva bahatirwa konsa, ariko mu bihugu bikize abana bahabwa amata y'ifu muri rusange bakura neza.\nKu mubyeyi, konsa bigabanya kuva amaraso nyuma yo kubyara, bifasha umura gusubirana vuba no kugabanya agahinda gakabije gakurikira kubyara. Bitinza kandi kongera kujya mu mihango no gusama (\"am\u00e9norrh\u00e9e lactationnelle\"). Mu gihe kirekire, bigabanya ibyago bya kanseri y'ibere, indwara z'umutima n'imitsi na rubagimpande. Konsa kandi birahendutse kurusha amata y'ifu.\nInama.\nImiryango y'ubuzima, harimo n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima (OMS), isaba konsa gusa mu mezi atandatu ya mbere, ni ukuvuga nta bindi biribwa cyangwa ibinyobwa, uretse wenda vitamine D. Nyuma yo gutangira guha umwana ibindi biribwa ku mezi atandatu, birasabwa gukomeza konsa kugeza ku mwaka umwe cyangwa ibiri, cyangwa birenga.\nIndwara zibuza umubyeyi konsa ni nke cyane. Ababyeyi bakoresha ibiyobyabwenge bimwe na bimwe ntibagomba konsa. Kunywa itabi, inzoga nke cyangwa ikawa si impamvu zo kureka konsa.\nUko bihagaze ku isi.\nKu isi, hafi 47 % by'abana bari hagati y'amezi 0 na 6 ni bo bonka gusa (2018\u20132025). Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 2015, 83 % by'ababyeyi batangiye konsa, ariko ku mezi atandatu 58 % gusa ni bo bari bakonsa, naho 25 % bonsa gusa."}
{"id": "23434", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23434", "title": "Ibibyimba", "text": "Ibibyimba (mu Gifaransa: \"verrues\"; mu Cyongereza: \"warts\") ni utubyimba duto, dukomeye, dufite ibara risa n'iry'uruhu, biterwa na virusi ya \"papillomavirus\" y'umuntu (HPV). Bikunze kuza ku biganza no ku birenge, kandi si kanseri.\nBikunze kugaragara cyane, kandi akenshi bishira ubwabyo mu mezi cyangwa imyaka. Kuvurwa bishobora kwihutisha gukira, hakoreshejwe nka \"acide salicylique\" cyangwa \"cryoth\u00e9rapie\".\nIbimenyetso n'ubwoko.\nIbibyimba ni utubyimba duto, dukomeye, dufite ibara risa n'iry'uruhu. Ubusanzwe ntibitera ibindi bimenyetso, keretse iyo biri munsi y'ibirenge, aho bishobora kubabaza. Akenshi biza ku biganza no ku birenge, ariko bishobora no kuza ahandi. Hashobora kuza kimwe cyangwa byinshi, kandi si kanseri.\nHari ubwoko bwinshi bw'ibibyimba: ibibyimba bisanzwe, ibyo munsi y'ibirenge, ibibyimba birebire kandi binanutse (\"filiformes\") n'ibyo ku myanya ndangagitsina. Ibyo ku myanya ndangagitsina akenshi byandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina.\nImpamvu.\nIbibyimba biterwa n'ubwandu bw'ubwoko bumwe bwa \"papillomavirus\" y'umuntu (HPV). Ibyongera ibyago ni ugukoresha ubwogero rusange, gukora ku nyama mbisi (nk'abacuruzi b'inyama), \"ecz\u00e9ma\" n'ubudahangarwa buke. Bikekwa ko virusi yinjira mu mubiri inyuze ahantu uruhu rwakomeretse gato.\nKuvura.\nIyo bitavuwe, ubwoko bwinshi bw'ibibyimba bushira ubwabwo mu mezi cyangwa imyaka. Uburyo bwinshi bwo kuvura bushobora kwihutisha gukira, harimo \"acide salicylique\" isigwa ku ruhu na \"cryoth\u00e9rapie\" (gukonjesha cyane). Ku bantu bafite ubuzima bwiza, ubusanzwe ntibiteza ibibazo bikomeye. Ibibyimba byo ku myanya ndangagitsina bivurwa mu buryo butandukanye n'ubundi bwoko.\nUko bikwirakwiye.\nIbibyimba birakunze kugaragara cyane, abantu benshi babirwara igihe runaka mu buzima bwabo. Ibitari ku myanya ndangagitsina bifata 1\u201313 % by'abaturage, cyane cyane urubyiruko. Ibyo ku myanya ndangagitsina bifata hafi 12 % by'abagore bakora imibonano mpuzabitsina. Ibibyimba byasobanuwe nibura kuva mu mwaka wa 400 mbere ya Yezu na Hippocrate."}
{"id": "23435", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23435", "title": "Norepinephrine", "text": "Norepinephrine, izwi kandi nka \"noradr\u00e9naline\", ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura abantu bafite umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi cyane. Itangwa iterwa buhoro buhoro mu mutsi, kandi ni molekile imwe n'umusemburo n'umutumwa w'imyakura (\"neurotransmetteur\") witwa norepinephrine.\nYavumbuwe mu 1946, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 1950. Iboneka nk'umuti rusange.\nIkoreshwa.\nNorepinephrine ikoreshwa mu kuvura umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi cyane. Ni umuti usanzwe ukoreshwa muri \"sepsis\" iyo umuvuduko w'amaraso utazamutse nyuma yo guterwa amazi mu mitsi. Ni molekile imwe n'umusemburo n'umutumwa w'imyakura norepinephrine. Ikora ifata kandi igakangura \"r\u00e9cepteurs\" za \"alpha-adr\u00e9nergiques\".\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara ni ukuribwa umutwe, umutima utera gahoro no guhangayika. Izindi ni umutima utera nabi. Iyo umuti usohotse mu mutsi, ushobora gutera \"isch\u00e9mie\" y'ingingo; icyo gihe gutera \"phentolamine\" ahangiritse bishobora gufasha.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nNorepinephrine yavumbuwe mu 1946, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu 1950. Iboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9rique\"). Mu Ubwongereza, agacupa kamwe katwara NHS hafi \u00a34,40."}
{"id": "23436", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23436", "title": "Indwara z'ibihumyo", "text": "Indwara z'ibihumyo (mu Gifaransa: \"oreillons\"; mu Cyongereza: \"mumps\") ni indwara iterwa na virusi y'ibihumyo. Irangwa no kubyimba kubabaza kw'imvubura z'amacandwe za \"parotide\", nyuma y'umuriro no kumva utameze neza.\nIrandura cyane binyuze mu bitonyanga by'ubuhumekero. Ishobora kwirindwa n'urukingo rufatwa inshuro ebyiri, kandi ntigira umuti wihariye. Mbere y'urukingo yari indwara isanzwe y'abana ku isi hose.\nIbimenyetso n'ingorane.\nIbimenyetso bya mbere akenshi ni umuriro, kuribwa imikaya, kuribwa umutwe, kubura ubushake bwo kurya no kumva utameze neza. Bikurikirwa no kubyimba kubabaza kw'imvubura imwe cyangwa zombi za \"parotide\". Ibimenyetso bigaragara nyuma y'iminsi 16 kugeza kuri 18 umuntu yanduye, bigashira nyuma y'iminsi 7 kugeza kuri 10. Bikunze gukomera ku bantu bakuru kurusha ku bana, naho hafi kimwe cya gatatu cy'abanduye bagira ibimenyetso byoroheje cyangwa ntibagire na kimwe.\nIngorane zishobora kuba \"m\u00e9ningite\" (15 %), \"pancr\u00e9atite\" (4 %), kubyimba k'umutima, kutumva burundu no kubyimba kw'amabya, gake bigatera ubugumba. Abagore bashobora kubyimba udusabo tw'intanga, ariko ibyo ntibyongera ibyago byo kutabyara. Hafi umuntu umwe ku 10 000 banduye arapfa.\nIkwirakwira n'isuzuma.\nIndwara irandura cyane kandi ikwirakwira vuba mu bantu babana hafi. Virusi yandurira mu bitonyanga by'ubuhumekero cyangwa mu gukoranaho n'uwanduye, kandi abantu ni bo bonyine bayandura bakanayikwirakwiza. Umuntu yanduza kuva ku minsi irindwi mbere y'uko \"parotide\" zibyimba kugeza ku minsi umunani nyuma yaho. Iyo umuntu akize, agira ubudahangarwa ubuzima bwe bwose; kongera kwandura birashoboka ariko bikaba byoroheje.\nUbusanzwe indwara ikekwa iyo \"parotide\" zabyimbye, ikemezwa no guhinga virusi ivuye mu muyoboro w'amacandwe wa \"parotide\". Gupima \"IgM\" mu maraso biroroshye kandi bifasha, ariko bishobora gutanga igisubizo kitari cyo ku bantu bakingiwe.\nKwirinda no kuvura.\nIndwara z'ibihumyo zirindwa n'urukingo rufatwa inshuro ebyiri. Ibihugu byinshi byateye imbere byarushyize muri gahunda yabyo yo gukingira, akenshi ruvanze n'inkingo z'iseru, \"rub\u00e9ole\" na \"varicelle\". Nta muti wihariye uyivura. Ubuvuzi bugamije kugabanya ibimenyetso hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya ububabare nka paracetamol. \"Immunoglobulines\" ziterwa mu mitsi zishobora gufasha mu ngorane zimwe na zimwe. Kujyanwa mu bitaro bishobora kuba ngombwa iyo havutse \"m\u00e9ningite\" cyangwa \"pancr\u00e9atite\".\nUko ikwirakwiye.\nGukingira byagabanyije umubare w'abarwara ku kigero kirenga 90 %. Indwara ikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere, aho gukingira bidakwiriye. Mbere y'urukingo, yari indwara isanzwe y'abana ku isi hose, ibyorezo bikaba buri myaka ibiri kugeza kuri itanu, cyane cyane ku bana bafite hagati y'imyaka 5 na 9. Mu bakingiwe, abari mu kigero cy'imyaka 20 ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa. Mu turere dushyuha, iboneka umwaka wose, naho mu turere tw'ubukonje ikunze kuboneka mu gihe cy'ubukonje n'urugaryi.\nKubyimba kubabaza kw'imvubura za \"parotide\" n'amabya byasobanuwe bwa mbere na Hippocrate mu kinyejana cya 5 mbere ya Yezu."}
{"id": "23437", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23437", "title": "Anencephaly", "text": "Anencephaly (mu Gifaransa: \"anenc\u00e9phalie\") ni ukubura igice kinini cy'ubwonko n'agahanga, bitewe n'ikibazo cyo mu mikurire y'umwana akiri mu nda. Ni bumwe mu bumuga bw'umuyoboro w'imyakura (\"tube neural\").\nIshobora kugaragara mbere yo kuvuka. Kuyirinda bishingiye ku kongera aside folike mu ndyo y'umubyeyi. Abana bavukana na yo benshi bapfa mu masaha cyangwa iminsi mike.\nIbimenyetso.\n\"Anenc\u00e9phalie\" ni ukubura igice kinini cy'ubwonko n'agahanga bitewe n'ibibazo mu mikurire y'umwana akiri mu nda. Abana bafite iyi ndwara ntibabona, ntibumva kandi nta bwenge bagira, ntibashobora kumva ububabare. Ariko bashobora kugira ibikorwa by'ikiyoborere (\"r\u00e9flexes\"), nko guhumeka cyangwa kwitaba amajwi n'ugukorwaho.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nBikekwa ko iterwa n'ibintu byinshi, birimo kubura \"folate\", imiti imwe n'imwe ivura igicuri, diyabete, vitamine A nyinshi n'ubushyuhe bwinshi mu gihe cyo gutwita. Ni ubwoko bw'ubumuga bw'umuyoboro w'imyakura, buterwa n'uko impera y'imbere y'uwo muyoboro idafunga neza.\nMbere yo kuvuka, ishobora gukekwa iyo urugero rwa \"alpha-f\u0153toprot\u00e9ine\" mu maraso y'umubyeyi ruri hejuru, ikemezwa na \"\u00e9chographie\".\nKwirinda no kuvura.\nKuyirinda bishingiye ku kongera aside folike mu ndyo y'umubyeyi. Umuti uvura igicuri witwa \"valproate\" ugomba kwirindwa mu gihe cyo gutwita, niba bishoboka. Nta muti uyikiza; ubuvuzi butangwa ni ubwo kwita ku mwana gusa. Iyo umwana avutse ari muzima, akenshi apfa mu masaha cyangwa iminsi mike nyuma yo kuvuka.\nUko ikwirakwiye.\nMuri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, umwana umwe kuri 4 762 avukana \"anenc\u00e9phalie\"."}
{"id": "23438", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23438", "title": "Herpes", "text": "Herpes (mu Cyongereza: \"herpes simplex\") ni indwara iterwa na virusi ya \"herpes simplex\". Itera uduheri duto dukoranye tumeneka tukaba udusebe, cyane cyane ku munwa (herpes yo mu kanwa) cyangwa ku myanya ndangagitsina (herpes yo mu gitsina). Virusi iguma mu mubiri ubuzima bwose, indwara ikagenda igaruka.\nHari ubwoko bubiri bwa virusi, HSV-1 na HSV-2. Ntirakingirwa kandi ntirakira, ariko imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi ifasha kugabanya ibimenyetso. Abantu benshi ku isi baranduye, kandi abenshi ntibabizi.\nIbimenyetso.\nIndwara zishyirwa mu byiciro hakurikijwe igice cy'umubiri cyanduye. Herpes yo mu kanwa ifata isura cyangwa umunwa, ikaba ishobora gutera uduheri duto dukoranye bita \u00abibisebe by'umuriro\u00bb cyangwa ububabare mu umuhogo. Herpes yo mu gitsina ishobora kugira ibimenyetso bike cyangwa ikagira uduheri tumeneka tukaba udusebe duto, dukunze gukira mu byumweru bibiri kugeza kuri bine. Kuribwa cyangwa kumva ibishyushye bishobora kubanziriza udusebe.\nIndwara igenda isimburana n'ibihe bitagira ibimenyetso. Ubwa mbere bikunze kuba bikomeye, bikajyana n'umuriro, kuribwa imikaya, kubyimba kwa \"ganglions\" no kuribwa umutwe; uko igihe gihita, ibihe by'indwara biragabanuka mu mubare no mu bukana. Virusi ishobora no gufata intoki, amaso, ubwonko cyangwa impinja zikivuka.\nImpamvu n'ikwirakwira.\nHSV-1 ikunze gutera indwara zo ku munwa, naho HSV-2 igatera iz'imyanya ndangagitsina. Zandurira mu gukora ku mazi cyangwa ku dusebe tw'umuntu wanduye, kandi zishobora kwandura no mu gihe nta bimenyetso bihari. Herpes yo mu gitsina iri mu ndwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina, kandi ishobora kwanduza umwana mu gihe cyo kubyara.\nNyuma yo kwandura, virusi zijya mu turemangingo tw'imyakura aho ziguma ubuzima bwose. Indwara ishobora kugaruka bitewe n'ubudahangarwa bugabanutse, \"stress\" cyangwa izuba.\nIsuzuma.\nUbusanzwe herpes isuzumwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso. Isuzuma rishobora kwemezwa no guhinga virusi cyangwa gushakisha ADN yayo (PCR) mu mazi ava mu dusebe. Gupima amaraso bishobora kwerekana ko umuntu yigeze kwandura, ariko ntibigaragaza ubwandu bushya.\nKwirinda no kuvura.\nUburyo bwizewe bwo kwirinda herpes yo mu gitsina ni ukwirinda imibonano mpuzabitsina. Gukoresha agakingirizo bigabanya ibyago, kimwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi ifatwa buri munsi n'uwanduye. Nta rukingo ruhari, kandi nta muti uyikiza burundu.\nParacetamol na \"lidoca\u00efne\" isigwa ku ruhu bishobora kugabanya ububabare. Imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi nka \"aciclovir\" cyangwa \"valaciclovir\" igabanya ubukana bw'ibimenyetso.\nUko ikwirakwiye.\nKu isi, abantu bakuru bari hagati ya 60 % na 95 % banduye HSV-1 cyangwa HSV-2. HSV-1 ikunze kwandura mu bwana, kandi umubare w'abanduye wiyongera uko abantu bakura. Abanduye HSV-1 ni 70\u201380 % mu baturage bakennye, na 40\u201360 % mu bafite imibereho myiza.\nMu 2020, abantu bagera kuri miliyari 3,8 bari munsi y'imyaka 50 (64 %) bari banduye HSV-1, naho abantu miliyoni 520 bafite hagati y'imyaka 15 na 49 (13 %) bari banduye HSV-2. Abenshi mu banduye HSV-2 ntibazi ko banduye.\nIzina.\nIzina \"herpes\" rikomoka ku Kigereki \"herp\u0113s\", risobanura \u00abgukwirakwira\u00bb, ryerekeza ku buryo udusebe dukwirakwira."}
{"id": "23439", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23439", "title": "Loratadine", "text": "Loratadine, igurishwa ku izina rya \"Claritin\" n'andi, ni umuti urwanya \"histamine\" ukoreshwa mu kuvura aleriji, nk'ibicurane biterwa n'ifu y'ibyatsi (\"rhinite allergique\") n'uduheri. Ufatwa mu kanwa.\nYahawe ipatanti mu 1980, igera ku isoko mu 1988. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima kandi iboneka nk'umuti rusange.\nIkoreshwa.\nLoratadine ikoreshwa mu kuvura aleriji, harimo \"rhinite allergique\" (ifu y'ibyatsi) n'uduheri. Iboneka kandi ivanze na \"pseudo\u00e9ph\u00e9drine\", umuti ugabanya kuziba kw'amazuru, ku izina rya loratadine/pseudo\u00e9ph\u00e9drine. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Iri mu miti irwanya \"histamine\" yo mu gisekuru cya kabiri.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara ni ugusinzira, kuma mu kanwa no kuribwa umutwe. Izikomeye ntizikunze kubaho; zirimo aleriji, igicuri n'ibibazo by'umwijima. Kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita bisa n'aho nta kibazo biteza, ariko ntibirigwa neza. Ntisabwa ku bana bari munsi y'imyaka ibiri.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nLoratadine yahawe ipatanti mu 1980, igera ku isoko mu 1988. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima kandi iboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9rique\"). Mu 2015, igiciro cyayo mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere cyari hagati ya 0,01 na 0,06 by'amadolari y'Amerika ku kinini. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika igurwa nta rupapuro rwa muganga. Mu 2024, wari umuti wa 101 wandikwaga cyane muri icyo gihugu, ufite impapuro z'abaganga hafi miliyoni zirindwi."}
{"id": "23440", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23440", "title": "Finasteride", "text": "Finasteride, igurishwa ku mazina ya \"Proscar\" na \"Propecia\" n'andi, ni umuti ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura \"prostate\" yabyimbye no gupfuka umusatsi (uruhara) ku bagabo. Ufatwa mu kanwa.\nNi umuti ubuza \"5\u03b1-r\u00e9ductase\", bityo ukagabanya ikorwa rya \"dihydrotestost\u00e9rone\" (DHT). Wemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1992 kandi uboneka nk'umuti rusange udahenze.\nIkoreshwa.\nFinasteride ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura \"prostate\" yabyimbye no gupfuka umusatsi ku bagabo. Ishobora kandi gukoreshwa mu kuvura ubwoya bwinshi ku bagore (\"hirsutisme\") no mu kuvura hakoreshejwe imisemburo ku bagore bahinduye igitsina. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nNi umuti ubuza \"5\u03b1-r\u00e9ductase\", bityo ukaba urwanya \"androg\u00e8nes\". Igabanya cyane ikorwa rya \"dihydrotestost\u00e9rone\" (DHT), harimo no muri \"prostate\" no ku ruhu rw'umutwe.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi za finasteride ntizikunze kubaho, ariko bamwe mu bagabo bagira ibibazo mu mibonano mpuzabitsina, agahinda gakabije no kubyimba amabere. Ku bagabo bamwe, ibibazo mu mibonano mpuzabitsina bishobora gukomeza na nyuma yo guhagarika umuti. Ishobora kandi kongera ibyago byo kurwara ubwoko bumwe bwa kanseri ya prostate.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nFinasteride yahawe ipatanti mu 1984, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1992. Iboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9rique\") kandi ntihenze. Mu 2019, ukwezi kw'imiti kwatwaraga NHS yo mu Ubwongereza hafi \u00a30,90, naho muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika igiciro cyayo cyari hafi amadolari 2,30. Mu 2024, wari umuti wa 81 wandikwaga cyane muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, ufite impapuro z'abaganga zirenga miliyoni umunani."}
{"id": "23441", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23441", "title": "Lithiyumu (umuti)", "text": "Lithiyumu (mu Cyongereza: \"lithium salts\") ni umuti ugizwe n'imyunyu ya lithiyumu, ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe, by'umwihariko indwara ya \"bipolaire\". Ufatwa mu kanwa kandi ushyirwa mu miti iringaniza imyumvire.\nIkoreshwa ryayo mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe ryatangijwe mu 1948 n'umuganga wo muri Ositaraliya John Cade. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima.\nIkoreshwa.\nLithiyumu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura indwara ya \"bipolaire\" no mu kuvura agahinda gakabije (\"d\u00e9pression\") kadakira nyuma yo gukoresha indi miti. Muri izi ndwara, igabanya ibyago byo kwiyahura. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Imyunyu ya lithiyumu ishyirwa mu miti iringaniza imyumvire (\"r\u00e9gulateurs de l'humeur\"). Uburyo ikora ntiburamenyekana neza.\nIngaruka mbi.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara ni ukwihagarika kenshi, guhinda kw'amaboko no kugira inyota nyinshi. Izikomeye ni \"hypothyro\u00efdie\", diyabete insipidus n'uburozi bwa lithiyumu. Birasabwa gupima kenshi urugero rwayo mu maraso kugira ngo hirindwe uburozi. Iyo urugero rwayo rubaye rwinshi cyane, hashobora kuza impiswi, kuruka, guhuza imikorere nabi, gusinzira cyane no kuvuza mu matwi.\nIyo ikoreshejwe mu gihe cyo gutwita, ishobora guteza ibibazo ku mwana. Bisa n'aho ishobora gukoreshwa mu gihe cyo konsa, ariko umwana agakurikiranwa.\nAmateka.\nMu kinyejana cya 19, lithiyumu yakoreshwaga mu kuvura \"goutte\", igicuri na kanseri. Ikoreshwa ryayo mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe ryatangijwe mu 1948 na John Cade wo muri Ositaraliya.\nIgiciro n'ikoreshwa.\nLithiyumu iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iboneka nk'umuti rusange (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9rique\"). Mu 2014, igiciro cyayo cyo kugurisha mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere cyari hagati ya 0,12 na 0,20 by'amadolari y'Amerika ku munsi. Mu 2024, wari umuti wa 167 wandikwaga cyane muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, ufite impapuro z'abaganga zirenga miliyoni eshatu."}
{"id": "23442", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23442", "title": "Ubwivu bw'imitsi yo mu mpande", "text": "Ubwivu bw'imitsi yo mu mpande (mu Cyongereza: \"peripheral neuropathy\") ni ukwangirika kw'imitsi yo mu mpande, ari yo mitsi ihuza ubwonko n'urutirigongo n'ibindi bice by'umubiri. Ibimenyetso biterwa n'ubwoko bw'imitsi yangiritse, kandi akenshi bitangirira ku maguru no ku maboko.\nIkunze guterwa na diyabete n'inzoga, ariko ifite izindi mpamvu nyinshi. Isuzumwa hashingiwe ku bimenyetso no ku bizamini, ikavurwa hakemurwa impamvu yayo no kugabanya ububabare. Ifata abantu bagera kuri 1 kugeza kuri 7 %.\nIbimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso bishobora kuba intege nke z'imitsi, guhindagurika kw'imitsi cyangwa kuyumva ishyuha; ibinya, ububabare cyangwa kuringaniza nabi; cyangwa kutihanganira ubushyuhe, kubira ibyuya byinshi n'ingorane zo kumira. Bishobora gutangira mu minsi mike cyangwa mu myaka myinshi. Akenshi bitangirira ku maguru yo hasi no ku maboko.\nImpamvu.\nUbwoko busanzwe burimo ubwivu buterwa na diyabete, ubuterwa n'inzoga, indwara ya Guillain-Barr\u00e9 n'imitsi ifatiwe ku kiganza (\"carpal tunnel syndrome\"). Izindi mpamvu zirimo ibikomere, amaraso adatembera neza, indwara z'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri, indwara z'impyiko cyangwa z'umwijima, kubura vitamine B12 cyangwa B6, imiti imwe n'imwe irimo iyivura kanseri (\"chimioth\u00e9rapie\"), uruhererekane rw'imiterere (\"g\u00e9n\u00e9tique\"), \"zona\", indwara ya Lyme na VIH/SIDA. Rimwe na rimwe impamvu ntimenyekana.\nIsuzuma.\nGusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso no ku isuzuma ry'umurwayi. Gupima amaraso bikorwa kugira ngo harebwe diyabete, vitamine, imikorere y'umwijima, ya tiroyide n'iy'impyiko; hashobora no gupimwa poroteyine zidasanzwe. Ibindi bizamini birimo gupima umuvuduko w'ubutumwa mu mitsi, \"electromyography\" cyangwa gufata agace k'umutsi (\"biopsie\").\nUbuvuzi.\nIyo impamvu nyamukuru ishobora gukemurwa, umurwayi ashobora gukira uko igihe gihita. Kureka kunywa itabi, gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri no kugenzura isukari mu maraso nabyo bishobora gufasha. Ubwivu buterwa n'indwara z'ubudahangarwa bushobora kuvurwa n'imiti nka prednisone, cyclosporine cyangwa azathioprine, rimwe na rimwe na \"plasmaph\u00e9r\u00e8se\". Imiti igabanya ububabare irimo nortriptyline, duloxetine na gabapentin.\nIkwirakwira n'amateka.\nUbwivu bw'imitsi yo mu mpande bufata abantu bagera kuri 1 kugeza kuri 7 %, bukaba bwiganje cyane ku barengeje imyaka 50; bufata kandi 25 kugeza kuri 50 % by'abarwayi ba diyabete. Ibisobanuro bya mbere bisobanutse by'iyi ndwara byanditswe n'umuganga w'Umufaransa Joseph Jules Dejerine guhera mu 1880."}
{"id": "23443", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23443", "title": "Ubwoko 1 bwa diyabete", "text": "Diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1 (mu Cyongereza: \"type 1 diabetes\", T1D), yahoze yitwa \"diyabete y'abana\", ni ubwoko bwa diyabete aho \"pancreas\" ikora insuline nke cyane cyangwa ntiyikore na gato. Insuline ni umusemburo umubiri ukenera kugira ngo ukoreshe isukari iri mu amaraso.\nUbusanzwe itangira mu bana no mu bakuru bakiri bato, ikagaragazwa no kwihagarika kenshi, inyota n'inzara nyinshi no kugabanuka ibiro. Nta buryo buzwi bwo kuyirinda; abayirwaye bakenera kuvurwa na insuline ubuzima bwabo bwose. Igize 5\u201310 % by'abarwayi bose ba diyabete.\nIbimenyetso.\nMbere yo kuvurwa, iyi ndwara itera isukari nyinshi mu maraso. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe ni ukwihagarika kenshi, inyota nyinshi, inzara nyinshi no kugabanuka ibiro. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba kutabona neza, umunaniro no gukira buhoro kw'ibikomere. Ibimenyetso bikunze kugaragara mu gihe gito.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nImpamvu ya diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1 ntizwi neza, ariko bikekwa ko iterwa n'uruvange rw'imiterere karande n'ibidukikije. Kugira umuntu wo mu muryango uyirwaye byongera ibyago. Indwara iterwa no gusenyuka kw'uturemangingo twa beta two muri \"pancreas\" dukora insuline.\nDiyabete isuzumwa hapimwa urugero rw'isukari cyangwa hemoglobine \"glyqu\u00e9e\" (HbA1C) mu maraso. Ubwoko bwa 1 butandukanywa n'ubwoko bwa 2 hapimwa \"autoantibodies\".\nKuvura n'ingorane.\nNta buryo buzwi bwo kwirinda diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1. Kuvurwa na insuline ni ngombwa kugira ngo umurwayi abeho. Ubusanzwe insuline iterwa mu nshinge munsi y'uruhu, ariko ishobora no gutangwa hakoreshejwe pompe ya insuline. Indyo n'imyitozo ngororamubiri ni ingenzi mu kuyicunga.\nIyo idavuwe, diyabete iteza ingorane nyinshi. Izihutirwa ni \"ketoacidose\" ya diyabete na \"coma hyperosmolaire\". Iz'igihe kirekire ni indwara z'umutima, indwara z'imitsi yo mu ubwonko, kunanirwa kw'impyiko, ibisebe ku birenge no kwangirika kw'amaso. Isukari nke mu maraso na yo ishobora guterwa no gufata insuline nyinshi.\nUko ikwirakwiye.\nDiyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1 igize 5\u201310 % by'abarwayi bose ba diyabete. Umubare w'abayirwaye ku isi ntuzwi, ariko bivugwa ko abana bagera ku 80 000 bayirwara buri mwaka. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, abayirwaye babarirwa hagati ya miliyoni imwe n'eshatu.\nUmubare w'abarwara bashya uratandukanye cyane: umuntu 1 kuri 100 000 buri mwaka muri Aziya y'Iburasirazuba no muri Amerika y\u2019Epfo, naho abagera kuri 30 kuri 100 000 muri Scandinavie no muri Koweti. Ubusanzwe itangirira mu bana no mu bakuru bakiri bato."}
{"id": "23444", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23444", "title": "Kaminuza ya Gikristo y'Indimi Ebyiri ya Kongo", "text": "Kaminuza ya Gikristo y'Indimi Ebyiri ya Kongo (mu gifaransa: \"Universit\u00e9 chr\u00e9tienne bilingue du Congo\", UCBC) ni kaminuza yigenga iherereye i Beni mu ntara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nYafunguwe mu 2007 n\u2019umuryango Congo Initiative.\nAmateka.\nKaminuza yashinzwe ku gitekerezo cya David M. Kasali n\u2019umugore we Kaswera Kasali, nyuma y\u2019amatora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu yo mu 2006. Congo Initiative, yashinzwe mu 2005, yayifunguye mu 2007. Yahawe uruhushya rwo gukora mu 2006, yemerwa burundu ku wa 27 Mata 2010. David Kasali yayiyoboye imyaka 12; mu 2019 yasimbuwe na Honor\u00e9 Bunduki Kwany wari umuyobozi wungirije. Mu 2023, abayobozi bayo bavuze ko umutekano muke watumye abanyeshuri bo mu yindi mijyi bareka kuhaza, kandi ko kaminuza itabona inkunga ya Leta.\nAmasomo.\nUCBC ikoresha gahunda ya LMD kuva yatangira, ikigisha mu mashami arimo itangazamakuru n\u2019itumanaho, tewolojiya, filozofiya n\u2019ubuyobozi, ubukungu, ikoranabuhanga n\u2019ubwubatsi, amategeko, ubumenyi bw\u2019imitekerereze n\u2019uburezi. Uburezi bwayo buhuza amasomo, akazi (\"Work Program\") n\u2019umurimo ufitiye abaturage akamaro (\"Service Learning\"). Ikigo cyayo cya hegitari 36 gifite imirima y\u2019igerageza, icyuzi, ibiraro by\u2019amatungo na radiyo."}
{"id": "23445", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23445", "title": "Rosa Parks", "text": "Rosa Parks (yavutse yitwa Rosa Louise McCauley, ku wa 4 Gashyantare 1913 \u2013 ku wa 24 Ukwakira 2005) yari umugore w\u2019Umunyamerika w\u2019umwirabura waharaniye uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage. Azwi cyane kubera ko ku wa 1 Ukuboza 1955, i Montgomery muri Leta ya Alabama, yanze guha umugabo w\u2019umuzungu intebe ye muri bisi, nk\u2019uko amategeko y\u2019ivangura ry\u2019amoko yabitegekaga.\nIfatwa rye ryateje imyigaragambyo yo kwanga gutega bisi z\u2019i Montgomery yamaze iminsi 381, iba intangiriro y\u2019urugamba rw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika. Akenshi yitwa \u00abnyina w\u2019urugamba rw\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abaturage\u00bb.\nUbuzima.\nRosa Louise McCauley yavukiye i Tuskegee muri Alabama, akurira i Pine Level hafi ya Montgomery. Mu 1932 yashakanye na Raymond Parks, wari umwe mu bagize umuryango NAACP (\"National Association for the Advancement of Colored People\"). Mu 1943, Rosa Parks na we yinjiye muri NAACP, aba umunyamabanga w\u2019ishami ryayo ry\u2019i Montgomery.\nIfatwa ryo mu 1955 n\u2019imyigaragambyo ya bisi.\nKu wa 1 Ukuboza 1955, ubwo yatahaga avuye ku kazi, Rosa Parks yanze kubahiriza itegeko ry\u2019umushoferi wa bisi wamusabaga guha intebe ye umugenzi w\u2019umuzungu. Yahise afatwa, aracibwa ihazabu.\nIri fatwa ryatumye Abirabura b\u2019i Montgomery batangiza imyigaragambyo yo kwanga gutega bisi, iyobowe na Martin Luther King Jr., wari umupasiteri ukiri muto icyo gihe. Yamaze iminsi 381, irangira mu Ukuboza 1956 nyuma y\u2019uko Urukiko rw\u2019Ikirenga rwa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika rwemeje ko ivangura muri bisi rinyuranyije n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga.\nNyuma y\u2019imyigaragambyo.\nKubera iterabwoba n\u2019ibura ry\u2019akazi, Rosa n\u2019umugabo we bimukiye i Detroit muri Leta ya Michigan mu 1957. Kuva mu 1965 kugeza mu 1988, yakoreye umudepite John Conyers. Mu 1987, we n\u2019umugabo we bashinze ikigo cyo guteza imbere urubyiruko.\nYahawe ibihembo byinshi, birimo umudari w\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu w\u2019ubwisanzure (\"Presidential Medal of Freedom\") mu 1996 n\u2019umudari wa zahabu w\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko (\"Congressional Gold Medal\") mu 1999.\nUrupfu.\nRosa Parks yapfiriye i Detroit ku wa 24 Ukwakira 2005, afite imyaka 92. Umurambo we washyizwe mu nzu y\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko (\"Capitole\") i Washington kugira ngo abantu bamwunamire; ni we mugore wa mbere wahawe icyo cyubahiro."}
{"id": "23448", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23448", "title": "MINUAR", "text": "Mission des Nations unies pour l'assistance au Rwanda\nMINUAR (mu Gifaransa: \"Mission des Nations unies pour l'assistance au Rwanda\"; mu Cyongereza: \"United Nations Assistance Mission for Rwanda\", UNAMIR) yari ubutumwa bw'Umuryango w\u2019Abibumye (Loni) bwo kubungabunga amahoro mu Rwanda, bwashyizweho ku ya 5 Ukwakira 1993 bukarangira ku ya 8 Werurwe 1996. Bwari bugamije gufasha mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry'amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha, yashyizweho umukono ku ya 4 Kanama 1993 hagati ya Leta y'u Rwanda na FPR-Inkotanyi.\nIngabo zabwo zari ziyobowe n'Umunyakanada Rom\u00e9o Dallaire. MINUAR ntiyashoboye gukumira cyangwa guhagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, kubera manda itarayemereraga gukoresha ingufu n'abasirikare bake yari ifite, nubwo yarokoye ibihumbi by'abantu bari bahungiye mu bigo byayo.\nIshingwa.\nAkanama ka Loni gashinzwe umutekano ku isi kashyizeho MINUAR mu cyemezo nimero 872 cyo ku ya 5 Ukwakira 1993, hashingiwe ku gice cya VI cy'Amasezerano shingiro ya Loni: ntiyari yemerewe gukoresha intwaro uretse mu kwirwanaho. Inshingano zayo zari izi: gufasha mu mutekano w'umujyi wa Kigali, gukurikirana iyubahirizwa ry'agahenge, gufasha mu gukura mu butaka ibisasu bitaturitse, gukurikirana itahuka ry'impunzi no guhuza ibikorwa by'ubutabazi.\nIntumwa yihariye y'Umunyamabanga mukuru wa Loni yari Umunyakameruni Jacques-Roger Booh-Booh, wasimbuwe muri Nyakanga 1994 na Shahryar Khan wo muri Pakisitani. Rom\u00e9o Dallaire yayoboye ingabo kugeza muri Kanama 1994, asimburwa n'Umunyakanada Guy Tousignant. Abasirikare bari bateganyijwe bari 2 500, ahanini baturutse mu Ububiligi, muri Bangaladeshi, muri Gana no muri Tunisiya.\nMbere ya jenoside.\nKu ya 11 Mutarama 1994, Dallaire yoherereje icyicaro cya Loni i New York ubutumwa buvuga ko umwe mu batoza b'Interahamwe yamumenyesheje ko hari intwaro zihishwe, ko hakozwe amalisiti y'Abatutsi, kandi ko hari umugambi wo kwica abasirikare b'Ababiligi. Dallaire yasabye uburenganzira bwo gufata izo ntwaro, ariko Ishami rya Loni rishinzwe ibikorwa byo kubungabunga amahoro rirabyanga, rivuga ko birenze manda ya MINUAR. Mu mezi yakurikiyeho umutekano wakomeje kuzamba; ku ya 5 Mata 1994, Akanama gashinzwe umutekano kongereye manda ya MINUAR kugeza ku ya 29 Nyakanga 1994.\nMu gihe cya jenoside.\nNyuma y'ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana ku ya 6 Mata 1994, Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi yaratangiye. Bukeye bwaho, Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana yarishwe, kimwe n'abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR bari bashinzwe kumurinda. Ku ya 11 Mata, abasirikare b'Ababiligi bari mu ishuri rya ETO i Kicukiro bararivuyemo, basiga abantu bagera ku 2 000 bari bahahungiye, bahita bicwa; muri bo harimo Boniface Ngulinzira.\nUbubiligi bwahise buvana abasirikare babwo muri MINUAR, maze ku ya 21 Mata 1994 Akanama gashinzwe umutekano kagabanya umubare w'abasirikare bayo ukagera kuri 270. Nubwo yari ifite ubushobozi buke, MINUAR yarinze ibihumbi by'abantu bari bahungiye kuri Stade Amahoro no mu bindi bigo bya Loni.\nKu ya 17 Gicurasi 1994, icyemezo 918 cyaguye manda ya MINUAR (yiswe MINUAR II) kandi cyemeza abasirikare bagera ku 5 500, ariko abasirikare bashya batangiye kugera muri Kamena, abenshi bagera jenoside yararangiye.\nNyuma ya jenoside.\nNyuma y'uko FPR-Inkotanyi ihagaritse jenoside muri Nyakanga 1994, MINUAR yakomeje gufasha mu kugarura umutekano no gufasha impunzi n'abavanywe mu byabo gutahuka. Manda yayo yongerewe inshuro nyinshi, kugeza ubwo, ku busabe bwa Leta y'u Rwanda, Akanama gashinzwe umutekano kemeje ko irangira burundu ku ya 8 Werurwe 1996. Abantu 27 bo muri MINUAR baguye muri ubwo butumwa.\nIsuzuma.\nRaporo ya komisiyo yigenga yakoze iperereza ku bikorwa bya Loni mu gihe cya jenoside (1999) yagaragaje ko MINUAR yari ifite abasirikare bake, ibikoresho bishaje na manda itajyanye n'ibihe, kandi ko ibihugu bigize Loni bitagaragaje ubushake bwo kuyiha ubushobozi. Iyo raporo yashimye ariko ubutwari bwa bamwe mu bagize MINUAR, by'umwihariko Jenerali Dallaire n'abasirikare bo muri Gana no muri Tunisiya bagumye mu Rwanda igihe cyose cya jenoside."}
{"id": "23455", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23455", "title": "Heliconia rostrata", "text": "Heliconia rostrata (mu Cyongereza \"hanging lobster claw\" cyangwa \"false bird of paradise\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Heliconiaceae\". Gikomoka mu mashyamba ashyuha y'imvura yo muri Amerika yo Hagati no mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Amerika y\u2019Epfo, kandi cyakwirakwiriye no mu tundi turere dushyuha tw'isi.\nNi ikimera cy'icyatsi kimara imyaka myinshi, gishobora kugera kuri metero 5 z'uburebure, gifite amababi manini asa n'ay'insina n'indabo zitukura n'umuhondo zimanuka zimanitse. Gihingwa cyane mu busitani bwo mu turere dushyuha kubera ubwiza bwacyo, kandi muri Boliviya ni kimwe mu ndabo z'ikirango cy'igihugu, aho cyitwa \"patuj\u00fa\".\nImiterere.\n\"Heliconia rostrata\" ni ikimera cy'icyatsi kimara imyaka myinshi, gishobora kugera kuri metero 5 z'uburebure. Amababi yacyo, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 60 kugeza kuri metero 1,2, asa n'ay'insina.\nMu gihe ubundi bwoko bwinshi bwa \"Heliconia\" (nka \"Heliconia bihai\") bufite indabo zimeze nk'izamuka, zifite ibibabi bimeze nk'ibikombe bibika amazi y'imvura akoreshwa n'inyoni n'udukoko, \"Heliconia rostrata\" yo ifite indabo zimanuka zimanitse, ibibabi byazo by'amabara bireba hasi, n'indabo nto zihishe munsi yabyo. Kubera ko ibyo bibabi bitabika amazi y'imvura, indabo zitanga umutobe (\"nectar\") utavanze n'amazi. Abazihinga bazi \"Heliconia\" nk'indabo zisurwa n'inyoni nyinshi, cyane cyane \"colibri\" (\"hummingbirds\").\nAho kiboneka.\n\"Heliconia rostrata\" ikomoka muri Amerika yo Hagati (Belize, Gwatemala, Hondurasi, El Salvador, Kosita Rika, Panama) no muri Amerika y\u2019Epfo (Kolombiya, Venezuwela, Ekwateri, Peru, Boliviya, Burezile). Iboneka cyane mu mashyamba ashyuha y'imvura, kuko ikunda ahantu hashyuha kandi hahehereye. Yakwirakwiriye kandi mu tundi turere dushyuha, nka Porto Riko no ku kirwa cya R\u00e9union mu Nyanja y'Abahinde.\nIkirango cya Boliviya.\nMuri Boliviya, \"Heliconia rostrata\" yitwa \"patuj\u00fa\" kandi ni imwe mu ndabo ebyiri z'ikirango cy'igihugu, hamwe na \"cantuta\" (\"Cantua buxifolia\").\nIhingwa.\n\"Heliconia rostrata\" ikunze guhingwa mu busitani no mu mbuga zo mu turere dushyuha kandi duhehereye. Ikenera ubushyuhe n'ubuhehere bwo mu kirere; ni byiza kuyibika ahantu hari ubushyuhe burenze dogere 18 \u00b0C. Ikenera ubutaka bukungahaye ku ifumbire, urugero nk'inombe nziza, kandi igomba kuvomererwa buri gihe n'amazi meza, igihe cyose ubutaka bwumye hejuru.\nAndi mazina y'ubumenyi.\nDukurikije \"World Checklist of Selected Plant Families\" (WCSP), \"Heliconia rostrata\" yanitwa:"}
{"id": "23458", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23458", "title": "Bougainvillea", "text": "Bougainvillea ni ubwoko (\"genre\") bw'ibihuru bifite amahwa byo mu muryango wa \"Nyctaginaceae\". Bikomoka mu mashyamba ashyuha y'imvura yo muri Amerika y\u2019Epfo, ariko ubu bihingwa hirya no hino ku isi nk'ibimera by'imitako, kugeza no mu turere dufite ubushyuhe buringaniye.\nIbyo abantu benshi bita indabo zabyo z'amabara meza si indabo nyirizina, ahubwo ni ibibabi byihariye (\"bract\u00e9es\") biri ku mitwe y'amashami; indabo nyazo ni nto, z'umweru, kandi zihishe hagati y'ibyo bibabi.\nAmateka y'izina.\nPhilibert Commerson n'umufasha we Jeanne Barret ni bo bahanga mu bimera ba mbere basobanuye kandi bita izina iki kimera, cyari cyatoraguwe muri Burezile mu rugendo rwo kuzenguruka isi rwayobowe n'umushakashatsi w'Umufaransa Louis Antoine de Bougainville.\nCommerson yacyise \"Buginvillaea\" mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro Bougainville; iyo nyandiko yaje gukosorwa iba \"Bougainvillea\". Jeanne Barret, umurimo we wose wari warahawe Commerson, yategereje umwaka wa 2012 kugira ngo izina rye ryibukwe binyuze ku kimera \"Solanum baretiae\".\nImiterere.\n\"Bougainvillea\" ni ibihuru bifite amahwa, byurira kandi bifite amabara meza (umutuku, iroza, isine, umuhondo, umweru\u2026). Ibice by'amabara bigaragara cyane si amababi y'indabo, ahubwo ni ibibabi byihariye (\"bract\u00e9es\") biri ku mitwe y'amashami. Indabo nyazo ni nto, z'umweru, kandi ziri hagati y'ibyo bibabi.\nIbi bimera bikomoka mu mashyamba ashyuha kandi ahehereye yo muri Amerika y\u2019Epfo, kandi bikoreshwa cyane nk'ibimera by'imitako kugeza no mu turere dufite ubushyuhe buringaniye. Hari amoko menshi yahinzwe (\"cultivars\") ameze nk'imigozi.\nAmoko.\nDukurikije \"The Plant List\" (2012), amwe mu moko ya \"Bougainvillea\" ni aya:"}
{"id": "23466", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23466", "title": "Agapanthus praecox", "text": "Agapanthus praecox (mu Gifaransa \"agapanthe\", mu Cyongereza \"African lily\" cyangwa \"lily of the Nile\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Amaryllidaceae\". Gikomoka muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, ariko ubu gihingwa cyane mu busitani hirya no hino ku isi nk'ikimera cy'imitako.\nNi ikimera cy'icyatsi kimara imyaka myinshi, gifite amababi maremare n'indabo z'ubururu, z'isine cyangwa z'umweru ziteranye ku mutwe w'uruti rurerure. Ibimera byinshi bya \"Agapanthus\" bihingwa ku isi bikomoka kuri ubu bwoko.\nImiterere.\n\"Agapanthus praecox\" ni ikimera cy'icyatsi gishobora kubaho imyaka igera kuri 75. Amababi yacyo afite ubugari bwa santimetero 2 n'uburebure bugera kuri santimetero 50. Uruti rwacyo rw'indabo rushobora kugera kuri metero 1 z'uburebure, kandi imizi yacyo irakomeye cyane ku buryo ishobora kumena sima.\nIndabo zacyo, z'ubururu, z'isine cyangwa z'umweru, ziteranye nk'umutaka (\"ombelle\"). Zikurikirwa n'udusanduku (\"capsules\") twuzuyemo imbuto nto z'umukara. Ibice byose by'iki kimera ni uburozi.\nAho kiboneka.\n\"Agapanthus praecox\" ikomoka mu ntara za Eastern Cape na KwaZulu-Natal muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo. Iwabo, izwi ku mazina nka \"agapant\", \"bloulelie\", \"isicakathi\" na \"ubani\".\nUbu ihingwa cyane mu busitani ku isi yose, cyane cyane mu turere dufite ikirere cyo mu karere ka Mediterane. Mu turere tumwe na tumwe nka Ositaraliya na Nuveli Zelande, yabaye ikimera cyigabiza kibangamira ibimera kavukire.\nAmoko mato.\n\"Agapanthus praecox\" igabanyijemo amoko mato (\"sous-esp\u00e8ces\") atatu:\nIhingwa.\n\"Agapanthus praecox\" ikunda ubutaka butareka amazi kandi bukungahaye, ariko yihanganira n'ubutaka bukennye. Ikunda izuba ryinshi, ariko ishobora no gukura ahari igicucu gito. Ntikunda kwimurwa.\nIshobora gutuburwa hakoreshejwe imbuto (ikarabya nyuma y'imyaka 3 kugeza kuri 4) cyangwa kugabanya ibishyitsi. Iyo imaze gufata neza, yihanganira izuba ryinshi n'amapfa, nubwo ari byiza kuyuhira igihe izuba rimaze igihe kirekire."}
{"id": "23467", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23467", "title": "Colette S\u00e9nami Agossou Houeto", "text": "Colette S\u00e9nami Agossou Houeto (6 Werurwe 1939 \u2013 29 Nzeri 2026) yari umwarimu, umusizi uharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore n'umunyapolitiki wo muri Bene.\nYabaye Minisitiri w'Amashuri Abanza n'Ayisumbuye muri guverinoma ya mbere ya Perezida Boni Yayi mu mwaka wa 2006.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nYavukiye i Porto-Novo, yiga amashuri yisumbuye i Cotonou, hanyuma akomereza amasomo ya kaminuza i Strasbourg mu Ubufaransa, i M\u00fcnchen mu Ubudage n'i Aix-en-Provence, mbere yo kuba umwarimu w'Ikidage. Kuva mu 1977 kugeza mu 1981 yayoboye Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe Amahugurwa n'Ubushakashatsi mu Uburezi (INFRE), nyuma akorera Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere (1986\u20131991) na UNICEF.\nKuva muri Mata kugeza muri Kanama 2006 yari minisitiri w'uburezi, naho kuva mu 2008 kugeza mu 2015 aba umuyobozi wungirije wa mbere w'umujyi wa Porto-Novo. Igitabo cye cy'imivugo \"L'Aube sur les cactus\" (1981) kirata urugamba rwo kurwanya ubukoloni kandi kigaharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore. Yitabye Imana ku wa 29 Nzeri 2026 afite imyaka 87."}
{"id": "23473", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23473", "title": "Spathodea campanulata", "text": "Spathodea campanulata (mu Gifaransa \"tulipier du Gabon\" cyangwa \"tulipier d'Afrique\", mu Cyongereza \"African tulip tree\") ni ubwoko bw'igiti kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Bignoniaceae\", gikomoka mu mashyamba ashyuha yo muri Afurika.\nKirangwa n'indabo nini z'umutuku zimeze nk'itulipe, kandi giterwa cyane mu turere dushyuha tw'isi nk'igiti cy'imitako n'icy'igicucu. Ariko kandi, aho cyajyanywe, cyabaye ikimera cyigabiza gikomeye: kiri ku rutonde rw'amoko 100 y'ibinyabuzima byigabiza bibangamiye isi kurusha ibindi.\nIzina.\n\"Spathodea campanulata\" yasobanuwe bwa mbere n'Umufaransa Ambroise Palisot de Beauvois mu gitabo cye \"Flore d'Oware et de B\u00e9nin, en Afrique\" (1805). Izina \"Spathodea\" rikomoka mu Kigereki, ryerekeza ku ishusho y'inkota y'igice cyo hasi cy'ururabo (\"calice\"), naho \"campanulata\" bisobanura mu Kilatini \u00abgisa n'inzogera nto\u00bb.\nImiterere.\n\"Spathodea campanulata\" ni igiti gishobora kugera kuri metero 10 kugeza kuri 35 z'uburebure, gifite umutwe w'amababi menshi kandi yijimye. Igihimba cyacyo gishobora kugira umurambararo wa santimetero 60. Igishishwa cyacyo kibanza kuba gisa n'ikijuju kandi kinyerera, hanyuma kigasaduka uko gisaza.\nAmababi yacyo agizwe n'udutabi 9 kugeza kuri 15, buri kamwe gafite uburebure bwa santimetero 7 kugeza kuri 16. Indabo zacyo ni nini, zifite ibara ry'umutuku ryerurutse inyuma n'umuhondo cyangwa icunga imbere, ziteranye ku mitwe y'amashami. Hari n'ubwoko bufite indabo z'umuhondo. Utubumbe tw'indabo tutarabumbuka tubamo amazi atukura.\nImbuto zacyo ni udusanduku tw'igiti dushinze, dufite uburebure bwa santimetero 15 kugeza kuri 27, twijimye. Iyo dufunguka, dusohora imbuto nyinshi nto, zifite amababa abonerana atuma zitwarwa n'umuyaga.\nAho kiboneka.\n\"Spathodea campanulata\" ikomoka mu mashyamba ashyuha yo muri Afurika, kuva muri Gineya kugera muri Angola ku nkombe y'iburengerazuba, ikagera mu majyepfo ya Sudani no muri Ubugande mu burasirazuba. Yajyanywe kandi mu turere twinshi dushyuha tw'isi, harimo Aziya, amajyepfo ya Afurika, Amerika na Oseyaniya.\nIkimera cyigabiza.\n\"Spathodea campanulata\" iri ku rutonde rw'amoko 100 y'ibinyabuzima byigabiza bibangamiye isi kurusha ibindi, rwakozwe n'Umuryango mpuzamahanga wo kubungabunga ibidukikije (UICN). Yakwirakwiriye cyane mu birwa byo mu nyanja ya Pasifika (Hawayi, Fiji, Nouvelle-Cal\u00e9donie\u2026), aho yigabiza imirima n'amashyamba. Ikwirakwira binyuze ku mbuto zayo zifite amababa zitwarwa n'umuyaga, ndetse no ku mizi yayo imeraho ibindi bimera, bigatuma kuyirandura bigorana. Ku kirwa cya R\u00e9union, kuva mu 2019 itegeko risaba ko irimburwa.\nImikoreshereze.\n\"Spathodea campanulata\" ikunzwe kubera indabo zayo nziza, kandi iterwa cyane ahantu rusange nk'igiti cy'imitako, icyo ku mihanda cyangwa icy'igicucu. Ariko kandi, ibiti byayo byoroshye kuvunika bishobora guteza akaga ku bahisi igihe cy'imiyaga n'inkubi. Imbuto zayo ziribwa mu turere tumwe na tumwe twa Afurika, kandi igishishwa cyayo, amababi n'indabo bikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo."}
{"id": "23477", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23477", "title": "Zantedeschia aethiopica", "text": "Zantedeschia aethiopica (mu Gifaransa \"arum blanc\" cyangwa \"calla\", mu Cyongereza \"calla lily\" cyangwa \"arum lily\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Araceae\", gikomoka muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo. Gikunze kumera ku nkombe z'imigezi no hafi y'ibidendezi.\nKirangwa n'ururabo runini rw'umweru rumeze nk'ingofero, ruzengurutse agati k'umuhondo, kandi gikoreshwa cyane mu gutaka kiliziya no mu ndabo z'abageni. Ibice byacyo bibisi ni uburozi iyo biriwe.\nIzina.\nIzina ry'ubwoko \"aethiopica\" ryerekeza kuri Etiyopiya mu buryo bwa kera, bisobanura Afurika muri rusange. Nubwo amazina yacyo asanzwe (\"calla\", \"arum\") yatuma umuntu atekereza ko ari mu bwoko bwa \"Calla\" cyangwa \"Arum\", si ko biri: ayo ni amazina atari yo nubwo akoreshwa cyane n'abacuruza indabo.\nImiterere.\n\"Zantedeschia aethiopica\" ni ikimera cy'icyatsi kimara imyaka myinshi, gifite igitsinsi (\"tubercule\"). Amababi yacyo ahora ari mabisi aho imvura n'ubushyuhe bihagije, ariko agahunguka mu turere twumutse. Gifite uburebure bwa metero 0,6 kugeza kuri 1, n'amababi manini y'icyatsi kibisi cyijimye ashobora kugera kuri santimetero 45 z'uburebure.\nIndabo zacyo ni nini, zikaboneka mu gihe cy'itumba, icy'izuba n'icy'umuhindo. Buri rurabo rugizwe n'ikibabi kinini cy'umweru (\"spathe\") gishobora kugera kuri santimetero 25, kizengurutse agati k'umuhondo (\"spadice\") gashobora kugera kuri milimetero 90. Ako gati gatanga impumuro nziza yoroheje.\nUburozi.\n\"Zantedeschia aethiopica\" irimo \"oxalate de calcium\". Kurya iki kimera kibisi bishobora gutera ububabare bukabije bwo kwokera no kubyimba iminwa, ururimi n'umuhogo, ndetse no kuribwa mu nda no gucibwamo.\nIhingwa.\nIki kimera gikenera amazi menshi kugira ngo gikure neza: gikunda ubutaka bw'ibishanga, kandi gishobora no kumera amaguru yacyo ari mu mazi agera kuri santimetero 30, ku buryo rimwe na rimwe gifatwa nk'ikimera cyo mu bidendezi. Mu butaka bwumutse, gikunze guhunguka amababi mu gihe cy'izuba.\nGitubururwa no kugabanya igitsinsi. Gishobora no guterwa hakoreshejwe imbuto, ariko ibimera bito bimara imyaka itatu mbere yo kurabya.\nImikoreshereze n'ikimenyetso.\nIndabo zacyo zikoreshwa cyane nk'indabo zaciwe, mu gutaka kiliziya no mu ndabo z'abageni mu bukwe.\nMuri Irilande, ku izina rya \u00abururabo rwa Pasika\u00bb (\"Easter Lily\"), iki kimera gikoreshwa n'abarepubulikani nk'ikimenyetso cyo kwibuka imyigaragambyo ya Pasika yo mu 1916."}
{"id": "23479", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23479", "title": "Jean Fourasti\u00e9", "text": "Jean Fourasti\u00e9 (15 Mata 1907 \u2013 25 Nyakanga 1990) yari umuhanga mu bukungu w'Umufaransa. Ni we wahimbye imvugo \"Les Trente Glorieuses\" (\"Imyaka mirongo itatu y'icyubahiro\"), isobanura igihe cy'iterambere Ubufaransa n'ibihugu byinshi bifite inganda byagize kuva Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose irangiye kugeza ku kibazo cya mbere cya peteroli (1947\u20131973).\nHamwe na Allan Fisher na Colin Clark, ni umwe mu bashyizeho igitekerezo cy'ibyiciro bitatu by'ubukungu, kivuga ko uko igihugu gitera imbere abakozi bacyo bagenda bava mu ubuhinzi no mu inganda bakajya muri serivisi.\nUbuzima.\nJean Fourasti\u00e9 yavukiye i Saint-Benin-d'Azy, mu ntara ya Ni\u00e8vre mu Bufaransa. Yize muri \u00c9cole centrale, hanyuma atsinda ikizamini cyo kuba umugenzuzi w'ibigo by'ubwishingizi wa Leta, yandika n'igitabo cy'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (doctorat) ku igenzura Leta ikora ku bigo by'ubwishingizi.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma y'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, Jean Monnet yamuzanye mu kigo cya Commissariat g\u00e9n\u00e9ral du Plan, cyateguraga isubirana ry'ubukungu bw'Ubufaransa, ahayobora komisiyo yita ku bakozi. Yabaye umwarimu muri Conservatoire national des arts et m\u00e9tiers (CNAM) i Paris n'umuyobozi w'amasomo muri \u00c9cole pratique des hautes \u00e9tudes, anigisha muri \u00c9cole nationale d'administration no muri Institut d'\u00e9tudes politiques. Yanditse kandi mu kinyamakuru \"Le Figaro\", atorerwa kuba umunyamuryango wa Acad\u00e9mie des sciences morales et politiques. Yapfiriye i Douelle, mu ntara ya Lot, mu 1990.\nIbitekerezo.\nMu gitabo \"Le Grand Espoir du XXe si\u00e8cle\" (1949), ashingiye ku ubushakashatsi bwa Colin Clark, yagaragaje ko iterambere ry'ubukungu risaba ko abakozi bimuka hagati y'ibyiciro bitatu by'ubukungu. Mu myaka ya 1950 yashyigikiye politiki yo kongera umusaruro w'umurimo, avuga ko hazaza \u00abumuco wa serivisi ushingiye ku muntu\u00bb.\nMu 1979 yasohoye igitabo \"Les Trente Glorieuses, ou la r\u00e9volution invisible de 1946 \u00e0 1975\"; iyo mvugo yabaye iy'ibisanzwe mu Gifaransa."}
{"id": "23483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23483", "title": "Jacaranda mimosifolia", "text": "Jacaranda mimosifolia (mu Gifaransa \"flamboyant bleu\" cyangwa \"jacaranda\", mu Cyongereza \"blue jacaranda\") ni ubwoko bw'igiti kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Bignoniaceae\", gikomoka muri Boliviya, Arijantine na Paragwe, muri Amerika y'Amajyepfo.\nKizwi cyane kubera indabo zacyo z'ibara ry'isine (\"violet\") zitwikira igiti cyose, kandi giterwa mu mijyi myinshi yo ku isi nk'igiti cy'imitako n'icy'igicucu ku mihanda.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere n'umuhanga mu bimera w'Umwongereza David Don mu 1822, mu gitabo \"Botanical Register\". Mu bitabo bya kera bwitwaga kandi \"Jacaranda acutifolia\".\nImiterere.\n\"Jacaranda mimosifolia\" ni igiti gikunze kugera kuri metero 8 kugeza kuri 12 z'uburebure, gifite umutwe mugari. Igishishwa cyacyo ni ikigina kandi kiroroshye iyo kikiri gito, nyuma kikagenda kiba igikakaye.\nAmababi yacyo ni maremare (santimetero 23 kugeza kuri 45), agizwe n'utubabi duto twinshi cyane, kandi aragwa mu gihe runaka cy'umwaka. Indabo zacyo z'isine, zimeze nk'impanda kandi zihumura gake, ziri mu matsinda manini ya santimetero 30 kugeza kuri 45. Urubuto rwacyo ni igishishwa gikomeye kimeze nk'isahani, gifite santimetero hafi 7.\nAho kiboneka.\nIgiti gikomoka muri Boliviya no mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Arijantine. Cyajyanywe mu bihugu byinshi bishyuha cyangwa bitagira ubukonje bukabije, nko muri Espanye, Megizike, Ositaraliya, Afurika y'Epfo n'ahandi.\nMuri Afurika y'Epfo, cyahageze mu kinyejana cya 19 kandi kibaye ikimenyetso cy'impeshyi mu mijyi ya Pretoria na Johannesburg; ariko gifatwa nk'ikimera cyigabiza kuko gishobora gukura nta muntu ukitayeho.\nImikoreshereze.\nGiterwa cyane ku mihanda, mu busitani no mu mbuga nk'igiti cy'imitako n'icy'igicucu. Ntigikwiriye guterwa hafi ya pisine kuko kigusha amababi n'indabo byinshi.\nMu Rwanda no mu buvanganzo.\nUmuhanzi n'umwanditsi Ga\u00ebl Faye yise igitabo cye \"Jacaranda\" (Grasset, 2024), kivuga ku kwiyubaka k'u Rwanda nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, cyahawe igihembo cya Renaudot mu 2024. Avuga ko icyo giti cyazanywe n'abakoloni kivuye muri Amerika y'Amajyepfo kigaterwa ku mihanda, kandi akagikoresha nk'ikimenyetso cy'\u00abimiterere y'ahantu h'abazima\u00bb, ahagereranya n'impinduka zihuse z'umujyi wa Kigali aho ibiti bitemwa kugira ngo hubakwe imihanda n'inyubako nshya."}
{"id": "23484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23484", "title": "Strelitzia reginae", "text": "Strelitzia reginae (mu Gifaransa \"oiseau de paradis\", mu Cyongereza \"bird of paradise\" cyangwa \"crane flower\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Strelitziaceae\", gikomoka muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo.\nNi ikimera cy'icyatsi gihora gifite amababi, kizwi cyane kubera indabo zacyo z'icunga n'ubururu zimeze nk'umutwe w'inyoni. Gihingwa cyane ku isi yose nk'ikimera cy'imitako mu busitani no mu nzu, kandi indabo zacyo zigurishwa n'abacuruza indabo.\nIzina.\n\"Strelitzia reginae\" yasobanuwe n'Umwongereza Joseph Banks mu 1788. Izina \"reginae\" risobanura \u00abcy'umwamikazi\u00bb mu Kilatini, rikaba ryibutsa umwamikazi w'Ubwongereza Charlotte wa Mecklembourg-Strelitz. Iwabo, mu ndimi z'Abanguni, cyitwa \"isigude\".\nIzina \"bird of paradise\" (\u00abinyoni yo mu ijuru\u00bb) rituruka ku buryo ururabo rufunguye rusa n'inyoni zitwa \"oiseaux de paradis\", naho \"crane flower\" rigereranya ururabo n'umutwe n'umunwa by'umusambi.\nImiterere.\n\"Strelitzia reginae\" ishobora kugera kuri metero 2 z'uburebure. Amababi yayo manini kandi akomeye, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 25 kugeza kuri 70 n'ubugari bwa santimetero 10 kugeza kuri 30, ari ku mitsi ishobora kugera kuri metero 1. Ahora ari mabisi kandi ateye nk'umufana.\nIndabo ziri hejuru y'amababi, ku mitwe y'imitsi miremire. Zisohoka mu gisanduku gikomeye kimeze nk'umunwa w'inyoni (\"spathe\"), giteye ku buryo gisa n'umutwe w'inyoni; ni na cyo inyoni nto zinywa umutobe w'indabo (\"souimangas\") zihagararaho iyo zije kuzibangurira. Buri rurabo rugizwe n'ibibabi bitatu by'icunga n'ibindi bitatu by'ubururu cyangwa umweru. Iyo inyoni ihagaze ku rurabo inywa umutobe, ururabo rurafunguka maze amaguru yayo agasigwa ibyangurira (\"pollen\").\nIhingwa.\n\"Strelitzia reginae\" ni ikimera cy'imitako gikunzwe cyane. Cyageze bwa mbere mu Bwongereza mu 1773, gihingwa mu busitani bw'ibimera bwa Kew, maze kikwirakwira ku isi yose, harimo Amerika na Ositaraliya, ahantu hose hari izuba n'ubushyuhe. Ni ururabo rw'ikimenyetso rw'umujyi wa Los Angeles muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika.\nGikunda ubutaka bukungahaye ku ifumbire n'ahantu hari izuba cyangwa igicucu gito. Ntikihanganira ubukonje bukabije: mu turere dukonje gihingwa mu nzu cyangwa mu nzu z'ibirahure."}
{"id": "23485", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23485", "title": "Amoko mu Rwanda", "text": "Amoko mu Rwanda bivuga amatsinda atatu y'abantu yakunze kuvugwa mu Rwanda: Abahutu, Abatutsi na Abatwa. Bose bavuga ururimi rumwe, Ikinyarwanda, kandi basangiye umuco n'imyemerere.\nInkomoko n'imiterere y'aya matsinda ni ingingo itavugwaho rumwe n'abahanga mu mateka. Mu gihe cy'ubukoloni, Ababiligi bayagize ibyiciro bidahinduka byanditswe mu ndangamuntu, ibyo bigira uruhare mu macakubiri yagejeje kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nMbere y'ubukoloni.\nAbakurambere b'Abahutu n'Abatutsi batuye muri aka karere mu gihe cy'imyaka igera ku bihumbi bibiri, basangira ururimi, imyemerere, umuco n'intwari. Abenshi bari abahinzi, naho aborozi b'inka babanaga na bo. Mbere, ijambo \u00abUmututsi\u00bb ryavugaga umuntu ukize ku nka, naho \u00abUmuhutu\u00bb rikavuga umugaragu cyangwa umuntu uri munsi y'undi; buhoro buhoro \u00abAbatutsi\u00bb ryaje kuvuga abategetsi, \u00abAbahutu\u00bb rivuga rubanda.\nImbibi hagati y'Abahutu n'Abatutsi ntizari zidahinduka, kandi bamwe mu Bahutu bari mu butegetsi. Abatwa, bari hafi 1 % by'abaturage, bari abahigi n'abatoragura mu mashyamba.\nInkomoko itavugwaho rumwe.\nAbahanga bamwe bavuga ko amatsinda atatu yaje mu Rwanda mu bihe bitandukanye: mbere Abatwa, hakurikiraho Abahutu, hanyuma Abatutsi baturutse mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba mu kinyejana cya 14 cyangwa cya 15. Abandi bemeza ko ayo matsinda yatandukanye buhoro buhoro mu gihugu, bitewe n'imibereho n'ubukungu.\nMu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, Abanyaburayi bakwirakwije \u00abigitekerezo cy'Abahami\u00bb (\"Hamitic hypothesis\"), cyavugaga ko Abatutsi ari ubwoko bwisumbuye bwaturutse mu majyaruguru ya Afurika. Kuva mu myaka ya 1960, abahanga mu mateka bagaragaje ko iyo nkuru yari ishingiye ku bitekerezo by'Abanyaburayi kurusha amateka nyayo y'u Rwanda.\nUbukoloni n'indangamuntu.\nKu butegetsi bw'Ababiligi, imyanya y'ubutegetsi n'amashuri makuru byahawe ahanini Abatutsi, ibyo byongera urwango hagati y'amatsinda. Mu myaka ya 1930, Ababiligi banditse ubwoko bwa buri Munyarwanda mu ndangamuntu: hafi 84 % Abahutu, 15 % Abatutsi na 1 % Abatwa. Iryo yandikwa ryatumye ibyiciro bidahinduka.\nNyuma ya revolisiyo yo mu 1959\u20131961, ubutegetsi bwa repubulika bwakomeje gukoresha iyo ndangamuntu mu guheza Abatutsi mu kazi no mu mashuri.\nNyuma ya jenoside.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, ubwoko bwavanywe mu ndangamuntu. Mu 2013, Komisiyo y'Igihugu y'Ubumwe n'Ubwiyunge yatangije gahunda ya \u00abNdi Umunyarwanda\u00bb, naho itegeko n\u00b0 59/2018 ryo ku wa 22 Kanama 2018 rihana icyaha cy'ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside n'ibyaha bifitanye isano na cyo."}
{"id": "23487", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23487", "title": "Delonix regia", "text": "Delonix regia (mu Gifaransa \"flamboyant\", mu Cyongereza \"flame tree\" cyangwa \"royal poinciana\") ni ubwoko bw'igiti kirabya cyo mu muryango w'ibishyimbo (\"Fabaceae\"), gikomoka muri Madagasikari.\nKizwi cyane kubera indabo zacyo nyinshi z'umutuku cyangwa icunga n'amababi yacyo ameze nk'aya \"foug\u00e8re\". Giterwa hose mu turere dushyuha tw'isi nk'igiti cy'imitako n'icy'igicucu ku mihanda no ku bibuga rusange.\nIzina.\nIzina ry'ubwoko \"Delonix\" rikomoka mu Kigereki \"delos\" (\u00abbigaragara\u00bb) na \"onux\" (\u00aburwara\u00bb), kubera ko amababi y'indabo zacyo afite agati karekare; naho \"regia\" bisobanura \u00abcy'umwami\u00bb mu Kilatini, rikaba ryerekana ubwiza bw'indabo zacyo.\nImiterere.\n\"Delonix regia\" ni igiti gisanzwe gifite uburebure bwa metero 5 kugeza kuri 8, ariko gishobora kurenga metero 15. Igihimba cyacyo kiba kinyerera kandi gisa n'ikijuju iyo kikiri gito. Umutwe wacyo umeze nk'umutaka, ufite amashami manini n'amababi agabanyijemo uduce duto twinshi, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 30 kugeza kuri 50.\nIndabo zacyo zifite amababi ane y'umutuku agera kuri santimetero 8, n'irya gatanu rinini rihagaze hagati, rifite imirongo y'umweru cyangwa y'umuhondo. Kirabya cyane ku mpera z'igihe cy'izuba. Imbuto zacyo ni imiteja minini ifite uburebure bwa santimetero 40 kugeza kuri 60 n'ubugari bwa santimetero 5, buri wose urimo imbuto nka cumi.\nAho kiboneka.\nNubwo cyari kimaze ibinyejana byinshi gihingwa hirya no hino, aho cyakomotse ntihari hazwi neza kugeza mu 1932, ubwo umuhanga J. Leandri yavumburaga ibiti byacyo byimereye mu gasozi ku nkombe y'iburengerazuba bwa Madagasikari. Ubu giterwa mu turere twose dushyuha tw'isi, harimo Afurika, Aziya, Amerika n'amajyaruguru ya Ositaraliya.\nImikoreshereze.\n\"Delonix regia\" yakoreshejwe nk'igiti gitanga igicucu mu mirima y'icyayi no mu nzuri, ku mihanda no ku bibuga rusange. Indabo zacyo zitanga umutobe ukoreshwa n'inzuki mu gukora ubuki. Igiti cyacyo cyoroshye gikoreshwa mu kubaka ibintu byoroheje nk'ubwato, nubwo cyangizwa n'imiswa; kenshi gikoreshwa nk'inkwi, kimwe n'imiteja yacyo."}
{"id": "23490", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23490", "title": "Uruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri jenoside y'Abatutsi mu Rwanda", "text": "Uruhare rw'Ubufaransa muri jenoside y'Abatutsi mu Rwanda ni ingingo ivugwaho impaka ku bijyanye n'ibyo Ubufaransa bwakoze mbere no mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ubufaransa bwashyigikiye ubutegetsi bwa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana mu bya gisirikare no mu bubanyi n'amahanga mu ntambara bwarwanaga na FPR-Inkotanyi.\nMu 2021, raporo ya komisiyo y'abahanga mu mateka iyobowe na Vincent Duclert yagaragaje \u00abinshingano ziremereye kandi zikomeye\u00bb z'abategetsi b'Abafaransa, naho raporo yasabwe na guverinoma y'u Rwanda ivuga ko Ubufaransa bwafashije ko jenoside yashoboraga guteganywa iba. Muri uwo mwaka, Perezida Emmanuel Macron yaje i Kigali kwemera izo nshingano.\nMbere ya jenoside.\nMbere ya jenoside, abategetsi b'Abafaransa bahaye ubutegetsi bwa Habyarimana intwaro, bahugura ingabo zabwo kandi barabukingira, nubwo ubwo butegetsi bwatesheshaga agaciro Abatutsi. Ubwo bufatanye bwa gisirikare bwanyuze mu bikorwa nka Igikorwa cya Noro\u00eet.\nMu gihe cya jenoside.\nNk'uko raporo yasabwe na guverinoma y'u Rwanda ibivuga, Ubufaransa \u00abnta cyo bwakoze\u00bb ngo buhagarike ubwicanyi muri Mata na Gicurasi 1994.\nKu wa 22 Kamena 1994, Akanama ka Loni gashinzwe umutekano kemeje icyemezo 929 cyemerera Ubufaransa gukora igikorwa cya gisirikare cyiswe \"Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\", cyayobowe na Jenerali Jean-Claude Lafourcade. Raporo y'u Rwanda ivuga ko icyo gikorwa cyaje gikerewe ngo kirokore Abatutsi benshi.\nNk'uko imiryango FIDH, LDH na Survie ibivuga, mu misozi ya Bisesero, aho Abatutsi babarirwa mu bihumbi bishwe hagati ya Mata na Nyakanga 1994, ingabo z'Abafaransa zari hafi zamenye amakuru ku wa 27 Kamena, ariko ubwicanyi bukomeza kugeza ku wa 30 Kamena ubwo zageraga ku barokotse. Iyo miryango yaregeye inkiko z'Ubufaransa ku cyaha cyo gufatanya na jenoside.\nRaporo n'ijambo rya Macron.\nKu wa 26 Werurwe 2021, komisiyo y'abahanga mu mateka yashyizweho na Perezida Emmanuel Macron, iyobowe na Vincent Duclert, yamushyikirije raporo yayo. Yanzuye ko Ubufaransa bufite \u00abinshingano ziremereye kandi zikomeye\u00bb (\"responsabilit\u00e9s lourdes et accablantes\"), inenga \u00abubuhumyi\u00bb bwa Perezida Fran\u00e7ois Mitterrand n'abari bamukikije, ariko ntiyemeza ko Ubufaransa bwafatanyije n'abakoze jenoside.\nKu wa 19 Mata 2021, guverinoma y'u Rwanda yashyize ahagaragara raporo y'impapuro 600 yakozwe n'ikigo cy'abanyamategeko cyo muri Amerika, Levy Firestone Muse. Yanzuye ko Ubufaransa bufite uruhare rukomeye mu gufasha ko \u00abjenoside yashoboraga guteganywa\u00bb iba, ko nyuma bwahishe uruhare rwabwo kandi bukingira abakoze ibyaha, ariko ko nta kimenyetso cyerekana ko Abafaransa bagize uruhare rutaziguye mu bwicanyi.\nKu wa 27 Gicurasi 2021, i Kigali, Macron yavuze ati \u00abnaje kwemera inshingano zacu\u00bb (\"je viens reconna\u00eetre nos responsabilit\u00e9s\"), ariko ntiyasaba imbabazi, kandi yongera kuvuga ko Ubufaransa butafatanyije n'abakoze jenoside."}
{"id": "23491", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23491", "title": "Canna indica", "text": "Canna indica (mu Gifaransa \"canna\" cyangwa \"balisier\", mu Cyongereza \"Indian shot\" cyangwa \"edible canna\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Cannaceae\", gikomoka muri Amerika ishyuha.\nNi ikimera cy'icyatsi kimara imyaka myinshi, gifite amababi manini asa n'ay'insina n'indabo z'umutuku cyangwa umuhondo. Gihingwa ku isi yose nk'ikimera cy'imitako, kandi muri Amerika y'Epfo gihingirwa ibitsinsi byacyo biribwa, bikungahaye ku binyamafufu.\nAho kiboneka.\n\"Canna indica\" ikomoka muri Amerika ishyuha, cyane cyane mu birwa bya Karayibe, kandi yakwirakwiriye mu turere twose dushyuha tw'isi, aho ikunze kwimerera ubwayo. Abacukumbuzi b'amateka basanze yarahingwaga muri Peru mu myaka 4 500 ishize.\nImiterere.\n\"Canna indica\" ishobora kugira uburebure bwa metero 0,5 kugeza kuri 2,5 bitewe n'ubwoko. Ifite igitsinsi kigabanyije amashami gishobora kugera kuri santimetero 60 z'uburebure. Amababi yayo manini, y'icyatsi cyangwa y'isine, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 30 kugeza kuri 60 n'ubugari bwa santimetero 10 kugeza kuri 25.\nIndabo zayo ni nto ugereranyije n'iz'ubwoko bwahinzwe, zikaba z'umutuku cyangwa umuhondo. Imbuto zayo ni udusanduku turimo utubuto duto tw'umukara, dukomeye kandi tuzengurutse.\nImikoreshereze.\nMuri Amerika y'Epfo, \"Canna indica\" (yitwa \"achira\") ihingirwa ibitsinsi byayo biribwa, bishobora gutekwa cyangwa kuribwa ari bibisi, kandi bikurwamo amidoni (\"amidon\"). Mu Burayi no mu bindi bihugu ikoreshwa cyane cyane nk'ikimera cy'imitako mu busitani.\nAmababi yayo akoreshwa mu gupfunyika ibiryo, naho utubuto twayo dukomeye dukoreshwa mu gukora amasaro n'ibikoresho by'umuziki nka \"maracas\" cyangwa \"kayamb\" (ku kirwa cya R\u00e9union)."}
{"id": "23496", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23496", "title": "Hibiscus rosa-sinensis", "text": "Hibiscus rosa-sinensis (mu Gifaransa \"hibiscus\" cyangwa \"rose de Chine\", mu Cyongereza \"Chinese hibiscus\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Malvaceae\", giterwa ku isi hose mu turere dushyuha kubera indabo zacyo nini z'amabara menshi.\nNi ururabo rw'igihugu cya Maleziya. Buri rurabo rumara umunsi umwe gusa, ariko igihuru kirabya kenshi.\nIzina n'inkomoko.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere na Carl Linnaeus mu gitabo \"Species Plantarum\" (1753). Inkomoko yacyo nyayo ntiramenyekana neza: \"Plants of the World Online\" ivuga ko ari ikimera cyahinzwe gikomoka ku mvange z'amoko yo mu birwa byo mu majyepfo y'inyanja ya Pasifika, naho izindi nkomoko zivuga ko gikomoka muri Aziya.\nImiterere.\n\"Hibiscus rosa-sinensis\" ni igihuru gishobora kugera kuri metero 1,2 kugeza kuri 3 z'uburebure. Amababi yacyo ni icyatsi kibisi cyijimye, arabagirana kandi ntagwa, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 7 kugeza kuri 15 n'impande zifite amenyo.\nIndabo zacyo zishobora kugira diyametero ya santimetero 5 kugeza kuri 25, zikagira amabara menshi: umweru, umuhondo, oranje, iroza, umutuku cyangwa isine. Buri rurabo rumara umunsi umwe, ariko igihuru gikomeza kurabya igihe kirekire.\nAho kiboneka n'imikoreshereze.\nGiterwa mu turere twinshi dushyuha two ku isi, harimo ibihugu byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba nka Kenya, Tanzaniya na Uganda, ndetse no muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nGiterwa cyane nk'igihuru cy'imitako mu busitani, ku nkengero z'inzu cyangwa nk'uruzitiro. Gikoreshwa kandi mu buvuzi, mu biribwa no mu kugaburira amatungo."}
{"id": "23500", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23500", "title": "Bahutu Manifesto", "text": "Bahutu Manifesto (mu Gifaransa \"Manifeste des Bahutu\") ni inyandiko yanditswe ku wa 24 Werurwe 1957 n'abize b'Abahutu icyenda, barimo Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda, yamagana ubusumbane hagati y'Abahutu n'Abatutsi ku butegetsi bw'Ababiligi.\nIyo nyandiko yagize uruhare runini mu ishingwa ry'imitwe ya politiki y'Abahutu no mu bikorwa byo mu 1959 byakuyeho ingoma ya cyami, kandi yongereye amacakubiri yagejeje kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nAmateka.\nMu 1957, igihe Inama nkuru y'igihugu yasabaga ko ubutegetsi bwahabwa Abanyarwanda vuba, itsinda ry'abayobozi b'Abahutu ryabonaga ko ibyo byari gukomeza ubutegetsi bw'Abatutsi. Ku wa 24 Werurwe 1957, i Kabgayi, Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda, Calliope Mulindahabi na Aloys Munyangaju n'abandi bashyize ahagaragara iyo nyandiko.\nUmutwe wayo wuzuye wari \"Note sur l'aspect social du probl\u00e8me racial indig\u00e8ne au Rwanda\" (\u00abInyandiko ku bijyanye n'imibereho y'ikibazo cy'amoko kavukire mu Rwanda\u00bb), ikaba yari igenewe Guverineri wa Ruanda-Urundi.\nIbikubiyemo.\nIyo nyandiko yavugaga ko ikibazo nyamukuru cy'u Rwanda ari uko ubutegetsi, ubukungu n'imibereho byari byihariwe n'Abatutsi, kandi yashinjaga ubutegetsi bwa gikoloni bwakoreraga mu bami b'Abatutsi (\"indirect rule\"). Yasabaga ubumwe bw'Abahutu mu bya politiki.\nIngaruka.\nMu 1959, abayobozi ba politiki b'Abahutu, bafashijwe n'Ababiligi, bakuyeho ingoma ya cyami y'Abatutsi; Abatutsi ibihumbi bishwe, abagera ku 130.000 bahungira mu bihugu bituranye n'u Rwanda. U Rwanda rwabonye ubwigenge ku wa 1 Nyakanga 1962. Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda yabaye Perezida wa mbere wa Repubulika, ayoboye ishyaka Parmehutu."}
{"id": "23501", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23501", "title": "Euphorbia pulcherrima", "text": "Euphorbia pulcherrima (izwi cyane ku izina rya \"poinsettia\"; mu Gifaransa \"\u00e9toile de No\u00ebl\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru cyo mu muryango wa \"Euphorbiaceae\", gikomoka muri Amerika yo Hagati no mu majyepfo ya Megizike.\nKizwi cyane kubera ibibabi byacyo by'umutuku werurutse bisa n'indabo, kandi kigurishwa cyane nk'ikimera cy'imitako mu gihe cya Noheli mu majyaruguru y'isi. Gifite amazi asa n'amata ashobora gutera indwara z'uruhu.\nIzina.\nIzina ryacyo rya kera \"Poinsettia\" rikomoka ku izina rya Joel Roberts Poinsett, ambasaderi wa mbere wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika muri Megizike. Mu Gifaransa cyitwa \u00abinyenyeri ya Noheli\u00bb (\"\u00e9toile de No\u00ebl\"), kuko ibibabi byacyo by'amabara biteye nk'inyenyeri kandi kigurishwa cyane mu gihe cya Noheli.\nImiterere.\nAho gikomoka, \"Euphorbia pulcherrima\" ni igihuru gishobora kugera kuri metero 4 kugeza kuri 5 z'uburebure. Amababi yacyo ni ay'icyatsi kibisi cyijimye, afite umutsi muremure n'imitsi igaragara.\nIbibabi byo hejuru (\"bract\u00e9es\") bifata ibara ry'umutuku werurutse (cyangwa andi mabara ku moko yahinzwe), bigakora nk'amababi y'indabo. Indabo nyazo ni nto, zitanga umutobe, kandi ziteranye hagati y'ibyo bibabi.\nUburozi.\nKimwe n'ibindi bimera byo mu bwoko bwa \"Euphorbia\", iki kimera gifite amazi asa n'amata (\"latex\") mu bice byacyo byose. Kizwi n'abahinzi n'abacuruza indabo kubera indwara z'uruhu gishobora gutera. Abantu bafite ubwivumbure ku \"latex\" bashobora no kugira ubwivumbure kuri iki kimera."}
{"id": "23503", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23503", "title": "Tecoma stans", "text": "Tecoma stans (mu Gifaransa \"trompette d'or\", mu Cyongereza \"yellow bells\" cyangwa \"yellow trumpetbush\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Bignoniaceae\", gikomoka muri Amerika ishyuha.\nGihingwa cyane nk'ikimera cy'imitako kubera indabo zacyo z'umuhondo zimeze nk'impanda, ariko mu turere twinshi tw'isi cyabaye ikimera cyigabiza gikomeye.\nImiterere.\n\"Tecoma stans\" ni igihuru gifite uburebure bwa metero 1 kugeza kuri 8. Amababi yacyo agizwe n'udutabi 3 kugeza kuri 6 tw'impande ebyiri, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 10 kugeza kuri 25.\nIndabo zacyo z'umuhondo werurutse zimeze nk'impanda, ziteranye ku mitwe y'amashami. Imbuto zacyo ni imiteja miremire imanitse; iyo ifunguka isohora imbuto nyinshi zifite amababa zitwarwa n'umuyaga.\nAho kiboneka.\n\"Tecoma stans\" ikomoka mu turere dushyuha twa Amerika, kuva mu majyepfo ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika (Texas, Arizona, Nouveau-Mexique) no muri Megizike kugeza muri Amerika y'Epfo. Ikunda uturere twumutse kandi turimo izuba, cyane cyane ku nkengero z'imihanda.\nIkimera cyigabiza.\nKubera ko yajyanywe ahantu henshi ku isi kubera ubwiza bwayo, \"Tecoma stans\" ubu ifatwa nk'ikimera cyigabiza muri Afurika (cyane cyane muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo), muri Amerika y'Epfo, muri Aziya, muri Ositaraliya no mu birwa bya Pasifika. Ikwirakwira binyuze ku mbuto zayo zitwarwa n'umuyaga no ku mishibuka imera ku gishyitsi.\nMuri Nouvelle-Cal\u00e9donie, aho bivugwa ko yageze mu 1904, yabaye ikibazo gikomeye ku buryo itegeko ribuza kuyitera, kuyitwara cyangwa kuyigurisha."}
{"id": "23510", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23510", "title": "Callistemon", "text": "Callistemon ni ubwoko (\"genre\") bw'ibihuru byo mu muryango wa \"Myrtaceae\", bikomoka muri Ositaraliya. Mu Gifaransa byitwa \"rince-bouteille\", mu Cyongereza \"bottlebrush\", kubera ko indabo zabyo zimeze nk'uburoso bwo koza amacupa.\nBihingwa hirya no hino ku isi nk'ibimera by'imitako mu busitani no ku mihanda. Abahanga bamwe ubu babishyira mu bwoko bwa \"Melaleuca\".\nIzina.\nIzina \"Callistemon\" rikomoka mu Kigereki \"kallos\" (\u00abubwiza\u00bb) na \"stemon\" (\u00abigice cy'ururabo gitanga ibyangurira\u00bb, \"\u00e9tamine\"), kubera \"\u00e9tamines\" ndende z'amabara zigize indabo zabyo. Ubu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere n'Umwongereza Robert Brown mu 1814.\nImiterere.\n\"Callistemon\" ni ibihuru cyangwa ibiti bito. Indabo zabyo ziteranye ku mashami zimeze nk'uburoso burebure, kandi ibara ryazo (akenshi umutuku) riterwa na \"\u00e9tamines\" ndende. Imbuto zabyo ni udusanduku duto dukomeye tuguma ku mashami imyaka myinshi.\nAho biboneka.\nUbwoko bwose bwa \"Callistemon\" bukomoka muri Ositaraliya, ariko buhingwa ahantu henshi ku isi kandi bwimereye ubwabwo ahantu hamwe na hamwe. Biboneka cyane cyane mu turere dufite ubushyuhe buringaniye bwa Ositaraliya, cyane cyane ku nkombe y'iburasirazuba, kandi amoko amwe aboneka no muri Nouvelle-Cal\u00e9donie. Amoko amwe yihanganira amapfa."}
{"id": "23512", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23512", "title": "Inshingano y'abinjira n'abasohoka muri Banyarwanda", "text": "Inshingano y'abinjira n'abasohoka muri Banyarwanda (mu Gifaransa \"Mission d'immigration des Banyarwanda\", MIB) yari gahunda y'ubutegetsi bwa gikoloni bw'Ababiligi yimuriye Abanyarwanda benshi muri Kongo Mbiligi, cyane cyane mu karere ka Masisi, muri Kivu y'Amajyaruguru y'ubu.\nIyo gahunda, yatangiye mu 1937, yari igamije kubona abakozi b'amasambu manini n'ibirombe. Ifatwa nk'imwe mu nkomoko z'amakimbirane y'ubutaka n'ay'ubwenegihugu akigaragara mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nAmateka.\nNyuma y'uko Umuryango w'Ibihugu (\"Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 des Nations\") uhaye Ububiligi u Rwanda n'u Burundi mu 1922, abategetsi b'Ababiligi bimuye abantu babarirwa mu bihumbi bavuye muri utwo turere twari dutuwe cyane, babajyana mu masambu yo muri Kivu y'Amajyaruguru y'ubu.\nIyo gahunda yatangiye ahagana mu 1937, ijyana Abanyarwanda i Masisi kugira ngo bakore mu masambu y'abakoloni; izina \u00abMIB\u00bb ryatangiye gukoreshwa mu cyiciro cyayo cya kabiri. Abanyarwanda barenga 25.000 bimuriwe i Masisi hagati ya 1937 na 1945, abandi bagera ku 60.000 bahagera hagati ya 1949 na 1955. Umuhanga mu mateka Gillian Mathys agaragaza ko benshi muri bo bari abimukira babishaka, bakoresheje izo politiki za gikoloni mu nyungu zabo.\nIngaruka.\nAbanyarwanda baje kuba hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abaturage ba Kivu y'Amajyaruguru. Ukwimuka kwabo kwongereye ihangana ku butaka: abatware b'Abahunde ntibishimiye ko abimukira bahabwa ubutaka, akenshi bwakoreshwaga mu guhiga.\nIkibazo cy'ubwenegihugu bw'Abanyarwanda bo muri Kongo cyakomeje guhindagurika mu mategeko: kuva ku Itegeko Nshinga rya 1964, amategeko ya 1971\u20131972, itegeko ryo mu 1981 ryabikomeje, kugeza ku itegeko ryo mu 2004 n'Itegeko Nshinga ryo mu 2006. Ibihumbi amagana by'Abanyarwanda bagombye kuba Abanyekongo baracyagorwa no kubyemererwa."}
{"id": "23513", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23513", "title": "Nerium oleander", "text": "Nerium oleander (mu Gifaransa \"laurier-rose\", mu Cyongereza \"oleander\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru cyangwa igiti gito kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Apocynaceae\", gikomoka mu karere ka Mediterane kugeza muri Aziya.\nGiterwa cyane ku isi hose nk'igihuru cy'imitako kubera indabo zacyo z'iroza, umweru cyangwa umutuku. Ibice byacyo byose ni uburozi bukomeye.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere na Carl Linnaeus mu gitabo \"Species Plantarum\" (1753).\nImiterere.\n\"Nerium oleander\" ni igihuru gishobora kugera kuri metero 1,5 kugeza kuri 6 z'uburebure. Amababi yacyo ni maremare kandi mato mu bugari, akomeye, y'icyatsi kibisi cyijimye, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 10 kugeza kuri 18.\nIndabo zacyo zihumura zifite amababi atanu, zikaba umweru, iroza ryijimye cyangwa andi mabara. Imbuto zacyo ni ibishishwa birebire (santimetero 13 kugeza kuri 18) birimo imbuto nto zifite ubwoya, zitwarwa n'umuyaga.\nUburozi.\nIbice byose by'iki kimera ni uburozi bukomeye kuko birimo ibinyabutabire byitwa \"glycosides cardiaques\" bigira ingaruka ku mutima. Kukirya bishobora gutera iseseme, kuruka, gutera nabi k'umutima ndetse n'urupfu. Umwotsi wacyo iyo gitwitswe nawo ugira ingaruka mbi, kandi gishobora kubabaza uruhu. Ni uburozi kandi ku mbwa, injangwe n'amafarasi.\nAho kiboneka n'imikoreshereze.\nGikomoka mu karere ka Mediterane, mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati no muri Aziya kugeza muri Miyanimari. Cyajyanywe mu bihugu byinshi, birimo ibyo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba nka Kenya na Etiyopiya.\nGiterwa nk'uruzitiro cyangwa igihuru cy'imitako; kihanganira izuba, amapfa n'umunyu wo ku nkombe z'inyanja."}
{"id": "23518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23518", "title": "Plumeria rubra", "text": "Plumeria rubra (mu Gifaransa \"frangipanier\", mu Cyongereza \"frangipani\") ni ubwoko bw'igiti gito kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Apocynaceae\", gikomoka muri Amerika yo Hagati, kuva muri Megizike kugeza muri Venezuwela.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo zihumura neza, z'iroza, umutuku, umweru cyangwa umuhondo, kandi giterwa cyane mu turere dushyuha two ku isi nk'igiti cy'imitako.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere na Carl Linnaeus mu gitabo \"Species Plantarum\" (1753). Izina ry'ubwoko \"Plumeria\" ryitiriwe umuhanga mu bimera w'Umufaransa Charles Plumier.\nImiterere.\n\"Plumeria rubra\" ni igiti gito gishobora kugera kuri metero 8 z'uburebure, gifite umutwe mugari umeze nk'inkono. Amababi yacyo ni manini, akomeye kandi arabagirana, akagwa mu gihe runaka cy'umwaka.\nIndabo zacyo zihumura, zifite amabara atandukanye bitewe n'ubwoko bwahinzwe; ntizigira umutobe w'isukari, kandi zibangurirwa n'udusimba nk'ibinyugunyugu bya nijoro. Urubuto rwacyo ni igishishwa cyumye gihinduka umukara cyangwa ikigina.\nIyo gikomeretse, kivamo amashira y'umweru ashobora gutera uruhu kwishimagura no kubyimba, kandi kuyamira bishobora gutera kuruka no gucibwamo.\nAho kiboneka n'imikoreshereze.\nGikomoka mu bihugu bya Amerika yo Hagati n'amajyaruguru ya Amerika y'Amajyepfo, kuva muri Megizike kugeza muri Kolombiya na Venezuwela. Cyajyanywe mu turere twinshi dushyuha two ku isi.\nGiterwa nk'igiti cy'imitako mu busitani, ku nkengero z'imihanda no mu nkono, kubera impumuro nziza y'indabo zacyo."}
{"id": "23522", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23522", "title": "Guverinoma y'agateganyo y'u Rwanda", "text": "Guverinoma y'agateganyo y'u Rwanda (mu Gifaransa \"Gouvernement int\u00e9rimaire rwandais\", yitwa kandi \u00abguverinoma Kambanda\u00bb) ni guverinoma yashyizweho ku wa 8 Mata 1994, nyuma y'iraswa ry'indege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana ku wa 6 Mata 1994. Yari iyobowe na Minisitiri w'Intebe Jean Kambanda, naho Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo ari Perezida.\nIyo guverinoma yayoboye u Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, kugeza ubwo FPR-Inkotanyi yatsindaga intambara muri Nyakanga 1994. Minisitiri w'Intebe wayo yahamwe n'icyaha cya jenoside n'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda.\nIshyirwaho.\nKu wa 8 Mata 1994, Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo, wari Perezida w'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko, yatangaje ishyirwaho rya guverinoma y'agateganyo, Jean Kambanda agirwa Minisitiri w'Intebe. Byabaye nyuma y'iyicwa rya Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana ku wa 7 Mata 1994.\nKu wa 12 Mata 1994, iyo guverinoma yimukiye i Murambi muri Gitarama (Muhanga y'ubu), ivuye i Kigali.\nUruhare muri jenoside.\nJean Kambanda yashinjwaga gutanga intwaro ku bantu bari bazikoresha mu bwicanyi, no kudahagarika ubwicanyi nubwo yari afite ububasha ku bakozi bakuru ba Leta n'abasirikare bakuru.\nImbere y'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR), Kambanda yemeye ibyaha byose yaregwaga, birimo jenoside, umugambi wo gukora jenoside, gushishikariza abantu gukora jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Ku wa 4 Nzeri 1998, urukiko rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Yabaye uwa mbere muri urwo rukiko wemeye icyaha, kandi urugereko rw'ubujurire rwemeje icyo gihano ku wa 19 Ukwakira 2000."}
{"id": "23523", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23523", "title": "Duranta erecta", "text": "Duranta erecta (mu Gifaransa \"vanillier de Cayenne\", mu Cyongereza \"golden dewdrop\" cyangwa \"skyflower\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru cyangwa igiti gito kirabya cyo mu muryango wa \"Verbenaceae\", gikomoka mu turere dushyuha twa Amerika.\nGiterwa cyane mu turere dushyuha tw'isi nk'uruzitiro n'igihuru cy'imitako kubera indabo zacyo z'ubururu n'imbuto zacyo z'umuhondo. Imbuto zacyo ni uburozi.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere na Carl Linnaeus mu gitabo \"Species Plantarum\" (1753). Buzwi kandi ku izina rya kera \"Duranta repens\".\nImiterere.\n\"Duranta erecta\" ni igihuru gihora gitoshye gishobora kugera kuri metero 3 kugeza kuri 4,5 z'uburebure, cyangwa igiti gito kigera kuri metero 6. Amashami amwe afite amahwa. Amababi yacyo arateganye, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 2,5 kugeza kuri 7,5.\nIndabo zacyo ni ntoya, z'ubururu, z'umweru cyangwa z'iroza, zikurikiranye ku mashami maremare. Zikurura inzuki, ibinyugunyugu n'inyoni. Imbuto zacyo ni utubuto duto tw'umuhondo cyangwa tw'icunga, dufite nka santimetero imwe; inyoni zirazirya maze zigakwirakwiza imbuto.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka muri Megizike kugeza mu majyaruguru ya Amerika y\u2019Epfo, no kuva mu majyepfo ya Florida kugeza mu birwa bya Karayibe. Giterwa kandi cyamaze kwimenyereza mu turere twinshi dushyuha tw'isi, harimo Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (Kenya, Tanzaniya, Ubugande) n'Afurika y'Amajyepfo. Muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo gifatwa nk'ikimera cyangiza ibidukikije (icyiciro 1b cy'itegeko NEMBA).\nUburozi.\nImbuto n'amababi bya \"Duranta erecta\" birimo saponine na aside hidorosiyaniki. Kubirya bishobora gutera kuruka, impiswi n'ububabare bwo mu nda, ndetse bikaba byahitana abana cyangwa amatungo nk'imbwa.\nIkoreshwa.\nGikoreshwa cyane nk'uruzitiro no mu busitani bw'imitako. Hari ubwoko bwatoranyijwe bufite amababi y'umuhondo, nka 'Sheena's Gold' na 'Cuban Gold'."}
{"id": "23524", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23524", "title": "Allamanda cathartica", "text": "Allamanda cathartica (mu Gifaransa \"allamanda\" cyangwa \"liane \u00e0 lait\", mu Cyongereza \"golden trumpet\" cyangwa \"yellow allamanda\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru kizamuka cyo mu muryango wa \"Apocynaceae\", gikomoka mu majyaruguru ya Amerika y'Amajyepfo.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo nini z'umuhondo zimeze nk'impanda, kandi giterwa mu turere dushyuha nk'ikimera cy'imitako. Amashira yacyo y'umweru ni uburozi.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere na Carl Linnaeus mu gitabo \"Mantissa Plantarum\" (1771).\nImiterere.\n\"Allamanda cathartica\" ni igihuru kizamuka nk'umugozi, gishobora kugera kuri metero 10 iyo cyurira ibindi. Amababi yacyo arabagirana, ni icyatsi kibisi cyijimye kandi akomeye, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 8 kugeza kuri 15, akaba ari mu matsinda ya 3 cyangwa 4 ku gice kimwe cy'uruti.\nIndabo zacyo z'umuhondo zimeze nk'impanda, zifite diyametero ya santimetero 6 kugeza kuri 10 n'amababi atanu. Urubuto rwacyo ni rwiburungushuye (hafi santimetero 4), rutwikiriwe n'amahwa yoroshye, kandi rurimo imbuto ziringaniye zifite amababa mato.\nUburozi.\nIbice byose by'iki kimera bifatwa nk'uburozi: kukirya bishobora gutera gucibwamo no kuruka, naho amashira yacyo y'umweru ashobora kubabaza uruhu.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka mu majyaruguru ya Amerika y'Amajyepfo kugeza mu majyaruguru ya Boliviya, harimo Burezili, Venezuwela na Giyana. Cyajyanywe mu bihugu byinshi bishyuha, birimo Tanzaniya, Madagasikari na Zimbabwe. Muri Queensland (Ositaraliya) gifatwa nk'ikimera cyigabiza gikwirakwira mu mashyamba no ku nkengero z'imihanda."}
{"id": "23525", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23525", "title": "Imbaraga z'Abahutu", "text": "Imbaraga z'Abahutu (mu Cyongereza \"Hutu Power\") ni ingengabitekerezo n'umutwe w'Abahutu b'intagondwa mu Rwanda, washyigikiraga ko ubutegetsi bwaharirwa Abahutu bonyine. Izina ryawo rikomoka ku nteruro \u00abHutu Power\u00bb yakoreshwaga n'abayobozi bawo mu myaka ya 1993\u20131994.\nUwo mutwe watumye amashyaka ya politiki yariho icyo gihe acikamo ibice, kandi wagize uruhare rukomeye muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nInkomoko.\nNyuma y'iyicwa rya Perezida w'Uburundi Melchior Ndadaye mu Kwakira 1993, Froduald Karamira, wari visi-perezida w'ishyaka MDR, na Justin Mugenzi, perezida w'ishyaka PL, bacamo kabiri amashyaka yabo: havuka \u00abMDR Power\u00bb na \u00abPL Power\u00bb, mu gihe ibindi bice by'ayo mashyaka byari biyobowe na Faustin Twagiramungu na Landouard Ndasingwa. Mu mbwirwaruhame zabo bavugaga ko \u00abUmuhutu ari we ufite ingufu\u00bb.\nKu wa 23 Ukwakira 1993, Karamira yavugiye ijambo kuri sitade ya Nyamirambo i Kigali, ryakwirakwije cyane interuro \u00abHutu Power\u00bb, yaje kuba intero y'Abahutu b'intagondwa mu gihe cya jenoside.\nMu gihe cya jenoside n'ingaruka.\nFroduald Karamira, umwe mu bayobozi b'uyu mutwe, yari n'umuyobozi muri Interahamwe; interuro \u00abHutu Power\u00bb yakoreshejwe n'intagondwa mu gihe cyose cya jenoside.\nNyuma ya jenoside, Froduald Karamira yafatiwe mu Buhinde mu 1996, yoherezwa mu Rwanda. Ku wa 14 Gashyantare 1997, urukiko rwa mbere rw'iremezo rwa Kigali rwamuhamije icyaha cya jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu, rumukatira igihano cyo kwicwa; yarashwe ku mugaragaro ku wa 24 Mata 1998 kuri sitade ya Nyamirambo."}
{"id": "23529", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23529", "title": "Vanny Bishweka", "text": "Vanny Bishweka (yavutse ahagana mu 1965) ni umucuruzi wo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ukorera i Goma mu Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru.\nNi nyiri hoteli Ihusi n\u2019isosiyete y\u2019amato yo ku Ikiyaga cya Kivu yitwa izina rimwe na yo, kandi yavuzweho kuba umucuruzi ukomeye kurusha abandi i Goma.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n\u2019intangiriro.\nYavukiye mu muryango ukennye i Birere, agace k\u2019ubucuruzi k\u2019umujyi wa Goma. Yatangiriye ku bucuruzi buciriritse no gutwara abantu n\u2019ibintu, aho yari atunze moto ebyiri muri esheshatu zari mu mujyi icyo gihe, mbere yo kwagura ubucuruzi bwe mu mijyi ituranye na wo no mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1992 yatangiye kubaka hoteli Ihusi ku nkombe y\u2019Ikiyaga cya Kivu, yitiriwe umudugudu wa se wo mu Kivu y\u2019Amajyepfo. Imirimo yarahagaze mu 1994 kubera umutekano muke i Goma; hoteli yuzuye mu 2001 ifungura imiryango mu 2002. Yakira cyane cyane imiryango itanga imfashanyo n\u2019abagenzi bari mu bucuruzi. Mu 2016 yari arimo kubaka hoteli ya kabiri ya Ihusi i Goma.\nIshoramari rye ryatumye hubakwa Goma Serena Hotel, hoteli ya mbere y\u2019inyenyeri eshanu muri uwo mujyi, yafunguwe mu 2020 nyuma y\u2019imyaka icumi yubakwa.\nAmato ye ya Ihusi ahuza Goma na Bukavu mu masaha agera kuri atatu, anyuze ku kirwa cya Idjwi. Ni umufatanyabikorwa w\u2019isosiyete yo muri Tuniziya yitwa EPPM, icukura gaze metani yo muri icyo kiyaga, kandi afite 20 % by\u2019imigabane ya Socodee, isosiyete ikwirakwiza amashanyarazi akorwa na Virunga Energie, ishami ry\u2019ikigo gicunga Pariki ya Virunga. Yanateye inkunga iyubakwa ry\u2019inyubako, sitasiyo za lisansi, imihanda n\u2019amasangano y\u2019imihanda i Goma. Mu 2023, Kaminuza Yigenga y\u2019Ibihugu by\u2019Ibiyaga Bigari (ULPGL) yamuhaye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyubahiro (\"honoris causa\")."}
{"id": "23530", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23530", "title": "Brugmansia suaveolens", "text": "Brugmansia suaveolens (mu Kinyarwanda \"ikibutibuti\", mu Gifaransa \"trompette des anges\" cyangwa \"trompette du jugement dernier\", mu Cyongereza \"angel's trumpet\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru cyangwa igiti gito cyo mu muryango wa \"Solanaceae\", umuryango urimo n'ibirayi n'inyanya. Gikomoka mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Burezile.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo nini zimeze nk'impanda zitendera, z'umweru, iz'umuhondo cyangwa iz'iroza, zihumura cyane nijoro. Giterwa henshi ku isi nk'ikimera cy'imitako, harimo no mu Rwanda. Ibice byacyo byose ni uburozi bukomeye.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere ku izina rya \"Datura suaveolens\", nyuma y'ubushakashatsi bwa Alexander von Humboldt na Aim\u00e9 Bonpland muri Amerika y'Amajyepfo; mu 1818 Robert Sweet abushyira mu bwoko \"Brugmansia\". Izina \"suaveolens\" risobanura mu Kilatini \u00abgihumura neza\u00bb.\nImiterere.\n\"Brugmansia suaveolens\" ni igihuru kitari igiti gikomeye, kireshya na metero 3 kugeza kuri 5, akenshi gifite igihimba kigabanyijemo amashami menshi. Amababi yacyo ni maremare ameze nk'igi, ashobora kugera kuri santimetero 25 z'uburebure na 15 z'ubugari.\nIndabo zacyo zireshya na santimetero 24 kugeza kuri 32, zimeze nk'impanda ifite imitwe itanu migufi ihetamiye hanze. Ku manywa zitendera zifunze igice, nijoro zigafunguka neza kandi zigahumura kugira ngo zikurure ibinyugunyugu bya nijoro bizitera intanga. Igiti gito gikura gifite uruti rumwe, kikazarabya ari uko kimaze kugira ishami rya mbere ku burebure bwa santimetero 80 kugeza kuri 150.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka mu mashyamba y'imvura yo ku nkombe z'inyanja mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Burezile, kuva muri leta ya Bahia kugeza muri Rio Grande do Sul. Abantu bakijyanye mu bihugu byinshi bishyuha, birimo u Rwanda, Ubugande, Kenya, Tanzaniya, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Etiyopiya na Madagasikari.\nUburozi n'imikoreshereze.\nIbice byose by'iki kimera, cyane cyane imbuto n'amababi, birimo \"alkalo\u00efdes\" zo mu bwoko bwa \"tropane\" nka scopolamine (hyoscine), zitera ibibonekerwa, umutima utera cyane n'ubundi burozi bushobora kwica.\nMu Rwanda, mu buvuzi gakondo bwakoreshwaga mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe, kandi giterwa nk'ikimera cy'imitako. Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe ku mbeba bwerekanye ko ibivuye mu ndabo zacyo bigabanya ububabare."}
{"id": "23531", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23531", "title": "Gloriosa superba", "text": "Gloriosa superba (mu Gifaransa \"lis de Malabar\" cyangwa \"lis de flamme\", mu Cyongereza \"flame lily\" cyangwa \"glory lily\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kizamuka cyo mu muryango wa \"Colchicaceae\". Gikomoka muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara, harimo n'u Rwanda, no mu majyepfo ya Aziya.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo nziza z'umutuku n'umuhondo zimeze nk'ibirimi by'umuriro. Ni ururabo rw'igihugu cya Zimbabwe. Ibice byacyo byose ni uburozi bukomeye, cyane cyane igitunguru cyacyo.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere na Carl Linnaeus mu gitabo \"Species Plantarum\" (1753).\nImiterere.\n\"Gloriosa superba\" ni ikimera kimara imyaka myinshi, gikura kivuye mu gitunguru kinini kimeze nk'inyuguti V. Uruti rwacyo rushobora kugera kuri metero 5, kikurira ku bindi bimera gikoresheje imitwe y'amababi yacyo yizingira nk'imigozi.\nIndabo zacyo nini zifite ibibabi bitandatu bihetamiye inyuma, bifite impera zihindagurika. Ibara ryazo riva ku mutuku ukeye ufite inkombe z'umuhondo kugeza ku muhondo werurutse, ndetse hari n'izera.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka mu bihugu byinshi byo muri Afurika, birimo u Rwanda, Uburundi, Ubugande, Kenya, Tanzaniya na Zimbabwe, ndetse no mu Ubuhinde, Sri Lanka no mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Aziya. Cyajyanywe no muri Ositaraliya no ku birwa byo mu nyanja ya Pasifika.\nGikura mu mashyamba, mu bihuru, mu turere tw'urutare no ku bitaka by'imiswa, ku butumburuke bwa metero 300 kugeza ku 1\u00a0800.\nUburozi.\nIbice byose by'iki kimera ni uburozi, cyane cyane igitunguru, kubera \"colchicine\" n'ibindi binyabutabire bikirimo. Kukirya bitera kuruka cyane, kuribwa mu nda no gucibwamo amaraso, kandi bishobora kwica. Igitunguru cyacyo gishobora kwitiranywa n'ibijumba cyangwa ibindi bitunguru biribwa."}
{"id": "23532", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23532", "title": "Grand Prix ya Afurika", "text": "Grand Prix ya Afurika (mu Cyongereza: \"African Grand Prix\") ni isiganwa ry'imodoka rya Formula One riteganyijwe kubera mu Rwanda, ku kibuga kizubakwa mu Akarere ka Bugesera, nko mu birometero 40 mu majyepfo ya Kigali.\nRizaba ari ryo siganwa rya mbere rya Formula One muri Afurika kuva muri 1993.\nAmateka.\nAfurika yakiriye amasiganwa ya Formula One muri Maroke (1958) no muri Afurika y'Epfo kugeza muri 1993. Mu Ukuboza 2024, ubwo i Kigali hafungurwaga inama rusange za FIA, Perezida Paul Kagame yatangaje ko u Rwanda rwifuza kwakira Grand Prix, umugambi washyigikiwe n'umushoferi Lewis Hamilton. Ku wa 13 Ukwakira 2026, yatangarije i Kigali amasezerano y'imyaka icumi na Formula One. Isiganwa, rimenyekanishwa na Visit Rwanda, riteganyijwe gutangira mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2030, ikibuga kimaze kuzura.\nIkibuga.\nIkibuga cyitwa RISE Motordrome kizubakwa i Bugesera mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, hafi y'ikibuga mpuzamahanga cy'indege gishya. Cyashushanyijwe na Tilke GmbH na Wurz Design hakurikijwe ibipimo bya FIA Grade 1, kandi kizakurikiza imiterere y'imisozi y'aho kizubakwa. Uyu mushinga uyobowe n'Ikigo cy'Igihugu cy'Iterambere (RDB), ukaba uri mu mushinga mugari wa siporo, ubukerarugendo n'ubucuruzi."}
{"id": "23536", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23536", "title": "Impatiens niamniamensis", "text": "Impatiens niamniamensis (mu Gifaransa \"impatience du Za\u00efre\" cyangwa \"impatience bec-de-perroquet\", mu Cyongereza \"parrot plant\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera cy'indabo cyo mu muryango wa \"Balsaminaceae\". Gikomoka muri Afurika yo hagati n'iy'uburasirazuba, harimo n'u Rwanda.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo z'amabara atatu, umutuku, umuhondo n'icyatsi, zimeze nk'umunwa w'inyoni yitwa \"perroquet\". Giterwa henshi nk'ikimera cy'imitako, kandi amababi yacyo akoreshwa nk'imboga n'imiti.\nImiterere.\n\"Impatiens niamniamensis\" ni ikimera kimara imyaka myinshi, gihagaze, gishobora kugera kuri metero 1 z'uburebure. Uruti rwacyo rurimo amazi menshi, ariko rugakomera nk'igiti hasi. Amababi yacyo ateye nk'igi, ashobora kugera kuri santimetero 22 z'uburebure, afite inkombe zimeze nk'amenyo mato.\nIndabo zacyo zimanitse munsi y'amababi, ziri hagati ya 2 na 6 ku ishami rimwe. Zifite umunwa w'icyatsi, hagati h'umuhondo n'umurizo w'umutuku uhetamye nk'inkoni, ureshya na santimetero 5. Urubuto rwacyo rurimo amazi menshi; iyo rukuze ruraturika rugasandaza imbuto.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka muri Kameruni, Gabon, Repubulika ya Santarafurika, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Angola, Sudani y'Epfo, Ubugande, Kenya, Tanzaniya, Uburundi n'u Rwanda. Gikura ahantu hari ubuhehere n'igicucu cyinshi, mu bihuru, mu mashyamba y'ibishanga no ku nkombe z'imigezi, ku butumburuke bwa metero 350 kugeza ku 2\u00a0400. Ntikihanganira ubukonje bukabije.\nImikoreshereze.\nMuri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, amababi yacyo aribwa nk'imboga, kandi akoreshwa mu gukora umunyu w'ibimera. Akoreshwa kandi mu buvuzi gakondo mu kuvura indwara z'umutima, no gupfuka ibikomere n'ibisebe. Muri Afurika no mu bindi bice by'isi, giterwa mu busitani cyangwa mu nkono nk'ikimera cy'imitako."}
{"id": "23539", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23539", "title": "Hypericum revolutum", "text": "Hypericum revolutum (mu Cyongereza \"curry bush\" cyangwa \"forest primrose\") ni ubwoko bw'igihuru cyangwa igiti gito cyo mu muryango wa \"Hypericaceae\". Gikomoka mu misozi miremire ya Afurika, harimo n'u Rwanda, no mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba bw'umwigimbakirwa wa Arabiya.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo nini z'umuhondo ukeye, n'amababi ahumura nk'ikirungo cya \"curry\" iyo ashwanyujwe. Gikoreshwa nk'inkwi, mu bwubatsi no mu buvuzi gakondo.\nIzina.\nUbu bwoko bwasobanuwe bwa mbere n'umuhanga mu bimera Martin Vahl mu 1790. Izina \"revolutum\" risobanura mu Kilatini \u00abgihinnye inyuma\u00bb, ryerekeza ku nkombe z'amababi yacyo zihinnye.\nImiterere.\n\"Hypericum revolutum\" ni igihuru gikura vuba, akenshi gifite ibihimba byinshi, gishobora kugera kuri metero 3, rimwe na rimwe kikaba igiti cya metero 10. Igishishwa cyacyo ni ikigina gisa n'umutuku, kigenda gihunguka.\nAmababi yacyo ni mato kandi maremare, ateganye ku mpera z'amashami, afite utudomo tw'umukara n'inkombe zihinnye. Iyo ashwanyujwe, ahumura nka \"curry\". Indabo zacyo z'umuhondo ukeye zigera kuri santimetero 5 z'umurambararo, zifite ibibabi bitanu n'ubudodo bwinshi hagati. Imbuto zacyo ziri mu gasanduku k'ikigina gasa n'umutuku.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka muri Afurika, kuva muri Nijeriya no muri Eritereya kugeza muri Afurika y'Epfo, harimo u Rwanda, no muri Yemeni na Arabiya Sawudite. Gikura ku nkombe z'imigezi, ku nkengero z'amashyamba no mu byatsi byo mu misozi miremire, akenshi hamwe n'umugeshi (\"Hagenia abyssinica\"), ku butumburuke bwa metero 1\u00a0400 kugeza kuri 3\u00a0700.\nIndabo zacyo zisurwa n'inyoni zinywa ubuki bw'indabo n'inzuki nini zibaza imbaho.\nImikoreshereze.\nIgiti cyacyo gikoreshwa nk'inkwi no mu bwubatsi. Amababi n'ibiti byacyo bikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo, cyane cyane mu kuvura uburibwe bwo mu nda. Ni n'ikimera cy'ingenzi ku nzuki kandi gifasha mu kurwanya isuri. Kubera ko kidafatwa n'umuriro byoroshye, gifatwa nk'urukuta rusanzwe rurinda amashyamba inkongi."}
{"id": "23541", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23541", "title": "Lewis Hamilton", "text": "Sir Lewis Carl Davidson Hamilton (yavutse ku ya 7 Mutarama 1985 i Stevenage, mu Ubwongereza) ni umushoferi w'amasiganwa y'imodoka w'Umwongereza, usiganwa muri Formula 1. Yegukanye igikombe cy'isi cya Formula 1 inshuro ndwi (2008, 2014, 2015, 2017, 2018, 2019 na 2020), anganya agahigo na Michael Schumacher.\nNi umwe mu bashoferi batsinze cyane mu mateka ya Formula 1, akaba afite agahigo k'amasiganwa ya Grand Prix menshi yatsinze. Yakiniye amakipe ya McLaren (2007\u20132012) na Mercedes (2013\u20132024); kuva mu 2025 akinira Ferrari.\nUbuto.\nLewis Hamilton yavukiye i Stevenage mu Ubwongereza ku ya 7 Mutarama 1985. Se, Anthony Hamilton, akomoka ku muryango wimukiye mu Bwongereza uvuye muri Grenade; ababyeyi be batandukanye afite nk'imyaka ibiri, maze arererwa na nyina.\nYatangiye amasiganwa ya \"karting\" (imodoka nto z'amasiganwa) ashishikarijwe na se, maze afite imyaka icumi yegukana igikombe cy'Ubwongereza cy'abato. Mu 1994 yahuye na Ron Dennis, umuyobozi wa McLaren, mu muhango wo gutanga ibihembo.\nUmwuga.\nAmasiganwa y'abato.\nMu 1998 yinjiye muri gahunda ya McLaren yo gutoza abashoferi bakiri bato. Yegukanye shampiyona ya Formula 3 Euroseries mu 2005, n'iya GP2 mu 2006 ari mu ikipe ya ART Grand Prix.\nMcLaren (2007\u20132012).\nHamilton yinjiye muri Formula 1 mu 2007 afite imyaka 22, mu ikipe ya McLaren iruhande rwa Fernando Alonso. Muri uwo mwaka wa mbere yatsinze amasiganwa ane, maze asoza ari uwa kabiri, arushwa inota rimwe gusa na Kimi R\u00e4ikk\u00f6nen. Mu 2008 yegukanye igikombe cy'isi ku nshuro ya mbere afite imyaka 23, ku isiganwa rya nyuma muri Burezile, aba icyo gihe nyampinga w'isi muto kurusha abandi bose.\nMercedes (2013\u20132024).\nMu 2013 yasimbuye Michael Schumacher mu ikipe ya Mercedes ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu. Hamwe n'iyo kipe yegukanye ibikombe bitandatu by'isi hagati ya 2014 na 2020, maze mu 2020 anganya na Schumacher agahigo k'ibikombe birindwi.\nMu 2021 yahatanye na Max Verstappen kugeza ku isiganwa rya nyuma i Abu Dhabi: imodoka y'umutekano (\"safety car\") imaze kwinjira habura amazenguruka make, Verstappen wari wahinduye amapine yamunyuzeho ku izenguruka rya nyuma, yegukana igikombe. Ku ya 28 Nyakanga 2024 yatsinze Grand Prix y'Ububiligi, iba intsinzi ye ya 105 muri Formula 1.\nFerrari (kuva 2025).\nKu ya 1 Gashyantare 2024, Ferrari na Mercedes byatangaje ko Hamilton azakinira Ferrari guhera mu 2025, iruhande rwa Charles Leclerc, nyuma y'imyaka cumi n'umwe muri Mercedes. Mu 2026 yabaye uwa gatatu muri Grand Prix y'Ubushinwa i Shanghai, bwa mbere ageze ku ruhimbi (\"podium\") ari kumwe na Ferrari.\nIbikorwa by'ubugiraneza.\nMuri Kamena 2020, Hamilton yashinze \"Hamilton Commission\" afatanyije na Royal Academy of Engineering, igamije kumenya inzitizi zibuza Abirabura kwinjira no kuzamuka mu mwuga w'amasiganwa y'imodoka mu Bwongereza; raporo yayo yasohotse muri Nyakanga 2021 ifite ibyifuzo icumi.\nMuri Nyakanga 2021 yatangije umuryango \"Mission 44\", ugamije gufasha urubyiruko rwo mu matsinda adahagarariwe neza mu Bwongereza mu burezi no mu kazi, awuha miliyoni 20 z'amapawundi ku giti cye.\nIcyubahiro.\nKu ya 15 Ukuboza 2021, Hamilton yagizwe \"Knight\" n'Igikomangoma cya Wales mu muhango wabereye mu ngoro ya Windsor, ari kumwe na nyina Carmen Larbalestier; kuva ubwo yitwa \"Sir Lewis Hamilton\"."}
{"id": "23542", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23542", "title": "Dombeya torrida", "text": "Dombeya torrida (mu Kinyarwanda \"umukore\") ni ubwoko bw'igiti cyo mu muryango wa \"Malvaceae\", gikomoka mu misozi miremire ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, harimo n'u Rwanda, no mu majyepfo y'umwigimbakirwa wa Arabiya.\nNi igiti cyo mu mashyamba y'imisozi miremire, kizwi kubera indabo zacyo nyinshi z'umweru cyangwa iroza zifite ubuki bwinshi. Gikoreshwa nk'inkwi, mu bwubatsi no mu buvuzi gakondo.\nImiterere.\n\"Dombeya torrida\" ni igihuru cyangwa igiti gifite amashami menshi, gishobora kugera kuri metero 12 kugeza kuri 15, gifite ikamba rimeze nk'umutaka. Igishishwa cyacyo ni ikijuju kandi kirashashagirana; imbere ni ikigina kirimo imigozi myinshi.\nAmababi yacyo ni manini, afite ubwoya, ameze nk'umutima, ashobora kugera kuri santimetero 30, afite inkombe zimeze nk'amenyo. Indabo zacyo z'umweru cyangwa iroza ziri mu mitwe minini; buri rurabo rufite ibibabi bitanu n'umutima w'umutuku wijimye. Iyo zumye, ibibabi bisigara bizengurutse imbuto bigahinduka ikigina.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka mu Rwanda, Uburundi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ubugande, Kenya, Tanzaniya, Malawi, Zambiya, Etiyopiya, Eritereya, Sudani, Yemeni na Arabiya Sawudite. Kiboneka mu mashyamba atoshye yo mu misozi miremire, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1\u00a0600 kugeza kuri 3\u00a0400.\nMu Rwanda, kiboneka mu turere tw'imisozi miremire, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1\u00a0800 kugeza ku 3\u00a0000, harimo i Gishwati no mu Bugesera. Giterwa mu mirima no ku miringoti irwanya isuri.\nImikoreshereze.\nIgiti cyacyo gikoreshwa nk'inkwi, mu gukora amakara, mu bwubatsi no mu gukora ibikoresho by'ubuhinzi. Indabo zacyo zifitiye akamaro inzuki, naho amababi yacyo afumbira ubutaka. Igishishwa cyacyo kivamo imigozi.\nMu buvuzi gakondo bwo mu Rwanda, igishishwa cyacyo gitekwa kikanyobwa mu kuvura igogora ribi, cyane cyane nyuma yo kurya inyama nyinshi."}
{"id": "23545", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23545", "title": "Ipomoea cairica", "text": "Ipomoea cairica (mu Gifaransa \"ipom\u00e9e du Caire\", mu Cyongereza \"coastal morning glory\" cyangwa \"mile-a-minute\") ni ubwoko bw'ikimera kizamuka cyo mu muryango wa \"Convolvulaceae\", umuryango urimo n'ibijumba. Gikomoka muri Afurika ishyuha, harimo n'u Rwanda, no muri Aziya.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo z'iroza cyangwa z'isine zimeze nk'impanda. Kubera ko gikura vuba cyane, mu bihugu byinshi cyajyanywemo gifatwa nk'ikimera cyigabiza, gitwikira kandi kikica ibindi bimera.\nImiterere.\n\"Ipomoea cairica\" ni ikimera kimara imyaka myinshi, kizamuka cyizingira ku bindi, gishobora kugera kuri metero 5 z'uburebure. Uruti rwacyo rukiri ruto rumeze nk'umugozi, rukura rugakomera; rurimo amashira y'umweru.\nAmababi yacyo agabanyijemo ibice 5 kugeza kuri 7 bigera hafi ku ntangiriro yayo, areshya na santimetero 4 kugeza kuri 9. Indabo zacyo zimeze nk'impanda, zifite ibara ry'isine cyangwa iroza (rimwe na rimwe umweru), n'umutima wijimye; zireshya na santimetero 3,5 kugeza kuri 6. Zirabya umwaka wose, ariko buri rurabo rumara umunsi umwe gusa. Imbuto zacyo ziri mu gasanduku k'uruziga gafite umurambararo wa milimetero 10, karimo imbuto enye z'umukara zifite ubwoya.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka mu bihugu byinshi bya Afurika, birimo u Rwanda, Uburundi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ubugande, Kenya, Tanzaniya, Zambiya, Angola na Madagasikari, ndetse no muri Aziya, kuva muri Arabiya kugeza muri Ubuhinde no mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Aziya. Cyajyanywe ku yindi migabane, harimo Amerika, Ositaraliya n'Uburayi bw'amajyepfo.\nGikura ahantu henshi hashyuha: ku nkombe z'inyanja, ku nkombe z'imigezi, mu mashyamba, no mu busitani aho kizamuka ku nzitiro.\nIkimera cyigabiza.\nMuri Ositaraliya, aho cyazanywe nk'ikimera cy'imitako, \"Ipomoea cairica\" gifatwa nk'ikimera cyigabiza: gikora ibirago binini ku butaka cyangwa kikazamuka ku biti, kigatwikira ibindi bimera kikabibuza urumuri. Uruti rwacyo rurimo ibinyabutabire bishobora kugirira nabi inka, ihene, intama n'ifarashi."}
{"id": "23548", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23548", "title": "Igitembe", "text": "Igitembe (\"Ensete ventricosum\"; mu Gifaransa \"bananier d'Abyssinie\", mu Cyongereza \"enset\" cyangwa \"false banana\") ni ikimera kinini gisa n'urutoki, cyo mu muryango wa \"Musaceae\". Gikomoka mu misozi ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'iy'Amajyepfo, harimo n'u Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda kiboneka mu mashyamba y'imisozi miremire, kandi gikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo no mu mitako. Muri Etiyopiya, ni igihingwa cy'ingenzi gitunga abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 20.\nImiterere.\nIgitembe ni ikimera kinini kimara imyaka myinshi, gisa n'urutoki ariko kidatanga imineke iribwa. Gishobora kugera kuri metero 6 z'uburebure, gifite amababi manini cyane afite umugongo w'umutuku. Kirabya rimwe gusa mu buzima bwacyo, nyuma kigapfa.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka mu Rwanda, Uburundi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ubugande, Kenya, Tanzaniya, Etiyopiya, Malawi, Zambiya, Zimbabwe, Mozambike, Angola na Afurika y'Epfo. Mu Rwanda gikura mu bice by'amashyamba y'imisozi miremire byatemwe cyangwa hafi y'imigezi, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1\u00a0900 kugeza ku 2\u00a0300.\nMuri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Bwindi (Ubugande), ubushakashatsi bwerekanye ko indabo zacyo zisurwa n'uducurama n'imbeba zo mu biti, naho imbuto zacyo zikaribwa n'ibisimba, inguge n'imbeba nini. Kubera ko kirabya kandi kikera umwaka wose, gishobora gutunga inyamaswa igihe ibindi biryo bibuze.\nImikoreshereze.\nMu buvuzi gakondo bwo mu Rwanda, amababi yacyo akoreshwa mu kuvura macinya, naho uruti rwacyo rutetse n'ivu ryarwo bigakoreshwa mu kuvura indwara z'umwijima. Giterwa kandi nk'ikimera cy'imitako.\nMuri Etiyopiya, igitembe ni igihingwa gitunga abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 20. Ibinyamafufu biribwa bikurwa mu gice cyo hasi cy'uruti rwacyo kibyimbye, mu bibabi bigize uruti no mu mizi yacyo, bisarurwa nyuma y'imyaka 4 kugeza kuri 7 gitewe. Kihanganira amapfa kandi gishobora gusarurwa igihe icyo ari cyo cyose cy'umwaka."}
{"id": "23550", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23550", "title": "Rwiziringa", "text": "Rwiziringa (\"Datura stramonium\"; mu Gifaransa \"stramoine\" cyangwa \"pomme \u00e9pineuse\", mu Cyongereza \"jimsonweed\" cyangwa \"thorn apple\") ni ikimera cyo mu muryango wa \"Solanaceae\", gikomoka muri Megizike ariko ubu kiboneka hafi ku isi hose, harimo no mu Rwanda.\nKizwi kubera indabo zacyo z'umweru zimeze nk'impanda n'imbuto zacyo zuzuyeho amahwa. Ibice byacyo byose ni uburozi bukomeye, cyane cyane imbuto.\nImiterere.\nRwiziringa ni ikimera kimara umwaka umwe, gishobora kugera kuri santimetero 50 kugeza kuri metero 1,5 z'uburebure. Amababi yacyo ni manini, ateye nk'igi, areshya na santimetero 8 kugeza kuri 17, afite inkombe zimeze nk'amenyo manini.\nIndabo zacyo zihagaze, zimeze nk'impanda, zireshya na santimetero 6 kugeza ku 10, zifite ibara ry'umweru cyangwa isine yerurutse. Urubuto rwacyo ni agasanduku k'uruziga kareshya na santimetero 3 kugeza kuri 4,5, kuzuyeho amahwa menshi; iyo gakuze kigabanyamo ibice bine, kakarekura imbuto nyinshi z'umukara.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka muri Megizike, ariko cyakwirakwiye ku migabane yose, harimo no muri Afurika. Mu Rwanda gikura ahantu hadahinzwe, mu mirima yararaye no ku nkengero z'imihanda, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1\u00a0400 kugeza ku 2\u00a0000.\nUburozi.\nIbice byose by'iki kimera ni uburozi, byaba bibisi cyangwa byumye, cyane cyane imbuto. Birimo ibinyabutabire bya \"alkalo\u00efdes\" nka atropine, hyoscyamine na scopolamine. Bitera umutima gutera vuba, imboni z'amaso kwaguka, umunwa kuma no kutabona neza; nyuma bishobora gutera guhumeka buhoro, kugagara na koma. Rwiziringa itera kandi ibibonekerwa. Amatungo, cyane cyane inka n'ingurube, ashobora kwicwa no kurya iki kimera.\nImikoreshereze.\nMu Rwanda, abavuzi gakondo bakoresha amababi yacyo mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe. Ahandi muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, umutobe w'imbuto zacyo ukoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare bw'amatwi, naho amababi agashyirwa ku ngingo zibyimbye. Kubera uburozi bwacyo, gukoresha iki kimera nk'umuti bishobora guteza akaga."}
{"id": "23555", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23555", "title": "Ageratum conyzoides", "text": "Ageratum conyzoides (mu Kinyarwanda \"inkuruba\" cyangwa \"akaziraruguma\", mu Cyongereza \"billygoat weed\") ni ikimera cyo mu muryango wa \"Asteraceae\", gikomoka muri Megizike ariko ubu kiboneka mu bihugu byinshi bishyuha, harimo n'u Rwanda.\nNi icyatsi gito gifite indabo nto z'isine cyangwa z'umweru, gikunze kumera mu mirima no ku nkengero z'imihanda. Mu Rwanda gikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo, cyane cyane mu kuvura ibikomere.\nImiterere.\n\"Ageratum conyzoides\" ni icyatsi gihagaze, gishobora kugera kuri santimetero 50 kugeza kuri metero 1, gifite amashami make cyangwa menshi n'ubwoya buke. Amababi yacyo ateye nk'igi, areshya na santimetero 2 kugeza kuri 6, afite inkombe zimeze nk'amenyo n'ubwoya ku mpande zombi.\nIndabo zacyo ziteranye mu mitwe mito y'uruziga ifite umurambararo wa milimetero 5 kugeza kuri 6, ifite ibara ry'isine cyangwa umweru. Imbuto zacyo ni nto, z'umukara, zifite uduhembe dutanu tw'umweru tuzifasha gutwarwa n'umuyaga.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka muri Megizike, ariko cyakwirakwiye mu turere dushyuha tw'isi yose, harimo u Rwanda n'ibindi bihugu byinshi bya Afurika. Mu Rwanda gikura mu mirima yararaye no ahantu hahinduwe n'abantu, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1\u00a0300 kugeza ku 2\u00a0300. Ahandi gifatwa nk'icyatsi kibi gikunze kumera mu nzuri no ahantu hadahinzwe.\nImikoreshereze.\nMu Rwanda, abavuzi gakondo bakoresha amababi yacyo mu kuvura ibikomere, kandi kizwiho kurwanya imiyege. I Kigali, umuvuzi gakondo akoresha amababi yacyo ashyizwe mu mazi ashyushye mu kuvura indwara z'impyiko."}
{"id": "23557", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23557", "title": "Kimali", "text": "Kimali (\"Galinsoga parviflora\"; mu Gifaransa \"galinsoga \u00e0 petites fleurs\", mu Cyongereza \"gallant soldier\") ni icyatsi cyo mu muryango wa \"Asteraceae\", gikomoka muri Amerika yo hagati, ariko ubu kiboneka hafi ku isi hose, harimo no mu Rwanda.\nNi icyatsi gito gifite indabo nto z'umweru n'umuhondo, gikunze kumera mu mirima nk'icyatsi kibi. Mu bice bimwe bya Afurika amababi yacyo aribwa nk'imboga, kandi gikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo.\nImiterere.\nKimali ni icyatsi kimara umwaka umwe, gihagaze, gishobora kugera kuri santimetero 20 kugeza kuri 60, rimwe na rimwe kikagera kuri metero 1,2. Amababi yacyo ateganye, areshya na santimetero 1 kugeza kuri 6,5, afite inkombe zifite amenyo mato.\nIndabo zacyo ziteranye mu mitwe mito iri ku mpera z'amashami, akenshi ebyiri ebyiri. Buri mutwe ufite ibibabi bitanu bito by'umweru bizengurutse umutima w'umuhondo. Ikimera kimwe gishobora kubyara imbuto zirenga 7\u00a0000.\nAho kiboneka.\nGikomoka muri Amerika yo hagati no muri Amerika y'Amajyepfo, ariko cyakwirakwiye ku migabane yose, harimo u Rwanda. Muri Afurika ishyuha kiboneka kuva ku nkombe z'inyanja kugeza ku butumburuke bwa metero 2\u00a0400, ahantu hagwa imvura nyinshi. Mu Rwanda kimera ku nkengero z'imihanda, mu mirima yararaye, mu mirima ihinzwe no ahandi hahinduwe n'abantu.\nKubera ko imbuto zacyo zikenera urumuri kugira ngo zimere, gikunze kumera ahantu harangaye, cyane cyane mu mirima y'ibihingwa bikiri bito. Ni icyatsi kibi gikomeye mu mirima y'ingano, ibigori n'ipamba, kandi kibamo udukoko na virusi byangiza itabi, ibirayi n'amashu.\nImikoreshereze.\nAmababi n'uduti twacyo tukiri duto bitekwa bikaribwa nk'imboga. Gihabwa kandi amatungo nk'inkoko, inkwavu n'ingurube. Mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda, ikimera cyose gikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo mu kuvura umunaniro w'ubwonko (\"stress\"). Muri Etiyopiya amababi yacyo apfuka ibikomere."}
{"id": "23558", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23558", "title": "Indwara y'ikibyimba mu maso (conjunctivitis)", "text": "Indwara ya Conjunctivite, izwi kandi nka pink eye, ni ukubyimba kw'igice cy'inyuma cy'ijisho ryera n'imbere mu jisho. Bituma ijisho risa n'umutuku cyangwa ibara ry'umutuku. Ububabare, ubushye, gushwanyagurika, cyangwa gushyuha bishobora kubaho. Ijisho ryagize ikibazo rishobora kuba ryarize cyane cyangwa \"rigafunga\" mu gitondo. Kubyimba igice cy'ijisho cyera nabyo bishobora kubaho. Kuryarya bikunze kugaragara cyane mu gihe habayeho ubwivumbure. Indwara y'ikibyimba ishobora gufata ijisho rimwe cyangwa yombi.\nImpamvu zikunze kwandura ni virusi zigakurikirwa na bagiteri. Ubwandu bwa virusi bushobora kubaho hamwe n'ibindi bimenyetso by'ibicurane bisanzwe. Ubwandu bwa virusi na bagiteri byombi bukwirakwira mu bantu byoroshye. Allergie iterwa n'umukungugu cyangwa ubwoya bw'inyamaswa nabyo ni impamvu ikunze kugaragara. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku bimenyetso n'ibimenyetso. Rimwe na rimwe, icyitegererezo cy'ibisigazwa byoherezwa kugira ngo bivurwe.\nKwirinda biterwa no gukaraba intoki. Uburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru. Mu ndwara nyinshi za virusi, nta buryo bwihariye bwo kuvura. Inshuro nyinshi ziterwa n'ubwandu bwa bagiteri nazo zirashira nta kuvurwa; icyakora, imiti yica udukoko ishobora kugabanya indwara. Abantu bambara indorerwamo z\u2019amaso n\u2019abafite ubwandu buterwa na gonorrhea cyangwa chlamydia bagomba kuvurwa. Abantu bafite ubwivumbure bashobora kuvurwa n'imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara cyangwa imiti igabanya ubukana bw'uturemangingo.\nAbantu bagera kuri miliyoni 3 kugeza kuri 6 barwara conjunctivitis buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ku bantu bakuru, impamvu ziterwa na virusi zikunze kugaragara cyane, mu gihe ku bana, impamvu ziterwa na bagiteri zikunze kugaragara cyane. Ubusanzwe, abantu bakira mu cyumweru kimwe cyangwa bibiri. Iyo umuntu atabona neza, afite ububabare bukabije, afite ubushobozi bwo kumva urumuri, ibimenyetso bya herpes, cyangwa niba ibimenyetso bidahindutse nyuma y'icyumweru, ashobora gukenera kwisuzumisha no kuvurwa. Indwara yo mu bwonko ku mwana ukiri mu nda, izwi nka conjunctivitis y\u2019impinja, ishobora no gukenera ubuvuzi bwihariye."}
{"id": "23560", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23560", "title": "Angina", "text": "Angina ni ububabare bwo mu gituza, umuvuduko, cyangwa gufungana bitewe n'uko amaraso adatembera neza mu mitsi y'umutima. Ububabare bushobora kugera mu musaya cyangwa ku kuboko. Hashobora kubaho kubura umwuka, ibyuya, cyangwa isesemi. Iyo bibaye gusa iyo umuntu akoze imyitozo ngororamubiri cyangwa stress, bigashira mu minota mike yo kuruhuka, anjine irahoraho. Iyo bibaye mu buryo butunguranye, mu gihe cyo kuruhuka, cyangwa bidahita bishira iyo umuntu aruhutse, biba ari angina idahindagurika.\nUbusanzwe angina iterwa no kuziba no kugabanuka kw'imitsi itanga amaraso mu mitsi y'umutima. Ibintu bishobora gutera indwara birimo hyperlipidemie, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, kunywa itabi, diyabete, n'umubyibuho ukabije. Izindi mpamvu zongera ibyago birimo kubura amaraso, imitsi y'umutima idasanzwe, umutima unanirwa gukora neza, n'umuvuduko w'amaraso ukabije. Izindi ndwara zishobora gutera ibimenyetso nk'ibi zirimo gucika kw'imitsi ifungana, gucika kw'imitsi ifungana mu bihaha, pericarditis, indwara yo kugabanuka k'umuyoboro w'amaraso mu gifu, pneumothorax, ububabare mu gituza, n'imihangayiko.\nUbuvuzi bushobora kuba burimo guhindura imibereho n'imiti. Imiti ikoreshwa mu gukumira ibitero n'ingorane irimo beta blockers, calcium channel blockers, aspirine, statins, na ACE inhibitors. Ibitero bikomeye bishobora kuvurwa na nitroglycerin. Niba ibi bidahagije, umuntu ashobora kubagwa. Ibisubizo bishobora kuba byiza iyo bivuwe.\nMu bihugu by'Iburengerazuba bw'isi, abantu 3.5% bafite indwara ya angina idahindagurika. Bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bantu bakuze aho abagabo barengeje imyaka 65 ari 15% naho abagore bakaba ari 11%. Iri jambo rikomoka ku ijambo ry'ikilatini \"angere\" (\"kwima\") na \"pectus\" (\"igituza\"), bityo rishobora guhindurwa nk'\"ibyiyumvo byo kwima mu gituza\". "}
{"id": "23561", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23561", "title": "Ikimongoliya", "text": "Melanocytosis yo mu bwoko bwa Congenital dermal, izwi kandi nka Mongolian spot, ni ikimenyetso cy'ubururu n'imvi gifite ibara ridasanzwe. Ni ahantu harambuye kandi akenshi bigira ingaruka ku mugongo wo hasi; nubwo hari n'ahandi hashobora kuba harimo. Muri rusange barakura iyo bageze ku myaka itandatu; nubwo hari bamwe badakira burundu.\nBiterwa no kwimuka kutuzuye kwa melanocytes mu gihe cy'ivuka rya mbere. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bishingiye ku kuntu igaragara. Bamwe babyitiranyije n'ibikomere. Muri rusange nta buvuzi bwihariye bukenewe. Abarwayi bavuwe hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa laser. Ntabwo ari abantu bakomeye.\nUduheri two muri Mongoliya turakunze kugaragara, tuboneka hafi 10% by'abazungu, 40% kugeza 70% by'abanya Hisipaniya, 80% by'abanya Aziya, na 98% by'abana b'Abanyamerika b'abirabura. Abagabo n'abagore barwara indwara imwe. Yasobanuwe kandi ihabwa izina ry\u2019Abanyamongoliya na Erwin B\u00e4lz mu 1883, umuhanga mu by\u2019imibanire y\u2019abantu w\u2019Umudage wari utuye mu Buyapani."}
{"id": "23562", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23562", "title": "Udukoko tw'ubwonko (neurosyphilis)", "text": "Udukoko tw'ubwonko yerekeza ku kwandura kw'imitsi yo hagati hakoreshejwe syphilis. Bishobora kubaho igihe icyo ari cyo cyose nyuma yo kwandura. Bishobora kubaho nta bimenyetso, cyangwa bigatera indwara ya meningitis, ibimenyetso bya stroke, paresis rusange, cyangwa tabes dorsalis. Meningite itera kuribwa umutwe, ijosi rigakomera, no kuruka. Guhagarara k'umutima mu buryo rusange bishobora gutera impinduka mu miterere y'umuntu, kwibeshya no gutigita. Ibice bya dorsalis bishobora gutera imikorere mibi y'umubiri, kubura ibinure, ibibazo by'uruhago, no kunyura mu maso mu buryo budasanzwe. \nImpamvu ni bagiteri yitwa \"Treponema pallidum\". Bikunze kugaragara cyane ku bafite agakoko gatera SIDA. Gusuzuma indwara birimo gutobora mu ruhu kugira ngo haboneke amazi yo mu bwonko (CSF) kugira ngo akoreshwe mu isuzuma. Iyo ikizamini cya VDRL kuri CSF cyagaragaje ko ari icyanduye, ibi byemeza ko ari indwara; icyakora, igipimo cyo gupima ko ari kibi ntikibuza ko ari ikibazo. Ibi rimwe na rimwe byuzuzwa n'ikizamini cyo kwiyongerera ubushobozi bwo gufata antibody treponemal (FTA-ABS).\nUbusanzwe, ubuvuzi bwa neurosyphilis bukorwa hakoreshejwe penisiline G ku gipimo cya miliyoni 3 kugeza kuri 4 mu mitsi buri masaha ane mu gihe cy'iminsi 10 kugeza kuri 14. Penicilline ishobora kandi gutangwa rimwe ku munsi binyuze mu gutera mu mitsi hamwe na probenecide mu kanwa. Ku bantu bafite ubwivumbure kuri penisiline, ceftriaxone ishobora gukoreshwa. Iyo bivuwe hakiri kare, muri rusange ingaruka ziba nziza.\nUdukoko two mu bwonko (Neurosyphilis) ni gake cyane, nubwo abarwayi bagiye biyongera. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, hafi 2% by'abantu barwaye syphilis hakiri kare, barwaye neurosyphilis. Nubwo mu bice bimwe bya Afurika, abaturage muri rusange bagera kuri 2% bashobora kwibasirwa n\u2019iki kibazo. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore. Mbere y'uko imiti yica udukoko iboneka, abantu bagera kuri 30% by'abarwayi ba syphilis bari bafite neurosyphilis."}
{"id": "23563", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23563", "title": "Indwara y'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri", "text": "Indwara y\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri ni indwara iterwa n\u2019uko ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri budashobora gukora neza ku gice cy\u2019umubiri. Hari nibura ubwoko 80 bw'indwara ziterwa n'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri. Hafi igice icyo ari cyo cyose cy'umubiri gishobora kugira uruhare. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe birimo umuriro muke no kumva unaniwe. Akenshi ibimenyetso biraza hanyuma bikagenda.\nImpamvu muri rusange ntabwo izwi. Zimwe mu ndwara ziterwa n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri nka lupus zigaragara mu miryango, kandi zimwe na zimwe zishobora guterwa n\u2019indwara cyangwa izindi mpamvu zishingiye ku bidukikije. Zimwe mu ndwara zikunze gufatwa nk'izishingiye ku bushobozi bw'umubiri zirimo indwara ya celiac, diyabete yo mu bwoko bwa 1, indwara ya Graves, indwara yo kubyimba amara, sclerosis nyinshi, rubagimpande, na lupus erythematosus. Indwara ishobora kugorana kumenya.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'ubwoko n'uburemere bw'indwara. Imiti igabanya ububyimbirwe idakoresha steroide (NSAIDs) hamwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bw'umubiri ikunze gukoreshwa. Immunoglobulin iterwa mu mitsi ishobora no gukoreshwa rimwe na rimwe. Nubwo ubusanzwe kuvurwa bigabanya ibimenyetso, ntabwo bivura indwara.\nAbantu bagera kuri miliyoni 24 (7%) muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bibasiwe n'indwara y\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri. Abagore ni bo bibasirwa cyane kurusha abagabo. Akenshi bitangira mu gihe cy'ubukure. Indwara za mbere ziterwa n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri zavuzwe mu ntangiriro z\u2019imyaka ya 1900."}
{"id": "23564", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23564", "title": "Isotretinoin", "text": "Isotretinoin, igurishwa ku izina rya Accutane n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura ibiheri bikomeye. By\u2019umwihariko ikoreshwa ku biheri bifite uduce duto kandi bitarakira hamwe n\u2019ubundi buryo bwo kuvura. Izindi ngaruka zirimo, ichthyosis, na kanseri zimwe na zimwe. Ifatwa mu kanwa cyangwa igashyirwa ku ruhu.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kubyimba iminwa, triglycerides nyinshi mu maraso, kubabara ingingo, no kubabara imitsi. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo ibibazo by'imibonano mpuzabitsina, kwiyongera k'ubushyuhe bw'izuba, gutakaza umusatsi, n'ibibazo by'ubuzima bwo mu mutwe. Isotretinoin izwiho gutera ibibazo mu gihe cyo kubyara kandi uburyo bwo kuboneza urubyaro bukora neza busabwa guhera mu kwezi mbere yo gutangira kuvurwa. Ni retinoid, bivuze ko ifitanye isano na vitamine A na tretinoin. Bikekwa ko bikora binyuze mu guhindura imikorere y'uturemangingo tw'imisemburo ya sebaceous.\nYahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha mu buvuzi mu 1969, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1982. Nubwo ikiri kuboneka hakurikijwe amazina menshi asanzwe, izina ry'umwimerere ryahagaritswe mu 2009 bitewe n'uruvange rw'ibicuruzwa bike byagurishijwe ndetse n'imanza nyinshi ku ngaruka mbi. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika no mu Bwongereza hari gahunda zihariye zo kugabanya ibyago byo gutwita kw'abagore mu gihe bakoresha uyu muti. Mu Bwongereza, miligarama 20 ku munsi mu kwezi zitwara NHS ibiro bigera kuri 17."}
{"id": "23565", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23565", "title": "Indwara yo guhakana imyitwarire idasanzwe", "text": "Indwara yo kudakunda kwifata (ODD) ni indwara yo mu bwana iterwa n'ibibazo byo kugenzura amarangamutima n'imyitwarire. Bigaragaza imiterere y'igihe kirekire y'umujinya, imyitwarire yo gusuzugura, no kwihimura ku bandi. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo indwara zo guhangayika, indwara zo mu mutwe, ikibazo cyo kwitwara nabi, no gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge nabi.\nImpamvu nyamukuru iterwa n\u2019ibintu by\u2019ingenzi bivugwa ko ishingiye ku miterere y\u2019umubiri, ibidukikije n\u2019imibereho. Bikekwa ko hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'ibyago byo kurwara iyi ndwara biterwa n'uturemangingo. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera ikibazo zirimo ihohoterwa rishingiye ku bana, ubukene, n'itsinda ry'abakene mu rungano. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku kiganiro n'abantu baganira n'umwana. Ibikoresho byinshi byo gusuzuma bishobora gufasha mu gusuzuma indwara. ODD itandukanye n'indwara yo kwitwara nabi kuko ibimenyetso byayo biba bike cyane.\nUbuyobozi bushobora kuba burimo amahugurwa y'ababyeyi, ubufasha mu ishuri, n'ubuvuzi bw'imyitwarire mu bwenge. Iyo ibi bidakora neza, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara zo mu mutwe ishobora gukoreshwa. Indwara ifitanye isano nayo ishobora gusaba kuvurwa. Indwara yo kudahuza ibitekerezo igaragara ko yibasira abantu bari hagati ya 2 na 11%. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore. Gutangira kw'ishuri akenshi biba ahagana mu ntangiriro z'ishuri kandi bigenda bigabanuka uko imyaka igenda ikura."}
{"id": "23566", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23566", "title": "Indwara yo guhakana imyitwarire idasanze", "text": "e\nIndwara yo kudakunda kwifata (ODD) ni indwara yo mu bwana iterwa n'ibibazo byo kugenzura amarangamutima n'imyitwarire. Bigaragaza imiterere y'igihe kirekire y'umujinya, imyitwarire yo gusuzugura, no kwihimura ku bandi. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo indwara zo guhangayika, indwara zo mu mutwe, ikibazo cyo kwitwara nabi, no gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge nabi.\nImpamvu nyamukuru iterwa n\u2019ibintu by\u2019ingenzi bivugwa ko ishingiye ku miterere y\u2019umubiri, ibidukikije n\u2019imibereho. Bikekwa ko hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'ibyago byo kurwara iyi ndwara biterwa n'uturemangingo. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera ikibazo zirimo ihohoterwa rishingiye ku bana, ubukene, n'itsinda ry'abakene mu rungano. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku kiganiro n'abantu baganira n'umwana. Ibikoresho byinshi byo gusuzuma bishobora gufasha mu gusuzuma indwara. ODD itandukanye n'indwara yo kwitwara nabi kuko ibimenyetso byayo biba bike cyane.\nUbuyobozi bushobora kuba burimo amahugurwa y'ababyeyi, ubufasha mu ishuri, n'ubuvuzi bw'imyitwarire mu bwenge. Iyo ibi bidakora neza, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara zo mu mutwe ishobora gukoreshwa. Indwara ifitanye isano nayo ishobora gusaba kuvurwa. Indwara yo kudahuza ibitekerezo igaragara ko yibasira abantu bari hagati ya 2 na 11%. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore. Gutangira kw'ishuri akenshi biba ahagana mu ntangiriro z'ishuri kandi bigenda bigabanuka uko imyaka igenda ikura."}
{"id": "23567", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23567", "title": "Indwara ya XYY", "text": "Indwara ya XYY ni indwara iterwa n\u2019uturemangingo tw\u2019umubiri aho umugabo aba afite chromosome Y y\u2019inyongera. Akenshi ibimenyetso ntibiba byinshi. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo kuba muremure ugereranije n'ibisanzwe, ibiheri, ndetse n'ibyago byinshi byo kugira ibibazo byo kwiga. Ubusanzwe umuntu aba ameze neza, harimo n'uburumbuke busanzwe.\nIyi ndwara muri rusange ntabwo ivuka ku babyeyi b'umuntu ahubwo iterwa n'ibintu bitunguranye mu gihe intanga ngabo zikura. Gupima indwara bikorwa hakoreshejwe isesengura rya chromosome, ariko abenshi mu bayirwaye ntibayisuzuma mu gihe cy'ubuzima bwabo. Hariho chromosomes 47, aho kuba 46 zisanzwe, zitanga karyotype ya 47,XYY.\nUbuvuzi bushobora kuba burimo uburyo bwo kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe cyangwa ubufasha bw'inyongera mu kazi ko ku ishuri, ariko muri rusange umusaruro uba mwiza. Iyi ndwara ibaho ku bana b'abahungu bagera kuri 1 mu 1000. Abantu benshi bafite iyi ndwara ntibazi ko bayifite. Iyo ndwara yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1961."}
{"id": "23568", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23568", "title": "Ketoconazole", "text": "Ketoconazole, igurishwa ku izina rya Nizoral n'indi, ni umuti uvura indwara ziterwa n'imiti irwanya udukoko ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zitandukanye z'imiti. Iyo ikoreshejwe ku ruhu, ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara z'uruhu ziterwa n'ibihumyo nka tinea, candidiasis y'uruhu, pityriasis versicolor, dandruff, na seborrheic dermatitis. Iyo uyinyoye ntabwo ari amahitamo meza cyane kandi ni byiza kuyikoresha gusa ku ndwara zikomeye mu gihe izindi miti zidashobora gukoreshwa. Izindi ngamba zirimo kuvura imikurire y'umusatsi ikabije ndetse n'indwara ya Cushing's syndrome.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara iyo zikoreshejwe ku ruhu zirimo gutukura, kuribwa no kuruma. Ingaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara iyo umuntu anyoye zirimo isesemi, kuribwa umutwe, n'ibibazo by'umwijima. Ibibazo by'umwijima bishobora gutera urupfu cyangwa gukenera guterwa umwijima. Izindi ngaruka mbi zikomeye iyo umuntu anyoye zirimo gukomeretsa QT, kudakora neza kw'uturemangingo tw'amaraso, no kunanirwa k'umubiri. Ni imidazole kandi ikora mu kugira ingaruka ku ikorwa rya ergosterol ikenewe ku ruhu rw'uturemangingo tw'ibihumyo bityo igatuma gukura kugabanuka.\nKetoconazole yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1977, itangira gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1981. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe kandi imiti ikoreshwa ku ruhu igurishwa ku giciro cya muganga mu Bwongereza. Umuyoboro wa garama 30 mu Bwongereza utwara NHS munsi y'amapawundi 5 mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho amavuta yo mu bwoko bwa \"topical cream\" aboneka gusa ku muganga, ikiguzi cy'aya mafaranga ni hafi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 219 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni ebyiri. Iyi ngingo ifatwa mu kanwa yakuweho mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019u Burayi no muri Ositaraliya mu 2013 no mu Bushinwa mu 2015. Byongeye kandi, ikoreshwa ryayo ryaragabanijwe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika na Kanada mu 2013."}
{"id": "23569", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23569", "title": "Indwara ya Cauda equina", "text": "Indwara ya Cauda equina syndrome (CES) ni indwara ibaho iyo umutsi uri munsi y'umugongo uzwi nka cauda equina wangiritse. Ibimenyetso birimo kubabara umugongo wo hasi, ububabare bugera mu kaguru, gucika intege hirya no hino mu kibuno, no kubura uburyo bwo kugenzura amara cyangwa uruhago. Gutangira bishobora kuba vuba cyangwa buhoro buhoro.\nImpamvu akenshi ni ukuvamo kwa disiki mu gice cyo hasi cy'umugongo. Izindi mpamvu zirimo stenosis y'umugongo, kanseri, ihungabana, ikibyimba cyo mu gice cy'imbere cy'umugongo, na hematoma yo mu gice cy'imbere cy'umugongo. Isuzuma rikekwaho hashingiwe ku bimenyetso kandi ryemezwa n'amashusho ya muganga nka MRI cyangwa CT scan.\nMuri rusange, CES ivurwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo kubaga hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa laminectomy. Ibibazo bidashira by'inkari, imikorere mibi mu mibonano mpuzabitsina cyangwa ibinya bishobora kubaho nubwo haba habayeho kubagwa. Umusaruro mubi uboneka ku bantu bagera kuri 20% nubwo bavuwe. Umuntu umwe kuri 70.000 yibasirwa n\u2019iki kibazo buri mwaka. Byasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1934."}
{"id": "23570", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23570", "title": "Udukoko tw'imitsi", "text": "Uduheri, tuzwi kandi nka wheals na urticaria, ni ubwoko bw'uduheri ku ruhu dufite uduheri dutukura, twazamutse kandi dusharira. Bishobora no gushya cyangwa kuruma. Akenshi uduce tw\u2019ibisebe turagendagenda. Ubusanzwe zimara iminsi mike kandi ntizisiga impinduka zirambye ku ruhu. Abanduye munsi ya 5% bamara ibyumweru birenga bitandatu. Iyo ndwara ikunze kugaruka.\nUdukoko dukunze kugaragara nyuma yo kwandura cyangwa bitewe n'ingaruka z'ubwivumbure nko ku miti, kurumwa n'udukoko, cyangwa ibiryo. Imihangayiko yo mu mutwe, ubukonje, cyangwa guhindagura bishobora kuba imbarutso. Mu kimwe cya kabiri cy'abarwaye indwara, icyayiteye ntikiramenyekana. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo kugira indwara nk'ibicurane cyangwa asima. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku kuntu igaragara. Gupima ibipande bishobora kuba ingirakamaro mu kumenya ubwivumbure.\nKwirinda ni ukwirinda ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose cyatera iyo ndwara. Ubusanzwe ubuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe imiti igabanya ubukana nka diphenhydramine na ranitidine. Mu bihe bikomeye, imiti ya corticosteroids cyangwa leukotriene inhibitors nayo ishobora gukoreshwa. Gukomeza ubushyuhe bw'ibidukikije nabyo ni ingirakamaro. Ku bantu bamaze ibyumweru birenga bitandatu, imiti igabanya ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri nka ciclosporin ishobora gukoreshwa.\nAbantu bagera kuri 20% nibo barwaye. Indwara z'igihe gito ziba ku bagabo no ku bagore mu gihe iz'igihe kirekire zikunze kugaragara ku bagore. Indwara z\u2019igihe gito zikunze kugaragara mu bana mu gihe iz\u2019igihe kirekire zikunze kugaragara mu bantu bari mu kigero cyo hagati. Udukoko tw\u2019umuhondo twavuzwe nibura kuva mu gihe cya Hippocrates. Ijambo urticaria rikomoka ku ijambo ry'ikilatini \"urtica\" risobanura \"nettle\"."}
{"id": "23571", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23571", "title": "Topiramate", "text": "Topiramate, igurishwa ku izina rya Topamax n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura igicuri no gukumira migraine. Yanakoreshejwe mu gihe cyo kuba umuntu ukunda kunywa inzoga. Ku ndwara y'igicuri, ibi bikubiyemo kuvura indwara z'igicuri rusange cyangwa iz'icyorezo. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuribwa mu nda, kubura ubushake bwo kurya, kumva unaniwe, kubabara mu nda, gutakaza umusatsi, no kugorwa no kwibanda ku bintu. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kwiyahura, kwiyongera k'urugero rwa ammonia bigatera indwara ya encephalothy, ndetse n'amabuye y'impyiko. Gukoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita bishobora kwangiza umwana kandi ntibikwiye gukoreshwa mu gihe cyo konsa. Uburyo bikora ntabwo birasobanutse neza.\nTopiramate yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1996. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ku kwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a31.40 ku kwezi guhera mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 4.00. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 77 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni icumi."}
{"id": "23572", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23572", "title": "Limfoma itari iya Hodgkin", "text": "Limfoma itari iya Hodgkin (NHL) ni itsinda rya kanseri y'amaraso irimo ubwoko bwose bwa limfoma usibye limfoma ya Hodgkin. Ibimenyetso birimo kwiyongera kw'uturemangingo tw'amaraso, umuriro, ibyuya nijoro, kugabanya ibiro no kunanirwa. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubabara mu magufwa, kubabara mu gituza cyangwa gushyuha. Hari ubwoko bukura buhoro buhoro, mu gihe ubundi bukura vuba. \nLymphoma ni ubwoko bwa kanseri buturuka kuri lymphocytes, ubwoko bw'uturemangingo tw'amaraso twera. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo imikorere mibi y'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri, indwara ziterwa n'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri, ubwandu bwa \"Helicobacter pylori\", hepatitis C, umubyibuho ukabije, n'ubwandu bwa virusi ya Epstein-Barr. Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye wita ku Buzima ushyira limfoma mu matsinda atanu akomeye, harimo n\u2019irya Hodgkin lymphoma. Mu matsinda ane ya NHL harimo ubwoko burenga 60 bwihariye bwa lymphoma. Gusuzuma indwara ni ugusuzuma umwongo w'amagufwa cyangwa lymph node biopsy. Gufata amashusho y'ubuvuzi bifasha mu kugabanya kanseri.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa no kumenya niba lymphoma ikura buhoro cyangwa vuba, kandi niba iri mu gace kamwe cyangwa mu duce twinshi. Uburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo imiti ivura indwara ya kanseri (chimiotherapie), imirasire (radiation), ubuvuzi bw\u2019ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri (immunotherapy), ubuvuzi bugamije, gutera uturemangingo tw\u2019umubiri (stem-cell transplantation), kubagwa, cyangwa gutegereza urebye. Iyo amaraso abaye menshi cyane bitewe n'umubare munini w'abasilikare, plasmapheresis ishobora gukoreshwa. Ariko, imirasire na chimiotherapie bimwe na bimwe byongera ibyago byo kurwara izindi kanseri, indwara z'umutima, cyangwa ibibazo by'imitsi mu myaka yakurikiyeho.\nMu 2015, abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 4.3 barwaye kanseri iterwa na lymphoma itari iya Hodgkin, naho 231.400 barapfa. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, 2.1% by'abantu bagira ingaruka mu gihe runaka mu buzima bwabo. Imyaka ikunze kugaragara yo gusuzuma indwara ni hagati y'imyaka 65 na 75. Igipimo cy'imyaka itanu yo kubaho muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ni 71%. "}
{"id": "23573", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23573", "title": "Uburozi bwa Mercury", "text": "Uburozi bwa Mercure ni ubwoko bw'uburozi bw'icyuma buterwa no kwibasirwa na Mercure. Ibimenyetso biterwa n'ubwoko, urugero, uburyo, n'igihe umuntu yahuye nacyo. Bishobora kuba birimo intege nke z'imitsi, kudakora neza kw'ingingo, kugira ibisebe mu maboko no mu birenge, uduheri ku ruhu, guhangayika, ibibazo byo kwibuka, ibibazo byo kuvuga, ibibazo byo kumva, cyangwa ibibazo byo kubona. Guhura cyane na methylmercury bizwi nka Minamata disease. Guhura na Methylmercury mu bana bishobora gutera acrodynia (indwara y'umutuku) aho uruhu ruhinduka umutuku rukavamo. Ingorane z'igihe kirekire zishobora kuba zirimo ibibazo by'impyiko no kugabanuka k'ubwenge. Ingaruka zo kwandura methylmercury ku gipimo gito igihe kirekire ntizisobanutse neza.\nUbwoko bw'ibintu bya mercure birimo icyuma, umwuka, umunyu, n'ibintu bikomoka ku bimera. Ibyinshi mu biyobyabwenge biterwa no kurya amafi, gusiga amenyo hakoreshejwe amalgam, cyangwa kuyakoresha ku kazi. Mu mafi, ayo hejuru mu ruhererekane rw'ibiribwa muri rusange agira urugero rwinshi rwa mercure. Akenshi, uburozi bushobora kubaho nk'uburyo bwo kugerageza kwiyahura. Ibikorwa bya muntu bisohora mercure mu bidukikije birimo gutwika amakara no gucukura zahabu. Ibizamini by'amaraso, inkari n'umusatsi birahari ariko ntibifitanye isano n'ingano iri mu mubiri.\nKwirinda birimo kurya indyo irimo mercure nkeya, gukura mercure mu bikoresho by'ubuvuzi n'ibindi bikoresho, guta mercure neza, no kudacukura mercure. Ku bantu bafite uburozi bukabije buturutse ku munyu wa mercure udakoreshwa, chelation irimo aside dimercaptosuccinic (DMSA) cyangwa dimercaptopropane sulfonate (DMPS) isa nkaho irushaho kuba myiza iyo itanzwe mu masaha make nyuma yo gukorerwa imibonano mpuzabitsina. Kuvura indwara y'umutima ku bantu bahura n'iyi ndwara igihe kirekire nta nyungu igaragara bifite. Mu turere tumwe na tumwe tubaho dukoresha uburobyi, igipimo cy\u2019uburozi bwa mercure mu bana cyageze kuri 1.7 kuri 100."}
{"id": "23574", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23574", "title": "Benzonatate", "text": "Benzonatate, igurishwa ku izina rya Tessalon n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kugerageza gufasha ibimenyetso by'inkorora n'imiti iterwa n'inkorora. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ntibyemewe gukoresha ibi biyobyabwenge ku bari munsi y'imyaka icumi. Ingaruka muri rusange zitangira mu minota 20 kandi zimara amasaha umunani.\nIngaruka mbi zirimo gusinzira, isereri, kuribwa umutwe, kubabara mu gifu, kurwara uduheri ku ruhu, kubona ibintu mu buryo butunguranye, ndetse no kugira ingaruka ku barwayi. Gukoresha imiti myinshi bishobora gutera indwara zo mu mutwe, gutera umutima ku buryo budasanzwe, ndetse no gupfa. Guhekenya cyangwa konka agapfukamunwa bishobora gutera laryngospasm, bronchospasm, no kugabanuka k'amaraso mu miyoboro y'amaraso. Ntabwo birasobanuka neza niba gukoresha iyi miti mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa nta kibazo bifite. Ikora mu kugabanya ibinyabutabire byo mu bihaha no guhagarika uburyo bwo gukorora mu bwonko.\nBenzonatate yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1958. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igiciro cya buri kwezi ni hafi $0.12 kuri buri 100.\u00a0igipimo cya mg. Ntabwo iboneka mu bihugu byinshi. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 148 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni enye."}
{"id": "23575", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23575", "title": "Adenosine", "text": "Adenosine ni ikinyabutabire kiboneka mu nyamaswa zo mu bwoko bwa \u201cbelles\u201d, kikaba gikoreshwa no mu kuvura. Nk'umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura cyangwa gusuzuma ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bwa tachycardia yo mu mutwe idakira iyo umuntu arwaye indwara yo mu nda. Muri rusange ikoreshwa mu gutera imitsi vuba vuba. Igikorwa gitangira mu masegonda 40 kandi ingaruka zimara igihe kiri munsi y'iminota 2. \nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kubabara mu gituza, kumva nta cyo ushoboye, guhumeka nabi, no gucika intege k'uruhu. Ingaruka mbi zirimo kugabanuka k'umuvuduko w'amaraso no kugabanuka k'umuvuduko w'amaraso. Nubwo ishobora gukoreshwa mu gihe cyo gutwita, umutekano wayo nturasobanuka neza. Adenosine ni imwe mu ngingo enye z\u2019ingenzi za RNA. Ikora mu kugabanya inshuro ibimenyetso by'amashanyarazi bishobora kunyura mu gice cy'umutima cya AV.\nAdenosine yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1989. Ariko, byagiye byigwa mu miterere y'ibinyabuzima kuva mu myaka ya 1920. Adenosine iboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ntabwo bihenze. Mu Bwongereza mu 2020, dose ya 6 mg yatwaye NHS hafi ikiro kimwe."}
{"id": "23576", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23576", "title": "Dermatomyositis", "text": "Dermatomyositis (DM) ni indwara y'ububyimbirwe bw'igihe kirekire ifata imitsi. Ibimenyetso byayo muri rusange ni uduheri ku ruhu no kugabanuka kw'imitsi uko igihe kigenda gihita. Ibi bishobora kubaho mu buryo butunguranye cyangwa bigakura mu mezi menshi. Ibindi bimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kugabanya ibiro, umuriro, kubyimba ibihaha, cyangwa kumva urumuri. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo calcium iri mu mitsi cyangwa uruhu.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana. Ibitekerezo birimo ko ari indwara iterwa n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019umubiri cyangwa ingaruka z\u2019ubwandu bwa virusi. Ni ubwoko bwa miyopathie itera ububabare. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku bimenyetso bimwe na bimwe, ibizamini by'amaraso, electromyography, no gusuzuma imitsi.\nNubwo nta muti uzwi w\u2019iyi ndwara, muri rusange uburyo bwo kuyivura butuma ibimenyetso birushaho kuba byiza. Uburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo imiti, ubuvuzi bw'umubiri, imyitozo ngororamubiri, ubushyuhe, uburyo bwo kuvura ingingo n'ibikoresho bifasha umubiri, ndetse no kuruhuka. Imiti yo mu muryango wa corticosteroids ikunze gukoreshwa hamwe n'indi miti nka methotrexate cyangwa azathioprine isabwa niba steroid idakora neza. Immunoglobulin iterwa mu mitsi bishobora kandi kunoza umusaruro. Abantu benshi barakira iyo bavuwe kandi muri bamwe iyo ndwara irakira burundu.\nDermatomyositis ikunze kwibasira umuntu umwe ku bantu 100.000 buri mwaka. Iyi ndwara ikunze kugaragara ku bantu bari mu kigero cy'imyaka 40 na 50, abagore bakaba ari bo bayirwara cyane kurusha abagabo. Ariko, abantu b'imyaka iyo ari yo yose bashobora kugerwaho n'ingaruka. Iyo mimerere yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu myaka ya 1800."}
{"id": "23577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23577", "title": "Indwara y'ukuri yishyizeho ku muntu wawe", "text": "Indwara y\u2019ibitekerezo iterwa n\u2019indwara, izwi kandi nka Munchausen syndrome, ni indwara yo mu mutwe aho umuntu yirema ubwe, abizi, ibimenyetso by\u2019indwara cyangwa iy\u2019imitekerereze. Ibi bibaho nta cyifuzo cyo gushaka inyungu zo hanze. Ibimenyetso bishobora gutandukana cyane kuva ku bikomere by'uruhu, kugeza ku bisekera, kugeza ku isukari nke mu maraso, kugeza ku kubabara mu gatuza. Ibimenyetso bishobora guterwa no gufata ingamba nko kurya ibiryo byangiritse cyangwa gutera insuline. Bikunze kubaho mu bice.\nImpamvu ntiramenyekana. Ibintu bishobora gutera ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, n'urupfu rw'umubyeyi akiri muto. Bikekwa ko ibibazo by'ubuzima bikomoka ku rwego rw'ubuvuzi kugira ngo bikurure abantu. Akenshi ibimenyetso bigaragara ntibihura n'ibyavuye muri laboratwari cyangwa mu mashusho ya muganga. Muri rusange kandi hari amateka menshi yo kujyanwa mu bitaro. Ni ubwoko bw'indwara y'ukuri kandi ifitanye isano n'indwara y'ukuri iterwa undi muntu, yerekeza ku ihohoterwa rikorerwa undi muntu, akenshi umwana, kugira ngo umuntu yitezweho.\nKuvura bikubiyemo kugira impuhwe no kugira inama. Benshi ariko, banze kuvurwa. Indwara y\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi yibasira umuntu ku giti cye igaragara ko yibasira munsi ya 1% by\u2019abashaka ubuvuzi. Bikunze kugaragara ku bagore kurusha abagabo. Gutangira akenshi biba mu bwana. Iyi ndwara yasobanuwe neza bwa mbere mu 1951, yitiriwe umukinnyi w\u2019umuhimbano Baron Munchausen."}
{"id": "23578", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23578", "title": "Igitero cy'ubwoba", "text": "Ibitero by'ubwoba ni ibihe bitunguranye by'ubwoba bukomeye bishobora kuba birimo gucika intege, kubira ibyuya, guhinda umushyitsi, guhumeka nabi, kugira ibinya, cyangwa kumva ko hari ikintu kibi kigiye kubaho. Ibimenyetso byinshi bibaho mu minota mike. Ubusanzwe zimara iminota 30 ariko igihe gishobora gutandukana kuva ku masegonda kugeza ku masaha. Hashobora kubaho ubwoba bwo kubura ubushobozi bwo kwifata cyangwa kubabara mu gatuza. Ibitero by'ubwoba ubwabyo ntabwo biteje akaga ku mubiri. \nIbitero by'ubwoba bishobora guterwa n'indwara zitandukanye zirimo indwara y'ubwoba, indwara yo guhangayika mu mibanire y'abantu, indwara yo guhangayika nyuma y'ihungabana, indwara yo gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge, kwiheba, n'ibibazo by'uburwayi. Bishobora guterwa n'ingaruka cyangwa bikabaho mu buryo butunguranye. Kunywa itabi, kafeyine, no guhangayika mu mutwe byongera ibyago byo kugira ikibazo cy'ubwoba. Mbere yo gusuzuma indwara, indwara zisa n\u2019izigomba kuvanwaho, nka hyperthyroidism, hyperparathyroidism, indwara z\u2019umutima, indwara z\u2019ibihaha, no gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge.\nUburyo bwo kuvura ibitero by'ubwoba bugomba kwerekezwa ku mpamvu nyamukuru. Ku bantu bakunze kurwara indwara, bashobora guhabwa inama cyangwa imiti. Imyitozo yo guhumeka no kuruhuka imitsi nabyo bishobora gufasha. Abahuye n'iki kibazo bafite ibyago byinshi byo kwiyahura. \nMu Burayi, abaturage bagera kuri 3% bagira ikibazo cy\u2019ubwoba mu mwaka runaka, mu gihe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bibasira bagera kuri 11%. Zikunze kugaragara cyane mu bagore kurusha abagabo. Akenshi bitangira mu gihe cy'ubugimbi cyangwa mu ntangiriro z'ubukure. Abana n'abantu bakuze ntibakunze kwibasirwa n'iyi ndwara. "}
{"id": "23579", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23579", "title": "Urukingo rwa Polio", "text": "Inkingo za polio ni inkingo zikoreshwa mu gukumira poliomyelitis (polio). Hari ubwoko bubiri bukoreshwa: virusi ya polio idakora itangwa hakoreshejwe inshinge (IPV) na virusi ya polio idakora itangwa hakoreshejwe umunwa (OPV). Umuryango Mpuzamahanga wita ku Buzima (OMS) usaba abana bose gukingirwa indwara ya polio burundu. Urukingo rubiri rwakuyeho indwara ya polio mu bice byinshi by'isi, kandi rugabanya umubare w'abarwayi bavugwa buri mwaka uva ku bantu bagera ku 350.000 mu 1988 ugera kuri 33 mu 2018. \nUrukingo rwa polio rudakora rufite umutekano cyane. Gutukura gake cyangwa ububabare bishobora kugaragara aho umuntu atewe inshinge. Urukingo rwa polio ruterwa n'umunwa rutera abantu bagera kuri batatu barwaye poliomyelitis iterwa n'urukingo kuri buri doze miliyoni yatanzwe. Ibi bigereranywa n'abantu 5.000 kuri miliyoni barwaye indwara ya poliyo. Muri rusange byombi ni byiza gutanga iyo ndwara mu gihe utwite ndetse no ku bafite ubwandu bwa virusi itera SIDA ariko ubundi bakaba bameze neza. \nIcyegeranyo cya mbere cy\u2019urukingo rwa polio cyagenze neza cyakozwe na Hilary Koprowski mu 1950, hamwe na virusi nzima yagabanutse abantu banywa. Urukingo ntirwemerewe gukoreshwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ariko rwakoreshejwe neza ahandi. Urukingo rwa polio rudakora, rwakozwe nyuma y'imyaka mike na Jonas Salk, rwatangiye gukoreshwa mu 1955. Urukingo rwa polio rutandukanye, rukoreshwa mu kanwa, rwakozwe na Albert Sabin, rutangira gukoreshwa mu bucuruzi mu 1961. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Igiciro cya buri dose ku rukingo runyobwa mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere ni hafi 0.25$ y'Amerika guhera mu 2014. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, iyo fomu idakora igura hagati y\u2019amadolari 25 na 50."}
{"id": "23580", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23580", "title": "Hepatite B", "text": "Hepatite B ni indwara yandura iterwa na virusi ya hepatite B (HBV), yibasira umwijima. Ni bumwe mu bwoko bwa hepatite iterwa na virusi, kandi ishobora gutera ubwandu bw'igihe gito cyangwa ubwandu budakira. Abenshi nta bimenyetso bagaragaza, ariko ubwandu budakira bushobora gutera cirrhose na kanseri y'umwijima.\nIyi virusi yandura binyuze mu amaraso cyangwa amatembabuzi y'umubiri, cyane cyane ku mwana mu gihe cyo kuvuka. Indwara yirindwa hakoreshejwe urukingo kuva mu 1982. Mu 2024, abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 240 ku isi bari bafite hepatite B idakira.\nIbimenyetso.\nBishobora gutera indwara z\u2019ubwandu bw\u2019igikatu n\u2019ubwandu buhoraho. Mu ntangiriro nta bimenyetso bigaragara. Mu ndwara zikabije, bamwe bashobora kurwara vuba cyane, bakaruka, uruhu rw'umuhondo, umunaniro, inkari z'umukara n'ububabare bwo mu nda. Akenshi ibi bimenyetso bimara ibyumweru bike kandi ni gake cyane ubwandu bwa mbere butera urupfu. Bishobora gufata iminsi 30 kugeza kuri 180 kugira ngo ibimenyetso bitangire. Ku bantu bandura ahagana mu gihe cyo kuvuka, 90% barwara idakira mu gihe abatageze kuri 10% by'abandura nyuma y'imyaka itanu barwara. Abenshi mu bafite indwara zidakira nta bimenyetso baba bafite; icyakora, cirrhose na kanseri y'umwijima bishobora kugaragara. Kurwara cirrhose cyangwa kanseri y'umwijima bibaho hafi 25% by'abafite indwara zidakira.\nUko yandura.\nVirusi ya hepatite B ni imwe muri virusi eshanu z\u2019ingenzi za hepatite hamwe na A, C, D, na E. Iyi virusi ikwirakwira iyo umuntu ahuye n'amaraso yanduye cyangwa amazi yo mu mubiri. Kwandura indwara mu gihe cyo kuvuka cyangwa mu gihe cyo guhura n'amaraso y'abandi mu bwana ni bwo buryo bukunze gukoreshwa cyane mu kwandura indwara ya Hepatite B mu turere iyo ndwara ikunze kugaragaramo. Mu turere aho iyi ndwara idakunze kugaragara, gukoresha imiti iterwa mu mitsi no gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina ni byo bintu bikunze kwanduriramo abantu benshi. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera ibyago zirimo gukora mu buvuzi, guterwa amaraso, dialyse, kubana n'umuntu wanduye, gutembera mu bihugu aho igipimo cy'ubwandu kiri hejuru, no kuba mu kigo. Gushushanya tatouage no gushushanya acupuncture byatumye habaho umubare munini w\u2019abantu barwaye mu myaka ya za 1980; icyakora, ibi byagiye bigabanuka cyane bitewe no kunoza uburyo bwo gusukura ibikoresho. Virusi ntishobora kwanduzwa no gufatana amaboko, gusangira ibikoresho byo kuriramo, gusomana, guhoberana, gukorora, kwitsamura, cyangwa konsa.\nIsuzuma.\nUbwandu bushobora kumenyekana nyuma y'iminsi 30 kugeza kuri 60 nyuma yo kwandura. Ubusanzwe isuzuma ryemezwa no gupima amaraso kugira ngo harebwe ibice bimwe na bimwe bya virusi ndetse no kureba niba hari ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri burwanya virusi.\nKwirinda.\nAbana bavutse ku babyeyi barwaye hepatite B bashobora guhabwa immunoglobulin ya hepatite B n'urukingo igihe bavuka. Umuryango Mpuzamahanga wita ku Buzima usaba inkingo ku munsi wa mbere w\u2019ubuzima niba bishoboka. Hakenewe izindi doze ebyiri cyangwa eshatu nyuma kugira ngo zigire ingaruka nziza. Uru rukingo rukora hafi 95% by'igihe. Ibihugu bigera ku 180 byatanze uru rukingo nk'igice cya gahunda z'igihugu kugeza mu 2006. Birasabwa kandi ko amaraso yose apimwa hepatite B mbere yo guterwa amaraso, kandi agakingirizo kagakoreshwa mu kwirinda kwandura.\nKuvura.\nMu gihe cyo kwandura ubwandu bwa mbere, kwitabwaho bishingiye ku bimenyetso umuntu afite. Ku bantu barwaye indwara zidakira, imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi nka tenofovir, entecavir, cyangwa interferon ishobora kuba ingirakamaro; icyakora, iyi miti irahenze. Gusimbuza umwijima rimwe na rimwe bikoreshwa ku ndwara ya cirrhose.\nIkwirakwira.\nHafi kimwe cya gatatu cy'abatuye isi bamaze kwandura mu gihe kimwe mu buzima bwabo. Ku isi yose mu 2019, hari abantu miliyoni 296 barwaye indwara ya hepatite B, aho buri mwaka hagaragaye abantu bashya miliyoni 1.5. Impfu 820.000 zanditswe mu 2019. Mu 2024, Umuryango Mpuzamahanga wita ku Buzima wagereranyije ko abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 240 bari bafite hepatite B idakira, abandura bashya bakaba hafi ibihumbi 900 buri mwaka, naho impfu zikaba hafi miliyoni 1,1, ahanini zitewe na cirrhose na kanseri y'umwijima. Iyi ndwara ikunze kugaragara cyane mu turere tw\u2019Iburengerazuba bwa Pasifika no muri Afurika; abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 200 bose hamwe bakaba baribasiwe n\u2019iyi ndwara mu 2019. Mu 2019, abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 14 bagizweho ingaruka n\u2019iki cyorezo mu karere k\u2019i Burayi na miliyoni 5 muri Amerika. Nanone kwandura virusi itera SIDA, hepatite C, cyangwa hepatite D ni ibintu bisanzwe aho hepatite B ikunze kugaragara. Serivisi zo gupima no gukumira indwara ya Hepatite B zakunze kugira ingaruka mbi mu gihe cy'icyorezo cya COVID-19.\nAmateka.\nMbere byari bizwi nka \"hepatitis yo mu maraso\". Ubwandu bwakomeje kwirindwa hakoreshejwe inkingo kuva mu 1982."}
{"id": "23581", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23581", "title": "Gutera kw'imitsi mu buryo bwimbitse", "text": "Gutera kw'imitsi mu buryo bwimbitse (mu Cyongereza \"deep vein thrombosis\", DVT) ni indwara iterwa n'ikibumbe cy'amaraso (\"thrombus\") kirema mu mitsi yimbitse ijyana amaraso ku mutima, akenshi mu amaguru cyangwa mu kibuno. Ishobora gutera ububabare, kubyimba no gutukura kw'igice cyafashwe, ariko rimwe na rimwe nta bimenyetso igaragaza. Ingorane yayo ikomeye ni uko ikibumbe gishobora kwimukira mu bihaha (\"pulmonary embolism\", PE). DVT na PE bigize indwara imwe yitwa \"venous thromboembolism\" (VTE).\nIsuzumwa ahanini hakoreshejwe \"ultrasound\", ikavurwa n'imiti igabanya kuvura kw'amaraso (\"anticoagulants\"). Ibyago byayo byiyongera uko umuntu asaza, nyuma yo kubagwa, ku barwaye kanseri, cyangwa iyo umuntu amara igihe kirekire adahaguruka.\nIbimenyetso n'ingorane.\nDVT ni ikibumbe cy'amaraso kirema mu mitsi yimbitse, akenshi mu maguru cyangwa mu kibuno. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba ububabare, kubyimba, gutukura no kwaguka kw'imitsi mu gice cyafashwe, ariko bamwe nta bimenyetso bagira. Bigereranywa ko 4\u201310% bya DVT bifata amaboko.\nIngorane ikunze kubaho vuba ni uko igice cy'ikibumbe gitandukana, kikanyura mu ruhande rw'iburyo rw'umutima, kikaziba umutsi ujyana amaraso mu bihaha (\"pulmonary embolism\"). Mu gihe kirekire, DVT ishobora gutera \"post-thrombotic syndrome\": ububabare, kubyimba, kumva ukuguru kuremereye, uburyaryate ndetse n'ibisebe mu bihe bikomeye. VTE yongera kugaruka ku bagera kuri 30% mu myaka icumi ikurikira iya mbere.\nImpamvu n'ibyongera ibyago.\nIkibumbe cy'amaraso kirema iyo amaraso adatembera neza, iyo amaraso arushaho kuvura vuba, cyangwa iyo urukuta rw'umutsi rwangiritse. Ibyongera ibyago birimo kubagwa vuba aha, gusaza, kanseri, umubyibuho ukabije, amateka y'umuntu cyangwa ay'umuryango we ya VTE, ibikomere, kumara igihe kirekire udahaguruka, imiti y'imisemburo yo kuboneza urubyaro, gutwita n'igihe gikurikira kubyara, ndetse n'indwara ya \"antiphospholipid syndrome\".\nUruhererekane rusobanura hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'ibyago. Muri izo mpamvu harimo ubwoko bw'amaraso butari O, kubura antithrombin, poroteyine C cyangwa poroteyine S, n'ihinduka rya \"factor V Leiden\" na \"prothrombin G20210A\".\nGusuzuma.\nUmuntu ukekwaho DVT abanza gusuzumwa hakoreshejwe amanota yo guhanura nk'aya Wells. Isuzuma ry'amaraso rya \"D-dimer\" rifasha gukuraho iyo ndwara cyangwa kwerekana ko hakenewe andi masuzuma. Isuzuma ryemezwa ahanini na \"ultrasound\" y'imitsi ikekwaho.\nKuvura no kwirinda.\nKuvura bikorwa ahanini n'imiti igabanya kuvura kw'amaraso (\"anticoagulants\"), nka rivaroxaban, apixaban na warfarin. Gutangira warfarin bisaba indi miti ikora ako kanya, akenshi inshinge za heparin.\nKwirinda muri rusange ni ukwirinda umubyibuho ukabije no gukomeza gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri. Nyuma yo kubagwa, kubyuka no kugenda hakiri kare kandi kenshi ni uburyo bwo kwirinda budafite ingaruka mbi. Ku babagwa bafite ibyago byinshi, hakoreshwa imiti igabanya kuvura kw'amaraso cyangwa \"aspirine\", hamwe n'ibikoresho bikanda amaguru hakoreshejwe umwuka (\"intermittent pneumatic compression\").\nIkwirakwizwa.\nAbantu bagera kuri 5\u201311% barwara VTE mu buzima bwabo, kandi iyo ndwara irushaho kuboneka uko imyaka yiyongera. Abafite imyaka 65 kuzamura bafite ibyago byikubye inshuro 15 ugereranyije n'abafite imyaka 40 cyangwa munsi yayo. Amakuru ahari ahanini yakusanyijwe mu Burayi no muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru; abakomoka muri Aziya n'Abanyamerika bakomoka mu bihugu bivuga Icyesipanyolo bafite ibyago bike ugereranyije n'abazungu cyangwa abirabura."}
{"id": "23582", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23582", "title": "Indwara ya Chagas", "text": "Indwara ya Chagas, izwi kandi nka \"American trypanosomiasis\", ni indwara yo mu turere dushyuha iterwa n'agakoko \"Trypanosoma cruzi\". Ikwirakwizwa cyane cyane n'udukoko twa \"Triatominae\", tuzwi nka \u00abudukoko dusomana\u00bb. Mu ntangiriro, ibimenyetso akenshi ntibigaragara cyangwa biba byoroheje, ariko nyuma y'imyaka myinshi indwara ishobora kwangiza umutima n'urwungano ngogozi.\nBivugwa ko abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 8 banduye, cyane cyane muri Megizike, Amerika yo Hagati na Amerika y\u2019Epfo, kandi ihitana abarenga 10 000 buri mwaka. Yasobanuwe bwa mbere mu 1909 n'umuganga w'Umunyaburezile Carlos Chagas, ari na we yitiriwe.\nUko yandura.\n\"Trypanosoma cruzi\" ikunze kwandurira mu bantu no mu zindi nyamaswa iyo zirumwe n'udukoko dusomana. Iyi ndwara ishobora kandi kwandurira mu guterwa amaraso, mu guterwa ingingo, mu kurya ibiryo byanduye, no kuva kuri nyina kugeza ku mwana we atwite cyangwa avuka. Agakoko gafata ubwoko burenga 150 bw'inyamaswa.\nIbimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso birahinduka uko ubwandu bugenda. Mu cyiciro cya mbere, kimara nk'amezi abiri, ibimenyetso akenshi ntibigaragara cyangwa bikaba byoroheje: umuriro, kubyimba kw'inturugunyu, kuribwa umutwe, cyangwa kubyimba aho umuntu yarumwe. Nyuma yaho, abantu binjira mu cyiciro cy'indwara idakira, akenshi idatanga ibimenyetso.\nNyuma y'imyaka 10 kugeza kuri 30, kugeza kuri kimwe cya gatatu cy'abanduye barwara indwara z'umutima, zishobora gutuma umutima unanirwa. Umwe ku icumi agira ingorane zo mu rwungano ngogozi (nko kwaguka k'umuhogo cyangwa k'urura runini), iz'imitsi cyangwa zombi.\nGusuzuma.\nMu cyiciro cya mbere, indwara isuzumwa hashakishwa agakoko mu maraso hakoreshejwe mikorosikopi, cyangwa hashakishwa ADN yako hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa \"polymerase chain reaction\" (PCR). Indwara idakira ivumburwa no kubona antibodies za \"T. cruzi\" mu maraso.\nKwirinda no kuvura.\nKwirinda bibanda ku kurandura udukoko dusomana no kwirinda kurumwa natwo, urugero hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko cyangwa inzitiramibu. Izindi ngamba zirimo gusuzuma amaraso n'ingingo bigiye guterwa abandi, no gusuzuma abana bavutse ku babyeyi banduye. Kugeza mu 2026, nta rukingo ruraboneka.\nUbwandu bwa vuba buvurwa n'imiti ya benznidazole cyangwa nifurtimox, ikora neza iyo itanzwe hakiri kare, ariko imbaraga zayo zikagabanuka uko umuntu amaze igihe kinini yanduye. Iyo ikoreshejwe mu ndwara idakira, ishobora gutinza cyangwa gukumira ibimenyetso bya nyuma. Iyi miti ikunze gutera ingaruka mbi (indwara z'uruhu, kurakara mu gifu, ibimenyetso by'imitsi) ku bantu bakuru bagera kuri 40%, kandi ntihabwa abagore batwite cyangwa abafite ibibazo by'impyiko cyangwa umwijima. Imiti mishya n'inkingo z'igerageza biracyakorwaho ubushakashatsi.\nIkwirakwizwa.\nIndwara ya Chagas iboneka cyane cyane mu bihugu 21 byo muri Amerika y'Epfo n'iyo Hagati, ariko ubwandu bwabonetse mu bihugu 44. Abantu barenga miliyoni 100 bafite ibyago byo kwandura. Abenshi mu barwayi ni abakene, kandi abenshi ntibazi ko banduye. Ubwimukira bw'abaturage bwatumye iboneka no mu bindi bihugu, birimo ibyo mu Uburayi na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ishyirwa mu cyiciro cy'indwara zo mu turere dushyuha zirengagijwe.\nAmateka.\nIyi ndwara yasobanuwe bwa mbere ku muntu ku wa 14 Mata 1909 n'umuganga w'Umunyaburezile (Burezile) Carlos Chagas, ari na we yitiriwe. Kuva mu 2019, tariki ya 14 Mata yizihizwa nk'Umunsi Mpuzamahanga w'Indwara ya Chagas."}
{"id": "23583", "revid": "19155", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23583", "title": "Nakaayi Dorcus", "text": "Nakaayi Dorcus (wavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 2019) ni umukinnyi wa filime muto w\u2019u Uganda. Akazi ke kaba mu gihe cyo gukura kw\u2019inganda y\u2019amashusho n\u2019amashusho y\u2019ubwigenge y\u2019u Uganda, aho habayeho kongera kw\u2019ikorerwa ry\u2019amakinamico mu ndimi z\u2019igihugu, kongera kw\u2019ishoramari mu birimo by\u2019igihugu n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019abakinyi bato mu serisi zibanda ku muryango, uburezi n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019abaturage.\nUbuzima bwo hambere n\u2019amashuri.\nNakaayi Dorcus yavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 2019 mu Karere ka Mpigi, Uganda. Yatangiye amashuri abanza ku Upendo Christian School hanyuma yinjira Kibibi Junior School mu Karere ka Butambala, aho yigira. Nakaayi ni umwana wa gatatu mu muryango wabo.\nUmwuga.\nDorcus yatangiye gukina binyuze mu birimo by\u2019ubwigenge by\u2019aho hantu mu 2024 mbere yo kugaragara mu makinamico ya televiziyo. Harimo \"No Time\" (Sezoni ya Mbere n\u2019Iya Kabiri), \"Omunanfusi\" na \"Jealous (S.1)\" izwi kandi nka \"Obujja\", byose byerekana kuri Makula TV na Makula Kika. Gahunda ye yo gufata amafilime yateguwe hagereranywa n\u2019ikarita y\u2019ishuri kugira ngo uburezi bugume ari bwo butandukanye."}
{"id": "23584", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23584", "title": "Lisinopril", "text": "Lisinopril ni umuti wo mu bwoko bwa angiotensin-converting enzyme (ACE) inhibitor ukoreshwa mu kuvura umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, kunanirwa k'umutima, ndetse no nyuma y'indwara z'umutima. Ku muvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, ubusanzwe ni uburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura, nubwo ku bantu b'abirabura imiti igabanya umuvuduko wa kalisiyumu cyangwa imiti igabanya ubukana bwa thiazide ikora neza. Ikoreshwa kandi mu gukumira ibibazo by'impyiko ku bantu barwaye diyabete. Lisinopril ifatwa n'umunwa. Ingaruka zuzuye zishobora gufata ibyumweru bine kugira ngo ziboneke.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuribwa umutwe, isereri, kumva unaniwe, inkorora, isesemi, no kurwara ibisebe. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo umuvuduko muke w'amaraso, ibibazo by'umwijima, potasiyumu nyinshi mu maraso, na angioedema. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyose cyo gutwita kuko ishobora kwangiza umwana. Lisinopril ikora mu kubuza sisitemu ya renin-angiotensin-aldosterone.\nLisinopril yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1978, yemererwa gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1987. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ikiguzi cyo kugurisha ku kwezi cyari munsi y'amadolari y'Amerika 0.70 mu 2018. Mu Bwongereza byatwaye NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u20a410 ku kwezi mu 2018. Mu 2017, ni wo muti wakunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni 104. Muri Nyakanga 2016, umuti wa lisinopril wo mu kanwa wemejwe gukoreshwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika."}
{"id": "23585", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23585", "title": "Sodium nitrite (ikoreshwa ry'ubuvuzi)", "text": "Sodium nitrite ikoreshwa nk'umuti hamwe na sodium thiosulfate mu kuvura uburozi bwa cyanide. Bigirwa inama gusa mu gihe habayeho uburozi bukomeye bwa cyanide. Ku bantu bafite uburozi bwa cyanide na carbon monoxide, uburozi bwa sodium thiosulfate ubwabwo bukunze kuba bwiza. Itangwa mu guterwa buhoro buhoro mu mitsi.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi, kuribwa umutwe, guhumeka nabi, guta ubwenge no kuruka. Abantu bafite indwara z'umutima bagomba kwitabwaho cyane. Igipimo cya methemoglobini mu bantu kigomba gusuzumwa buri gihe mu gihe cyo kuvurwa. Nubwo bitarasuzumwa neza mu gihe cyo gutwita, hari ibimenyetso bimwe na bimwe bigaragaza ingaruka zishobora kugaragara ku mwana. Bivugwa ko sodium nitrite ikora mu gukora methemoglobini hanyuma igafata cyanide bityo ikayikura muri mitochondria.\nSodium nitrite yatangiye gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu myaka ya 1920 na 1930. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi rw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Igiciro muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika hamwe na sodium thiosulfate ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 110."}
{"id": "23586", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23586", "title": "Indwara yo kongera kugaburira", "text": "Indwara yo kongera kugaburira abana ni indwara ishobora kubaho nyuma yo kongera kurya nyuma y'igihe kirekire umuntu atarya. Bishobora kandi kubaho no mu mirire mu buryo bw'imirire yose ya parenteral. Bishobora gutuma fosifate nkeya, manyeziyumu nkeya, potasiyumu nkeya, na thiamine nkeya. Ibi bishobora gutera intege nke, kugabanuka k'ubuhumekero, kudahuza neza kw'imikorere y'umubiri, urujijo, gucika intege, no kurwara umutima.\nIbintu bishobora gutera ingorane birimo ibibazo byo kurya, ubusinzi, nyuma yo kubagwa, imirire mibi idakira, kubagwa ibibari, n'indwara zo mu mara ziterwa no kubyimba. Uburyo bw'ibanze bukubiyemo kwiyongera kw'isukari mu maraso bigatuma urugero rwa insuline rwiyongera bigatuma uturemangingo twinjiza potasiyumu na fosifate. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku kugabanuka k'urugero rwa fosifate, potasiyumu, cyangwa manyeziyumu mu maraso. Indwara yoroheje ni ukugabanuka kwa 10 kugeza kuri 20%, indwara iringaniye igabanukaho 20 kugeza kuri 30%, naho indwara ikomeye igabanukaho kurenza 30%.\nKuvura ni ukwiyongera buhoro buhoro kwa karori. Mu masaha 24 ya mbere, ni ngombwa gukoresha kcal 10 kugeza kuri 20/kg cyangwa se nturenze kimwe cya kabiri cy'ingufu umuntu akeneye. Inyongeramusaruro za Thiamine bigomba gutangwa hakiri kare. Inyongeramusaruro za Potasiyumu, fosifeta, kalisiyumu na manyeziyumu nazo zikunze gusabwa. Electrolyte zigomba gupimwa buri masaha 12 ku ikubitiro.\nInshuro indwara yo kongera kugaburira abana ntabwo iramenyekana neza. Ubushakashatsi bumwe bwagaragaje ko igipimo kiri hagati ya 0.5% na 18% mu bantu bari mu bitaro. Ibisobanuro bya none by'iyi ndwara byatangiye mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. Nubwo bimeze gutyo, hari byinshi byasobanuwe mbere ku bantu bapfa nyuma yo kurya nyuma y\u2019inzara mu mateka."}
{"id": "23587", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23587", "title": "Methotrexate", "text": "Methotrexate (MTX), yahoze izwi nka amethopterin, ni umuti uvura kanseri y'imiti kandi ugabanya ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri. Ikoreshwa mu kuvura kanseri, indwara ziterwa n'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri, gutwita hanze y'urugo, no mu gukuramo inda kwa muganga. Ubwoko bwa kanseri ikoreshwa harimo kanseri y'ibere, kanseri y'amaraso, kanseri y'ibihaha, kanseri ya kanseri y'imitsi, indwara yo mu gihe cyo gutwita, na kanseri y'ibihaha. Ubwoko bw'indwara ziterwa n'ubwiyongere bw'umubiri ikoreshwamo harimo, rubagimpande, na Crohn's disease. Ishobora gutangwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa inshinge.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, kumva umunaniro, umuriro, ibyago byinshi byo kwandura, umubare muke w'uturemangingo tw'amaraso yera, no kwangirika k'uruhu mu kanwa. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo indwara y'umwijima, indwara y'ibihaha, lymphoma, n'uduheri twinshi tw'uruhu. Abantu bavurwa igihe kirekire bagomba gupimwa buri gihe ingaruka mbi. Ntabwo ari byiza mu gihe cyo konsa. Ku bafite ibibazo by'impyiko, hashobora kuba ngombwa ko bagabanya dose. Ikora mu kubuza umubiri gukoresha aside folike.\nMethotrexate yakozwe mu 1947, itangira gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu kuvura kanseri, kuko yari ifite uburozi buke ugereranyije n\u2019ubuvuzi bwakoreshwaga icyo gihe. Mu 1956 yatanze uburyo bwa mbere bwo kuvura kanseri yateye. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Methotrexate iboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ntabwo bihenze. Igiciro cyo kugurisha ku isoko mu 2014 mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati y'amadolari y'Amerika 0.06 na 0.36 ku munsi ku ifishi ifatwa mu kanwa. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ukwezi gusanzwe ko kuvurwa kugura hagati y'amadolari 25 na 50. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 117 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni esheshatu."}
{"id": "23588", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23588", "title": "Colchicine", "text": "Colchicine ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ya goutte n'indwara ya Beh\u00e7et. Ku ndwara ya goutte, ntabwo ikundwa cyane kuruta imiti igabanya ubukana bwa NSAID cyangwa steroid. Izindi ngamba zirimo kwirinda indwara ya pericarditis n'indwara y'imitsi yo mu muryango ya Mediterane. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kurwara igifu, cyane cyane iyo umuntu afashe dose nyinshi. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kugabanuka k'uturemangingo tw'amaraso no kwangirika kwa rhabdomyolysis. Umutekano w'ikoreshwa ry'iyi mashini mu gihe cyo gutwita ntuzwi neza mu gihe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo konsa bisa n'aho nta kibazo. Kugabanya urugero rw'ibinini bishobora gutera urupfu. Colchicine ikora mu kugabanya ububyimbirwe binyuze mu buryo butandukanye.\nColchicine, mu ishusho ya crocus yo mu gihe cy'umuhindo, yakoreshejwe kuva mu 1500 mbere ya Yesu mu kuvura kubyimba kw'ingingo. Yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1961. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Mu Bwongereza, ibicuruzwa by'ukwezi bitwara NHS amapawundi 7 kugeza mu 2019 mu gihe muri Kanada ari amapawundi 10 kugeza mu 2021. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 252. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 201 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni ebyiri."}
{"id": "23589", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23589", "title": "Necrosis y'imitsi", "text": "Indwara yo mu mitsi (AVN), yitwa kandi osteonecrosis cyangwa ihungabana ry'amagufwa, ni urupfu rw'imitsi y'amagufwa bitewe no kubura kw'amaraso. Mu ntangiriro, hashobora kuba nta bimenyetso bihari. Buhoro buhoro ububabare bw'ingingo bushobora kugaragara, ibyo bikaba bishobora kugabanya ubushobozi bwo kugenda. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kugwa kw'igufwa cyangwa igice cy'ingingo cyegereye.\nIbintu bikunze gutera ingaruka ni inzoga nyinshi n'imisemburo ya steroide nyinshi. Izindi ngaruka zirimo kuvunika amagufwa, gucika kw'ingingo, indwara ya sickle cell, lupus, no kwibira mu mazi ya SCUBA. Iyo ndwara ishobora no kubaho nta mpamvu igaragara. Igufwa rikunze kwibasirwa cyane ni femur. Izindi mbuga zikunze kugaragara zirimo igufwa ryo hejuru ry'ukuboko, ivi, urutugu, n'akaguru. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bikorwa hakoreshejwe amashusho ya muganga nka X-ray, CT scan, cyangwa MRI. Ni gake cyane hashobora gukoreshwa biopsy.\nUburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo imiti, kudakora ku kuguru kwangiritse, kunanura imitsi no kubagwa. Akenshi kubagwa biba ngombwa kandi bishobora kuba birimo gukuramo core decompression, osteotomy, grafting foromaje, cyangwa gusimbuza ingingo. Abantu bagera ku 15.000 bandura buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Abantu bafite hagati y'imyaka 30 na 50 ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa n'iyi ndwara. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore."}
{"id": "23590", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23590", "title": "Aneurysm", "text": "Aneurysm ni ikibyimba gisa n'ibendera ry'umuhondo, akenshi, mu mitsi. Akenshi mu ntangiriro nta bimenyetso biragaragara. Iyo ibimenyetso bigaragaye, biterwa n'aho aneurysm iherereye kandi bishobora kuba birimo kuribwa umutwe, kubabara mu nda, kubabara umugongo, no guhungabana kw'amaraso. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kurema kw'ibibyimba cyangwa gucika kw'ibibyimba. \nIbintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo amateka y'umuryango, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, cholesterol nyinshi, kunywa itabi, no gukomereka k'imitsi y'amaraso. Nubwo imitsi iyo ari yo yose ishobora kugira ingaruka, ikunze kugaragara muri aorta (AA). Izindi ndwara zirimo ubwonko, umutsi wo mu bwoko bwa popliteal, umutsi wo mu bwoko bwa mesenteric, umutsi wo mu mutima, n'umutsi wo mu bwoko bwa splenic. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku isuzuma ry\u2019indwara.\nUburyo bwo kuvura bushobora kuba burimo guhindura imibereho no kubagwa. Igihe kubagwa bisabwe biterwa n'imitsi ivugwa. Gusana AAA muri rusange bigirwa inama ku burebure bwa cm 5, mu gihe aneurysms zo mu bwonko muri rusange zisanwa iyo zifite uburebure bwa mm 7 cyangwa bunini cyangwa zigasaba inzira y'amaraso inyuma. Imitsi yo mu maboko muri rusange isanwa vuba iyo ibonetse mu gihe iyo mu maguru isanwa iyo ingano yayo ibaye inshuro ebyiri.\nImitsi y'ubwonko igira ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri 4%, mu gihe imitsi y'amaraso ifata imitsi y'ubwonko igira ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri 2.5%. Abantu bakuze ni bo bashobora kwibasirwa cyane. Ibisobanuro by'ibintu byizewe ko ari aneurysms biboneka mu nyandiko za kera zo mu Misiri no mu Buhinde. Iryo jambo rikomoka kuri, \"aneurysma\", bisobanura \"ubugari\". "}
{"id": "23591", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23591", "title": "Ephedrine", "text": "Ephedrine ni umuti kandi utera imbaraga. Ikunze gukoreshwa mu gukumira umuvuduko w'amaraso uri hasi mu gihe cyo gusinziriza uruti rw'umugongo. Yanakoreshejwe mu kuvura asima, indwara yo kubura ibinure (narcolepsy), n'umubyibuho ukabije ariko si bwo buryo bwiza bwo kuvura. Nta kamaro gasobanutse neza mu kubyimba izuru. Ishobora gufatwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu guterwa mu mitsi, mu mitsi, cyangwa munsi y'uruhu. Gutangira gukoreshwa mu mitsi bihita byihuta, mu gihe gutera mu mitsi bishobora gufata iminota 20, kandi mu kanwa bishobora gufata isaha kugira ngo bigire ingaruka. Iyo itewe mu buryo bw'urushinge imara isaha imwe kandi iyo inyowe mu kanwa ishobora kumara amasaha ane.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kugorwa no gusinzira, guhangayika, kuribwa umutwe, kubona ibintu mu buryo butunguranye, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, umutima utera cyane, kubura ubushake bwo kurya, no kunanirwa kwihagarika. Ingaruka mbi zikomeye zirimo gucika imitsi y'amaraso mu bwonko, indwara z'umutima, no guhohoterwa. Nubwo bishobora kuba ari umutekano mu gihe cyo gutwita, ikoreshwa ryayo muri aba bantu ntiryizweho neza. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo konsa. Ephedrine ikora mu kongera imikorere ya \u03b1 na \u03b2 adrenergic receptors.\nEphedrine yakuweho bwa mbere mu 1885 itangira gukoreshwa mu bucuruzi mu 1926. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Igiciro cy'igurishwa ku giciro kinini mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 0.69\u20131.35 kuri buri dose. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ntabwo bihenze cyane. Ubusanzwe iboneka mu bimera byo mu bwoko bwa Ephedra. Inyongeramusaruro zirimo ephedrine ntizemewe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, usibye izikoreshwa mu buvuzi gakondo bw'Abashinwa, aho m\u00e1 hu\u00e1ng igaragara."}
{"id": "23592", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23592", "title": "Urukingo rwa BCG", "text": "Urukingo rwa Bacillus Calmette\u2013Gu\u00e9rin (BCG) ni urukingo rukoreshwa cyane cyane mu kurwanya igituntu. Mu bihugu aho igituntu cyangwa ibibembe bikunze kugaragara, ni byiza ko abana bazima barwara doze imwe gusa. Mu turere aho igituntu kidakunze kugaragara, abana bari mu kaga gakomeye ni bo bonyine bakunze gukingirwa, mu gihe abakekwaho kuba baranduye igituntu bapimwa kandi bakavurwa. Abantu bakuru badafite igituntu batarakingirwa mbere ariko bakunze guhura n\u2019iki cyorezo nabo bashobora kukingirwa. BCG ifite kandi akamaro mu kurwanya igisebe cya Buruli n'izindi ndwara za mycobacteria zitari iz'igituntu. Hari igihe ikoreshwa nk'igice cy'ubuvuzi bwa kanseri y'uruhago.\nIgipimo cy'uburinzi ku ndwara y'igituntu kiratandukanye kandi uburinzi bumara imyaka makumyabiri. Mu bana birinda hafi 20% kwandura indwara kandi mu bandura birinda kimwe cya kabiri cyazo kurwara. Urukingo rutangwa hakoreshejwe urushinge mu ruhu. Nta gihamya kigaragaza ko ingero z'inyongera ari ingirakamaro.\nIngaruka mbi zikomeye ni gake cyane. Akenshi habaho gutukura, kubyimba, n'ububabare buke aho watewe inshinge. Igisebe gito gishobora no kuvuka gifite inkovu nyuma yo gukira. Ingaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara cyane kandi zishobora kuba zikomeye ku bantu bafite ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri budakora neza. Ntabwo ari byiza kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita. Urukingo rwakozwe bwa mbere rukomoka kuri \"Mycobacterium bovis\", ikunze kuboneka mu nka. Nubwo yacitse intege, iracyariho.\nUrukingo rwa BCG rwakoreshejwe bwa mbere mu buvuzi mu 1921. Iri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima. Hagati ya 2011 na 2014 igiciro cya bulijanseri cyari hagati ya 0.20 na 1.10$ y'Amerika kuri doze imwe mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bigura amadolari y'Amerika 100 kugeza 200. Guhera mu 2004, urukingo ruhabwa abana bagera kuri miliyoni 100 buri mwaka ku isi."}
{"id": "23593", "revid": "5728", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23593", "title": "Kuvase (Vasectomy)", "text": "Kuvasectomy ni uburyo bwo kubaga abagabo kugira ngo bakureho burundu. Kugira ngo intanga zikore neza, nibura amezi 3 n'amezi 20 birakenewe, ibi bikaba bigomba kwemezwa no gusesengura amasohoro. Igipimo cy'inanirwa kuri iyi ngingo ni hafi 1 kuri 2.000. Muri rusange ni uburyo buhoraho bwo kuboneza urubyaro; ariko, uburyo bwo kugabanya imbyaro burimo guhindura intanga no kugarura intanga hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo guterateranya intanga mu buryo bwa vitro.\nNubwo muri rusange nta kibazo kirimo, ingaruka mbi ziri hagati ya 1 na 2% zishobora kuba zirimo hematoma cyangwa ubwandu. Indwara y'ububabare nyuma yo kuva mu ivuriro bishobora kugaragara kugeza kuri 6%. Ntabwo bihindura imikorere y'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Muri rusange bisaba gukuraho agace ka buri vas deferens no gufunga impera z'intanga ngabo, ibyo bigatuma intanga ngabo zitajya mu gitsina bityo bigatuma intanga ngabo zidakora.\nUbu buryo bukunze gukorerwa kwa muganga ushyushye. Amavuta yo kwisiga ashobora gushyirwaho mbere yo gukonjesha hakoreshejwe inshinge. Umusatsi urakurwaho hanyuma agace gasukurwa. Udukoko tw\u2019imitsi dushyirwa hafi y\u2019uruhu hagati y\u2019intanga ngabo n\u2019igitsina gabo. Kugira ngo ugere ku ruhu, uruhu ruri hejuru rushobora gucibwa n'icyuma cyo kuvura cyangwa gufungurwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gukata ibyuma mu buryo butarimo icyuma cyo kuvura. Igice cy'umuyoboro w'amazi gikurwaho impera zisigaye zigacibwa cyangwa zigafungwa hanyuma zigatwikwa. Parasetamol (acetaminophen) na NSAIDs bishobora gufatwa ku bubabare. Guterura ibintu biremereye no gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina ntibisabwa mu cyumweru kimwe nyuma yaho.\nUbu buryo bwakozwe bwa mbere mu 1899 na Reginald Harrison. Guhera mu 2020, ikoreshwa n'abagore miliyoni 17 bakuze kubyara (1.8%) nk'uburyo bwo kuboneza urubyaro. Iri ni igabanuka rivuye kuri 6% mu 1995. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ubu buryo muri rusange buhendutse munsi ya 1.000 USD mu 2021; buhendutse ugereranyije na tubal ligation."}
{"id": "23594", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23594", "title": "Indwara ya Treacher Collins", "text": "Indwara ya Treacher Collins (TCS) ni indwara iterwa n'uturemangingo tw'amatwi, amaso, amagufwa y'amatako n'akananwa. Ariko, urugero umuntu agiramo ingaruka rushobora gutandukana kuva ku rugero rworoshye kugeza ku rugero rukomeye. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo ibibazo byo guhumeka, ibibazo byo kutabona neza, gucikamo ibice mu kanwa no kutumva neza. Abagiraho ingaruka muri rusange baba bafite ubwenge busanzwe.\nUbusanzwe TCS ni yo ikoresha autosomal cyane. Inshuro zirenga kimwe cya kabiri bibaho bitewe n\u2019impinduka nshya aho kuba byararazwe n\u2019ababyeyi b\u2019umuntu. Utunyangingo tw\u2019umubiri dushobora kuba turimo \"TCOF1\", \"POLR1C\", cyangwa \"POLR1D\". Isuzuma muri rusange rikekwaho hashingiwe ku bimenyetso na X-rays, kandi rishobora kwemezwa n'ibizamini bya genetiki.\nIndwara ya Treacher Collins ntabwo ivurwa. Ibimenyetso bishobora gukemurwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo kubaga, uburyo bwo kumva, uburyo bwo kuvura indwara, n'ibindi bikoresho bifasha umuntu. Icyizere cy'ubuzima muri rusange ni ibisanzwe. TCS ibaho ku muntu umwe mu bantu 50.000. Iyi ndwara yitiriwe Edward Treacher Collins, umuganga w\u2019inzobere mu kubaga amaso w\u2019Umwongereza, wasobanuye imiterere yayo y\u2019ingenzi mu 1900."}
{"id": "23595", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23595", "title": "Tadalafil", "text": "Tadalafil, igurishwa ku izina rya Cialis n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura ikibazo cyo guhagarara k'uburemba (ED), hyperplasia y'uburemba (BPH), n'umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso mu bihaha. Ni ikinini gifatwa mu kanwa. Gutangira kwa muganga akenshi biba mu gihe cy'igice cy'isaha kandi igihe kigera ku masaha 36.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo kuribwa umutwe, kubabara imitsi, uruhu rusa n'isesemi. Kwitonda ni ngombwa ku bantu bafite indwara z'umutima n'imitsi. Ingaruka mbi zidasanzwe ariko zikomeye zirimo guhagarara igihe kirekire bishobora kwangiza igitsina cy'umugabo, ibibazo byo kutabona no kutumva neza. Tadalafil ntiyemerwa ku bantu bafata imiti igabanya ubukana bwa nitrovasodilators nka nitroglycerin, kuko ibi bishobora gutuma umuvuduko w'amaraso ugabanuka cyane. Tadalafil ni umuti ubuza PDE5 kongera amaraso ajya mu gitsina bitewe n'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Nanone kandi, bigabanya umuvuduko w'amaraso mu bihaha, bigatuma imitsi yo mu bihaha igabanuka.\nTadalafil yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2003. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika no mu Bwongereza. Mu Bwongereza byatwaye NHS amafaranga agera kuri 80p kuri dose imwe kugeza mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 1.91. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 282 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni imwe."}
{"id": "23596", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23596", "title": "Temazepam", "text": "Temazepam, igurishwa ku mazina y'ikirango cya Restoril n'ibindi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura ibibazo byo gusinzira. Gukoresha bene ubwo buryo muri rusange bigomba kuba mu gihe kiri munsi y'iminsi icumi. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ingaruka muri rusange zitangira mu isaha imwe kandi zimara amasaha umunani.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gusinzira, guhangayika, urujijo no kuzerera. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kubona ibintu nk'ibi, guhohoterwa, guhangayika no kwiyahura. Muri rusange ntibisabwa kuyikoresha hamwe n'imiti igabanya ubukana bw'ibiyobyabwenge (opioids). Iyo igipimo kigabanutse cyane, guhagarika imiti bishobora kubaho. Gukoresha iyo miti mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa ntibyemewe. Temazepam ni benzodiazepine ikora neza kandi ikora ku mutima. Ikora mu kugira ingaruka kuri GABA mu bwonko.\nTemazapam yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoresha imiti mu 1962, itangira gukoreshwa mu buvuzi mu 1969. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. Ku kwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a31.40 mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi amadolari y'Amerika 1.76. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 142 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni enye."}
{"id": "23597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23597", "title": "Allergique", "text": "Ibintu bikunze gutera ubwivumbure birimo impongo n'ibiribwa bimwe na bimwe. Ibyuma n'ibindi bintu nabyo bishobora guteza ibibazo. Ibiryo, kurumwa n'udukoko, n'imiti ni byo bintu bikunze gutera ingaruka zikomeye. Iterambere ryabyo riterwa n'ibintu bigize imiterere y'umubiri ndetse n'ibidukikije. Uburyo bw\u2019ibanze bugizwe n\u2019uturemangingo twa immunoglobulin E (IgE), igice cy\u2019ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri, buhuza n\u2019ikintu kitera ubwivumbure hanyuma bugahuza n\u2019agace kabugenewe kari ku turemangingo twa mast cyangwa basophil aho gatuma habaho irekurwa ry\u2019ibinyabutabire bitera ububyimbirwe nka histamine. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku mateka y'ubuzima bw'umuntu. Gusuzuma uruhu cyangwa amaraso bishobora kuba ingirakamaro mu bihe bimwe na bimwe. Icyakora, ibizamini byagaragaje ko ari byiza bishobora kutagaragaza ko hari ubwivumbure bukomeye kuri iyi ngano.\nGuhura n'ibintu bishobora gutera ubwivumbure hakiri kare bishobora kuba inzitizi. Uburyo bwo kuvura allergie burimo kwirinda ibintu bizwiho gutera allergie no gukoresha imiti nka steroide na antihistamines. Imiti ivura indwara zo mu mutwe (antihistamines) ikunzwe cyane ni imiti idatuma umuntu aruhuka nka loratidine. Mu gihe cy\u2019ingaruka zikomeye, adrenaline (epinephrine) iterwa mu nganda irasabwa. Kuvura indwara ziterwa n'ubwivumbure bw'umubiri (allergen immunotherapy), ishyira abantu mu kaga gakomeye kandi gakomeye ku bintu bishobora gutuma umuntu arwara indwara ziterwa n\u2019ubwivumbure, ni ingirakamaro ku bwoko bumwe na bumwe bw\u2019ubwivumbure nk\u2019ibicurane by\u2019ibyatsi ndetse n\u2019ingaruka zo kurumwa n\u2019udukoko. Ikoreshwa ryayo mu ndwara ziterwa n'ibiribwa ntirirasobanutse neza. \nAllergie ni ikintu gisanzwe. Mu bihugu byateye imbere, abantu bagera kuri 20% bibasirwa na rhinitis y\u2019ubwivumbure, abantu bagera kuri 6% bafite nibura ubwivumbure bumwe mu biribwa, naho abagera kuri 20% bafite dermatitis y\u2019ibicurane mu gihe runaka. Bitewe n'igihugu, abantu bagera kuri 1\u201318% barwaye asima. Anaphylaxis ibaho hagati ya 0.05\u20132% by'abantu. Igipimo cy'indwara nyinshi ziterwa n'ubwivumbure gisa n'aho kirimo kwiyongera. Ijambo \"allergie\" ryakoreshejwe bwa mbere na Clemens von Pirquet mu 1906."}
{"id": "23598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23598", "title": "Cannabidiol", "text": "Cannabidiol (CBD) ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe zifata ibice by'umubiri, Lennox-Gastaut na Dravet syndrome. Ikoreshwa hamwe na clobazam. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Ibimenyetso ntibihagije kugira ngo bishyigikire ikoreshwa ryayo mu guhangayika, indwara zo mu mutwe, cyangwa ububabare kugeza mu 2019.\nIngaruka zikunze kugaragara zirimo gushyukwa, impiswi, umunaniro, gusinzira nabi, no kugira ibisebe. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo ibibazo by'umwijima no kwiyahura. Gukoresha iyo ndwara mu gihe utwite bishobora kwangiza umwana. Uburyo ikora ntabwo busobanutse neza. Ntabwo ifite ubushobozi bumwe bwo kuvura indwara zo mu mutwe nk'ubwa tetrahydrocannabinol (THC).\nCannabidiol yavumbuwe mu 1940. Yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2018 no mu Burayi mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, mililitiro 300 z'umuti wa 100 mg/ml zigura hafi 4,600 by'amadolari y'Amerika mu 2021. Yakozwe mu kimera cya \"Cannabis sativa\". Hari abantu bayikoresha mu buryo bw'amavuta ya CBD, muri rusange ikaba irimo urugero ruto rwa THC."}
{"id": "23599", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23599", "title": "Aneurysm y'ubwonko", "text": "Aneurysm yo mu bwonko, izwi kandi nka aneurysm yo mu bwonko, ni igihe hari umuyoboro w'amaraso uherereye hafi y'ubwonko urimo kwigaragaza. Kenshi na kenshi nta bimenyetso biragaragara. Hari igihe umuntu ashobora kugira ibinya, ububabare, cyangwa kunanirwa kwimura uruhande rumwe rw'isura. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kuva amaraso muri subarachnoid, bigatera umuntu kurwara umutwe cyane.\nIbintu bishobora gutera indwara birimo umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, kunywa itabi, kunywa inzoga nyinshi, kokayine, gukomereka mu mutwe, indwara yandura yo mu mutima, n'amateka y'umuryango. Indwara nyinshi ziterwa n\u2019uturemangingo, nk\u2019indwara y\u2019impyiko ya autosomal dominant polycystic na Ehlers-Danlos syndrome, zifitanye isano n\u2019ibyago byinshi. Ubwoko burimo udukoko two mu bwoko bwa saccular, fusiform, na infectious. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bikorwa hakoreshejwe amashusho y\u2019abaganga.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'ingano, aho umuntu aherereye, n'ubuzima bwe muri rusange. Muri rusange, ubuvuzi bugirwa inama iyo aneurysm ifite ingano irenga mm 7. Icyo wakora ku mitsi mito y'amaraso ntabwo kirasobanuka neza kandi ibi bishobora gukurikiranwa byoroshye kugira ngo harebwe uko bikura. Ibi bishobora gukorwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gufunga imitsi yo mu nda cyangwa gukata igice cy'amaraso.\nAbantu bagera kuri 3% nibo bagizweho ingaruka. Igipimo cy\u2019indwara z\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore kirangana. Bikunze kugaragara cyane ku bafite imyaka iri hagati ya 30 na 60. Ni bo batera hafi 0.5% by'impfu zose. Nyuma yo gucika kw'ivu, ibyago byo gupfa nyuma y'amezi atatu ni 50%. Indwara yo gucika kw'ubwonko yavuzwe bwa mbere mu 1765."}
{"id": "23600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23600", "title": "Igitero cy'ischemic cy'agateganyo", "text": "Igitero cy\u2019indwara y\u2019imitsi (TIA), kizwi kandi nka mini-stroke, ni igihe gito cy\u2019imikorere mibi y\u2019imitsi iterwa no kubura amaraso atembera neza (ischemia) mu gace k\u2019ubwonko cyangwa retina, nta rupfu rw\u2019ingingo. Bitera ibimenyetso bimwe n'indwara yo mu bwonko, nko kugira intege nke cyangwa kugira ibinya ku ruhande rumwe rw'umubiri, gutakaza amaso mu buryo butunguranye, kugorwa no kuvuga cyangwa kumva imvugo, kudahuza neza kw'ingingo, cyangwa urujijo. Ibimenyetso muri rusange bitangira mu buryo butunguranye kandi bimara igihe kitarenze isaha.\nIbintu bishobora gutera indwara birimo diyabete, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, kunywa itabi, ubusinzi, stress yo mu mutwe, no kutagira imyitozo ngororamubiri. TIA zifite uburyo busanzwe nk'ubwo gucika kw'imitsi mu maraso. Ibisobanuro byabanje gushingira ku gihe cy'ibimenyetso biri munsi y'amasaha 24; kandi ibisobanuro bishya nta bimenyetso by'indwara y'umutima birimo ku mashusho y'abaganga.\nNi ikibazo cyihutirwa cy\u2019ubuvuzi. Ubuvuzi bushobora kuba burimo guhindura imibereho nko kureka kunywa itabi no kugabanya inzoga, ndetse n'imiti nka aspirine, clopidogrel, cyangwa imiti igabanya amaraso. Izindi ngamba zirimo gucunga umuvuduko w'amaraso, imiti ya statine, no kugenzura isukari mu maraso. Ku bantu bafite imitsi yo mu ijosi ifunganye, bashobora kubagwa carotid endarterectomy. Hafi kimwe cya gatatu cy'abantu bafite TIA bazagira stroke mu gihe kizaza.\nAbantu bagera kuri 2% bigeze kugira TIA kandi umuntu 1 ku bantu 1,000 niwe uba yibasiwe buri mwaka. Abantu bakuze (barengeje imyaka 60) ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane. Abagabo ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane kurusha abagore. Indwara za TIA zasobanuwe bwa mbere ahagana mu 400 mbere ya Yesu na Hippocrates kandi byagaragaye ko ari zo mpamvu zishobora gutera indwara yo mu bwonko nyuma yo gucika intege."}
{"id": "23601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23601", "title": "Vortioxetine", "text": "Vortioxetine, igurishwa ku mazina y'ubucuruzi ya Trintellix na Brintellix n'andi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba. Kugira umusaruro bifatwa nk'ibisanzwe nk'iby'indi miti igabanya ubudahangarwa bw'imitsi. Mu Bwongereza, irasabwa gusa ku bantu bataragira uburwayi buhagije ku yindi miti ibiri igabanya ubukana bw'indwara. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo impatwe n'isesemi. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kwiyahura ku bari munsi y'imyaka 25, serotonin syndrome, kuva amaraso, mania, na SIADH. Indwara yo kwiyica ishobora kubaho iyo igipimo cyagabanutse vuba. Gukoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita no konsa ntabwo byifuzwa muri rusange. Ishyirwa mu cyiciro cy\u2019umusemburo wa serotonin. Uburyo ikora ntabwo busobanutse neza ariko bikekwa ko bifitanye isano no kwiyongera k'urugero rwa serotonin.\nYemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 2013. Ku kwezi mu Bwongereza bitwara NHS amafaranga agera kuri \u00a327.72 mu 2019. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikiguzi cy'iyi ngano ni hafi 368.40 USD. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 312 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni imwe."}
{"id": "23602", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23602", "title": "Urukingo rwa MMR", "text": "Urukingo rwa MMR ni urukingo rurinda iseru, mumps, na rubella (iseru yo mu Budage). Igipimo cya mbere gikunze guhabwa abana bari hagati y'amezi 9 na 15, ikindi gipimo kikaba kiri hagati y'amezi 15 na 6, nibura ibyumweru 4 hagati y'igipimo. Nyuma yo gupima inshuro ebyiri, 97% by'abantu barindwa iseru, 88% bakirwa indwara ya mumps, na nibura 97% bakirwa indwara ya rubella. Uru rukingo kandi rurasabwa ku bantu badafite ibimenyetso by\u2019ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri, abafite agakoko gatera SIDA kagenzurwa neza, kandi mu masaha 72 nyuma yo kwandura iseru mu bantu batarakingirwa burundu. Itangwa binyuze mu gutera imitsi cyangwa munsi y'uruhu.\nUrukingo rwa MMR rukoreshwa cyane ku isi yose, aho doze zisaga miliyoni 500 zimaze gutangwa mu bihugu birenga 100 kugeza mu 2001. Indwara ya serumu yahitanye abantu miliyoni 2.6 buri mwaka mbere y\u2019uko inkingo zitangira gukoreshwa. Ibi byagabanutse bigera ku mfu 122.000 ku mwaka mu 2012, cyane cyane mu bihugu bikennye. Binyuze mu gukingira, kugeza mu 2018, igipimo cy'indwara ya measles muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru n'Amajyepfo kiri hasi cyane. Igipimo cy'indwara cyagaragaye ko cyiyongera mu baturage badakingiwe. Hagati ya 2000 na 2016, gukingira byagabanyije impfu za measles ku kigero cya 84%. \nIngaruka mbi muri rusange ziba zoroshye kandi zishira nta muti wihariye wavuwe. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo umuriro, ubusanzwe iminsi 7 na 10 nyuma yo gukingirwa, ndetse no kurwara uduheri, ibyumweru 2 nyuma yo gukingirwa. Izindi ngaruka mbi zirimo ububabare cyangwa gutukura aho bateye inshinge. Indwara zikomeye z'ubwivumbure biba ku bantu bagera kuri umwe muri miliyoni. Kubera ko irimo virusi nzima, urukingo rwa MMR ntirwemerwa mu gihe utwite, ahubwo rushobora gutangwa mu gihe cyo konsa. Uru rukingo ni rwiza gutanga mu gihe kimwe n'izindi nkingo. Kuba uherutse gukingirwa ntabwo byongera ibyago byo kwanduza abandi iseru, mumps, cyangwa rubella. Gukingirwa ntabwo byongera ibyago byo kurwara autisme. Urukingo rwa MMR ni uruvange rwa virusi zisanzwe zo mu bwoko bwa virusi eshatu.\nUrukingo rwa MMR rwakozwe na Maurice Hilleman. Yahawe uburenganzira bwo gukoreshwa na Merck mu 1971. Urukingo rwa surua, mumps, na rubella rwari rwarahawe uburenganzira bwo gukingira mu 1963, 1967, na 1969. Inama ku gipimo cya kabiri cyatanzwe mu 1989. Urukingo rwa MMRV runakingira inkoko rushobora gukoreshwa. Urukingo rwa MR, rudafite ubwishingizi ku ndwara ya mumps, narwo rukoreshwa rimwe na rimwe. Mu Bwongereza, dose imwe ya MMR yuzuye mbere itwara NHS hafi \u00a310 guhera mu 2021."}
{"id": "23603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23603", "title": "Uruhu rw'uruhu", "text": "Dermatitis, izwi kandi nka eczema, ni itsinda ry'indwara zitera kubyimba k'uruhu. Izi ndwara zirangwa no gushyuha, uruhu rutukura n'uduheri. Mu gihe cy'igihe gito, hashobora kubaho udusebe duto, mu gihe mu gihe kirekire uruhu rushobora kubyimba. Agace k'uruhu karimo gashobora gutandukana kuva ku gato kugeza ku gutwikira umubiri wose.\nDermatitis irimo dermatitis itera indwara ya atopic, dermatitis itera allergie, dermatitis itera irritant na dermatitis itera stasis. Impamvu nyayo y\u2019iyi ndwara akenshi ntirasobanuka neza. Abarwayi bashobora kuba bafite uburibwe, allergie no kugaruka nabi kw'imitsi. Ubwoko bw'indwara y'uruhu muri rusange buterwa n'amateka y'umuntu n'aho yatewe n'ibisebe. Urugero, indwara y\u2019uruhu ikunze kugaragara ku maboko y\u2019abantu bakunze kuyatobesha. Dermatitis yo mu bwoko bwa allergie ibaho iyo umuntu ahuye n'ikintu kimutera allergie, bigatuma uruhu rugira allergie nyinshi.\nUbusanzwe kuvura dermatitis itera indwara ya atopic bikoreshwa mu kuvura ibinure n'amavuta yo mu bwoko bwa steroid. Amavuta ya steroid muri rusange agomba kuba afite imbaraga hagati kugeza kuri nyinshi kandi agakoreshwa mu gihe kitarenze ibyumweru bibiri icyarimwe, kuko ingaruka zishobora kubaho. Antibiyotike zishobora gukenerwa iyo hari ibimenyetso by'indwara z'uruhu. Ubusanzwe dermatitis yo mu bwoko bwa contact ivurwa hirindwa ibintu bishobora gutera ubwivumbure cyangwa ibintu bitera ubwivumbure. Antihistamines bishobora gufasha mu gusinzira no kugabanya kwiyahura nijoro.\nIndwara y'uruhu yibasiye abantu miliyoni 245 ku isi mu 2015. Ubwoko bw'indwara ya atopic dermatitis ni bwo bukunze kugaragara cyane kandi muri rusange butangira mu bwana. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, igira ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri 10\u201330%. Dermatitis yo mu bwoko bwa contact ikunze kugaragara ku bagore inshuro ebyiri kurusha abagabo. Dermatitis ifata abantu bagera kuri 7% mu gihe runaka mu buzima bwabo. Indwara yo kubabara mu mutwe irakabije, cyane cyane mu bantu bafite imirimo imwe n'imwe; igipimo nyacyo ntikizwi neza."}
{"id": "23604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23604", "title": "Amabuye y'amatoni", "text": "Amabuye ya tonsil, azwi kandi nka tonsilloliths, ni ubutare bw'imyanda iri mu myobo ya tonsil. Iyo hatashyizwemo amabuye y'agaciro, kuba hari imyanda bizwi nka tonsillitis idakira (CCT). Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kunuka mu kanwa. Muri rusange nta bubabare buhari, nubwo hashobora kubaho kumva ikintu runaka kirimo.\nIbintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo indwara zo mu muhogo zigaruka kenshi. Amabuye yo mu tunyangingo akubiyemo biofilm igizwe na bagiteri zitandukanye. Nubwo akenshi biba mu tunyangingo twa palatine, bishobora no kugaragara mu tunyangingo two mu rurimi rumwe. Amabuye y'imitsi yanditsweho uburemere kuva kuri 0.3g kugeza kuri 42g. Bishobora kuboneka mu gihe cyo gufata amashusho y\u2019abaganga kubera izindi mpamvu.\nIyo amabuye yo mu toni adateye ikibazo umuntu, nta muti ukenewe. Bitabaye ibyo, gusuka amazi y'umunyu no kuyakuraho n'intoki bishobora kugeragezwa. Chlorhexidine ishobora no kugeragezwa. Ubuvuzi bwo kubaga bushobora kuba burimo gukuraho igice cy'imitsi cyangwa burundu. Abantu bagera ku 10% bafite utubuye tw\u2019imitsi. Abagabo n'abagore bagira ingaruka kimwe. Abantu bakuze ni bo bakunze kwibasirwa cyane."}
{"id": "23605", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23605", "title": "Paresthesia", "text": "Paresthesia, izwi kandi nka pins and injections, ni ukumva urimo gucika intege, gutobora, gushya, cyangwa kutabona neza. Bidakunze kugaragara bishobora kuvugwa nk'ubukonje cyangwa kumva umuntu anyaraguritse. Bibaho nta ruhu rukozweho. Nubwo bishobora kugaragara ahantu hose ku mubiri, akenshi amaboko n'amaguru birabagiraho ingaruka. Bishobora kuba igihe gito cyangwa kirekire.\nImpamvu ikunze gutera ibihe bigufi ni igitutu ku mitsi. Indwara z'igihe kirekire zishobora guterwa n'indwara ya carpal tunnel syndrome, stroke, multiple sclerosis, transverse myelitis, ibibyimba, kubura vitamine B12, uburozi bwa lead, diyabete, Guillain-Barre syndrome, cyangwa encephalitis. Gusuzuma indwara bishingiye ku bimenyetso, isuzuma, n'ibindi bipimo.\nUburyo bwo kuvura buterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru. Mu rwego rwo kunoza ubukana bw'iyi ndwara, harimo amavuta ya capsaicin, carbamazepine, cyangwa gabapentin. Iri jambo rikomoka ku ijambo ry'Ikigiriki \"para\" risobanura iruhande rwaryo na \"aesthesis\" risobanura ibyiyumvo. Ijambo \"dysesthesia\" rifite ibisobanuro bisa; icyakora, bamwe barikoresha gusa iyo bakozweho bivamo kumva kudasanzwe. "}
{"id": "23606", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23606", "title": "Kuva amaraso mu bwonko", "text": "Kuva amaraso mu bwonko (ICH), bizwi kandi nka kuva amaraso mu bwonko, ni ubwoko bw'amaraso ava mu bwonko cyangwa mu mitsi. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kuribwa umutwe, intege nke z'uruhande rumwe, kuruka, gucika intege, kugabanuka k'ubushobozi bwo gutekereza, no kunangira ijosi. Akenshi ibimenyetso birarushaho kwiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Umuriro nabyo ni ibisanzwe. Kenshi na kenshi kuva amaraso biba biri mu bwonko no mu mitsi.\nImpamvu zirimo gukomereka mu bwonko, imitsi itera amaraso mu bwonko, ubumuga bw'imitsi itera amaraso mu bwonko, n'ibibyimba byo mu bwonko. Ibintu bikomeye bishobora gutera kuva amaraso mu buryo butunguranye ni umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso na amyloidosis. Izindi mpamvu zishobora gutera iyi ndwara zirimo ubusinzi, cholesterol nke, imiti igabanya amaraso, no gukoresha kokayine. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bikorwa hakoreshejwe CT scan. Ni ubwoko bw'indwara yo kuva amaraso mu bwonko. Izindi ndwara zishobora kugaragara nk'izo zirimo indwara yo mu bwonko ischemic.\nUbusanzwe ubuvuzi bugomba gukorerwa mu cyumba cy\u2019indembe. Amabwiriza agamije kugabanya umuvuduko w'amaraso ukagera kuri systolic 130 kugeza kuri 140\u00a0mmHg. Imiti igabanya amaraso igomba guhindurwa uko bishoboka kose kandi isukari yo mu maraso ikaguma ku rugero rusanzwe. Kubaga kugira ngo hashyirweho umuyoboro w'amazi mu mitsi bishobora gukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ya hydrocephalus ariko imiti ya corticosteroid ntigomba gukoreshwa. Kubagwa kugira ngo amaraso akurweho ni ingirakamaro mu bihe bimwe na bimwe.\nKuva amaraso mu bwonko bifata abantu bagera kuri 2.5 kuri 10.000 buri mwaka. Bikunze kugaragara ku bagabo n'abantu bakuze. Abagera kuri 44% by'abanduye bapfa mu kwezi kumwe. Umusaruro mwiza uboneka hafi 20% by'abahuye n'iki kibazo. Kuva amaraso mu bwonko byatangiye gutandukanywa n'indwara zo mu bwonko bitewe n'uko amaraso atembera nabi, ibyo bikaba byaritwaga \"kuvunika no gufungana\", mu 1823."}
{"id": "23607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23607", "title": "Rickets", "text": "Rickets ni indwara ituma amagufwa y'abana adakomera cyangwa yoroshye. Ibimenyetso birimo amaguru ahetamye, kugorana gukura, kubabara amagufwa, agahanga kanini, no kugorwa no gusinzira. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kuvunika kw'amagufwa, imitsi icikagurika, umugongo ugoramye ku buryo budasanzwe, cyangwa ubumuga bwo mu mutwe.\nImpamvu ikunze gutera indwara ya rickets ni ukubura vitamine D. Ibi bishobora guterwa no kurya indyo idafite vitamine D ihagije, uruhu rwijimye, kutagira izuba ryinshi, konsa umwana gusa nta nyongera ya vitamine D, indwara ya celiac, n'izindi ndwara zimwe na zimwe zikomoka ku ngirabuzimafatizo. Ibindi bintu bishobora kuba birimo kalisiyumu cyangwa fosifore idahagije. Uburyo bw'ibanze bukubiyemo ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro budafite ubuziranenge ku gice cyo gukura. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bishingiye ku bipimo by'amaraso bigasangamo kalisiyumu nkeya, fosifore nkeya, na fosifore ya alkaline nyinshi hamwe na X-rays.\nKwirinda abana bonsa gusa ni inyongeramusaruro za Vitamine D. Bitabaye ibyo, ubuvuzi buterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru. Iyo umuntu arwaye indwara yo kubura vitamine D, ubusanzwe avurwa na vitamine D na kalisiyumu. Ibi muri rusange bitanga impinduka mu byumweru bike. Ubusembwa bw'amagufwa nabwo bushobora kwiyongera uko igihe kigenda gihita. Rimwe na rimwe hashobora kubagwa kugira ngo hakosorwe ubumuga bw'amagufwa. Ubwoko bw'indwara busanzwe bukenera ubuvuzi bwihariye.\nRickets ikunze kugaragara mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati, muri Afurika no muri Aziya. Muri rusange ntibikunze kugaragara muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika no mu Burayi, uretse mu matsinda amwe n'amwe y'abantu bake. Bitangira mu bwana, akenshi hagati y'amezi 3 na 18. Igipimo cy'indwara kirangana ku bagabo no ku bagore. Ingero z'ibyo bivugwa ko ari indwara ya rickets zavuzwe kuva mu kinyejana cya 1, kandi iyo ndwara yari ikwirakwiriye mu bwami bw'Abaroma. Iyi ndwara yari isanzwe mu kinyejana cya 20. Uburyo bwo kuvura bwa mbere bwari bukubiyemo gukoresha amavuta y'umwijima w'ifi ya cod."}
{"id": "23608", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23608", "title": "Igisebe", "text": "Igisebe ni uruhurirane rw'amashyira yishyize mu ngingo z'umubiri. Ibimenyetso by'ibibyimba birimo gutukura, ububabare, ubushyuhe, no kubyimba. Kubyimba bishobora kumva ko byuzuye amazi iyo bikandagiwe. Agace k'umutuku gakunze kurenga ku kubyimba. Karubuncle n'ibibyimba ni ubwoko bw'ibibyimba akenshi biba birimo uduce tw'umusatsi, aho karubuncle ziba nini.\nAkenshi biterwa n'ubwandu bwa bagiteri. Akenshi ubwoko bwinshi butandukanye bwa bagiteri bugira uruhare mu kwandura kumwe. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika no mu tundi duce twinshi tw\u2019isi, bagiteri ikunze kugaragara cyane ni \"Staphylococcus aureus irwanya methicillin\". Ni gake cyane, udukoko dushobora gutera ibibyimba; ibi bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Ubusanzwe isuzuma rikorwa hashingiwe ku kuntu risa kandi ryemezwa no kuricamo. Ultrasound Gufata amashusho bishobora kuba ingirakamaro mu gihe indwara idasobanutse neza. Mu bibyimba bikikije ikibuno, computer tomography (CT) ishobora kuba ingenzi kugira ngo harebwe ubwandu bwimbitse.\nUburyo busanzwe bwo kuvura ibibyimba byinshi by'uruhu cyangwa ingingo zoroshye ni ukubikata no kubikuramo amazi. Bigaragara ko hari inyungu zimwe na zimwe zo gukoresha imiti yica udukoko; nubwo gukoresha iyo miti bifitanye isano n'ingaruka mbi. Ibimenyetso bike bigaragaza ko nta gupfunyika umwobo usigayemo gaze nyuma yo gusohora amazi. Gufunga iki kibonobono nyuma yo kugikuramo amazi aho kugisiga gifunguye bishobora kwihutisha gukira hatabayeho kongera ibyago byo kugaruka kw'igisebe. Gukuramo amabyi ukoresheje urushinge akenshi ntibihagije.\nIbibyimba by'uruhu birakunze kugaragara kandi byarushijeho kwiyongera mu myaka ya vuba aha. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo gukoresha imiti mu mitsi, aho igipimo cyavuzwe ko kiri hejuru cyane kigera kuri 65% mu bayikoresha. Mu 2005 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, abantu miliyoni 3.2 bagiye mu ishami ryita ku barwayi barwaye ikibyimba. Muri Ositaraliya, abantu bagera ku 13.000 barwariye mu bitaro mu 2008 bafite iyo ndwara."}
{"id": "23609", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23609", "title": "Dystonia", "text": "Dystonia ni indwara yo kwimuka aho kwifata kw'imitsi bidaturutse ku bushake bitera kwimuka buhoro buhoro cyangwa kwifata mu buryo budasanzwe. Hari n'ubwo bubabare cyangwa gutigita bishobora kubaho. Muri bimwe, ibimenyetso bigaragara gusa iyo umuntu akoze imyitozo ngororamubiri, afite stress, cyangwa ananiwe. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kwiheba cyangwa guhangayika.\nBishobora kuragwa n'ababyeyi, cyangwa bigaterwa n'imvune yavutse, gucika imitsi, ubwandu, uburozi bwa lisansi, uburozi bwa CO, ndetse n'ingaruka mbi z'imiti imwe n'imwe nka antidopaminergic agents. Uburyo bw'ibanze bukoresha ibice bimwe na bimwe by'ubwonko, akenshi ganglia y'ibanze. Ishobora gushyirwa mu byiciro nka generalized, focal, multifocal, segmental, cyangwa hemidystonia; cyangwa bitewe n'igice cy'umubiri cyagizweho ingaruka nka cervical, blepharospasm, stripping, na dystonia y'umucuranzi. Gusuzuma bishobora kuba birimo gupima imiterere y\u2019umubiri, MRI, no gupima amaraso.\nIyo bibayeho bitewe n'imiti, guhagarika imiti bishobora gutuma umuntu akira neza. Bitabaye ibyo, ubuvuzi bushobora kuba burimo imiti nka anticholinergics, benzodiazepines cyangwa dopaminergic agents; inshinge za botulinum toxin; ubuvuzi bw'umubiri; cyangwa kubagwa, nko gukangura ubwonko mu buryo bwimbitse.\nIndwara ya Dystonia yibasira abantu bagera ku 250.000 muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ntibikunze kugaragara cyane nk'indwara zo mu mutwe ziterwa no gutitira no gucika intege (movement disorders) hamwe na Parkinson. Imyaka yose ishobora kugerwaho n'ingaruka. Iryo jambo ryahimbwe mu 1911."}
{"id": "23610", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23610", "title": "Ihungabana ry'amazi", "text": "Ubwoko bw'ubwandu bukunze kugaragara ni bagiteri, aho ubwandu bwa bagiteri butagira garama bugaragara muri 62% by'abanduye naho ubwandu bwa bagiteri butagira garama bugaragara muri 47%. Mu bihe biri munsi ya 5% by'abarwayi, virusi cyangwa udukoko tuba turimo. Ahantu hakunze kugaragara ubwandu ni ibihaha (42%), amaraso (21%), n'inkari (10%), nubwo kimwe cya gatatu cy'abarwayi aho hantu hatazwi neza. Ibintu bishobora gutera sepsis birimo diyabete, kanseri, ibibazo by'umwijima cyangwa impyiko, ikoreshwa rya corticosteroids, ubushye, imikorere mibi y'ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri, ndetse n'imyaka ikabije. Ni ubwoko bw'ihungabana rikwirakwira.\nUbuvuzi bukubiyemo uburyo bwo kuvura hakiri kare hifashishijwe intego, hakoreshejwe imiti yica udukoko, gukuramo ingirangingo zanduye, amazi yo mu mitsi, n'imiti itera imitsi nka norepinephrine. Izindi ngamba zishobora kuba zirimo guhumeka hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga na kortikosteroidi. Sepsis ikomeye ibaho ku bantu bagera ku 750.000 (300 kuri 100.000) buri mwaka muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ingaruka zo gupfa zirenze 40% kandi bamwe mu barokotse basigarana ubumuga bw'igihe kirekire."}
{"id": "23611", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23611", "title": "Umuti utari umuti urwanya ububyimbirwe", "text": "Imiti igabanya ububabare idakoresha steroide (NSAIDs) ni ubwoko bw'imiti ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu kuvura ububabare, umuriro, no kubyimba. Aspirine ishobora kandi gukoreshwa mu gukumira indwara z'umutima cyangwa indwara zo mu bwonko. Bishobora gufatwa mu kanwa, mu guterwa inshinge, mu gusigwa ku ruhu, cyangwa mu buryo bwo gukamura. Bishobora gukoreshwa hamwe na parasetamol (acetaminophen). Ku bantu bafite ibyago byo kugira ibibazo byo mu gifu, bashobora gufatwa hamwe n'umuti ugabanya ubukana bwa pompe ya proton.\nIngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo ibisebe byo mu gifu, indwara z'umutima, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, n'indwara z'impyiko. Izindi ngaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo indwara ya asima n'uduheri. Ntibikwiye gufatwa mu mezi 3 ya nyuma yo gutwita. Hari ubwoko bubiri bw'ibidatoranywa n'ibidatoranywa bya COX-2. Nubwo imiti itoranya COX-2 ishobora kugira ibyago bike byo kubabara mu gifu, ifite ibyago byinshi byo kurwara indwara z'umutima. Zikora mu kubuza imikorere ya enzymes za cyclooxygenase (COX-1 cyangwa COX-2).\nNSAID ya mbere yari aspirine, yatangiye gukoreshwa mu bucuruzi mu 1899, nubwo mbere yakoreshejwe mu buryo bw'igishishwa cy'umukungugu. Ibi byakurikiwe na ibuprofen mu myaka ya 1960 na naproxen mu myaka ya 1970. Inyinshi muri zo ziraboneka nk'imiti isanzwe kandi ntabwo ihenze cyane. Zimwe muri zo zishobora no kugurwa ukoresheje ikarita (OTC). Parasetamol ntabwo ifatwa nk'umuti urwanya indwara zo mu mutwe (NSAID). "}
{"id": "23612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23612", "title": "Kunanirwa kw'impyiko", "text": "Kunanirwa kw'impyiko (mu Gifaransa \"insuffisance r\u00e9nale\", mu Cyongereza \"kidney failure\"), bizwi kandi nk'indwara y'impyiko yo mu cyiciro cya nyuma, ni indwara aho impyiko zigira imikorere iri munsi ya 15% by'ibisanzwe. Ishobora kuza vuba (kunanirwa gukabije) cyangwa buhoro buhoro (kunanirwa kudakira). Ivurwa hakoreshejwe dialyse cyangwa gusimbuza impyiko.\nIbimenyetso n'ingorane.\nKunanirwa kw'impyiko bishyirwa mu cyiciro cy'intege nke z'impyiko, zikura vuba kandi zishobora gukemuka; n'intege nke z'impyiko zidakira, zikura buhoro buhoro kandi akenshi ntizishobora gusubizwa inyuma. Ibimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubyimba amaguru, kumva unaniwe, kuruka, kubura ubushake bwo kurya, no kwitiranya ibintu. Ingorane zo kunanirwa gukabije no kudakora neza zirimo uremia, potasiyumu nyinshi mu maraso, no kwiyongera k'umuvuduko w'amaraso. Ingorane zo kudakora neza zirimo kandi indwara z'umutima, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, no kubura amaraso.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nImpamvu zitera impyiko gucika intege cyane zirimo umuvuduko muke w'amaraso, kuziba kw'inzira y'inkari, imiti imwe n'imwe, kwangirika kw'imitsi, na hemolytic uremic syndrome. Impamvu zitera impyiko kudakora neza zirimo diyabete, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, indwara ya nephrotic, n'indwara y'impyiko ya polycystic. Gusuzuma indwara yo gucika intege mu buryo bwihuse akenshi bishingiye ku bintu bitandukanye nko kugabanuka k'umusaruro w'inkari cyangwa kwiyongera kwa creatinine mu maraso. Gusuzuma indwara idakira biterwa n'igipimo cyo kuyungurura glomerular (GFR) kiri munsi ya 15 cyangwa hakenewe ubuvuzi bwo gusimbuza impyiko. Bingana kandi n'indwara y'impyiko idakira yo mu cyiciro cya 5.\nKuvura.\nKuvura kunanirwa gukabije kw'impyiko biterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru. Kuvura indwara idakira bishobora kuba birimo hemodialysis, dialysis ya peritoneal, cyangwa gusimbuza impyiko. Hemodialysis ikoresha imashini iyungurura amaraso hanze y'umubiri. Muri dialyse ya peritoneal amazi runaka ashyirwa mu nda hanyuma akavomwa, ibi bigasubirwamo inshuro nyinshi ku munsi. Gutera impyiko bikubiyemo kubagwa no gushyira impyiko y'undi muntu hanyuma ugafata imiti igabanya ubudahangarwa bw'umubiri kugira ngo wirinde kwangwa. Izindi ngamba zisabwa mu ndwara zidakira zirimo gukomeza gukora cyane no guhindura imirire ku buryo bwihariye.\nIkwirakwira.\nMuri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, kunanirwa gukabije kw'impyiko kwibasira abantu bagera kuri 3 ku bantu 1,000 ku mwaka. 000, abantu 3 ku bantu 10.000 bashya barwara iyi ndwara buri mwaka. Iyo abantu benshi bafite indwara zidakira bavuwe neza bashobora gukomeza gukora."}
{"id": "23613", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23613", "title": "Nyamweru", "text": "Nyamweru cyangwa ubumuga bw'uruhu (mu Gifaransa \"albinisme\", mu Cyongereza \"albinism\") ni ikibazo umuntu avukana, kirangwa no kutagira ibara ry'uruhu, umusatsi n'amaso mu buryo bwuzuye cyangwa igice. Buterwa n'impinduka mu turemangingo zigabanya melanin, kandi bujyana n'ibibazo byo kureba ndetse n'ibyago byo kurwara kanseri y'uruhu. Bwibasira hafi umuntu 1 ku bantu 20.000.\nIbimenyetso.\nUbumuga bw'uruhu bufitanye isano n'ibibazo byo kureba birimo nystagmus. Abantu kandi bakunze kwibasirwa n'izuba ndetse na kanseri y'uruhu.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nUbumuga bw'uruhu buterwa n'impinduka mu miterere y'uturemangingo bigatuma ubushobozi bwo gukora cyangwa gukwirakwiza melanin bugabanuka. Nibura ubwoko 7 bw'impinduka z'uturemangingo (autosomal recessive) bushobora gutera ubumuga bw'uruhu, kandi iyi ndwara nayo igaragara mu ndwara zitandukanye zirimo Hermansky-Pudlak na Ch\u00e9diak-Higashi syndrome. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bikorwa hashingiwe ku isuzuma kandi bishobora gushyigikirwa n'ibizamini by'uturemangingo.\nKwitabwaho n'ikwirakwira.\nUbuvuzi bukubiyemo kurinda izuba ubuzima bwose nko gukoresha imyenda yo kwirinda, imiti irinda izuba, indorerwamo z'izuba, no kwirinda urumuri rwa UV. Gusuzuma kanseri y'uruhu byibuze buri mwaka, byumvikana ko melanoma izaba ibara ry'umutuku aho kuba umukara. Gusuzuma amaso kenshi nabyo birasabwa. Hafi umuntu 1 kuri 20.000 yibasiwe n\u2019iki kibazo. Ijambo \"albinisme\" rikomoka ku ijambo ry'ikilatini \"albus\" risobanura \"umweru\"."}
{"id": "23614", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23614", "title": "Donepezil", "text": "Donepezil, igurishwa ku izina ry'ubucuruzi rya Aricept n'andi, ni umuti ukoreshwa mu kuvura indwara ya Alzheimer. Ifatwa mu kanwa. Yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1996.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nBisa nkaho bitanga inyungu nto mu mikorere y'ubwonko n'ubushobozi bwo gukora. Icyakora, gukoresha uyu muti ntibyagaragaye ko bihindura uko indwara igenda ikura. Ubuvuzi bugomba guhagarikwa niba nta nyungu igaragara. Ifatwa mu kanwa.\nIngaruka n'uko ikora.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, gusinzira nabi, impiswi, kumva unaniwe, no kuribwa mu mitsi. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo kugorwa no kuva inkari mu ruhago, no gucika intege. Donepezil ni umuti ubuza acetylcholinesterase gukora neza.\nAmateka.\nDonepezil yemerewe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1996. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. 52 mu 2019. 38. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 127 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni eshanu."}
{"id": "23615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23615", "title": "Kubyara umwana upfuye", "text": "Kubyara umwana upfuye bisobanurwa nk'urupfu rw'umwana uri mu nda nyuma y'ibyumweru 20 cyangwa 28, bitewe n'aho byaturutse. Akenshi impamvu yabyo ntimenyekana. Mu 2015, ku isi habayeho abana bagera kuri miliyoni 2,6 bavutse bapfuye, cyane cyane muri Aziya y'Epfo no muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara.\nIbisobanuro.\nUmwana avuka adafite ibimenyetso by'ubuzima. Kubyara umwana wapfuye bishobora gutuma umubyeyi yumva afite icyaha cyangwa agahinda. Iri jambo ritandukanye no gukuramo inda, ari byo gutakaza inda mbere y\u2019igihe, no kubyara umwana ari muzima, aho umwana avuka ari muzima, nubwo yapfa nyuma gato.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nAkenshi impamvu iba itazwi. Impamvu zishobora kuba zirimo ibibazo byo kuvukana, indwara nka malariya na syphilis, ndetse n'ubuzima bubi bw'umubyeyi. Ibintu bishobora gutera ibyago birimo kuba umubyeyi w\u2019imyaka irenga 35, kunywa itabi, gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge, gukoresha ikoranabuhanga rifasha mu kubyara, no gutwita bwa mbere. Byemezwa hakoreshejwe ultrasound.\nKwirinda no kwitabwaho.\nHafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abana bapfa bavuka mu gihe cyo kubyara, ibi bikaba bikunze kugaragara mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere kurusha ibihugu byateye imbere. Bitewe n'igihe inda igeze, imiti ishobora gukoreshwa mu gutangira kubyara cyangwa ubwoko bw'ubuganga buzwi nka dilation and evacuation bushobora gukorwa. Nyuma yo kubyara umwana wapfuye, abagore baba bafite ibyago byinshi byo kubyara undi mwana; icyakora, inda nyinshi zikurikiraho ntabwo zigira ibibazo nk'ibyo. Ihungabana, igihombo cy'amafaranga, no gusenyuka kw'imiryango ni ingorane zizwi.\nIkwirakwira.\nKu isi yose mu 2015 habayeho abana bapfa bavuka bagera kuri miliyoni 2.6 nyuma y'ibyumweru 28 batwite (hafi 1 kuri buri mwana 45). Bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, cyane cyane muri Aziya y'Epfo no muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara. Muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika kuri buri mwana 167 uvuka, umwana umwe uvuka yapfuye. Igipimo cy'abana bapfa bavuka cyaragabanutse, nubwo cyagabanutse buhoro buhoro kuva mu myaka ya 2000."}
{"id": "23616", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23616", "title": "Fentermine", "text": "Phentermine, igurishwa ku izina rya Ionamin n'indi, ni umuti ukoreshwa hamwe n'imirire n'imyitozo ngororamubiri kugira ngo uvure umubyibuho ukabije. Ifatwa mu kanwa kugeza ku byumweru bike. Yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1959.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nPhentermine ikoreshwa mu kuvura umubyibuho ukabije, hamwe n'imirire n'imyitozo ngororamubiri, kandi ifatwa mu kanwa kugeza ku byumweru bike. Iraboneka kandi nk'umuti uvanze wa phentermine/topiramate.\nIngaruka n'ibibujijwe.\nIngaruka mbi zikunze kugaragara zirimo gutera k'umutima vuba, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, kubura ibitotsi, isereri no kubura ituze. Ingaruka mbi zishobora kuba zirimo umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso mu bihaha. Ntibyemewe kuyikoresha mu gihe cyo gutwita cyangwa konsa. Ntibyemewe gukoresha hamwe na SSRI cyangwa MAO inhibitors. \nAmateka.\nPhentermine yemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1959. Iraboneka nk'umuti usanzwe. 55. Mu 2017, wari umuti wa 210 ukunze kwandikirwa muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, aho wanditswe n'abaganga barenga miliyoni ebyiri. Phentermine yakuwe ku isoko mu Bwongereza mu 2000 mu gihe umuti uvanze wa fen-phen, wari ugizwe na wo, wakuwe ku isoko mu 1997 kubera ingaruka mbi."}
{"id": "23617", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23617", "title": "Lymphedema", "text": "Lymphedema ni ukubyimba kw'igice cy'umubiri bitewe n'uko sisitemu y'imitsi yangiritse. Akenshi iterwa na kanseri n'uburyo ivurwa cyangwa n'indwara ya lymphatic filariasis. Nta muti uyikiza uhari, ariko ubuvuzi bushobora kugabanya ibimenyetso. Yibasira abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 200 ku isi.\nIbimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso bishobora kuba birimo kubabara, kuremererwa, gukomera kw'ingingo, no kubyimba k'uruhu. Ingorane zishobora kuba zirimo kwandura, na lymphangiosarcoma.\nImpamvu n'isuzuma.\nAkenshi ikunze kubaho bitewe na kanseri n'uburyo ivurwa cyangwa indwara ziterwa n'udukoko (lymphatic filariasis), ariko ishobora no kugaragara mu ndwara nyinshi ziterwa n'uturemangingo. Ibintu bishobora gutera ikibazo birimo umubyibuho ukabije. Gusuzuma indwara muri rusange bishingiye ku bimenyetso, nyuma y\u2019uko izindi mpamvu zishobora kuyitera zitabonetse.\nKuvura.\nUbuvuzi bukunze kuba burimo kwita ku ruhu neza, gukora imyitozo ngororamubiri, no gusohora amazi mu mubiri hakoreshejwe intoki (MLD), bizwi nka \"combined decongestive therapy\". Ubusanzwe kubaga bikoreshwa gusa ku bantu batavuwe hakoreshejwe izindi ngamba.\nIkwirakwira.\nLymphedema yibasira abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 200 ku isi yose. Abagore ni bo bibasirwa cyane kurusha abagabo. Abagore 1 kuri 5 barokotse kanseri y'ibere na 40% by'abagore barwaye kanseri y'abagore barwara lymphedema. Impamvu ziterwa n\u2019uturemangingo ntizikunze kugaragara cyane, zigaragara ku muntu umwe ku bantu 100.000. Iyo mimerere yasobanuwe mu mateka ya kera."}
{"id": "23618", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23618", "title": "Phenylketonuria", "text": "Phenylketonuria (PKU) ni indwara y'uruhererekane umuntu avukana, ituma umubiri udashobora gusenya neza aside amine yitwa phenylalanine. Iyo idavuwe, ishobora gutera ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, igicuri, ibibazo by'imyitwarire n'indwara zo mu mutwe.\nIvurwa hakoreshejwe indyo irimo phenylalanine nke, itangira vuba nyuma yo kuvuka igakomeza ubuzima bwose. Yavumbuwe mu 1934 n'umuganga w'Umunyanoruveje Ivar Asbj\u00f8rn F\u00f8lling.\nIbimenyetso.\nIyo idavuwe, PKU ishobora gutera ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, igicuri, ibibazo by'imyitwarire n'indwara zo mu mutwe. Ishobora kandi gutuma umubiri ugira impumuro idasanzwe, kandi uruhu n'umusatsi bikeruruka kurusha iby'abandi bo mu muryango. Umwana wavutse ku mubyeyi urwaye PKU utubahiriza indyo ashobora kuvukana ibibazo by'umutima, umutwe muto (microcephaly) n'ibiro bike.\nImpamvu.\nPKU ni indwara y'uruhererekane umwana aragwa n'ababyeyi be. Iterwa n'ihinduka (mutation) rya gene ya \"PAH\", bigatuma enzyme ya phenylalanine hydroxylase igabanuka. Ibi bituma phenylalanine ituruka mu biryo yiyongera mu mubiri kugeza ku rugero rw'uburozi.\nNi autosomal recessive: kugira ngo umuntu arware, kopi zombi za gene zigomba kuba zarahindutse; abafite kopi imwe gusa yahindutse nta bimenyetso bagira. Hari ubwoko bubiri bw'ingenzi: PKU isanzwe (classic), ikomeye kurusha, na PKU yoroheje (variant), aho enzyme igikora igice.\nIsuzuma.\nIbihugu byinshi bifite gahunda zo gupima abana bakimara kuvuka kugira ngo PKU imenyekane hakiri kare.\nUbuvuzi.\nUbuvuzi bukorwa hakoreshejwe indyo irimo ibiryo bike birimo phenylalanine n'inyongeramirire zidasanzwe. Ibiryo bikungahaye kuri poroteyine nk'amata, amagi, inyama, amafi n'ibishyimbo biragabanywa, kimwe n'isukari y'ubukorano yitwa aspartame. Impinja zihabwa amata y'ifu yihariye ashobora kuvangwa n'amashereka make. Indyo igomba gutangira vuba bishoboka nyuma yo kuvuka kandi igakomeza ubuzima bwose; urugero rwa phenylalanine mu amaraso rugenzurwa buri gihe. Umuti wa sapropterin dihydrochloride ushobora gufasha bamwe.\nAbasuzumwe hakiri kare bakubahiriza indyo bashobora kugira ubuzima bwiza n'icyizere cy'ubuzima gisanzwe. Mu 2014, ubuvuzi bwa gene (gene therapy) bwatangaga icyizere ariko bwari bugikeneye ubushakashatsi bwinshi.\nIkwirakwira.\nPKU yibasira umwana umwe mu bana bagera ku 12.000. Abahungu n'abakobwa bayirwara ku rugero rumwe.\nAmateka.\nPKU yavumbuwe mu 1934 n'umuganga w'Umunyanoruveje Ivar Asbj\u00f8rn F\u00f8lling; akamaro k'imirire mu kuyivura kamenyekanye mu 1953."}
{"id": "23619", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23619", "title": "Hypospadias", "text": "Hypospadias ni ubumuga umwana w'umuhungu avukana, aho umwenge wa \"urethra\" (umuyoboro usohora inkari) udafunguka ku mpera y'igitsina gabo, ahubwo ukaba munsi yacyo: hafi y'umutwe wacyo, ku giti cyacyo cyangwa hafi y'agasaho k'intanga.\nImpamvu zayo ntizizwi ku bantu benshi. Abenshi bavurwa no kubagwa bakiri bato, hagati y'amezi 3 na 18. Ni ubumuga bwa kabiri bukunze kugaragara ku bahungu bavuka, nyuma y'intanga zitamanutse (\"cryptorchidie\").\nIbimenyetso.\nUmwenge w'inkari uba munsi y'igitsina gabo aho kuba ku mpera yacyo. Igitsina gishobora kugorama, kandi uruhu rwo hejuru (\"pr\u00e9puce\") rukaba rutwikiriye uruhande rwo hejuru gusa. Iyo hypospadias ikomeye, umwana ashobora kugira ingorane zo kunyara ahagaze.\nImpamvu n'ibyago.\nKu bana benshi, impamvu ntizwi. Hypospadias ivuka iyo igitsina gikura nabi hagati y'icyumweru cya 8 n'icya 14 cyo gutwita. Ibyongera ibyago birimo amateka y'umuryango, nyina ufite imyaka 30 kuzamura, umubyibuho ukabije wa nyina, gusama hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga, n'imiti y'imisemburo ya progestin mbere cyangwa mu gihe cyo gutwita. Ishobora kandi kuba kimwe mu bigize izindi ndwara zivukanwa.\nGusuzuma n'ubwoko.\nIsuzuma rikorwa mu isuzuma ry'umubiri umwana akivuka. Hypospadias igabanywa hakurikijwe aho umwenge uri:\nKuvura.\nAbenshi bavurwa no kubagwa, akenshi hagati y'amezi 3 na 18, rimwe na rimwe mu byiciro byinshi. Kubaga bishobora kwimura umwenge, kugorora igitsina no gusana uruhu. Abana bafite hypospadias ntibagomba gukebwa mbere yo kubagwa, kuko uruhu rwo hejuru rushobora gukenerwa mu gusana. Nyuma yo kubagwa hashobora kuvuka ingorane nka \"fistula\" (umwenge mushya unyuramo inkari), kwifunga k'umwenge cyangwa k'umuyoboro. Abenshi bagira ubuzima busanzwe bw'imibonano mpuzabitsina bamaze kuba bakuru.\nIkwirakwizwa.\nMuri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, hafi umwe ku bahungu 150 avukana hypospadias. Mu Burayi, nko muri Danimarike, igipimo kiri hagati ya 0,5 % na 0,8 %; ishobora kuba idakunze kugaragara mu bindi bice by'isi."}
